window.__TOEFL_DATA__["data-examples"]=JSON.parse("{\"adverse\":[[\"The crops failed because of <b>adverse</b> weather: first a long drought, then flooding.\",\"庄稼歉收是因为天气不利：先是长期干旱，接着又是洪水。\"],[\"Some patients experience <b>adverse</b> effects from the drug and must stop taking it.\",\"有些病人服用这种药后出现不良反应，不得不停药。\"]],\"advocate\":[[\"The report <b>advocates</b> smaller class sizes in the first years of primary school.\",\"这份报告提倡在小学低年级缩小班级规模。\"],[\"She has long <b>advocated</b> for protecting the wetlands along the coast.\",\"她长期以来一直提倡保护沿海湿地。\"]],\"argue\":[[\"The two historians <b>argue</b> that trade, not war, was the main force that spread the technology.\",\"两位历史学家论证说，传播这项技术的主要力量是贸易而非战争。\"],[\"Neighbors began to <b>argue</b> over where the new fence should be built.\",\"邻居们开始为新栅栏该建在哪里而争吵。\"]],\"assassin\":[[\"The archduke's <b>assassin</b> was arrested at the scene, but the shooting still set off a chain of events that led to war.\",\"刺杀大公的刺客当场被捕，但这起枪击仍引发了一连串事件，最终导致了战争。\"],[\"In the novel, a retired <b>assassin</b> is forced to take one last job.\",\"在这部小说里，一名退休刺客被迫接下最后一单任务。\"]],\"asteroid\":[[\"Most <b>asteroids</b> orbit the Sun in a belt between Mars and Jupiter.\",\"大多数小行星在火星和木星之间的一个带里绕太阳运行。\"],[\"Scientists believe an <b>asteroid</b> struck Earth 66 million years ago and wiped out the dinosaurs.\",\"科学家认为，一颗小行星在 6600 万年前撞击地球，导致了恐龙灭绝。\"]],\"attitude\":[[\"Her positive <b>attitude</b> toward failure — treating it as data rather than defeat — helped the team keep experimenting.\",\"她对失败的积极态度——把失败看作数据而非挫败——帮助团队不断尝试。\"],[\"Surveys show that public <b>attitudes</b> toward remote work have shifted sharply since 2020.\",\"调查显示，2020 年以来公众对远程办公的态度发生了明显转变。\"]],\"ballet\":[[\"She began training in <b>ballet</b> at the age of five and joined a professional company at eighteen.\",\"她五岁开始练芭蕾，十八岁加入了专业舞团。\"],[\"The <b>ballet</b> retells a folk tale through dance, without a single spoken word.\",\"这部芭蕾舞剧不用一句台词，完全用舞蹈重述了一个民间故事。\"]],\"banal\":[[\"The film's plot was so <b>banal</b> that most viewers guessed the ending within ten minutes.\",\"这部电影的情节平庸到大多数观众十分钟内就猜到了结局。\"],[\"What sounds like a <b>banal</b> piece of advice — sleep eight hours — turns out to matter enormously.\",\"听起来平平无奇的建议——睡满八小时——其实至关重要。\"]],\"bask\":[[\"After emerging from the cold water, the seals climbed onto the rocks to <b>bask</b> in the sun.\",\"从冷水里出来后，海豹爬上岩石晒太阳取暖。\"],[\"The cat found a patch of sunlight on the rug and settled down to <b>bask</b> for the whole afternoon.\",\"猫在地毯上找了一块阳光，趴下来舒舒服服地晒了一下午。\"]],\"benefit\":[[\"Regular exercise has a clear <b>benefit</b> for memory, especially in older adults.\",\"经常锻炼对记忆力有明显益处，对老年人尤其如此。\"],[\"Small farmers <b>benefit</b> most when cooperatives sell their crops directly to cities.\",\"当合作社把农产品直接卖到城市时，小农户获益最大。\"]],\"bind\":[[\"Workers <b>bind</b> the steel rods together with wire before the concrete is poured.\",\"浇筑混凝土之前，工人先用铁丝把钢筋绑在一起。\"],[\"A common language helps <b>bind</b> the members of a diverse community together.\",\"共同的语言有助于把一个多元社区的成员凝聚在一起。\"]],\"carpet\":[[\"A thick red <b>carpet</b> covered the floor of the old hotel lobby.\",\"一块厚厚的红地毯铺在老酒店大堂的地板上。\"],[\"By mid-April, wildflowers formed a bright <b>carpet</b> across the hillside.\",\"到四月中旬，野花在山坡上铺成了一片鲜亮的花毯。\"]],\"channel\":[[\"The company opened an online <b>channel</b> so that customers could order directly from their phones.\",\"这家公司开通了线上渠道，顾客可以直接用手机下单。\"],[\"Teachers use the class website as a <b>channel</b> for sharing readings and announcements.\",\"老师们把班级网站当作发布阅读材料和通知的渠道。\"]],\"clatter\":[[\"Pots and pans <b>clattered</b> in the kitchen as the cooks hurried to prepare lunch.\",\"厨师们忙着准备午饭，厨房里锅碗瓢盆哗啦作响。\"],[\"The old train <b>clattered</b> over the bridge, shaking dust from the beams.\",\"老火车哐当哐当地驶过桥面，震得梁上尘土直落。\"]],\"consume\":[[\"Modern air conditioners <b>consume</b> far less electricity than models from twenty years ago.\",\"现代空调比二十年前的型号耗电少得多。\"],[\"A large wildfire can <b>consume</b> hundreds of hectares of forest in a single day.\",\"一场大山火一天就能吞噬数百公顷森林。\"]],\"coral\":[[\"<b>Coral</b> reefs support about a quarter of all marine species, despite covering less than one percent of the ocean floor.\",\"珊瑚礁面积不到海底的百分之一，却养育着约四分之一的海洋物种。\"],[\"When water temperatures rise too high, <b>coral</b> expels the algae living inside it and turns white.\",\"水温过高时，珊瑚会排出体内的藻类，变成白色。\"]],\"cranberry\":[[\"The tart red <b>cranberry</b> grows in bogs and is harvested by flooding the fields in autumn.\",\"酸酸的红蔓越莓长在沼泽里，秋天人们灌水淹田来采收。\"],[\"She sweetened the <b>cranberry</b> sauce with a little honey before serving it.\",\"上桌前，她给蔓越莓酱加了一点蜂蜜调甜。\"]],\"currency\":[[\"The euro is the official <b>currency</b> of twenty countries in Europe.\",\"欧元是欧洲二十个国家的官方货币。\"],[\"When a country's <b>currency</b> loses value, imported goods become more expensive for its citizens.\",\"当一国货币贬值时，进口商品对该国民众来说就变贵了。\"]],\"current\":[[\"The warm ocean <b>current</b> carries heat from the tropics toward the poles.\",\"暖洋流把热量从热带带向两极。\"],[\"Sailors learned to ride the <b>current</b> south in autumn and return with the northward flow in spring.\",\"水手们学会了秋天顺洋流南下，春天再借北上的洋流返航。\"]],\"decision\":[[\"After weeks of discussion, the committee finally reached a <b>decision</b> about the new curriculum.\",\"经过数周讨论，委员会终于就新课程做出了决定。\"],[\"Moving abroad for graduate school was the hardest <b>decision</b> she had ever made.\",\"出国读研是她做过的最艰难的决定。\"]],\"drama\":[[\"Greek <b>drama</b> was performed outdoors in huge stone theaters that could seat thousands of spectators.\",\"希腊戏剧在能容纳数千名观众的巨型石剧场里露天演出。\"],[\"There was enough <b>drama</b> in the final minutes of the match to fill an entire season.\",\"比赛最后几分钟的戏剧性场面，抵得上一整季。\"]],\"duration\":[[\"The <b>duration</b> of the flight from New York to London is about seven hours.\",\"从纽约飞往伦敦的航程持续时间约为七小时。\"],[\"What matters for language learning is not only the <b>duration</b> of study but also its regularity.\",\"对语言学习来说，重要的不只是学习的时长，还有规律性。\"]],\"ecology\":[[\"<b>Ecology</b> studies how living things interact with each other and with their environment.\",\"生态学研究生物之间以及生物与环境之间如何相互作用。\"],[\"The marsh has a delicate <b>ecology</b> that even small changes in water level can disturb.\",\"这片沼泽的生态十分脆弱，连水位的微小变化都可能打破平衡。\"]],\"epidemic\":[[\"The cholera <b>epidemic</b> of 1854 led scientists to discover that the disease spread through contaminated water.\",\"1854 年的霍乱流行促使科学家发现，这种病是通过受污染的水传播的。\"],[\"Health officials moved quickly to contain the <b>epidemic</b> before it reached the capital.\",\"卫生官员迅速行动，在疫情蔓延到首都之前将其控制住。\"]],\"evolution\":[[\"<b>Evolution</b> explains how a single ancestral species can, over millions of years, give rise to many different forms of life.\",\"演化解释了单一祖先物种如何在数百万年里衍生出众多不同的生命形式。\"],[\"The <b>evolution</b> of the smartphone from a simple calling device took less than two decades.\",\"智能手机从简单的通话设备演变至今，用了不到二十年。\"]],\"flute\":[[\"The <b>flute</b> is one of the oldest instruments; bone flutes have been found in caves dating back 40,000 years.\",\"长笛是最古老的乐器之一，在四万年前的洞穴里就发现了骨笛。\"],[\"She practices the <b>flute</b> for an hour every morning before school.\",\"她每天上学前练一小时长笛。\"]],\"fruit\":[[\"Apples, pears, and grapes are among the most widely grown <b>fruits</b> in the region.\",\"苹果、梨和葡萄是这个地区种植最广的水果。\"],[\"After years of experiments, the team's work finally bore <b>fruit</b> in a working prototype.\",\"经过多年实验，团队的工作终于结出果实，做出了能用的原型机。\"]],\"furthermore\":[[\"The hotel is within walking distance of the station; <b>furthermore</b>, it offers a free airport shuttle.\",\"这家酒店离车站步行可达；此外，它还提供免费的机场接送。\"],[\"The drug is effective in most patients. <b>Furthermore</b>, its side effects are mild and short-lived.\",\"这种药对大多数病人有效。此外，它的副作用轻微且短暂。\"]],\"glove\":[[\"Surgeons wear a fresh pair of sterile <b>gloves</b> for every operation.\",\"外科医生每台手术都要换一副新的无菌手套。\"],[\"He pulled on thick leather <b>gloves</b> before handling the thorny branches.\",\"处理带刺的树枝之前，他戴上了厚厚的皮手套。\"]],\"gold\":[[\"<b>Gold</b> does not rust, which is why ancient coins made of it still shine after two thousand years.\",\"金不会生锈，所以两千年前的金币至今依然闪亮。\"],[\"During the nineteenth century, thousands of miners traveled west in search of <b>gold</b>.\",\"十九世纪，成千上万的淘金者前往西部寻找黄金。\"]],\"guitar\":[[\"He taught himself the <b>guitar</b> by copying songs he heard on the radio.\",\"他靠模仿收音机里听到的歌自学了吉他。\"],[\"The classical <b>guitar</b> has nylon strings, which give it a softer sound than steel strings.\",\"古典吉他用尼龙弦，音色比钢弦更柔和。\"]],\"hazardous\":[[\"The factory was fined for dumping <b>hazardous</b> chemicals into the river without treatment.\",\"这家工厂因未经处理就把危险化学品倒入河中而被罚款。\"],[\"Driving on icy mountain roads can be extremely <b>hazardous</b>, especially at night.\",\"在结冰的山路上开车非常危险，夜里尤其如此。\"]],\"incubation\":[[\"The <b>incubation</b> period of the flu is usually one to four days, during which a person can already spread the virus.\",\"流感的潜伏期通常为一到四天，这期间感染者已经能传播病毒。\"],[\"During <b>incubation</b>, the mother bird leaves the eggs only briefly to feed.\",\"孵化期间，母鸟只会短暂离巢觅食。\"]],\"metaphor\":[[\"Calling time a thief is a <b>metaphor</b>: it suggests that time steals moments from our lives.\",\"把时间称作小偷是一种隐喻：它暗示时间偷走了我们生命中的时光。\"],[\"The lecture used the <b>metaphor</b> of a river to explain how electric current flows.\",\"讲座用河流的隐喻来解释电流是如何流动的。\"]],\"nectar\":[[\"Bees collect <b>nectar</b> from flowers and turn it into honey back at the hive.\",\"蜜蜂从花朵上采集花蜜，回到蜂巢后把它酿成蜂蜜。\"],[\"Hummingbirds hover in front of flowers and use their long tongues to drink the <b>nectar</b>.\",\"蜂鸟悬停在花前，用长长的舌头吸食花蜜。\"]],\"nutrient\":[[\"Nitrogen is an essential <b>nutrient</b> that plants absorb from the soil through their roots.\",\"氮是植物通过根从土壤中吸收的必需养分。\"],[\"Too much <b>nutrient</b> runoff from farms can cause algae to bloom in nearby lakes.\",\"农田流失的过多养分会导致附近湖泊藻类暴发。\"]],\"parasite\":[[\"A tapeworm is a <b>parasite</b> that lives in the intestines of its host and absorbs nutrients from its food.\",\"绦虫是一种寄生虫，寄居在宿主的肠道里，吸取食物中的养分。\"],[\"Some plants, such as mistletoe, act as <b>parasites</b> and draw water from the trees they grow on.\",\"有些植物如槲寄生是寄生性的，从寄主树上吸取水分。\"]],\"pool\":[[\"The hotel <b>pool</b> opens at six in the morning for guests who like an early swim.\",\"酒店的游泳池早上六点开放，方便喜欢晨泳的客人。\"],[\"Algae turned the water of the unused <b>pool</b> a cloudy green within a few weeks.\",\"闲置的泳池几周内就因藻类滋生而变成了浑浊的绿色。\"]],\"prejudice\":[[\"The hiring study showed that <b>prejudice</b> against older applicants persisted even when their qualifications were identical.\",\"这项招聘研究表明，即使资历完全相同，针对年长求职者的偏见依然存在。\"],[\"Good science requires setting aside <b>prejudice</b> and letting the evidence speak for itself.\",\"好的科学要求放下偏见，让证据自己说话。\"]],\"rehabilitation\":[[\"After knee surgery, his <b>rehabilitation</b> took six months of daily exercises.\",\"膝盖手术后，他做了六个月的每日康复训练。\"],[\"The center focuses on the <b>rehabilitation</b> of injured sea turtles before releasing them back into the ocean.\",\"这个中心专门救治受伤的海龟，康复后再把它们放回大海。\"]],\"sandwich\":[[\"He packed a cheese <b>sandwich</b> and an apple for the train ride.\",\"他给火车旅途准备了一个奶酪三明治和一个苹果。\"],[\"The small town is <b>sandwiched</b> between two mountain ranges, with only one road in or out.\",\"这座小镇夹在两座山脉之间，只有一条路进出。\"]],\"shooting\":[[\"<b>Shooting</b> demands a steady hand and total concentration, since even a small shake can move the bullet off target.\",\"射击要求手稳、心无旁骛，因为哪怕轻微的抖动都会让子弹偏离目标。\"],[\"She won a silver medal in <b>shooting</b> at her first international competition.\",\"她在第一次国际比赛中就拿到了射击银牌。\"]],\"smartphone\":[[\"A modern <b>smartphone</b> contains more computing power than the systems that guided the first Moon landing.\",\"一部现代智能手机的计算能力，比当年引导首次登月的系统还要强。\"],[\"Many farmers now check crop prices on a <b>smartphone</b> before deciding when to sell.\",\"许多农民现在会先用智能手机查看作物价格，再决定何时出售。\"]],\"swing\":[[\"The children took turns on the <b>swing</b> while their parents watched from a bench.\",\"孩子们轮流荡秋千，父母坐在长椅上看着他们。\"],[\"A tire hanging from a rope makes a simple but sturdy <b>swing</b>.\",\"用绳子吊一个轮胎，就是一架简单又结实的秋千。\"]],\"tooth\":[[\"The dentist found a small cavity in one of the child's back <b>teeth</b> and filled it the same day.\",\"牙医在孩子一颗后牙上发现了一个小蛀洞，当天就补好了。\"],[\"Elephants use their <b>teeth</b> not only for chewing tough grasses but also for stripping bark from trees.\",\"大象的牙齿不只用来咀嚼坚韧的草，还用来剥树皮。\"]],\"treatment\":[[\"Early <b>treatment</b> greatly improves the chances of a full recovery from this disease.\",\"及早治疗能大大提高这种疾病完全康复的机会。\"],[\"The city built a new plant for the <b>treatment</b> of wastewater before it returns to the river.\",\"这座城市建了一座新厂，在废水排回河流之前先进行处理。\"]],\"unconscious\":[[\"Much of our decision-making is <b>unconscious</b>: we act first and find reasons afterward.\",\"我们的许多决策是无意识的：先行动，事后再找理由。\"],[\"After the fall, he lay <b>unconscious</b> for several minutes before the paramedics arrived.\",\"摔倒之后，他昏迷了几分钟，急救人员才赶到。\"]],\"vaccine\":[[\"The polio <b>vaccine</b> has nearly wiped out the disease worldwide since the 1950s.\",\"自二十世纪五十年代以来，脊髓灰质炎疫苗几乎在全球消灭了这种疾病。\"],[\"Researchers are testing a new <b>vaccine</b> that trains the immune system to recognize several virus variants at once.\",\"研究人员正在测试一种新疫苗，它能训练免疫系统同时识别多种病毒变体。\"]],\"vacuum\":[[\"Sound cannot travel through a <b>vacuum</b> because there are no particles to carry the vibrations.\",\"声音无法在真空中传播，因为没有粒子来传递振动。\"],[\"In the laboratory, the sample is kept in a <b>vacuum</b> so that air cannot contaminate it.\",\"在实验室里，样品被保存在真空中，以免空气污染它。\"]],\"worm\":[[\"After the rain, <b>worms</b> came out of the soil and covered the garden paths.\",\"雨后，蚯蚓从土里钻出来，爬满了花园小径。\"],[\"Earthworms improve the soil by loosening it as they move, a job no machine does as gently as the <b>worm</b> itself.\",\"蚯蚓爬行时能疏松土壤、改善土质，这份工作没有哪台机器能做得像蚯蚓这样温和。\"]],\"absence\":[[\"Her <b>absence</b> from the meeting was noticed, since she usually leads the discussion.\",\"她缺席会议引人注目，因为讨论通常由她主持。\"],[\"After a long <b>absence</b>, the species has returned to the river as the water grew cleaner.\",\"水变清之后，这个物种在消失很久之后又回到了这条河里。\"]],\"approval\":[[\"The new bridge design won <b>approval</b> from the city council after months of debate.\",\"新桥的设计方案经过数月辩论，终于获得了市议会的批准。\"],[\"She glanced at her mentor, looking for a sign of <b>approval</b> before she began.\",\"开始之前，她看了一眼导师，想得到一个肯定的表示。\"]],\"art\":[[\"<b>Art</b> in the Renaissance was closely tied to religion, and most paintings showed biblical scenes.\",\"文艺复兴时期的艺术与宗教紧密相连，大多数画作描绘的都是圣经场景。\"],[\"Cooking at this level becomes an <b>art</b>: timing, temperature, and instinct matter as much as the recipe.\",\"到了这个水准，烹饪就成了一门艺术：火候、温度和直觉与菜谱同样重要。\"]],\"athletic\":[[\"Years of training gave her an <b>athletic</b> build and remarkable endurance.\",\"多年的训练让她拥有运动型的体格和惊人的耐力。\"],[\"The scholarship is awarded to students who are both <b>athletic</b> and strong in science.\",\"这项奖学金颁给既擅长运动又理科出色的学生。\"]],\"avocado\":[[\"The <b>avocado</b> is unusual among fruits for being rich in healthy fats rather than sugars.\",\"牛油果在水果中很特别：它富含健康脂肪，而不是糖分。\"],[\"She spread mashed <b>avocado</b> on toast and sprinkled it with chili flakes.\",\"她把牛油果捣碎抹在吐司上，撒了一点辣椒碎。\"]],\"bark\":[[\"The medicine was originally extracted from the <b>bark</b> of the willow tree.\",\"这种药最初是从柳树皮中提取的。\"],[\"Different species can often be identified by the color and texture of their <b>bark</b>.\",\"单看树皮的颜色和质地，往往就能分辨出不同的树种。\"]],\"basin\":[[\"The river <b>basin</b> covers three provinces and supplies water to millions of people.\",\"这条河的流域覆盖三个省，为数百万人供水。\"],[\"Over millions of years, sediments settled in the <b>basin</b> and slowly turned into rock.\",\"数百万年里，沉积物在盆地中沉积，慢慢变成了岩石。\"]],\"blacken\":[[\"Smoke from the fire <b>blackened</b> the walls of the kitchen.\",\"大火的烟把厨房的墙熏黑了。\"],[\"Left in the open air, the silver spoons gradually <b>blacken</b> and need polishing.\",\"银勺放在空气中会慢慢变黑，需要擦亮。\"]],\"bleed\":[[\"If the cut keeps <b>bleeding</b>, press a clean cloth against it and raise the arm.\",\"如果伤口继续流血，就用干净的布压住，并把手臂抬高。\"],[\"The red dye <b>bled</b> into the white shirt during the wash, turning it pink.\",\"红染料在洗涤时渗到了白衬衫上，把衬衫染成了粉色。\"]],\"bonded\":[[\"The two panels are <b>bonded</b> together with a heat-resistant glue.\",\"两块板子用耐热胶粘合在一起。\"],[\"After years of working side by side, the rescue team members had <b>bonded</b> into a close-knit group.\",\"多年的并肩工作让救援队成员之间结下了深厚的情谊，成了一个紧密的集体。\"]],\"budget\":[[\"The city council approved a <b>budget</b> that sets aside more money for road repairs.\",\"市议会批准了一份预算，为道路维修拨出了更多资金。\"],[\"Travelers on a tight <b>budget</b> often choose overnight trains to save on hotel costs.\",\"预算紧张的旅行者常选夜班火车，以省下住宿费。\"]],\"circumstance\":[[\"Under no <b>circumstances</b> should the machine be opened while it is still running.\",\"在任何情况下，都不能在机器运转时打开它。\"],[\"His financial <b>circumstances</b> forced him to sell the house he had grown up in.\",\"他的经济状况迫使他卖掉了自己从小长大的房子。\"]],\"combust\":[[\"Dry grass can <b>combust</b> easily in the summer heat, so campfires are banned in the park.\",\"干草在夏日高温下很容易燃烧，所以公园里禁止生篝火。\"],[\"The engine is designed so that fuel <b>combusts</b> completely, producing less smoke.\",\"这台发动机的设计让燃油充分燃烧，从而减少烟雾。\"]],\"concentrate\":[[\"It is hard to <b>concentrate</b> on reading when messages keep arriving on your phone.\",\"手机消息不断进来时，很难专心读书。\"],[\"Most of the country's tech companies are <b>concentrated</b> in a few large cities.\",\"这个国家的大多数科技公司都集中在几个大城市。\"]],\"crib\":[[\"Two students were caught <b>cribbing</b> answers from each other during the exam.\",\"两名学生在考试中互相抄袭答案被当场抓住。\"],[\"The speaker openly admitted that he had <b>cribbed</b> the joke from an old comedy show.\",\"演讲者坦然承认，这个笑话是他从一档老喜剧节目里抄来的。\"]],\"customer\":[[\"The shop trains its staff to greet every <b>customer</b> within a minute of entering.\",\"这家店要求员工在每位顾客进门一分钟内上前问候。\"],[\"Online reviews now influence <b>customers</b> more than advertisements do.\",\"如今网络评价对顾客的影响比广告还大。\"]],\"cycling\":[[\"<b>Cycling</b> to work is faster than driving in the city center during rush hour.\",\"在高峰时段，骑行上班比开车穿过市中心还快。\"],[\"She took up <b>cycling</b> after her doctor advised her to exercise her knees gently.\",\"医生建议她温和地活动膝盖之后，她开始骑行。\"]],\"dentistry\":[[\"Advances in <b>dentistry</b> have made it possible to save teeth that would once have been pulled.\",\"牙科的进步让过去只能拔掉的牙齿如今也能保住。\"],[\"He studied <b>dentistry</b> for five years before opening his own clinic.\",\"他学了五年牙科，才开了自己的诊所。\"]],\"entrance\":[[\"The museum's main <b>entrance</b> faces the square, but the side door is closer to the parking lot.\",\"博物馆正门朝向广场，但侧门离停车场更近。\"],[\"Her sudden <b>entrance</b> silenced the room; everyone turned to look.\",\"她突然入场，全场安静下来，所有人都转头看她。\"]],\"exclusion\":[[\"The <b>exclusion</b> of women from the profession lasted well into the twentieth century.\",\"把女性排除在这个行业之外的现象一直持续到二十世纪。\"],[\"The price is quoted with the <b>exclusion</b> of taxes and delivery charges.\",\"这个报价不含税费和运费。\"]],\"expansion\":[[\"The rapid <b>expansion</b> of the suburbs pushed farmland farther from the city.\",\"郊区的快速扩张把农田推到了离城市更远的地方。\"],[\"Gases undergo <b>expansion</b> when heated, which is why hot-air balloons rise.\",\"气体受热会膨胀，这正是热气球能升空的原因。\"]],\"festival\":[[\"During the lantern <b>festival</b>, thousands of lights are floated down the river at night.\",\"灯节期间，夜里有成千上万盏灯顺河漂下。\"],[\"The film <b>festival</b> screens over two hundred movies from forty countries.\",\"这个电影节放映来自四十个国家的两百多部影片。\"]],\"fossil\":[[\"The <b>fossil</b> of a fish found high in the mountains proves that the area was once under the sea.\",\"在高山上发现的鱼类化石证明，这片地区曾经是海底。\"],[\"Coal, oil, and natural gas are called <b>fossil</b> fuels because they formed from ancient living things.\",\"煤、石油和天然气被称为化石燃料，因为它们由远古生物形成。\"]],\"freeway\":[[\"Traffic on the <b>freeway</b> slowed to a crawl after a truck overturned near the exit.\",\"一辆卡车在出口附近翻车后，快速路上的交通慢得像爬行。\"],[\"The new <b>freeway</b> cut the drive between the two cities from three hours to ninety minutes.\",\"新快速路把两座城市之间的车程从三小时缩短到九十分钟。\"]],\"hazelnut\":[[\"The cake is topped with crushed <b>hazelnuts</b> and a thin layer of chocolate.\",\"蛋糕上面撒了榛子碎和一层薄薄的巧克力。\"],[\"Squirrels bury <b>hazelnuts</b> in autumn and dig them up during the winter.\",\"松鼠秋天把榛子埋进土里，冬天再挖出来吃。\"]],\"horn\":[[\"Unlike antlers, a rhino's <b>horn</b> is made of keratin, the same material as human fingernails.\",\"和鹿角不同，犀牛的角由角蛋白构成，与人的指甲是同一种物质。\"],[\"The driver honked the <b>horn</b> twice to warn the cyclist ahead.\",\"司机按了两下喇叭，提醒前面的骑行者。\"]],\"host\":[[\"Our <b>host</b> showed us around the farm and served a lunch made entirely from its own produce.\",\"主人带我们参观了农场，还用农场自产的食材做了一顿午饭。\"],[\"A tick feeds on its <b>host</b> — often a deer or a dog — for several days before dropping off.\",\"蜱虫会在宿主——通常是鹿或狗——身上吸血数天，然后才脱落。\"]],\"internet\":[[\"The <b>internet</b> allows a small workshop in a village to sell its products to the whole world.\",\"互联网让村里的一个小作坊也能把产品卖到全世界。\"],[\"When the undersea cable was cut, the island lost its <b>internet</b> connection for two days.\",\"海底电缆被切断后，这座岛的互联网连接中断了两天。\"]],\"kernel\":[[\"Each ear of corn carries hundreds of <b>kernels</b> arranged in neat rows.\",\"每个玉米棒上整齐地排列着数百粒玉米粒。\"],[\"At the <b>kernel</b> of his argument is a simple claim: habits matter more than talent.\",\"他论证的果核——也就是核心——是一个简单的主张：习惯比天赋更重要。\"]],\"knit\":[[\"She learned to <b>knit</b> from her grandmother and still makes all her winter scarves by hand.\",\"她跟祖母学会了编织，冬天的围巾至今都自己手织。\"],[\"Broken bones usually <b>knit</b> together within six to eight weeks if kept still.\",\"骨折后只要固定不动，骨头通常在六到八周内愈合。\"]],\"magic\":[[\"The magician's best <b>magic</b> trick relied on a mirror hidden inside the table.\",\"魔术师最拿手的魔术靠的是藏在桌子里的镜子。\"],[\"There is a kind of <b>magic</b> in the first snowfall of the year that makes the whole town quieter.\",\"每年第一场雪有一种魔力，能让整个小镇都安静下来。\"]],\"memory\":[[\"Childhood <b>memories</b> of the old house still come back to her whenever it rains.\",\"每逢下雨，童年时那栋老房子的记忆仍会回到她脑海。\"],[\"The new laptop comes with twice the <b>memory</b> of the previous model, so it handles large files easily.\",\"新款笔记本的内存是上一代的两倍，处理大文件很轻松。\"]],\"monopoly\":[[\"The company held a <b>monopoly</b> on ferry services to the island for almost thirty years.\",\"这家公司在近三十年里垄断了前往该岛的渡轮服务。\"],[\"Regulators broke up the telephone <b>monopoly</b> to encourage competition and lower prices.\",\"监管机构拆分了电话垄断企业，以鼓励竞争、降低价格。\"]],\"orange\":[[\"An <b>orange</b> a day provides most of the vitamin C an adult needs.\",\"每天一个橙子就能提供成年人所需的大部分维生素 C。\"],[\"She peeled the <b>orange</b> in one long spiral and dropped the peel into her tea.\",\"她把橙子皮剥成一整条长螺旋，放进了茶里。\"]],\"oxidation\":[[\"<b>Oxidation</b> is what turns the surface of an old copper roof from brown to green.\",\"氧化正是老铜屋顶表面由棕变绿的原因。\"],[\"Cut apples brown quickly because of <b>oxidation</b>; a little lemon juice slows the process.\",\"切开的苹果因氧化很快变褐，一点柠檬汁就能延缓这个过程。\"]],\"pea\":[[\"Garden <b>peas</b> are sweetest when eaten on the same day they are picked.\",\"菜园里的豌豆在采摘当天吃最甜。\"],[\"Mendel's experiments with <b>pea</b> plants laid the foundation of modern genetics.\",\"孟德尔用豌豆植株做的实验奠定了现代遗传学的基础。\"]],\"pen\":[[\"He signed the contract with a fountain <b>pen</b> he had carried for twenty years.\",\"他用一支带了二十年的钢笔签了合同。\"],[\"In her travel journal, she sketched the harbor with a fine <b>pen</b> and a few strokes.\",\"在旅行日记里，她用细笔寥寥几笔勾出了港口。\"]],\"photosynthesis\":[[\"Through <b>photosynthesis</b>, green plants convert sunlight, water, and carbon dioxide into oxygen and sugar.\",\"绿色植物通过光合作用，把阳光、水和二氧化碳转化成氧气和糖。\"],[\"The rate of <b>photosynthesis</b> drops on cloudy days, slowing the growth of the crop.\",\"阴天时光合作用速率下降，作物的生长也随之变慢。\"]],\"physics\":[[\"<b>Physics</b> explains everything from the fall of an apple to the orbit of a planet.\",\"物理学解释从苹果落地到行星运行的一切。\"],[\"She switched her major from chemistry to <b>physics</b> after one lecture on relativity.\",\"上了一堂相对论的课之后，她把专业从化学换成了物理学。\"]],\"primary\":[[\"The <b>primary</b> goal of the survey was to find out how residents actually use the park.\",\"这项调查的首要目标是了解居民实际如何使用这座公园。\"],[\"In the experiment, temperature was the <b>primary</b> variable, and all other conditions were held constant.\",\"在实验中，温度是首要变量，其他条件都保持不变。\"]],\"reporter\":[[\"The <b>reporter</b> interviewed fishermen, scientists, and officials to cover the oil spill from every angle.\",\"记者采访了渔民、科学家和官员，从各个角度报道这起漏油事件。\"],[\"A local <b>reporter</b> first noticed that the river's color had changed.\",\"一位当地记者最先注意到河水变了颜色。\"]],\"resort\":[[\"The ski <b>resort</b> employs half the town during the winter season.\",\"冬季里，这家滑雪度假村雇用了全镇一半的人。\"],[\"When every other plan had failed, negotiation was their last <b>resort</b>.\",\"所有办法都失败后，谈判成了他们最后的手段。\"]],\"rhyme\":[[\"The poem's <b>rhyme</b> scheme repeats the same two sounds at the end of every four lines.\",\"这首诗的押韵格式是每四行在行尾重复同样的两个音。\"],[\"Young children often learn new words more easily when the words <b>rhyme</b>.\",\"幼儿在词语押韵时往往更容易学会新词。\"]],\"section\":[[\"The last <b>section</b> of the report lists what still needs to be tested.\",\"报告的最后一部分列出了仍需测试的事项。\"],[\"One <b>section</b> of the old wall has been rebuilt with the original stones.\",\"古城墙的一段已经用原石重建。\"]],\"settler\":[[\"The first <b>settlers</b> built their homes along the river, where the soil was deepest.\",\"第一批定居者沿河建房，那里土层最厚。\"],[\"<b>Settlers</b> introduced new crops, but some of them later became invasive weeds.\",\"定居者带来了新作物，但其中一些后来变成了入侵性杂草。\"]],\"singer\":[[\"The <b>singer</b> trained as an opera performer before turning to folk music.\",\"这位歌手在转向民谣之前接受的是歌剧演唱训练。\"],[\"Street <b>singers</b> in the square drew a small crowd despite the cold.\",\"广场上的街头歌手冒着寒冷，仍吸引了一小群听众。\"]],\"squeeze\":[[\"She <b>squeezed</b> the sponge dry before wiping the counter.\",\"擦台面之前，她先把海绵拧干。\"],[\"Six people <b>squeezed</b> into the elevator, though the sign said the limit was four.\",\"六个人挤进了电梯，尽管牌子上写着限乘四人。\"]],\"tomb\":[[\"The pharaoh's <b>tomb</b> was filled with gold objects, furniture, and even boats for the afterlife.\",\"法老的陵墓里装满了金器、家具，甚至还有为来世准备的船。\"],[\"Archaeologists sealed the <b>tomb</b> again after recording everything inside it.\",\"考古学家把墓内一切记录完毕后，重新封闭了陵墓。\"]],\"tropic\":[[\"Plants in the <b>tropics</b> grow all year round because the temperature never drops sharply.\",\"热带地区的植物全年生长，因为那里的气温从不骤降。\"],[\"The expedition crossed the <b>Tropic</b> of Cancer on its way south across the ocean.\",\"探险队在横渡大洋南下的途中穿过了北回归线。\"]],\"website\":[[\"The museum's <b>website</b> lets visitors book tickets and preview the exhibition online.\",\"博物馆的网站让游客可以在线订票并预览展览。\"],[\"He built the band's first <b>website</b> himself, using a free template.\",\"他用免费模板亲手做了乐队的第一个网站。\"]],\"advertiser\":[[\"An <b>advertiser</b> will pay more for a time slot during the evening news than for one at midnight.\",\"广告商愿意为晚间新闻时段的广告位支付比午夜时段更高的价格。\"],[\"Small businesses can now act as their own <b>advertisers</b> by posting short videos online.\",\"小企业现在可以自己在网上发短视频，充当自己的广告商。\"]],\"aggression\":[[\"In many species, <b>aggression</b> rises when food becomes scarce and competition increases.\",\"在许多物种中，食物变少、竞争加剧时，攻击性会上升。\"],[\"The coach taught players to channel their <b>aggression</b> into defense rather than fouls.\",\"教练教队员把攻击性用在防守上，而不是犯规上。\"]],\"allegiance\":[[\"The soldiers swore <b>allegiance</b> to the republic, not to any single general.\",\"士兵们宣誓效忠共和国，而不是任何一位将军。\"],[\"Fans' <b>allegiance</b> to their hometown team often passes from parents to children.\",\"球迷对家乡球队的忠诚常常由父母传给孩子。\"]],\"ant\":[[\"A single <b>ant</b> can carry objects many times its own body weight.\",\"一只蚂蚁能搬动数倍于自身体重的物体。\"],[\"When one <b>ant</b> finds food, it leaves a chemical trail so the others can follow.\",\"一只蚂蚁找到食物后会留下化学气味，让同伴循迹而来。\"]],\"apprehensive\":[[\"She felt <b>apprehensive</b> about speaking in public for the first time, but the audience was kind.\",\"第一次公开演讲让她心里忧虑，但听众很友善。\"],[\"Farmers watched the darkening sky with <b>apprehensive</b> eyes as harvest time approached.\",\"收获时节临近，农民们忧心忡忡地望着越来越暗的天空。\"]],\"approve\":[[\"The board <b>approved</b> the plan to renovate the library over the summer.\",\"董事会批准了暑期翻修图书馆的计划。\"],[\"Most parents <b>approve</b> of the later start time because teenagers sleep better.\",\"大多数家长赞成推迟上课时间，因为青少年能睡得更好。\"]],\"attraction\":[[\"The main <b>attraction</b> of the park is a waterfall that freezes into a wall of ice each winter.\",\"这座公园最大的吸引力是一道瀑布，每年冬天都会冻成一面冰墙。\"],[\"The <b>attraction</b> between opposite poles of a magnet can be felt even through a sheet of paper.\",\"磁铁异极之间的吸引力隔着一张纸也能感觉到。\"]],\"avalanche\":[[\"Warm afternoon sun loosened the snowpack and triggered an <b>avalanche</b> above the village.\",\"午后暖阳使积雪松动，在村庄上方引发了雪崩。\"],[\"After the new product launch, the company received an <b>avalanche</b> of orders it could barely handle.\",\"新产品发布后，公司收到了雪崩般涌来的订单，几乎应付不过来。\"]],\"bacon\":[[\"He fried the <b>bacon</b> until it was crisp and laid it on a paper towel to drain.\",\"他把培根煎到酥脆，放在纸巾上沥油。\"],[\"A few strips of <b>bacon</b> add a smoky flavor to the bean soup.\",\"几条培根能为豆汤增添烟熏风味。\"]],\"bankruptcy\":[[\"The airline filed for <b>bankruptcy</b> after fuel prices rose and passenger numbers fell.\",\"油价上涨、客流下降之后，这家航空公司申请了破产。\"],[\"Small suppliers are often pushed into <b>bankruptcy</b> when a large client pays its bills months late.\",\"大客户拖欠账款数月时，小供应商常常被拖入破产。\"]],\"biased\":[[\"The sample was <b>biased</b> because only gym members were asked about their exercise habits.\",\"样本有偏差，因为调查只问了健身房会员的运动习惯。\"],[\"A good judge must set aside personal feelings and refuse to be <b>biased</b> toward either side.\",\"好法官必须抛开个人情感，拒绝偏袒任何一方。\"]],\"bloom\":[[\"The cherry trees usually <b>bloom</b> in the first week of April, drawing crowds to the park.\",\"樱花树通常在四月第一周开花，吸引大批人来到公园。\"],[\"Under the right conditions, algae <b>bloom</b> rapidly and cover the surface of the lake.\",\"条件适宜时，藻类会迅速暴发，覆盖湖面。\"]],\"boxing\":[[\"<b>Boxing</b> requires not only strength but also quick footwork and patience.\",\"拳击不只需要力量，还需要灵活的步法和耐心。\"],[\"He took up <b>boxing</b> at a local gym to improve his fitness, not to compete.\",\"他在一家本地健身房练拳击是为了健身，而不是比赛。\"]],\"canoeing\":[[\"<b>Canoeing</b> on the quiet river is popular with families because the current is gentle.\",\"在这条平静的河上划独木舟很受家庭欢迎，因为水流平缓。\"],[\"They spent the morning <b>canoeing</b> between the islands, stopping to swim whenever they felt hot.\",\"他们一上午都在群岛之间划独木舟，热了就停下来游泳。\"]],\"carnival\":[[\"During <b>carnival</b>, the streets fill with dancers in bright costumes and bands on every corner.\",\"嘉年华期间，街上满是穿着鲜艳服装的舞者，每个街角都有乐队。\"],[\"The school <b>carnival</b> raised enough money to buy new instruments for the music room.\",\"学校嘉年华筹到的钱足够为音乐教室添置新乐器。\"]],\"cell\":[[\"The human body is made of trillions of <b>cells</b>, most of which contain a complete copy of the DNA.\",\"人体由数万亿个细胞构成，其中大多数都含有一套完整的 DNA 副本。\"],[\"Under the microscope, a plant <b>cell</b> shows a rigid wall that animal cells do not have.\",\"在显微镜下，植物细胞有一层动物细胞所没有的坚硬细胞壁。\"]],\"cherry\":[[\"The <b>cherry</b> harvest lasts only a few weeks, and pickers must work fast before the birds arrive.\",\"樱桃的采收季只有几周，采摘工必须赶在鸟群到来之前抓紧干。\"],[\"She decorated the cake with a single <b>cherry</b> on top.\",\"她在蛋糕顶上点缀了一颗樱桃。\"]],\"chip\":[[\"A modern phone <b>chip</b> contains billions of transistors, each smaller than a virus.\",\"现代手机芯片含有数十亿个晶体管，每个都比病毒还小。\"],[\"He ordered fish and <b>chips</b> at the small restaurant by the harbor.\",\"他在港口边的小餐馆点了炸鱼薯条。\"]],\"coin\":[[\"The empire began to <b>coin</b> money with the emperor's portrait to spread his image across the provinces.\",\"帝国开始铸造印有皇帝肖像的货币，把他的形象传播到各个行省。\"],[\"Under pressure, the metal blank is struck once to <b>coin</b> both sides at the same time.\",\"在压力下，金属坯被冲压一次，钱币的两面同时成型。\"]],\"commodity\":[[\"Coffee is a global <b>commodity</b> whose price swings with the weather in a few producing countries.\",\"咖啡是一种全球性商品，其价格随着几个产国的天气而波动。\"],[\"In the desert, fresh water became the most precious <b>commodity</b> of all.\",\"在沙漠里，淡水成了最珍贵的商品。\"]],\"destruction\":[[\"The earthquake caused widespread <b>destruction</b> in the old part of the city.\",\"地震给城市的老城区造成了大面积破坏。\"],[\"Habitat <b>destruction</b> is the single greatest threat to most endangered species.\",\"栖息地破坏是大多数濒危物种面临的单一最大威胁。\"]],\"determination\":[[\"Her <b>determination</b> to finish the marathon carried her through the final, painful kilometers.\",\"跑完马拉松的决心支撑着她熬过了最后痛苦的几公里。\"],[\"The committee praised the young researcher's <b>determination</b> in repeating the experiment fifty times.\",\"委员会赞扬了这位年轻研究者把实验重复五十次的决心。\"]],\"discussion\":[[\"The <b>discussion</b> turned to how the school should spend its limited repair budget.\",\"讨论转向了学校该如何使用有限的维修预算。\"],[\"After a long <b>discussion</b>, the two sides agreed to test both designs.\",\"经过长时间讨论，双方同意对两种设计都进行测试。\"]],\"distance\":[[\"The <b>distance</b> between the two towns is only thirty kilometers, but the mountain road takes an hour.\",\"两镇之间的距离只有三十公里，但山路要走一个小时。\"],[\"From a <b>distance</b>, the lighthouse looked like a white pencil standing on the cliff.\",\"远远望去，灯塔像一支立在悬崖上的白色铅笔。\"]],\"elephant\":[[\"An <b>elephant</b> uses its trunk both to grab food and to spray water over its back.\",\"大象用鼻子既抓食物，也往背上喷水。\"],[\"Female <b>elephants</b> lead the herd, and the oldest female usually knows where water can be found in a drought.\",\"母象带领象群，年纪最大的母象通常知道干旱时哪里能找到水。\"]],\"elevation\":[[\"At an <b>elevation</b> of 3,000 meters, water boils at a lower temperature and cooking takes longer.\",\"在海拔 3000 米处，水沸腾的温度更低，做饭要花更长时间。\"],[\"The map uses contour lines to show changes in <b>elevation</b> across the valley.\",\"这张地图用等高线标示山谷里的高程变化。\"]],\"enclosure\":[[\"The horses spend the night in a fenced <b>enclosure</b> near the barn.\",\"马匹夜里待在谷仓附近的围栏圈地里过夜。\"],[\"Zoo designers replaced cages with open <b>enclosures</b> that mimic each animal's natural habitat.\",\"动物园设计者用模仿动物自然栖息地的开放式围地取代了笼子。\"]],\"enforcement\":[[\"Law <b>enforcement</b> in the port focuses on stopping the smuggling of endangered animals.\",\"港口的执法重点是打击濒危动物走私。\"],[\"Strict <b>enforcement</b> of speed limits reduced accidents on the highway by a third.\",\"严格执行限速规定后，高速公路上的事故减少了三分之一。\"]],\"envy\":[[\"She felt a flash of <b>envy</b> when her rival won the prize she had worked for all year.\",\"对手拿走了她努力一年的奖项时，她心里闪过一阵嫉妒。\"],[\"I <b>envy</b> his ability to fall asleep anywhere, even on a noisy train.\",\"我羡慕他在哪儿都能睡着的本事，连吵闹的火车上都行。\"]],\"exultation\":[[\"There was <b>exultation</b> in the locker room after the underdog team won in the final second.\",\"弱旅在最后一秒获胜后，更衣室里一片欢欣。\"],[\"He read the acceptance letter twice, unable to hide his <b>exultation</b>.\",\"他把录取通知书读了两遍，掩饰不住满心的欢欣。\"]],\"finger\":[[\"The baby wrapped her tiny hand around his <b>finger</b> and would not let go.\",\"婴儿用小手攥住他的手指，不肯松开。\"],[\"Pianists stretch their <b>fingers</b> before a performance to keep them flexible.\",\"钢琴家演出前会伸展手指，保持灵活。\"]],\"grasp\":[[\"The climber <b>grasped</b> the rope with both hands and pulled herself up.\",\"攀登者双手抓牢绳子，把自己拉了上去。\"],[\"It took the class a week to <b>grasp</b> the difference between heat and temperature.\",\"全班花了一周才领会热量和温度的区别。\"]],\"gymnastics\":[[\"<b>Gymnastics</b> combines strength, balance, and flexibility in a way few other sports do.\",\"体操把力量、平衡和柔韧结合在一起，这一点很少有其他运动能做到。\"],[\"She started <b>gymnastics</b> at six and competed nationally by the time she was fourteen.\",\"她六岁开始练体操，十四岁就参加了全国比赛。\"]],\"interval\":[[\"Buses on this route run at fifteen-minute <b>intervals</b> during the morning rush.\",\"这条线路的公交车在早高峰每十五分钟一班。\"],[\"During the <b>interval</b> between the two experiments, the samples were kept in the dark.\",\"两次实验的间隔期间，样品被保存在黑暗中。\"]],\"jackal\":[[\"A <b>jackal</b> often follows lions at a distance, hoping to scavenge what they leave behind.\",\"豺常远远跟着狮子，希望能捡食它们剩下的猎物。\"],[\"The <b>jackal</b>'s howl at dusk is a familiar sound on the savanna.\",\"黄昏时豺的嚎叫声是热带草原上熟悉的声音。\"]],\"judo\":[[\"In <b>judo</b>, a smaller fighter can throw a larger opponent by using the opponent's own momentum.\",\"在柔道中，体格较小的选手可以借对手自身的冲力把大块头对手摔出去。\"],[\"She earned her black belt in <b>judo</b> after eight years of training.\",\"经过八年训练，她拿到了柔道黑带。\"]],\"magnetic\":[[\"The refrigerator door stays shut because of a <b>magnetic</b> strip along its edge.\",\"冰箱门靠边缘的磁条吸住而关紧。\"],[\"Earth's <b>magnetic</b> field protects the surface from most of the charged particles streaming from the Sun.\",\"地球磁场保护地表免受来自太阳的大部分带电粒子的冲击。\"]],\"moose\":[[\"A <b>moose</b> can stand over two meters tall at the shoulder, yet it moves almost silently through the forest.\",\"驼鹿肩高可超过两米，却能几乎无声地穿过森林。\"],[\"In winter, <b>moose</b> feed on twigs and bark because the plants they prefer are buried under snow.\",\"冬天，驼鹿以嫩枝和树皮为食，因为它们爱吃的植物被埋在了雪下。\"]],\"neutron\":[[\"A <b>neutron</b> has no electric charge, so it can slip into an atomic nucleus without being pushed away.\",\"中子不带电荷，所以能不受排斥地进入原子核。\"],[\"When a <b>neutron</b> strikes a uranium nucleus, the nucleus can split and release energy.\",\"当一个中子撞击铀原子核时，原子核会分裂并释放能量。\"]],\"pack\":[[\"She <b>packed</b> a warm jacket, since nights in the mountains turn cold even in July.\",\"她打包了一件厚外套，因为山里的夜晚连七月也冷。\"],[\"Volunteers <b>pack</b> boxes of food each Friday for families in the neighborhood.\",\"志愿者每周五为社区家庭打包食物箱。\"]],\"pier\":[[\"Fishermen cast their lines from the end of the <b>pier</b> at dawn.\",\"渔民在黎明时分站在栈桥尽头抛线钓鱼。\"],[\"The old wooden <b>pier</b> now serves as a viewing platform for watching sunsets over the bay.\",\"这座老木栈桥如今成了观赏海湾日落的观景台。\"]],\"positive\":[[\"The pilot study produced <b>positive</b> results, so the team moved on to a larger trial.\",\"试点研究取得了积极结果，团队于是推进到更大规模的试验。\"],[\"She stayed <b>positive</b> during the long recovery, setting small goals for each week.\",\"在漫长的康复期里，她始终保持积极，每周给自己定小目标。\"]],\"proportion\":[[\"In a classical building, the <b>proportion</b> of height to width follows strict mathematical rules.\",\"在古典建筑中，高度与宽度的比例遵循严格的数学法则。\"],[\"A large <b>proportion</b> of the budget went to repairing roads rather than building new ones.\",\"预算的很大一部分用于修路，而不是建新路。\"]],\"reindeer\":[[\"<b>Reindeer</b> are unusual among deer because both males and females grow antlers.\",\"驯鹿在鹿类中很特别，因为雄性和雌性都长角。\"],[\"For centuries, herders in the far north have depended on <b>reindeer</b> for transport, milk, and clothing.\",\"几个世纪以来，极北地区的牧民依靠驯鹿提供交通、奶和衣物。\"]],\"share\":[[\"Each founder received an equal <b>share</b> of the company when it was incorporated.\",\"公司成立时，每位创始人都获得了均等的股份。\"],[\"The price of the company's <b>shares</b> rose after it announced record profits.\",\"公司宣布创纪录利润后，其股价随即上涨。\"]],\"superintendent\":[[\"The school <b>superintendent</b> announced that all schools would close during the snowstorm.\",\"学监宣布暴风雪期间所有学校停课。\"],[\"As building <b>superintendent</b>, he is responsible for repairs in all forty apartments.\",\"作为大楼管理员，他负责全部四十户公寓的维修。\"]],\"swarm\":[[\"A <b>swarm</b> of bees can contain twenty thousand workers following a single queen.\",\"一群蜜蜂可包含两万只工蜂，跟随一只蜂王。\"],[\"When disturbed, the ants <b>swarm</b> out of the nest within seconds.\",\"受到惊扰时，蚂蚁会在几秒内成群涌出巢穴。\"]],\"tear\":[[\"A single <b>tear</b> ran down her cheek as she read the letter from her brother.\",\"读着哥哥的来信，一滴眼泪顺着她的脸颊滑落。\"],[\"<b>Tears</b> help keep the surface of the eye moist and wash away dust.\",\"眼泪有助于保持眼球表面湿润，并冲走灰尘。\"]],\"trombone\":[[\"In the orchestra, the <b>trombone</b> changes pitch by extending a long sliding tube.\",\"在管弦乐队中，长号靠伸缩一根长长的滑管来改变音高。\"],[\"He carries his <b>trombone</b> to school in a case almost as tall as he is.\",\"他把长号装在一个几乎和他一样高的盒子里带去学校。\"]],\"woodpecker\":[[\"The <b>woodpecker</b> hammers at the trunk up to twenty times per second without injuring its brain.\",\"啄木鸟每秒啄击树干多达二十次，大脑却不会受伤。\"],[\"A <b>woodpecker</b>'s tongue is so long that it wraps around the bird's skull when not in use.\",\"啄木鸟的舌头长到不用时会绕在头骨上。\"]],\"admire\":[[\"Visitors <b>admire</b> the bridge not only for its beauty but also for the engineering behind it.\",\"参观者钦佩这座桥，不仅因为它美，还因为它背后的工程技术。\"],[\"She has always <b>admired</b> her grandfather's calm way of solving problems.\",\"她一直钦佩祖父那种沉着解决问题的作风。\"]],\"anterior\":[[\"The <b>anterior</b> part of the brain is involved in planning and decision-making.\",\"大脑的前部参与计划和决策。\"],[\"In the diagram, the <b>anterior</b> fin of the fish is drawn in a darker shade.\",\"在图示中，鱼的前鳍用较深的色调标出。\"]],\"anticipation\":[[\"In <b>anticipation</b> of the storm, residents stocked up on water and candles.\",\"为防备风暴，居民提前储备了水和蜡烛。\"],[\"The audience waited in <b>anticipation</b> as the curtain slowly rose.\",\"幕布缓缓升起，观众满怀期待地等待着。\"]],\"anxiety\":[[\"Test <b>anxiety</b> can lower performance even in students who know the material well.\",\"考试焦虑会让本来很熟练的学生也发挥失常。\"],[\"He felt a wave of <b>anxiety</b> as the plane began its descent through the storm.\",\"飞机开始穿过风暴下降时，他感到一阵焦虑袭来。\"]],\"apathy\":[[\"Voter <b>apathy</b> is a serious problem when people believe their single vote cannot matter.\",\"当人们觉得自己的一票无关紧要时，选民的冷漠就成了严重问题。\"],[\"The manager was troubled by the team's <b>apathy</b> toward the new safety rules.\",\"团队对新安全规定的冷漠让经理很头疼。\"]],\"applicable\":[[\"The same principle is <b>applicable</b> to many other machines, not just steam engines.\",\"同样的原理适用于许多其他机器，不只是蒸汽机。\"],[\"Please check the box if the statement is <b>applicable</b> to your situation.\",\"如果这条陈述适用于你的情况，请勾选方框。\"]],\"approach\":[[\"One <b>approach</b> to the water shortage is to recycle wastewater for irrigation.\",\"应对水资源短缺的一个方法是把废水回收用于灌溉。\"],[\"The teacher tried a new <b>approach</b>: students first explained the problem in their own words.\",\"老师尝试了新方法：先让学生用自己的话把问题讲一遍。\"]],\"attempt\":[[\"The climbers will <b>attempt</b> the summit again tomorrow if the wind drops.\",\"如果风势减弱，登山者明天将再次尝试冲顶。\"],[\"Do not <b>attempt</b> to repair the wiring yourself; call a licensed electrician.\",\"不要试图自己修电线，请找有执照的电工。\"]],\"augmented\":[[\"The museum guide uses <b>augmented</b> reality to show how the ruined temple once looked.\",\"博物馆导览用增强现实展示了这座废墟神庙曾经的样子。\"],[\"Her income from teaching was <b>augmented</b> by weekend translation work.\",\"她周末做翻译，为教学收入做了补充。\"]],\"bakery\":[[\"The <b>bakery</b> on the corner sells out of its bread before nine every morning.\",\"街角的面包店每天早上九点前就把面包卖光了。\"],[\"Warm air carrying the smell of fresh rolls drifted out of the <b>bakery</b>.\",\"面包店里飘出带着新鲜面包卷香气的暖风。\"]],\"boss\":[[\"Her <b>boss</b> asked her to present the results at Friday's meeting.\",\"她老板让她在周五的会议上汇报结果。\"],[\"He is not afraid to tell his <b>boss</b> when a deadline is unrealistic.\",\"他不怕告诉老板某个期限不切实际。\"]],\"canvass\":[[\"Volunteers <b>canvassed</b> the neighborhood for a week, knocking on doors to ask about the bus service.\",\"志愿者用一周时间在社区游说，挨家挨户敲门询问公交服务的情况。\"],[\"Before the vote, students <b>canvassed</b> support for extending library hours.\",\"投票前，学生们四处游说，争取延长图书馆开放时间。\"]],\"catalyze\":[[\"Enzymes <b>catalyze</b> reactions in the cell that would otherwise happen far too slowly.\",\"酶能催化细胞内的反应，否则这些反应会慢得无法进行。\"],[\"The documentary <b>catalyzed</b> a national conversation about plastic waste.\",\"这部纪录片促成了一场关于塑料垃圾的全国讨论。\"]],\"ceramic\":[[\"<b>Ceramic</b> tiles keep the kitchen walls cool and are easy to wipe clean.\",\"陶瓷砖让厨房墙面保持凉爽，而且容易擦洗。\"],[\"Archaeologists date the site by the style of the <b>ceramic</b> fragments found in its deepest layer.\",\"考古学家根据最深层出土的陶瓷碎片的样式来判定遗址的年代。\"]],\"cheese\":[[\"The region is famous for a firm <b>cheese</b> that is aged in caves for two years.\",\"这个地区以一种在洞穴中陈化两年的硬质奶酪闻名。\"],[\"Aged <b>cheese</b> contains very little lactose, so many people who avoid milk can still eat it.\",\"陈年奶酪的乳糖含量极低，所以许多不喝牛奶的人也能吃。\"]],\"cite\":[[\"In her essay, she <b>cited</b> three recent studies that support her argument.\",\"她在文章中引用了三项支持其论点的近期研究。\"],[\"The report <b>cites</b> rising sea levels as the main reason for rebuilding the harbor.\",\"报告指出海平面上升是重建港口的主要原因。\"]],\"cloy\":[[\"The dessert is rich with honey, but the lemon keeps it from becoming <b>cloying</b>.\",\"这道甜点蜜味浓厚，但柠檬让它不至于腻人。\"],[\"After the third helping of the sweet glaze, the flavor began to <b>cloy</b>.\",\"吃了三份甜酱汁之后，那股味道开始让人腻烦。\"]],\"commission\":[[\"The city formed a <b>commission</b> to investigate why the bridge had cracked.\",\"市政府成立了一个委员会，调查大桥开裂的原因。\"],[\"A <b>commission</b> of historians reviewed the documents before they were made public.\",\"一个由历史学家组成的委员会在文件公开前审阅了它们。\"]],\"communicate\":[[\"Dolphins <b>communicate</b> with each other through clicks and whistles.\",\"海豚通过咔嗒声和哨声彼此交流。\"],[\"The engineer struggled to <b>communicate</b> the design's advantages to non-technical managers.\",\"工程师费力地向非技术背景的管理者说明这个设计的优点。\"]],\"concentration\":[[\"<b>Concentration</b> in the library was impossible during the construction outside.\",\"外面在施工，图书馆里根本无法专注。\"],[\"The <b>concentration</b> of salt in the lake is so high that swimmers float without effort.\",\"湖里盐的浓度极高，游泳者不用费力就能浮起来。\"]],\"conserve\":[[\"Farmers use drip irrigation to <b>conserve</b> water in this dry region.\",\"这个干旱地区的农民用滴灌来节约用水。\"],[\"To <b>conserve</b> energy, the building's lights switch off automatically when rooms are empty.\",\"为了节能，这栋楼的灯在房间没人时会自动关闭。\"]],\"critique\":[[\"Her <b>critique</b> of the mayor's plan appeared in the Sunday paper and sparked a week of debate.\",\"她批评市长方案的文章刊登在周日报纸上，引发了一周的争论。\"],[\"The journal published a sharp <b>critique</b> of the study's methods.\",\"这家期刊刊登了一篇犀利批评该研究方法的文章。\"]],\"definition\":[[\"By <b>definition</b>, a square is a rectangle with four equal sides.\",\"按定义，正方形是四条边相等的矩形。\"],[\"The legal <b>definition</b> of a wetland has changed several times in the past century.\",\"湿地的法律定义在过去一个世纪里改过好几次。\"]],\"dresser\":[[\"She kept her folded sweaters in the top drawer of the <b>dresser</b>.\",\"她把叠好的毛衣放在梳妆台最上面的抽屉里。\"],[\"The old wooden <b>dresser</b> had brass handles polished bright by decades of use.\",\"这台旧木梳妆台的黄铜把手被几十年的使用磨得发亮。\"]],\"entirety\":[[\"The committee read the report in its <b>entirety</b> before voting on it.\",\"委员会在投票前通读了报告的全部内容。\"],[\"He donated the <b>entirety</b> of his prize money to the village school.\",\"他把奖金的全部捐给了村里的学校。\"]],\"essence\":[[\"The <b>essence</b> of her argument is that habits, not goals, determine long-term success.\",\"她论点的本质是：决定长期成功的是习惯，而不是目标。\"],[\"Vanilla <b>essence</b> is added in drops; too much will overpower the cake.\",\"香草精要一滴滴加，加多了会盖过蛋糕的味道。\"]],\"eventually\":[[\"After three failed prototypes, the team <b>eventually</b> built a pump that worked in the cold.\",\"三个原型失败之后，团队最后做出了一台能在严寒中工作的泵。\"],[\"The small stream <b>eventually</b> joins the great river near the coast.\",\"这条小溪最终在近海岸处汇入大河。\"]],\"explanation\":[[\"His <b>explanation</b> for the delay was simple: the parts had not arrived.\",\"他对延误的解释很简单：零件还没到。\"],[\"The textbook offers a clear <b>explanation</b> of why the Moon changes shape in the sky.\",\"教科书清楚地解释了月亮为什么会在天空中盈亏变化。\"]],\"generalization\":[[\"Saying that all teenagers are careless is an unfair <b>generalization</b> based on a few examples.\",\"说所有青少年都粗心，是根据少数例子做出的不公平泛化。\"],[\"In psychology experiments, <b>generalization</b> occurs when a learned response spreads to similar stimuli.\",\"在心理学实验中，当习得的反应扩散到相似刺激时，就发生了泛化。\"]],\"hurricane\":[[\"The <b>hurricane</b> knocked out power to the entire island for five days.\",\"飓风让全岛停电了五天。\"],[\"Warm ocean water fuels a <b>hurricane</b>; once it moves over land, it weakens quickly.\",\"温暖的海水为飓风提供能量；一旦登陆，它就迅速减弱。\"]],\"millet\":[[\"<b>Millet</b> was one of the earliest grains farmed in northern China, long before rice spread north.\",\"小米是中国北方最早种植的谷物之一，远在水稻北传之前。\"],[\"Because <b>millet</b> needs little water, it remains a vital crop in dry regions.\",\"小米需水量少，所以在干旱地区仍是重要作物。\"]],\"mop\":[[\"She filled a bucket and grabbed a <b>mop</b> to clean the muddy footprints from the hall.\",\"她打了一桶水，拿起拖把清理大厅里的泥脚印。\"],[\"After the pipe burst, it took two people with <b>mops</b> an hour to dry the floor.\",\"水管爆裂后，两个人拿着拖把拖了一个小时才把地板弄干。\"]],\"mortgage\":[[\"They paid off their <b>mortgage</b> five years early by making one extra payment each year.\",\"他们每年多还一期款，提前五年还清了按揭。\"],[\"The bank requires proof of income before approving a <b>mortgage</b>.\",\"银行在批准按揭贷款前要求提供收入证明。\"]],\"oxide\":[[\"Rust is an iron <b>oxide</b> that forms when iron, water, and oxygen meet.\",\"铁锈是一种氧化铁，由铁、水和氧气相遇时生成。\"],[\"Zinc <b>oxide</b> is the white ingredient that gives sunscreen its color.\",\"氧化锌是防晒霜里的白色成分。\"]],\"palace\":[[\"The <b>palace</b> took forty years to build and employed thousands of craftsmen.\",\"这座宫殿建了四十年，动用了数千名工匠。\"],[\"After the revolution, the royal <b>palace</b> was opened to the public as a museum.\",\"革命之后，王宫作为博物馆向公众开放。\"]],\"pharmacist\":[[\"The <b>pharmacist</b> explained that the medicine should be taken with food.\",\"药剂师说明这种药应该随餐服用。\"],[\"If you are unsure about the dosage, ask the <b>pharmacist</b> rather than guessing.\",\"不确定剂量时，要问药剂师，不要自己猜。\"]],\"refugee\":[[\"The camp provides <b>refugees</b> with tents, food, and basic medical care.\",\"难民营为难民提供帐篷、食物和基本医疗。\"],[\"Many <b>refugees</b> in the program have started small businesses in their new cities.\",\"这个项目中的许多难民已经在新城市里做起了小生意。\"]],\"relic\":[[\"The sword is a <b>relic</b> of the Bronze Age, preserved in mud for three thousand years.\",\"这把剑是青铜时代的遗迹，在泥里保存了三千年。\"],[\"In the corner of the yard stood an old plow, a <b>relic</b> of the farm's earliest days.\",\"院子角落里立着一台旧犁，是农场最早年月的遗物。\"]],\"rhino\":[[\"A <b>rhino</b> has poor eyesight but an excellent sense of smell.\",\"犀牛视力不好，但嗅觉极佳。\"],[\"Poaching has reduced some <b>rhino</b> populations to only a few dozen animals.\",\"偷猎使某些犀牛种群只剩下几十头。\"]],\"roll\":[[\"The ball <b>rolled</b> down the slope and stopped against the fence.\",\"球滚下斜坡，撞到栅栏停了下来。\"],[\"Mist began to <b>roll</b> in from the sea, hiding the harbor within minutes.\",\"雾开始从海上涌来，几分钟内就遮住了港口。\"]],\"sensation\":[[\"Diving into the icy lake gave her a shocking <b>sensation</b> of cold all over her body.\",\"跳进冰湖让她全身感到一阵刺骨的凉意。\"],[\"The concert was a <b>sensation</b>: tickets sold out within an hour.\",\"这场音乐会轰动一时：门票一小时内就售罄了。\"]],\"software\":[[\"The <b>software</b> updates itself overnight, so users always have the latest version.\",\"这款软件会在夜间自动更新，用户用的始终是最新版本。\"],[\"Open-source <b>software</b> allows anyone to inspect and improve the code.\",\"开源软件允许任何人查看和改进代码。\"]],\"stab\":[[\"He <b>stabbed</b> at the map with his finger, showing where the bridge had stood.\",\"他用手指戳着地图，指出桥原来所在的位置。\"],[\"In the play, the conspirators <b>stab</b> the general as he enters the senate.\",\"剧中，阴谋者在将军走进元老院时刺杀了他。\"]],\"star\":[[\"The Sun is an average-sized <b>star</b>, one of billions in our galaxy.\",\"太阳是一颗中等大小的恒星，是银河系数十亿颗恒星之一。\"],[\"On clear nights in the desert, thousands of <b>stars</b> are visible without a telescope.\",\"在沙漠晴朗的夜里，不用望远镜就能看到数千颗星星。\"]],\"throne\":[[\"The young prince ascended the <b>throne</b> at nineteen, after the sudden death of his father.\",\"父亲突然去世后，年轻的王子在十九岁时登上王位。\"],[\"The <b>throne</b> itself was carved from a single block of dark wood.\",\"王位本身是用一整块深色木头雕成的。\"]],\"tick\":[[\"After hiking, check your legs for <b>ticks</b>, since some carry serious diseases.\",\"徒步之后要检查腿上有没有蜱虫，因为有些蜱虫会传播严重疾病。\"],[\"A <b>tick</b> can swell to several times its normal size as it feeds on blood.\",\"蜱虫吸血时能膨胀到平时的好几倍大。\"]],\"tsunami\":[[\"The earthquake under the ocean floor triggered a <b>tsunami</b> that reached the coast in twenty minutes.\",\"海底地震引发了海啸，二十分钟后就抵达海岸。\"],[\"Warning systems now detect a forming <b>tsunami</b> and alert coastal towns within minutes.\",\"如今的预警系统能在海啸形成时探测到，并在几分钟内通知沿海城镇。\"]],\"wireless\":[[\"The library offers free <b>wireless</b> access to all registered students.\",\"图书馆为所有注册学生提供免费无线网络接入。\"],[\"<b>Wireless</b> microphones let the singers move freely around the stage.\",\"无线麦克风让歌手可以在舞台上自由走动。\"]],\"allergic\":[[\"She is <b>allergic</b> to peanuts, so the school cafeteria labels every dish carefully.\",\"她对花生过敏，所以学校食堂给每道菜都仔细标注。\"],[\"In spring, <b>allergic</b> reactions to pollen make many people sneeze through the whole season.\",\"春天，对花粉的过敏反应让很多人整个季节都在打喷嚏。\"]],\"amusement\":[[\"To everyone's <b>amusement</b>, the puppy chased its own tail until it fell over.\",\"小狗追着自己的尾巴转到摔倒，逗得大家直乐。\"],[\"The old fairground is the town's main place of <b>amusement</b> in summer.\",\"老游乐场是小镇夏天主要的娱乐场所。\"]],\"antenna\":[[\"An insect's <b>antennae</b> can detect smells from hundreds of meters away.\",\"昆虫的触角能探测到数百米外的气味。\"],[\"The moth uses its feathery <b>antennae</b> to follow a scent trail through the night forest.\",\"飞蛾用羽毛状的触角在夜晚的森林里循着气味飞行。\"]],\"approachable\":[[\"Despite her fame, the professor is warm and <b>approachable</b>, and students often stop her in the hall.\",\"尽管名气很大，这位教授却亲切平易，学生们常在走廊里拦住她请教。\"],[\"The textbook makes a difficult subject <b>approachable</b> by starting with everyday examples.\",\"这本教科书从日常例子入手，让艰深的学科变得容易亲近。\"]],\"armpit\":[[\"The thermometer is placed under the <b>armpit</b> for a minute to measure body temperature.\",\"体温计放在腋窝下一分钟来测量体温。\"],[\"He tucked the book under his <b>armpit</b> and hurried across the rainy square.\",\"他把书夹在腋下，匆匆穿过雨中的广场。\"]],\"autonomy\":[[\"The region was granted <b>autonomy</b> and now runs its own schools and hospitals.\",\"这个地区获得了自治权，如今自己管理学校和医院。\"],[\"Good managers give experienced staff a degree of <b>autonomy</b> in how they organize their work.\",\"好的管理者会给有经验的员工一定的自主权，让他们自己安排工作。\"]],\"avail\":[[\"They tried to push the car out of the snow, but it was of no <b>avail</b>.\",\"他们试着把车推出雪地，但无济于事。\"],[\"All his explanations were to no <b>avail</b>; the committee had already decided.\",\"他的一切解释都没有用，委员会已经做了决定。\"]],\"avenge\":[[\"In the story, the knight returns after ten years to <b>avenge</b> his father's death.\",\"故事里，骑士十年后归来，为父亲报仇。\"],[\"She did not seek to <b>avenge</b> the insult; instead, she proved herself through her work.\",\"她没有去报这一箭之仇，而是用工作证明了自己。\"]],\"battery\":[[\"The flashlight went dead because its <b>battery</b> had run out during the night.\",\"手电筒灭了，因为它的电池在夜里耗尽了。\"],[\"Electric cars store energy in a heavy <b>battery</b> pack under the floor.\",\"电动汽车把能量储存在地板下的沉重电池组中。\"]],\"beetle\":[[\"A ladybird is actually a kind of <b>beetle</b>, not a true bug.\",\"瓢虫其实是一种甲虫，并非真正的蝽。\"],[\"Some <b>beetles</b> can produce light in their abdomens to attract mates at night.\",\"有些甲虫能在腹部发光，在夜里吸引配偶。\"]],\"blunt\":[[\"Her review was <b>blunt</b>: the bridge design was elegant but unsafe.\",\"她的评审很直率：这座桥的设计优雅但不安全。\"],[\"A <b>blunt</b> knife is more dangerous than a sharp one because it slips off the food.\",\"钝刀比快刀更危险，因为它容易从食物上滑脱。\"]],\"blurred\":[[\"Through the rain-streaked window, the city lights looked <b>blurred</b> and doubled.\",\"透过被雨水划花的窗户，城市的灯光显得模糊而重影。\"],[\"His memories of that summer are <b>blurred</b>, except for one afternoon by the lake.\",\"他对那个夏天的记忆已经模糊了，只记得湖边的一个下午。\"]],\"bolted\":[[\"When the storm hit, every window in the cottage was <b>bolted</b> shut.\",\"风暴来袭时，小屋的每扇窗都被闩上了。\"],[\"He found the gate <b>bolted</b> from the inside and had to climb the fence.\",\"他发现大门从里面闩上了，只好翻栅栏进去。\"]],\"cancer\":[[\"Smoking is the leading cause of lung <b>cancer</b> in most countries.\",\"吸烟是大多数国家肺癌的主要成因。\"],[\"Early screening has greatly improved survival rates for several types of <b>cancer</b>.\",\"早期筛查大大提高了几种癌症的存活率。\"]],\"cliff\":[[\"The lighthouse stands on a <b>cliff</b> sixty meters above the sea.\",\"灯塔矗立在高出海面六十米的悬崖上。\"],[\"Over centuries, waves have eaten into the base of the <b>cliff</b>, causing whole sections to fall.\",\"几个世纪以来，海浪侵蚀着崖基，使整段整段的悬崖坍塌。\"]],\"clip\":[[\"She <b>clipped</b> the best ten seconds of the interview and posted it online.\",\"她把采访中最精彩的十秒剪下来发到了网上。\"],[\"He <b>clips</b> the hedge twice a year to keep it below the window.\",\"他每年修剪两次树篱，让它保持在窗户以下。\"]],\"clue\":[[\"The muddy footprint by the window was the first <b>clue</b> that someone had entered the garden.\",\"窗边泥泞的脚印是有人进过花园的第一个线索。\"],[\"Her accent gave no <b>clue</b> about where she had grown up.\",\"她的口音没有透露任何关于她成长地点的线索。\"]],\"cluster\":[[\"Most of the province's villages <b>cluster</b> along the river, where water is available.\",\"这个省的大多数村庄都聚集在河边，因为那里有水。\"],[\"In autumn, the bees <b>cluster</b> around the queen to keep the hive warm.\",\"秋天，蜜蜂聚集在蜂王周围，给蜂巢保暖。\"]],\"coil\":[[\"The snake lay in a tight <b>coil</b> on the warm rock, ready to strike.\",\"蛇盘成紧紧的一圈卧在暖石上，随时准备出击。\"],[\"She <b>coiled</b> the rope neatly and hung it on the hook by the door.\",\"她把绳子整齐地盘起来，挂在门边的挂钩上。\"]],\"contagious\":[[\"Chickenpox is highly <b>contagious</b>, so children with it must stay home from school.\",\"水痘传染性很强，所以患病的孩子必须待在家里，不能上学。\"],[\"Her enthusiasm was <b>contagious</b>: soon the whole team was working late willingly.\",\"她的热情很有感染力：很快整个团队都心甘情愿地加班了。\"]],\"diagnose\":[[\"Doctors <b>diagnosed</b> the illness as malaria after the blood test came back.\",\"血检结果出来后，医生诊断这种病是疟疾。\"],[\"It is hard to <b>diagnose</b> why the machine fails only on humid days.\",\"很难查明这台机器为什么只在潮湿天出故障。\"]],\"distinction\":[[\"There is an important <b>distinction</b> between weather and climate that students often miss.\",\"天气和气候之间有一个学生常忽略的重要区别。\"],[\"She graduated with <b>distinction</b>, at the top of her class.\",\"她以优异成绩毕业，名列全班第一。\"]],\"edition\":[[\"The first <b>edition</b> of the dictionary contained 40,000 words; the latest has over 170,000.\",\"这本词典第一版收词四万个，最新版已超过十七万个。\"],[\"A special <b>edition</b> of the novel was printed for the author's eightieth birthday.\",\"为庆祝作者八十大寿，出版社印行了这部小说的特别版。\"]],\"elk\":[[\"A male <b>elk</b> can weigh over 300 kilograms and sheds its antlers every spring.\",\"一头雄性麋鹿体重可超过 300 公斤，每年春天都会脱落鹿角。\"],[\"At dawn, a herd of <b>elk</b> crossed the meadow in single file.\",\"黎明时分，一群麋鹿排成一列穿过草甸。\"]],\"empire\":[[\"At its height, the Roman <b>Empire</b> stretched from Britain to Mesopotamia.\",\"在鼎盛时期，罗马帝国从不列颠一直延伸到美索不达米亚。\"],[\"He built a business <b>empire</b> from a single bakery his parents had left him.\",\"他从父母留下的一家面包店起步，建起了一个商业帝国。\"]],\"exaggeration\":[[\"Saying the fish was as long as his arm was only a slight <b>exaggeration</b>.\",\"说那条鱼有他的手臂那么长，只是略有夸张。\"],[\"Her claim that the hike took forever was an <b>exaggeration</b>, but the trail really was long.\",\"她说徒步像走了永远那么久是夸张了，但那条路确实很长。\"]],\"expedience\":[[\"The decision was made for <b>expedience</b> rather than fairness, and many people objected.\",\"这个决定是出于权宜而非公平，许多人表示反对。\"],[\"He chose the shorter route out of pure <b>expedience</b>, even though the longer one was safer.\",\"他纯粹为了方便选了较短的路，尽管长一点的那条更安全。\"]],\"extinguisher\":[[\"Every floor of the dormitory has a fire <b>extinguisher</b> mounted beside the stairs.\",\"宿舍楼每一层楼梯旁都装着灭火器。\"],[\"He grabbed the <b>extinguisher</b> and put out the small fire on the stove before it spread.\",\"他抓起灭火器，在火势蔓延之前扑灭了炉子上的小火。\"]],\"fantasy\":[[\"Her childhood <b>fantasy</b> was to live in a treehouse and talk to animals.\",\"她小时候的幻想是住在树屋里，和动物说话。\"],[\"The novel is pure <b>fantasy</b>, filled with dragons, spells, and a hidden kingdom.\",\"这部小说是纯粹的幻想作品，里面有龙、咒语和一个隐藏的王国。\"]],\"fist\":[[\"He banged his <b>fist</b> on the table to demand silence.\",\"他用拳头捶桌子，要求大家安静。\"],[\"The baby gripped the rattle in her tiny <b>fist</b>.\",\"婴儿用小拳头攥着拨浪鼓。\"]],\"forestry\":[[\"<b>Forestry</b> students learn to measure a forest's growth before deciding which trees to harvest.\",\"林业专业的学生要先学会测量森林的生长量，再决定采伐哪些树。\"],[\"Sustainable <b>forestry</b> requires replanting at least as many trees as are cut down.\",\"可持续林业要求补种的树至少和砍伐的一样多。\"]],\"foundation\":[[\"The house rests on a concrete <b>foundation</b> that extends below the frost line.\",\"这栋房子坐落在延伸到冻土层以下的混凝土地基上。\"],[\"Early reading is the <b>foundation</b> on which all later study is built.\",\"早期阅读是日后一切学习的基础。\"]],\"fraud\":[[\"The accountant was arrested for <b>fraud</b> after inventing invoices for work never done.\",\"这名会计伪造从未做过的工作的发票，因欺诈被逮捕。\"],[\"Online shoppers should beware of <b>fraud</b> when a price looks impossibly low.\",\"价格低得离谱时，网购者要当心欺诈。\"]],\"geology\":[[\"<b>Geology</b> explains how the canyon was carved by a river over millions of years.\",\"地质学解释了这条峡谷如何被河流在数百万年中切割而成。\"],[\"Field trips are a central part of studying <b>geology</b>, since rocks must be examined where they lie.\",\"实地考察是学习地质学的核心部分，因为岩石必须在原地考察。\"]],\"hibernate\":[[\"Bears <b>hibernate</b> through the winter, living off the fat they stored in autumn.\",\"熊靠秋天储存的脂肪冬眠过冬。\"],[\"Before they <b>hibernate</b>, hedgehogs build nests of dry leaves under hedges.\",\"冬眠之前，刺猬会在树篱下用干树叶筑巢。\"]],\"indicate\":[[\"Dark clouds often <b>indicate</b> that rain is approaching.\",\"乌云密布通常表明雨要来了。\"],[\"The survey results <b>indicate</b> that most residents support the new park.\",\"调查结果表明，大多数居民支持新公园。\"]],\"liquid\":[[\"Mercury is the only metal that is <b>liquid</b> at room temperature.\",\"汞是唯一在常温下呈液态的金属。\"],[\"The recipe calls for <b>liquid</b> honey rather than the crystallized kind.\",\"菜谱要求用液体蜂蜜，而不是结晶的那种。\"]],\"medium\":[[\"Watercolor was her favorite <b>medium</b> because it forced her to work quickly.\",\"水彩是她最喜欢的媒介，因为它逼着她快速落笔。\"],[\"Radio remains an important <b>medium</b> in regions where internet access is limited.\",\"在网络不发达的地区，广播仍然是重要的媒介。\"]],\"olive\":[[\"<b>Olive</b> trees can live for more than a thousand years and still produce fruit.\",\"橄榄树能活一千多年，还能结果。\"],[\"The salad was dressed with <b>olive</b> oil, lemon juice, and a pinch of salt.\",\"沙拉用橄榄油、柠檬汁和一小撮盐调味。\"]],\"ostrich\":[[\"An <b>ostrich</b> cannot fly, but it is the fastest running bird on land.\",\"鸵鸟不会飞，但它是陆地上跑得最快的鸟。\"],[\"Contrary to the myth, an <b>ostrich</b> does not bury its head in the sand when frightened.\",\"与传说相反，鸵鸟受惊时并不会把头埋进沙里。\"]],\"penalty\":[[\"The <b>penalty</b> for returning the book late is fifty cents per day.\",\"逾期还书的罚款是每天五十美分。\"],[\"The referee awarded a <b>penalty</b> after the defender handled the ball inside the box.\",\"防守队员在禁区内手球后，裁判判了一个点球。\"]],\"pot\":[[\"She filled the <b>pot</b> with water and set it on the stove to boil for the pasta.\",\"她往锅里装满水，放到炉子上烧开煮意面。\"],[\"Clay <b>pots</b> keep plant roots cooler than plastic ones in summer.\",\"陶土花盆在夏天比塑料盆更能让植物根部保持凉爽。\"]],\"pupil\":[[\"In bright light, the <b>pupil</b> of the eye narrows to let in less light.\",\"在强光下，眼睛的瞳孔会收缩，减少进入的光线。\"],[\"A cat's <b>pupil</b> can widen dramatically at night, helping it see in near darkness.\",\"猫的瞳孔在夜里能大幅放大，帮助它在近乎黑暗中看清东西。\"]],\"recycling\":[[\"The city's <b>recycling</b> program turns old glass bottles into new ones within a month.\",\"这座城市的回收计划把旧玻璃瓶在一个月内变成新瓶。\"],[\"<b>Recycling</b> aluminum uses only five percent of the energy needed to make it from ore.\",\"回收铝所用的能量只有从矿石提炼的百分之五。\"]],\"retail\":[[\"She works in <b>retail</b> and finds the holiday season the most exhausting part of the year.\",\"她在零售业工作，觉得节假日季是一年中最累的时候。\"],[\"The phones are sold at <b>retail</b> for twice the price the factory receives.\",\"这些手机的零售价是工厂出厂价的两倍。\"]],\"robbery\":[[\"The bank <b>robbery</b> lasted less than three minutes, but the cameras recorded everything.\",\"银行抢劫持续不到三分钟，但摄像头记录下了一切。\"],[\"Police believe the same group carried out both <b>robberies</b> on the same street.\",\"警方认为同一条街上的两起抢劫是同一伙人所为。\"]],\"saxophone\":[[\"The <b>saxophone</b> was invented in the 1840s for military bands but became famous through jazz.\",\"萨克斯是十九世纪四十年代为军乐队发明的，却因爵士乐而闻名。\"],[\"He practiced the <b>saxophone</b> in the garage so the sound would not disturb the neighbors.\",\"他在车库里练萨克斯，免得吵到邻居。\"]],\"sink\":[[\"The kitchen <b>sink</b> was full of dishes after the dinner party.\",\"晚宴之后，厨房水槽里堆满了碗碟。\"],[\"A plumber fixed the leak under the <b>sink</b> in less than an hour.\",\"水管工不到一小时就修好了水槽下面的漏水。\"]],\"socket\":[[\"Never plug too many devices into a single <b>socket</b>; the circuit may overheat.\",\"不要在一个插座上插太多设备，电路可能会过热。\"],[\"The lamp's plug does not fit the wall <b>socket</b> in this country, so he bought an adapter.\",\"这盏灯的插头不适合这个国家的墙壁插座，他便买了个转换头。\"]],\"stair\":[[\"She counted the <b>stairs</b> as she climbed: ninety-eight steps to the top of the tower.\",\"她一边爬一边数台阶：到塔顶共九十八级。\"],[\"The old house has a narrow wooden <b>stair</b> that creaks with every step.\",\"老房子有一段狭窄的木楼梯，每走一步都嘎吱作响。\"]],\"stereotype\":[[\"The film challenges the <b>stereotype</b> that scientists are always serious and socially awkward.\",\"这部影片挑战了「科学家总是严肃、不善社交」的刻板印象。\"],[\"A <b>stereotype</b> can survive for decades because people notice examples that fit it and ignore the rest.\",\"刻板印象能存续几十年，因为人们只注意到符合它的例子，而忽略其余。\"]],\"sulfur\":[[\"<b>Sulfur</b> is a yellow element that smells like rotten eggs when it is burned.\",\"硫是一种黄色元素，燃烧时有臭鸡蛋味。\"],[\"Hot springs near volcanoes often contain <b>sulfur</b>, which gives the water a milky color.\",\"火山附近的温泉常含硫，使水呈现乳白色。\"]],\"survey\":[[\"A <b>survey</b> of two thousand households found that most families recycle glass and paper.\",\"一项对两千户家庭的调查发现，大多数家庭会回收玻璃和纸张。\"],[\"Before building, engineers <b>survey</b> the land to map its slopes and water flow.\",\"修建之前，工程师会勘测土地，绘制坡度和水流图。\"]],\"syrup\":[[\"Maple <b>syrup</b> is made by boiling the sap of maple trees until it thickens.\",\"枫糖浆是把枫树汁熬到浓稠制成的。\"],[\"She poured warm <b>syrup</b> over the pancakes until it ran down the sides.\",\"她把温热的糖浆浇在煎饼上，直到糖浆顺着边缘流下来。\"]],\"texture\":[[\"The painter built up the <b>texture</b> of the canvas with thick layers of paint.\",\"画家用厚厚的颜料层堆出画布的质感。\"],[\"Tofu has a smooth <b>texture</b> that absorbs the flavors of whatever sauce it is cooked in.\",\"豆腐质地顺滑，能吸收一起烹煮的酱汁味道。\"]],\"academic\":[[\"The <b>academic</b> year in this country runs from September to June.\",\"这个国家的学年从九月到次年六月。\"],[\"Her interest in the subject is not purely <b>academic</b>; her own village faces the same water problem.\",\"她对这个课题的兴趣不纯粹是学术上的；她自己的村子也面临同样的水问题。\"]],\"adjacent\":[[\"The library is <b>adjacent</b> to the science building, sharing the same courtyard.\",\"图书馆与科学楼相邻，共用同一个庭院。\"],[\"Farmers planted trees on the land <b>adjacent</b> to the river to stop the banks from eroding.\",\"农民在紧邻河岸的土地上种树，防止河岸被侵蚀。\"]],\"admit\":[[\"He finally <b>admitted</b> that he had broken the window while playing ball.\",\"他终于承认是自己踢球时打碎了窗户。\"],[\"She was <b>admitted</b> to the hospital with a high fever and kept overnight for observation.\",\"她因高烧被收治入院，留院观察了一夜。\"]],\"affirmation\":[[\"The award was an <b>affirmation</b> of twenty years of quiet, careful work.\",\"这个奖项是对二十年默默细致工作的肯定。\"],[\"For the young writer, a single letter from a reader was a powerful <b>affirmation</b>.\",\"对这位年轻作家来说，读者的一封来信就是有力的肯定。\"]],\"announce\":[[\"The company will <b>announce</b> its new president at tomorrow's press conference.\",\"公司将在明天的新闻发布会上宣布新任总裁。\"],[\"A loudspeaker <b>announced</b> that the train would be delayed by forty minutes.\",\"广播宣布火车将晚点四十分钟。\"]],\"appearance\":[[\"Judging a book by its <b>appearance</b> is risky; plain covers often hide the best stories.\",\"以貌取书是有风险的；朴素的封面里常藏着最好的故事。\"],[\"The sudden <b>appearance</b> of algae turned the clear lake green within a week.\",\"藻类的突然出现让清澈的湖水一周内就变绿了。\"]],\"aristocratic\":[[\"The novel describes an <b>aristocratic</b> family slowly losing its land and influence.\",\"小说描写了一个贵族家庭如何慢慢失去土地和影响力。\"],[\"He spoke with an <b>aristocratic</b> accent that immediately revealed his background.\",\"他说话带着贵族腔，立刻暴露了他的出身。\"]],\"attack\":[[\"The wolves rarely <b>attack</b> healthy adult deer, preferring the old and the weak.\",\"狼很少攻击健康的成年鹿，它们更偏好年老体弱的。\"],[\"In his speech, the senator <b>attacked</b> the proposal as wasteful and unfair.\",\"参议员在演讲中抨击这项提案既浪费又不公平。\"]],\"auditorium\":[[\"The school <b>auditorium</b> seats eight hundred people and hosts concerts every month.\",\"学校礼堂能坐八百人，每月都举办音乐会。\"],[\"Latecomers waited outside the <b>auditorium</b> until the first piece had ended.\",\"迟到的人在礼堂外等到第一首曲子结束才进场。\"]],\"authorize\":[[\"Only the manager can <b>authorize</b> payments above ten thousand dollars.\",\"只有经理能授权一万美元以上的付款。\"],[\"The city council <b>authorized</b> the construction of a new footbridge over the river.\",\"市议会批准在河上修建一座新人行桥。\"]],\"awkwardness\":[[\"There was a moment of <b>awkwardness</b> when the two former partners met at the door.\",\"两位前合伙人在门口相遇时，场面一度有些尴尬。\"],[\"He laughed to cover his <b>awkwardness</b> at forgetting her name.\",\"他用笑声掩饰自己忘了她名字的尴尬。\"]],\"bare\":[[\"The dog <b>bared</b> its teeth when the stranger approached the gate.\",\"陌生人走近大门时，狗露出了牙齿。\"],[\"Winter winds stripped the tree <b>bare</b> of leaves within a week.\",\"冬风在一周内把这棵树的叶子刮得精光。\"]],\"beach\":[[\"At low tide, the <b>beach</b> stretches for hundreds of meters, exposing pools full of small crabs.\",\"退潮时，海滩绵延数百米，露出满是小螃蟹的水洼。\"],[\"Volunteers cleaned the <b>beach</b> every Sunday, collecting bags of plastic washed in by the tide.\",\"志愿者每周日清理海滩，收集被潮水冲上岸的一袋袋塑料。\"]],\"calendar\":[[\"The ancient Maya <b>calendar</b> tracked both a 260-day ritual cycle and the solar year.\",\"古代玛雅历法同时记录 260 天的仪式周期和太阳年。\"],[\"Farmers once planned sowing by a lunar <b>calendar</b> rather than by fixed dates.\",\"过去农民按阴历而不是固定日期安排播种。\"]],\"captain\":[[\"The ship's <b>captain</b> decided to wait out the storm in the harbor.\",\"船长决定在港口避过这场风暴。\"],[\"As team <b>captain</b>, she speaks for the players at every press conference.\",\"作为队长，她在每场新闻发布会上代表队员发言。\"]],\"chess\":[[\"In <b>chess</b>, controlling the center of the board is usually the key to winning.\",\"在国际象棋中，控制棋盘中心通常是取胜的关键。\"],[\"The two grandmasters played <b>chess</b> for six hours before agreeing to a draw.\",\"两位特级大师对弈了六个小时，最终同意和棋。\"]],\"chill\":[[\"A sudden <b>chill</b> ran through him as the fever began to rise.\",\"烧开始升起来时，他浑身一阵寒战。\"],[\"Many flu patients report <b>chills</b> before the high fever arrives.\",\"许多流感病人说，高烧来临前会先发寒战。\"]],\"coexist\":[[\"In this forest, wolves and farmers have learned to <b>coexist</b> by keeping livestock behind fences.\",\"在这片森林里，狼和农民学会了共存：牲畜都圈在栅栏里。\"],[\"Old traditions and new technology <b>coexist</b> in the town, sometimes uneasily.\",\"新旧传统与新技术在这座小镇共存，有时并不那么融洽。\"]],\"concept\":[[\"The <b>concept</b> of zero was a revolutionary idea in the history of mathematics.\",\"零这个概念是数学史上革命性的想法。\"],[\"For young children, the <b>concept</b> of time is best taught through daily routines.\",\"对幼儿来说，时间的概念最好通过日常作息来教。\"]],\"conform\":[[\"All products must <b>conform</b> to the same safety standards before they can be sold.\",\"所有产品在销售前都必须符合相同的安全标准。\"],[\"He refused to <b>conform</b> to the office dress code and wore what he liked.\",\"他拒绝遵守办公室的着装规定，穿自己喜欢的衣服。\"]],\"curtain\":[[\"Heavy <b>curtains</b> keep the room dark during the day for the baby's nap.\",\"厚窗帘让房间白天保持昏暗，方便宝宝午睡。\"],[\"As the <b>curtain</b> rose, the audience saw a stage set as a medieval market.\",\"幕布升起时，观众看到舞台被布置成了一个中世纪集市。\"]],\"dessert\":[[\"For <b>dessert</b>, the restaurant serves a lemon tart with fresh berries.\",\"这家餐厅的甜点是配新鲜莓果的柠檬塔。\"],[\"She skipped <b>dessert</b> because the main course had been so filling.\",\"主菜吃得太饱，她跳过了甜点。\"]],\"distributor\":[[\"The film's <b>distributor</b> decided to release it in small towns first.\",\"这部电影的分销商决定先在小城镇上映。\"],[\"The company is the sole <b>distributor</b> of this vaccine in three provinces.\",\"这家公司是这种疫苗在三个省的独家分销商。\"]],\"excursion\":[[\"The class went on an <b>excursion</b> to the wetlands to observe migrating birds.\",\"全班去湿地远足，观察迁徙的鸟类。\"],[\"A short <b>excursion</b> to the nearby island costs less than a night in a hotel.\",\"去附近小岛短途游一趟，花费还不到一晚酒店钱。\"]],\"eyewitness\":[[\"An <b>eyewitness</b> told police that the truck had run the red light.\",\"一名目击者告诉警方，那辆卡车闯了红灯。\"],[\"The documentary combines <b>eyewitness</b> accounts with footage shot at the scene.\",\"这部纪录片把目击者的叙述与现场拍摄的画面结合在了一起。\"]],\"fur\":[[\"The arctic fox grows a thick white <b>fur</b> coat in winter to blend with the snow.\",\"北极狐冬天会长出厚厚的白色毛皮，与雪地融为一体。\"],[\"A cat's <b>fur</b> traps air close to the skin, providing insulation against the cold.\",\"猫的毛皮能在皮肤附近留住空气，起到御寒作用。\"]],\"hail\":[[\"The storm dropped <b>hail</b> the size of marbles, denting cars across the town.\",\"暴风雨下起了弹珠大小的冰雹，把全镇的汽车砸出了凹坑。\"],[\"Farmers fear <b>hail</b> most just before harvest, when one storm can flatten a whole field.\",\"农民最怕收获前下冰雹，一场风暴就能把整片田打平。\"]],\"hallucination\":[[\"After three days without sleep, the explorer began to suffer <b>hallucinations</b>.\",\"三天没睡之后，这名探险者开始出现幻觉。\"],[\"High fever can cause <b>hallucination</b>, making patients see people who are not there.\",\"高烧会引起幻觉，让病人看到并不存在的人。\"]],\"incline\":[[\"The road <b>inclines</b> gently for the first kilometer and then climbs steeply.\",\"这条路前一公里缓坡，之后陡然变陡。\"],[\"The tower <b>inclines</b> slightly to the south because its foundation settled unevenly.\",\"这座塔微微向南倾斜，因为地基沉降不均匀。\"]],\"issue\":[[\"The main <b>issue</b> in the debate was whether the dam should be built at all.\",\"这场争论的主要议题是这座大坝到底该不该建。\"],[\"Climate change is an <b>issue</b> that no single country can solve alone.\",\"气候变化是一个任何国家都无法单独解决的议题。\"]],\"levy\":[[\"The city council voted to <b>levy</b> a tax on plastic bags to reduce waste.\",\"市议会投票决定对塑料袋征税，以减少浪费。\"],[\"In medieval times, lords could <b>levy</b> soldiers from the villages on their land.\",\"中世纪时，领主可以从自己领地上的村庄征兵。\"]],\"liter\":[[\"The recipe for the soup requires two <b>liters</b> of water and a handful of lentils.\",\"这道汤的配方需要两升水和一把小扁豆。\"],[\"An adult should drink roughly two <b>liters</b> of water a day in hot weather.\",\"炎热天气里，成年人每天大约要喝两升水。\"]],\"meridian\":[[\"The prime <b>meridian</b>, at zero degrees longitude, passes through Greenwich in London.\",\"本初子午线即经度零度线，穿过伦敦的格林尼治。\"],[\"Before standard time zones, each town set its clocks by its own <b>meridian</b>.\",\"在标准时区出现之前，每个城镇都按自己的子午线对钟表。\"]],\"monsoon\":[[\"The summer <b>monsoon</b> brings most of the region's rainfall between June and September.\",\"夏季风在六月到九月间带来这个地区的大部分降雨。\"],[\"Farmers time their planting to the arrival of the <b>monsoon</b>.\",\"农民按季风到来的时间安排播种。\"]],\"museum\":[[\"The natural history <b>museum</b> displays a complete skeleton of a blue whale.\",\"自然历史博物馆展出一具完整的蓝鲸骨架。\"],[\"Admission to the <b>museum</b> is free for students on Thursdays.\",\"这家博物馆周四对学生免费开放。\"]],\"nod\":[[\"She <b>nodded</b> in agreement but said nothing.\",\"她点头表示同意，但什么也没说。\"],[\"The chairman gave a brief <b>nod</b>, and the voting began.\",\"主席微微点头，投票随即开始。\"]],\"pancreas\":[[\"The <b>pancreas</b> produces insulin, the hormone that controls blood sugar levels.\",\"胰腺分泌胰岛素，这种激素控制着血糖水平。\"],[\"Because the <b>pancreas</b> lies deep in the abdomen, diseases there are hard to detect early.\",\"由于胰腺位于腹腔深处，那里的疾病很难早期发现。\"]],\"potato\":[[\"The <b>potato</b> was brought to Europe from South America in the sixteenth century.\",\"土豆在十六世纪从南美洲传入欧洲。\"],[\"He planted the <b>potatoes</b> in rows and covered them with straw to keep the soil moist.\",\"他把土豆成行种下，盖上稻草保持土壤湿润。\"]],\"princess\":[[\"In the tale, the <b>princess</b> disguises herself as a servant to leave the palace unseen.\",\"故事里，公主扮成仆人，悄悄离开了王宫。\"],[\"The <b>princess</b> devoted her later years to building schools in remote villages.\",\"公主晚年致力于在偏远村庄建学校。\"]],\"rake\":[[\"He used a <b>rake</b> to gather the fallen leaves into piles for composting.\",\"他用耙子把落叶拢成一堆堆，用来堆肥。\"],[\"The gardener leveled the soil with a <b>rake</b> before sowing the grass seed.\",\"播草籽之前，园丁用耙子把土整平。\"]],\"ritual\":[[\"In the village, the harvest <b>ritual</b> has been performed in the same way for three hundred years.\",\"在这个村子里，收获仪式以同样的方式举行了三百年。\"],[\"Making tea is a morning <b>ritual</b> he never skips, even when traveling.\",\"泡茶是他从不省略的晨间仪式，哪怕旅行时也是如此。\"]],\"rug\":[[\"A hand-woven <b>rug</b> covered the center of the wooden floor.\",\"一块手工编织的小地毯铺在木地板中央。\"],[\"She shook the <b>rug</b> outside to get rid of the dust.\",\"她把小地毯拿到屋外抖掉灰尘。\"]],\"statistics\":[[\"<b>Statistics</b> helps researchers decide whether a result is real or just a coincidence.\",\"统计学帮助研究者判断一个结果是真实的还是纯属巧合。\"],[\"He teaches <b>statistics</b> to first-year students in the economics department.\",\"他在经济系给一年级学生教统计学。\"]],\"steel\":[[\"The bridge is built of <b>steel</b> and concrete and can withstand a major earthquake.\",\"这座桥由钢和混凝土建成，能抵御强震。\"],[\"Stainless <b>steel</b> resists rust because it contains chromium.\",\"不锈钢含有铬，所以不易生锈。\"]],\"tutor\":[[\"She works as a math <b>tutor</b> on weekends to pay for her own studies.\",\"她周末做数学辅导老师，挣钱供自己读书。\"],[\"The <b>tutor</b> asked the student to explain each step aloud rather than just give the answer.\",\"辅导老师让学生把每一步大声讲出来，而不是只给答案。\"]],\"village\":[[\"The <b>village</b> has only one well, so residents queue for water every morning.\",\"村里只有一口井，村民每天早上排队打水。\"],[\"News travels fast in a small <b>village</b> where everyone knows each other.\",\"在人人都互相认识的小村子里，消息传得很快。\"]],\"well\":[[\"The <b>well</b> went dry during the drought, and villagers had to walk to the next valley for water.\",\"干旱期间井干了，村民只好走到下一个山谷去取水。\"],[\"Workers dug the <b>well</b> thirty meters deep before striking clean water.\",\"工人们把井挖到三十米深，才打到干净的水。\"]],\"gender\":[[\"The survey asked respondents to state their age and <b>gender</b>.\",\"这项调查要求受访者填写年龄和性别。\"],[\"In German, every noun has a <b>gender</b> — the word for “sun” is feminine, while “moon” is masculine.\",\"在德语里，每个名词都有性别——“太阳”是阴性词，而“月亮”是阳性词。\"]],\"botany\":[[\"She chose <b>botany</b> because she wanted to understand how plants survive in dry climates.\",\"她选择植物学，是因为她想弄清植物如何在干旱气候中生存。\"],[\"The <b>botany</b> professor took the class to the greenhouse to examine orchids up close.\",\"植物学教授带全班去温室近距离观察兰花。\"]],\"homework\":[[\"The teacher assigns <b>homework</b> every day, but never more than students can finish in an hour.\",\"老师每天都布置家庭作业，但从不超过学生一小时能完成的量。\"],[\"He left his <b>homework</b> on the bus and had to redo the math problems at lunch.\",\"他把家庭作业落在公交车上，只好午休时重做那些数学题。\"]],\"dam\":[[\"The <b>dam</b> holds back the river and stores water for farms during the dry season.\",\"这座水坝拦住河水，在旱季为农田蓄水。\"],[\"Engineers inspected the <b>dam</b> after the earthquake, checking the concrete for cracks.\",\"地震后，工程师检查了这座水坝，查看混凝土有没有裂缝。\"]],\"autobiography\":[[\"In her <b>autobiography</b>, the scientist describes failing her first university entrance exam.\",\"这位科学家在自传里写到，她第一次参加大学入学考试时落榜了。\"],[\"An <b>autobiography</b> tells the author's own life story in the author's own words.\",\"自传是用作者自己的语言讲述作者本人的人生故事。\"]],\"quarter\":[[\"At this university, each <b>quarter</b> lasts about ten weeks, noticeably shorter than a semester.\",\"在这所大学，每个学季约十周，明显比一学期短。\"],[\"He needs two more courses to graduate, so he will stay for one extra <b>quarter</b>.\",\"他还差两门课才能毕业，所以要多读一个学季。\"]],\"duty\":[[\"The government raised the <b>duty</b> on imported cars to protect local manufacturers.\",\"政府提高了进口汽车的税款，以保护本土制造商。\"],[\"Travelers must pay <b>duty</b> on goods that exceed the tax-free limit.\",\"旅客携带超过免税额度的商品必须缴纳税款。\"]],\"shower\":[[\"After the hike, everyone took a quick <b>shower</b> and changed into dry clothes.\",\"徒步结束后，大家都快速冲了个淋浴，换上干衣服。\"],[\"The small bathroom has a <b>shower</b> but no bathtub.\",\"这间小浴室有淋浴，但没有浴缸。\"]],\"character\":[[\"Her calm <b>character</b> makes her a good emergency-room nurse — she never panics.\",\"她性格沉稳，很适合做急诊室护士——她从不慌乱。\"],[\"Years of hardship shaped his <b>character</b> and taught him patience.\",\"多年的艰辛磨炼了他的性格，也教会了他耐心。\"]],\"explosion\":[[\"The <b>explosion</b> at the chemical plant shattered windows two streets away.\",\"化工厂的爆炸震碎了两条街之外的窗户。\"],[\"A gas <b>explosion</b> in the mine trapped twelve workers underground.\",\"矿井里的瓦斯爆炸把十二名工人困在了地下。\"]],\"agreement\":[[\"The two companies signed an <b>agreement</b> to share the cost of the new research center.\",\"两家公司签署协议，共同承担新研究中心的费用。\"],[\"After weeks of negotiation, the union and the city finally reached an <b>agreement</b>.\",\"经过数周谈判，工会与市政府终于达成了协议。\"]],\"diminish\":[[\"As the medicine wore off, the pain gradually <b>diminished</b>.\",\"药效消退后，疼痛逐渐减轻了。\"],[\"During the summer drought, the town's water supply <b>diminishes</b> week by week.\",\"夏季干旱期间，镇上的供水一周比一周少。\"]],\"accusation\":[[\"He denied the <b>accusation</b> that he had copied data from a rival laboratory.\",\"他否认了关于他抄袭对手实验室数据的指控。\"],[\"It was a serious <b>accusation</b>, but no evidence was ever presented to support it.\",\"这是一项严重的指控，但从未有人拿出证据来支持它。\"]],\"accord\":[[\"The peace <b>accord</b> ended ten years of fighting between the two countries.\",\"这份和平协议结束了两国之间长达十年的战争。\"],[\"Under the <b>accord</b>, both sides agreed to withdraw their troops from the border region.\",\"根据这份协议，双方同意从边境地区撤军。\"]],\"basement\":[[\"They store winter clothes and old furniture in the <b>basement</b>.\",\"他们把冬衣和旧家具存放在地下室里。\"],[\"The <b>basement</b> flooded after the heavy rain, ruining boxes of old books.\",\"大雨过后地下室进水，泡坏了一箱箱旧书。\"]],\"gym\":[[\"The school <b>gym</b> doubles as an auditorium when the whole school meets.\",\"全校集会时，学校体育馆还兼作礼堂。\"],[\"She goes to the <b>gym</b> three times a week to lift weights and run.\",\"她每周去健身房三次，举重加跑步。\"]],\"senator\":[[\"The <b>senator</b> argued that the new bill would hurt small farmers.\",\"这位参议员认为，新法案会损害小农户的利益。\"],[\"Each state elects two <b>senators</b> to represent it in Washington.\",\"每个州选出两名参议员在华盛顿代表本州。\"]],\"javelin\":[[\"He threw the <b>javelin</b> nearly eighty meters, setting a new school record.\",\"他把标枪投出了近八十米，创造了学校新纪录。\"],[\"In the ancient Olympics, the <b>javelin</b> throw grew out of soldiers' spear training.\",\"在古代奥运会上，标枪项目源于士兵的投矛训练。\"]],\"user\":[[\"The app asks each <b>user</b> to create a password of at least twelve characters.\",\"这款应用要求每位用户设置至少十二位的密码。\"],[\"<b>User</b> feedback led the designers to make the buttons bigger and the text darker.\",\"用户的反馈促使设计师把按钮做大、把文字加深。\"]],\"environment\":[[\"Children who grow up surrounded by books develop in an <b>environment</b> that favors reading.\",\"在书香环绕中长大的孩子，成长于一个有利于阅读的环境。\"],[\"The factory was fined for releasing chemicals into the local <b>environment</b>.\",\"这家工厂因向当地环境排放化学物质被罚款。\"]],\"manufacturing\":[[\"<b>Manufacturing</b> moved overseas, and the town lost its largest employer.\",\"制造业转移到海外后，这座小镇失去了最大的雇主。\"],[\"The region's <b>manufacturing</b> sector now produces parts for electric vehicles.\",\"该地区的制造业如今生产电动汽车零部件。\"]],\"canary\":[[\"Miners once carried a <b>canary</b> underground; if the bird fell silent, dangerous gas was present.\",\"矿工过去会带一只金丝雀下井；如果鸟不再鸣叫，就说明有危险气体。\"],[\"Her pet <b>canary</b> sings every morning as soon as the sun rises.\",\"她养的金丝雀每天日出时都会鸣唱。\"]],\"temperament\":[[\"His even <b>temperament</b> makes him easy to work with, even under pressure.\",\"他性情平稳，即使压力很大也很好合作。\"],[\"The breed is popular with families because of its gentle <b>temperament</b>.\",\"这个品种因性情温和而受家庭欢迎。\"]],\"cinema\":[[\"The old <b>cinema</b> on Main Street shows classic films every Friday night.\",\"主街上的那家老电影院每周五晚放映经典影片。\"],[\"French <b>cinema</b> of the 1960s changed how directors everywhere told stories.\",\"20 世纪 60 年代的法国电影改变了世界各地导演讲故事的方式。\"]],\"comedy\":[[\"The <b>comedy</b> had the whole audience laughing from the very first scene.\",\"这部喜剧从第一场戏起就让全场笑个不停。\"],[\"Shakespeare's <b>comedies</b> usually end with a wedding and a dance.\",\"莎士比亚的喜剧通常以婚礼和舞蹈结尾。\"]],\"metallurgy\":[[\"<b>Metallurgy</b> allowed early peoples to turn soft copper into much harder bronze.\",\"冶金学让早期人类能把软铜变成硬得多的青铜。\"],[\"She studies <b>metallurgy</b> to design alloys that can survive the heat inside a jet engine.\",\"她研究冶金学，设计能承受喷气发动机内部高温的合金。\"]],\"capital\":[[\"The startup raised enough <b>capital</b> to build its first factory.\",\"这家初创公司筹集了足够的资本来建第一座工厂。\"],[\"Small farms often lack the <b>capital</b> to buy modern harvesting equipment.\",\"小农场常常缺乏购买现代收割设备的资本。\"]],\"inference\":[[\"From the worn teeth, scientists drew the <b>inference</b> that the animal ate tough, fibrous plants.\",\"从磨损的牙齿，科学家推断这种动物以坚韧的纤维植物为食。\"],[\"His <b>inference</b> that prices would fall turned out to be completely wrong.\",\"他推断价格会下跌，结果完全错了。\"]],\"boosted\":[[\"The new highway <b>boosted</b> trade between the two farming regions.\",\"新公路促进了两个农业区之间的贸易。\"],[\"One early victory left the young team with <b>boosted</b> confidence for the rest of the season.\",\"一场早早的胜利让这支年轻队伍在整个赛季余下的时间里信心大增。\"]],\"advertising\":[[\"The company now spends more on online <b>advertising</b> than on television commercials.\",\"这家公司如今在网络广告上的花费超过了电视广告。\"],[\"In some countries, <b>advertising</b> aimed at young children is strictly limited.\",\"在一些国家，针对幼儿的广告受到严格限制。\"]],\"folklore\":[[\"In local <b>folklore</b>, a clever fox spirit tricks travelers who walk alone at night.\",\"在当地民俗传说里，一只狡猾的狐仙会捉弄夜间独行的人。\"],[\"The museum collects <b>folklore</b> — songs, tales, and proverbs — from villages across the region.\",\"这家博物馆收集整个地区的民俗——歌谣、故事和谚语。\"]],\"bee\":[[\"A single <b>bee</b> colony may contain fifty thousand workers.\",\"一个蜜蜂群落可能有多达五万只工蜂。\"],[\"As <b>bees</b> collect nectar, they carry pollen from flower to flower.\",\"蜜蜂采蜜时，把花粉从一朵花带到另一朵花。\"]],\"disgust\":[[\"He looked at the spoiled milk with <b>disgust</b> and poured it down the sink.\",\"他厌恶地看了一眼变质的牛奶，把它倒进了水槽。\"],[\"Her <b>disgust</b> at the unfair rule led her to write a letter to the school board.\",\"她对这条不公平规定的厌恶促使她给校董事会写了信。\"]],\"geometry\":[[\"In <b>geometry</b> class, students prove that the angles of a triangle add up to 180 degrees.\",\"在几何课上，学生证明三角形内角和为 180 度。\"],[\"The <b>geometry</b> of a honeycomb gives it great strength while using very little wax.\",\"蜂巢的几何结构让它用很少的蜂蜡就获得很大的强度。\"]],\"champion\":[[\"The defending <b>champion</b> won the final in straight sets without losing a game.\",\"卫冕冠军直落数盘赢下决赛，一局未失。\"],[\"At sixteen, she became the youngest chess <b>champion</b> in her country's history.\",\"十六岁时，她成为该国历史上最年轻的国际象棋冠军。\"]],\"equation\":[[\"To solve the <b>equation</b>, first move all the terms with x to one side.\",\"解这个等式，先把所有含 x 的项移到一边。\"],[\"Einstein's most famous <b>equation</b> links energy, mass, and the speed of light.\",\"爱因斯坦最著名的等式把能量、质量和光速联系在一起。\"]],\"equipment\":[[\"The laboratory bought <b>equipment</b> that can measure temperature changes of a thousandth of a degree.\",\"实验室购进了能测出千分之一度温度变化的设备。\"],[\"Campers must carry all of their own <b>equipment</b> up the mountain.\",\"露营者必须自己把全部设备背上山。\"]],\"solar\":[[\"<b>Solar</b> panels on the roof supply most of the building's electricity.\",\"屋顶上的太阳能电池板为这栋楼供应了大部分电力。\"],[\"A <b>solar</b> eclipse happens when the Moon passes directly between Earth and the Sun.\",\"当月球恰好运行到地球与太阳之间时，就会发生日食。\"]],\"coordinate\":[[\"One manager <b>coordinates</b> the work of the four research teams so their results can be compared.\",\"一位经理协调四个研究团队的工作，以便比较他们的结果。\"],[\"Rescue teams <b>coordinated</b> their search so that no area was checked twice or missed.\",\"救援队协调搜寻，避免任何区域被重复搜索或遗漏。\"]],\"photograph\":[[\"The <b>photograph</b> shows the glacier as it looked a hundred years ago — far larger than it is today.\",\"这张照片记录了一百年前的冰川——比现在大得多。\"],[\"He keeps a framed <b>photograph</b> of his grandparents on his desk.\",\"他的书桌上放着一幅装框的祖父母照片。\"]],\"bestow\":[[\"The university <b>bestowed</b> an honorary degree on the novelist at the spring ceremony.\",\"大学在春季典礼上授予这位小说家荣誉学位。\"],[\"Each year the foundation <b>bestows</b> small grants on young artists who cannot afford studio space.\",\"这家基金会每年向租不起工作室的年轻艺术家授予小额资助。\"]],\"finch\":[[\"A <b>finch</b> built its nest in the bush right beside the kitchen window.\",\"一只雀在厨房窗边的灌木里筑了巢。\"],[\"Darwin noticed that the <b>finches</b> on different Galápagos islands had beaks of different shapes.\",\"达尔文注意到，加拉帕戈斯不同岛屿上的雀鸟喙形各不相同。\"]],\"arrow\":[[\"The hunter's <b>arrow</b> missed the deer and stuck deep into a tree trunk.\",\"猎人的箭没有射中鹿，深深扎进了一棵树干。\"],[\"Follow the red <b>arrows</b> painted on the floor to reach the emergency exit.\",\"沿着地板上红色的箭头标志走，就能到达紧急出口。\"]],\"retina\":[[\"Light entering the eye forms a focused image on the <b>retina</b> at the back.\",\"进入眼睛的光在后部的视网膜上形成聚焦的图像。\"],[\"Serious damage to the <b>retina</b> can cause permanent loss of vision.\",\"视网膜严重受损可能导致永久性视力丧失。\"]],\"slap\":[[\"She <b>slapped</b> the mosquito that had landed on her arm.\",\"她一巴掌拍死了落在手臂上的蚊子。\"],[\"The <b>slap</b> of waves against the side of the boat kept her awake all night.\",\"海浪拍打船身的声音让她整夜没睡着。\"]],\"kilogram\":[[\"The newborn baby weighed just over three <b>kilograms</b>.\",\"这个新生儿体重刚过三千克。\"],[\"A <b>kilogram</b> of feathers takes up far more space than a <b>kilogram</b> of steel, though they weigh the same.\",\"一千克羽毛所占的空间远大于一千克钢，尽管两者一样重。\"]],\"culture\":[[\"In this company's <b>culture</b>, junior staff are expected to question their managers' decisions.\",\"在这家公司的文化里，基层员工被鼓励质疑经理的决定。\"],[\"Visitors can experience the <b>culture</b> of the region through its food, music, and festivals.\",\"游客可以通过当地的饮食、音乐和节日体验这个地区的文化。\"]],\"blast\":[[\"Workers used a controlled <b>blast</b> to break up the rock blocking the tunnel route.\",\"工人用定向爆破炸开通往隧道线路的岩石。\"],[\"The <b>blast</b> at the quarry was so strong that it rattled windows in the next valley.\",\"采石场的爆破威力很大，震得隔壁山谷的窗户都响。\"]],\"envelope\":[[\"She sealed the letter in an <b>envelope</b> and wrote the address in blue pen.\",\"她把信封好，写上地址，用的是蓝笔。\"],[\"Inside the <b>envelope</b> there was a check and a short handwritten note.\",\"信封里有一张支票和一张手写的短信。\"]],\"hybrid\":[[\"Their new <b>hybrid</b> runs on electric power in the city and switches to gasoline on the highway.\",\"他们的新混合动力车在城里用电，上了高速切换为汽油。\"],[\"Because a <b>hybrid</b> recharges its battery while braking, it uses less fuel than a conventional car.\",\"混合动力车在刹车时给电池充电，所以比普通汽车更省油。\"]],\"cougar\":[[\"The <b>cougar</b> hunts mostly at dawn, stalking deer through the dry hills.\",\"美洲狮多在黎明时捕猎，在干旱的山丘间悄悄跟踪鹿。\"],[\"Hikers were warned that a <b>cougar</b> had been seen near the trail twice that week.\",\"徒步者被警告说，那周已有人两次在小径附近看到美洲狮。\"]],\"omnivore\":[[\"The brown bear is an <b>omnivore</b>: it eats berries and roots, but also catches fish.\",\"棕熊是杂食动物：它吃浆果和根茎，也会捕鱼。\"],[\"As <b>omnivores</b>, pigs thrive on almost anything, from grain to kitchen scraps.\",\"猪是杂食动物，从谷物到厨余几乎什么都能长得很好。\"]],\"alumni\":[[\"The university invites its <b>alumni</b> back every autumn for a weekend of lectures and games.\",\"大学每年秋天邀请校友返校，参加一个周末的讲座和比赛。\"],[\"Several wealthy <b>alumni</b> donated the money for the new library wing.\",\"几位富有的校友捐资修建了图书馆的新翼。\"]],\"exhortation\":[[\"The coach's <b>exhortation</b> at halftime — to keep passing and stay patient — changed the game.\",\"教练中场时的劝告——保持传球、保持耐心——改变了比赛。\"],[\"His letters are full of <b>exhortations</b> to work hard and waste no time.\",\"他的书信里满是劝人勤奋、莫虚度光阴的话。\"]],\"relay\":[[\"She ran the final leg of the <b>relay</b> and passed two runners in the last fifty meters.\",\"她跑接力赛的最后一棒，在最后五十米超过了两名选手。\"],[\"In a <b>relay</b>, dropping the baton usually costs the team the race.\",\"在接力赛中，掉棒通常会让全队输掉比赛。\"]],\"capsize\":[[\"A sudden wave struck the small fishing boat and <b>capsized</b> it within seconds.\",\"一个突如其来的浪头打中小渔船，几秒钟内就把它掀翻了。\"],[\"If the kayak <b>capsizes</b>, stay calm and hold on to it until help arrives.\",\"如果皮划艇翻船，要保持冷静，抓住船体等待救援。\"]],\"stable\":[[\"Keep the ladder on <b>stable</b> ground before you climb it.\",\"爬梯子之前，要先把它放在稳定的地面上。\"],[\"After the operation, the patient's condition was described as <b>stable</b>.\",\"手术后，病人的状况被描述为稳定。\"]],\"bulb\":[[\"The <b>bulb</b> in the hallway has burned out again, so the stairs are dark.\",\"走廊的灯泡又烧坏了，楼梯一片漆黑。\"],[\"LED <b>bulbs</b> use far less electricity than the older glass bulbs they replaced.\",\"LED 灯泡比它们替代的老式玻璃灯泡省电得多。\"]],\"description\":[[\"The witness gave police a detailed <b>description</b> of the man she had seen.\",\"目击者向警方详细描述了她见过的那个男子的外貌。\"],[\"The job <b>description</b> lists teamwork and clear writing as essential skills.\",\"这份职位描述把团队合作和清晰写作列为必备技能。\"]],\"climbing\":[[\"<b>Climbing</b> the steep trail took the group almost four hours.\",\"爬完那条陡峭的山路，这支队伍花了近四个小时。\"],[\"She took up rock <b>climbing</b> at university and now competes nationally.\",\"她在大学时开始攀岩，如今参加全国比赛。\"]],\"atlas\":[[\"He looked up the river's course in a world <b>atlas</b> before planning the trip.\",\"规划行程前，他在世界地图册里查了这条河的走向。\"],[\"The school library keeps a large <b>atlas</b> on a stand near the geography shelves.\",\"学校图书馆在地理书架旁的支架上放着一本大地图册。\"]],\"besides\":[[\"<b>Besides</b> English, she speaks French and a little Japanese.\",\"除了英语，她还会说法语和一点日语。\"],[\"The hotel was full, and <b>besides</b>, it was far too expensive for our budget.\",\"那家酒店已经客满，而且价格也远超我们的预算。\"]],\"garden\":[[\"She grows tomatoes, peppers, and beans in the <b>garden</b> behind the house.\",\"她在房后的花园里种西红柿、辣椒和豆子。\"],[\"The public <b>garden</b> opens at dawn, and by seven it is full of people exercising.\",\"公共花园黎明开放，七点时已满是锻炼的人。\"]],\"absurdity\":[[\"He laughed at the <b>absurdity</b> of paying for bottled water beside a clean mountain spring.\",\"在干净的山泉旁还要花钱买瓶装水，他觉得这事荒谬得好笑。\"],[\"The report points out the <b>absurdity</b> of building more parking lots to reduce traffic.\",\"报告指出，靠多建停车场来缓解交通是荒谬的。\"]],\"toilet\":[[\"The train's <b>toilet</b> was out of order for the whole six-hour journey.\",\"火车上的厕所在六小时行程中一直故障停用。\"],[\"Please do not throw paper towels into the <b>toilet</b>; use the bin beside it.\",\"请不要把纸巾扔进厕所，请用旁边的垃圾桶。\"]],\"expiration\":[[\"Check the <b>expiration</b> date on the milk before you drink it.\",\"喝牛奶之前先看一下保质期到期日。\"],[\"His driver's license reaches its <b>expiration</b> next March and must be renewed.\",\"他的驾照明年三月到期，必须更换。\"]],\"chloride\":[[\"Sodium <b>chloride</b> — ordinary table salt — is the most familiar <b>chloride</b> in daily life.\",\"氯化钠——也就是食盐——是日常生活中最常见的氯化物。\"],[\"The laboratory tested the well water for <b>chloride</b> levels after the factory spill.\",\"工厂泄漏后，实验室检测了井水中的氯化物含量。\"]],\"treaty\":[[\"The <b>treaty</b> signed in 1842 redrew the border between the two nations.\",\"1842 年签署的条约重新划定了两国边界。\"],[\"Under the peace <b>treaty</b>, prisoners from both sides were sent home.\",\"根据和平条约，双方的战俘都被遣返回国。\"]],\"athlete\":[[\"An Olympic <b>athlete</b> may train for ten years for a race that lasts ten seconds.\",\"一名奥运运动员可能为一场十秒的比赛训练十年。\"],[\"The young <b>athlete</b> recovered from her injury faster than her doctors expected.\",\"这位年轻运动员伤愈的速度比医生预期的快。\"]],\"justice\":[[\"The court's decision was widely praised as a victory for <b>justice</b>.\",\"法院的这项裁决被广泛称赞为正义的胜利。\"],[\"He spent his career fighting for <b>justice</b> for workers injured on the job.\",\"他一生都在为工伤工人争取正义。\"]],\"mattress\":[[\"The hotel <b>mattress</b> was so soft that she woke up with a sore back.\",\"酒店的床垫太软，她醒来时后背酸痛。\"],[\"They carried the old <b>mattress</b> down three flights of stairs to the truck.\",\"他们把旧床垫抬下三层楼，搬上了卡车。\"]],\"fee\":[[\"The museum charges a small entrance <b>fee</b> on weekends only.\",\"这家博物馆只在周末收取少量门票费用。\"],[\"Lawyers usually charge a <b>fee</b> for the first consultation as well.\",\"律师通常对第一次咨询也要收费。\"]],\"salad\":[[\"She made a simple <b>salad</b> with lettuce, tomatoes, and olive oil.\",\"她用生菜、西红柿和橄榄油做了一份简单的沙拉。\"],[\"The restaurant serves the <b>salad</b> before the main course, not with it.\",\"这家餐厅在主菜之前上沙拉，而不是一起上。\"]],\"eliminate\":[[\"Boiling the water <b>eliminates</b> most of the bacteria in it.\",\"把水烧开可以消除其中大部分细菌。\"],[\"The new design <b>eliminated</b> the need for a separate cooling fan.\",\"新设计消除了对单独散热风扇的需求。\"]],\"basil\":[[\"Fresh <b>basil</b> leaves give the tomato sauce its distinctive smell.\",\"新鲜的罗勒叶赋予番茄酱独特的香气。\"],[\"She grows <b>basil</b> in a pot on the kitchen windowsill all summer.\",\"整个夏天，她都在厨房窗台的花盆里种罗勒。\"]],\"membrane\":[[\"The cell <b>membrane</b> controls which substances can enter or leave the cell.\",\"细胞膜控制哪些物质可以进出细胞。\"],[\"A thin <b>membrane</b> of ice had already formed on the pond by early morning.\",\"清晨时分，池塘上已经结了一层薄冰膜。\"]],\"pork\":[[\"The stew is made with <b>pork</b>, potatoes, and carrots, cooked slowly for hours.\",\"这锅炖菜用猪肉、土豆和胡萝卜小火慢炖数小时。\"],[\"For religious reasons, the school cafeteria does not serve <b>pork</b>.\",\"出于宗教原因，学校食堂不供应猪肉。\"]],\"catfish\":[[\"The <b>catfish</b> uses its whisker-like barbels to find food in muddy river bottoms.\",\"鲶鱼用胡须一样的触须在浑浊的河底寻找食物。\"],[\"They caught a <b>catfish</b> so large that two people had to lift it into the boat.\",\"他们钓到一条大鲶鱼，大到需要两个人才能抬上船。\"]],\"crease\":[[\"He ironed the shirt carefully to remove every <b>crease</b>.\",\"他仔细熨烫衬衫，去除每一道折痕。\"],[\"The old map had a <b>crease</b> down the middle from years of being folded.\",\"这张旧地图因多年折叠，中间有一道深深的折痕。\"]],\"photo\":[[\"She took a <b>photo</b> of the sunset with her phone and sent it to her sister.\",\"她用手机拍了一张日落照片，发给了妹妹。\"],[\"Old <b>photos</b> in the family album show the street as it looked in 1950.\",\"家庭相册里的老照片记录了这条街 1950 年的样子。\"]],\"legal\":[[\"It is not <b>legal</b> to copy the whole book, even for classroom use.\",\"即使是课堂使用，整本复制这本书也不合法（法律不允许）。\"],[\"She sought <b>legal</b> advice before signing the contract with the publisher.\",\"与出版社签合同之前，她寻求了法律咨询。\"]],\"wink\":[[\"She gave him a quick <b>wink</b> to show she was only joking.\",\"她朝他快速眨了下眼，示意她只是在开玩笑。\"],[\"He <b>winked</b> at the children and pulled a coin from behind his ear.\",\"他朝孩子们眨眨眼，从耳后变出一枚硬币。\"]],\"estate\":[[\"The family sold the <b>estate</b> — a large house with gardens and a small lake — after their father died.\",\"父亲去世后，这家人卖掉了这处房地产——一栋带花园和小湖的大房子。\"],[\"Real <b>estate</b> prices in the capital rose for the tenth year in a row.\",\"首都的房地产价格连续第十年上涨。\"]],\"algorithm\":[[\"The search <b>algorithm</b> ranks pages by how closely they match the question.\",\"搜索算法按页面与问题的匹配程度给页面排序。\"],[\"He designed an <b>algorithm</b> that sorts these records ten times faster than the old method.\",\"他设计了一种算法，排序这些记录比旧方法快十倍。\"]],\"wither\":[[\"Without rain for a month, the young plants began to <b>wither</b>.\",\"一个月没下雨，幼苗开始枯萎。\"],[\"Cut flowers <b>wither</b> quickly if the vase runs dry.\",\"如果花瓶里没水，鲜切花很快就会枯萎。\"]],\"partnership\":[[\"Their <b>partnership</b> began in a garage and grew into a company of two hundred people.\",\"他们的合伙企业起步于一间车库，后来成长为两百人的公司。\"],[\"The two charities formed a <b>partnership</b> to deliver food to remote villages.\",\"两家慈善机构建立合伙关系，把食物送到偏远村庄。\"]],\"alpaca\":[[\"The <b>alpaca's</b> thick fleece keeps it warm in the cold Andes mountains.\",\"羊驼厚厚的绒毛让它在寒冷的安第斯山脉保持温暖。\"],[\"Farmers in Peru raise <b>alpacas</b> mainly for their soft wool.\",\"秘鲁的农民养羊驼，主要是为了它们柔软的毛。\"]],\"apricot\":[[\"The <b>apricots</b> ripened early this year because of the warm spring.\",\"因为今春暖和，杏子今年熟得早。\"],[\"She dried the extra <b>apricots</b> to use in winter baking.\",\"她把多余的杏晒干，留着冬天烘焙时用。\"]],\"entity\":[[\"The hospital is a separate legal <b>entity</b> from the university that founded it.\",\"这家医院是独立于创办它的大学的法律实体。\"],[\"In the database, each customer is treated as a single <b>entity</b> with one account number.\",\"在数据库中，每位顾客被视为一个独立实体，只有一个账号。\"]],\"cordon\":[[\"Police set up a <b>cordon</b> around the damaged building to keep the crowds back.\",\"警方在受损建筑周围设置了封锁线，拦住人群。\"],[\"A <b>cordon</b> of soldiers lined the road while the convoy passed through.\",\"车队通过时，一列士兵封锁了道路两旁。\"]],\"initial\":[[\"Her <b>initial</b> reaction was anger, but she calmed down once she heard the full story.\",\"她最初的反应是愤怒，但听完事情原委后平静了下来。\"],[\"The <b>initial</b> results of the trial were promising enough to justify a larger study.\",\"试验的初步结果很有希望，足以支持开展更大规模的研究。\"]],\"confer\":[[\"The university will <b>confer</b> degrees on more than two thousand graduates this June.\",\"大学今年六月将向两千多名毕业生授予学位。\"],[\"The title <b>confers</b> no salary, but it carries great honor in the profession.\",\"这个头衔没有薪水，但在业内享有极高的荣誉。\"]],\"appraisal\":[[\"The bank ordered an <b>appraisal</b> of the house before approving the loan.\",\"银行在批准贷款前，要求对这栋房子进行评估。\"],[\"Her yearly <b>appraisal</b> praised her careful record keeping and calm manner.\",\"她的年度评估表扬了她细致的记录习惯和沉稳的态度。\"]],\"temperature\":[[\"The <b>temperature</b> dropped below freezing overnight, and the pipes froze.\",\"气温夜间降到冰点以下，水管冻住了。\"],[\"Body <b>temperature</b> above thirty-nine degrees is a sign the infection is serious.\",\"体温超过三十九度，说明感染很严重。\"]],\"eyebrow\":[[\"She raised an <b>eyebrow</b> when he claimed he had finished the work in one hour.\",\"当他声称一小时就做完了这项工作时，她扬起了眉毛。\"],[\"His thick <b>eyebrows</b> made his serious expression look even more severe.\",\"他浓浓的眉毛让严肃的表情显得更加严厉。\"]],\"implicate\":[[\"The leaked emails <b>implicated</b> two senior officials in the bribery scandal.\",\"泄露的邮件把两名高级官员牵连进了贿赂丑闻。\"],[\"He refused to answer questions that might <b>implicate</b> his brother.\",\"他拒绝回答任何可能牵连他兄弟的问题。\"]],\"parole\":[[\"After serving half his sentence, he was released on <b>parole</b> and reported weekly to an officer.\",\"服满一半刑期后，他获得假释，每周向监管人员报到。\"],[\"Violating the conditions of his <b>parole</b> sent him back to prison.\",\"他违反假释条件，又被送回了监狱。\"]],\"expert\":[[\"An <b>expert</b> in medieval manuscripts identified the document as a forgery.\",\"一位中世纪手稿专家鉴定这份文件是伪造的。\"],[\"You don't need to be an <b>expert</b> to grow tomatoes; they need sun and regular watering.\",\"种西红柿不需要是专家；它们需要阳光和定期浇水。\"]],\"seal\":[[\"A <b>seal</b> can stay underwater for twenty minutes before it must come up for air.\",\"海豹能在水下待二十分钟，才必须浮上来换气。\"],[\"Hundreds of <b>seals</b> rest on the ice in spring, warming themselves in the weak sun.\",\"春天，成百上千只海豹躺在冰面上，在微弱的阳光下取暖。\"]],\"security\":[[\"Airport <b>security</b> now requires passengers to remove their shoes at the checkpoint.\",\"机场安检现在要求乘客在检查点脱鞋。\"],[\"For many older workers, job <b>security</b> matters more than a slightly higher salary.\",\"对许多年长员工来说，工作的安全感比稍高的薪水更重要。\"]],\"concurrent\":[[\"The two conferences held <b>concurrent</b> sessions, so she could attend only one of them.\",\"两个会议的议程同时进行，她只能参加其中一个。\"],[\"He served <b>concurrent</b> terms as mayor and as head of the school board.\",\"他同时担任市长和校董事会主席两个职务。\"]],\"patent\":[[\"She applied for a <b>patent</b> before showing the invention to any company.\",\"在向任何公司展示这项发明之前，她先申请了专利。\"],[\"The <b>patent</b> on the drug expired, and cheaper versions appeared within months.\",\"这种药的专利到期后，几个月内就出现了更便宜的版本。\"]],\"marrow\":[[\"Bone <b>marrow</b> produces the red and white blood cells the body needs.\",\"骨髓制造人体所需的红细胞和白细胞。\"],[\"A <b>marrow</b> transplant from her brother saved the girl's life.\",\"她哥哥捐献的骨髓移植挽救了这个女孩的生命。\"]],\"tendon\":[[\"He tore a <b>tendon</b> in his ankle and could not walk for six weeks.\",\"他脚踝的肌腱撕裂，六周不能走路。\"],[\"<b>Tendons</b> connect muscle to bone, so every movement pulls on them.\",\"肌腱连接肌肉与骨骼，所以每个动作都会牵动它们。\"]],\"relativity\":[[\"Einstein's theory of <b>relativity</b> changed how physicists understand time and gravity.\",\"爱因斯坦的相对论改变了物理学家对时间和引力的理解。\"],[\"In general <b>relativity</b>, gravity is described as the curvature of space and time.\",\"在广义相对论中，引力被描述为时空的弯曲。\"]],\"jaguar\":[[\"The <b>jaguar</b> is the largest cat in the Americas and a powerful swimmer.\",\"美洲豹是美洲最大的猫科动物，也是游泳健将。\"],[\"Unlike most big cats, the <b>jaguar</b> often hunts in rivers, catching fish and small caimans.\",\"与多数大型猫科动物不同，美洲豹常在河里捕猎，捕鱼和小凯门鳄。\"]],\"precipitation\":[[\"Annual <b>precipitation</b> in the desert is less than twenty-five centimeters.\",\"这片沙漠的年降水量不到二十五厘米。\"],[\"Most of the region's <b>precipitation</b> falls as snow between November and March.\",\"该地区大部分降水以雪的形式落在十一月至三月之间。\"]],\"distraction\":[[\"He turned off his phone to study without <b>distraction</b>.\",\"他关掉手机，以便不受分心地学习。\"],[\"The television in the waiting room was a welcome <b>distraction</b> for nervous patients.\",\"候诊室里的电视让紧张的病人有了令人欣喜的分心之物。\"]],\"wallet\":[[\"He keeps his driver's license and two cards in a thin leather <b>wallet</b>.\",\"他把驾照和两张卡放在一个薄薄的皮钱包里。\"],[\"She found a lost <b>wallet</b> on the train and handed it to the conductor.\",\"她在火车上捡到一个丢失的钱包，交给了列车员。\"]],\"scientist\":[[\"The <b>scientist</b> repeated the experiment three times before publishing the result.\",\"这位科学家把实验重复了三遍才发表结果。\"],[\"As a young <b>scientist</b>, she worked in a small lab with equipment she built herself.\",\"年轻时，她在一间小实验室里工作，设备都是自己做的。\"]],\"data\":[[\"The researchers collected <b>data</b> from five hundred volunteers over three years.\",\"研究人员在三年内从五百名志愿者那里收集了数据。\"],[\"Before drawing conclusions, check whether the <b>data</b> were recorded correctly.\",\"在下结论之前，先检查数据记录得是否正确。\"]],\"evasion\":[[\"His answer was a clear <b>evasion</b> — he talked for five minutes without addressing the question.\",\"他的回答明显是逃避——说了五分钟，却没碰问题本身。\"],[\"She was charged with tax <b>evasion</b> after hiding her income for six years.\",\"她因隐瞒收入六年而被控逃税。\"]],\"coincide\":[[\"The festival <b>coincides</b> with the harvest, so the whole village celebrates together.\",\"节日恰逢收获时节，全村人一起庆祝。\"],[\"Her visit to Tokyo <b>coincided</b> with the cherry-blossom season.\",\"她去东京时正好赶上樱花季。\"]],\"claw\":[[\"The cat extended its <b>claws</b> and scratched at the post by the door.\",\"猫伸出爪子，抓挠门边的柱子。\"],[\"An eagle's <b>claws</b> are strong enough to lift a rabbit off the ground.\",\"鹰的爪子力量很大，能把一只兔子抓离地面。\"]],\"bucket\":[[\"He filled a <b>bucket</b> with water and carried it to the garden.\",\"他装满一桶水，提到了花园里。\"],[\"Rain dripped steadily from the leaking roof into the <b>bucket</b> below.\",\"雨水从漏雨的屋顶不停地滴进下面的水桶里。\"]],\"sculptor\":[[\"The <b>sculptor</b> spent two years carving the statue from a single block of marble.\",\"雕塑家花了两年时间，把一整块大理石雕成这座雕像。\"],[\"A young <b>sculptor</b> from the village won the national art prize.\",\"村里一位年轻雕塑家赢得了全国艺术奖。\"]],\"collage\":[[\"The children made a <b>collage</b> from magazine pictures, leaves, and pieces of colored cloth.\",\"孩子们用杂志图片、树叶和彩布做了一幅拼贴画。\"],[\"Her most famous work is a <b>collage</b> that covers an entire gallery wall.\",\"她最著名的作品是一幅占满整面展厅墙壁的拼贴画。\"]],\"lobster\":[[\"The <b>lobster</b> hides among the rocks during the day and hunts at night.\",\"龙虾白天藏在岩石间，夜里出来捕食。\"],[\"They served grilled <b>lobster</b> with lemon and melted butter.\",\"他们上了烤龙虾，配柠檬和融化黄油。\"]],\"iris\":[[\"The <b>iris</b> controls how much light enters the eye by widening or narrowing the pupil.\",\"虹膜通过放大或缩小瞳孔来控制进入眼睛的光量。\"],[\"Her <b>irises</b> are an unusual shade of greenish gray.\",\"她的虹膜是少见的灰绿色。\"]],\"maple\":[[\"The <b>maple</b> in their front yard turns brilliant red every October.\",\"他们前院的那棵枫树每年十月都会变得鲜红。\"],[\"Canada's flag carries a single red <b>maple</b> leaf at its center.\",\"加拿大国旗中央有一片红色的枫叶。\"]],\"allotment\":[[\"Each research team received an equal <b>allotment</b> of laboratory time.\",\"每个研究团队都分到了相等的实验室使用时间。\"],[\"Under the treaty, the country's <b>allotment</b> of fishing waters was reduced.\",\"根据条约，该国分得的捕鱼水域减少了。\"]],\"reasoning\":[[\"Her <b>reasoning</b> was careful: she checked each assumption before trusting the conclusion.\",\"她的推理很严谨：信任结论之前，先逐一核查每个假设。\"],[\"The detective's <b>reasoning</b> led him to question the witness a second time.\",\"侦探的推理让他决定第二次询问目击者。\"]],\"dignity\":[[\"Even in prison, he kept his <b>dignity</b> and treated his guards with courtesy.\",\"即使身在狱中，他也保持着尊严，礼貌地对待看守。\"],[\"The nurse believes every patient deserves to be treated with <b>dignity</b>.\",\"这位护士认为，每位病人都应得到有尊严的对待。\"]],\"revenue\":[[\"Ticket sales are the theater's main source of <b>revenue</b>.\",\"门票销售是这家剧院的主要收入来源。\"],[\"The city's <b>revenue</b> fell when the factory closed and workers moved away.\",\"工厂关闭、工人离开后，这座城市的收入下降了。\"]],\"abundance\":[[\"The reef supports an <b>abundance</b> of fish, turtles, and other sea life.\",\"这片礁区有丰富的鱼类、海龟和其他海洋生物。\"],[\"After years of scarcity, the harvest brought an <b>abundance</b> of grain to the region.\",\"经过多年歉收，这次丰收为该地区带来了丰富的粮食。\"]],\"vitamin\":[[\"Oranges are rich in <b>vitamin</b> C, which helps the body fight infection.\",\"橙子富含维生素 C，有助于身体抵抗感染。\"],[\"A lack of <b>vitamin</b> D is common in places where winters are long and dark.\",\"在冬季漫长、日照不足的地方，缺乏维生素 D 很常见。\"]],\"demonstrate\":[[\"The teacher <b>demonstrated</b> the experiment once, then let the students try it themselves.\",\"老师把实验演示了一遍，然后让学生自己动手试。\"],[\"Thousands of workers <b>demonstrated</b> in the square, demanding higher wages.\",\"数千名工人在广场上示威，要求提高工资。\"]],\"neck\":[[\"She wore a scarf around her <b>neck</b> against the cold wind.\",\"她围着围巾抵御寒风，围巾绕在脖子上。\"],[\"The giraffe's long <b>neck</b> lets it reach leaves other animals cannot.\",\"长颈鹿的长脖子让它能吃到其他动物够不到的树叶。\"]],\"banker\":[[\"The <b>banker</b> explained why the loan had been refused: the farm's income was too uncertain.\",\"银行家解释了贷款被拒的原因：农场的收入太不稳定。\"],[\"Before becoming a <b>banker</b>, she studied mathematics and worked as an accountant.\",\"成为银行家之前，她学过数学，还做过会计。\"]],\"constitute\":[[\"Twelve men and women <b>constitute</b> the jury in a criminal trial.\",\"十二名男女公民构成刑事审判的陪审团。\"],[\"These small errors <b>constitute</b> a serious problem when added together.\",\"这些小错误加在一起，就构成了一个严重的问题。\"]],\"sketchbook\":[[\"She carries a <b>sketchbook</b> everywhere and draws strangers on the train.\",\"她随身带着素描本，在火车上画陌生人。\"],[\"The artist's early <b>sketchbooks</b> show how his style changed year by year.\",\"这位艺术家早年的素描本记录了他的风格如何逐年变化。\"]],\"pottery\":[[\"The museum displays <b>pottery</b> made in this region more than two thousand years ago.\",\"博物馆展出两千多年前本地区制作的陶器。\"],[\"In the evening class, beginners learn <b>pottery</b> on a wheel before trying hand building.\",\"在晚间课程里，初学者先学拉坯陶艺，再尝试手捏成型。\"]],\"degree\":[[\"She earned her <b>degree</b> in biology while working nights at a hospital.\",\"她一边在医院上夜班，一边拿到了生物学学位。\"],[\"A master's <b>degree</b> usually requires two more years of study after the bachelor's.\",\"硕士学位通常需要在学士学位之后再读两年。\"]],\"copyright\":[[\"The novel is still under <b>copyright</b>, so the website cannot publish its full text.\",\"这部小说仍在版权保护期内，网站不能刊登全文。\"],[\"He registered the <b>copyright</b> for his photographs before selling them to a magazine.\",\"在把照片卖给杂志之前，他先登记了版权。\"]],\"initiate\":[[\"The students <b>initiated</b> a recycling program that the whole school now follows.\",\"学生们发起了一项回收计划，如今全校都在执行。\"],[\"It was the junior senator who <b>initiated</b> the investigation.\",\"正是这位年轻参议员发起了这项调查。\"]],\"orbit\":[[\"The satellite completes one <b>orbit</b> of Earth every ninety minutes.\",\"这颗卫星每九十分钟绕地球一圈（完成一条轨道）。\"],[\"It takes Mars almost two Earth years to <b>orbit</b> the Sun once.\",\"火星绕太阳一周差不多需要两个地球年。\"]],\"artifice\":[[\"The card trick relies on <b>artifice</b> — quick hands and a prepared deck.\",\"这个纸牌魔术靠的是诡计——手快加一副做过手脚的牌。\"],[\"He gained the old man's trust by <b>artifice</b>, pretending to be a distant relative.\",\"他用诡计冒充远亲，骗取了老人的信任。\"]],\"alike\":[[\"The two sisters look so <b>alike</b> that their teachers often confuse them.\",\"这对姐妹长得太像了，老师们常常认错人。\"],[\"Great teachers are not all <b>alike</b>, but they share a respect for their students.\",\"优秀的教师并不都一个样，但他们都尊重学生。\"]],\"rugby\":[[\"<b>Rugby</b> players wear no helmets, yet serious head injuries are closely studied in the sport.\",\"橄榄球运动员不戴头盔，但这项运动对严重头部伤的研究很细致。\"],[\"He broke two fingers playing <b>rugby</b> at school and switched to swimming.\",\"他在学校打橄榄球时折了两根手指，后来改练游泳。\"]],\"chemistry\":[[\"In <b>chemistry</b>, students learn why some substances react violently when mixed.\",\"在化学课上，学生学习为什么有些物质混合后会剧烈反应。\"],[\"She failed <b>chemistry</b> the first time, then passed it easily after changing how she studied.\",\"她第一次化学没及格，改变学习方法后轻松通过了。\"]],\"astounding\":[[\"The rescue was <b>astounding</b>: all forty passengers survived the crash landing.\",\"这次救援令人震惊（惊人）：四十名乘客在迫降中全部生还。\"],[\"She has an <b>astounding</b> memory — she can recall the page number of almost any quote.\",\"她的记忆力惊人——几乎任何引文的页码她都能记起来。\"]],\"game\":[[\"Chess is a <b>game</b> of patience: one careless move can undo an hour of careful play.\",\"国际象棋是一场耐心的游戏：一步不慎就可能毁掉一小时的谨慎布局。\"],[\"The children invented a <b>game</b> with a ball, two chairs, and constantly changing rules.\",\"孩子们用一个球、两把椅子和不断变化的规则发明了一个游戏。\"]],\"flood\":[[\"The river <b>flooded</b> after three days of rain, covering the low roads near the bank.\",\"连下三天雨后河水泛滥（洪水），淹没了岸边低洼的道路。\"],[\"In spring, melting snow often causes a <b>flood</b> in the valley villages.\",\"春天融雪常常让山谷里的村庄发洪水。\"]],\"biography\":[[\"The <b>biography</b> of Marie Curie describes both her discoveries and her difficult early years.\",\"居里夫人的传记既写了她的发现，也写了她艰难的早年。\"],[\"He is writing a <b>biography</b> of the little-known engineer who designed the bridge.\",\"他正在写那位鲜为人知的大桥设计工程师的传记。\"]],\"resilience\":[[\"Children who read with adults every day often show greater <b>resilience</b> after setbacks at school.\",\"每天有大人陪读的儿童，在学校受挫后往往表现出更强的心理韧性。\"],[\"The town's <b>resilience</b> after the earthquake impressed visitors: markets reopened within weeks.\",\"小镇震后的韧性令访客印象深刻：几周内市场就重新开业了。\"]],\"explicit\":[[\"The instructions are <b>explicit</b>: no phones are allowed during the exam.\",\"说明非常明确：考试期间不许带手机。\"],[\"He gave <b>explicit</b> directions — turn left at the bakery, then left again — so we could not get lost.\",\"他给出了明确的指引——在面包房左转，再左转——我们不可能迷路。\"]],\"stool\":[[\"He sat on a wooden <b>stool</b> by the fire and peeled potatoes.\",\"他坐在火边的木凳子上削土豆。\"],[\"The piano <b>stool</b> is adjustable, so both children can reach the keys comfortably.\",\"钢琴凳可以调节高度，两个孩子都能舒服地够到琴键。\"]],\"abdomen\":[[\"The surgeon made a small cut in the lower <b>abdomen</b> and removed the appendix.\",\"外科医生在下腹部切开一个小口，切除了阑尾。\"],[\"Bees carry pollen and nectar in a special stomach inside the <b>abdomen</b>.\",\"蜜蜂在腹部内一个特殊的胃里携带花粉和花蜜。\"]],\"amuse\":[[\"The clown <b>amused</b> the children by making animals out of balloons.\",\"小丑用气球做小动物，把孩子们逗乐了。\"],[\"His stories about life on a fishing boat never fail to <b>amuse</b> his grandchildren.\",\"他讲的渔船生活故事总能把孙辈们逗乐。\"]],\"click\":[[\"<b>Click</b> the blue button once and wait for the page to load.\",\"点击一次蓝色按钮，然后等页面加载。\"],[\"The lock gave a small <b>click</b> as the key turned.\",\"钥匙转动时，锁发出一声轻响。\"]],\"allegation\":[[\"The <b>allegation</b> that he had taken bribes was printed before any charges were filed.\",\"在他被正式起诉之前，关于他受贿的指控说法就已经见报了。\"],[\"She denied every <b>allegation</b> and offered her records to the investigators.\",\"她否认了每一项指控，并把自己的记录交给了调查人员。\"]],\"numeracy\":[[\"The course improves <b>numeracy</b> by teaching students to estimate before they calculate.\",\"这门课通过教学生先估算再计算，提高计算能力。\"],[\"Poor <b>numeracy</b> makes it hard to judge whether a loan offer is actually fair.\",\"计算能力差，就很难判断一份贷款报价是否真的划算。\"]],\"clarify\":[[\"The professor paused to <b>clarify</b> the difference between the two theories.\",\"教授停下来澄清这两个理论之间的区别。\"],[\"Please <b>clarify</b> whether the fee includes breakfast or not.\",\"请澄清这笔费用是否包含早餐。\"]],\"sew\":[[\"She learned to <b>sew</b> from her grandmother, starting with buttons and hems.\",\"她跟祖母学缝纫，从钉纽扣和缝下摆开始。\"],[\"The nurse <b>sewed</b> up the cut with four neat stitches.\",\"护士用整齐的四针缝合了伤口。\"]],\"bay\":[[\"The small fishing boats shelter in the <b>bay</b> when a storm approaches.\",\"暴风雨来临时，小渔船都躲进海湾避风。\"],[\"From the cliff, the whole <b>bay</b> curves below like a blue half-moon.\",\"从悬崖上望去，整个海湾像一弯蓝色的半月在脚下展开。\"]],\"ranch\":[[\"The <b>ranch</b> covers three thousand acres and raises cattle and horses.\",\"这个牧场占地三千英亩，养牛也养马。\"],[\"He grew up on a <b>ranch</b> in Texas and learned to ride before he could read.\",\"他在得克萨斯的一个牧场长大，还没学会读书就先学会了骑马。\"]],\"alien\":[[\"The film's <b>alien</b> is not a monster but a lost traveler trying to get home.\",\"这部电影里的外星人不是怪物，而是一个迷路想回家的旅行者。\"],[\"Scientists searching for <b>alien</b> life focus on planets with liquid water.\",\"寻找外星生命的科学家重点关注有液态水的行星。\"]],\"edge\":[[\"She stood at the <b>edge</b> of the cliff and looked down at the sea.\",\"她站在悬崖边缘，低头看着大海。\"],[\"Be careful: the <b>edge</b> of this knife is extremely sharp.\",\"小心：这把刀的刃口非常锋利。\"]],\"colleague\":[[\"Her <b>colleague</b> in the chemistry department lent her the equipment she needed.\",\"化学系的一位同事把她需要的设备借给了她。\"],[\"He discussed the problem with <b>colleagues</b> before raising it at the meeting.\",\"开会提出这个问题之前，他先和同事们讨论过。\"]],\"arrogant\":[[\"His <b>arrogant</b> reply — that questions from juniors wasted his time — angered the whole team.\",\"他傲慢的回答——说新人的问题浪费他的时间——激怒了整个团队。\"],[\"She is confident, but never <b>arrogant</b>; she listens carefully to criticism.\",\"她很自信，但从不傲慢；她认真听取批评。\"]],\"condense\":[[\"Steam <b>condenses</b> into water droplets on the cold window glass.\",\"蒸汽在冰冷的窗玻璃上凝结成水珠。\"],[\"She <b>condensed</b> her thirty-page report into a two-page summary.\",\"她把三十页的报告浓缩成两页摘要。\"]],\"pudding\":[[\"For dessert, they served a warm bread <b>pudding</b> with cream.\",\"甜点上的是温热的面包布丁配奶油。\"],[\"She stirred the <b>pudding</b> constantly so it would not stick to the pan.\",\"她不停地搅拌布丁，以免粘锅。\"]],\"elasticity\":[[\"The <b>elasticity</b> of rubber lets the band stretch and then return to its shape.\",\"橡胶的弹性让橡皮筋能拉伸后再恢复原状。\"],[\"Economists measure the <b>elasticity</b> of demand to predict how buyers react to price changes.\",\"经济学家衡量需求的弹性，预测买家对价格变化的反应。\"]],\"comprise\":[[\"The committee <b>comprises</b> five professors and two student representatives.\",\"委员会由五位教授和两名学生代表组成（包含）。\"],[\"Women <b>comprise</b> nearly half of the medical school's students.\",\"女生占医学院学生总数的近一半。\"]],\"boar\":[[\"A wild <b>boar</b> can charge without warning if it feels cornered.\",\"野猪感到被逼入绝境时，会毫无征兆地冲撞。\"],[\"The hunters followed the <b>boar's</b> tracks through the muddy forest floor.\",\"猎人循着野猪在泥泞林地上的足迹追踪。\"]],\"adhere\":[[\"The glue needs a clean, dry surface to <b>adhere</b> properly.\",\"这种胶水需要干净干燥的表面才能黏附牢固。\"],[\"Posters <b>adhered</b> to the wall stayed up all winter despite the damp.\",\"贴在墙上的海报尽管受潮，整个冬天都没掉下来。\"]],\"colonist\":[[\"The first <b>colonists</b> arrived with seeds, tools, and enough food for one winter.\",\"第一批殖民者带着种子、工具和够吃一个冬天的食物抵达。\"],[\"Many <b>colonists</b> died during the first winter from cold and hunger.\",\"许多殖民者在第一个冬天死于寒冷和饥饿。\"]],\"artistic\":[[\"The poster is <b>artistic</b> in a quiet way: three colors, one line, and a great deal of empty space.\",\"这张海报有一种安静的艺术感：三种颜色、一条线、大片留白。\"],[\"His parents worried that an <b>artistic</b> career would never pay the rent.\",\"他的父母担心，艺术这条路恐怕永远付不起房租。\"]],\"advisor\":[[\"Her thesis <b>advisor</b> read every draft and returned it with pages of comments.\",\"她的论文导师读了每一稿，都附上好几页批注返还。\"],[\"The president's economic <b>advisor</b> warned against raising interest rates too quickly.\",\"总统的经济顾问警告不要过快加息。\"]],\"attorney\":[[\"The <b>attorney</b> advised her client not to answer questions without a lawyer present.\",\"这位律师建议她的当事人，在没有律师在场时不要回答问题。\"],[\"As district <b>attorney</b>, she decides which cases will go to trial.\",\"作为地区检察官，她决定哪些案件将进入审判。\"]],\"agitate\":[[\"The washing machine <b>agitates</b> the clothes in soapy water to loosen the dirt.\",\"洗衣机在肥皂水中搅动衣物，把污垢搅松。\"],[\"Workers <b>agitated</b> for shorter hours and safer conditions in the mines.\",\"工人们鼓动要求缩短工时、改善矿井安全条件。\"]],\"cup\":[[\"He poured her a <b>cup</b> of tea and set it down without a word.\",\"他给她倒了一杯茶，一声不响地放下。\"],[\"The recipe calls for two <b>cups</b> of flour and one of sugar.\",\"这份食谱需要两杯面粉和一杯糖。\"]],\"pore\":[[\"Sweat leaves the body through tiny <b>pores</b> in the skin.\",\"汗液通过皮肤上细小的毛孔排出体外。\"],[\"The cream is said to make the <b>pores</b> on the nose look smaller.\",\"据说这款面霜能让鼻子上的毛孔看起来更小。\"]],\"waist\":[[\"The water came up to his <b>waist</b> as he crossed the flooded street.\",\"他趟过被淹的街道时，水已经没到了腰。\"],[\"She tied the apron strings around her <b>waist</b> and began kneading the dough.\",\"她把围裙带子系在腰间，开始揉面。\"]],\"cuckoo\":[[\"The <b>cuckoo</b> lays its eggs in other birds' nests and lets them raise its young.\",\"布谷鸟把蛋下在其他鸟的巢里，让它们替自己养育幼鸟。\"],[\"We heard a <b>cuckoo</b> calling from the woods every morning in May.\",\"五月的每个清晨，我们都能听见树林里传来布谷鸟的叫声。\"]],\"application\":[[\"Her <b>application</b> to the graduate program included two letters from former teachers.\",\"她申请研究生项目的材料里包括两位前任老师的推荐信。\"],[\"The job <b>application</b> must be submitted online before the end of the month.\",\"求职申请必须在本月底前在线提交。\"]],\"apartment\":[[\"They rent a small <b>apartment</b> two streets from the university.\",\"他们在离大学两条街的地方租了一套小公寓。\"],[\"The <b>apartment</b> building has no elevator, and her rooms are on the fifth floor.\",\"这栋公寓楼没有电梯，她的房间在五楼。\"]],\"color\":[[\"The <b>color</b> of the leaves changes from green to red as the nights grow cold.\",\"随着夜晚变冷，叶子的色彩从绿色变成红色。\"],[\"She chose a deep blue <b>color</b> for the kitchen walls.\",\"她为厨房墙壁选了一种深蓝色。\"]],\"diction\":[[\"The actor's clear <b>diction</b> made every word audible in the back row.\",\"这位演员吐字清晰，后排也能听清每个词。\"],[\"Her <b>diction</b> — simple words, short sentences — suits the serious subject.\",\"她的措辞——简单的词、短句——很配这个严肃的主题。\"]],\"area\":[[\"The <b>area</b> around the lake is protected, so no new houses can be built there.\",\"湖边的这片区域受到保护，不能再建新房。\"],[\"His research <b>area</b> is the history of medicine in the nineteenth century.\",\"他的研究领域是十九世纪医学史。\"]],\"supplier\":[[\"The restaurant changed its fish <b>supplier</b> after two deliveries arrived late.\",\"两次送货迟到后，餐厅更换了鱼类供应商。\"],[\"Our main <b>supplier</b> of paper raised its prices, so we are looking for alternatives.\",\"我们的主要纸张供应商涨价了，我们正在寻找替代者。\"]],\"program\":[[\"He wrote a small <b>program</b> that renames thousands of files in seconds.\",\"他写了一个小程序，能在几秒内重命名数千个文件。\"],[\"The <b>program</b> crashed whenever two users opened the same document.\",\"只要两个用户打开同一份文档，这个程序就会崩溃。\"]],\"simile\":[[\"“As brave as a lion” is a <b>simile</b> because it compares courage to a lion using “as”.\",\"“像狮子一样勇敢”是一个明喻，因为它用 “as” 把勇气比作狮子。\"],[\"The poem is full of <b>similes</b>: eyes like stars, hands like ice.\",\"这首诗里满是明喻：眼睛像星星，手像冰。\"]],\"riddle\":[[\"The <b>riddle</b> asks what has keys but cannot open a single lock — the answer is a piano.\",\"这个谜语问：什么有键却开不了一把锁——答案是钢琴。\"],[\"He could not solve the last <b>riddle</b> in the puzzle book, so he peeked at the answer.\",\"他解不开谜题书里最后一个谜语，只好偷看答案。\"]],\"equivalent\":[[\"One tablespoon is roughly the <b>equivalent</b> of three teaspoons.\",\"一汤匙大约相当于三茶匙。\"],[\"There is no exact English <b>equivalent</b> for this word; translators usually add a note.\",\"这个词在英语里没有完全对应的等价说法，译者通常加注释说明。\"]],\"secondary\":[[\"In Britain, children usually start <b>secondary</b> school at the age of eleven.\",\"在英国，孩子通常十一岁开始上中学（中等学校）。\"],[\"Cost is important, but it is <b>secondary</b> to safety in the design of the bridge.\",\"在大桥设计中，成本固然重要，但居于安全之后（是次要的）。\"]],\"assurance\":[[\"The doctor gave her <b>assurance</b> that the operation was routine and low-risk.\",\"医生向她保证，这次手术是常规手术，风险很低。\"],[\"Despite repeated <b>assurances</b> from the company, customers remained worried about their data.\",\"尽管公司一再保证，顾客仍担心自己的数据安全。\"]],\"cilantro\":[[\"She chops fresh <b>cilantro</b> over the soup just before serving it.\",\"上汤之前，她在汤上撒上切碎的新鲜香菜。\"],[\"To some people, <b>cilantro</b> tastes like soap because of a genetic difference.\",\"对一些人来说，香菜尝起来像肥皂，这是基因差异造成的。\"]],\"embargo\":[[\"The council imposed an arms <b>embargo</b> on the country after the coup.\",\"政变后，理事会对该国实施武器禁运。\"],[\"Under the trade <b>embargo</b>, no oil could be sold to the regime.\",\"在贸易禁运之下，不得向该政权出售石油。\"]],\"table\":[[\"Please set the <b>table</b> for six; two more guests are coming.\",\"请摆好六个人的桌子；还有两位客人要来。\"],[\"The heavy oak <b>table</b> has stood in the kitchen for three generations.\",\"这张沉重的橡木桌子已经在厨房里放了三代人。\"]],\"customs\":[[\"At <b>customs</b>, officers asked whether she was carrying any fresh food.\",\"过海关时，工作人员问她有没有携带新鲜食物。\"],[\"The crate was held at <b>customs</b> for two days while its papers were checked.\",\"这个板条箱在海关被扣了两天，等待查验文件。\"]],\"contrast\":[[\"There is a sharp <b>contrast</b> between the old town's narrow streets and the new district's wide avenues.\",\"老城狭窄的街道与新区宽阔的大道形成鲜明对比。\"],[\"In <b>contrast</b> to her brother, who loves crowds, she prefers quiet evenings at home.\",\"与喜欢热闹的哥哥形成对比，她更喜欢安静地待在家里。\"]],\"crab\":[[\"The <b>crab</b> scuttled sideways into a crack between the rocks when we approached.\",\"我们走近时，螃蟹横着钻进了岩石缝里。\"],[\"At low tide, children catch small <b>crabs</b> in the rock pools along the shore.\",\"退潮时，孩子们在岸边的岩石水洼里抓小螃蟹。\"]],\"bow\":[[\"The students <b>bowed</b> to their teacher at the end of the ceremony.\",\"典礼结束时，学生们向老师鞠躬。\"],[\"The actor took a deep <b>bow</b> as the audience rose to applaud.\",\"观众起立鼓掌时，演员深深鞠了一躬。\"]],\"cafe\":[[\"They met at a small <b>cafe</b> near the station and talked for two hours.\",\"他们在车站附近一家小咖啡馆见面，聊了两个小时。\"],[\"The <b>cafe</b> serves coffee and sandwiches but no hot meals.\",\"这家咖啡馆供应咖啡和三明治，但不供应热餐。\"]],\"stamp\":[[\"She licked the <b>stamp</b> and pressed it onto the corner of the envelope.\",\"她舔了一下邮票，把它贴在信封角上。\"],[\"His collection includes a <b>stamp</b> from 1840, the first year stamps were ever issued.\",\"他的收藏里有一枚 1840 年的邮票，那是邮票发行的第一年。\"]],\"equality\":[[\"The constitution promises <b>equality</b> before the law for every citizen.\",\"宪法承诺每位公民在法律面前平等。\"],[\"She campaigned for pay <b>equality</b> between men and women doing the same work.\",\"她为同工同酬的男女平等而奔走呼吁。\"]],\"inflation\":[[\"When <b>inflation</b> is high, the money in a savings account slowly loses value.\",\"通货膨胀高时，储蓄账户里的钱会慢慢贬值。\"],[\"The central bank raised interest rates to bring <b>inflation</b> under control.\",\"中央银行加息以控制通货膨胀。\"]],\"solvent\":[[\"Turpentine is used as a <b>solvent</b> to thin oil paint.\",\"松节油被用作溶剂来稀释油画颜料。\"],[\"The <b>solvent</b> dissolved the glue, and the two pieces came apart easily.\",\"溶剂把胶水溶解了，两块部件轻松分开。\"]],\"anonymous\":[[\"The donation was <b>anonymous</b> — even the charity's director does not know who sent it.\",\"这笔捐款是匿名的——连慈善机构的负责人都不知道是谁捐的。\"],[\"An <b>anonymous</b> letter warned the editor that the story contained errors.\",\"一封匿名信提醒编辑，这篇报道有错误。\"]],\"alive\":[[\"The old dog is still <b>alive</b>, though it sleeps most of the day.\",\"这条老狗还活着，尽管它一天中的大部分时间都在睡觉。\"],[\"Rescuers found the climber <b>alive</b> after three nights on the mountain.\",\"救援人员在山上搜寻三夜后，发现登山者还活着。\"]],\"nonfiction\":[[\"She prefers <b>nonfiction</b>: history and science books fill her shelves.\",\"她偏爱非虚构作品：书架上全是历史和科学书籍。\"],[\"The <b>nonfiction</b> account of the expedition is more exciting than most novels.\",\"这部关于探险的非虚构记述比大多数小说还精彩。\"]],\"master\":[[\"After her bachelor's degree, she stayed for a <b>master's</b> in public health.\",\"拿到学士学位后，她继续攻读公共卫生硕士。\"],[\"A <b>master's</b> program in engineering here takes two years of full-time study.\",\"这里的工程硕士项目需要两年全日制学习。\"]],\"concession\":[[\"The union won a wage <b>concession</b> after threatening to strike.\",\"工会以罢工相威胁，赢得了工资上的让步。\"],[\"Making that <b>concession</b> cost the negotiator support from his own side.\",\"做出那个让步，让这位谈判代表失去了自己一方支持。\"]],\"guest\":[[\"The hotel asks each <b>guest</b> to show identification at check-in.\",\"酒店要求每位客人在登记时出示身份证明。\"],[\"We are expecting <b>guests</b> for dinner, so set two extra places.\",\"今晚有客人来吃饭，多摆两副餐具。\"]],\"calf\":[[\"The <b>calf</b> stood up within an hour of birth and walked to its mother.\",\"小牛出生后一小时内就站了起来，走向母亲。\"],[\"In spring, each cow on the ranch gives birth to a single <b>calf</b>.\",\"春天，牧场上每头母牛都会产下一头小牛。\"]],\"sailor\":[[\"The young <b>sailor</b> was seasick for the first three days of the voyage.\",\"这位年轻水手在航程的前三天一直晕船。\"],[\"After twenty years as a <b>sailor</b>, he settled in the port town where his ship was based.\",\"做了二十年水手后，他定居在他的船停靠的港口小镇。\"]],\"symbiosis\":[[\"The clownfish and the sea anemone live in <b>symbiosis</b>: each protects the other.\",\"小丑鱼和海葵共生：彼此保护对方。\"],[\"<b>Symbiosis</b> between fungi and tree roots helps both partners absorb nutrients.\",\"真菌与树根之间的共生帮助双方吸收养分。\"]],\"angle\":[[\"The two streets meet at an <b>angle</b> of about forty-five degrees.\",\"两条街以大约四十五度的角度相交。\"],[\"Measure the <b>angle</b> between the two lines with a protractor.\",\"用量角器测量这两条线之间的角度。\"]],\"arch\":[[\"The cat <b>arched</b> its back and hissed when the dog came too close.\",\"狗靠得太近时，猫拱起了背，发出嘶嘶声。\"],[\"Stone bridges <b>arch</b> over the canal at three points in the old town.\",\"老城有三处石桥拱跨运河之上。\"]],\"distortion\":[[\"The loudspeaker's <b>distortion</b> made the speaker's voice hard to understand.\",\"扬声器的失真（扭曲）让讲话者的声音难以听清。\"],[\"His account of the meeting was a <b>distortion</b> — it left out every decision he had opposed.\",\"他对会议的描述是一种扭曲——他反对过的决定全都被略去了。\"]],\"consultant\":[[\"The city hired a <b>consultant</b> to redesign its bus network.\",\"市政府聘请了一位顾问重新设计公交网络。\"],[\"As a management <b>consultant</b>, he advises three companies at the same time.\",\"作为管理顾问，他同时为三家公司提供咨询。\"]],\"instructor\":[[\"The driving <b>instructor</b> stayed calm even when the student stalled the car three times.\",\"即使学员把车熄火了三次，驾校教练也保持镇定。\"],[\"Our yoga <b>instructor</b> asks everyone to arrive ten minutes early.\",\"我们的瑜伽教练要求大家提前十分钟到。\"]],\"epic\":[[\"The <b>epic</b> tells of a hero's ten-year journey home from war.\",\"这部史诗讲述一位英雄战后十年归乡的旅程。\"],[\"Homer's <b>epics</b> were sung aloud for centuries before they were written down.\",\"荷马的史诗在被写下来之前，已经口头传唱了几个世纪。\"]],\"detective\":[[\"The <b>detective</b> noticed that the window had been opened from the inside.\",\"侦探注意到，窗户是从里面打开的。\"],[\"In the novel, a retired <b>detective</b> solves one last case in his hometown.\",\"小说里，一位退休侦探在家乡破了最后一个案子。\"]],\"dragonfly\":[[\"A <b>dragonfly</b> can fly backward, hover, and change direction in an instant.\",\"蜻蜓能倒飞、悬停，还能瞬间改变方向。\"],[\"<b>Dragonflies</b> lay their eggs in the still water at the pond's edge.\",\"蜻蜓把卵产在池塘边静止的水里。\"]],\"exactness\":[[\"The clockmaker worked with an <b>exactness</b> that left no room for a misplaced gear.\",\"这位钟表匠工作精确，不容许任何一个齿轮放错位置。\"],[\"Science depends on the <b>exactness</b> of its measurements.\",\"科学依赖于测量的精确。\"]],\"extremum\":[[\"To find the <b>extremum</b> of the function, set its derivative equal to zero.\",\"要求这个函数的极值，先令它的导数等于零。\"],[\"The graph reaches an <b>extremum</b> at the top of the curve, then falls steadily.\",\"图像在曲线顶点达到极值，然后稳步下降。\"]],\"eclipse\":[[\"During a total solar <b>eclipse</b>, the sky darkens in the middle of the day.\",\"日全食期间，白昼的天空会变暗。\"],[\"Ancient astronomers recorded <b>eclipses</b> on clay tablets more than two thousand years ago.\",\"两千多年前，古代天文学家就把日食月食记录在泥板上。\"]],\"inquire\":[[\"She called the office to <b>inquire</b> about the price of the course.\",\"她打电话到办公室询问这门课的价格。\"],[\"The committee will <b>inquire</b> into how the accident happened that night.\",\"委员会将调查那晚事故是如何发生的。\"]],\"chest\":[[\"He felt a tight pain in his <b>chest</b> and sat down to rest.\",\"他感到胸部一阵紧痛，坐下来休息。\"],[\"The X-ray showed a shadow on the left side of her <b>chest</b>.\",\"X 光片显示她胸部左侧有阴影。\"]],\"lift\":[[\"Two workers could not <b>lift</b> the piano, so they called for two more.\",\"两个工人抬不动钢琴，只好又叫来两个人。\"],[\"He <b>lifted</b> the child onto the wall so she could see the parade.\",\"他把孩子举到墙上，让她能看到游行队伍。\"]],\"authenticity\":[[\"Experts tested the painting's <b>authenticity</b> by analyzing its pigments.\",\"专家通过分析颜料来检验这幅画的真实性。\"],[\"The letter's <b>authenticity</b> was doubted until the handwriting was matched.\",\"这封信的真实性一直受到质疑，直到笔迹比对吻合。\"]],\"chromosome\":[[\"Humans have twenty-three pairs of <b>chromosomes</b> in almost every cell.\",\"人类几乎每个细胞里都有二十三对染色体。\"],[\"A missing piece of one <b>chromosome</b> can cause serious developmental problems.\",\"一条染色体缺失一小段，就可能导致严重的发育问题。\"]],\"explosive\":[[\"Workers stored the <b>explosive</b> in a locked concrete building far from the camp.\",\"工人把炸药存放在远离营地的上锁混凝土建筑里。\"],[\"Dynamite is an <b>explosive</b> powerful enough to break solid rock.\",\"硝甘炸药是一种足以炸开坚硬岩石的炸药。\"]],\"shirt\":[[\"He changed his <b>shirt</b> after spilling coffee down the front.\",\"咖啡洒在前襟后，他换了一件衬衫。\"],[\"For the interview, wear a clean <b>shirt</b> and pressed trousers.\",\"面试时穿一件干净的衬衫和熨平的裤子。\"]],\"chocolate\":[[\"Hot <b>chocolate</b> with a little cinnamon is her favorite winter drink.\",\"加一点肉桂的热巧克力是她最喜欢的冬日饮品。\"],[\"The cake contains dark <b>chocolate</b> and almost no sugar.\",\"这款蛋糕用了黑巧克力，几乎不加糖。\"]],\"devote\":[[\"She <b>devotes</b> every Saturday morning to teaching children in the village to read.\",\"她把每个周六上午都用于教村里的孩子读书。\"],[\"After retiring, he <b>devoted</b> himself to restoring old sailing boats.\",\"退休后，他致力于修复老式帆船。\"]],\"elicitation\":[[\"The interview was designed for the <b>elicitation</b> of memories that questionnaires miss.\",\"这次访谈旨在引出问卷捕捉不到的记忆。\"],[\"Linguists use picture tasks for the <b>elicitation</b> of words in endangered languages.\",\"语言学家用图片任务来引出濒危语言中的词汇。\"]],\"stimulus\":[[\"Plants bend toward light because light acts as a <b>stimulus</b> for their growth.\",\"植物向光弯曲，因为光对它们的生长起刺激作用。\"],[\"In the experiment, a flash of light served as the <b>stimulus</b>, and reaction time was measured.\",\"实验中以一道闪光作为刺激，并测量反应时间。\"]],\"interview\":[[\"The <b>interview</b> lasted forty minutes, and most of it was about her research experience.\",\"面试持续了四十分钟，大部分在谈她的研究经历。\"],[\"In the radio <b>interview</b>, the author explained why she writes under another name.\",\"在广播访谈中，这位作者解释了她为什么用笔名写作。\"]],\"visible\":[[\"On a clear night, the Milky Way is <b>visible</b> without a telescope.\",\"晴朗的夜晚，不用望远镜也能看得见银河。\"],[\"The damage to the bridge was barely <b>visible</b> until engineers inspected it closely.\",\"桥的损伤几乎看不出来，直到工程师仔细检查才发现。\"]],\"airport\":[[\"The <b>airport</b> closed for six hours while snow crews cleared the runways.\",\"机场关闭了六个小时，铲雪队清理跑道。\"],[\"She took the first train to the <b>airport</b> to catch the early flight to Chicago.\",\"她坐第一班火车去机场，赶飞往芝加哥的早班飞机。\"]],\"barbecue\":[[\"They held a <b>barbecue</b> in the backyard for twenty friends.\",\"他们在后院办了一场烧烤，招待二十位朋友。\"],[\"The smell of <b>barbecue</b> drifted across the park all afternoon.\",\"整个下午，烧烤的香味飘满了公园。\"]],\"attain\":[[\"Few runners ever <b>attain</b> the speed needed to qualify for the national team.\",\"很少有跑者能达到入选国家队所需的速度。\"],[\"By saving a little every month, she <b>attained</b> her goal of buying a small house.\",\"靠每月存一点钱，她达到了买一栋小房子的目标。\"]],\"bedroom\":[[\"Their apartment has two <b>bedrooms</b>, a kitchen, and a small balcony.\",\"他们的公寓有两间卧室、一间厨房和一个小阳台。\"],[\"He painted his <b>bedroom</b> walls a pale green to make the room feel calmer.\",\"他把卧室墙壁刷成淡绿色，让房间显得更宁静。\"]],\"drift\":[[\"The boat began to <b>drift</b> toward the rocks after its engine failed.\",\"发动机熄火后，船开始向礁石漂移。\"],[\"Over thousands of years, the river's course <b>drifted</b> slowly eastward.\",\"数千年间，河道慢慢向东漂移。\"]],\"atrocious\":[[\"The report describes <b>atrocious</b> conditions in the prison: no heat, little food, and no medical care.\",\"报告描述了监狱里极为恶劣的条件：没有暖气、食物很少、没有医疗。\"],[\"His treatment of the horses was <b>atrocious</b>, and neighbors finally reported him to the police.\",\"他残暴地对待马匹，邻居们最终报了警。\"]],\"ego\":[[\"Winning the prize so young inflated his <b>ego</b>, and he stopped listening to advice.\",\"年纪轻轻就获奖让他的自我膨胀起来，不再听取建议。\"],[\"In Freud's model, the <b>ego</b> balances the demands of instinct and conscience.\",\"在弗洛伊德的模型里，自我在本能与良知的需求之间求平衡。\"]],\"tap\":[[\"She turned on the <b>tap</b> and filled the kettle for tea.\",\"她拧开水龙头，往水壶里灌水泡茶。\"],[\"The kitchen <b>tap</b> has been dripping all week; the washer needs replacing.\",\"厨房水龙头滴了一周水了，垫圈需要更换。\"]],\"salary\":[[\"Her <b>salary</b> is paid on the last working day of each month.\",\"她的薪水在每个月最后一个工作日发放。\"],[\"He accepted a lower <b>salary</b> in exchange for shorter hours.\",\"他接受了较低的薪水，换取更短的工作时间。\"]],\"antique\":[[\"The shop sells <b>antique</b> furniture, some of it more than two hundred years old.\",\"这家店卖古董家具，有些已有两百多年历史。\"],[\"She inherited an <b>antique</b> clock that still keeps perfect time.\",\"她继承了一座古董钟，走时依然分毫不差。\"]],\"bed\":[[\"The hikers <b>bedded</b> down in the barn when the storm made the tents unsafe.\",\"暴风雨让帐篷不安全时，徒步者们在谷仓里安置睡觉。\"],[\"The small hotel can <b>bed</b> forty guests in rooms of two and four.\",\"这家小旅馆有两人间和四人间，可安置四十位客人住宿。\"]],\"chicken\":[[\"They keep twelve <b>chickens</b> behind the house for eggs.\",\"他们在屋后养了十二只鸡下蛋。\"],[\"Roast <b>chicken</b> with lemon and herbs is her favorite Sunday dish.\",\"柠檬香草烤鸡是她最喜欢的周日菜。\"]],\"wrestling\":[[\"<b>Wrestling</b> was one of the original sports of the ancient Olympic Games.\",\"摔跤是古代奥运会最初的项目之一。\"],[\"He took up <b>wrestling</b> at school because he was small but quick.\",\"他个子小但动作快，所以在学校练起了摔跤。\"]],\"curator\":[[\"The museum's <b>curator</b> chose ninety photographs for the exhibition.\",\"博物馆馆长为这次展览挑选了九十幅照片。\"],[\"She became <b>curator</b> of the Egyptian collection after twenty years as a researcher.\",\"做了二十年研究员后，她成为埃及藏品部的馆长。\"]],\"tectonic\":[[\"<b>Tectonic</b> plates move only a few centimeters a year, but over millions of years they rebuild continents.\",\"构造板块每年只移动几厘米，但在数百万年里重塑大陆。\"],[\"Earthquakes along this coast are caused by <b>tectonic</b> activity under the ocean floor.\",\"这片海岸的地震由海底之下的构造活动引起。\"]],\"hiking\":[[\"They went <b>hiking</b> in the national park and covered twenty kilometers in one day.\",\"他们去国家公园徒步，一天走了二十公里。\"],[\"Good boots are the most important equipment for <b>hiking</b> in wet mountains.\",\"在潮湿的山地徒步，一双好鞋是最重要的装备。\"]],\"conquest\":[[\"The Norman <b>conquest</b> of England in 1066 changed the English language forever.\",\"1066 年诺曼人征服英格兰，永久改变了英语。\"],[\"After the <b>conquest</b>, the victors built castles to control the countryside.\",\"征服之后，胜利者修建城堡来控制乡村。\"]],\"seafood\":[[\"The coastal town is famous for its <b>seafood</b>, especially oysters and grilled fish.\",\"这座海滨小镇以海鲜闻名，尤其是牡蛎和烤鱼。\"],[\"She avoids <b>seafood</b> because even a small amount of shrimp makes her ill.\",\"她不吃海鲜，因为哪怕一点点虾都会让她不舒服。\"]],\"automobile\":[[\"The first <b>automobiles</b> were slower than a horse-drawn carriage.\",\"最早的汽车比马车还慢。\"],[\"By 1930, the <b>automobile</b> had already changed how American cities were built.\",\"到 1930 年，汽车已经改变了美国城市的建造方式。\"]],\"union\":[[\"The <b>union</b> negotiated a shorter working week for factory staff.\",\"工会为工厂员工谈下了更短的工作周。\"],[\"Teachers voted to join the <b>union</b> after their pay was frozen for three years.\",\"工资冻结三年后，教师们投票加入工会。\"]],\"fatigue\":[[\"After three night shifts in a row, her <b>fatigue</b> made it hard to concentrate.\",\"连续三个夜班后，疲劳让她难以集中注意力。\"],[\"Metal <b>fatigue</b> caused a crack in the wing that inspectors had missed.\",\"金属疲劳导致机翼出现一道检查人员没发现的裂纹。\"]],\"method\":[[\"Her <b>method</b> for learning names is to repeat each one aloud three times.\",\"她记名字的方法是把每个名字大声重复三遍。\"],[\"The two teams used different <b>methods</b> but reached the same result.\",\"两个团队用了不同的方法，却得到了相同的结果。\"]],\"coat\":[[\"She put on a heavy <b>coat</b> before stepping into the snow.\",\"走进雪地之前，她穿上了一件厚外套。\"],[\"His <b>coat</b> was still wet from the morning rain.\",\"他的外套还带着清晨雨水的潮气。\"]],\"wind\":[[\"A cold <b>wind</b> blew in from the sea all afternoon.\",\"整个下午，海上吹来一阵阵冷风。\"],[\"The strong <b>wind</b> knocked down several old trees in the park.\",\"强风刮倒了公园里几棵老树。\"]],\"exercise\":[[\"The textbook's first <b>exercise</b> asks students to rewrite the sentences in the past tense.\",\"课本的第一道练习要求学生把句子改写成过去时。\"],[\"Regular <b>exercise</b> — even a daily half-hour walk — lowers the risk of heart disease.\",\"规律的锻炼——哪怕每天散步半小时——也能降低心脏病风险。\"]],\"overlap\":[[\"The two courses <b>overlap</b> in content: both cover the first half of the textbook.\",\"这两门课内容部分重叠：都讲课本的前半部分。\"],[\"Their working hours <b>overlap</b> by only one hour, so handovers are rushed.\",\"他们的工作时间只重叠一小时，所以交接很匆忙。\"]],\"grape\":[[\"A bunch of <b>grapes</b> hung over the garden wall, already turning purple.\",\"一串葡萄垂在花园墙上，已经开始变紫。\"],[\"The region is famous for the <b>grapes</b> it grows for wine.\",\"该地区以酿酒葡萄闻名。\"]],\"hacker\":[[\"A <b>hacker</b> broke into the hospital's system and locked its patient records.\",\"一名黑客侵入医院系统，锁住了病人记录。\"],[\"The company hires former <b>hackers</b> to test the strength of its own defenses.\",\"这家公司聘请前黑客来测试自家防御的强度。\"]],\"arctic\":[[\"The <b>Arctic</b> Ocean is covered by sea ice for most of the year.\",\"北冰洋一年中的大部分时间都被海冰覆盖。\"],[\"Polar bears depend on <b>Arctic</b> sea ice to hunt seals.\",\"北极熊依赖北极海冰捕猎海豹。\"]],\"diffraction\":[[\"<b>Diffraction</b> spreads light into a rainbow when it passes through a narrow slit.\",\"光穿过狭缝时发生衍射，散成彩虹般的光谱。\"],[\"Using X-ray <b>diffraction</b>, scientists worked out the structure of DNA.\",\"科学家利用 X 射线衍射弄清了 DNA 的结构。\"]],\"boorish\":[[\"His <b>boorish</b> behavior at dinner — shouting at the waiter and talking with his mouth full — embarrassed everyone.\",\"他在晚宴上粗野的行为——对服务员大喊大叫、满嘴食物还说话——让所有人难堪。\"],[\"She apologized for her brother's <b>boorish</b> manners and led him outside.\",\"她为弟弟粗野的举止道歉，把他带到了外面。\"]],\"instrument\":[[\"The violin is the smallest <b>instrument</b> in the string family but plays the highest notes.\",\"小提琴是弦乐家族中最小的乐器，却演奏最高的音。\"],[\"Each student must learn one <b>instrument</b> — piano, flute, or guitar — for two years.\",\"每名学生必须学一门乐器——钢琴、长笛或吉他——学两年。\"]],\"collaborate\":[[\"The two universities <b>collaborated</b> on a study of air pollution in port cities.\",\"两所大学协作开展了一项港口城市空气污染研究。\"],[\"Artists and engineers <b>collaborate</b> closely on the design of the new theater.\",\"艺术家与工程师在新剧院的设计上紧密协作。\"]],\"automation\":[[\"<b>Automation</b> of the warehouse cut packing time from hours to minutes.\",\"仓库自动化把打包时间从几小时缩短到几分钟。\"],[\"Factory <b>automation</b> raised output but reduced the number of manual jobs.\",\"工厂自动化提高了产量，但减少了体力岗位。\"]],\"enamel\":[[\"The bathtub's white <b>enamel</b> was chipped where the tap had dripped for years.\",\"浴缸的白色搪瓷在水龙头常年滴漏处磕掉了一块。\"],[\"Tooth <b>enamel</b> is the hardest substance in the human body, yet acid can dissolve it.\",\"牙釉质（搪瓷质）是人体最硬的物质，但酸仍能溶解它。\"]],\"invoke\":[[\"The lawyer <b>invoked</b> a law from 1935 that few people still remembered.\",\"律师援引了一部 1935 年的法律，几乎没人还记得它。\"],[\"In his speech, he <b>invoked</b> the memory of those who had built the school.\",\"他在演讲中追忆了建校者，唤起大家对他们的怀念。\"]],\"facilitate\":[[\"The new bridge will <b>facilitate</b> trade between the island and the mainland.\",\"新桥将使岛屿与大陆之间的贸易更加便利。\"],[\"A shared calendar <b>facilitates</b> planning for teams in different time zones.\",\"共享日历使不同时区的团队做计划更加便利。\"]],\"conclude\":[[\"From the footprints, police <b>concluded</b> that two people had entered the house.\",\"警方从脚印推断，有两个人进过这栋房子。\"],[\"The report <b>concludes</b> that the drug is safe but only mildly effective.\",\"报告的结论是：这种药安全，但疗效有限。\"]],\"virtual\":[[\"The museum offers a <b>virtual</b> tour for visitors who cannot travel to the city.\",\"博物馆为无法到访的游客提供虚拟参观。\"],[\"Students attended a <b>virtual</b> lecture given by a professor on another continent.\",\"学生们听了一位另一大洲教授的虚拟讲座。\"]],\"jam\":[[\"She spread strawberry <b>jam</b> thickly on her toast.\",\"她在吐司上厚厚地抹了草莓果酱。\"],[\"Homemade <b>jam</b> keeps for a year if the jars are sealed while hot.\",\"如果趁热密封罐口，自制果酱能保存一年。\"]],\"receipt\":[[\"Keep the <b>receipt</b>; without it, the shop will not accept the return.\",\"保留好收据；没有它，商店不接受退货。\"],[\"The email serves as a <b>receipt</b> confirming that your payment was received.\",\"这封邮件就是收据，确认你的付款已收到。\"]],\"denote\":[[\"A red circle with a line through it <b>denotes</b> that something is forbidden.\",\"带斜杠的红圈表示禁止。\"],[\"In the table, an asterisk <b>denotes</b> a result that is statistically significant.\",\"在表格中，星号表示结果具有统计显著性。\"]],\"polymer\":[[\"Nylon is a synthetic <b>polymer</b> made of long chains of repeating units.\",\"尼龙是一种合成聚合物，由重复单元组成的长链构成。\"],[\"Natural <b>polymers</b> include rubber, silk, and the cellulose in wood.\",\"天然聚合物包括橡胶、蚕丝和木材中的纤维素。\"]],\"wire\":[[\"A loose <b>wire</b> in the lamp caused the light to flicker.\",\"台灯里一根松动的电线让灯光闪烁。\"],[\"The fence is made of <b>wire</b> stretched between wooden posts.\",\"栅栏由拉在木桩之间的铁丝（电线）做成。\"]],\"audible\":[[\"His voice was barely <b>audible</b> over the noise of the train.\",\"在火车的噪声中，他的声音几乎听不见。\"],[\"The warning beep is <b>audible</b> throughout the building when the test begins.\",\"测试开始时，警示蜂鸣声在整栋楼里都听得见。\"]],\"fold\":[[\"She <b>folded</b> the letter twice and slipped it into her pocket.\",\"她把信折了两次，放进口袋。\"],[\"<b>Fold</b> the egg whites gently into the batter so the cake stays light.\",\"把打发的蛋白轻轻拌入面糊，让蛋糕保持蓬松。\"]],\"programmer\":[[\"The <b>programmer</b> found the bug by reading the error log line by line.\",\"程序员逐行读错误日志，找到了漏洞。\"],[\"Good <b>programmers</b> write comments so that others can understand their code later.\",\"好的程序员会写注释，方便别人日后看懂代码。\"]],\"academy\":[[\"The military <b>academy</b> trains officers for four years before their first posting.\",\"这所军事学院在学员第一次任职前培训他们四年。\"],[\"She was elected to the national <b>academy</b> of sciences at the age of forty.\",\"她在四十岁时当选国家科学院院士（学院成员）。\"]],\"manager\":[[\"The store <b>manager</b> apologized for the mistake and replaced the broken item.\",\"商店经理为错误道歉，并更换了损坏的商品。\"],[\"As project <b>manager</b>, she is responsible for both the budget and the schedule.\",\"作为项目经理，她同时负责预算和进度。\"]],\"engagement\":[[\"They announced their <b>engagement</b> at a small dinner with both families.\",\"他们在一次双方家人参加的小型晚宴上宣布了订婚。\"],[\"Her <b>engagement</b> ring once belonged to her grandmother.\",\"她的订婚戒指曾是她祖母的。\"]],\"shrimp\":[[\"She is allergic to <b>shrimp</b> and reads every menu carefully.\",\"她对虾过敏，看菜单格外仔细。\"],[\"The fishermen sort the <b>shrimp</b> by size before selling them at the dock.\",\"渔民在码头出售前，按大小把虾分拣好。\"]],\"blessed\":[[\"They felt <b>blessed</b> to have healthy children and a house of their own.\",\"他们有健康的孩子和自己的房子，觉得很有福气。\"],[\"The valley is <b>blessed</b> with rich soil and a mild climate.\",\"这座山谷得天独厚，土壤肥沃、气候温和。\"]],\"ordinance\":[[\"A city <b>ordinance</b> bans loud music in the park after ten at night.\",\"一项城市条例禁止晚上十点后在公园里大声放音乐。\"],[\"Under the new <b>ordinance</b>, shops must close their shutters by midnight.\",\"根据新条例，商店必须在午夜前关门落闸。\"]],\"blackmail\":[[\"He threatened to publish the letters unless she paid — a clear case of <b>blackmail</b>.\",\"他威胁说不给钱就公开信件——这是明显的勒索。\"],[\"The official was arrested for trying to <b>blackmail</b> a local businessman.\",\"这名官员因试图勒索一名本地商人而被捕。\"]],\"percent\":[[\"Only twelve <b>percent</b> of the students chose the harder question.\",\"只有百分之十二的学生选了更难的那道题。\"],[\"Unemployment fell to five <b>percent</b>, the lowest rate in a decade.\",\"失业率降到了百分之五，是十年来的最低点。\"]],\"dialect\":[[\"The old man speaks a local <b>dialect</b> that visitors from the capital can barely understand.\",\"老人说一口当地方言，首都来的游客几乎听不懂。\"],[\"Some words in this <b>dialect</b> come from the language of sailors who settled here centuries ago.\",\"这种方言里的一些词，来自几个世纪前在此定居的水手的语言。\"]],\"dig\":[[\"They <b>dug</b> a hole two meters deep for the new tree.\",\"他们为新树挖了一个两米深的坑。\"],[\"Archaeologists <b>dig</b> slowly, recording the position of every object they find.\",\"考古学家挖掘得很慢，记录每一件出土文物的位置。\"]],\"artificial\":[[\"The lake is <b>artificial</b> — it was created by the dam built in 1958.\",\"这个湖是人工的——由 1958 年建成的水坝形成。\"],[\"<b>Artificial</b> sweeteners taste sweet but add almost no calories.\",\"人工甜味剂味道甜，但几乎不增加热量。\"]],\"vote\":[[\"Citizens will <b>vote</b> next Tuesday to choose a new mayor.\",\"市民们下周二将投票选出新市长。\"],[\"The committee took a <b>vote</b> and rejected the proposal by a single ballot.\",\"委员会进行了投票，以一票之差否决了提案。\"]],\"pig\":[[\"The farm keeps <b>pigs</b> in a large pen behind the barn.\",\"农场在谷仓后面的大围栏里养猪。\"],[\"A mother <b>pig</b> can give birth to more than ten piglets at once.\",\"一头母猪一次能产下十多头小猪。\"]],\"award\":[[\"The jury <b>awarded</b> first prize to a seventeen-year-old pianist.\",\"评委会把一等奖授予了一位十七岁的钢琴家。\"],[\"The court <b>awarded</b> her compensation for the injury she suffered at work.\",\"法院判给她一笔工伤赔偿金。\"]],\"couch\":[[\"They bought a secondhand <b>couch</b> for the small living room.\",\"他们为小客厅买了一张二手长沙发。\"],[\"He fell asleep on the <b>couch</b> with the book still open on his chest.\",\"他在长沙发上睡着了，书还摊开放在胸口。\"]],\"enormous\":[[\"An <b>enormous</b> wave knocked the fishing boat sideways.\",\"一个巨大的浪头把渔船打得横了过来。\"],[\"The project required an <b>enormous</b> amount of data entry before the analysis could begin.\",\"分析开始之前，这个项目需要录入巨大的数据量。\"]],\"conduct\":[[\"The university will <b>conduct</b> a survey of all first-year students in October.\",\"大学将于十月对全体一年级学生实施一项调查。\"],[\"Researchers <b>conducted</b> the experiment in a windowless room to control the light.\",\"研究人员在一间无窗的房间里实施实验，以控制光线。\"]],\"button\":[[\"The coat is missing a <b>button</b>, so she keeps a box of spare buttons for repairs.\",\"外套少了一颗纽扣，她备了一盒备用纽扣用来缝补。\"],[\"He pressed the red <b>button</b> and the machine stopped at once.\",\"他按下红色按钮，机器立刻停了下来。\"]],\"bond\":[[\"The city issued <b>bonds</b> to pay for the new subway line.\",\"市政府发行债券，为新地铁线路筹资。\"],[\"Government <b>bonds</b> are considered safe because the state promises to repay them.\",\"政府债券被认为安全，因为国家承诺偿还。\"]],\"cello\":[[\"She has played the <b>cello</b> since she was nine and performs with the city orchestra.\",\"她九岁开始拉大提琴，如今在市交响乐团演出。\"],[\"The <b>cello's</b> deep sound carries the melody in the second movement.\",\"大提琴低沉的声音在第二乐章中奏出主旋律。\"]],\"collapse\":[[\"The old bridge <b>collapsed</b> during the flood, cutting the village off from the town.\",\"洪水期间，老桥坍塌，村子与镇子的联系被切断。\"],[\"After running the marathon, he <b>collapsed</b> from exhaustion just past the finish line.\",\"跑完马拉松后，他刚过终点就因体力耗尽倒下了。\"]],\"accompaniment\":[[\"She sang the folk song with piano <b>accompaniment</b>.\",\"她在钢琴伴奏下唱了这首民歌。\"],[\"The violin solo needs a quiet <b>accompaniment</b> so it can stand out.\",\"小提琴独奏需要安静的伴奏来衬托。\"]],\"accounting\":[[\"She majored in <b>accounting</b> and now audits small businesses.\",\"她主修会计学，现在为小企业做审计。\"],[\"In <b>accounting</b>, every transaction must be recorded twice, once as a debit and once as a credit.\",\"在会计学中，每笔交易都要记录两次，一次借方，一次贷方。\"]],\"admiration\":[[\"She looked at the climbers with <b>admiration</b> as they reached the summit.\",\"登山者登顶时，她满怀钦佩地望着他们。\"],[\"His honesty earned him the <b>admiration</b> of the whole team.\",\"他的诚实赢得了全队的钦佩。\"]],\"adventure\":[[\"Their <b>adventure</b> began when the map led them to a hidden cave.\",\"地图把他们引向一个隐秘洞穴，他们的冒险就此开始。\"],[\"He wrote a book about his <b>adventures</b> sailing alone across the Atlantic.\",\"他写了一本书，讲述自己独自航行横渡大西洋的冒险经历。\"]],\"advocacy\":[[\"Her <b>advocacy</b> for clean water brought new wells to the region.\",\"她对清洁用水的倡导为该地区打了新井。\"],[\"The group's <b>advocacy</b> work focuses on protecting children's rights.\",\"这个团体的倡导工作聚焦于保护儿童权利。\"]],\"alarm\":[[\"The sudden drop in temperature <b>alarmed</b> the farmers.\",\"气温骤降使农民们惊恐不安。\"],[\"Residents were <b>alarmed</b> by smoke rising from the factory at night.\",\"夜里工厂冒出的浓烟让居民们惊恐。\"]],\"alphabet\":[[\"The English <b>alphabet</b> has 26 letters.\",\"英语字母表有 26 个字母。\"],[\"Children learn the <b>alphabet</b> before they begin to read words.\",\"孩子们先学字母表，然后才开始认单词。\"]],\"alteration\":[[\"The plan needs a small <b>alteration</b> before we submit it.\",\"这个计划在提交前需要一点小改动。\"],[\"She took the dress to a tailor for <b>alterations</b>.\",\"她把裙子拿到裁缝那里改尺寸。\"]],\"anniversary\":[[\"The museum is celebrating the 100th <b>anniversary</b> of its founding.\",\"这家博物馆正在庆祝建馆 100 周年纪念。\"],[\"They return to the same small restaurant every year on their wedding <b>anniversary</b>.\",\"每年结婚纪念日，他们都回到同一家小餐馆。\"]],\"attention\":[[\"The teacher asked the class to pay <b>attention</b> to the diagram.\",\"老师让全班注意看图示。\"],[\"The bright sign is designed to attract the <b>attention</b> of drivers.\",\"这个醒目的标志是用来吸引司机注意力的。\"]],\"ban\":[[\"The city has <b>banned</b> plastic bags in all supermarkets.\",\"该市已禁止所有超市使用塑料袋。\"],[\"A <b>ban</b> on fishing during the breeding season helps fish populations recover.\",\"繁殖季节的禁渔令有助于鱼类种群恢复。\"]],\"beast\":[[\"The legend describes a huge <b>beast</b> living deep in the forest.\",\"传说描述了一头住在森林深处的巨大野兽。\"],[\"Farmers kept their sheep in pens at night to protect them from wild <b>beasts</b>.\",\"农夫夜里把羊关在圈里，防野兽袭击。\"]],\"blab\":[[\"He <b>blabbed</b> the surprise party plans to everyone at lunch.\",\"他午饭时把惊喜派对的计划向所有人泄了密。\"],[\"Don't tell Tom the secret — he always <b>blabs</b>.\",\"别把秘密告诉汤姆——他总是守不住嘴。\"]],\"burrow\":[[\"Rabbits dig <b>burrows</b> to hide from foxes.\",\"兔子挖洞穴躲避狐狸。\"],[\"The fox raised its cubs in an abandoned <b>burrow</b>.\",\"狐狸在一个废弃的洞穴里养育幼崽。\"]],\"captivate\":[[\"The storyteller <b>captivated</b> the children with tales of dragons.\",\"讲故事的人用巨龙的故事迷住了孩子们。\"],[\"Her voice <b>captivates</b> audiences from the first note.\",\"她的歌声从第一个音符起就迷住听众。\"]],\"category\":[[\"The library sorts books into <b>categories</b> such as history, science, and fiction.\",\"图书馆把书分成历史、科学、小说等类别。\"],[\"This storm falls into the strongest <b>category</b> on the scale.\",\"这场风暴属于量表上最强的类别。\"]],\"cease\":[[\"The factory <b>ceased</b> production after the fire.\",\"火灾后工厂停止了生产。\"],[\"At midnight, the shelling finally <b>ceased</b>.\",\"到了午夜，炮击终于停止了。\"]],\"cheek\":[[\"The cold wind turned the children's <b>cheeks</b> red.\",\"寒风把孩子们的脸颊吹得通红。\"],[\"She kissed her grandmother on the <b>cheek</b> before leaving.\",\"临走前，她亲了亲祖母的脸颊。\"]],\"childhood\":[[\"She spent her <b>childhood</b> in a small fishing village.\",\"她在一个小渔村度过了童年。\"],[\"Reading aloud in <b>childhood</b> is linked to stronger language skills later.\",\"童年时期大声朗读与后来更强的语言能力有关。\"]],\"criteria\":[[\"The main <b>criterion</b> for the scholarship is academic achievement.\",\"这项奖学金的主要标准是学业成绩。\"],[\"Judges score each performance against five <b>criteria</b>, including technique and expression.\",\"评委按包括技巧和表现力在内的五项标准为每个表演打分。\"]],\"diffusion\":[[\"<b>Diffusion</b> moves oxygen from the lungs, where it is concentrated, into the blood.\",\"扩散作用让氧气从浓度较高的肺部进入血液。\"],[\"The <b>diffusion</b> of printing technology in the 15th century spread books across Europe.\",\"15 世纪印刷技术的扩散让书籍传遍了欧洲。\"]],\"enormity\":[[\"Rescue teams were stunned by the <b>enormity</b> of the damage after the earthquake.\",\"地震过后，救援队被破坏的巨大程度震惊了。\"],[\"Only when he saw the archive did he grasp the <b>enormity</b> of the task ahead.\",\"直到看见那批档案，他才意识到眼前任务的艰巨浩大。\"]],\"equator\":[[\"Countries near the <b>equator</b> have warm temperatures all year round.\",\"赤道附近的国家全年气温都很高。\"],[\"The ship crossed the <b>equator</b> at dawn, and the crew marked the moment with a small ceremony.\",\"船在黎明时分越过赤道，船员们举行了一个小仪式纪念这一刻。\"]],\"execution\":[[\"The <b>execution</b> of the prisoner was scheduled for dawn.\",\"这名囚犯的死刑定于黎明执行。\"],[\"In the novel, a last-minute letter stops the <b>execution</b>.\",\"小说里，一封最后一刻送到的信阻止了这场处决。\"]],\"expressway\":[[\"The new <b>expressway</b> cuts the trip to the airport to 30 minutes.\",\"新快速干道把去机场的时间缩短到 30 分钟。\"],[\"Trucks are not allowed on this <b>expressway</b> during rush hour.\",\"高峰时段这条快速干道禁止卡车通行。\"]],\"extinction\":[[\"In the conditioning experiment, the learned response weakened through <b>extinction</b> once the reward stopped.\",\"在条件反射实验中，奖励停止后，习得反应因消退而减弱。\"],[\"Habitat loss is pushing many frog species toward <b>extinction</b>.\",\"栖息地丧失正把许多蛙类推向灭绝。\"]],\"factor\":[[\"Cost was the deciding <b>factor</b> in choosing the design.\",\"成本是选择这一设计的决定性因素。\"],[\"Many <b>factors</b>, including rainfall and soil, affect the harvest.\",\"包括降雨和土壤在内的许多因素影响收成。\"]],\"fragment\":[[\"Archaeologists found a <b>fragment</b> of pottery with painted patterns.\",\"考古学家发现了一块带彩绘图案的陶器碎片。\"],[\"Only a <b>fragment</b> of the ancient manuscript survived the fire.\",\"那份古代手稿只有一小片残篇在火灾中幸存。\"]],\"harp\":[[\"A musician plucked the strings of the <b>harp</b> as the guests took their seats.\",\"宾客入座时，一位乐手拨动了竖琴的琴弦。\"],[\"The <b>harp</b> has 47 strings and seven pedals that change their pitch.\",\"竖琴有 47 根弦和七个改变音高的踏板。\"]],\"hence\":[[\"The bridge was damaged in the flood; <b>hence</b>, all traffic was diverted.\",\"大桥在洪水中受损，因此所有车辆都改道行驶。\"],[\"He had studied the data for years and <b>hence</b> spotted the error at once.\",\"他研究这批数据多年，因此一眼就发现了错误。\"]],\"hip\":[[\"She stood with her hands on her <b>hips</b>.\",\"她双手叉腰站着。\"],[\"The dancer injured her <b>hip</b> during rehearsal.\",\"舞者在排练时伤了臀部（髋部）。\"]],\"hue\":[[\"The artist mixed blue and green to get a softer <b>hue</b>.\",\"画家把蓝色和绿色混合，得到更柔和的色调。\"],[\"Autumn leaves turn to <b>hues</b> of red, orange, and gold.\",\"秋叶变成红、橙、金等各种色调。\"]],\"induce\":[[\"Nothing could <b>induce</b> him to reveal the source of the story.\",\"什么也不能引诱他说出这则报道的消息来源。\"],[\"A changing magnetic field can <b>induce</b> an electric current in a wire.\",\"变化的磁场能在导线中感应出电流。\"]],\"insert\":[[\"<b>Insert</b> the key into the lock and turn it slowly.\",\"把钥匙插入锁孔，慢慢转动。\"],[\"The editor <b>inserted</b> a map between the two chapters.\",\"编辑在两章之间插入了一幅地图。\"]],\"layer\":[[\"The cake has three <b>layers</b> of chocolate and cream.\",\"这块蛋糕有三层巧克力和奶油。\"],[\"A thick <b>layer</b> of dust covered the old furniture.\",\"旧家具上盖着厚厚一层灰。\"]],\"masterpiece\":[[\"The novel is considered the author's <b>masterpiece</b>.\",\"这部小说被视为作者的杰作。\"],[\"Thousands visit the museum each year to see this <b>masterpiece</b> of Renaissance painting.\",\"每年有成千上万的人来博物馆看这幅文艺复兴绘画杰作。\"]],\"meteor\":[[\"A bright <b>meteor</b> crossed the sky and vanished in seconds.\",\"一颗明亮的流星划过天空，几秒钟就消失了。\"],[\"During the <b>meteor</b> shower, hundreds of streaks appear each hour.\",\"流星雨期间，每小时会出现数百道流星轨迹。\"]],\"mild\":[[\"The patient had only <b>mild</b> symptoms and recovered at home.\",\"病人只有轻微症状，在家休息后就康复了。\"],[\"Winters here are <b>mild</b>, with temperatures rarely below freezing.\",\"这里冬季温和，气温很少降到冰点以下。\"]],\"miner\":[[\"The <b>miners</b> worked deep underground in narrow tunnels.\",\"矿工们在地下深处的狭窄巷道里工作。\"],[\"After the accident, every <b>miner</b> was brought safely to the surface.\",\"事故发生后，每位矿工都被安全带回地面。\"]],\"pedestrian\":[[\"Drivers must stop when a <b>pedestrian</b> is crossing at the crosswalk.\",\"行人走斑马线过马路时，司机必须停车让行。\"],[\"The bridge is open to <b>pedestrians</b> and cyclists only.\",\"这座桥只供行人和骑车者通行。\"]],\"politician\":[[\"The <b>politician</b> promised to lower taxes during her campaign.\",\"这位政治家在竞选中承诺减税。\"],[\"Local <b>politicians</b> debated the plan for hours before voting.\",\"地方政治家们就该计划辩论了数小时才表决。\"]],\"rainbow\":[[\"After the storm, a <b>rainbow</b> stretched across the valley.\",\"暴风雨过后，一道彩虹横跨山谷。\"],[\"A <b>rainbow</b> forms when sunlight passes through raindrops and splits into colors.\",\"阳光穿过雨滴并分解成各种颜色时，就形成了彩虹。\"]],\"rhythm\":[[\"The drummer kept a steady <b>rhythm</b> throughout the song.\",\"鼓手在整首歌中保持着稳定的节奏。\"],[\"Daily life in the village followed the <b>rhythm</b> of the seasons.\",\"村里的日常生活遵循着季节的节奏。\"]],\"rocking\":[[\"Grandfather sat in a <b>rocking</b> chair, reading by the window.\",\"祖父坐在摇椅上，靠着窗边看书。\"],[\"The boat began <b>rocking</b> gently as the waves grew.\",\"随着浪头变大，船开始轻轻摇晃。\"]],\"rope\":[[\"The climbers tied themselves together with a <b>rope</b>.\",\"登山者用一根绳子把彼此系在一起。\"],[\"He pulled the boat to shore with a thick <b>rope</b>.\",\"他用一根粗绳把船拉到岸边。\"]],\"self-esteem\":[[\"Praise for effort, not just results, helps build children's <b>self-esteem</b>.\",\"表扬努力而非只看结果，有助于培养孩子的自尊。\"],[\"Losing his job damaged his <b>self-esteem</b> for months.\",\"失业让他的自尊受损数月。\"]],\"shark\":[[\"Great white <b>sharks</b> can detect a drop of blood in 100 liters of water.\",\"大白鲨能察觉到 100 升水里的一滴血。\"],[\"The documentary follows a <b>shark</b> as it migrates thousands of miles across the Pacific.\",\"这部纪录片跟踪一条鲨鱼，看它横渡太平洋迁徙数千英里。\"]],\"similar\":[[\"The two species look <b>similar</b>, but their DNA differs greatly.\",\"这两个物种外表相似，但 DNA 差异很大。\"],[\"Twins often have <b>similar</b> tastes in music and food.\",\"双胞胎在音乐和食物口味上往往相似。\"]],\"stadium\":[[\"The <b>stadium</b> held 60,000 fans for the final match.\",\"决赛那天，体育场容纳了六万名球迷。\"],[\"Workers are building a new <b>stadium</b> near the river for next year's games.\",\"工人们正在河边修建一座新体育场，供明年的赛事使用。\"]],\"vacation\":[[\"They spent their summer <b>vacation</b> hiking in the mountains.\",\"他们在山里徒步度过了暑假假期。\"],[\"After the long project, she took a two-week <b>vacation</b> by the sea.\",\"漫长的项目结束后，她去海边休了两周假。\"]],\"abuse\":[[\"The report criticized the <b>abuse</b> of power by local officials.\",\"报告批评了地方官员滥用职权。\"],[\"Long-term <b>abuse</b> of antibiotics can make bacteria resistant to them.\",\"长期滥用抗生素会让细菌产生耐药性。\"]],\"acid\":[[\"Vinegar contains a weak <b>acid</b> that gives it a sour taste.\",\"醋里含有一种弱酸，使它有酸味。\"],[\"The scientist tested how the <b>acid</b> reacted with the metal.\",\"科学家测试了这种酸与金属的反应。\"]],\"acquire\":[[\"She <b>acquired</b> a good knowledge of French while living in Paris.\",\"她在巴黎生活期间获得了扎实的法语知识。\"],[\"The museum <b>acquired</b> the painting at an auction last year.\",\"博物馆去年在拍卖会上购得这幅画。\"]],\"allocation\":[[\"The <b>allocation</b> of funds to rural schools increased this year.\",\"今年分配给农村学校的资金增加了。\"],[\"Fair <b>allocation</b> of water is a challenge during droughts.\",\"干旱期间公平分配水资源是一大难题。\"]],\"appeal\":[[\"The defendant decided to <b>appeal</b> the court's decision.\",\"被告决定对法院判决提出上诉。\"],[\"His <b>appeal</b> was rejected, and the original sentence stood.\",\"他的上诉被驳回，原判维持不变。\"]],\"artillery\":[[\"The fortress was protected by heavy <b>artillery</b>.\",\"要塞由重型大炮守卫。\"],[\"<b>Artillery</b> fire could be heard from miles away.\",\"几英里外都能听到大炮的轰鸣。\"]],\"aunt\":[[\"My <b>aunt</b> taught me how to bake bread.\",\"我阿姨教我烤面包。\"],[\"We visit <b>Aunt</b> Li every Spring Festival.\",\"每年春节我们都去看望李阿姨。\"]],\"avoid\":[[\"He took a side road to <b>avoid</b> the traffic jam.\",\"他走小路避免堵车。\"],[\"Try to <b>avoid</b> making the same mistake twice.\",\"尽量避免同一个错误犯两次。\"]],\"calibrate\":[[\"Technicians <b>calibrate</b> the scale before each experiment.\",\"技术人员在每次实验前校准天平。\"],[\"The thermometer was not <b>calibrated</b>, so its readings were unreliable.\",\"这支温度计没有校准，读数不可靠。\"]],\"chili\":[[\"She added dried <b>chili</b> to the soup for extra heat.\",\"她往汤里加了干红辣椒提辣味。\"],[\"This <b>chili</b> is made with beef, beans, and tomatoes.\",\"这道辣椒炖菜用牛肉、豆子和番茄做成。\"]],\"chronology\":[[\"The historian built a <b>chronology</b> of events leading up to the war.\",\"历史学家编制了战争爆发前一系列事件的年表。\"],[\"Tree rings help scientists establish the <b>chronology</b> of past droughts.\",\"年轮帮助科学家确定过去干旱发生的先后顺序。\"]],\"civilization\":[[\"Ancient Egyptian <b>civilization</b> developed along the Nile.\",\"古埃及文明在尼罗河沿岸发展起来。\"],[\"Writing appeared early in several <b>civilizations</b>, including Mesopotamia and China.\",\"文字在包括美索不达米亚和中国在内的几个文明中很早就出现了。\"]],\"clan\":[[\"The whole <b>clan</b> gathered at the ancestral hall for the festival.\",\"全氏族的人在节日时聚集到祠堂。\"],[\"In the highlands, each <b>clan</b> had its own tartan pattern.\",\"在高地，每个氏族都有自己的格纹图案。\"]],\"compute\":[[\"The program can <b>compute</b> the route in less than a second.\",\"这个程序不到一秒就能计算出路线。\"],[\"Engineers <b>computed</b> the load the bridge could carry.\",\"工程师计算了这座桥能承受的载荷。\"]],\"concord\":[[\"The two nations lived in <b>concord</b> for decades after the treaty.\",\"条约签订后，两国和谐一致地相处了几十年。\"],[\"In the painting, the colors are in perfect <b>concord</b>.\",\"这幅画里，各种颜色和谐一致。\"]],\"consistent\":[[\"His results are <b>consistent</b> with the earlier study.\",\"他的结果与先前研究一致。\"],[\"She is a <b>consistent</b> student who hands in homework on time every day.\",\"她是个一贯认真的学生，每天按时交作业。\"]],\"contribute\":[[\"Everyone <b>contributed</b> ideas during the meeting.\",\"会上每个人都贡献了想法。\"],[\"Regular exercise <b>contributes</b> to better sleep.\",\"规律锻炼有助于改善睡眠。\"]],\"copper\":[[\"Electrical wires are usually made of <b>copper</b> because it conducts well.\",\"电线通常用铜制成，因为铜导电性好。\"],[\"The old coins were made of <b>copper</b> and had turned green.\",\"这些古币是铜制的，已经变绿了。\"]],\"cupboard\":[[\"She keeps the plates in the kitchen <b>cupboard</b>.\",\"她把盘子放在厨房的碗柜里。\"],[\"The <b>cupboard</b> was full of jars and cans.\",\"碗柜里塞满了罐子。\"]],\"dancing\":[[\"<b>Dancing</b> was part of the festival, with everyone joining in the square.\",\"舞蹈是节庆的一部分，大家都在广场上一起跳。\"],[\"She has taken <b>dancing</b> lessons since she was six.\",\"她六岁起就上舞蹈课。\"]],\"decay\":[[\"Sugar speeds up tooth <b>decay</b> if you don't brush regularly.\",\"不经常刷牙的话，糖会加速牙齿腐烂（龋坏）。\"],[\"The fallen tree slowly <b>decayed</b> and returned nutrients to the soil.\",\"倒下的树慢慢腐烂，把养分还给土壤。\"]],\"deviate\":[[\"The pilot <b>deviated</b> from the planned route to avoid the storm.\",\"飞行员偏离计划航线以避开风暴。\"],[\"If you <b>deviate</b> from the recipe, the cake may not rise.\",\"偏离食谱做，蛋糕可能发不起来。\"]],\"dispose\":[[\"Please <b>dispose</b> of used batteries in the special bin.\",\"请把废电池处理到专用回收箱里。\"],[\"The company must <b>dispose</b> of chemical waste safely.\",\"公司必须安全处理化学废料。\"]],\"dissemination\":[[\"The internet allows the rapid <b>dissemination</b> of news around the world.\",\"互联网让新闻能迅速传播到全世界。\"],[\"The <b>dissemination</b> of seeds by wind helps plants colonize new areas.\",\"种子借风传播，帮助植物在新区域扎根。\"]],\"dock\":[[\"The ship waited at the <b>dock</b> while workers unloaded the cargo.\",\"船停在码头，等工人卸货。\"],[\"Fishermen repair their nets on the wooden <b>dock</b>.\",\"渔民在木码头上修补渔网。\"]],\"driver\":[[\"The bus <b>driver</b> waited until all the children were seated.\",\"公交车司机等所有孩子坐好才开车。\"],[\"Taxi <b>drivers</b> in the city know every shortcut.\",\"城里的出租车司机知道每条近路。\"]],\"economic\":[[\"The country's <b>economic</b> growth slowed last year.\",\"该国去年的经济增长放缓。\"],[\"<b>Economic</b> sanctions were imposed after the invasion.\",\"入侵之后，国际社会实施了经济制裁。\"]],\"effectiveness\":[[\"The study measured the <b>effectiveness</b> of the new teaching method.\",\"这项研究测量了新教学法的有效性。\"],[\"Regular practice improves the <b>effectiveness</b> of memory training.\",\"定期练习能提高记忆训练的有效性。\"]],\"ensure\":[[\"Please <b>ensure</b> that all windows are closed before leaving.\",\"离开前请确保所有窗户都关好。\"],[\"Regular checks <b>ensure</b> the machines run safely.\",\"定期检查确保机器安全运行。\"]],\"ethos\":[[\"The school's <b>ethos</b> emphasizes curiosity over competition.\",\"这所学校的精神特质强调好奇心重于竞争。\"],[\"Hard work and thrift were part of the community's <b>ethos</b>.\",\"勤劳节俭是这个社区精神特质的一部分。\"]],\"executive\":[[\"The company's top <b>executives</b> met to discuss the merger.\",\"公司高管们开会讨论合并事宜。\"],[\"As an <b>executive</b>, she is responsible for a team of 200 people.\",\"作为高管，她负责一个 200 人的团队。\"]],\"extinct\":[[\"The dodo became <b>extinct</b> in the 17th century.\",\"渡渡鸟在 17 世纪灭绝。\"],[\"Several volcanoes in the region are <b>extinct</b> and no longer erupt.\",\"该地区几座火山已是死火山，不再喷发。\"]],\"fin\":[[\"The shark's dorsal <b>fin</b> cut through the surface of the water.\",\"鲨鱼的背鳍划破水面。\"],[\"Fish use their <b>fins</b> to steer and balance as they swim.\",\"鱼用鳍在游动时掌握方向和平衡。\"]],\"firefighter\":[[\"The <b>firefighters</b> reached the burning building within minutes.\",\"消防员几分钟内赶到着火的建筑。\"],[\"A <b>firefighter</b> carried the child out of the smoke-filled room.\",\"一名消防员把孩子抱出浓烟弥漫的房间。\"]],\"flour\":[[\"She mixed <b>flour</b>, water, and yeast to make the dough.\",\"她把面粉、水和酵母混合做面团。\"],[\"A cloud of <b>flour</b> rose when he opened the bag.\",\"他打开袋子时扬起一阵面粉。\"]],\"ham\":[[\"She made a sandwich with <b>ham</b> and cheese.\",\"她做了一个火腿奶酪三明治。\"],[\"A baked <b>ham</b> was the centerpiece of the holiday dinner.\",\"一只烤火腿是节日大餐的主菜。\"]],\"infancy\":[[\"During <b>infancy</b>, the brain develops faster than at any other time.\",\"婴儿期大脑发育比任何其他时期都快。\"],[\"The technology was still in its <b>infancy</b> in the 1970s.\",\"这项技术在 20 世纪 70 年代还处于婴儿期（萌芽阶段）。\"]],\"interpret\":[[\"It is hard to <b>interpret</b> the meaning of these ancient symbols.\",\"这些古代符号的含义很难解释。\"],[\"Different historians <b>interpret</b> the same event in different ways.\",\"不同的历史学家对同一事件有不同的解释。\"]],\"joke\":[[\"Everyone laughed at his <b>joke</b> about the absent-minded professor.\",\"他讲的那个心不在焉教授的笑话逗得大家都笑了。\"],[\"It was only a <b>joke</b> — he didn't mean to offend anyone.\",\"那只是个笑话——他并非有意冒犯任何人。\"]],\"juice\":[[\"He squeezed three oranges to make a glass of <b>juice</b>.\",\"他榨了三个橙子做了一杯果汁。\"],[\"The recipe calls for lemon <b>juice</b> and a little sugar.\",\"食谱要求加柠檬汁和一点糖。\"]],\"lawyer\":[[\"The <b>lawyer</b> advised her client not to sign the contract yet.\",\"律师建议她的当事人先不要签合同。\"],[\"He hired a <b>lawyer</b> to handle the property dispute.\",\"他请了一位律师处理房产纠纷。\"]],\"mural\":[[\"Artists painted a huge <b>mural</b> of the ocean on the library wall.\",\"艺术家在图书馆墙上画了一幅巨大的海洋墙画。\"],[\"The subway station is decorated with a colorful <b>mural</b>.\",\"地铁站里装饰着一幅色彩鲜艳的墙画。\"]],\"peninsula\":[[\"The Korean <b>Peninsula</b> is surrounded by sea on three sides.\",\"朝鲜半岛三面环海。\"],[\"Ferries connect the <b>peninsula</b> to the nearby islands.\",\"渡轮把半岛与附近岛屿连接起来。\"]],\"physician\":[[\"The <b>physician</b> prescribed rest and plenty of fluids.\",\"内科医生开的处方是休息和多喝水。\"],[\"You should consult a <b>physician</b> if the fever lasts more than three days.\",\"如果发烧超过三天，应咨询内科医生。\"]],\"radioactive\":[[\"The waste from the plant is <b>radioactive</b> and must be stored underground.\",\"工厂的废料有放射性，必须存放在地下。\"],[\"Scientists use <b>radioactive</b> dating to estimate the age of fossils.\",\"科学家用放射性测年法估算化石的年代。\"]],\"rooster\":[[\"The <b>rooster</b> crows at dawn every morning.\",\"公鸡每天黎明打鸣。\"],[\"A <b>rooster</b> with bright red feathers strutted around the yard.\",\"一只羽毛鲜红的公鸡在院子里昂首阔步。\"]],\"salesman\":[[\"The <b>salesman</b> showed us three different models of the car.\",\"推销员向我们展示了这款车的三个型号。\"],[\"A door-to-door <b>salesman</b> tried to sell him a vacuum cleaner.\",\"一名上门推销员想卖给他一台吸尘器。\"]],\"siege\":[[\"The city survived a <b>siege</b> that lasted nearly a year.\",\"这座城市挺过了长达近一年的围攻。\"],[\"During the <b>siege</b>, food was rationed among the residents.\",\"围攻期间，食物在居民中定量配给。\"]],\"statue\":[[\"A bronze <b>statue</b> of the founder stands in the main square.\",\"主广场上立着一尊创始人的铜雕像。\"],[\"The museum displays a marble <b>statue</b> from ancient Greece.\",\"博物馆展出一尊古希腊大理石雕像。\"]],\"tail\":[[\"The dog wagged its <b>tail</b> when it saw its owner.\",\"狗一看到主人就摇尾巴。\"],[\"A comet's <b>tail</b> always points away from the sun.\",\"彗星的尾巴总是背向太阳。\"]],\"alimony\":[[\"The court ordered him to pay monthly <b>alimony</b> to his former wife.\",\"法院判令他每月向前妻支付赡养费。\"],[\"She relied on <b>alimony</b> while she retrained for a new job.\",\"她在接受新工作培训期间靠赡养费生活。\"]],\"amplitude\":[[\"The <b>amplitude</b> of a sound wave determines how loud it seems.\",\"声波的振幅决定了它听起来有多响。\"],[\"As the wave loses energy, its <b>amplitude</b> decreases.\",\"波损失能量时，振幅会减小。\"]],\"aqueduct\":[[\"The Roman <b>aqueduct</b> carried water into the city from the hills.\",\"这条罗马水渠把水从山里引到城中。\"],[\"Parts of the ancient <b>aqueduct</b> still stand after 2,000 years.\",\"这条古水渠的一部分在 2000 年后仍然矗立。\"]],\"arc\":[[\"The ball flew in an <b>arc</b> over the fence.\",\"球划出一道弧线飞过栅栏。\"],[\"In geometry, an <b>arc</b> is part of the circumference of a circle.\",\"在几何学中，弧是圆周的一部分。\"]],\"ascend\":[[\"The climbers began to <b>ascend</b> the mountain before dawn.\",\"登山者在黎明前开始向上攀登这座山。\"],[\"Smoke <b>ascended</b> slowly from the chimney.\",\"烟从烟囱里缓缓上升。\"]],\"audio\":[[\"The <b>audio</b> quality of the recording is poor because of background noise.\",\"这段录音的音频质量很差，因为背景噪音大。\"],[\"Students can download the <b>audio</b> files for each lesson.\",\"学生可以下载每节课的音频文件。\"]],\"bellow\":[[\"The bull <b>bellowed</b> across the field.\",\"公牛在田野里吼叫。\"],[\"\\\"Get out of the way!\\\" he <b>bellowed</b> at the driver ahead.\",\"“让开！”他对前面的司机吼道。\"]],\"blank\":[[\"The page was completely <b>blank</b>.\",\"这一页完全空白。\"],[\"His mind went <b>blank</b> during the exam, and he forgot everything.\",\"考试时他脑子一片空白，什么都忘了。\"]],\"blanket\":[[\"She covered the child with a warm <b>blanket</b>.\",\"她给孩子盖上一条暖和的毯子。\"],[\"A <b>blanket</b> of snow covered the whole village overnight.\",\"一夜之间，全村盖上了一层雪毯。\"]],\"bronze\":[[\"The <b>bronze</b> statue turned green after years outdoors.\",\"这尊青铜雕像在户外多年后变成了绿色。\"],[\"In the <b>Bronze</b> Age, tools were made from an alloy of copper and tin.\",\"青铜时代，工具用铜锡合金制成。\"]],\"cancel\":[[\"The flight was <b>canceled</b> because of the storm.\",\"航班因暴风雨取消。\"],[\"She called the hotel to <b>cancel</b> her reservation.\",\"她给酒店打电话取消预订。\"]],\"choreography\":[[\"The <b>choreography</b> of the ballet took months to perfect.\",\"这部芭蕾的编舞花了几个月才完善。\"],[\"She creates the <b>choreography</b> for the school's dance team.\",\"她为学校舞蹈队创作编舞。\"]],\"chorus\":[[\"The school <b>chorus</b> performed at the spring concert.\",\"学校合唱团在春季音乐会上演出。\"],[\"The audience joined in the <b>chorus</b> of the final song.\",\"观众跟着最后一首歌的合唱部分一起唱。\"]],\"climate\":[[\"The <b>climate</b> in the desert is hot and dry.\",\"沙漠的气候炎热干燥。\"],[\"Changes in ocean currents can affect the regional <b>climate</b>.\",\"洋流变化会影响区域气候。\"]],\"collection\":[[\"The museum has a large <b>collection</b> of ancient coins.\",\"博物馆有大量古代钱币收藏。\"],[\"Her stamp <b>collection</b> includes rare stamps from the 19th century.\",\"她的集邮收藏包括 19 世纪的珍稀邮票。\"]],\"collide\":[[\"The two cars <b>collided</b> at the intersection.\",\"两辆车在十字路口相撞。\"],[\"Particles <b>collide</b> millions of times per second inside the accelerator.\",\"加速器里，粒子每秒碰撞数百万次。\"]],\"conservative\":[[\"His <b>conservative</b> views on education were well known.\",\"他在教育上的保守观点众所周知。\"],[\"The bank took a <b>conservative</b> approach to lending after the crisis.\",\"危机之后，这家银行在贷款上采取了保守的做法。\"]],\"cooperate\":[[\"The two labs agreed to <b>cooperate</b> on the research.\",\"两个实验室同意在这项研究中合作。\"],[\"If everyone <b>cooperates</b>, the cleanup will finish by noon.\",\"大家合作的话，清理工作中午就能完成。\"]],\"cradle\":[[\"The baby slept peacefully in the wooden <b>cradle</b>.\",\"婴儿安静地睡在木摇篮里。\"],[\"Mesopotamia is often called the <b>cradle</b> of civilization.\",\"美索不达米亚常被称为文明的摇篮。\"]],\"dancer\":[[\"The lead <b>dancer</b> performed a solo in the second act.\",\"领舞舞者在第二幕表演了独舞。\"],[\"Becoming a professional <b>dancer</b> requires years of daily practice.\",\"成为职业舞者需要多年每日练习。\"]],\"enable\":[[\"The new software <b>enables</b> students to study anywhere.\",\"新软件使学生能够在任何地方学习。\"],[\"A scholarship <b>enabled</b> him to attend university.\",\"一笔奖学金使他能够上大学。\"]],\"engraving\":[[\"The museum displays wood <b>engravings</b> from the 18th century.\",\"博物馆展出 18 世纪的木刻雕刻版画。\"],[\"Each <b>engraving</b> in the book was printed from a copper plate.\",\"书中每幅雕刻版画都是用铜版印制的。\"]],\"episode\":[[\"In one <b>episode</b> of the novel, the hero returns to his hometown.\",\"小说的一个插曲里，主人公回到了家乡。\"],[\"She missed the final <b>episode</b> of the series.\",\"她错过了这部剧的最后一集。\"]],\"eventuality\":[[\"The team prepared for every <b>eventuality</b>, including rain and power failures.\",\"团队为每种可能性事件都做好了准备，包括下雨和停电。\"],[\"Insurance protects your family against the <b>eventuality</b> of an accident.\",\"保险保护你的家庭以防发生意外这类可能性事件。\"]],\"exile\":[[\"The writer lived in <b>exile</b> for twenty years before returning home.\",\"这位作家流放了二十年才回到祖国。\"],[\"The king was sent into <b>exile</b> on a remote island.\",\"国王被流放到一座偏远岛屿。\"]],\"feedback\":[[\"The teacher gave detailed <b>feedback</b> on each essay.\",\"老师对每篇文章都给了详细的反馈。\"],[\"Customer <b>feedback</b> helped the company improve the design.\",\"顾客反馈帮助公司改进了设计。\"]],\"fusion\":[[\"The sun's energy comes from nuclear <b>fusion</b> in its core.\",\"太阳的能量来自其核心的核融合（聚变）。\"],[\"The restaurant offers a <b>fusion</b> of Japanese and French cooking.\",\"这家餐厅提供日式与法式融合的菜肴。\"]],\"glacier\":[[\"The <b>glacier</b> moves only a few centimeters a day.\",\"这条冰川每天只移动几厘米。\"],[\"As the climate warms, many <b>glaciers</b> are shrinking.\",\"随着气候变暖，许多冰川正在缩小。\"]],\"gps\":[[\"The <b>GPS</b> in the car recalculated the route after we missed the turn.\",\"我们错过路口后，车上的定位系统重新计算了路线。\"],[\"Hikers use <b>GPS</b> devices to avoid getting lost in the mountains.\",\"徒步者用定位系统设备避免在山里迷路。\"]],\"hang\":[[\"She <b>hung</b> the painting above the fireplace.\",\"她把画悬挂在壁炉上方。\"],[\"Wet clothes were <b>hanging</b> on a line in the garden.\",\"湿衣服悬挂在花园的绳子上。\"]],\"hydrogen\":[[\"Water is made of <b>hydrogen</b> and oxygen.\",\"水由氢和氧组成。\"],[\"<b>Hydrogen</b> is the lightest element in the universe.\",\"氢是宇宙中最轻的元素。\"]],\"inconsistent\":[[\"His statements were <b>inconsistent</b> with the facts.\",\"他的说法与事实不一致。\"],[\"The team's performance was <b>inconsistent</b>, winning one week and losing badly the next.\",\"这支队伍表现不一致，一周赢、下一周惨败。\"]],\"innovation\":[[\"The smartphone was a major <b>innovation</b> in communication.\",\"智能手机是通信领域的一大革新。\"],[\"Companies that encourage <b>innovation</b> tend to grow faster.\",\"鼓励革新的公司往往发展更快。\"]],\"insomnia\":[[\"Stress at work gave him <b>insomnia</b> for several weeks.\",\"工作压力让他失眠了好几周。\"],[\"People with <b>insomnia</b> often feel tired during the day.\",\"失眠的人白天常常感到疲倦。\"]],\"internal\":[[\"The company carried out an <b>internal</b> review of its finances.\",\"公司对财务进行了内部审查。\"],[\"The bleeding was <b>internal</b>, so doctors operated at once.\",\"出血发生在体内（内部的），医生立即做了手术。\"]],\"ion\":[[\"When salt dissolves in water, it splits into sodium and chloride <b>ions</b>.\",\"盐溶于水时，会分解成钠离子和氯离子。\"],[\"An <b>ion</b> is an atom that has gained or lost electrons.\",\"离子是得到或失去电子的原子。\"]],\"journalism\":[[\"She studied <b>journalism</b> and now reports for a national newspaper.\",\"她学了新闻学，现在为一家全国性报纸做报道。\"],[\"Good <b>journalism</b> requires checking facts before publishing.\",\"好的新闻工作要求发表前核查事实。\"]],\"lynx\":[[\"The <b>lynx</b> hunts rabbits and birds in the northern forests.\",\"猞猁在北方森林里捕食兔子和鸟。\"],[\"A <b>lynx</b> has tufted ears and a very short tail.\",\"猞猁耳朵上有簇毛，尾巴很短。\"]],\"monitor\":[[\"Doctors <b>monitor</b> the patient's heart rate around the clock.\",\"医生全天监视病人的心率。\"],[\"Cameras <b>monitor</b> traffic at busy intersections.\",\"摄像头监视着繁忙路口的交通。\"]],\"mosque\":[[\"The old <b>mosque</b> in the city center has a tall minaret.\",\"市中心的老清真寺有一座高高的宣礼塔。\"],[\"Visitors to the <b>mosque</b> are asked to dress modestly.\",\"参观清真寺的游客被要求着装得体。\"]],\"phosphorus\":[[\"<b>Phosphorus</b> is essential for plant growth and is found in fertilizers.\",\"磷对植物生长必不可少，肥料中就含有磷。\"],[\"The body stores <b>phosphorus</b> mainly in bones and teeth.\",\"人体把磷主要储存在骨骼和牙齿中。\"]],\"potassium\":[[\"Bananas are rich in <b>potassium</b>, which helps regulate blood pressure.\",\"香蕉富含钾，有助调节血压。\"],[\"<b>Potassium</b> reacts violently when it touches water.\",\"钾一接触水就会剧烈反应。\"]],\"protein\":[[\"Eggs and beans are good sources of <b>protein</b>.\",\"鸡蛋和豆类是蛋白质的良好来源。\"],[\"The body uses <b>protein</b> to build and repair muscle.\",\"身体利用蛋白质构建和修复肌肉。\"]],\"raspberry\":[[\"She picked a basket of <b>raspberries</b> from the garden.\",\"她从花园里摘了一篮子覆盆子。\"],[\"<b>Raspberry</b> jam goes well with fresh bread.\",\"覆盆子果酱配新鲜面包很好吃。\"]],\"robot\":[[\"The factory uses <b>robots</b> to assemble car parts.\",\"工厂用机器人组装汽车零件。\"],[\"A small <b>robot</b> vacuum cleaned the floor while we were out.\",\"我们外出时，一台小型扫地机器人打扫了地板。\"]],\"seismic\":[[\"<b>Seismic</b> waves from the earthquake were recorded across the continent.\",\"地震的地震波在整个大陆都被记录到。\"],[\"The sensors detect <b>seismic</b> activity deep underground.\",\"这些传感器探测地下深处的地震活动。\"]],\"sidewalk\":[[\"Children walked to school along the <b>sidewalk</b>.\",\"孩子们沿着人行道走去学校。\"],[\"Snow covered the <b>sidewalks</b>, making walking difficult.\",\"积雪覆盖了人行道，走路很困难。\"]],\"species\":[[\"The island is home to a <b>species</b> of bird found nowhere else.\",\"这座岛上有一种别处没有的鸟类物种。\"],[\"Scientists discovered a new <b>species</b> of frog in the rainforest.\",\"科学家在雨林中发现了一个新物种的青蛙。\"]],\"tourist\":[[\"Thousands of <b>tourists</b> visit the old town every summer.\",\"每年夏天有成千上万的游客来古镇游览。\"],[\"A <b>tourist</b> asked us how to get to the museum.\",\"一名游客问我们去博物馆怎么走。\"]],\"victim\":[[\"The <b>victims</b> of the flood were given food and shelter.\",\"洪水的受害者得到了食物和住所。\"],[\"He was the <b>victim</b> of a phone scam and lost his savings.\",\"他是一场电话诈骗的受害者，损失了积蓄。\"]],\"abnormality\":[[\"The test revealed an <b>abnormality</b> in the baby's heart.\",\"检查发现婴儿心脏有异常。\"],[\"Doctors monitored the patient closely after finding a small <b>abnormality</b> in the scan.\",\"扫描发现一处小异常后，医生密切监测病人。\"]],\"absorption\":[[\"The roots of plants are responsible for the <b>absorption</b> of water.\",\"植物的根负责吸收水分。\"],[\"Dark surfaces have a higher <b>absorption</b> of sunlight than light ones.\",\"深色表面比浅色表面对阳光的吸收更强。\"]],\"accordion\":[[\"A street musician played the <b>accordion</b> on the corner.\",\"一位街头乐手在街角拉手风琴。\"],[\"The <b>accordion</b> expands and contracts as the player pushes air through the reeds.\",\"演奏手风琴时风箱一开一合，把空气压过簧片。\"]],\"addict\":[[\"He became <b>addicted</b> to video games and played until dawn.\",\"他沉溺于电子游戏，一直玩到天亮。\"],[\"The program helps drug <b>addicts</b> rebuild their lives.\",\"这个项目帮助吸毒成瘾者重建生活。\"]],\"alert\":[[\"The warning system <b>alerted</b> residents to the coming flood.\",\"预警系统使居民对即将到来的洪水保持警觉。\"],[\"A barking dog <b>alerted</b> the family to the fire.\",\"狗叫声使这家人警觉到火灾。\"]],\"analyst\":[[\"A data <b>analyst</b> examined the sales figures for patterns.\",\"数据分析师检查销售数字，寻找规律。\"],[\"Financial <b>analysts</b> predicted the company would grow this year.\",\"金融分析师预测该公司今年会增长。\"]],\"animate\":[[\"The teacher used hand puppets to <b>animate</b> the story for the children.\",\"老师用手偶使故事生动起来，讲给孩子们听。\"],[\"Artists <b>animated</b> the characters frame by frame.\",\"艺术家们一帧一帧地让角色动起来。\"]],\"archetype\":[[\"The wise old man is an <b>archetype</b> found in myths around the world.\",\"智慧老人是世界各地神话中都有的原型。\"],[\"This design became the <b>archetype</b> for all later smartphones.\",\"这一设计成了后来所有智能手机的原型。\"]],\"artist\":[[\"The <b>artist</b> spent months on a single painting.\",\"这位艺术家花了几个月画一幅画。\"],[\"Local <b>artists</b> display their work in the gallery every spring.\",\"本地艺术家每年春天在画廊展出作品。\"]],\"availability\":[[\"Please check the <b>availability</b> of rooms before you travel.\",\"出行前请确认房间的可用性（是否有空房）。\"],[\"The <b>availability</b> of clean water varies widely between regions.\",\"清洁水的可用性在不同地区差异很大。\"]],\"bankrupt\":[[\"The company went <b>bankrupt</b> after sales collapsed.\",\"销量暴跌后，公司破产了。\"],[\"Bad investments <b>bankrupted</b> the once-famous restaurant chain.\",\"糟糕的投资使这家曾经有名的连锁餐厅破产。\"]],\"borderline\":[[\"His test score was <b>borderline</b>, just at the passing line.\",\"他的考试分数在边缘，刚好在及格线上。\"],[\"The patient's condition is <b>borderline</b> and needs close observation.\",\"病人的情况处于边缘状态，需要密切观察。\"]],\"boring\":[[\"The lecture was so <b>boring</b> that several students fell asleep.\",\"讲座太乏味，几个学生睡着了。\"],[\"He found data entry <b>boring</b> but necessary.\",\"他觉得数据录入乏味但必要。\"]],\"butter\":[[\"She spread <b>butter</b> on the warm toast.\",\"她在热吐司上抹黄油。\"],[\"Melt the <b>butter</b> in a pan before adding the eggs.\",\"先在锅里把黄油融化，再加鸡蛋。\"]],\"campus\":[[\"The university <b>campus</b> is especially beautiful in autumn.\",\"大学校园在秋天格外美丽。\"],[\"Students live in dormitories on <b>campus</b> during the term.\",\"学期期间学生住在校园里的宿舍。\"]],\"clone\":[[\"Scientists <b>cloned</b> the gene to study its function.\",\"科学家克隆了这个基因以研究其功能。\"],[\"Dolly the sheep was the first mammal <b>cloned</b> from an adult cell.\",\"多莉羊是第一只用成年细胞克隆出的哺乳动物。\"]],\"compatible\":[[\"This software is not <b>compatible</b> with older computers.\",\"这个软件与旧电脑不兼容。\"],[\"The two systems are fully <b>compatible</b>, so data moves between them easily.\",\"两个系统完全兼容，数据在它们之间传输很容易。\"]],\"conformity\":[[\"The experiment showed how easily people fall into <b>conformity</b> with a group.\",\"实验显示人们多么容易随群体从众。\"],[\"Teenagers often dress alike out of a desire for <b>conformity</b>.\",\"青少年常因从众心理而穿着相似。\"]],\"conversion\":[[\"The <b>conversion</b> of the warehouse into apartments took a year.\",\"把仓库改建成公寓花了一年时间。\"],[\"The app handles the <b>conversion</b> of dollars to euros automatically.\",\"这个应用自动完成美元到欧元的转换。\"]],\"discount\":[[\"Students get a 20 percent <b>discount</b> at the bookstore.\",\"学生在书店可享八折折扣。\"],[\"The shoes were on sale at a <b>discount</b> of forty dollars.\",\"这双鞋打折，便宜了四十美元。\"]],\"document\":[[\"Please sign the <b>document</b> at the bottom of the page.\",\"请在页面底部的文件上签名。\"],[\"The archive keeps <b>documents</b> dating back 300 years.\",\"档案馆保存着可追溯到 300 年前的文件。\"]],\"doubt\":[[\"There is little <b>doubt</b> that exercise improves health.\",\"运动改善健康，这几乎没有疑问。\"],[\"She expressed <b>doubt</b> about the plan's chances of success.\",\"她对这个计划能否成功表示怀疑。\"]],\"draft\":[[\"She wrote three <b>drafts</b> of the essay before submitting it.\",\"她写了三稿才提交这篇文章。\"],[\"The first <b>draft</b> of the report is due on Friday.\",\"报告的初稿要在周五交。\"]],\"ecosystem\":[[\"Coral reefs support a rich <b>ecosystem</b> of fish and other sea life.\",\"珊瑚礁支撑着一个丰富的、由鱼类和其他海洋生物组成的生态系统。\"],[\"Removing one species can disturb the whole <b>ecosystem</b>.\",\"移除一个物种会扰乱整个生态系统。\"]],\"encyclopedia\":[[\"He looked up the topic in an <b>encyclopedia</b> at the library.\",\"他在图书馆的百科全书里查了这个主题。\"],[\"The online <b>encyclopedia</b> is edited by thousands of volunteers.\",\"这部在线百科全书由成千上万的志愿者编辑。\"]],\"epidermis\":[[\"The <b>epidermis</b> is the thin outer layer of the skin.\",\"表皮是皮肤薄薄的外层。\"],[\"Sunburn damages the cells of the <b>epidermis</b>.\",\"晒伤会损伤表皮细胞。\"]],\"eyelash\":[[\"A single <b>eyelash</b> fell onto her cheek.\",\"一根睫毛落到她的脸颊上。\"],[\"<b>Eyelashes</b> protect the eyes from dust.\",\"睫毛保护眼睛免受灰尘侵入。\"]],\"federal\":[[\"Education is not controlled by the <b>federal</b> government alone.\",\"教育并非仅由联邦政府管控。\"],[\"The <b>federal</b> budget includes money for highway repairs.\",\"联邦预算包括公路维修资金。\"]],\"franchise\":[[\"He bought a coffee shop <b>franchise</b> and opened two stores.\",\"他买下一家咖啡店的特许经营权，开了两家店。\"],[\"Under the <b>franchise</b> agreement, each store must use the same menu.\",\"根据特许经营协议，每家店必须使用相同菜单。\"]],\"grizzly\":[[\"A <b>grizzly</b> bear can weigh more than 300 kilograms.\",\"一头灰熊体重可超过 300 公斤。\"],[\"The hikers kept their distance when they spotted a <b>grizzly</b> near the trail.\",\"徒步者在小路旁发现灰熊时保持了距离。\"]],\"hamlet\":[[\"The <b>hamlet</b> had only a dozen houses and one small shop.\",\"这个小村庄只有十几户人家和一家小商店。\"],[\"They walked through a quiet <b>hamlet</b> in the hills.\",\"他们穿过山间一个安静的小村庄。\"]],\"hormone\":[[\"Insulin is a <b>hormone</b> that controls blood sugar.\",\"胰岛素是一种控制血糖的激素。\"],[\"During puberty, <b>hormones</b> cause rapid changes in the body.\",\"青春期，激素引起身体的快速变化。\"]],\"invasion\":[[\"The <b>invasion</b> of Normandy took place in June 1944.\",\"诺曼底入侵发生在 1944 年 6 月。\"],[\"The island's birds were threatened by an <b>invasion</b> of rats.\",\"岛上的鸟类受到鼠类入侵的威胁。\"]],\"investigator\":[[\"The <b>investigator</b> interviewed witnesses at the scene.\",\"调查员在现场询问了目击者。\"],[\"Private <b>investigators</b> were hired to find the missing documents.\",\"他们雇了私人调查员寻找丢失的文件。\"]],\"liability\":[[\"The company's <b>liabilities</b> were greater than its assets.\",\"公司的负债大于资产。\"],[\"Before buying the firm, they checked all its <b>liabilities</b>.\",\"收购这家公司前，他们核查了它所有的负债。\"]],\"merry-go-round\":[[\"The children rode the <b>merry-go-round</b> three times in a row.\",\"孩子们连坐了三次旋转木马。\"],[\"Colorful horses go up and down on the <b>merry-go-round</b>.\",\"旋转木马上彩色的木马上下起伏。\"]],\"meter\":[[\"The pool is 50 <b>meters</b> long and 25 <b>meters</b> wide.\",\"泳池长 50 米，宽 25 米。\"],[\"One <b>meter</b> is slightly longer than one yard.\",\"一米比一码略长。\"]],\"mole\":[[\"The <b>mole</b> digs tunnels under the garden with its strong front paws.\",\"鼹鼠用强壮的前爪在花园下挖隧道。\"],[\"A <b>mole</b> rarely comes above ground during the day.\",\"鼹鼠白天很少到地面上来。\"]],\"olympic\":[[\"The city built new stadiums for the <b>Olympic</b> Games.\",\"这座城市为奥林匹克运动会建了新体育场。\"],[\"She is an <b>Olympic</b> gold medalist in swimming.\",\"她是奥林匹克游泳金牌得主。\"]],\"origin\":[[\"The <b>origin</b> of the river is high in the mountains.\",\"这条河的起源在高山上。\"],[\"Scientists still debate the <b>origin</b> of language.\",\"科学家仍在争论语言的起源。\"]],\"parade\":[[\"Thousands watched the <b>parade</b> pass through the main street.\",\"成千上万的人观看游行队伍穿过主街。\"],[\"The school band marched in the holiday <b>parade</b>.\",\"学校乐队参加了节日游行。\"]],\"perspective\":[[\"In this drawing, the road narrows in <b>perspective</b> toward the horizon.\",\"这幅画里，道路按透视向地平线收窄。\"],[\"Artists use <b>perspective</b> to create depth on a flat surface.\",\"艺术家用透视法在平面上营造深度感。\"]],\"pre-historic\":[[\"<b>Prehistoric</b> people painted animals on cave walls.\",\"史前的人类在洞穴墙壁上画动物。\"],[\"The museum displays tools from the <b>prehistoric</b> period.\",\"博物馆展出史前时期的工具。\"]],\"sacrifice\":[[\"Ancient peoples offered animal <b>sacrifices</b> to their gods.\",\"古代民族向神献上牲畜祭祀。\"],[\"The festival began with a <b>sacrifice</b> at the temple altar.\",\"节日在神庙祭坛的祭祀中开始。\"]],\"slide\":[[\"The toddler climbed the steps and went down the <b>slide</b> laughing.\",\"小宝宝爬上台阶，笑着从滑梯滑下来。\"],[\"The playground has a <b>slide</b>, swings, and a climbing frame.\",\"游乐场有滑梯、秋千和攀爬架。\"]],\"snake\":[[\"The <b>snake</b> slid silently through the grass.\",\"蛇悄悄地滑过草地。\"],[\"Some <b>snakes</b> can swallow prey larger than their own heads.\",\"有些蛇能吞下比自己头还大的猎物。\"]],\"spleen\":[[\"The <b>spleen</b> helps filter old blood cells from the blood.\",\"脾帮助过滤血液中的衰老血细胞。\"],[\"After the accident, doctors had to remove his damaged <b>spleen</b>.\",\"事故后，医生不得不切除他受损的脾。\"]],\"synthetic\":[[\"Nylon is a <b>synthetic</b> fiber made from chemicals.\",\"尼龙是一种用化学品制成的合成纤维。\"],[\"The jacket is made of <b>synthetic</b> material that dries quickly.\",\"这件夹克用速干的合成材料做成。\"]],\"virus\":[[\"The flu is caused by a <b>virus</b>, not by bacteria.\",\"流感由病毒引起，不是细菌。\"],[\"A computer <b>virus</b> spread through email attachments.\",\"一种电脑病毒通过邮件附件传播。\"]],\"xylophone\":[[\"The child tapped the <b>xylophone</b> with two small mallets.\",\"孩子用两根小槌敲木琴。\"],[\"In the orchestra, the <b>xylophone</b> adds a bright, ringing sound.\",\"在乐队里，木琴增添了明亮清脆的声音。\"]],\"abyss\":[[\"The diver peered into the dark <b>abyss</b> below.\",\"潜水员凝视下方黑暗的深渊。\"],[\"Standing at the canyon rim, he stared into the <b>abyss</b>.\",\"站在峡谷边缘，他盯着深渊。\"]],\"address\":[[\"The meeting was held to <b>address</b> the problem of water shortages.\",\"会议召开是为了处理缺水问题。\"],[\"The new policy <b>addresses</b> the concerns of local farmers.\",\"新政策着手处理当地农民关心的问题。\"]],\"advice\":[[\"The doctor's <b>advice</b> was to rest and drink more water.\",\"医生的建议是休息、多喝水。\"],[\"She asked her teacher for <b>advice</b> on choosing courses.\",\"她向老师请教选课的建议。\"]],\"align\":[[\"<b>Align</b> the edges of the two boards before nailing them.\",\"钉钉子前先把两块板的边缘对齐。\"],[\"The planets rarely <b>align</b> in a straight line.\",\"行星很少对齐成一条直线。\"]],\"alter\":[[\"The tailor <b>altered</b> the suit to fit him perfectly.\",\"裁缝改了这套西装，使其完全合身。\"],[\"Moving to a new city <b>altered</b> her daily routine completely.\",\"搬到新城市彻底改变了她的日常作息。\"]],\"ample\":[[\"There is <b>ample</b> evidence that the treatment works.\",\"有充足的证据表明这种疗法有效。\"],[\"The hall provides <b>ample</b> space for 500 guests.\",\"大厅为 500 名客人提供了充足的空间。\"]],\"apple\":[[\"An <b>apple</b> a day is a common health saying.\",\"“一天一个苹果”是常见的健康谚语。\"],[\"She picked the reddest <b>apples</b> from the tree.\",\"她从树上摘了最红的苹果。\"]],\"approximate\":[[\"This value <b>approximates</b> the true answer closely enough for the purpose.\",\"这个值已足够接近真实答案，能满足当前用途。\"],[\"Her description <b>approximates</b> what actually happened.\",\"她的描述接近于实际发生的情况。\"]],\"archaic\":[[\"The word \\\"thou\\\" is <b>archaic</b> and rarely used today.\",\"“thou”一词古老过时，如今很少使用。\"],[\"The museum keeps an <b>archaic</b> farming calendar from centuries ago.\",\"博物馆保存着几百年前农民用过的古老历书。\"]],\"artwork\":[[\"The gallery's new exhibition features <b>artwork</b> by young local painters.\",\"画廊的新展览展出本地年轻画家的艺术品。\"],[\"Each section of the book includes original <b>artwork</b>.\",\"这本书每一部分都配有原创艺术品（插图）。\"]],\"atmosphere\":[[\"Earth's <b>atmosphere</b> protects us from harmful rays.\",\"地球的大气保护我们免受有害射线。\"],[\"Gases in the <b>atmosphere</b> trap heat from the sun.\",\"大气中的气体留住太阳的热量。\"]],\"autonomous\":[[\"The region became <b>autonomous</b>, electing its own local government.\",\"该地区实现自治，选举自己的地方政府。\"],[\"<b>Autonomous</b> vehicles use sensors to drive themselves.\",\"自动驾驶（自治）车辆用传感器自己行驶。\"]],\"bamboo\":[[\"Pandas feed almost entirely on <b>bamboo</b>.\",\"大熊猫几乎完全以竹子为食。\"],[\"The fence was built from <b>bamboo</b> poles.\",\"栅栏用竹竿建成。\"]],\"beforehand\":[[\"Please book the tickets <b>beforehand</b> because the show sells out.\",\"请预先订票，因为演出票会售罄。\"],[\"She prepared the slides <b>beforehand</b> so the meeting ran smoothly.\",\"她预先做好幻灯片，会议因此顺利进行。\"]],\"bone\":[[\"The dog buried its <b>bone</b> in the garden.\",\"狗把骨头埋在花园里。\"],[\"He broke a <b>bone</b> in his wrist when he fell.\",\"他摔倒时手腕骨折了一根骨头。\"]],\"bread\":[[\"She baked a loaf of <b>bread</b> every Sunday.\",\"她每个星期天烤一条面包。\"],[\"For breakfast he had <b>bread</b> with jam and a cup of tea.\",\"早餐他吃了果酱面包，喝了一杯茶。\"]],\"calorie\":[[\"An average adult needs about 2,000 <b>calories</b> a day.\",\"普通成年人每天约需 2000 卡路里。\"],[\"This drink contains fewer <b>calories</b> than a cola.\",\"这种饮料的卡路里比可乐少。\"]],\"campaign\":[[\"The health <b>campaign</b> encouraged people to quit smoking.\",\"这场健康宣传活动鼓励人们戒烟。\"],[\"Volunteers joined the <b>campaign</b> to clean up the beach.\",\"志愿者加入了清理海滩的活动。\"]],\"caterpillar\":[[\"The <b>caterpillar</b> eats leaves before turning into a butterfly.\",\"毛毛虫在变成蝴蝶前吃树叶。\"],[\"A green <b>caterpillar</b> crawled along the branch.\",\"一条绿色的毛毛虫沿着树枝爬行。\"]],\"clasp\":[[\"She <b>clasped</b> the child's hand tightly as they crossed the street.\",\"过马路时她紧紧握住孩子的手。\"],[\"He <b>clasped</b> his hands behind his back and waited.\",\"他双手紧扣背在身后等待。\"]],\"cricket\":[[\"On summer nights, you can hear <b>crickets</b> chirping in the grass.\",\"夏夜里能听到蟋蟀在草丛中鸣叫。\"],[\"A <b>cricket</b> makes sound by rubbing its wings together.\",\"蟋蟀靠摩擦翅膀发声。\"]],\"deficit\":[[\"The country ran a large budget <b>deficit</b> for five years.\",\"这个国家连续五年出现巨额预算赤字。\"],[\"A sleep <b>deficit</b> can harm memory and concentration.\",\"睡眠不足会损害记忆力和注意力。\"]],\"deteriorate\":[[\"The patient's condition began to <b>deteriorate</b> during the night.\",\"病人的病情在夜间开始恶化。\"],[\"Without maintenance, the old bridge will continue to <b>deteriorate</b>.\",\"没有维护，老桥会继续破损退化。\"]],\"diversity\":[[\"The rainforest is famous for its <b>diversity</b> of species.\",\"雨林以物种多样性闻名。\"],[\"The university values <b>diversity</b> among its students and staff.\",\"大学重视师生群体的多样性。\"]],\"edit\":[[\"She <b>edits</b> articles for a science magazine.\",\"她为一家科学杂志编辑文章。\"],[\"Always <b>edit</b> your essay before handing it in.\",\"交作文前务必先编辑修改。\"]],\"egg\":[[\"The hen lays one <b>egg</b> almost every day.\",\"母鸡几乎每天下一个鸡蛋。\"],[\"He cracked two <b>eggs</b> into the bowl.\",\"他往碗里磕了两个鸡蛋。\"]],\"elevator\":[[\"We took the <b>elevator</b> to the tenth floor.\",\"我们乘电梯到十楼。\"],[\"The <b>elevator</b> was out of order, so we climbed the stairs.\",\"电梯坏了，我们只好爬楼梯。\"]],\"eloquence\":[[\"Her <b>eloquence</b> moved the audience to tears.\",\"她的口才让听众感动落泪。\"],[\"The speech was praised for its <b>eloquence</b> and clarity.\",\"这篇演讲因口才出众、条理清晰而受赞扬。\"]],\"encryption\":[[\"<b>Encryption</b> protects messages by turning them into code.\",\"加密通过把信息变成代码来保护信息。\"],[\"The app uses strong <b>encryption</b> for all payments.\",\"这个应用对所有支付使用强加密。\"]],\"erode\":[[\"Wind and water slowly <b>erode</b> the cliffs.\",\"风和水慢慢侵蚀悬崖。\"],[\"Repeated failures can <b>erode</b> a person's confidence.\",\"反复失败会侵蚀一个人的信心。\"]],\"exploit\":[[\"The country began to <b>exploit</b> its offshore oil fields.\",\"这个国家开始开发近海油田。\"],[\"New farms <b>exploit</b> the region's strong sunlight to grow winter vegetables.\",\"新农场开发利用该地区强烈的阳光种植冬季蔬菜。\"]],\"externality\":[[\"Pollution is a classic negative <b>externality</b>: factories produce it, but everyone pays the cost.\",\"污染是典型的负外部性：工厂制造污染，代价却由所有人承担。\"],[\"Economists argue that a carbon tax can correct the <b>externality</b> of emissions.\",\"经济学家认为碳税可以纠正排放的外部性。\"]],\"feudal\":[[\"Under the <b>feudal</b> system, peasants worked land owned by lords.\",\"在封建制度下，农民耕种领主的土地。\"],[\"The castle dates from the <b>feudal</b> period of the region.\",\"这座城堡建于该地区的封建时期。\"]],\"generation\":[[\"My grandmother's <b>generation</b> grew up without television.\",\"我祖母那一代人是在没有电视的环境中长大的。\"],[\"The custom has been passed down from <b>generation</b> to <b>generation</b>.\",\"这个习俗一代一代传了下来。\"]],\"gill\":[[\"Fish breathe by taking oxygen from water through their <b>gills</b>.\",\"鱼通过鳃从水中获取氧气呼吸。\"],[\"The shark's <b>gills</b> opened and closed as it swam.\",\"鲨鱼游动时鳃一张一合。\"]],\"goose\":[[\"A flock of <b>geese</b> flew south for the winter.\",\"一群鹅飞往南方过冬。\"],[\"The farmer keeps chickens, ducks, and a <b>goose</b>.\",\"农夫养了鸡、鸭和一只鹅。\"]],\"headache\":[[\"She took a pill for her <b>headache</b> and lay down.\",\"她吃了一片治头痛的药，躺下休息。\"],[\"Staring at the screen all day gave him a <b>headache</b>.\",\"整天盯着屏幕让他头痛。\"]],\"jogging\":[[\"She goes <b>jogging</b> in the park every morning before work.\",\"她每天上班前去公园慢跑。\"],[\"<b>Jogging</b> for twenty minutes a day can improve heart health.\",\"每天慢跑二十分钟能改善心脏健康。\"]],\"magazine\":[[\"She reads a science <b>magazine</b> on the train.\",\"她在火车上看一本科学杂志。\"],[\"The <b>magazine</b> publishes a new issue every month.\",\"这本杂志每月出版一期。\"]],\"ointment\":[[\"The nurse applied an <b>ointment</b> to the burn.\",\"护士给烫伤处涂了药膏。\"],[\"This <b>ointment</b> helps relieve itching from insect bites.\",\"这种药膏有助于缓解蚊虫叮咬的痒。\"]],\"physiotherapy\":[[\"After the knee surgery, she went to <b>physiotherapy</b> twice a week.\",\"膝盖手术后，她每周做两次物理治疗。\"],[\"<b>Physiotherapy</b> can help patients recover movement after a stroke.\",\"物理治疗能帮助中风病人恢复运动能力。\"]],\"pilates\":[[\"She does <b>Pilates</b> twice a week to strengthen her back.\",\"她每周做两次普拉提来强化背部。\"],[\"<b>Pilates</b> focuses on controlled movements and core strength.\",\"普拉提注重动作控制和核心力量。\"]],\"pioneer\":[[\"Marie Curie was a <b>pioneer</b> in the study of radioactivity.\",\"玛丽·居里是放射性研究的先驱。\"],[\"The <b>pioneers</b> crossed the mountains in covered wagons.\",\"先驱者们乘有篷马车翻山越岭。\"]],\"prey\":[[\"The owl hunts mice and other small <b>prey</b> at night.\",\"猫头鹰在夜里捕食老鼠等小猎物。\"],[\"Zebras are common <b>prey</b> for lions on the savanna.\",\"斑马是草原上狮子常见的猎物。\"]],\"shrub\":[[\"Flowering <b>shrubs</b> lined both sides of the path.\",\"小路两旁种着开花的灌木。\"],[\"He trimmed the <b>shrub</b> in front of the house.\",\"他修剪了房子前面的灌木。\"]],\"skating\":[[\"The children went <b>skating</b> on the frozen lake.\",\"孩子们在结冰的湖面上滑冰。\"],[\"She practices figure <b>skating</b> four times a week.\",\"她每周练习四次花样滑冰。\"]],\"supermarket\":[[\"The <b>supermarket</b> stays open until 10 p.m.\",\"超市营业到晚上十点。\"],[\"He bought milk, eggs, and rice at the <b>supermarket</b>.\",\"他在超市买了牛奶、鸡蛋和大米。\"]],\"town\":[[\"The small <b>town</b> lies at the foot of the mountains.\",\"小城镇坐落在山脚下。\"],[\"A new library opened in the center of <b>town</b>.\",\"城镇中心新开了一家图书馆。\"]],\"vegetable\":[[\"Children are encouraged to eat more <b>vegetables</b>.\",\"孩子们被鼓励多吃蔬菜。\"],[\"The market sells fresh <b>vegetables</b> every morning.\",\"市场每天早上卖新鲜蔬菜。\"]],\"wing\":[[\"The bird spread its <b>wings</b> and flew away.\",\"鸟张开翅膀飞走了。\"],[\"The plane's left <b>wing</b> was damaged in the storm.\",\"飞机的左翼在风暴中受损。\"]],\"acute\":[[\"He was rushed to hospital with <b>acute</b> appendicitis.\",\"他因急性阑尾炎被紧急送往医院。\"],[\"<b>Acute</b> pain in the chest should never be ignored.\",\"胸部的急性疼痛绝不能忽视。\"]],\"aloof\":[[\"He seemed <b>aloof</b> at the party and spoke to almost no one.\",\"他在派对上显得冷漠疏远，几乎不跟任何人说话。\"],[\"The manager kept <b>aloof</b> from the argument.\",\"经理对这场争论保持冷漠疏远，不参与。\"]],\"attract\":[[\"The flowers <b>attract</b> bees with their bright colors.\",\"花用鲜艳的颜色吸引蜜蜂。\"],[\"The festival <b>attracts</b> visitors from all over the country.\",\"这个节日吸引全国各地的游客。\"]],\"berserk\":[[\"The bear went <b>berserk</b> after being wounded.\",\"熊受伤后狂怒起来。\"],[\"He went <b>berserk</b> and smashed the furniture.\",\"他狂怒起来，砸坏了家具。\"]],\"blameless\":[[\"The driver was <b>blameless</b>; the accident was caused by ice on the road.\",\"司机无可责备，事故是路面结冰造成的。\"],[\"She lived a quiet, <b>blameless</b> life in the village.\",\"她在村里过着平静、无可责备的生活。\"]],\"bribery\":[[\"The official was arrested for <b>bribery</b> after taking money from a contractor.\",\"这名官员从承包商处收钱后因贿赂被捕。\"],[\"The company has a strict policy against <b>bribery</b>.\",\"公司对贿赂有严格的禁止政策。\"]],\"capitalize\":[[\"The company failed to <b>capitalize</b> on the growing demand for electric cars.\",\"公司没能利用电动汽车不断增长的需求。\"],[\"A good speaker knows how to <b>capitalize</b> on the audience's attention.\",\"好的演讲者知道如何利用听众的注意力。\"]],\"chastise\":[[\"The teacher <b>chastised</b> the students for cheating on the test.\",\"老师惩戒了考试作弊的学生。\"],[\"In the past, children were often <b>chastised</b> for speaking out of turn.\",\"过去，孩子插嘴常会受到惩戒。\"]],\"chestnut\":[[\"Vendors roast <b>chestnuts</b> on street corners in winter.\",\"冬天小贩在街角烤栗子卖。\"],[\"The <b>chestnut</b> tree in the park is over a hundred years old.\",\"公园里的栗子树有一百多年了。\"]],\"chew\":[[\"<b>Chew</b> your food slowly; it helps digestion.\",\"慢慢咀嚼食物，有助于消化。\"],[\"The dog was <b>chewing</b> on an old shoe.\",\"狗在咀嚼一只旧鞋。\"]],\"chief\":[[\"The village <b>chief</b> welcomed the visitors at the gate.\",\"村里的首领在门口迎接来客。\"],[\"She is the <b>chief</b> of the local fire department.\",\"她是当地消防部门的负责人（首领）。\"]],\"computation\":[[\"The <b>computation</b> of the rocket's path took months in the 1950s.\",\"在 20 世纪 50 年代，火箭轨道的计算要花几个月。\"],[\"Modern chips perform billions of <b>computations</b> per second.\",\"现代芯片每秒执行数十亿次计算。\"]],\"confiscate\":[[\"Customs officers <b>confiscated</b> the smuggled goods at the border.\",\"海关人员在边境没收了走私货物。\"],[\"The teacher <b>confiscated</b> the phone until the end of class.\",\"老师没收了手机，下课才归还。\"]],\"correlate\":[[\"In the study, sleep quality <b>correlated</b> strongly with memory scores.\",\"研究中，睡眠质量与记忆分数密切相关。\"],[\"Income and health often <b>correlate</b>, though one does not simply cause the other.\",\"收入与健康常相关，但并非简单的因果关系。\"]],\"delineation\":[[\"The map shows a clear <b>delineation</b> of the border between the two provinces.\",\"地图清楚地描绘出两省之间的边界。\"],[\"Her <b>delineation</b> of the character made him feel real to readers.\",\"她对人物的描绘让读者觉得他栩栩如生。\"]],\"differentiate\":[[\"It is hard to <b>differentiate</b> the twins at first glance.\",\"乍一看很难区分这对双胞胎。\"],[\"One feature that <b>differentiates</b> this species is its striped tail.\",\"条纹尾巴是区分这个物种的一个特征。\"]],\"dioxide\":[[\"Plants absorb carbon <b>dioxide</b> from the air.\",\"植物从空气中吸收二氧化碳。\"],[\"Sulfur <b>dioxide</b> from factories can cause acid rain.\",\"工厂排放的二氧化硫会造成酸雨。\"]],\"documentary\":[[\"We watched a <b>documentary</b> about deep-sea creatures.\",\"我们看了一部关于深海生物的纪录片。\"],[\"The <b>documentary</b> follows a group of climbers for a year.\",\"这部纪录片跟踪了一群登山者整整一年。\"]],\"eligibility\":[[\"Your <b>eligibility</b> for the scholarship depends on your grades.\",\"你是否有资格拿奖学金取决于成绩。\"],[\"The committee checked each applicant's <b>eligibility</b>.\",\"委员会核查了每位申请人的资格。\"]],\"exist\":[[\"Does life <b>exist</b> on other planets?\",\"其他星球上存在生命吗？\"],[\"The custom still <b>exists</b> in a few mountain villages.\",\"这个习俗仍在几个山村存在。\"]],\"fern\":[[\"<b>Ferns</b> grow well in shady, damp places.\",\"蕨类在阴凉潮湿的地方长得好。\"],[\"The forest floor was covered with <b>ferns</b>.\",\"森林地面上长满了蕨类。\"]],\"frog\":[[\"The <b>frog</b> jumped from the leaf into the pond.\",\"青蛙从叶子上跳进池塘。\"],[\"<b>Frogs</b> begin life as tadpoles in the water.\",\"青蛙生命之初是水中的蝌蚪。\"]],\"ideology\":[[\"The two parties differ sharply in <b>ideology</b>.\",\"两党在意识形态上差异很大。\"],[\"The course compares the <b>ideologies</b> behind different economic systems.\",\"这门课比较不同经济制度背后的意识形态。\"]],\"infection\":[[\"Washing your hands helps prevent <b>infection</b>.\",\"洗手有助于预防感染。\"],[\"The wound showed signs of <b>infection</b> and needed antibiotics.\",\"伤口出现感染迹象，需要用抗生素。\"]],\"inventor\":[[\"Thomas Edison is remembered as the <b>inventor</b> of the practical light bulb.\",\"托马斯·爱迪生被铭记为实用电灯泡的发明家。\"],[\"The young <b>inventor</b> presented her solar cooker at the science fair.\",\"年轻的发明家在科学展上展示了她的太阳能炊具。\"]],\"journalist\":[[\"The <b>journalist</b> interviewed residents after the flood.\",\"记者在洪水后采访了居民。\"],[\"A good <b>journalist</b> checks every fact twice.\",\"好记者把每个事实核查两遍。\"]],\"limestone\":[[\"Many caves form in <b>limestone</b> when water dissolves the rock.\",\"许多洞穴是水溶解石灰石形成的。\"],[\"The cathedral was built from local <b>limestone</b>.\",\"大教堂用当地的石灰石建造。\"]],\"lunar\":[[\"The <b>lunar</b> surface is covered with craters.\",\"月亮的（月球）表面布满环形山。\"],[\"A <b>lunar</b> eclipse occurs when Earth blocks sunlight from reaching the moon.\",\"当地球挡住射向月球的阳光时，就发生月食。\"]],\"mental\":[[\"Regular exercise benefits both physical and <b>mental</b> health.\",\"规律运动有益身体和精神（心理）健康。\"],[\"The puzzle requires <b>mental</b> effort rather than strength.\",\"这道谜题需要动脑（脑力努力）而非体力。\"]],\"mercury\":[[\"Old thermometers contained <b>mercury</b>, a toxic liquid metal.\",\"旧温度计含有汞，一种有毒的液态金属。\"],[\"Workers must handle <b>mercury</b> with great care because it is poisonous.\",\"工人处理汞必须格外小心，因为它有毒。\"]],\"metabolism\":[[\"Exercise speeds up your <b>metabolism</b>.\",\"运动能加快新陈代谢。\"],[\"As people age, their <b>metabolism</b> tends to slow down.\",\"随着年龄增长，人的新陈代谢往往变慢。\"]],\"nightstand\":[[\"She keeps a lamp and a book on her <b>nightstand</b>.\",\"她的床头柜上放着一盏灯和一本书。\"],[\"He set his alarm clock on the <b>nightstand</b>.\",\"他把闹钟放在床头柜上。\"]],\"nurse\":[[\"The <b>nurse</b> checked the patient's temperature every hour.\",\"护士每小时给病人量一次体温。\"],[\"He trained as a <b>nurse</b> and works in a children's hospital.\",\"他受训成为护士，在儿童医院工作。\"]],\"offspring\":[[\"A female salmon can produce thousands of <b>offspring</b> in one season.\",\"一条雌鲑鱼一个季节能产下数千后代。\"],[\"The lioness protects her <b>offspring</b> from other predators.\",\"母狮保护她的后代免受其他掠食者伤害。\"]],\"peek\":[[\"The child <b>peeked</b> through the curtain at the party below.\",\"孩子透过窗帘偷看楼下的派对。\"],[\"Don't <b>peek</b> at the answers before you finish the test.\",\"做完测试前不要偷看答案。\"]],\"plasma\":[[\"<b>Plasma</b> makes up more than half of human blood.\",\"血浆占人类血液的一半以上。\"],[\"The patient was given <b>plasma</b> after losing a lot of blood.\",\"病人失血过多后输了血浆。\"]],\"plate\":[[\"She put a slice of cake on each <b>plate</b>.\",\"她在每个盘子里放了一块蛋糕。\"],[\"The waiter carried a stack of clean <b>plates</b> to the kitchen.\",\"服务员把一摞干净盘子端回厨房。\"]],\"republic\":[[\"France is a <b>republic</b> whose president is elected by the people.\",\"法国是共和国，总统由人民选举产生。\"],[\"The country became a <b>republic</b> after the monarchy ended.\",\"君主制结束后，这个国家成为共和国。\"]],\"reward\":[[\"The company offers a <b>reward</b> for information about the theft.\",\"公司为提供盗窃线索的人提供奖励。\"],[\"Hard work is its own <b>reward</b>.\",\"努力本身就是奖励。\"]],\"running\":[[\"She goes <b>running</b> along the river every evening.\",\"她每晚沿河跑步。\"],[\"<b>Running</b> is one of the simplest forms of exercise.\",\"跑步是最简单的运动方式之一。\"]],\"soap\":[[\"Wash the grease off with hot water and <b>soap</b>.\",\"用热水和肥皂把油污洗掉。\"],[\"This <b>soap</b> is made with olive oil and herbs.\",\"这块肥皂用橄榄油和草药制成。\"]],\"sovereignty\":[[\"The treaty recognized the new nation's <b>sovereignty</b>.\",\"条约承认了这个新国家的主权。\"],[\"Control over its borders is a basic part of state <b>sovereignty</b>.\",\"对边境的控制是国家主权的基本组成部分。\"]],\"storm\":[[\"The <b>storm</b> knocked down trees and power lines.\",\"暴风雨刮倒了树木和电线。\"],[\"Fishermen stayed in port until the <b>storm</b> passed.\",\"渔民待在港口，直到暴风雨过去。\"]],\"subconscious\":[[\"In the experiment, <b>subconscious</b> cues influenced which product people chose.\",\"实验中，潜意识的暗示影响了人们选择哪种产品。\"],[\"His fear of water was <b>subconscious</b>; he could not explain it himself.\",\"他对水的恐惧是潜意识的，他自己也说不清。\"]],\"terrorism\":[[\"The lecture examined the causes of international <b>terrorism</b>.\",\"讲座分析了国际恐怖主义的成因。\"],[\"Governments cooperate to share information about <b>terrorism</b>.\",\"各国政府合作共享有关恐怖主义的信息。\"]],\"tin\":[[\"The cans are made of steel coated with a thin layer of <b>tin</b>.\",\"罐头盒用镀了一层薄锡的钢制成。\"],[\"<b>Tin</b> melts at a relatively low temperature.\",\"锡在相对较低的温度下熔化。\"]],\"toothpaste\":[[\"He squeezed a pea-sized amount of <b>toothpaste</b> onto the brush.\",\"他往牙刷上挤了豌豆大小的牙膏。\"],[\"This <b>toothpaste</b> contains fluoride to protect against cavities.\",\"这款牙膏含氟，能防蛀牙。\"]],\"trumpet\":[[\"The <b>trumpet</b> opens the piece with a bright fanfare.\",\"小号以明亮的号声开启乐曲。\"],[\"He has played the <b>trumpet</b> in the school band for three years.\",\"他在学校乐队吹小号已经三年了。\"]],\"veterinary\":[[\"She studies <b>veterinary</b> medicine and hopes to work with horses.\",\"她学兽医学，希望将来从事马匹相关工作。\"],[\"The dog was taken to a <b>veterinary</b> clinic for its vaccinations.\",\"狗被带到兽医诊所打疫苗。\"]],\"wifi\":[[\"The café offers free <b>Wi-Fi</b> to customers.\",\"这家咖啡馆为顾客提供免费无线网络。\"],[\"The <b>Wi-Fi</b> signal is weak in the basement.\",\"地下室的无线网络信号很弱。\"]],\"fog\":[[\"Thick <b>fog</b> covered the harbor, and the ferry did not leave until noon.\",\"浓雾笼罩着港口，渡轮直到中午才出发。\"],[\"Drivers slowed down because the <b>fog</b> made it hard to see the road ahead.\",\"司机们放慢了车速，因为雾使人很难看清前方的路。\"]],\"skull\":[[\"The fossil <b>skull</b> shows that this early human had a much smaller brain case than ours.\",\"这块头骨化石显示，这种早期人类的脑容量比我们小得多。\"],[\"He fractured his <b>skull</b> in the fall and was kept in hospital for observation.\",\"他摔倒时头骨骨折，被留在医院观察。\"]],\"fridge\":[[\"Put the milk back in the <b>fridge</b> so it does not spoil.\",\"把牛奶放回冰箱，免得坏掉。\"],[\"Leftovers will keep for two days in the <b>fridge</b>, but they should be frozen after that.\",\"剩菜在冰箱里能放两天，之后就该冷冻了。\"]],\"innovate\":[[\"Small companies often <b>innovate</b> faster because they have fewer rules to follow.\",\"小公司往往改革得更快，因为它们要遵守的条条框框更少。\"],[\"The school <b>innovated</b> by letting students design part of the course themselves.\",\"这所学校进行了改革，让学生自己设计一部分课程。\"]],\"greenhouse\":[[\"Tomatoes ripen weeks earlier inside a <b>greenhouse</b> than outdoors.\",\"温室里的西红柿比露天的早熟好几周。\"],[\"The botanical garden's <b>greenhouse</b> keeps tropical plants alive through the winter.\",\"植物园的温室让热带植物能熬过冬天。\"]],\"nurture\":[[\"In the nature-versus-<b>nurture</b> debate, <b>nurture</b> refers to upbringing and environment rather than genes.\",\"在先天与后天的争论中，后天培养指的是养育和环境，而不是基因。\"],[\"Good teachers <b>nurture</b> curiosity by letting children ask questions freely.\",\"好老师通过让孩子自由提问来培养他们的好奇心。\"]],\"protest\":[[\"Thousands joined the <b>protest</b> outside city hall against the new tax.\",\"数千人参加了市政厅外反对新税的抗议。\"],[\"Workers <b>protested</b> when the factory announced longer hours without extra pay.\",\"工厂宣布延长工时却不加薪时，工人们提出了抗议。\"]],\"reality\":[[\"In <b>reality</b>, the journey takes six hours, not the three shown on the map.\",\"实际上，这段路要走六个小时，而不是地图上标的三个小时。\"],[\"The film blurs the line between dream and <b>reality</b>.\",\"这部电影模糊了梦境与现实之间的界限。\"]],\"bureaucracy\":[[\"Getting a building permit meant weeks of dealing with the local <b>bureaucracy</b>.\",\"办一张建筑许可证，意味着要和当地官僚机构打好几周交道。\"],[\"Critics say the <b>bureaucracy</b> spends too much time on paperwork and too little on decisions.\",\"批评者说，这个官僚机构把太多时间花在文书上，花在决策上的太少。\"]],\"temple\":[[\"Visitors must cover their shoulders before entering the <b>temple</b>.\",\"进入寺庙前，参观者必须遮住肩膀。\"],[\"The ancient <b>temple</b> was built on a hill overlooking the river.\",\"这座古寺建在俯瞰河流的小山上。\"]],\"marathon\":[[\"She trained for six months before running her first <b>marathon</b>.\",\"她训练了六个月，才跑了人生第一场马拉松。\"],[\"The city <b>marathon</b> closes the main roads to traffic every spring.\",\"这座城市的马拉松比赛每年春天都会封闭主要道路。\"]],\"system\":[[\"The city's transport <b>system</b> carries two million passengers a day.\",\"这座城市的交通系统每天运送两百万乘客。\"],[\"Our solar <b>system</b> has eight planets orbiting the Sun.\",\"我们的太阳系有八颗行星绕太阳运行。\"]],\"sketch\":[[\"The artist made a quick pencil <b>sketch</b> of the harbour before starting the painting.\",\"画家在动笔作画前，先用铅笔快速勾了一幅港口的素描。\"],[\"He <b>sketched</b> the layout of the room on the back of an envelope.\",\"他在信封背面草草画出了房间的布局图。\"]],\"relevant\":[[\"Please attach only documents that are <b>relevant</b> to your application.\",\"请只附上与你的申请相关的文件。\"],[\"Her experience in marine biology is directly <b>relevant</b> to this research project.\",\"她在海洋生物学方面的经验与这个研究项目直接相关。\"]],\"dissent\":[[\"There was strong <b>dissent</b> within the committee over the new policy.\",\"委员会内部对新政策有强烈的异议。\"],[\"Two judges wrote opinions expressing their <b>dissent</b> from the majority decision.\",\"两位法官写下了意见书，表达了他们对多数裁决的异议。\"]],\"aging\":[[\"Regular exercise can slow the <b>aging</b> of muscles and bones.\",\"经常锻炼能减缓肌肉和骨骼的老化。\"],[\"Japan has an <b>aging</b> population, with more and more people over eighty.\",\"日本人口正在老化，八十岁以上的人越来越多。\"]],\"constellation\":[[\"Orion is an easy <b>constellation</b> to spot on clear winter nights.\",\"猎户座是在晴朗冬夜里很容易找到的星座。\"],[\"Ancient sailors used <b>constellations</b> to navigate across open seas.\",\"古代水手靠星座在大海上航行定位。\"]],\"ohm\":[[\"Resistance is measured in <b>ohms</b>, named after the physicist Georg Ohm.\",\"电阻以欧姆为单位，得名于物理学家格奥尔格·欧姆。\"],[\"This resistor is rated at 100 <b>ohms</b>.\",\"这个电阻器的阻值是 100 欧姆。\"]],\"discus\":[[\"He won gold in the <b>discus</b> with a throw of over sixty metres.\",\"他以六十多米的成绩赢得了铁饼金牌。\"],[\"In the <b>discus</b> throw, athletes spin around before releasing the disc.\",\"在掷铁饼项目中，运动员先旋转身体再把铁饼掷出。\"]],\"aerobics\":[[\"She teaches an <b>aerobics</b> class at the gym three mornings a week.\",\"她每周三个上午在健身房教有氧运动课。\"],[\"<b>Aerobics</b> improves heart health because it keeps the heart rate up for a long stretch.\",\"有氧运动能改善心脏健康，因为它让心率长时间保持在较高水平。\"]],\"bleak\":[[\"The village sits on a <b>bleak</b> hillside where almost nothing grows.\",\"村子坐落在一片荒凉的山坡上，那里几乎什么都长不出来。\"],[\"After the factory closed, the town's future looked <b>bleak</b>.\",\"工厂关闭后，这个镇子的前景显得十分黯淡。\"]],\"school\":[[\"The <b>school</b> is a ten-minute walk from our house.\",\"学校离我家步行十分钟。\"],[\"Children in this village start <b>school</b> at the age of five.\",\"这个村子的孩子五岁开始上学。\"]],\"path\":[[\"A narrow <b>path</b> leads from the village down to the river.\",\"一条狭窄的小径从村子通向河边。\"],[\"Follow the <b>path</b> through the woods and you will reach the lake.\",\"沿着穿过树林的小径走，就能到湖边。\"]],\"accelerate\":[[\"The car <b>accelerated</b> as it merged onto the highway.\",\"汽车并入高速公路时加速了。\"],[\"Rising temperatures are <b>accelerating</b> the melting of the glaciers.\",\"气温上升正在加速冰川的融化。\"]],\"cure\":[[\"Doctors still have not found a <b>cure</b> for the common cold.\",\"医生至今还没有找到治愈普通感冒的方法。\"],[\"The new treatment <b>cured</b> most patients within two weeks.\",\"这种新疗法在两周内治愈了大多数病人。\"]],\"mango\":[[\"She cut the ripe <b>mango</b> into cubes and added it to the salad.\",\"她把熟芒果切成丁，加进沙拉里。\"],[\"<b>Mango</b> trees grow best in hot, frost-free climates.\",\"芒果树在炎热、无霜的气候里长得最好。\"]],\"contest\":[[\"He won first prize in the national speech <b>contest</b>.\",\"他在全国演讲竞赛中获得了一等奖。\"],[\"Twenty choirs entered this year's singing <b>contest</b>.\",\"二十支合唱团参加了今年的歌唱竞赛。\"]],\"director\":[[\"The <b>director</b> shot the final scene in a single take.\",\"导演把最后一场戏一条就拍完了。\"],[\"As a young <b>director</b>, she is known for filming on real locations instead of in studios.\",\"作为一名年轻导演，她以实地取景、不用摄影棚而闻名。\"]],\"glass\":[[\"She poured him a <b>glass</b> of orange juice.\",\"她给他倒了一玻璃杯橙汁。\"],[\"He raised his <b>glass</b> and wished everyone good health.\",\"他举起玻璃杯，祝大家身体健康。\"]],\"harmonica\":[[\"He pulled a <b>harmonica</b> from his pocket and played a slow blues tune.\",\"他从口袋里掏出口琴，吹了一首舒缓的布鲁斯。\"],[\"The <b>harmonica</b> is small enough to carry anywhere, which is why soldiers took it to war.\",\"口琴小到可以随身携带，所以士兵们曾把它带上战场。\"]],\"designer\":[[\"The <b>designer</b> showed her new collection at Paris Fashion Week.\",\"这位设计师在巴黎时装周上展示了她的新系列。\"],[\"As an industrial <b>designer</b>, he draws the shape of products before engineers build them.\",\"作为工业设计师，他先画出产品的外形，工程师再照着做出来。\"]],\"glance\":[[\"She <b>glanced</b> at the clock and realized she was late.\",\"她瞥了一眼钟，发现自己迟到了。\"],[\"He took a quick <b>glance</b> at the map, then folded it away.\",\"他快速瞥了一眼地图，然后把它收了起来。\"]],\"bookish\":[[\"The <b>bookish</b> boy spent his lunch breaks in the library instead of the playground.\",\"这个书呆子气的男孩午休时间泡在图书馆里，而不是去操场。\"],[\"Her <b>bookish</b> speech, full of quotations, sounded odd at a football match.\",\"她那满是引经据典的书呆子气的讲话，在足球赛上听起来很不合时宜。\"]],\"incentive\":[[\"The government offers tax breaks as an <b>incentive</b> to buy electric cars.\",\"政府提供税收减免，作为刺激人们购买电动汽车的措施。\"],[\"Without any <b>incentive</b> to save water, households kept using as much as before.\",\"没有任何节水刺激措施，居民用水量和以前一样多。\"]],\"law\":[[\"A new <b>law</b> bans smoking in all public buildings.\",\"一项新法律禁止在所有公共建筑内吸烟。\"],[\"Under the <b>law</b>, drivers must stop for pedestrians at crossings.\",\"根据法律，司机必须在人行横道前为行人停车。\"]],\"mutation\":[[\"A single <b>mutation</b> in this gene can make the bacteria resistant to antibiotics.\",\"这个基因里的一个突变，就能让细菌对抗生素产生耐药性。\"],[\"Most <b>mutations</b> are harmless, but a few change how a protein works.\",\"大多数突变是无害的，但少数会改变蛋白质的工作方式。\"]],\"ability\":[[\"Reading has the <b>ability</b> to change how we see the world.\",\"阅读有改变我们看世界方式的能力。\"],[\"The test measures students' <b>ability</b> to solve problems, not just to memorize facts.\",\"这场考试测的是学生解决问题的能力，而不只是背事实的能力。\"]],\"attribute\":[[\"Scientists <b>attribute</b> the decline in bees to pesticide use and habitat loss.\",\"科学家把蜜蜂数量下降归因于农药使用和栖息地丧失。\"],[\"She <b>attributes</b> her success to hard work rather than talent.\",\"她把自己的成功归因于努力，而不是天赋。\"]],\"cork\":[[\"He <b>corked</b> the half-finished bottle and put it back in the cellar.\",\"他把喝了一半的酒瓶塞住，放回酒窖。\"],[\"Make sure you <b>cork</b> the bottle tightly, or the wine will turn to vinegar.\",\"一定要把瓶子塞紧，不然酒会变成醋。\"]],\"college\":[[\"She was the first in her family to go to <b>college</b>.\",\"她是家里第一个上学院（大学）的人。\"],[\"The <b>college</b> offers courses in both science and the arts.\",\"这所学院既开理科课程，也开文科课程。\"]],\"sofa\":[[\"They bought a leather <b>sofa</b> big enough for the whole family.\",\"他们买了一张大到能坐下全家人的皮沙发。\"],[\"The cat sleeps on the arm of the <b>sofa</b> every afternoon.\",\"猫每天下午都睡在沙发的扶手上。\"]],\"quarantine\":[[\"Passengers with symptoms were placed in <b>quarantine</b> for fourteen days.\",\"出现症状的乘客被隔离了十四天。\"],[\"The dog was kept in <b>quarantine</b> after arriving from abroad.\",\"这条狗从国外抵达后被隔离了一段时间。\"]],\"hyena\":[[\"A spotted <b>hyena</b>'s laugh-like call can be heard kilometres away.\",\"斑鬣狗那像笑声一样的叫声，几公里外都能听见。\"],[\"<b>Hyenas</b> hunt in groups but also scavenge what lions leave behind.\",\"鬣狗成群猎食，也会捡狮子剩下的食物。\"]],\"goat\":[[\"The <b>goat</b> climbed onto the rock to reach the leaves.\",\"山羊爬上岩石去够树叶。\"],[\"Mountain <b>goats</b> can keep their footing on cliffs that look almost vertical.\",\"野山羊能在近乎垂直的悬崖上站稳脚跟。\"]],\"newspaper\":[[\"He reads the <b>newspaper</b> on the train every morning.\",\"他每天早上在火车上看报纸。\"],[\"The local <b>newspaper</b> reported the fire on its front page.\",\"当地报纸在头版报道了这场火灾。\"]],\"limp\":[[\"After twisting his ankle, he <b>limped</b> off the field.\",\"扭伤脚踝后，他一瘸一拐地走下了赛场。\"],[\"The injured dog <b>limps</b> whenever the weather turns cold.\",\"这条受伤的狗每逢天冷就会跛行。\"]],\"machine\":[[\"This <b>machine</b> washes and dries clothes in a single cycle.\",\"这台机器能在一个程序里把衣服洗好又烘干。\"],[\"Factories replaced hand looms with <b>machines</b> that could weave much faster.\",\"工厂用织得快得多的机器取代了手工织机。\"]],\"involve\":[[\"The project will <b>involve</b> researchers from six different universities.\",\"这个项目将包含来自六所不同大学的研究人员。\"],[\"Building the bridge <b>involved</b> years of planning before any construction began.\",\"修这座桥在动工前包含了多年的规划工作。\"]],\"forehead\":[[\"She wiped the sweat from her <b>forehead</b> and kept running.\",\"她擦掉前额的汗，继续跑。\"],[\"He has a small scar on his <b>forehead</b> from a childhood fall.\",\"他前额上有一道小时候摔伤留下的小疤。\"]],\"automate\":[[\"The factory <b>automated</b> its packing line, so boxes are now sealed by robots.\",\"工厂使包装线自动化了，现在纸箱由机器人封口。\"],[\"Software can <b>automate</b> routine tasks such as renaming hundreds of files.\",\"软件能使重命名几百个文件这类日常任务自动化。\"]],\"whale\":[[\"The blue <b>whale</b> is the largest animal that has ever lived on Earth.\",\"蓝鲸是地球上有史以来最大的动物。\"],[\"<b>Whales</b> communicate over long distances with low-frequency sounds.\",\"鲸用低频声音进行远距离交流。\"]],\"chimpanzee\":[[\"The <b>chimpanzee</b> used a stick to pull termites out of the mound.\",\"黑猩猩用一根树枝把白蚁从蚁丘里掏出来。\"],[\"<b>Chimpanzees</b> share about 98 percent of their DNA with humans.\",\"黑猩猩与人类约有 98% 的 DNA 相同。\"]],\"prison\":[[\"He spent ten years in <b>prison</b> for the robbery.\",\"他因抢劫在监狱里待了十年。\"],[\"The old <b>prison</b> has been turned into a museum.\",\"这座旧监狱已经被改成了博物馆。\"]],\"peach\":[[\"She bit into a ripe <b>peach</b> and the juice ran down her hand.\",\"她咬了一口熟桃子，汁水顺着手流了下来。\"],[\"<b>Peach</b> trees blossom early in spring, before their leaves appear.\",\"桃树在早春先开花，然后才长叶子。\"]],\"traditional\":[[\"They served a <b>traditional</b> meal of roast lamb and flatbread.\",\"他们上了一顿传统的餐食：烤羊肉配大饼。\"],[\"<b>Traditional</b> farming methods used no chemical fertilizers at all.\",\"传统农耕方法完全不用化肥。\"]],\"cling\":[[\"Wet leaves <b>clung</b> to the soles of his shoes.\",\"湿树叶粘在他鞋底上。\"],[\"The child <b>clung</b> to her mother's hand in the crowded station.\",\"孩子在拥挤的车站里紧紧粘着妈妈的手不放。\"]],\"adjacency\":[[\"The <b>adjacency</b> of the school to the park makes outdoor lessons easy.\",\"学校与公园的邻近，让户外课很容易安排。\"],[\"In the diagram, <b>adjacency</b> is shown by drawing the two rooms side by side.\",\"在示意图里，两间屋子画在一起，表示它们的邻近关系。\"]],\"petition\":[[\"Residents signed a <b>petition</b> asking the council not to close the library.\",\"居民们在一份请愿书上签名，要求市政会不要关闭图书馆。\"],[\"The workers presented their <b>petition</b> for safer conditions to the factory owners.\",\"工人们把要求改善安全条件的请愿书递给了工厂主。\"]],\"congress\":[[\"<b>Congress</b> passed the new healthcare bill after a long debate.\",\"国会经过长时间辩论后通过了新的医疗法案。\"],[\"The president asked <b>Congress</b> for more money for disaster relief.\",\"总统向国会申请更多救灾资金。\"]],\"array\":[[\"The roof carries an <b>array</b> of solar panels facing south.\",\"屋顶上装着一排朝南的太阳能电池板阵列。\"],[\"Shops displayed an <b>array</b> of cheeses from all over the country.\",\"商店里陈列着来自全国各地的各种奶酪，排成一阵列。\"]],\"embrace\":[[\"She <b>embraced</b> her brother at the airport after two years apart.\",\"时隔两年，她在机场拥抱了弟弟。\"],[\"Old friends <b>embrace</b> warmly whenever they meet again.\",\"老朋友每次重逢都会热情拥抱。\"]],\"nursing\":[[\"She chose <b>nursing</b> because she wanted work that directly helps patients.\",\"她选择护理学，是因为她想做直接帮助病人的工作。\"],[\"The university's <b>nursing</b> program includes a year of hospital placements.\",\"这所大学的护理学专业包含一年的医院实习。\"]],\"zucchini\":[[\"Slice the <b>zucchini</b> and fry it with garlic and olive oil.\",\"把夏南瓜切片，用大蒜和橄榄油煎。\"],[\"<b>Zucchini</b> plants produce so much fruit that gardeners give much of it away.\",\"夏南瓜结得太多，种菜的人会把很多送人。\"]],\"refraction\":[[\"<b>Refraction</b> makes a straw look bent where it enters the water.\",\"折射让吸管在入水处看起来是弯的。\"],[\"The bending of light by <b>refraction</b> is what allows lenses to focus images.\",\"光的折射弯曲正是透镜能够聚焦成像的原因。\"]],\"delusion\":[[\"He lived under the <b>delusion</b> that everyone at work was plotting against him.\",\"他活在一种妄想里，以为公司里人人都在算计他。\"],[\"It would be a <b>delusion</b> to think one speech could end the conflict overnight.\",\"以为一场演讲就能一夜结束冲突，那是妄想。\"]],\"agile\":[[\"The <b>agile</b> cat leapt from the fence onto the roof in one movement.\",\"那只敏捷的猫一跃就从栅栏跳上了屋顶。\"],[\"Gymnasts must be both strong and <b>agile</b>.\",\"体操运动员既要有力量，也要敏捷。\"]],\"sea\":[[\"The town faces the <b>sea</b>, and most families there fish for a living.\",\"小镇面朝大海，大多数人家以捕鱼为生。\"],[\"After weeks at <b>sea</b>, the crew were glad to reach land.\",\"在海上漂了几周后，船员们很高兴终于靠岸。\"]],\"rainforest\":[[\"The Amazon <b>rainforest</b> produces a large share of the world's oxygen.\",\"亚马孙雨林产生了世界上很大一部分氧气。\"],[\"In a tropical <b>rainforest</b>, rain falls almost every afternoon.\",\"在热带雨林里，几乎每天下午都会下雨。\"]],\"maintenance\":[[\"Regular <b>maintenance</b> keeps the bridge safe for heavy traffic.\",\"定期维护让这座桥能安全承受繁忙交通。\"],[\"The building's <b>maintenance</b> costs rise as the lifts and pipes get older.\",\"随着电梯和管道老化，这栋楼的维护费用不断上升。\"]],\"source\":[[\"The river's <b>source</b> is a spring high in the mountains.\",\"这条河的来源是高山上的一眼泉水。\"],[\"Historians check every <b>source</b> before trusting an old account.\",\"历史学家在相信一份旧记载之前，会核查每一个来源。\"]],\"clown\":[[\"The <b>clown</b> made balloon animals for the children at the party.\",\"小丑在派对上给孩子们用气球做小动物。\"],[\"He felt like a <b>clown</b> wearing such a bright suit to a formal dinner.\",\"穿着这么鲜艳的西装去正式晚宴，他觉得自己像个小丑。\"]],\"estuary\":[[\"Salmon swim up the <b>estuary</b> when the tide comes in.\",\"涨潮时，鲑鱼游进河口湾。\"],[\"An <b>estuary</b>, where river water mixes with seawater, is rich in young fish.\",\"河口湾里河水与海水混合，是幼鱼丰富的栖息地。\"]],\"tablet\":[[\"The law was carved into a clay <b>tablet</b> over four thousand years ago.\",\"这部法律在四千多年前被刻在一块泥板上。\"],[\"Museum staff photographed each <b>tablet</b> before translating its cuneiform text.\",\"博物馆工作人员先给每块泥板拍照，再翻译上面的楔形文字。\"]],\"conscious\":[[\"She was <b>conscious</b> of being the only new student in the class.\",\"她意识到自己是班里唯一的新生。\"],[\"Patients remain <b>conscious</b> during this operation but feel no pain.\",\"做这个手术时病人保持有意识，但感觉不到疼痛。\"]],\"eyesight\":[[\"His <b>eyesight</b> worsened after years of reading in poor light.\",\"多年在昏暗光线下看书后，他的视力变差了。\"],[\"Pilots must have excellent <b>eyesight</b> to keep their licence.\",\"飞行员必须有出色的视力才能保住执照。\"]],\"attic\":[[\"They store old furniture and winter clothes in the <b>attic</b>.\",\"他们把旧家具和冬衣存放在阁楼里。\"],[\"The <b>attic</b> room has a small round window under the roof.\",\"阁楼房间在屋顶下有一扇小圆窗。\"]],\"phenomenon\":[[\"Lightning is a natural <b>phenomenon</b> caused by electric charge building up in clouds.\",\"闪电是一种自然现象，由云层中电荷积聚引起。\"],[\"The rapid growth of online learning is a recent <b>phenomenon</b>.\",\"在线学习的快速增长是近来的一个现象。\"]],\"downtown\":[[\"They live <b>downtown</b>, within walking distance of the station.\",\"他们住在市中心，离车站步行可达。\"],[\"The <b>downtown</b> area is full of offices, theatres and coffee shops.\",\"市中心一带满是办公室、剧院和咖啡馆。\"]],\"bang\":[[\"He <b>banged</b> the door shut behind him.\",\"他砰地一声把门猛击关上。\"],[\"The pot fell off the counter with a loud <b>bang</b>.\",\"锅从台面上掉下来，发出一声猛击般的巨响。\"]],\"eyeball\":[[\"Dust got into his eye and scratched the surface of the <b>eyeball</b>.\",\"灰尘进了他的眼睛，划伤了眼球表面。\"],[\"The doctor shone a light into her eye to examine the <b>eyeball</b>.\",\"医生用灯照她的眼睛，检查眼球。\"]],\"cornea\":[[\"Light enters the eye through the clear <b>cornea</b> at the front.\",\"光线穿过眼睛前部透明的角膜进入眼内。\"],[\"A scratched <b>cornea</b> is painful but usually heals within a few days.\",\"角膜划伤很疼，但通常几天就能愈合。\"]],\"expose\":[[\"Do not <b>expose</b> the film to direct sunlight, or the photos will be ruined.\",\"不要把胶片暴露在直射阳光下，否则照片就毁了。\"],[\"The report <b>exposed</b> serious safety problems at the factory.\",\"这份报告暴露了工厂严重的安全问题。\"]],\"derivative\":[[\"The drug is a <b>derivative</b> of a compound found in tree bark.\",\"这种药是树皮中一种化合物的衍生物。\"],[\"Many English words are <b>derivatives</b> of Latin roots.\",\"许多英语单词是拉丁词根的衍生物。\"]],\"adoption\":[[\"The couple began the <b>adoption</b> process two years before bringing their daughter home.\",\"这对夫妇在把女儿接回家两年前就开始办收养手续了。\"],[\"After its <b>adoption</b> by the council, the new plan took effect immediately.\",\"新方案被市政会采纳后立即生效。\"]],\"anthropology\":[[\"<b>Anthropology</b> studies how human societies and customs develop over time.\",\"人类学研究人类社会和习俗如何随时间发展。\"],[\"She did fieldwork in Peru as part of her <b>anthropology</b> degree.\",\"她在秘鲁做田野调查，这是她人类学学位的一部分。\"]],\"dynasty\":[[\"The Tang <b>dynasty</b> is remembered for its poetry and open trade.\",\"唐朝以诗歌和开放贸易而被铭记。\"],[\"The <b>dynasty</b> ruled the country for more than three hundred years.\",\"这个王朝统治该国三百多年。\"]],\"exclude\":[[\"The price <b>excludes</b> flights, which must be booked separately.\",\"这个价格不包含机票，机票需另行预订。\"],[\"Students felt <b>excluded</b> when the discussion was held only in a language they did not speak.\",\"讨论只用他们不会的语言进行时，学生们感到被排除在外。\"]],\"assemble\":[[\"Workers <b>assemble</b> the cars from parts made in three countries.\",\"工人们用三个国家生产的零件来集合组装汽车。\"],[\"The whole school <b>assembled</b> in the hall for the morning announcement.\",\"全校在礼堂集合，听晨间通知。\"]],\"explorer\":[[\"The <b>explorer</b> mapped rivers that no European had recorded before.\",\"这位探险家绘制了此前没有欧洲人记录过的河流地图。\"],[\"Early <b>explorers</b> crossed the Pacific in small wooden ships.\",\"早期的探险家乘着小木船横渡太平洋。\"]],\"chime\":[[\"The church bells <b>chime</b> every hour, and you can hear them across the valley.\",\"教堂的钟每小时鸣钟一次，整个山谷都能听见。\"],[\"At midnight the clock began to <b>chime</b>, and the party fell silent.\",\"午夜时分，时钟开始鸣钟，派对安静了下来。\"]],\"smuggling\":[[\"Customs officers found gold hidden in the truck and charged the driver with <b>smuggling</b>.\",\"海关人员在卡车里发现藏匿的黄金，以走私罪起诉了司机。\"],[\"<b>Smuggling</b> across the border fell sharply after new scanners were installed.\",\"安装新扫描仪后，边境走私大幅减少。\"]],\"hemisphere\":[[\"Australia lies entirely in the southern <b>hemisphere</b>.\",\"澳大利亚完全位于南半球。\"],[\"The left <b>hemisphere</b> of the brain controls the right side of the body.\",\"大脑的左半球控制身体的右侧。\"]],\"acceptance\":[[\"Her <b>acceptance</b> letter from the university arrived in March.\",\"她三月份收到了大学的录取接受通知。\"],[\"Public <b>acceptance</b> of the vaccine grew as the safety data came in.\",\"随着安全数据公布，公众对疫苗的接受程度提高了。\"]],\"picnic\":[[\"They had a <b>picnic</b> by the lake and stayed until sunset.\",\"他们在湖边野餐，一直待到日落。\"],[\"Rain ruined our <b>picnic</b> plans, so we ate indoors instead.\",\"雨毁了我们的野餐计划，于是改在室内吃。\"]],\"equate\":[[\"You cannot <b>equate</b> working long hours with working well.\",\"你不能把工作时间长等同于工作做得好。\"],[\"The report <b>equates</b> wealth with happiness, which many readers questioned.\",\"这份报告把财富等同于幸福，许多读者对此表示质疑。\"]],\"antagonist\":[[\"In the novel, the <b>antagonist</b> is a landlord who tries to drive the family off their land.\",\"小说里的反派是一个想把这家人赶出土地的地主。\"],[\"A good <b>antagonist</b> makes the hero's choices harder, not just louder.\",\"一个好的反派会让主人公的选择更艰难，而不只是更热闹。\"]],\"browser\":[[\"This website does not work properly in older <b>browsers</b>.\",\"这个网站在旧版浏览器里无法正常运行。\"],[\"She opened the <b>browser</b> and typed in the address of the library catalogue.\",\"她打开浏览器，输入了图书馆目录的网址。\"]],\"brand\":[[\"This <b>brand</b> of coffee is sold in over forty countries.\",\"这个品牌的咖啡销往四十多个国家。\"],[\"Shoppers often trust a familiar <b>brand</b> more than a cheaper unknown one.\",\"购物者往往更信任熟悉的品牌，而不是更便宜的无名产品。\"]],\"ridge\":[[\"The trail follows the <b>ridge</b>, with valleys dropping away on both sides.\",\"小路沿着山脊走，两边都是陡然下坠的山谷。\"],[\"From the <b>ridge</b> we could see the sea in the distance.\",\"从山脊上，我们能望见远处的大海。\"]],\"architect\":[[\"The <b>architect</b> designed the museum so that daylight reaches every gallery.\",\"建筑师把博物馆设计成让日光能照到每个展厅。\"],[\"As the project's <b>architect</b>, she drew up both the plans and the budget.\",\"作为这个项目的建筑师，她既画图纸又做预算。\"]],\"syllabus\":[[\"The <b>syllabus</b> lists every reading you must finish this term.\",\"教学大纲列出了这学期必须读完的所有材料。\"],[\"Teachers met to revise the history <b>syllabus</b> for next year.\",\"老师们开会修订下一年的历史教学大纲。\"]],\"mixture\":[[\"Concrete is a <b>mixture</b> of cement, sand and water.\",\"混凝土是水泥、沙子和水的混合物。\"],[\"The paint is a <b>mixture</b> of blue and green pigments.\",\"这种颜料是蓝色和绿色颜料的混合物。\"]],\"integrity\":[[\"The judge was known for his honesty and <b>integrity</b>.\",\"这位法官以诚实和诚信著称。\"],[\"Voters questioned the candidate's <b>integrity</b> after the scandal.\",\"丑闻之后，选民质疑这位候选人的诚信。\"]],\"enlargement\":[[\"The photo <b>enlargement</b> shows details that are invisible in the original print.\",\"这张放大照片显示出原片上看不见的细节。\"],[\"Doctors found an <b>enlargement</b> of the heart and ordered more tests.\",\"医生发现心脏扩大，下令做更多检查。\"]],\"viscosity\":[[\"Honey has a much higher <b>viscosity</b> than water, so it pours slowly.\",\"蜂蜜的黏度比水高得多，所以倒得很慢。\"],[\"Engine oil loses <b>viscosity</b> as it gets old and must be replaced.\",\"机油用久了会失去黏度，必须更换。\"]],\"iodine\":[[\"<b>Iodine</b> is added to table salt to prevent thyroid problems.\",\"食盐里加碘是为了预防甲状腺问题。\"],[\"The nurse cleaned the cut with <b>iodine</b> before bandaging it.\",\"护士在包扎前用碘给伤口消毒。\"]],\"crystallize\":[[\"As the solution cooled, salt began to <b>crystallize</b> on the sides of the beaker.\",\"溶液冷却时，盐开始在烧杯壁上结晶。\"],[\"Sugar syrup left in the pan will <b>crystallize</b> if it is stirred too much.\",\"糖浆留在锅里时如果搅得太多，就会结晶。\"]],\"digital\":[[\"She keeps a <b>digital</b> copy of every photograph she takes.\",\"她拍的每张照片都留有数字副本。\"],[\"The library replaced its paper catalogue with a <b>digital</b> one.\",\"图书馆用数字目录取代了纸质目录。\"]],\"dominate\":[[\"One large tree <b>dominates</b> the garden and shades everything beneath it.\",\"一棵大树支配着整个花园，遮住了下面的一切。\"],[\"A few big companies <b>dominate</b> the smartphone market.\",\"几家大公司支配着智能手机市场。\"]],\"activity\":[[\"Volcanic <b>activity</b> forced the airport to close for two days.\",\"火山活动迫使机场关闭了两天。\"],[\"Brain <b>activity</b> increases when we solve difficult problems.\",\"我们解决难题时，大脑活动会增强。\"]],\"film\":[[\"The <b>film</b> is based on a true story about mountain climbers.\",\"这部电影根据登山者的真实故事改编。\"],[\"They shot the whole <b>film</b> in a small fishing village.\",\"他们整部电影都是在一个小渔村拍的。\"]],\"vehicle\":[[\"No <b>vehicles</b> are allowed in the park after dark.\",\"天黑后，任何车辆都不准进公园。\"],[\"The electric <b>vehicle</b> can travel 400 kilometres on one charge.\",\"这辆电动车充一次电能跑 400 公里。\"]],\"economist\":[[\"The <b>economist</b> warned that rising food prices would hit poor families hardest.\",\"这位经济学家警告说，食品涨价对贫困家庭打击最大。\"],[\"As chief <b>economist</b> at the bank, she writes the yearly forecast.\",\"作为银行的首席经济学家，她负责撰写年度预测。\"]],\"apex\":[[\"Only a few climbers reach the <b>apex</b> of the mountain each year.\",\"每年只有少数登山者能到达这座山的顶峰。\"],[\"At the <b>apex</b> of his career, he was directing three theatres at once.\",\"在他事业的顶峰时期，他同时管理着三家剧院。\"]],\"fever\":[[\"The child had a high <b>fever</b> and was given medicine to bring it down.\",\"孩子发高烧，喂了退烧药。\"],[\"A <b>fever</b> is often the first sign that the body is fighting an infection.\",\"发烧往往是身体正在对抗感染的第一个信号。\"]],\"clog\":[[\"Leaves <b>clogged</b> the drain, and rainwater flooded the basement.\",\"树叶堵塞了排水口，雨水淹了地下室。\"],[\"Too many cars <b>clog</b> the narrow streets of the old town every morning.\",\"每天早上，太多汽车堵塞了老城狭窄的街道。\"]],\"global\":[[\"Climate change is a <b>global</b> problem that no country can solve alone.\",\"气候变化是一个全球问题，没有哪个国家能独自解决。\"],[\"The company's <b>global</b> sales rose for the third year in a row.\",\"这家公司的全球销售额连续第三年上升。\"]],\"blackberry\":[[\"She picked a handful of ripe <b>blackberries</b> from the hedge.\",\"她从树篱上摘了一把熟黑莓。\"],[\"<b>Blackberry</b> bushes spread quickly if they are not cut back.\",\"黑莓灌木如果不修剪，就会蔓延得很快。\"]],\"aristocracy\":[[\"Before the revolution, the <b>aristocracy</b> owned most of the farmland.\",\"革命之前，贵族拥有大部分农田。\"],[\"Members of the old <b>aristocracy</b> spoke French at home well into the 1900s.\",\"直到二十世纪，老贵族成员在家中还在说法语。\"]],\"component\":[[\"Each <b>component</b> of the engine is tested before assembly.\",\"发动机的每个成分部件在组装前都要测试。\"],[\"Trust is a key <b>component</b> of any successful team.\",\"信任是任何成功团队的关键成分。\"]],\"holiday\":[[\"They went to the coast for a week's <b>holiday</b>.\",\"他们去海边度了一周的假日。\"],[\"Monday is a public <b>holiday</b>, so banks and schools will be closed.\",\"周一是公共假日，银行和学校都放假。\"]],\"create\":[[\"The artist used scrap metal to <b>create</b> a sculpture of a horse.\",\"艺术家用废金属创造了一尊马的雕塑。\"],[\"The new park will <b>create</b> jobs for local people.\",\"新公园将为当地人创造就业机会。\"]],\"calculate\":[[\"He <b>calculated</b> the cost of the trip down to the last ticket.\",\"他把这次旅行的费用计算到最后一张票。\"],[\"Scientists <b>calculate</b> the age of the rock from the decay of its minerals.\",\"科学家根据矿物的衰变来计算岩石的年龄。\"]],\"admission\":[[\"<b>Admission</b> to the university depends on your exam results.\",\"这所大学的入学取决于你的考试成绩。\"],[\"She received her letter of <b>admission</b> to medical school in April.\",\"她在四月收到了医学院的入学录取通知。\"]],\"desert\":[[\"The Sahara is the largest hot <b>desert</b> in the world.\",\"撒哈拉是世界上最大的热沙漠。\"],[\"Few plants can survive in the <b>desert</b>, where rain may not fall for years.\",\"很少有植物能在沙漠里存活，那里可能几年都不下雨。\"]],\"baffle\":[[\"The disease <b>baffled</b> doctors for months before its cause was found.\",\"这种病在查明病因前，使医生们困惑了好几个月。\"],[\"His sudden resignation <b>baffles</b> everyone who worked with him.\",\"他的突然辞职使所有和他共事的人都感到困惑。\"]],\"ignore\":[[\"He <b>ignored</b> the warning signs and drove on through the storm.\",\"他忽视了警告标志，在暴风雨中继续开车。\"],[\"You cannot <b>ignore</b> the fact that costs are rising every year.\",\"你不能忽视成本每年都在上涨这个事实。\"]],\"begin\":[[\"Classes <b>begin</b> at nine and finish at four.\",\"课程九点开始，四点结束。\"],[\"To <b>begin</b> the experiment, mix the two powders in a dry bowl.\",\"开始实验时，先把两种粉末在干碗里混合。\"]],\"tangerine\":[[\"She peeled a <b>tangerine</b> and shared the segments with her friend.\",\"她剥了一个橘子，把瓣分给朋友。\"],[\"<b>Tangerine</b> peel is used to flavour both desserts and traditional medicine.\",\"橘子皮既用于给甜点调味，也用于传统药物。\"]],\"contemporary\":[[\"The gallery shows work by <b>contemporary</b> artists from across Asia.\",\"这家画廊展出全亚洲当代艺术家的作品。\"],[\"<b>Contemporary</b> accounts describe the fire destroying half the city in one night.\",\"当代的记载描述了那场大火一夜之间烧毁半座城市。\"]],\"harmony\":[[\"The choir sang in four-part <b>harmony</b>.\",\"合唱团用四声部和声演唱。\"],[\"In a string quartet, the <b>harmony</b> shifts between the instruments as the melody moves.\",\"在弦乐四重奏中，随着旋律移动，和声在各乐器之间变换。\"]],\"drought\":[[\"The <b>drought</b> lasted three years and the wells ran dry.\",\"干旱持续了三年，水井都干了。\"],[\"Farmers planted crops that can survive long <b>droughts</b>.\",\"农民种了能熬过长期干旱的作物。\"]],\"puppet\":[[\"The child worked the <b>puppet</b> with strings attached to its arms and head.\",\"孩子用系在木偶胳膊和头上的线操纵它。\"],[\"In the show, a rabbit <b>puppet</b> tells the story to the audience.\",\"演出里，一只兔子木偶给观众讲故事。\"]],\"audience\":[[\"The <b>audience</b> clapped for a full minute when the concert ended.\",\"音乐会结束时，观众鼓了整整一分钟掌。\"],[\"The lecture was designed for a general <b>audience</b>, not specialists.\",\"这场讲座是面向普通观众的，不是给专家的。\"]],\"hertz\":[[\"Frequency is measured in <b>hertz</b>: one <b>hertz</b> means one cycle per second.\",\"频率以赫兹为单位：一赫兹表示每秒一个周期。\"],[\"Human hearing covers roughly 20 to 20,000 <b>hertz</b>.\",\"人类听觉范围大约是 20 到 20,000 赫兹。\"]],\"wrist\":[[\"She broke her <b>wrist</b> falling off her bicycle.\",\"她从自行车上摔下来，摔断了手腕。\"],[\"He wears his watch on his left <b>wrist</b>.\",\"他把手表戴在左手腕上。\"]],\"tuition\":[[\"<b>Tuition</b> at this university has risen by ten percent in five years.\",\"这所大学的学费五年里涨了百分之十。\"],[\"She works evenings to pay her college <b>tuition</b>.\",\"她晚上打工来付大学学费。\"]],\"evil\":[[\"In the story, the wizard uses his powers for <b>evil</b>.\",\"故事里，巫师用他的法力作恶——走向邪恶。\"],[\"The novel asks whether people are born <b>evil</b> or made that way by their lives.\",\"这部小说追问：人是生来邪恶，还是被生活逼成那样。\"]],\"recommendation\":[[\"She wrote him a <b>recommendation</b> letter for the scholarship.\",\"她为他写了一封奖学金推荐信。\"],[\"You will need a <b>recommendation</b> from a former teacher to apply.\",\"申请时你需要一封以前老师写的推荐信。\"]],\"eradication\":[[\"The <b>eradication</b> of smallpox is one of medicine's greatest successes.\",\"根除天花是医学最伟大的成就之一。\"],[\"Complete <b>eradication</b> of the weed took three summers of digging.\",\"彻底根除这种杂草，花了三个夏天不停地挖。\"]],\"epilogue\":[[\"The novel's <b>epilogue</b> tells what happened to the family twenty years later.\",\"小说的结尾交代了这家人二十年后的结局。\"],[\"In the <b>epilogue</b>, the author explains why she wrote the book.\",\"在结尾部分，作者解释了她为什么写这本书。\"]],\"robin\":[[\"A <b>robin</b> sang from the fence every morning that spring.\",\"那个春天，一只知更鸟每天早上都在栅栏上歌唱。\"],[\"The American <b>robin</b> has a rust-red breast and eats worms after rain.\",\"美洲知更鸟胸部呈锈红色，雨后吃蚯蚓。\"]],\"patrol\":[[\"Police <b>patrol</b> the park on bicycles at night.\",\"警察夜里骑自行车在公园巡逻。\"],[\"Two guards were sent on <b>patrol</b> along the border fence.\",\"两名警卫被派去沿边境围栏巡逻。\"]],\"problem-solving\":[[\"The course teaches <b>problem-solving</b> through real cases, not just theory.\",\"这门课通过真实案例、而不是只讲理论来教解决问题。\"],[\"Good <b>problem-solving</b> starts with defining exactly what the problem is.\",\"好的解决问题方法，始于准确界定问题到底是什么。\"]],\"bull\":[[\"The farmer warned visitors not to cross the field with the <b>bull</b> in it.\",\"农夫警告游客不要穿过有公牛的那片田。\"],[\"A <b>bull</b> can weigh over 800 kilograms and still run surprisingly fast.\",\"一头公牛体重可超过 800 公斤，却仍能跑得惊人地快。\"]],\"warehouse\":[[\"The furniture is stored in a <b>warehouse</b> near the docks.\",\"家具存放在码头附近的一座仓库里。\"],[\"Workers loaded the boxes onto trucks outside the <b>warehouse</b>.\",\"工人们在仓库外把箱子装上卡车。\"]],\"deadline\":[[\"The <b>deadline</b> for applications is Friday at noon.\",\"申请的截止日期是周五中午。\"],[\"She stayed up all night to meet the <b>deadline</b> for her essay.\",\"她熬了整夜，赶在论文截止日期前交稿。\"]],\"bathroom\":[[\"The flat has one <b>bathroom</b> shared by four students.\",\"这套公寓有一间浴室，由四个学生共用。\"],[\"He slipped on the wet <b>bathroom</b> tiles.\",\"他在湿滑的浴室瓷砖上滑倒了。\"]],\"colony\":[[\"A <b>colony</b> of ants can contain millions of workers.\",\"一个蚂蚁群体可以包含数百万只工蚁。\"],[\"Scientists grew a <b>colony</b> of bacteria from a single cell.\",\"科学家从单个细胞培养出了一个细菌群体。\"]],\"curriculum\":[[\"The school added computer science to its <b>curriculum</b> this year.\",\"学校今年把计算机科学加入了课程体系。\"],[\"Under the new <b>curriculum</b>, students study two foreign languages.\",\"按新的课程体系，学生要学两门外语。\"]],\"guideline\":[[\"The <b>guidelines</b> say that essays must not exceed 3,000 words.\",\"指导方针规定论文不得超过 3,000 字。\"],[\"Doctors follow strict <b>guidelines</b> when prescribing this drug.\",\"医生开这种药时遵循严格的指导方针。\"]],\"secretary\":[[\"The <b>secretary</b> booked his flights and arranged the meeting rooms.\",\"秘书为他订了机票，并安排了会议室。\"],[\"She works as a <b>secretary</b> for a small law firm.\",\"她在一家小律师事务所当秘书。\"]],\"prose\":[[\"The novel is written in clear, simple <b>prose</b>.\",\"这部小说用清晰、简洁的散文写成。\"],[\"His <b>prose</b> is admired for saying a great deal in very few words.\",\"他的散文以用极少的字表达丰富内容而受到赞赏。\"]],\"crater\":[[\"The volcano's <b>crater</b> now holds a small blue lake.\",\"火山的火山口现在积成了一个小蓝湖。\"],[\"This <b>crater</b> on the Moon was formed by a meteor impact billions of years ago.\",\"月球上的这个火山口（陨石坑）是数十亿年前陨石撞击形成的。\"]],\"sock\":[[\"He put on a clean pair of <b>socks</b> and his running shoes.\",\"他穿上一双干净袜子和跑鞋。\"],[\"One <b>sock</b> always seems to disappear in the wash.\",\"洗衣服时总有一只袜子会不见。\"]],\"bake\":[[\"She <b>bakes</b> bread at home every Sunday.\",\"她每个周日在家烘烤面包。\"],[\"<b>Bake</b> the cake at 180 degrees for thirty minutes.\",\"把蛋糕用 180 度烘烤三十分钟。\"]],\"proton\":[[\"A hydrogen atom has one <b>proton</b> and one electron.\",\"一个氢原子有一个质子和一个电子。\"],[\"The number of <b>protons</b> in the nucleus decides which element an atom is.\",\"原子核中质子的数量决定了原子属于哪种元素。\"]],\"model\":[[\"The <b>model</b> walked down the runway in a long red coat.\",\"模特穿着红色长大衣走过 T 台。\"],[\"As a hand <b>model</b>, she appears in advertisements for jewellery and watches.\",\"作为手模，她出现在珠宝和手表的广告里。\"]],\"averse\":[[\"He is not <b>averse</b> to hard work, but he dislikes working at weekends.\",\"他并不厌恶辛苦工作，但不喜欢周末加班。\"],[\"Older investors tend to be <b>averse</b> to risky shares.\",\"年长的投资者往往厌恶高风险股票。\"]],\"balance\":[[\"She lost her <b>balance</b> on the icy steps and grabbed the railing.\",\"她在结冰的台阶上失去平衡，抓住了扶手。\"],[\"Try to keep a <b>balance</b> between work and rest.\",\"尽量在工作和休息之间保持平衡。\"]],\"isotope\":[[\"Carbon-14 is a radioactive <b>isotope</b> used to date ancient objects.\",\"碳-14 是一种放射性同位素，用来测定古代物品的年代。\"],[\"The two <b>isotopes</b> of hydrogen differ by one neutron.\",\"氢的两种同位素相差一个中子。\"]],\"mite\":[[\"Dust <b>mites</b> live in mattresses and feed on dead skin cells.\",\"尘螨住在床垫里，以死皮细胞为食。\"],[\"Some <b>mites</b> damage crops by sucking sap from leaves.\",\"有些螨虫吸食叶汁，危害作物。\"]],\"counter\":[[\"He tried to <b>counter</b> her argument with new evidence.\",\"他试图用新证据来反击她的论点。\"],[\"To <b>counter</b> rising prices, the shop cut its own costs first.\",\"为了反击涨价，这家店先削减了自身成本。\"]],\"distribution\":[[\"The <b>distribution</b> of this plant is limited to wet mountain slopes.\",\"这种植物的分布仅限于潮湿的山坡。\"],[\"The map shows the <b>distribution</b> of rainfall across the country.\",\"地图显示了全国降雨的分布。\"]],\"biodegradable\":[[\"The bags are made of <b>biodegradable</b> material that breaks down in soil.\",\"这些袋子用可生物降解的材料制成，能在土壤中分解。\"],[\"Unlike plastic, paper is <b>biodegradable</b> and disappears within months.\",\"与塑料不同，纸是可生物降解的，几个月内就会消失。\"]],\"nausea\":[[\"The boat trip gave him <b>nausea</b>, and he had to sit on deck in the fresh air.\",\"坐船让他恶心，他只好坐在甲板上吹新鲜空气。\"],[\"This medicine may cause <b>nausea</b> in some patients.\",\"这种药可能会让一些病人感到恶心。\"]],\"ruler\":[[\"Use a <b>ruler</b> to draw a straight line across the page.\",\"用尺子在纸上画一条直线。\"],[\"She measured the shelf with a metal <b>ruler</b>.\",\"她用金属尺子量了搁板的尺寸。\"]],\"emerald\":[[\"The ring is set with a deep green <b>emerald</b>.\",\"戒指上镶着一颗深绿色的祖母绿。\"],[\"Colombia is famous for producing the world's finest <b>emeralds</b>.\",\"哥伦比亚以出产世界上最好的祖母绿而闻名。\"]],\"squat\":[[\"He <b>squatted</b> down to talk to the child at eye level.\",\"他蹲下身，与孩子平视着说话。\"],[\"Workers <b>squat</b> beside the low machines all day, which hurts their knees.\",\"工人们整天蹲在矮机器旁，膝盖很受罪。\"]],\"image\":[[\"The company tried to improve its public <b>image</b> after the scandal.\",\"丑闻之后，公司努力改善其公众形象。\"],[\"Her <b>image</b> as a tough negotiator helps her in business talks.\",\"她强硬谈判者的形象在商务谈判中对她有帮助。\"]],\"probation\":[[\"He was given two years' <b>probation</b> instead of a prison sentence.\",\"他被判两年缓刑，而不是监禁。\"],[\"During <b>probation</b>, she must report to an officer every week.\",\"缓刑期间，她必须每周向监管员报到。\"]],\"studio\":[[\"The painter works in a bright <b>studio</b> at the top of the building.\",\"画家在大楼顶层一间明亮的工作室里作画。\"],[\"The band recorded the album in a small <b>studio</b> in Nashville.\",\"乐队在纳什维尔一间小录音工作室里录制了这张专辑。\"]],\"behavior\":[[\"The teacher praised the class for its good <b>behavior</b> during the trip.\",\"老师表扬了全班在旅行期间的良好行为。\"],[\"Scientists study the <b>behavior</b> of wolves by tracking them with radio collars.\",\"科学家用无线电项圈追踪狼，来研究它们的行为。\"]],\"knee\":[[\"He injured his <b>knee</b> playing football and needed surgery.\",\"他踢足球时伤了膝盖，需要手术。\"],[\"The water in the flooded street came up to her <b>knees</b>.\",\"被淹街道上的水没到了她的膝盖。\"]],\"ankle\":[[\"She twisted her <b>ankle</b> stepping off the curb.\",\"她下路沿时扭伤了脚踝。\"],[\"The socks come up just above the <b>ankle</b>.\",\"这双袜子的长度刚好到脚踝上方。\"]],\"apply\":[[\"You can <b>apply</b> for the job through the company's website.\",\"你可以通过公司网站申请这份工作。\"],[\"He <b>applied</b> to five universities and was accepted by three.\",\"他申请了五所大学，被三所录取。\"]],\"bawl\":[[\"The baby began to <b>bawl</b> as soon as the lights went out.\",\"灯一灭，婴儿就开始放声大哭。\"],[\"She <b>bawled</b> so loudly at the sad ending that people in the cinema turned around.\",\"结局太悲伤，她放声大哭，引得影院里的人都回头看。\"]],\"theft\":[[\"He was arrested for the <b>theft</b> of a delivery van.\",\"他因盗窃一辆送货车被捕。\"],[\"Bike <b>theft</b> is common near the station, so use a strong lock.\",\"车站附近自行车盗窃很常见，要用结实的锁。\"]],\"archive\":[[\"The national <b>archive</b> keeps letters written by soldiers in both world wars.\",\"国家档案馆保存着两次世界大战中士兵写的信。\"],[\"Old exam papers are stored in the university <b>archive</b>.\",\"旧试卷存放在大学档案室。\"]],\"earthquake\":[[\"The <b>earthquake</b> damaged hundreds of houses along the coast.\",\"地震损坏了沿海数百栋房屋。\"],[\"People ran into the street when the <b>earthquake</b> shook the building.\",\"地震摇晃大楼时，人们跑到了街上。\"]],\"onion\":[[\"Chop the <b>onion</b> finely before adding it to the pan.\",\"把洋葱切碎再下锅。\"],[\"Frying <b>onions</b> slowly makes them sweet and golden.\",\"慢慢煎洋葱会让它们变甜、变金黄。\"]],\"centipede\":[[\"A <b>centipede</b> ran across the bathroom floor and hid under the tub.\",\"一只蜈蚣爬过浴室地板，躲到了浴缸下面。\"],[\"Despite its name, a <b>centipede</b> does not always have exactly one hundred legs.\",\"尽管名字叫蜈蚣，它并不总是有正好一百条腿。\"]],\"clinic\":[[\"The village <b>clinic</b> has one doctor and two nurses.\",\"村诊所里有一名医生和两名护士。\"],[\"She took her son to the dental <b>clinic</b> for a check-up.\",\"她带儿子去牙科诊所检查。\"]],\"pressure\":[[\"Tire <b>pressure</b> should be checked once a month.\",\"轮胎压力应该每月检查一次。\"],[\"At that depth, the water <b>pressure</b> is strong enough to crush a thin metal can.\",\"在那个深度，水压大到足以压扁一个薄金属罐。\"]],\"induction\":[[\"The course moves from specific examples to general rules, teaching by <b>induction</b>.\",\"这门课从具体例子到一般规律，用归纳法教学。\"],[\"By <b>induction</b>, scientists concluded that all metals expand when heated.\",\"科学家通过归纳得出结论：所有金属受热都会膨胀。\"]],\"leader\":[[\"The expedition <b>leader</b> decided to turn back when the storm came.\",\"暴风雨来临时，探险队领袖决定返回。\"],[\"She became the party's <b>leader</b> after winning the internal vote.\",\"她赢得党内投票后成为该党领袖。\"]],\"donkey\":[[\"The farmer loaded the sacks onto a <b>donkey</b> for the trip down the mountain.\",\"农夫把麻袋装到驴背上，运下山去。\"],[\"<b>Donkeys</b> are sure-footed on narrow mountain paths.\",\"驴在狭窄的山路上走得很稳。\"]],\"bluetooth\":[[\"Connect the headphones to your phone using <b>Bluetooth</b>.\",\"用蓝牙把耳机连接到手机。\"],[\"The speaker pairs with any <b>Bluetooth</b> device within ten metres.\",\"这台音箱能与十米内的任何蓝牙设备配对。\"]],\"inherent\":[[\"There are <b>inherent</b> risks in climbing alone, however experienced you are.\",\"无论经验多丰富，独自攀登都有固有的风险。\"],[\"Flexibility is an <b>inherent</b> quality of rubber.\",\"弹性是橡胶固有的性质。\"]],\"cap\":[[\"He wore a baseball <b>cap</b> to keep the sun out of his eyes.\",\"他戴了一顶鸭舌帽（棒球帽）遮阳。\"],[\"She took off her swimming <b>cap</b> and shook out her hair.\",\"她摘下泳帽，甩了甩头发。\"]],\"worship\":[[\"People come to this shrine to <b>worship</b> their ancestors.\",\"人们来这座祠堂崇拜祖先。\"],[\"In the novel, villagers <b>worship</b> the river as a god.\",\"小说里，村民把河流当作神来崇拜。\"]],\"sole\":[[\"A stone had worked its way into his shoe and hurt the <b>sole</b> of his foot.\",\"一颗石子钻进他鞋里，硌疼了脚底。\"],[\"Walking barefoot toughens the <b>soles</b> over time.\",\"光脚走路久了，脚底会变厚变硬。\"]],\"nocturnal\":[[\"Owls are <b>nocturnal</b> and hunt mainly at night.\",\"猫头鹰是夜行的，主要在夜间捕食。\"],[\"Bats are <b>nocturnal</b> mammals that navigate by sound.\",\"蝙蝠是夜行哺乳动物，靠声音导航。\"]],\"collaboration\":[[\"The film was a <b>collaboration</b> between directors from three countries.\",\"这部电影是三个国家的导演协作的成果。\"],[\"This report was written in <b>collaboration</b> with local farmers.\",\"这份报告是与当地农民协作写成的。\"]],\"expand\":[[\"The company plans to <b>expand</b> into Asian markets next year.\",\"公司计划明年向亚洲市场扩张。\"],[\"Metals <b>expand</b> when heated and shrink when cooled.\",\"金属受热时扩张，冷却时收缩。\"]],\"avert\":[[\"Quick action by the pilot <b>averted</b> a crash.\",\"飞行员的快速处置避免了一场坠机灾祸。\"],[\"Planting trees along the river can help <b>avert</b> floods.\",\"沿河种树有助于避免洪水灾祸。\"]],\"bath\":[[\"The children need a <b>bath</b> after playing in the mud.\",\"孩子们在泥里玩过后需要洗澡。\"],[\"She likes to <b>bath</b> the baby in warm water before bed.\",\"她喜欢在睡前用温水给宝宝洗澡。\"]],\"rosemary\":[[\"She added fresh <b>rosemary</b> to the roast potatoes.\",\"她往烤土豆里加了新鲜迷迭香。\"],[\"<b>Rosemary</b> grows wild on dry hillsides around the Mediterranean.\",\"迷迭香野生于地中海周围干旱的山坡上。\"]],\"panel\":[[\"A <b>panel</b> of experts answered questions from the audience.\",\"一个专家小组回答了观众的问题。\"],[\"The control <b>panel</b> shows the temperature of every room in the building.\",\"控制面板显示大楼里每个房间的温度。\"]],\"behave\":[[\"The children <b>behaved</b> well during the long ceremony.\",\"孩子们在漫长的仪式上表现得很好。\"],[\"Metals <b>behave</b> differently at very low temperatures.\",\"金属在极低温度下表现不同。\"]],\"genre\":[[\"Science fiction is the <b>genre</b> she writes in most often.\",\"科幻是她写得最多的体裁。\"],[\"Each literary <b>genre</b> — poetry, drama, the novel — has its own conventions.\",\"每种文学体裁——诗歌、戏剧、小说——都有自己的惯例。\"]],\"adaptation\":[[\"The polar bear's white coat is an <b>adaptation</b> to life in the snow.\",\"北极熊的白毛是对雪地生活的一种适应。\"],[\"Cacti show many <b>adaptations</b> to desert conditions, such as storing water in thick stems.\",\"仙人掌展现出许多对沙漠环境的适应，比如在粗茎里储水。\"]],\"visualization\":[[\"The <b>visualization</b> turned ten years of temperature data into a single clear map.\",\"这个可视化把十年的温度数据变成了一张清晰的地图。\"],[\"Athletes use <b>visualization</b>, imagining each move before a competition.\",\"运动员用可视化（心理成像）在比赛前想象每一个动作。\"]],\"confound\":[[\"The results <b>confounded</b> the researchers, who had expected the opposite.\",\"结果使研究者们困惑不解，他们原本预期的是相反的结果。\"],[\"Age can <b>confound</b> the study if older patients are all in one group.\",\"如果年长病人都集中在一组，年龄就会混淆这项研究。\"]],\"emptiness\":[[\"After his friends moved away, he felt a deep <b>emptiness</b>.\",\"朋友们搬走后，他感到深深的空虚。\"],[\"The <b>emptiness</b> of the desert at noon can feel overwhelming.\",\"正午沙漠的空旷空虚感会让人难以承受。\"]],\"affirm\":[[\"She <b>affirmed</b> that she had written the letter herself.\",\"她肯定地说，信是她亲手写的。\"],[\"The court <b>affirmed</b> the original verdict, so the sentence stands.\",\"法院肯定并维持了原判，所以判决不变。\"]],\"illegal\":[[\"It is <b>illegal</b> to fish in the lake during the breeding season.\",\"繁殖季节在湖里捕鱼是非法的。\"],[\"The company was fined for dumping <b>illegal</b> waste into the river.\",\"公司因向河里倾倒非法废料被罚款。\"]],\"pumpkin\":[[\"They carved a face into the <b>pumpkin</b> for Halloween.\",\"他们在南瓜上刻了一张脸过万圣节。\"],[\"<b>Pumpkin</b> soup with a little cream makes a warm autumn lunch.\",\"加一点奶油的南瓜汤是温暖的秋日午餐。\"]],\"combat\":[[\"The two armies met in <b>combat</b> near the river.\",\"两军在河边交战——进入了战斗。\"],[\"Pilots train for years before they fly in <b>combat</b>.\",\"飞行员要训练多年才能参加战斗飞行。\"]],\"graduation\":[[\"Her parents flew in from abroad for her <b>graduation</b>.\",\"她的父母从国外飞来参加她的毕业典礼。\"],[\"After <b>graduation</b>, he plans to work in a rural hospital.\",\"毕业后，他打算去一家乡村医院工作。\"]],\"example\":[[\"Norway is often given as an <b>example</b> of a country with clean energy.\",\"挪威常被当作清洁能源国家的例子。\"],[\"Give an <b>example</b> of a plant that eats insects.\",\"举一个吃昆虫的植物的例子。\"]],\"spoon\":[[\"She stirred the soup with a wooden <b>spoon</b>.\",\"她用木勺子搅汤。\"],[\"He ate the yoghurt with a small <b>spoon</b>.\",\"他用小勺子吃酸奶。\"]],\"biologist\":[[\"The <b>biologist</b> spent the summer studying frogs in the wetlands.\",\"这位生物学家整个夏天都在湿地里研究青蛙。\"],[\"As a marine <b>biologist</b>, she dives to collect samples from the reef.\",\"作为海洋生物学家，她潜水到礁石区采集样本。\"]],\"parliament\":[[\"<b>Parliament</b> debated the budget for three days before voting.\",\"议会就预算辩论了三天才投票。\"],[\"The new law must be approved by <b>Parliament</b> before it takes effect.\",\"新法律必须经议会批准才能生效。\"]],\"diabetes\":[[\"People with <b>diabetes</b> must watch their blood sugar carefully.\",\"糖尿病患者必须仔细监测血糖。\"],[\"Regular exercise lowers the risk of type 2 <b>diabetes</b>.\",\"经常锻炼能降低患 2 型糖尿病的风险。\"]],\"dichotomy\":[[\"The lecture questioned the simple <b>dichotomy</b> between nature and culture.\",\"讲座质疑了自然与文化之间简单的二分法。\"],[\"There is a false <b>dichotomy</b> here: a policy can protect jobs and the environment at once.\",\"这里存在一种虚假的二分法：一项政策可以同时保护就业和环境。\"]],\"attractiveness\":[[\"The town's main <b>attractiveness</b> for visitors is its old harbour.\",\"这座小镇对游客的主要吸引魅力是它的老港口。\"],[\"Price, not <b>attractiveness</b>, was the main reason people bought the phone.\",\"人们买这款手机的主要原因是价格，而不是吸引魅力。\"]],\"institute\":[[\"She works at a research <b>institute</b> that studies ocean currents.\",\"她在一家研究洋流的研究机构工作。\"],[\"The <b>institute</b> offers summer courses for young musicians.\",\"这家机构为年轻音乐人开设暑期课程。\"]],\"evaporate\":[[\"On a hot day, puddles <b>evaporate</b> within a few hours.\",\"炎热的日子里，水洼几小时内就会蒸发。\"],[\"As the seawater <b>evaporated</b>, salt was left behind in white crusts.\",\"海水蒸发后，留下一层层白色的盐壳。\"]],\"balcony\":[[\"They grow tomatoes in pots on the <b>balcony</b>.\",\"他们在阳台上的花盆里种西红柿。\"],[\"From the hotel <b>balcony</b> we could watch the fishing boats come in.\",\"从酒店阳台上，我们能看着渔船进港。\"]],\"criterion\":[[\"The main <b>criterion</b> for the scholarship is academic achievement, not family income.\",\"这项奖学金的主要标准是学业成绩，而不是家庭收入。\"],[\"A good <b>criterion</b> must be clear enough for two judges to apply the same way.\",\"一个好的标准必须足够清晰，让两位评委能以同样的方式执行。\"]],\"hygiene\":[[\"Good hand <b>hygiene</b> is the simplest way to stop infections spreading in hospitals.\",\"良好的手部卫生是阻止医院感染传播最简单的方法。\"],[\"The restaurant was closed for poor kitchen <b>hygiene</b>.\",\"这家餐厅因厨房卫生差被关停。\"]],\"density\":[[\"Lead has a much higher <b>density</b> than aluminium, so it feels heavier for its size.\",\"铅的密度比铝高得多，所以同样大小感觉更重。\"],[\"Population <b>density</b> is highest in the river delta.\",\"人口密度在河流三角洲最高。\"]],\"county\":[[\"The <b>county</b> is holding an election for a new council next month.\",\"这个县下个月将举行新一届议会选举。\"],[\"He grew up in a farming village in <b>County</b> Cork, Ireland.\",\"他在爱尔兰科克县的一个农耕村庄长大。\"]],\"barge\":[[\"He <b>barged</b> into the meeting without knocking.\",\"他没敲门就闯入了会议。\"],[\"A man <b>barged</b> past the queue and demanded to be served first.\",\"一个男人挤开队伍闯入，要求先给他服务。\"]],\"stagnation\":[[\"Years of economic <b>stagnation</b> left many young people without jobs.\",\"多年的经济停滞让许多年轻人没有工作。\"],[\"Without fresh water flowing in, the pond fell into <b>stagnation</b> and began to smell.\",\"没有新鲜水流入，池塘陷入停滞，开始发臭。\"]],\"convention\":[[\"By <b>convention</b>, the youngest guest is served first at this festival meal.\",\"按照惯例，这顿节日餐先给最年轻的客人上菜。\"],[\"Shaking hands was once the standard <b>convention</b> when meeting a stranger.\",\"与陌生人见面时握手，曾经是标准的惯例。\"]],\"marble\":[[\"The temple steps are made of white <b>marble</b>.\",\"神庙的台阶用白色大理石砌成。\"],[\"The sculptor carved the statue from a single block of <b>marble</b>.\",\"雕塑家用一整块大理石刻出了这尊雕像。\"]],\"president\":[[\"The <b>president</b> signed the bill into law on Monday.\",\"总统周一签署法案，使其成为法律。\"],[\"She was elected <b>president</b> of the student union.\",\"她当选为学生会总统（主席）。\"]],\"port\":[[\"The ship reached <b>port</b> after ten days at sea.\",\"船在海上航行十天后抵达港口。\"],[\"This <b>port</b> handles most of the country's grain exports.\",\"这个港口承担该国大部分粮食出口。\"]],\"region\":[[\"Rice grows well in this warm, wet <b>region</b>.\",\"水稻在这个温暖潮湿的地区长得很好。\"],[\"The whole <b>region</b> lost power during the storm.\",\"暴风雨期间，整个地区都停电了。\"]],\"continuum\":[[\"Colour forms a <b>continuum</b>, with no sharp line where red becomes orange.\",\"颜色构成一个连续体，红变橙之间没有分明的界线。\"],[\"The teacher described ability as a <b>continuum</b> rather than two fixed groups.\",\"老师把能力描述为一个连续体，而不是两个固定组别。\"]],\"aisle\":[[\"She walked down the <b>aisle</b> of the plane looking for seat 14A.\",\"她沿着飞机过道走，寻找 14A 座位。\"],[\"Canned food is in the third <b>aisle</b> of the supermarket.\",\"罐头食品在超市的第三条过道。\"]],\"operating\":[[\"This laptop runs the latest <b>operating</b> system and starts up in seconds.\",\"这台笔记本运行最新的操作系统，几秒钟就能启动。\"],[\"You must update the <b>operating</b> system before installing the new software.\",\"安装新软件前，你必须更新操作系统。\"]],\"evolve\":[[\"Birds <b>evolved</b> from small feathered dinosaurs.\",\"鸟类是由小型有羽毛的恐龙演化而来的。\"],[\"Over millions of years, whales <b>evolved</b> bodies suited to life in the sea.\",\"数百万年间，鲸演化出了适合海洋生活的身体。\"]],\"cabbage\":[[\"She shredded the <b>cabbage</b> and mixed it with carrots for the salad.\",\"她把卷心菜切丝，和胡萝卜拌在一起做沙拉。\"],[\"<b>Cabbage</b> keeps for weeks in a cold cellar.\",\"卷心菜在阴凉的地窖里能放好几周。\"]],\"boot\":[[\"His <b>boots</b> were covered in mud after the walk.\",\"走完路后，他的靴子沾满了泥。\"],[\"She wore thick <b>boots</b> for hiking in the snow.\",\"她穿着厚靴子在雪地里徒步。\"]],\"enrichment\":[[\"The soil's <b>enrichment</b> with compost doubled the harvest.\",\"用堆肥丰富土壤后，收成翻了一倍。\"],[\"After-school clubs are offered as <b>enrichment</b> for students who finish early.\",\"课外俱乐部是给早完成学业的学生的丰富活动。\"]],\"clap\":[[\"The audience began to <b>clap</b> as soon as the singer appeared.\",\"歌手一出场，观众就开始拍手鼓掌。\"],[\"Children <b>clap</b> along to the rhythm of the song.\",\"孩子们跟着歌曲的节奏拍手。\"]],\"bigoted\":[[\"His <b>bigoted</b> remarks about immigrants shocked the whole office.\",\"他对移民的偏执言论震惊了整个办公室。\"],[\"The <b>bigoted</b> landlord refused to rent to anyone from outside the town.\",\"那个偏执的房东拒绝把房子租给镇外的人。\"]],\"mouse\":[[\"Move the <b>mouse</b> to the corner of the screen and click.\",\"把鼠标移到屏幕角落并点击。\"],[\"The computer <b>mouse</b> stopped working, so she used the trackpad instead.\",\"电脑鼠标坏了，于是她改用触控板。\"]],\"debate\":[[\"The two candidates held a televised <b>debate</b> on healthcare.\",\"两位候选人就医疗问题举行了一场电视辩论。\"],[\"Students <b>debated</b> whether school uniforms should be required.\",\"学生们辩论是否应该强制穿校服。\"]],\"pollination\":[[\"Bees carry pollen from flower to flower, and this <b>pollination</b> allows plants to make seeds.\",\"蜜蜂把花粉从一朵花带到另一朵花，这种授粉让植物能结出种子。\"],[\"Without <b>pollination</b> by insects, many fruit trees produce almost no fruit.\",\"没有昆虫授粉，许多果树几乎不结果。\"]],\"domino\":[[\"He set up a long line of <b>dominoes</b> and knocked the first one over.\",\"他摆了一长排多米诺骨牌，推倒了第一张。\"],[\"The tiles in a <b>domino</b> set are marked with dots from zero to six.\",\"一套多米诺骨牌的牌面上标着从零到六的点数。\"]],\"hieroglyph\":[[\"Each <b>hieroglyph</b> on the temple wall stands for a sound or an idea.\",\"神庙墙上的每个象形文字都代表一个声音或一个意思。\"],[\"Scholars could not read Egyptian <b>hieroglyphs</b> until the Rosetta Stone was found.\",\"直到罗塞塔石碑被发现，学者们才读懂埃及象形文字。\"]],\"apparatus\":[[\"The chemistry <b>apparatus</b> includes flasks, tubes and a burner.\",\"这套化学器械包括烧瓶、试管和燃烧器。\"],[\"Gymnasts performed on the <b>apparatus</b> one at a time.\",\"体操运动员一个接一个在器械上表演。\"]],\"covet\":[[\"He has always <b>coveted</b> his neighbour's orchard by the river.\",\"他一直垂涎邻居在河边的果园。\"],[\"Do not <b>covet</b> what others have; build your own instead.\",\"不要垂涎别人的东西；自己去创造。\"]],\"cheapen\":[[\"Mass production has <b>cheapened</b> clothing, but also lowered its quality.\",\"大规模生产贬低了服装的价值，但也降低了其质量。\"],[\"Using stock photos would <b>cheapen</b> the whole book.\",\"用图库存图会贬低整本书的格调。\"]],\"clout\":[[\"As a senior senator, she has real <b>clout</b> in budget negotiations.\",\"作为资深参议员，她在预算谈判中有真正的影响力。\"],[\"Social media stars now have <b>clout</b> with young voters.\",\"社交媒体红人如今对年轻选民有影响。\"]],\"commentary\":[[\"The TV <b>commentary</b> explained the referee's decision to viewers.\",\"电视评论向观众解释了裁判的决定。\"],[\"His edition of the poems includes a long <b>commentary</b> on each text.\",\"他编的诗集里，每首诗都附有长篇评论。\"]],\"investment\":[[\"Building schools is an <b>investment</b> in the country's future.\",\"建学校是对国家未来的一项投资。\"],[\"She made her first <b>investment</b> at twenty-five, buying shares in a local company.\",\"她二十五岁时做了第一笔投资，买了一家本地公司的股票。\"]],\"instinct\":[[\"By <b>instinct</b>, the deer froze when it heard the branch snap.\",\"出于本能，鹿听到树枝折断声时僵住了。\"],[\"Birds build nests by <b>instinct</b>; no one teaches them.\",\"鸟筑巢靠本能，没人教它们。\"]],\"contend\":[[\"Eight athletes will <b>contend</b> for the gold medal tonight.\",\"今晚将有八名运动员竞争金牌。\"],[\"Several strong teams are <b>contending</b> for the championship this year.\",\"今年有几支强队在竞争冠军。\"]],\"bachelor\":[[\"He earned his <b>bachelor's</b> degree in biology in 2019.\",\"他在 2019 年获得了生物学学士学位。\"],[\"Most jobs in the lab require at least a <b>bachelor's</b> degree.\",\"实验室大多数岗位至少要求学士学位。\"]],\"mathematician\":[[\"The <b>mathematician</b> proved the result using only geometry.\",\"这位数学家只用几何学就证明了这个结果。\"],[\"As a <b>mathematician</b> working in weather science, she builds models of storms.\",\"作为在气象科学工作的数学家，她建立风暴模型。\"]],\"punch\":[[\"The boxer landed a hard <b>punch</b> in the final round.\",\"拳击手在最后一回合打出了一记重拳击。\"],[\"He <b>punched</b> the bag again and again during training.\",\"训练时他一次次拳击沙袋。\"]],\"tomato\":[[\"She sliced a large <b>tomato</b> for the sandwiches.\",\"她切了一个大番茄做三明治。\"],[\"<b>Tomato</b> plants need full sun and regular watering.\",\"番茄植株需要充足阳光和定期浇水。\"]],\"infer\":[[\"From the footprints, we can <b>infer</b> that the animal walked this way last night.\",\"从脚印可以推断，这只动物昨晚从这边走过。\"],[\"Readers <b>infer</b> the character's feelings from what she does, not from what she says.\",\"读者从人物的行为、而不是她说的话，来推断她的感受。\"]],\"gallery\":[[\"The <b>gallery</b> is showing photographs of the Arctic this month.\",\"画廊本月展出北极的摄影作品。\"],[\"Visitors walked slowly through the <b>gallery</b>, stopping at each painting.\",\"参观者慢慢走过画廊，在每幅画前停留。\"]],\"joint\":[[\"The knee is the largest <b>joint</b> in the human body.\",\"膝盖是人体最大的关节。\"],[\"As we age, the cartilage in our <b>joints</b> slowly wears away.\",\"随着年龄增长，我们关节里的软骨慢慢磨损。\"]],\"brain\":[[\"The <b>brain</b> uses about a fifth of the body's energy.\",\"大脑用掉了身体大约五分之一的能量。\"],[\"Learning a language changes how the <b>brain</b> processes sound.\",\"学习语言会改变大脑处理声音的方式。\"]],\"batch\":[[\"The factory <b>batches</b> orders together and ships them once a week.\",\"工厂把订单分批处理，每周发货一次。\"],[\"Instead of renaming files one by one, use a tool to <b>batch</b> the whole folder.\",\"不要一个个重命名文件，用工具把整个文件夹分批处理。\"]],\"stem\":[[\"The flower's <b>stem</b> bends towards the light.\",\"花茎朝着光弯曲。\"],[\"Cut the <b>stems</b> at an angle so the roses can drink more water.\",\"把茎斜着剪，玫瑰就能吸更多水。\"]],\"fear\":[[\"Her biggest <b>fear</b> was speaking in front of a large audience.\",\"她最大的恐惧是在一大群人面前讲话。\"],[\"The dog shook with <b>fear</b> during the thunderstorm.\",\"雷雨时，这条狗吓得（因恐惧）发抖。\"]],\"bendable\":[[\"The toy is made of soft, <b>bendable</b> plastic that will not break.\",\"这个玩具用柔软、可弯曲的塑料制成，不会断。\"],[\"Thin copper wire is <b>bendable</b> enough to shape by hand.\",\"细铜线足够可弯曲，可以用手塑形。\"]],\"respiration\":[[\"During <b>respiration</b>, cells break down glucose to release energy.\",\"呼吸作用时，细胞分解葡萄糖以释放能量。\"],[\"Plants carry out <b>respiration</b> day and night, even while they photosynthesize in daylight.\",\"植物日夜都进行呼吸作用，即使白天在进行光合作用时也是如此。\"]],\"brush\":[[\"She cleaned the <b>brush</b> carefully after finishing the painting.\",\"画完后，她仔细清洗了画笔。\"],[\"He applied the paint with a wide, flat <b>brush</b>.\",\"他用一把宽平的画笔上漆。\"]],\"grade\":[[\"Students are sorted into three <b>grades</b> by their entrance scores.\",\"学生按入学成绩被分成三个等级。\"],[\"This olive oil is of the highest <b>grade</b> and sells for twice the price.\",\"这种橄榄油是最高等级的，售价贵一倍。\"]],\"exploitation\":[[\"The novel describes the <b>exploitation</b> of child workers in nineteenth-century factories.\",\"小说描述了十九世纪工厂对童工的剥削。\"],[\"Workers protested against their <b>exploitation</b> by demanding fair wages.\",\"工人们要求公平工资，抗议对他们的剥削。\"]],\"palm\":[[\"He held the tiny bird gently in the <b>palm</b> of his hand.\",\"他把小鸟轻轻托在手掌里。\"],[\"Sweat made her <b>palms</b> slippery before the piano exam.\",\"钢琴考试前，汗让她的手掌变得滑溜溜的。\"]],\"impact\":[[\"The new road had a big <b>impact</b> on trade in the region.\",\"新公路对该地区的贸易产生了很大的影响。\"],[\"Nobody yet knows the full <b>impact</b> of the dam on fish populations.\",\"还没人知道大坝对鱼类种群的全部影响。\"]],\"bizarre\":[[\"He wore a <b>bizarre</b> hat shaped like a chicken to the party.\",\"他戴着一顶鸡形的奇异帽子去参加派对。\"],[\"The town has a <b>bizarre</b> custom of racing furniture down the main street.\",\"这个镇子有个奇异的习俗：在大街上赛家具。\"]],\"deny\":[[\"The company <b>denied</b> that it had polluted the river.\",\"公司否认污染了河流。\"],[\"She <b>denied</b> taking the money, and no evidence was ever found.\",\"她否认拿了钱，而且始终没有找到任何证据。\"]],\"democracy\":[[\"In a <b>democracy</b>, citizens choose their leaders by voting.\",\"在民主制度下，公民通过投票选择领导人。\"],[\"Free newspapers are considered essential to a healthy <b>democracy</b>.\",\"自由的报刊被认为是健康民主不可或缺的。\"]],\"bacterium\":[[\"Each <b>bacterium</b> divides into two roughly every twenty minutes in warm conditions.\",\"在温暖条件下，每个细菌大约每二十分钟分裂成两个。\"],[\"The <b>bacterium</b> that causes cholera lives in contaminated water.\",\"引起霍乱的细菌生存在受污染的水中。\"]],\"thunder\":[[\"The children counted the seconds between the lightning and the <b>thunder</b>.\",\"孩子们数着闪电和雷之间的秒数。\"],[\"<b>Thunder</b> rolled across the valley long after the rain had stopped.\",\"雨停很久后，雷声仍滚过山谷。\"]],\"tennis\":[[\"They play <b>tennis</b> at the public courts every Saturday morning.\",\"他们每周六上午在公共球场打网球。\"],[\"She has won three <b>tennis</b> titles since turning professional.\",\"转为职业选手以来，她已赢得三个网球冠军。\"]],\"dice\":[[\"Roll the <b>dice</b> and move your counter that many spaces.\",\"掷骰子，按点数移动你的棋子。\"],[\"The game uses two <b>dice</b>, and doubles let you roll again.\",\"这个游戏用两颗骰子，掷出双数可以再掷一次。\"]],\"rub\":[[\"She <b>rubbed</b> her sore shoulder after the long drive.\",\"长途开车后，她摩擦（揉）了酸痛的肩膀。\"],[\"<b>Rub</b> the stain with a damp cloth before washing the shirt.\",\"洗衬衫前，先用湿布摩擦污渍。\"]],\"independence\":[[\"The country celebrated fifty years of <b>independence</b> with a parade.\",\"该国用阅兵庆祝独立五十周年。\"],[\"Living away at university gave her a new sense of <b>independence</b>.\",\"在大学住校生活给了她一种新的独立感。\"]],\"authorise\":[[\"Only a manager can <b>authorise</b> payments above £10,000.\",\"只有经理才能授权一万英镑以上的付款。（authorise 是英式拼写）\"],[\"The council <b>authorised</b> the building of a new bridge.\",\"市政会授权修建一座新桥。\"]],\"alternate\":[[\"Wet and dry seasons <b>alternate</b> through the year in this region.\",\"这个地区一年中干湿两季交替。\"],[\"The two singers <b>alternate</b> verses and sing the chorus together.\",\"两位歌手交替唱主歌，副歌一起唱。\"]],\"armada\":[[\"In 1588 the Spanish <b>Armada</b> sailed towards England and was defeated.\",\"1588 年，西班牙舰队驶向英格兰并被击败。\"],[\"An <b>armada</b> of fishing boats left the harbour before dawn.\",\"一支由渔船组成的舰队在黎明前离开了港口。\"]],\"prism\":[[\"A glass <b>prism</b> splits white light into a rainbow of colours.\",\"玻璃棱镜把白光分解成彩虹般的色彩。\"],[\"Light bends as it passes through a <b>prism</b> because it slows down in glass.\",\"光穿过棱镜时发生弯曲，因为它在玻璃中变慢了。\"]],\"occur\":[[\"Earthquakes <b>occur</b> most often along the edges of tectonic plates.\",\"地震最常发生在板块边缘。\"],[\"The festival <b>occurs</b> on the first full moon of spring.\",\"这个节日在春天第一个满月时发生（举行）。\"]],\"belong\":[[\"This book <b>belongs</b> to the school library, not to me.\",\"这本书属于学校图书馆，不属于我。\"],[\"Penguins <b>belong</b> to a group of flightless birds.\",\"企鹅属于不会飞的鸟类这一组。\"]],\"concert\":[[\"The orchestra gave a free <b>concert</b> in the park on Sunday.\",\"乐团周日在公园里举行了一场免费音乐会。\"],[\"Tickets for the <b>concert</b> sold out within an hour.\",\"音乐会的票一小时内就卖光了。\"]],\"assistance\":[[\"He walks with the <b>assistance</b> of a stick after his operation.\",\"手术后，他在拐杖的协助下行走。\"],[\"The charity provides financial <b>assistance</b> to families after a flood.\",\"这家慈善机构在洪水后为家庭提供经济协助。\"]],\"scallop\":[[\"Grilled <b>scallops</b> with garlic butter are the restaurant's speciality.\",\"蒜香黄油烤扇贝是这家餐厅的招牌菜。\"],[\"A <b>scallop</b> swims by clapping its two shells together.\",\"扇贝靠两扇贝壳一开一合来游泳。\"]],\"drop\":[[\"A single <b>drop</b> of rain fell on the dry ground.\",\"一滴雨落（落下）在干地上。\"],[\"Careful — don't <b>drop</b> the eggs on the way home.\",\"小心——回家路上别把鸡蛋掉（落下）了。\"]],\"oyster\":[[\"He ordered a dozen raw <b>oysters</b> with lemon.\",\"他点了一打配柠檬的生牡蛎。\"],[\"An <b>oyster</b> can filter many litres of water a day as it feeds.\",\"一只牡蛎进食时，一天能过滤许多升水。\"]],\"surprise\":[[\"Her visit was a complete <b>surprise</b>; nobody knew she was in town.\",\"她的来访完全是个惊讶（意外）：没人知道她在城里。\"],[\"To my <b>surprise</b>, the old machine still worked perfectly.\",\"令我惊讶的是，这台旧机器居然还完好地工作。\"]],\"orchard\":[[\"The family picks apples in their <b>orchard</b> every September.\",\"这家人每年九月在自家果园里摘苹果。\"],[\"Bees are kept near the <b>orchard</b> to pollinate the fruit trees.\",\"果园附近养着蜜蜂，给果树授粉。\"]],\"athletics\":[[\"She took up <b>athletics</b> at school and now runs the 400 metres nationally.\",\"她在学校开始练田径，现在在全国跑 400 米。\"],[\"The <b>athletics</b> stadium will host the regional championships.\",\"这座田径体育场将承办地区锦标赛。\"]],\"distinct\":[[\"The two species look similar but have <b>distinct</b> calls.\",\"这两个物种看起来相似，但叫声明显不同。\"],[\"Even from the hill, the church tower was <b>distinct</b> against the sky.\",\"即使从山上看，教堂塔楼在天空下也轮廓明显。\"]],\"apparel\":[[\"The store sells sports <b>apparel</b> for runners and cyclists.\",\"这家店卖跑步者和骑行者的运动服装。\"],[\"Workers in the <b>apparel</b> industry sew clothing for export.\",\"服装行业的工人缝制出口服装。\"]],\"procedure\":[[\"The safety <b>procedure</b> must be followed before the machine is switched on.\",\"开机前必须遵守安全程序。\"],[\"Applying for a visa is a long <b>procedure</b> with many forms to fill in.\",\"申请签证是一个漫长的程序，要填很多表格。\"]],\"energy\":[[\"Solar panels turn sunlight into electrical <b>energy</b>.\",\"太阳能板把阳光转化为电能（能量）。\"],[\"Children seem to have endless <b>energy</b> after a good night's sleep.\",\"睡了个好觉后，孩子们似乎有无穷的能量（精力）。\"]],\"census\":[[\"The national <b>census</b> counts every person living in the country.\",\"全国人口普查统计居住在该国的每一个人。\"],[\"According to the latest <b>census</b>, the town's population has doubled in twenty years.\",\"根据最新人口普查，这个镇的人口二十年里翻了一倍。\"]],\"discharge\":[[\"The factory was fined for the <b>discharge</b> of chemicals into the river.\",\"工厂因向河中释放（排放）化学物质被罚款。\"],[\"The hospital will <b>discharge</b> him tomorrow if his temperature stays normal.\",\"如果他体温保持正常，医院明天就让他出院——也就是把他释放回家休养。\"]],\"acquaintance\":[[\"He is not a close friend, just an <b>acquaintance</b> from my chemistry class.\",\"他不是我的密友，只是化学课上认识的一个熟人。\"],[\"She made the <b>acquaintance</b> of several young artists while she was living in Paris.\",\"她住在巴黎期间结识了几位年轻艺术家。\"]],\"ancient\":[[\"The museum displays farm tools made by <b>ancient</b> peoples thousands of years ago.\",\"博物馆展出了数千年前古代人制作的农具。\"],[\"In <b>ancient</b> Rome, a network of roads connected the capital with distant provinces.\",\"在古罗马，道路网把首都和遥远的行省连接起来。\"]],\"angular\":[[\"The new museum has an <b>angular</b> design, with sharp corners and sloping glass walls.\",\"新博物馆的设计棱角分明，尖角配上倾斜的玻璃墙。\"],[\"He had a thin, <b>angular</b> face with high cheekbones and a strong jaw.\",\"他脸庞瘦削、轮廓有棱角，颧骨高，下巴线条硬朗。\"]],\"assent\":[[\"After a short debate, the committee gave its <b>assent</b> to the new budget.\",\"经过简短辩论，委员会同意了新预算。\"],[\"When the teacher asked if everyone understood, most students nodded in <b>assent</b>.\",\"老师问大家是否都听懂了，大多数学生点头表示同意。\"]],\"assess\":[[\"Teachers <b>assess</b> students' progress through tests, projects and classwork.\",\"老师通过考试、项目和课堂作业来评估学生的进步。\"],[\"Engineers were sent to <b>assess</b> the damage to the bridge after the earthquake.\",\"震后，工程师被派去评估桥梁的受损情况。\"]],\"astonishment\":[[\"To everyone's <b>astonishment</b>, the quiet first-year student won the national science prize.\",\"令所有人惊讶的是，那位沉默寡言的大一新生获得了全国科学奖。\"],[\"He stared in <b>astonishment</b> at the huge whale swimming beside the boat.\",\"他惊讶地盯着在船边游动的那头巨鲸。\"]],\"autumn\":[[\"In <b>autumn</b>, the leaves of the maple trees turn bright red and gold.\",\"秋天，枫叶变成鲜艳的红色和金色。\"],[\"Farmers in the valley harvest their crops in early <b>autumn</b>.\",\"山谷里的农民在初秋收获庄稼。\"]],\"awareness\":[[\"The campaign raised public <b>awareness</b> of the dangers of smoking.\",\"这场宣传活动提高了公众对吸烟危害的意识。\"],[\"His <b>awareness</b> of the problem grew after he spent a summer volunteering at the shelter.\",\"在一个收容所做了一夏天志愿者之后，他对这个问题的认识加深了。\"]],\"bear\":[[\"She could no longer <b>bear</b> the noise from the construction site next door.\",\"她再也忍受不了隔壁工地的噪音了。\"],[\"Farmers in this dry region must <b>bear</b> months of drought almost every year.\",\"这个干旱地区的农民几乎每年都要忍受长达数月的旱灾。\"]],\"bewitch\":[[\"In the fairy tale, an evil queen <b>bewitches</b> the princess, who falls into a sleep that lasts a hundred years.\",\"在童话里，邪恶的王后给公主施了魔法，公主陷入长达百年的沉睡。\"],[\"The audience sat in silence, <b>bewitched</b> by the singer's voice.\",\"观众静静地坐着，被歌手的嗓音迷住了。\"]],\"bold\":[[\"It was a <b>bold</b> decision to sail across the Atlantic alone in such a small boat.\",\"乘这么小的船独自横渡大西洋，是一个勇敢的决定。\"],[\"The climbers made a <b>bold</b> attempt to reach the summit in the middle of winter.\",\"登山者们勇敢地尝试在隆冬登顶。\"]],\"bookstore\":[[\"There is a small <b>bookstore</b> near the campus gate that sells used textbooks.\",\"校门附近有一家小书店，出售二手教材。\"],[\"He works part-time in a <b>bookstore</b> on weekends to pay for his studies.\",\"他周末在一家书店兼职，挣钱支付学业开销。\"]],\"cater\":[[\"This hotel <b>caters</b> mainly to business travelers who stay only one or two nights.\",\"这家酒店主要迎合只住一两晚的商务旅客。\"],[\"The beginner's course <b>caters</b> for students with no previous training in biology.\",\"这门入门课程照顾到此前没有受过生物学训练的学生。\"]],\"classify\":[[\"Biologists <b>classify</b> living things into groups based on shared features.\",\"生物学家根据共同特征把生物划分成不同的类群。\"],[\"The librarian <b>classified</b> the new books by subject and shelved them the same day.\",\"图书管理员按学科给新书分类，当天就上了架。\"]],\"clothe\":[[\"The charity <b>clothes</b> and feeds families who lost their homes in the fire.\",\"这家慈善机构为在火灾中失去家园的家庭提供衣物和食物。\"],[\"She <b>clothed</b> the baby in a soft cotton suit before taking him outside.\",\"她给婴儿穿上柔软的棉衣，然后才带他出门。\"]],\"confirm\":[[\"Please <b>confirm</b> your hotel booking by replying to this email.\",\"请回复这封邮件，确认您的酒店预订。\"],[\"The test results <b>confirm</b> that the lake water is safe for swimming.\",\"检测结果证实，湖水可以安全游泳。\"]],\"context\":[[\"You can often guess the meaning of an unfamiliar word from its <b>context</b>.\",\"你常常可以根据上下文猜出一个生词的意思。\"],[\"The professor discussed the poem against the historical <b>context</b> of the civil war.\",\"教授结合内战的历史背景讲解了这首诗。\"]],\"desktop\":[[\"He bought a <b>desktop</b> computer because design work needs a large screen.\",\"他买了一台台式电脑，因为设计工作需要大屏幕。\"],[\"Students may use the <b>desktop</b> computers in the library free of charge.\",\"学生可以免费使用图书馆里的台式电脑。\"]],\"embarrassment\":[[\"To his great <b>embarrassment</b>, he forgot the guest speaker's name in front of everyone.\",\"令他十分尴尬的是，他在众人面前忘了嘉宾的名字。\"],[\"She blushed with <b>embarrassment</b> when her phone rang loudly in the middle of the lecture.\",\"讲座进行到一半，她的手机大声响起，她尴尬得脸都红了。\"]],\"empress\":[[\"Wu Zetian was the only woman in Chinese history to rule as <b>empress</b> in her own name.\",\"武则天是中国历史上唯一以女皇身份亲自统治的女性。\"],[\"The <b>empress</b> ordered a new palace to be built beside the river.\",\"女皇下令在河边修建一座新宫殿。\"]],\"endurance\":[[\"Marathon running tests both speed and <b>endurance</b>.\",\"马拉松既考验速度，也考验耐力。\"],[\"The bridge was built from materials chosen for their <b>endurance</b> in salt water.\",\"这座桥选用的材料能在盐水中经久耐用，看中的正是它们的耐久性。\"]],\"equity\":[[\"The reform was designed to bring greater <b>equity</b> in access to higher education.\",\"这项改革旨在让接受高等教育的机会更加公平。\"],[\"Pay <b>equity</b> means that work of equal value should receive equal pay, whoever does it.\",\"薪酬公平意味着同等价值的工作，无论由谁来做，都应获得同等报酬。\"]],\"evacuation\":[[\"The fire alarm led to the <b>evacuation</b> of everyone in the office building within minutes.\",\"火警一响，办公楼里所有人在几分钟内完成了疏散。\"],[\"Before the hurricane made landfall, the mayor ordered the <b>evacuation</b> of the coastal villages.\",\"飓风登陆之前，市长下令疏散沿海村庄。\"]],\"expulsion\":[[\"Cheating on the final exam led to his <b>expulsion</b> from the university.\",\"期末考试作弊导致他被大学开除。\"],[\"A cough is caused by the sudden <b>expulsion</b> of air from the lungs.\",\"咳嗽是空气突然从肺部排出所引起的。\"]],\"glare\":[[\"The teacher <b>glared</b> at the two students who kept talking during the test.\",\"老师怒视着考试时一直说话的那两个学生。\"],[\"He gave me a cold <b>glare</b> and walked out without saying a word.\",\"他冷冷地瞪了我一眼，一言不发地走了出去。\"]],\"judgment\":[[\"The court will announce its <b>judgment</b> on the case next week.\",\"法院将于下周宣判这起案件。\"],[\"In my <b>judgment</b>, the experiment should be repeated with a much larger sample.\",\"依我判断，这项实验应该用大得多的样本再做一遍。\"]],\"malignant\":[[\"Tests showed that the tumor was <b>malignant</b>, so surgery was scheduled for the same week.\",\"检查显示肿瘤是恶性的，因此手术安排在同一周进行。\"],[\"A <b>malignant</b> tumor can spread to other parts of the body if it is not treated early.\",\"恶性肿瘤如果不尽早治疗，可能扩散到身体的其他部位。\"]],\"mathematics\":[[\"He is studying <b>mathematics</b> at university and hopes to become a teacher.\",\"他在大学里学数学，希望将来当老师。\"],[\"This physics course requires a solid background in <b>mathematics</b>, especially calculus.\",\"这门物理课要求学生有扎实的数学基础，尤其是微积分。\"]],\"mechanism\":[[\"Scientists still do not fully understand the <b>mechanism</b> by which this drug lowers blood pressure.\",\"科学家仍未完全弄清这种药物降低血压的机制。\"],[\"The clock's <b>mechanism</b> consists of tiny gears that must be cleaned and oiled regularly.\",\"这座钟的机芯由微小的齿轮组成，必须定期清洁和上油。\"]],\"monarchy\":[[\"France was a <b>monarchy</b> for centuries before the revolution of 1789.\",\"1789 年革命之前，法国实行了好几个世纪的君主制。\"],[\"In a constitutional <b>monarchy</b>, the king or queen shares power with an elected parliament.\",\"在君主立宪制下，国王或女王与民选议会分享权力。\"]],\"monologue\":[[\"The play opens with a long <b>monologue</b> in which the old king doubts his own decisions.\",\"这部剧以一段长独白开场，老国王在独白中怀疑自己的决定。\"],[\"Her fifteen-minute <b>monologue</b> about the trip left no room for anyone else to speak.\",\"她关于这次旅行一个人讲了十五分钟，别人根本插不上话。\"]],\"nation\":[[\"Japan is an island <b>nation</b> in East Asia.\",\"日本是东亚的一个岛国。\"],[\"After independence, the new <b>nation</b> had to build its own government and army.\",\"独立之后，这个新国家必须建立自己的政府和军队。\"]],\"novel\":[[\"Her latest <b>novel</b> is set in a small fishing village in the nineteenth century.\",\"她的最新小说以十九世纪的一个小渔村为背景。\"],[\"This term, every student must read one full <b>novel</b> and write a report on it.\",\"这学期每名学生必须读完一部长篇小说并写一份读书报告。\"]],\"pelican\":[[\"A <b>pelican</b> catches fish by diving into the water with its huge beak wide open.\",\"鹈鹕张开大嘴扎进水里捕鱼。\"],[\"White <b>pelicans</b> gather on the lake in large flocks during the migration season.\",\"迁徙季节，白鹈鹕成群聚集在这片湖面上。\"]],\"pelvis\":[[\"The <b>pelvis</b> supports the weight of the upper body when a person sits or stands.\",\"人坐着或站立时，骨盆支撑着上半身的重量。\"],[\"He fractured his <b>pelvis</b> in the fall and could not walk for several months.\",\"他摔伤了骨盆，好几个月都不能走路。\"]],\"penguin\":[[\"Emperor <b>penguins</b> huddle together to survive the long Antarctic winter.\",\"帝企鹅挤成一团，熬过南极漫长的冬天。\"],[\"Unlike most birds, a <b>penguin</b> cannot fly, but it is an excellent swimmer.\",\"与大多数鸟类不同，企鹅不会飞，却是游泳能手。\"]],\"planet\":[[\"Mars is the fourth <b>planet</b> from the Sun and is often called the Red Planet.\",\"火星是距离太阳第四近的行星，常被称为红色星球。\"],[\"Astronomers have found a <b>planet</b> outside our solar system that may have liquid water on its surface.\",\"天文学家在太阳系外发现了一颗行星，它的表面可能存在液态水。\"]],\"poem\":[[\"The students memorized a short <b>poem</b> by Robert Frost for Friday's class.\",\"学生们为周五的课背诵了罗伯特·弗罗斯特的一首短诗。\"],[\"She wrote a <b>poem</b> about the sea near her childhood home.\",\"她写了一首诗，写的正是童年故乡附近的大海。\"]],\"police\":[[\"The <b>police</b> closed the road while they investigated the accident.\",\"警方在调查这起事故期间封闭了道路。\"],[\"Campus <b>police</b> patrol the dormitory area at night to keep students safe.\",\"校园警察夜间在宿舍区巡逻，保障学生安全。\"]],\"principal\":[[\"The school <b>principal</b> welcomed the new students at the opening ceremony.\",\"校长在开学典礼上欢迎新同学。\"],[\"Several parents asked to meet the <b>principal</b> about the new lunch program.\",\"几位家长要求与校长见面，谈谈新的午餐计划。\"]],\"punishment\":[[\"In the experiment, the rats quickly learned to press the lever in order to avoid <b>punishment</b>.\",\"在实验中，老鼠很快学会了按压杠杆来躲避惩罚。\"],[\"The <b>punishment</b> for breaking the school rules was a week of detention.\",\"违反校规的惩罚是留堂一周。\"]],\"purse\":[[\"She kept her coins, keys and bus pass in a small leather <b>purse</b>.\",\"她把硬币、钥匙和公交卡放在一个小皮手提包里。\"],[\"Someone stole her <b>purse</b> on the crowded bus yesterday morning.\",\"昨天早上，有人在拥挤的公交车上偷走了她的手提包。\"]],\"sentence\":[[\"The judge gave him a <b>sentence</b> of five years in prison for the robbery.\",\"法官以抢劫罪判处他五年监禁。\"],[\"She is appealing against her <b>sentence</b>, arguing that ten years is far too harsh.\",\"她正对判决提起上诉，认为十年刑期太重。\"]],\"shoulder\":[[\"He carried the heavy box on his <b>shoulder</b> all the way up the stairs.\",\"他把沉重的箱子扛在肩膀上，一路上了楼。\"],[\"The doctor told her to rest her injured <b>shoulder</b> for at least two weeks.\",\"医生叮嘱她让受伤的肩膀至少休息两周。\"]],\"stove\":[[\"She put a pot of water on the <b>stove</b> and waited for it to boil.\",\"她在炉灶上放了一壶水，等它烧开。\"],[\"A wood <b>stove</b> kept the single room of the cabin warm all night.\",\"一台烧木柴的炉子让小木屋唯一的房间整夜都暖暖的。\"]],\"technician\":[[\"A <b>technician</b> came to repair the broken projector in the lecture hall.\",\"一名技术员来修理报告厅里坏掉的投影仪。\"],[\"Lab <b>technicians</b> prepare and label the samples before the scientists analyze them.\",\"实验室技术员在科学家分析之前备好样本并贴上标签。\"]],\"thigh\":[[\"The muscles at the front of the <b>thigh</b> work together to straighten the knee.\",\"大腿前侧的肌肉协同发力，把膝盖伸直。\"],[\"She felt a sharp pain in her <b>thigh</b> during the race and had to stop running.\",\"比赛中她大腿一阵剧痛，只好停了下来。\"]],\"untie\":[[\"He knelt down to <b>untie</b> his shoelaces before stepping into the house.\",\"他蹲下来解开鞋带，然后才走进屋子。\"],[\"The sailor <b>untied</b> the boat and pushed it away from the dock.\",\"水手解开小船的缆绳，把船推离码头。\"]],\"villain\":[[\"In the play, the <b>villain</b> plots to steal the throne from the young king.\",\"在剧中，恶棍密谋从年轻国王手中夺取王位。\"],[\"The novel's <b>villain</b> is a charming banker who secretly ruins everyone who trusts him.\",\"小说里的恶棍是个迷人的银行家，暗地里毁掉每一个信任他的人。\"]],\"wetland\":[[\"This <b>wetland</b> provides a feeding ground for hundreds of migrating birds each spring.\",\"这片湿地每年春天为数百只候鸟提供觅食地。\"],[\"Building houses on the <b>wetland</b> was banned, because it protects the town from floods.\",\"这片湿地上禁止建房，因为它能保护城镇免遭洪水。\"]],\"accuracy\":[[\"The new watch is famous for its <b>accuracy</b>; it loses less than a second a month.\",\"这款新手表以走时准确闻名，一个月误差不到一秒。\"],[\"Journalists must check the <b>accuracy</b> of their information before publishing.\",\"记者在发表之前必须核查信息的准确性。\"]],\"achieve\":[[\"With regular practice, most students can <b>achieve</b> a high score in the listening test.\",\"通过规律练习，大多数学生都能在听力测试中取得高分。\"],[\"She <b>achieved</b> her goal of running a full marathon before she turned thirty.\",\"她在三十岁之前实现了跑完一场全程马拉松的目标。\"]],\"advantage\":[[\"Knowing two languages is a real <b>advantage</b> when you apply for this job.\",\"会两种语言在申请这份工作时是真正的优势。\"],[\"The home team took <b>advantage</b> of the wind in the second half.\",\"主队在下半场利用了顺风的优势。\"]],\"archaeologist\":[[\"The <b>archaeologist</b> carefully brushed the dust away from the ancient pottery.\",\"考古学家小心地刷去古代陶器上的尘土。\"],[\"An <b>archaeologist</b> can learn a great deal about a village from its buried cooking pots and tools.\",\"考古学家能从埋在地下的炊具和工具中了解一个村庄的许多情况。\"]],\"assertive\":[[\"An <b>assertive</b> student is not afraid to ask questions when something is unclear.\",\"坚定自信的学生在有不明白的地方时敢于提问。\"],[\"She gave her opinion in a calm but <b>assertive</b> tone that ended the argument.\",\"她用平静而坚定的语气说出自己的意见，结束了争论。\"]],\"astronomer\":[[\"The <b>astronomer</b> spent the whole night watching a newly discovered comet.\",\"这位天文学家整夜观测一颗新发现的彗星。\"],[\"Using a larger telescope, <b>astronomers</b> found hundreds of galaxies that had never been seen before.\",\"借助更大的望远镜，天文学家发现了数百个从未被观测到的星系。\"]],\"baboon\":[[\"A troop of <b>baboons</b> crossed the road in front of our car.\",\"一群狒狒从我们的车前穿过马路。\"],[\"The male <b>baboon</b> showed its teeth to warn the others away from its food.\",\"雄狒狒露出牙齿，警告同伴离它的食物远点。\"]],\"ballot\":[[\"Voters marked their <b>ballot</b> in private and dropped it into the box.\",\"选民在私下填写选票，然后投入票箱。\"],[\"The result was decided by a secret <b>ballot</b> of all union members.\",\"结果由全体工会成员无记名投票决定。\"]],\"beacon\":[[\"For centuries, the lighthouse on the cliff <b>beaconed</b> ships safely into the harbour.\",\"几个世纪以来，悬崖上的灯塔像指路明灯一样，引导船只安全进港。\"],[\"A single radio tower on the hill <b>beacons</b> aircraft toward the small airport at night.\",\"山上的一座无线电塔在夜里为飞机指引方向，把它们引向那座小机场。\"]],\"bearable\":[[\"With the windows open, the heat in the classroom became <b>bearable</b>.\",\"打开窗户后，教室里的炎热变得可以忍受了。\"],[\"A good pair of shoes makes the long walk much more <b>bearable</b>.\",\"一双好鞋能让长途步行好受得多。\"]],\"belt\":[[\"She <b>belted</b> her coat tightly against the freezing wind.\",\"她用带子把大衣紧紧系住，抵御刺骨的寒风。\"],[\"He <b>belted</b> the stack of books together so they would be easier to carry.\",\"他用带子把那摞书捆在一起，这样更好搬。\"]],\"bulk\":[[\"The <b>bulk</b> of the work was finished before the end of March.\",\"这项工作的大部分在三月底之前就完成了。\"],[\"Farmers sell the <b>bulk</b> of their grain to a few large companies.\",\"农民把他们的大量粮食卖给几家大公司。\"]],\"camera\":[[\"He bought a new <b>camera</b> before his trip to the mountains.\",\"去山区旅行之前，他买了一台新相机。\"],[\"Security <b>cameras</b> at the station recorded the man leaving with the bag.\",\"车站的监控摄像头拍下了那名男子拎着包离开的画面。\"]],\"certificate\":[[\"She received a <b>certificate</b> after completing the first-aid course.\",\"她完成急救课程后获得了一张证书。\"],[\"You need to show your birth <b>certificate</b> when you apply for a passport.\",\"申请护照时需要出示出生证明。\"]],\"coast\":[[\"They walked along the <b>coast</b>, watching the waves break against the rocks.\",\"他们沿着海岸散步，看海浪拍打礁石。\"],[\"The town lies on the west <b>coast</b>, about two hours from the capital.\",\"这座小镇位于西海岸，离首都约两小时车程。\"]],\"condemn\":[[\"Leaders around the world <b>condemned</b> the attack on the hospital.\",\"世界各国领导人谴责了对医院的袭击。\"],[\"The report <b>condemns</b> the factory for dumping waste into the river.\",\"报告谴责这家工厂向河里倾倒废料。\"]],\"continent\":[[\"Africa is the second largest <b>continent</b> in the world.\",\"非洲是世界第二大大陆。\"],[\"Millions of years ago, all the <b>continents</b> were joined together in a single landmass.\",\"数百万年前，所有大陆连成了一整块陆地。\"]],\"cooperation\":[[\"The bridge was built through the <b>cooperation</b> of engineers from three countries.\",\"这座桥是三国工程师合作建成的。\"],[\"Good teamwork depends on trust and <b>cooperation</b> among all members.\",\"良好的团队协作依赖于所有成员之间的信任与合作。\"]],\"decryption\":[[\"Without the correct key, the <b>decryption</b> of the message could take years.\",\"没有正确的密钥，这条信息的解密可能需要数年。\"],[\"Modern software performs the <b>decryption</b> automatically when you enter your password.\",\"你输入密码后，现代软件会自动完成解密。\"]],\"diploma\":[[\"She framed her university <b>diploma</b> and hung it on the wall of her office.\",\"她把大学文凭装进相框，挂在办公室的墙上。\"],[\"A high-school <b>diploma</b> is required for most office jobs in the city.\",\"这座城市的大多数办公室工作都要求有高中毕业文凭。\"]],\"diplomacy\":[[\"The border dispute was settled through <b>diplomacy</b> rather than war.\",\"这场边境争端通过外交而非战争得到了解决。\"],[\"Years of careful <b>diplomacy</b> finally brought the two countries to the negotiating table.\",\"多年审慎的外交努力，终于让两国坐到了谈判桌前。\"]],\"dishwasher\":[[\"After dinner, he loaded the plates into the <b>dishwasher</b> and pressed start.\",\"晚饭后，他把盘子放进洗碗机，按下启动键。\"],[\"A <b>dishwasher</b> uses less water than washing the same dishes by hand.\",\"洗碗机比手洗同样的碗碟更省水。\"]],\"dose\":[[\"The doctor increased the <b>dose</b> to two tablets a day.\",\"医生把剂量增加到每天两片。\"],[\"Take one <b>dose</b> of the medicine every six hours, with food.\",\"这种药每六小时服用一个剂量，要随餐服用。\"]],\"eggplant\":[[\"She sliced the <b>eggplant</b> and grilled it with garlic and olive oil.\",\"她把茄子切成片，用大蒜和橄榄油烤制。\"],[\"In this climate, <b>eggplants</b> grow best in full sunlight with plenty of water.\",\"在这种气候下，茄子在阳光充足、水分充沛时生长最好。\"]],\"electron\":[[\"An <b>electron</b> carries a negative electric charge.\",\"电子带负电荷。\"],[\"When atoms lose or gain <b>electrons</b>, they become electrically charged ions.\",\"当原子失去或获得电子时，就变成了带电的离子。\"]],\"enthusiasm\":[[\"She joined the science club with great <b>enthusiasm</b> in her first week at college.\",\"开学第一周，她满怀热情地加入了科学社团。\"],[\"The teacher's <b>enthusiasm</b> for history made every lecture lively.\",\"老师对历史的热情让每一堂课都生动起来。\"]],\"expense\":[[\"Travel is the largest <b>expense</b> in the project's budget.\",\"差旅是该项目预算中最大的一笔开支。\"],[\"She keeps a record of every small <b>expense</b>, down to bus fares and coffee.\",\"她把每一笔小开支都记下来，细到公交车费和咖啡钱。\"]],\"extraction\":[[\"The <b>extraction</b> of the wisdom tooth took less than twenty minutes.\",\"这颗智齿的拔除用了不到二十分钟。\"],[\"After the <b>extraction</b>, the dentist told him not to eat hot food for a day.\",\"拔牙之后，牙医叮嘱他一天内不要吃热的食物。\"]],\"golf\":[[\"He plays <b>golf</b> with his father every Sunday morning.\",\"他每周日上午和父亲一起打高尔夫。\"],[\"A standard <b>golf</b> course has eighteen holes spread over a large area of grassland.\",\"一座标准高尔夫球场有十八个球洞，分布在一大片草地上。\"]],\"grab\":[[\"He <b>grabbed</b> his umbrella and ran out into the rain.\",\"他抓起雨伞，冲进雨里。\"],[\"The hawk swooped down and <b>grabbed</b> the mouse in its claws.\",\"老鹰俯冲下来，用爪子抓住了老鼠。\"]],\"hornet\":[[\"A <b>hornet</b> sting can be dangerous for people who are allergic to it.\",\"大黄蜂的蜇刺对过敏的人来说可能很危险。\"],[\"Do not disturb the <b>hornets'</b> nest hanging under the roof.\",\"不要去招惹挂在屋檐下的大黄蜂窝。\"]],\"illusion\":[[\"The mirrors in the hall create the <b>illusion</b> that the room is twice its real size.\",\"大厅里的镜子制造出一种错觉，让房间看起来有实际大小的两倍。\"],[\"It is an <b>illusion</b> that the Moon grows bigger near the horizon; it is actually the same size.\",\"月亮在地平线附近看起来变大只是一种错觉，它实际上一样大。\"]],\"judge\":[[\"The <b>judge</b> asked the witness to describe exactly what she had seen that night.\",\"法官让证人确切描述她那晚看到的情形。\"],[\"After hearing both sides, the <b>judge</b> decided to postpone the trial for two weeks.\",\"听取双方陈述后，法官决定将审判推迟两周。\"]],\"kite\":[[\"The children flew a bright red <b>kite</b> on the windy hill.\",\"孩子们在多风的山坡上放一只鲜红的风筝。\"],[\"A strong gust of wind carried the <b>kite</b> high above the trees.\",\"一阵强风把风筝吹到了树梢之上。\"]],\"longevity\":[[\"Regular exercise and a balanced diet are linked to greater <b>longevity</b>.\",\"规律锻炼和均衡饮食与更长的寿命相关。\"],[\"The village is famous for the <b>longevity</b> of its people; many residents live past ninety.\",\"这个村子以居民长寿闻名，许多人活过九十岁。\"]],\"moisture\":[[\"Plants take up <b>moisture</b> from the soil through their roots.\",\"植物通过根从土壤中吸收水分。\"],[\"Too much <b>moisture</b> in the air can damage old books and paintings.\",\"空气中湿气过重会损坏古籍和画作。\"]],\"normal\":[[\"It is <b>normal</b> for babies to wake up several times during the night.\",\"婴儿夜里醒来好几次是正常的。\"],[\"After the storm, bus services returned to <b>normal</b> the following morning.\",\"暴风雨过后，公交服务在第二天早上恢复了正常。\"]],\"owl\":[[\"An <b>owl</b> hunts at night, using its excellent hearing to find mice in the dark.\",\"猫头鹰在夜间捕猎，靠敏锐的听觉在黑暗中寻找老鼠。\"],[\"We heard an <b>owl</b> calling from the tall pine tree behind the house.\",\"我们听见一只猫头鹰在屋后的高松树上鸣叫。\"]],\"personality\":[[\"Her warm <b>personality</b> makes her popular with both students and parents.\",\"她热情的性格让她深受学生和家长的喜爱。\"],[\"Twins may look alike, but their <b>personalities</b> can be completely different.\",\"双胞胎长相可能相似，性格却可能完全不同。\"]],\"premium\":[[\"Her monthly car insurance <b>premium</b> rose after the accident.\",\"事故之后，她每月的汽车保险费涨了。\"],[\"Young drivers usually pay a higher <b>premium</b> because insurers consider them a greater risk.\",\"年轻司机通常要交更高的保险费，因为保险公司认为他们的风险更大。\"]],\"pull\":[[\"He had to <b>pull</b> hard to open the heavy wooden door.\",\"他得使劲拉，才能打开那扇沉重的木门。\"],[\"Two horses were used to <b>pull</b> the cart up the steep hill.\",\"人们用两匹马把大车拉上陡坡。\"]],\"scholarship\":[[\"She won a <b>scholarship</b> that pays for her full four years at university.\",\"她获得了一份奖学金，覆盖大学四年的全部费用。\"],[\"The <b>scholarship</b> is awarded each year to students with excellent grades and financial need.\",\"这项奖学金每年颁发给成绩优异且经济困难的学生。\"]],\"shampoo\":[[\"She bought a bottle of <b>shampoo</b> made for dry hair.\",\"她买了一瓶适合干性发质的洗发水。\"],[\"He washed the dog with a special <b>shampoo</b> that keeps fleas away.\",\"他用一种防跳蚤的专用香波给狗洗澡。\"]],\"sheep\":[[\"The farmer keeps about two hundred <b>sheep</b> on the hill farm.\",\"农场主在山地农场里养了大约两百只绵羊。\"],[\"A <b>sheep's</b> thick wool protects it from the cold winter wind.\",\"绵羊厚厚的羊毛能为它抵御冬日的寒风。\"]],\"shell\":[[\"She collected a pink <b>shell</b> on the beach and kept it on her desk.\",\"她在海滩上捡了一个粉色的贝壳，放在书桌上。\"],[\"The turtle pulled its head inside its <b>shell</b> when the dog came near.\",\"狗靠近时，乌龟把头缩进了壳里。\"]],\"suck\":[[\"The baby <b>sucked</b> his thumb and soon fell asleep.\",\"婴儿吮着拇指，很快就睡着了。\"],[\"Use a straw to <b>suck</b> the juice up from the bottom of the glass.\",\"用吸管把杯子底部的果汁吸上来。\"]],\"throat\":[[\"He cleared his <b>throat</b> and began to read the announcement aloud.\",\"他清了清喉咙，开始大声宣读通知。\"],[\"A sore <b>throat</b> is often the first sign of a cold.\",\"喉咙痛往往是感冒的最初症状。\"]],\"transmission\":[[\"The live <b>transmission</b> of the football match reached millions of viewers.\",\"这场足球比赛的现场直播有数百万观众收看。\"],[\"Mosquitoes are responsible for the <b>transmission</b> of malaria from person to person.\",\"蚊子是疟疾在人与人之间传播的媒介。\"]],\"trial\":[[\"The <b>trial</b> lasted three weeks before the jury reached its verdict.\",\"这场审判持续了三周，陪审团才作出裁决。\"],[\"During the <b>trial</b>, several witnesses described what they had seen outside the bank.\",\"审判期间，几名证人描述了他们在银行外看到的情形。\"]],\"vendor\":[[\"A street <b>vendor</b> was selling roasted corn outside the station.\",\"一名街头小贩在车站外卖烤玉米。\"],[\"The market is full of <b>vendors</b> offering fruit, flowers and handmade cloth.\",\"市场上满是卖水果、鲜花和手工布料的小贩。\"]],\"administration\":[[\"The day-to-day <b>administration</b> of the hospital is handled by a small team of managers.\",\"医院的日常管理工作由一个小型管理团队负责。\"],[\"Under the new <b>administration</b>, the city increased spending on public transport.\",\"在新一届政府领导下，这座城市增加了对公共交通的投入。\"]],\"afford\":[[\"Most families in the village cannot <b>afford</b> a car of their own.\",\"村里大多数家庭买不起自己的汽车。\"],[\"He worked extra shifts so that he could <b>afford</b> his daughter's music lessons.\",\"他多上夜班，这样就能负担得起女儿的音乐课费用。\"]],\"alley\":[[\"The cat slipped into a narrow <b>alley</b> between the two shops.\",\"那只猫钻进了两家商店之间的一条窄巷。\"],[\"Children were playing basketball in the <b>alley</b> behind the apartment building.\",\"孩子们在公寓楼后面的小巷里打篮球。\"]],\"ancestor\":[[\"In the village temple, families burn incense to honour their <b>ancestors</b>.\",\"在村里的庙中，各家焚香祭拜祖先。\"],[\"The festival is a time to remember one's <b>ancestors</b> and the land they farmed.\",\"这个节日是缅怀祖先和他们耕种过的土地的时刻。\"]],\"appendix\":[[\"His <b>appendix</b> became inflamed, and doctors removed it the same night.\",\"他的阑尾发炎了，医生当晚就做了切除手术。\"],[\"The <b>appendix</b> is a small tube attached to the large intestine whose function is still debated.\",\"阑尾是连在大肠上的一根小管，其功能至今仍有争议。\"]],\"appropriateness\":[[\"The committee questioned the <b>appropriateness</b> of building a casino next to a school.\",\"委员会质疑在学校旁边建赌场是否适当。\"],[\"She checked the <b>appropriateness</b> of her outfit before the job interview.\",\"面试之前，她检查了一下自己的着装是否得体。\"]],\"article\":[[\"She published an <b>article</b> on ocean pollution in a scientific journal.\",\"她在一本科学期刊上发表了一篇关于海洋污染的文章。\"],[\"I read an interesting <b>article</b> about the history of the Olympic Games.\",\"我读了一篇关于奥运会历史的有趣文章。\"]],\"asylum\":[[\"The journalist fled the country and asked for political <b>asylum</b> abroad.\",\"这名记者逃离本国，在国外寻求政治庇护。\"],[\"Thousands of refugees applied for <b>asylum</b> after the war broke out.\",\"战争爆发后，数千名难民申请了庇护。\"]],\"axle\":[[\"The truck's rear <b>axle</b> broke, and the vehicle had to be towed away.\",\"卡车的后车轴断了，车不得不被拖走。\"],[\"Grease is applied to the <b>axle</b> so the wheels can turn smoothly.\",\"在车轴上涂润滑脂，车轮才能转动顺畅。\"]],\"barricade\":[[\"Protesters <b>barricaded</b> the street with overturned carts and wooden planks.\",\"抗议者用翻倒的手推车和木板把街道堵了起来，设成路障。\"],[\"The soldiers <b>barricaded</b> the bridge to stop the enemy from crossing the river.\",\"士兵们在桥上设置路障，阻止敌人过河。\"]],\"box\":[[\"She packed her books into a cardboard <b>box</b> and taped it shut.\",\"她把书装进一个纸盒子，用胶带封好。\"],[\"He keeps his tools in a metal <b>box</b> under the workbench.\",\"他把工具放在工作台下面的一只金属盒子里。\"]],\"canon\":[[\"Shakespeare's plays form a central part of the <b>canon</b> of English literature.\",\"莎士比亚的戏剧是英国文学经典规范的核心部分。\"],[\"The novel was slowly added to the <b>canon</b> of works every student is expected to read.\",\"这部小说逐渐被纳入学生必读的经典书目。\"]],\"carbon\":[[\"All living things are based on <b>carbon</b>, which can form an enormous variety of molecules.\",\"一切生物都以碳为基础，碳能构成种类极其繁多的分子。\"],[\"Burning coal releases <b>carbon</b> into the air as carbon dioxide.\",\"燃烧煤炭会以二氧化碳的形式把碳排放到空气中。\"]],\"compound\":[[\"Water is a <b>compound</b> made of hydrogen and oxygen.\",\"水是由氢和氧组成的化合物。\"],[\"In the lab, students heated the <b>compound</b> and recorded how it changed colour.\",\"在实验室里，学生加热这种化合物，并记录它颜色的变化。\"]],\"decade\":[[\"The city's population has doubled in the last <b>decade</b>.\",\"这座城市的人口在过去十年里翻了一倍。\"],[\"She spent a <b>decade</b> studying the behaviour of wolves in the wild.\",\"她花了十年时间研究野外狼群的行为。\"]],\"digestion\":[[\"Fibre in vegetables helps <b>digestion</b> and keeps the stomach healthy.\",\"蔬菜中的纤维有助于消化，保持肠胃健康。\"],[\"<b>Digestion</b> begins in the mouth, where food is broken down by chewing and saliva.\",\"消化从口腔开始，食物在那里被咀嚼和唾液分解。\"]],\"disagreement\":[[\"The two scientists were in <b>disagreement</b> about the age of the fossils.\",\"两位科学家对这些化石的年代存在分歧。\"],[\"After hours of <b>disagreement</b>, the council finally reached a compromise.\",\"经过数小时的分歧，委员会最终达成了妥协。\"]],\"dizzy\":[[\"Standing up too quickly made him feel <b>dizzy</b> for a moment.\",\"站起来太快，他一时觉得头晕。\"],[\"She felt <b>dizzy</b> after spinning around on the playground ride.\",\"在游乐设施上转了几圈后，她感到头晕。\"]],\"dune\":[[\"Wind slowly moves the sand <b>dunes</b> across the desert, metre by metre.\",\"风把沙丘在沙漠中缓缓推移，一米一米地移动。\"],[\"They climbed the tallest <b>dune</b> to watch the sun set over the sand sea.\",\"他们爬上最高的沙丘，看太阳在沙海上方落下。\"]],\"ember\":[[\"The campers watched the last <b>embers</b> of the fire glow in the dark.\",\"露营者看着篝火最后的余烬在黑暗中闪烁。\"],[\"An <b>ember</b> from the fireplace landed on the rug and started to smoke.\",\"壁炉里飞出的一块余烬落在地毯上，开始冒烟。\"]],\"empirical\":[[\"The theory is supported by <b>empirical</b> evidence gathered from hundreds of experiments.\",\"这一理论有数百项实验收集的经验证据支持。\"],[\"Psychologists rely on <b>empirical</b> studies rather than guesswork to understand behaviour.\",\"心理学家依靠经验研究而非猜测来理解行为。\"]],\"endorsement\":[[\"The famous athlete's <b>endorsement</b> helped the new sports drink sell millions of bottles.\",\"这位著名运动员的代言帮助这款新运动饮料卖出了数百万瓶。\"],[\"The newspaper's <b>endorsement</b> of the mayor surprised many readers.\",\"这家报纸公开支持市长，让许多读者感到意外。\"]],\"enterprise\":[[\"The small fishing village grew into a busy trading <b>enterprise</b> within a generation.\",\"这个小渔村在一代人的时间里发展成了一家繁忙的贸易企业。\"],[\"State-owned <b>enterprises</b> employ a large share of the country's workers.\",\"国有企业雇用了该国相当大比例的劳动力。\"]],\"eulogy\":[[\"At the funeral, his oldest friend delivered a moving <b>eulogy</b>.\",\"在葬礼上，他最老的朋友致了一篇感人的颂词。\"],[\"The <b>eulogy</b> praised her fifty years of service to the hospital.\",\"颂词赞扬了她为医院服务五十年的贡献。\"]],\"euphemism\":[[\"\\\"Passed away\\\" is a common <b>euphemism</b> for \\\"died\\\".\",\"“去世”是“死亡”的一种常见委婉说法。\"],[\"Companies often use <b>euphemisms</b> such as \\\"downsizing\\\" when they cut jobs.\",\"公司裁员时常使用“缩减规模”之类的委婉语。\"]],\"excitement\":[[\"The children's <b>excitement</b> grew as the train approached the zoo.\",\"火车快到动物园时，孩子们越来越兴奋。\"],[\"There was great <b>excitement</b> in the lab when the results finally matched the theory.\",\"当结果终于与理论吻合时，实验室里一片兴奋。\"]],\"exclamation\":[[\"\\\"Watch out!\\\" she cried, in an <b>exclamation</b> of alarm.\",\"“小心！”她惊呼道，那是一声警觉的感叹。\"],[\"His letter was full of <b>exclamations</b> about the beauty of the northern lights.\",\"他的信里满是对北极光之美的感叹。\"]],\"exodus\":[[\"The long drought caused an <b>exodus</b> of farmers from the region.\",\"长期干旱导致农民大批离开这一地区。\"],[\"After the factory closed, there was an <b>exodus</b> of young people to the cities.\",\"工厂关闭后，年轻人大量涌向城市。\"]],\"expectancy\":[[\"Life <b>expectancy</b> in the country has risen from 60 to 78 over the past fifty years.\",\"过去五十年里，该国的预期寿命从 60 岁提高到了 78 岁。\"],[\"Better hospitals have raised the life <b>expectancy</b> of people in rural areas.\",\"更好的医院提高了农村居民的预期寿命。\"]],\"fault\":[[\"The San Andreas <b>Fault</b> in California is one of the most studied faults in the world.\",\"加利福尼亚的圣安德烈亚斯断层是世界上研究得最多的断层之一。\"],[\"Earthquakes often occur where the rocks along a <b>fault</b> suddenly slip.\",\"当地震沿断层的岩石突然滑动时，常常发生地震。\"]],\"finite\":[[\"The Earth has only a <b>finite</b> supply of fresh water, so we must not waste it.\",\"地球上的淡水供应是有限的，所以我们不能浪费。\"],[\"Each student was given a <b>finite</b> amount of time to complete the design.\",\"每名学生完成设计的时间是有限的。\"]],\"gallbladder\":[[\"The <b>gallbladder</b> stores bile, which helps the body digest fat.\",\"胆囊储存胆汁，胆汁帮助身体消化脂肪。\"],[\"Stones had formed in her <b>gallbladder</b>, causing severe pain after meals.\",\"她的胆囊里形成了结石，饭后疼痛剧烈。\"]],\"gate\":[[\"The school <b>gate</b> opens at seven thirty every morning.\",\"学校大门每天早上七点半开。\"],[\"Passengers waited at the <b>gate</b> for their flight to be called.\",\"乘客在登机口等候航班广播。\"]],\"growth\":[[\"Regular watering led to the rapid <b>growth</b> of the tomato plants.\",\"定期浇水让番茄植株生长迅速。\"],[\"The <b>growth</b> of online shopping has changed how people buy books and clothes.\",\"网上购物的增长改变了人们购买书籍和服装的方式。\"]],\"gum\":[[\"The dentist warned that bleeding <b>gums</b> can be an early sign of disease.\",\"牙医警告说，牙龈出血可能是疾病的早期信号。\"],[\"She brushed gently so as not to hurt her sore <b>gums</b>.\",\"她轻轻地刷牙，以免弄疼发炎的牙龈。\"]],\"helium\":[[\"The balloon floated up quickly because it was filled with <b>helium</b>.\",\"气球升得很快，因为里面充的是氦气。\"],[\"<b>Helium</b> is produced inside stars when hydrogen atoms join together.\",\"氢原子结合时会生成氦，恒星内部正是这样产生氦的。\"]],\"incompatible\":[[\"The new software is <b>incompatible</b> with older computers.\",\"这款新软件与较旧的电脑不兼容。\"],[\"Their working styles were <b>incompatible</b>, so the project kept falling behind schedule.\",\"两人的工作方式不合，项目进度一再落后。\"]],\"insurance\":[[\"After the fire, the <b>insurance</b> company paid for the repairs to the house.\",\"火灾之后，保险公司支付了房屋维修费用。\"],[\"Every driver in the state must carry car <b>insurance</b> by law.\",\"法律规定，该州每位司机都必须购买汽车保险。\"]],\"justify\":[[\"He tried to <b>justify</b> his decision by pointing to the rising costs.\",\"他试图以成本上涨来为自己的决定辩护。\"],[\"Nothing can <b>justify</b> cheating, even when the exam is extremely difficult.\",\"任何理由都不能为作弊辩护，哪怕考试极难也不行。\"]],\"liver\":[[\"The <b>liver</b> removes harmful substances from the blood.\",\"肝脏清除血液中的有害物质。\"],[\"Drinking too much alcohol over many years can seriously damage the <b>liver</b>.\",\"多年过量饮酒会严重损害肝脏。\"]],\"medicine\":[[\"She decided to study <b>medicine</b> after volunteering at the village clinic.\",\"在村诊所做志愿者之后，她决定学医。\"],[\"Modern <b>medicine</b> has greatly reduced deaths from infectious diseases.\",\"现代医学大大降低了传染病的死亡人数。\"]],\"mist\":[[\"Early in the morning, a thin <b>mist</b> hung over the river.\",\"清晨，一层薄雾笼罩在河面上。\"],[\"The mountain tops disappeared into the <b>mist</b> as the weather turned colder.\",\"天气转冷时，山顶隐没在雾气之中。\"]],\"moderate\":[[\"In the election, the <b>moderates</b> won support from voters tired of extreme positions.\",\"在这次选举中，温和派赢得了厌倦极端立场的选民的支持。\"],[\"The party's <b>moderates</b> argued for gradual reform instead of sudden change.\",\"该党的温和派主张渐进改革，而不是骤然变革。\"]],\"moth\":[[\"A large <b>moth</b> flew around the lamp all evening.\",\"一整晚，一只大飞蛾绕着灯飞来飞去。\"],[\"Some <b>moths</b> damage stored clothes by eating natural fibres.\",\"有些飞蛾会啃食天然纤维，损坏存放的衣物。\"]],\"nitrate\":[[\"Farmers add <b>nitrate</b> fertiliser to fields to help crops grow faster.\",\"农民给田地施硝酸盐肥料，帮助作物长得更快。\"],[\"Too much <b>nitrate</b> in drinking water can be harmful to babies.\",\"饮用水中硝酸盐过多会对婴儿有害。\"]],\"rebellion\":[[\"High taxes led to a <b>rebellion</b> in the southern provinces.\",\"高额税收引发了南方各省的叛乱。\"],[\"The <b>rebellion</b> was defeated after the army took back the capital.\",\"军队夺回首都后，叛乱被平息。\"]],\"seek\":[[\"Thousands of people left their homes to <b>seek</b> safety across the border.\",\"数千人离开家园，越境寻找安全。\"],[\"He went to the library to <b>seek</b> information about the old railway.\",\"他去图书馆查找关于那条老铁路的资料。\"]],\"semester\":[[\"This <b>semester</b> she is taking courses in biology, chemistry and statistics.\",\"这学期她选了生物、化学和统计学课程。\"],[\"Students must register for classes before the <b>semester</b> begins.\",\"学生必须在学期开始前完成选课注册。\"]],\"semiconductor\":[[\"Silicon is the most common material used to make <b>semiconductors</b>.\",\"硅是制造半导体最常用的材料。\"],[\"A <b>semiconductor</b> can conduct electricity under some conditions but not others.\",\"半导体在某些条件下能导电，在另一些条件下则不能。\"]],\"sparrow\":[[\"A <b>sparrow</b> built its nest in the small tree outside our window.\",\"一只麻雀在我们窗外的小树上筑了巢。\"],[\"In winter, <b>sparrows</b> gather in large flocks to search for seeds.\",\"冬天，麻雀成大群聚集觅食种子。\"]],\"strait\":[[\"Ships pass through the <b>strait</b> between the island and the mainland every day.\",\"船只每天穿行于岛屿与大陆之间的海峡。\"],[\"The <b>strait</b> is only a few kilometres wide, but its currents are dangerously strong.\",\"这条海峡只有几公里宽，但水流湍急危险。\"]],\"stranger\":[[\"She was warned as a child never to talk to <b>strangers</b>.\",\"她小时候就被告诫不要和陌生人说话。\"],[\"A kind <b>stranger</b> helped him carry his suitcase up the station stairs.\",\"一位热心的陌生人帮他把行李箱拎上车站的楼梯。\"]],\"stream\":[[\"A clear <b>stream</b> runs down the mountain and through the village.\",\"一条清澈的溪流从山上流下，穿过村庄。\"],[\"Trout live in the cold <b>stream</b> that flows behind the farm.\",\"鳟鱼生活在农场后面那条冰冷的溪流里。\"]],\"sunglasses\":[[\"He put on his <b>sunglasses</b> because the light on the snow was blinding.\",\"他戴上太阳镜，因为雪地上的光太刺眼了。\"],[\"She lost her <b>sunglasses</b> somewhere on the beach.\",\"她把太阳镜丢在了海滩上的某个地方。\"]],\"symptom\":[[\"A high fever is a common <b>symptom</b> of the flu.\",\"高烧是流感的常见症状。\"],[\"The doctor asked him to describe every <b>symptom</b>, even ones that seemed unimportant.\",\"医生让他描述每一个症状，哪怕是看起来不重要的。\"]],\"vinegar\":[[\"She added a spoonful of <b>vinegar</b> to the salad dressing.\",\"她往沙拉酱里加了一勺醋。\"],[\"<b>Vinegar</b> has been used for thousands of years to preserve vegetables.\",\"几千年来，人们一直用醋来腌制蔬菜。\"]],\"watermelon\":[[\"On hot afternoons, nothing tastes better than a slice of cold <b>watermelon</b>.\",\"在炎热的下午，没有什么比一片冰镇西瓜更爽口了。\"],[\"Farmers load the harvested <b>watermelons</b> onto trucks before sunrise.\",\"农民在日出前把摘下的西瓜装上卡车。\"]],\"wolf\":[[\"A lone <b>wolf</b> was seen near the edge of the forest at dawn.\",\"黎明时分，有人在森林边缘看到一匹孤狼。\"],[\"<b>Wolves</b> hunt in packs and can bring down animals much larger than themselves.\",\"狼群成群捕猎，能猎杀比自己大得多的动物。\"]],\"wrap\":[[\"She <b>wrapped</b> the gift in blue paper and tied it with a ribbon.\",\"她用蓝纸把礼物包起来，系上丝带。\"],[\"Please <b>wrap</b> the glass in a towel so it does not break in the suitcase.\",\"请用毛巾把玻璃杯裹起来，免得它在行李箱里碎掉。\"]],\"aggravate\":[[\"Lack of sleep can <b>aggravate</b> the pain in his back.\",\"睡眠不足会加重他的背痛。\"],[\"Cutting down more trees will only <b>aggravate</b> the flooding in the valley.\",\"砍伐更多树木只会加重山谷的洪灾。\"]],\"airline\":[[\"The <b>airline</b> cancelled all flights because of the snowstorm.\",\"由于暴风雪，这家航空公司取消了所有航班。\"],[\"She works as a pilot for a national <b>airline</b>.\",\"她是一家国家航空公司的飞行员。\"]],\"authorization\":[[\"You need written <b>authorization</b> from the manager before using the company car.\",\"使用公司车辆之前，你需要经理的书面授权。\"],[\"Only nurses with proper <b>authorization</b> may give this medicine to patients.\",\"只有获得相应授权的护士才能给病人服用这种药。\"]],\"axis\":[[\"The Earth rotates on its <b>axis</b> once every twenty-four hours.\",\"地球每二十四小时绕地轴自转一周。\"],[\"In the graph, the vertical <b>axis</b> shows the temperature and the horizontal one shows the time.\",\"在这张图上，纵轴表示温度，横轴表示时间。\"]],\"bandwidth\":[[\"Streaming video in high quality requires a lot of <b>bandwidth</b>.\",\"观看高清流媒体视频需要很大的带宽。\"],[\"The school upgraded its network to give students more <b>bandwidth</b> for online classes.\",\"学校升级了网络，给学生上网课提供更大的带宽。\"]],\"bowl\":[[\"She poured the soup into a large <b>bowl</b> and carried it to the table.\",\"她把汤盛进一只大碗里，端到桌上。\"],[\"He eats a <b>bowl</b> of rice with vegetables every evening.\",\"他每天晚上吃一碗米饭配蔬菜。\"]],\"brake\":[[\"The driver pressed the <b>brake</b> hard when a child ran into the road.\",\"一个孩子跑到路上时，司机猛踩刹车。\"],[\"The mechanic checked the car's <b>brakes</b> and replaced the worn pads.\",\"修理工检查了汽车的刹车，更换了磨损的刹车片。\"]],\"capture\":[[\"The soldiers managed to <b>capture</b> the hill before dawn.\",\"士兵们在黎明前成功攻占了那座山头。\"],[\"The photographer waited for hours to <b>capture</b> the eagle in flight.\",\"摄影师等了几个小时，只为拍下老鹰飞翔的画面。\"]],\"chirp\":[[\"Baby birds <b>chirp</b> loudly when their parents return with food.\",\"父母带食物回来时，雏鸟大声啁啾。\"],[\"Outside the window, crickets were <b>chirping</b> in the warm night air.\",\"窗外，蟋蟀在温暖的夜色中鸣叫。\"]],\"condensation\":[[\"<b>Condensation</b> formed on the cold window as warm air from the room touched the glass.\",\"房间里的暖空气接触到冰冷的窗玻璃，形成了凝结的水珠。\"],[\"Morning dew is the result of <b>condensation</b> of water vapour during the cool night.\",\"晨露是水汽在凉爽的夜里凝结而成的。\"]],\"conquer\":[[\"The Romans <b>conquered</b> most of the lands around the Mediterranean Sea.\",\"罗马人征服了地中海周围的大部分土地。\"],[\"She finally <b>conquered</b> her fear of speaking in public.\",\"她终于战胜了当众讲话的恐惧。\"]],\"consolidate\":[[\"The two small banks merged to <b>consolidate</b> their position in the market.\",\"两家小银行合并，以巩固它们在市场中的地位。\"],[\"After the victory, the general moved to <b>consolidate</b> his control of the region.\",\"获胜后，将军着手巩固他对该地区的控制。\"]],\"coping\":[[\"She is <b>coping</b> well with the pressure of her new job.\",\"她应对新工作的压力应对得很好。\"],[\"The course teaches practical strategies for <b>coping</b> with stress during exams.\",\"这门课教实用的方法，帮助学生在考试期间应对压力。\"]],\"creak\":[[\"The old wooden stairs <b>creak</b> whenever someone walks up them.\",\"有人上楼时，老旧的木楼梯就会嘎吱作响。\"],[\"The door <b>creaked</b> slowly open in the wind.\",\"门在风中嘎吱嘎吱地慢慢开了。\"]],\"cycle\":[[\"The life <b>cycle</b> of a frog begins in water as an egg.\",\"青蛙的生命周期始于水中的卵。\"],[\"In the water <b>cycle</b>, water evaporates from the sea and falls back as rain.\",\"在水循环中，水从海面蒸发，又以雨的形式落回。\"]],\"donation\":[[\"She made a generous <b>donation</b> to the children's hospital.\",\"她向儿童医院慷慨捐赠。\"],[\"The school library was built entirely from private <b>donations</b>.\",\"学校图书馆完全是用私人捐赠建成的。\"]],\"election\":[[\"The <b>election</b> will be held on the first Tuesday of November.\",\"选举将于十一月的第一个星期二举行。\"],[\"Millions of people voted in the country's first free <b>election</b>.\",\"数百万人参加了该国第一次自由选举的投票。\"]],\"emperor\":[[\"The first <b>emperor</b> of China united the country in 221 BC.\",\"中国的第一位皇帝于公元前 221 年统一了全国。\"],[\"The <b>emperor</b> built roads and canals to connect the far corners of his empire.\",\"皇帝修建道路和运河，把帝国遥远的角落连接起来。\"]],\"etching\":[[\"The museum owns several <b>etchings</b> by Rembrandt, printed from copper plates.\",\"博物馆藏有伦勃朗的几幅蚀刻版画，是用铜版印制的。\"],[\"In an <b>etching</b>, acid is used to cut lines into a metal plate.\",\"在蚀刻版画中，人们用酸在金属板上蚀出线条。\"]],\"evaluation\":[[\"The course ends with a written <b>evaluation</b> of each student's project.\",\"这门课最后要对每位学生的项目写一份书面评估。\"],[\"Regular <b>evaluation</b> helps teachers decide which topics need more time.\",\"定期评估帮助老师决定哪些课题需要更多时间。\"]],\"goal\":[[\"Her main <b>goal</b> this year is to finish her first novel.\",\"她今年的主要目标是写完自己的第一部小说。\"],[\"The two teams agreed on the <b>goal</b> of reducing waste by half.\",\"两个团队商定了将浪费减少一半的目标。\"]],\"gravity\":[[\"<b>Gravity</b> pulls everything on Earth toward its centre.\",\"引力把地球上的一切都拉向地心。\"],[\"Because the Moon has weaker <b>gravity</b>, astronauts can jump much higher there.\",\"由于月球引力较弱，宇航员在那里能跳得高得多。\"]],\"guard\":[[\"A <b>guard</b> stands at the museum entrance and checks visitors' bags.\",\"一名警卫站在博物馆入口处，检查参观者的包。\"],[\"Two <b>guards</b> patrolled the prison walls through the night.\",\"两名警卫整夜在监狱围墙上巡逻。\"]],\"hide\":[[\"The children loved to <b>hide</b> behind the curtains during the game.\",\"孩子们在游戏中喜欢躲在窗帘后面。\"],[\"She tried to <b>hide</b> her disappointment behind a smile.\",\"她努力用微笑掩藏自己的失望。\"]],\"hurdle\":[[\"In the race, she cleared every <b>hurdle</b> without touching a single one.\",\"比赛中，她跃过了每一个跨栏，一个都没碰到。\"],[\"The athletes train daily to jump the <b>hurdles</b> smoothly at full speed.\",\"运动员们每天训练，以便全速时也能顺畅地跨栏。\"]],\"intrinsic\":[[\"Gold has long been given value, but its <b>intrinsic</b> usefulness is actually limited.\",\"黄金长期以来被赋予价值，但它本质上的用途其实有限。\"],[\"One <b>intrinsic</b> property of diamond is its extreme hardness.\",\"钻石的一个本质属性是它极高的硬度。\"]],\"magma\":[[\"Deep underground, melted rock is called <b>magma</b> until it reaches the surface.\",\"在地下深处，熔化的岩石在到达地表之前称为岩浆。\"],[\"The volcano erupted, sending rivers of <b>magma</b> down its sides.\",\"火山喷发，岩浆如河流般顺山坡流下。\"]],\"mayor\":[[\"The <b>mayor</b> promised to repair the city's oldest bridge within two years.\",\"市长承诺在两年内修好该市最古老的桥。\"],[\"Voters elected a new <b>mayor</b> who had once worked as a schoolteacher.\",\"选民选出了一位新市长，他曾当过学校教师。\"]],\"mortality\":[[\"Child <b>mortality</b> fell sharply after clean water reached the villages.\",\"清洁饮用水通到村庄后，儿童死亡率大幅下降。\"],[\"The study compares <b>mortality</b> rates between smokers and non-smokers.\",\"这项研究比较了吸烟者与非吸烟者的死亡率。\"]],\"policy\":[[\"The government introduced a new <b>policy</b> to reduce air pollution in cities.\",\"政府出台了一项新政策，减少城市空气污染。\"],[\"It is the school's <b>policy</b> that homework must be handed in on time.\",\"学校的规定是作业必须按时上交。\"]],\"shortage\":[[\"The long drought caused a serious <b>shortage</b> of drinking water.\",\"长期干旱造成饮用水严重短缺。\"],[\"Hospitals in the region face a <b>shortage</b> of nurses.\",\"该地区的医院面临护士短缺。\"]],\"sneeze\":[[\"The dust in the old library made her <b>sneeze</b> again and again.\",\"老图书馆里的灰尘让她一个接一个地打喷嚏。\"],[\"He turned away and <b>sneezed</b> into his handkerchief.\",\"他转过身，用手帕捂着打了个喷嚏。\"]],\"spawn\":[[\"Each spring, salmon swim upriver to <b>spawn</b> in the shallow streams where they were born.\",\"每年春天，鲑鱼逆流而上，到它们出生的浅溪中产卵。\"],[\"Frogs <b>spawn</b> in ponds, laying hundreds of eggs at a time.\",\"青蛙在池塘里产卵，一次能产下数百枚。\"]],\"stomach\":[[\"The <b>stomach</b> mixes food with acid and begins to break it down.\",\"胃把食物与胃酸混合，开始将其分解。\"],[\"Eating too quickly gave him a pain in his <b>stomach</b>.\",\"吃得太快，他胃疼了起来。\"]],\"addiction\":[[\"His <b>addiction</b> to video games began to hurt his schoolwork.\",\"他对电子游戏成瘾，开始影响学业。\"],[\"Doctors treat <b>addiction</b> as a disease, not a failure of character.\",\"医生把成瘾视为一种疾病，而不是品格缺陷。\"]],\"ally\":[[\"During the war, the two countries were close <b>allies</b> and shared supplies.\",\"战争期间，两国是亲密盟友，共享物资。\"],[\"France was an important <b>ally</b> of the new republic.\",\"法国是这个新共和国的重要盟友。\"]],\"altar\":[[\"The couple placed flowers on the <b>altar</b> before the ceremony began.\",\"仪式开始前，这对夫妇把鲜花放在祭坛上。\"],[\"In the ancient temple, priests offered grain at the stone <b>altar</b>.\",\"在古庙中，祭司在石祭坛上献上谷物。\"]],\"army\":[[\"The <b>army</b> crossed the river at night and took the town by surprise.\",\"军队夜里渡河，出其不意地攻下了城镇。\"],[\"He joined the <b>army</b> at eighteen and served for six years.\",\"他十八岁参军，服役了六年。\"]],\"asbestos\":[[\"Old schools sometimes contain <b>asbestos</b>, which must be removed by specialists.\",\"老学校里有时含有石棉，必须由专业人员清除。\"],[\"Workers wore masks to protect themselves from <b>asbestos</b> dust during the demolition.\",\"拆除时，工人们戴着口罩，防护石棉粉尘。\"]],\"ashamed\":[[\"He was <b>ashamed</b> of having lied to his best friend.\",\"他为自己对最好的朋友撒谎而感到羞耻。\"],[\"She felt deeply <b>ashamed</b> when her careless mistake cost the team the match.\",\"她因自己的粗心失误让团队输掉比赛而深感羞愧。\"]],\"belief\":[[\"His <b>belief</b> in the power of education changed the lives of many village children.\",\"他坚信教育的力量，改变了许多村里孩子的命运。\"],[\"The <b>belief</b> that the Earth was flat was common for centuries.\",\"地平说这一信念曾流行了数百年。\"]],\"blame\":[[\"Do not <b>blame</b> the driver; the accident was caused by ice on the road.\",\"不要责备司机，这场事故是路面结冰造成的。\"],[\"She took the <b>blame</b> for the team's mistake, although it was not her fault.\",\"她替团队承担了过错，尽管那并不是她的错。\"]],\"blind\":[[\"The accident left him <b>blind</b> in one eye, but he continued to paint.\",\"那场事故让他一只眼睛失明，但他仍继续作画。\"],[\"Guide dogs are trained to lead <b>blind</b> people safely across busy streets.\",\"导盲犬经过训练，能领着盲人安全穿过繁忙的街道。\"]],\"broadcasting\":[[\"She studied <b>broadcasting</b> at university and now works for a television station.\",\"她在大学里学广播学，现在在电视台工作。\"],[\"Public <b>broadcasting</b> in the country is funded mainly by the government.\",\"该国的公共广播主要由政府资助。\"]],\"cast\":[[\"In the late afternoon, the tower <b>casts</b> a long shadow across the square.\",\"傍晚时分，高塔在广场上投下长长的影子。\"],[\"The full moon <b>cast</b> a pale light over the silent lake.\",\"满月在寂静的湖面上投下淡淡的光。\"]],\"circuit\":[[\"When the switch is closed, current flows around the <b>circuit</b>.\",\"开关合上时，电流在电路中流动。\"],[\"A break anywhere in the <b>circuit</b> stops the lamp from lighting.\",\"电路中任何一处断开，灯就不会亮。\"]],\"commerce\":[[\"The port city grew rich through <b>commerce</b> with distant countries.\",\"这座港口城市靠与远方国家的商业往来富裕起来。\"],[\"New roads opened the inland region to <b>commerce</b> for the first time.\",\"新修的道路第一次让内陆地区通了商。\"]],\"conceptualize\":[[\"It is hard to <b>conceptualize</b> just how large the universe really is.\",\"很难在概念上想象宇宙究竟有多大。\"],[\"Designers <b>conceptualized</b> the new library as a forest of books and light.\",\"设计师把新图书馆构想成一片由书和光组成的森林。\"]],\"confine\":[[\"The illness <b>confined</b> him to bed for almost two weeks.\",\"这场病让他卧床将近两周。\"],[\"Please <b>confine</b> your answer to the question on the screen.\",\"请把回答限制在屏幕上的这个问题之内。\"]],\"cringe\":[[\"He <b>cringed</b> when he heard his own recorded voice in the interview.\",\"听到采访中自己录下来的声音时，他尴尬得畏缩了一下。\"],[\"The dog <b>cringed</b> at the sound of thunder and hid under the table.\",\"小狗听到雷声畏缩起来，躲到了桌子底下。\"]],\"cripple\":[[\"The fall <b>crippled</b> the young horse, and it never raced again.\",\"那一摔让这匹年轻的马跛了，它再也没参加过比赛。\"],[\"A broken leg in childhood had <b>crippled</b> him, yet he walked to school every day.\",\"童年时摔断的腿使他跛行，但他仍每天步行去上学。\"]],\"cruise\":[[\"They plan to <b>cruise</b> along the coast for a week in a small sailing boat.\",\"他们打算乘一艘小帆船沿海岸巡游一周。\"],[\"The ship <b>cruised</b> slowly between the islands, stopping at a port each night.\",\"船在岛屿之间缓缓巡游，每晚停靠一个港口。\"]],\"discriminate\":[[\"The law forbids employers to <b>discriminate</b> against workers because of their age.\",\"法律禁止雇主因年龄而歧视员工。\"],[\"In the past, women were <b>discriminated</b> against in many professions.\",\"过去，女性在许多职业中受到歧视。\"]],\"diving\":[[\"<b>Diving</b> judges award points for both the difficulty and the cleanness of the entry into water.\",\"跳水裁判根据动作难度和入水的干净程度打分。\"],[\"She won a silver medal in the ten-metre <b>diving</b> event.\",\"她在十米跳台跳水项目中获得银牌。\"]],\"doll\":[[\"The little girl dressed her <b>doll</b> in a red coat every morning.\",\"小女孩每天早上给她的玩偶穿上红外套。\"],[\"He bought a wooden <b>doll</b> as a gift for his daughter.\",\"他买了一个木玩偶送给女儿。\"]],\"drainage\":[[\"Good <b>drainage</b> keeps the playing field dry after heavy rain.\",\"良好的排水能让球场在大雨后保持干爽。\"],[\"Farmers dug channels to improve the <b>drainage</b> of the wet fields.\",\"农民挖沟渠，改善潮湿田地的排水。\"]],\"embarkation\":[[\"Passengers gathered at the gate an hour before <b>embarkation</b>.\",\"乘客在登船前一小时聚集在检票口。\"],[\"The port was busy on the morning of the fleet's <b>embarkation</b>.\",\"舰队登船出发的那天早上，港口一片忙碌。\"]],\"enslavement\":[[\"The novel describes the <b>enslavement</b> of African people and their long struggle for freedom.\",\"这部小说描写了非洲人遭受的奴役以及他们争取自由的漫长斗争。\"],[\"After centuries of <b>enslavement</b>, the island's people finally won their independence.\",\"经过数百年的奴役，这座岛上的人民终于赢得了独立。\"]],\"forest\":[[\"Deep in the <b>forest</b>, the air is cool and filled with the smell of pine.\",\"在森林深处，空气凉爽，弥漫着松树的气味。\"],[\"A large part of the country is still covered by <b>forest</b>.\",\"该国很大一部分土地仍被森林覆盖。\"]],\"frost\":[[\"The first <b>frost</b> of the year covered the fields in white.\",\"今年的第一场霜把田野盖得一片雪白。\"],[\"Farmers worry that a late <b>frost</b> will damage the young wheat.\",\"农民担心晚霜会冻坏嫩麦苗。\"]],\"hospital\":[[\"After the accident, he was taken to the <b>hospital</b> by ambulance.\",\"事故发生后，他被救护车送往医院。\"],[\"The new <b>hospital</b> has three hundred beds and a special children's ward.\",\"新医院有三百张床位和一个专门的儿童病房。\"]],\"inorganic\":[[\"Sand is an <b>inorganic</b> material; it was never alive.\",\"沙子是无机物，它从来没有生命。\"],[\"Fertilisers made in factories are mostly <b>inorganic</b>, unlike animal manure.\",\"工厂生产的化肥大多是无机的，不同于动物粪肥。\"]],\"lock\":[[\"Remember to <b>lock</b> the door when you leave the laboratory.\",\"离开实验室时记得锁门。\"],[\"She keeps her diary in a drawer with a small <b>lock</b>.\",\"她把日记放在一个带小锁的抽屉里。\"]],\"lung\":[[\"Smoking damages the <b>lungs</b> and makes breathing harder over time.\",\"吸烟会损害肺部，时间久了呼吸会越来越困难。\"],[\"The left <b>lung</b> is slightly smaller than the right one because the heart sits beside it.\",\"左肺比右肺略小，因为心脏就在它旁边。\"]],\"mirror\":[[\"She checked her reflection in the <b>mirror</b> before leaving for the interview.\",\"去面试前，她对着镜子检查了一下自己的仪表。\"],[\"A convex <b>mirror</b> at the corner lets drivers see around the blind bend.\",\"转角处的凸面镜让司机能看到盲弯另一侧的情况。\"]],\"obtain\":[[\"You must <b>obtain</b> a permit before building anything on the land.\",\"在这块地上建任何东西之前，必须先取得许可证。\"],[\"The researchers <b>obtained</b> their samples from a lake deep in the mountains.\",\"研究人员从深山中的一个湖里取得了样本。\"]],\"oregano\":[[\"She sprinkled dried <b>oregano</b> over the tomato sauce.\",\"她在番茄酱上撒了些干牛至。\"],[\"<b>Oregano</b> is a herb widely used in Italian and Greek cooking.\",\"牛至是一种在意大利和希腊烹饪中广泛使用的香草。\"]],\"plaintiff\":[[\"The <b>plaintiff</b> claimed that the company had copied her design.\",\"原告声称这家公司抄袭了她的设计。\"],[\"The judge asked the <b>plaintiff</b> to present evidence first.\",\"法官要求原告先出示证据。\"]],\"porcelain\":[[\"The museum displays blue-and-white <b>porcelain</b> made six hundred years ago.\",\"博物馆展出的是六百年前制作的青花瓷。\"],[\"She served the tea in a thin <b>porcelain</b> cup painted with flowers.\",\"她用一只绘有花卉的薄瓷杯奉茶。\"]],\"recall\":[[\"He can still <b>recall</b> the names of all his primary-school teachers.\",\"他现在还能回忆起所有小学老师的名字。\"],[\"Witnesses were asked to <b>recall</b> exactly where they were at nine o'clock.\",\"证人被要求回忆九点整时他们究竟在哪里。\"]],\"reef\":[[\"The coral <b>reef</b> is home to thousands of brightly coloured fish.\",\"这片珊瑚礁是数千条色彩鲜艳的鱼类的家。\"],[\"The ship struck a hidden <b>reef</b> and sank within an hour.\",\"船撞上了暗礁，一小时内就沉没了。\"]],\"regulation\":[[\"A new safety <b>regulation</b> requires all workers to wear helmets on the site.\",\"一项新的安全规章要求工地上所有工人都戴头盔。\"],[\"Government <b>regulations</b> limit how much noise factories may make at night.\",\"政府规章限制了工厂夜间可以发出的噪音。\"]],\"representative\":[[\"Each class sends one <b>representative</b> to the student council meeting.\",\"每个班派一名代表参加学生会会议。\"],[\"The company sent a <b>representative</b> to discuss the contract with the farmers.\",\"公司派了一名代表与农民商谈合同。\"]],\"rib\":[[\"He broke two <b>ribs</b> when he fell off the ladder.\",\"他从梯子上摔下来，摔断了两根肋骨。\"],[\"The <b>ribs</b> form a cage that protects the heart and lungs.\",\"肋骨构成胸廓，保护心脏和肺。\"]],\"salmon\":[[\"In autumn, <b>salmon</b> return from the sea to the rivers where they were born.\",\"秋天，鲑鱼从大海回到它们出生的河流。\"],[\"She ordered grilled <b>salmon</b> with lemon and fresh herbs.\",\"她点了一份配柠檬和新鲜香草的烤鲑鱼。\"]],\"shovel\":[[\"He used a <b>shovel</b> to clear the snow from the path.\",\"他用铲子清扫小路上的积雪。\"],[\"Workers loaded the sand onto the truck with <b>shovels</b>.\",\"工人们用铲子把沙子装上卡车。\"]],\"slice\":[[\"She cut the bread into thick <b>slices</b> for breakfast.\",\"她把面包切成厚片当早餐。\"],[\"Would you like another <b>slice</b> of cake?\",\"你想再来一片蛋糕吗？\"]],\"soliloquy\":[[\"Hamlet's famous <b>soliloquy</b> begins with the words \\\"To be, or not to be\\\".\",\"哈姆雷特那段著名的独白以“生存还是毁灭”开头。\"],[\"In a <b>soliloquy</b>, a character alone on stage speaks his innermost thoughts aloud.\",\"在独白中，独自站在舞台上的人物把内心最深处的想法说了出来。\"]],\"stroll\":[[\"After dinner, they took a slow <b>stroll</b> along the river bank.\",\"晚饭后，他们沿着河岸慢慢散步。\"],[\"She likes to <b>stroll</b> through the old streets in the early morning.\",\"她喜欢在清晨漫步于老街巷。\"]],\"toaster\":[[\"He put two slices of bread into the <b>toaster</b> for breakfast.\",\"他把两片面包放进烤面包机做早餐。\"],[\"The <b>toaster</b> pops the bread up automatically when it is done.\",\"面包烤好后，烤面包机会自动把面包弹起来。\"]],\"tongue\":[[\"The doctor asked him to stick out his <b>tongue</b> so she could examine his throat.\",\"医生让他伸出舌头，以便检查喉咙。\"],[\"Taste buds on the <b>tongue</b> detect sweet, sour, salty and bitter flavours.\",\"舌头上的味蕾能分辨甜、酸、咸、苦等味道。\"]],\"verse\":[[\"The poem is written in short <b>verses</b> of four lines each.\",\"这首诗由每节四行的短诗句构成。\"],[\"She learned the song by singing the first <b>verse</b> again and again.\",\"她一遍遍唱第一段歌词，把这首歌学会了。\"]],\"warrior\":[[\"The tomb belonged to a <b>warrior</b> buried with his sword and shield.\",\"这座墓属于一位武士，他与自己的剑和盾一起下葬。\"],[\"In the story, a young <b>warrior</b> leaves her village to defend it from invaders.\",\"故事中，一位年轻的女武士离开村庄，去抵御入侵者、保卫家园。\"]],\"accurate\":[[\"The report gave an <b>accurate</b> description of the accident, matching what the cameras recorded.\",\"报告对事故的描述准确无误，与摄像头记录的一致。\"],[\"An <b>accurate</b> clock is essential for experiments that measure very short periods of time.\",\"对于测量极短时间的实验来说，一台准确的时钟必不可少。\"]],\"achievement\":[[\"Winning the national spelling prize was her greatest <b>achievement</b> at school.\",\"赢得全国拼字大赛奖项是她在学校最大的成就。\"],[\"Building the bridge in under two years was a remarkable engineering <b>achievement</b>.\",\"在不到两年内建成这座桥，是了不起的工程成就。\"]],\"agree\":[[\"Both teachers <b>agree</b> that students should read more widely.\",\"两位老师都同意学生应该更广泛地阅读。\"],[\"I <b>agree</b> with you that the meeting should be postponed.\",\"我同意你的看法，会议应该推迟。\"]],\"agreeable\":[[\"She has an <b>agreeable</b> manner and gets along well with everyone in the office.\",\"她待人宜人，和办公室里的每个人都相处得很好。\"],[\"We spent an <b>agreeable</b> afternoon walking by the lake.\",\"我们在湖边散步，度过了一个愉快的下午。\"]],\"album\":[[\"She keeps photographs of her children in a thick <b>album</b> on the shelf.\",\"她把孩子的照片放在书架上一本厚厚的相册里。\"],[\"The band will release a new <b>album</b> of songs next spring.\",\"这支乐队明年春天将发行一张新歌专辑。\"]],\"anomaly\":[[\"The sudden drop in temperature was an <b>anomaly</b> in an otherwise warm month.\",\"气温骤降是这个原本温暖的月份里的一次异常。\"],[\"Scientists studied the <b>anomaly</b> in the data to make sure it was not a recording error.\",\"科学家研究了数据中的异常，确认它不是记录错误。\"]],\"arise\":[[\"Problems often <b>arise</b> when too many people try to use the road at the same time.\",\"太多人同时使用这条路时，常常会出现问题。\"],[\"A discussion <b>arose</b> about how the money should be spent.\",\"一场关于这笔钱该如何花的讨论出现了。\"]],\"blender\":[[\"She put strawberries, yogurt and honey into the <b>blender</b> to make a smoothie.\",\"她把草莓、酸奶和蜂蜜放进搅拌机里做奶昔。\"],[\"Press the button for ten seconds and the <b>blender</b> will crush the ice.\",\"按住按钮十秒钟，搅拌机就能把冰打碎。\"]],\"bracelet\":[[\"She wore a silver <b>bracelet</b> that her grandmother had given her.\",\"她戴着一条银手镯，是祖母送给她的。\"],[\"The shop sells <b>bracelets</b> made from polished shells.\",\"这家店卖用抛光贝壳制作的手镯。\"]],\"clay\":[[\"The potter shaped the wet <b>clay</b> into a bowl on the spinning wheel.\",\"陶工在转动的陶轮上把湿黏土塑成一只碗。\"],[\"Heavy <b>clay</b> soil holds water well but is hard for roots to grow through.\",\"重的黏土保水性好，但根很难穿透。\"]],\"conceive\":[[\"It is difficult to <b>conceive</b> of a city with no cars at all.\",\"很难构想一座完全没有汽车的城市。\"],[\"The architect <b>conceived</b> the building as a series of gardens stacked on top of each other.\",\"这位建筑师构想这座建筑是一层层叠起来的花园。\"]],\"consequence\":[[\"As a <b>consequence</b> of the drought, many farmers lost their entire harvest.\",\"干旱的后果是，许多农民颗粒无收。\"],[\"He had not considered the <b>consequences</b> of quitting his job so suddenly.\",\"他没有考虑过突然辞职的后果。\"]],\"corporation\":[[\"He works in the legal department of a large <b>corporation</b>.\",\"他在一家大公司的法务部门工作。\"],[\"The <b>corporation</b> announced plans to build a new factory near the port.\",\"这家公司宣布计划在港口附近建一座新工厂。\"]],\"correspond\":[[\"The numbers in the report do not <b>correspond</b> to the figures in the table.\",\"报告中的数字与表格中的数字不一致。\"],[\"Each colour on the map <b>corresponds</b> to a different soil type.\",\"地图上的每种颜色对应一种不同的土壤类型。\"]],\"difference\":[[\"There is a clear <b>difference</b> between the two species in the shape of their leaves.\",\"这两个物种在叶子形状上有明显的差异。\"],[\"Can you explain the <b>difference</b> between these two words? They look almost the same.\",\"你能解释一下这两个词的区别吗？它们看起来几乎一样。\"]],\"disposition\":[[\"She has a cheerful <b>disposition</b> and rarely complains, even when things go wrong.\",\"她性情开朗，即使事情不顺也很少抱怨。\"],[\"His calm <b>disposition</b> made him well suited to work with anxious patients.\",\"他性情沉稳，很适合照顾焦虑的病人。\"]],\"district\":[[\"The old <b>district</b> of the city is famous for its narrow streets and markets.\",\"这座城市的老城区以窄街和市场闻名。\"],[\"Each <b>district</b> elects its own representative to the city council.\",\"每个地区选举自己的代表进入市议会。\"]],\"dolphin\":[[\"A <b>dolphin</b> followed our boat, leaping out of the water again and again.\",\"一只海豚跟着我们的船，一次次跃出水面。\"],[\"<b>Dolphins</b> communicate with each other using clicks and whistles.\",\"海豚用咔嗒声和口哨声相互交流。\"]],\"drone\":[[\"Farmers now use a <b>drone</b> to check their crops from the air.\",\"农民现在用无人机从空中查看庄稼。\"],[\"The <b>drone</b> carried a camera and filmed the whole coastline.\",\"这架无人机带着相机，把整条海岸线都拍了下来。\"]],\"elite\":[[\"Only the <b>elite</b> runners finished the race in under two hours.\",\"只有精英跑者能在两小时内跑完全程。\"],[\"The school trains an <b>elite</b> group of young musicians for national competitions.\",\"这所学校培养一批精英青年音乐家，备战全国比赛。\"]],\"embodiment\":[[\"For many fans, she is the <b>embodiment</b> of dedication to the sport.\",\"在许多粉丝眼中，她是献身这项运动的化身。\"],[\"The new library is the <b>embodiment</b> of the town's belief in free education.\",\"新图书馆是这座城镇免费教育信念的体现。\"]],\"entrepreneur\":[[\"The young <b>entrepreneur</b> started her first company while still at university.\",\"这位年轻的企业家还在上大学时就创办了自己的第一家公司。\"],[\"Successful <b>entrepreneurs</b> are willing to take risks but plan carefully.\",\"成功的企业家愿意冒险，但会仔细谋划。\"]],\"eraser\":[[\"She rubbed out the wrong word with an <b>eraser</b> and wrote the correct one.\",\"她用橡皮擦掉写错的词，写上正确的。\"],[\"The <b>eraser</b> on the end of the pencil had worn down to nothing.\",\"铅笔末端的橡皮已经磨得什么都不剩了。\"]],\"excess\":[[\"The factory was fined for producing an <b>excess</b> of waste water.\",\"这家工厂因产生过量废水被罚款。\"],[\"After the feast, the <b>excess</b> food was taken to a shelter for the homeless.\",\"宴会之后，多余的食物被送到无家可归者收容所。\"]],\"exemplar\":[[\"Her essay was held up as an <b>exemplar</b> for the rest of the class.\",\"她的文章被树立为全班的典范。\"],[\"The old bridge remains an <b>exemplar</b> of nineteenth-century engineering.\",\"这座古桥仍是十九世纪工程的典范。\"]],\"folder\":[[\"He kept all the exam papers in a blue <b>folder</b>.\",\"他把所有试卷放在一个蓝色文件夹里。\"],[\"On the computer, create a new <b>folder</b> for each project.\",\"在电脑上，为每个项目新建一个文件夹。\"]],\"kidney\":[[\"The <b>kidneys</b> filter waste products out of the blood.\",\"肾脏把废物从血液中过滤出去。\"],[\"He donated one of his <b>kidneys</b> to his younger brother.\",\"他把自己的一只肾脏捐给了弟弟。\"]],\"lever\":[[\"Pull the <b>lever</b> and the gate will open automatically.\",\"拉一下杠杆，闸门就会自动打开。\"],[\"Workers used a long <b>lever</b> to lift the heavy stone into place.\",\"工人们用一根长杠杆把沉重的石头撬到位。\"]],\"logic\":[[\"Her argument follows clear <b>logic</b>: if the roads are icy, schools should close.\",\"她的论证逻辑清晰：如果路面结冰，学校就应该停课。\"],[\"There is no <b>logic</b> in spending more money on a broken machine.\",\"往一台坏机器上再花更多的钱，毫无道理。\"]],\"margin\":[[\"Write your notes in the <b>margin</b> of the page, next to the main text.\",\"把笔记写在页边空白处、紧挨着正文。\"],[\"The path runs along the <b>margin</b> of the lake, just above the water.\",\"小路沿着湖的边缘延伸，就在水面上方。\"]],\"marketing\":[[\"She works in <b>marketing</b> and designs campaigns for new products.\",\"她从事市场营销，为新产品设计推广活动。\"],[\"Good <b>marketing</b> helped the small company reach customers in other countries.\",\"出色的市场营销帮助这家小公司打入其他国家的客户群。\"]],\"meadow\":[[\"In spring, the <b>meadow</b> is covered with yellow and purple wildflowers.\",\"春天，草甸上开满了黄色和紫色的野花。\"],[\"Cows were grazing peacefully in the <b>meadow</b> beside the river.\",\"奶牛在河边的草甸上安详地吃草。\"]],\"military\":[[\"The country increased its <b>military</b> spending after the border conflict.\",\"边境冲突之后，该国增加了军事开支。\"],[\"He spent ten years in <b>military</b> service before becoming a teacher.\",\"他从军十年，之后当了老师。\"]],\"mucus\":[[\"When you have a cold, the nose produces extra <b>mucus</b> to trap germs and dust.\",\"感冒时，鼻子会分泌更多黏液，以黏住病菌和灰尘。\"],[\"<b>Mucus</b> in the airways helps catch dust and bacteria before they reach the lungs.\",\"气道里的黏液帮助拦截灰尘和细菌，防止它们到达肺部。\"]],\"nerve\":[[\"A <b>nerve</b> carries signals between the brain and the rest of the body.\",\"神经在大脑和身体其他部位之间传递信号。\"],[\"The dentist touched a <b>nerve</b>, and she felt a sharp pain in her tooth.\",\"牙医碰到了一根神经，她的牙齿一阵剧痛。\"]],\"pasta\":[[\"For dinner she cooked <b>pasta</b> with tomato sauce and cheese.\",\"晚餐她做了意大利面，配番茄酱和奶酪。\"],[\"In Italy, <b>pasta</b> is often served as the first course, before the meat.\",\"在意大利，意大利面常作为第一道菜，在肉菜之前上。\"]],\"pineapple\":[[\"A ripe <b>pineapple</b> smells sweet and has golden skin.\",\"成熟的菠萝闻起来香甜，表皮金黄。\"],[\"She added chunks of <b>pineapple</b> to the fruit salad.\",\"她往水果沙拉里加了菠萝块。\"]],\"poet\":[[\"Li Bai is one of the most famous <b>poets</b> in Chinese history.\",\"李白是中国历史上最著名的诗人之一。\"],[\"The young <b>poet</b> read her work aloud at the small café.\",\"这位年轻的诗人在小咖啡馆里朗读了自己的作品。\"]],\"poetry\":[[\"She has loved <b>poetry</b> since she was a child and keeps a notebook of favourite lines.\",\"她从小就喜爱诗歌，备着一本笔记本抄录喜欢的诗句。\"],[\"In the course, students study both modern <b>poetry</b> and classical drama.\",\"这门课上，学生既学现代诗歌，也学古典戏剧。\"]],\"robber\":[[\"The bank <b>robber</b> was caught by the police two days later.\",\"银行强盗两天后被警察抓住了。\"],[\"A masked <b>robber</b> demanded money from the shopkeeper.\",\"一名蒙面强盗向店主索要钱财。\"]],\"saliva\":[[\"The smell of food made his mouth fill with <b>saliva</b>.\",\"食物的香味让他满口生津，唾液涌了出来。\"],[\"<b>Saliva</b> contains substances that begin to break down starch in the mouth.\",\"唾液含有能开始分解口腔中淀粉的物质。\"]],\"scissors\":[[\"She cut the ribbon with a pair of <b>scissors</b> and tied it around the box.\",\"她用一把剪刀剪断丝带，把它系在盒子上。\"],[\"Keep the <b>scissors</b> away from small children.\",\"把剪刀放在小孩子够不到的地方。\"]],\"silicon\":[[\"Most computer chips are made from <b>silicon</b>, a common element in sand.\",\"大多数电脑芯片由硅制成，硅是沙子中常见的元素。\"],[\"<b>Silicon</b> is used to make solar panels that turn sunlight into electricity.\",\"硅被用来制造太阳能板，把阳光转化为电能。\"]],\"suburb\":[[\"They moved to a quiet <b>suburb</b> where their children could play outside safely.\",\"他们搬到了一个安静的郊区，孩子可以在外面安全玩耍。\"],[\"The train carries thousands of workers from the <b>suburbs</b> into the city centre each morning.\",\"火车每天早晨把数千名上班族从郊区送进市中心。\"]],\"sword\":[[\"The museum displays a <b>sword</b> that belonged to a general three hundred years ago.\",\"博物馆展出一把三百年前一位将军的剑。\"],[\"In the legend, the hero pulls a magic <b>sword</b> from a stone.\",\"在传说中，英雄从石头里拔出了一把魔剑。\"]],\"tea\":[[\"She drinks a cup of green <b>tea</b> every morning before work.\",\"她每天早上上班前喝一杯绿茶。\"],[\"The region is famous for its <b>tea</b>, which is sold all over the world.\",\"这个地区以茶闻名，茶叶销往世界各地。\"]],\"vapor\":[[\"Water <b>vapor</b> in the air condenses into tiny droplets to form clouds.\",\"空气中的水汽凝结成微小水滴，形成云。\"],[\"Steam is simply water <b>vapor</b> that becomes visible in cool air.\",\"蒸汽其实就是水汽，在冷空气中变得可见。\"]],\"variable\":[[\"In the experiment, temperature was the one <b>variable</b> the scientists changed.\",\"在这项实验中，温度是科学家改变的唯一变量。\"],[\"The equation contains two <b>variables</b>, x and y, that students must solve for.\",\"这个方程含有 x 和 y 两个变量，学生必须把它们求出来。\"]],\"wholesale\":[[\"He buys vegetables at <b>wholesale</b> prices and sells them in his small shop.\",\"他以批发价进蔬菜，在自己的小店里出售。\"],[\"The company's <b>wholesale</b> business supplies supermarkets across the region.\",\"这家公司的批发业务为整个地区的超市供货。\"]],\"wrench\":[[\"He tightened the bolt with a <b>wrench</b> from his toolbox.\",\"他用工具箱里的扳手拧紧了螺栓。\"],[\"The plumber reached for a larger <b>wrench</b> to loosen the rusty pipe.\",\"水管工伸手去拿一把更大的扳手，来拧松生锈的管子。\"]],\"assessment\":[[\"The course ends with a final <b>assessment</b> that tests reading, listening, speaking and writing.\",\"这门课以一次期末评估结尾，考查读、听、说、写四项技能。\"],[\"After a careful <b>assessment</b> of the risks, the bank agreed to lend the company the money.\",\"银行在仔细评估风险之后，同意把钱贷给这家公司。\"]],\"boastful\":[[\"After winning the prize, he became so <b>boastful</b> that his friends began to avoid him.\",\"获奖之后，他变得十分自夸，朋友们开始躲着他。\"],[\"Her <b>boastful</b> talk about her family's wealth made the other guests uncomfortable.\",\"她自夸自家财富的言谈让其他宾客感到不自在。\"]],\"convene\":[[\"The committee will <b>convene</b> again next month to discuss the new budget.\",\"委员会下个月将再次召开会议，讨论新预算。\"],[\"An emergency meeting was <b>convened</b> within hours of the dam being damaged by the flood.\",\"大坝被洪水损坏后几小时内，就召开了紧急会议。\"]],\"disturbance\":[[\"Neighbours complained to the police about the <b>disturbance</b> caused by the all-night party next door.\",\"邻居们向警方投诉隔壁通宵派对造成的骚扰。\"],[\"Any <b>disturbance</b> during the examination will lead to immediate disqualification.\",\"考试期间的任何扰乱行为都会导致立即取消资格。\"]],\"emotion\":[[\"Music can express <b>emotions</b> that are very difficult to put into words.\",\"音乐能够表达那些很难用言语形容的情绪。\"],[\"She tried hard to hide her <b>emotion</b>, but her voice was shaking.\",\"她努力掩饰自己的情绪，但声音却在发抖。\"]],\"shin\":[[\"The footballer wears thick guards to protect his <b>shins</b> during matches.\",\"这名足球运动员在比赛中戴着厚护腿板，保护小腿前部。\"],[\"He banged his <b>shin</b> against the sharp edge of the coffee table.\",\"他的小腿前部撞到了茶几的锋利边沿上。\"]],\"storage\":[[\"The museum keeps its oldest documents in a special <b>storage</b> room where the temperature is carefully controlled.\",\"博物馆把最古老的文件存放在一间温度严格受控的专门储藏室里。\"],[\"This computer has enough <b>storage</b> space for thousands of photographs and videos.\",\"这台电脑的存储空间足够存放数千张照片和视频。\"]],\"vine\":[[\"A <b>vine</b> climbed up the wall and eventually covered the whole south side of the house.\",\"一根藤蔓爬上墙面，最终覆盖了房子的整个南面。\"],[\"The farmer tied each grape <b>vine</b> to a wooden post so it would grow upward.\",\"农民把每株葡萄藤绑在一根木桩上，好让它向上生长。\"]],\"founder\":[[\"The <b>founder</b> of the company started it in a garage with two friends and a borrowed computer.\",\"这家公司的创始人和两个朋友在一间车库里、用一台借来的电脑创办了它。\"],[\"Historians still debate who should be called the true <b>founder</b> of the modern Olympic Games.\",\"历史学家仍在争论，谁才应被称为现代奥林匹克运动会的真正创始人。\"]],\"amalgamate\":[[\"The two small colleges <b>amalgamated</b> in 1975 to form a single university.\",\"这两所小学院于1975年合并，组成了一所大学。\"],[\"When the two metals melt and <b>amalgamate</b>, they form an alloy stronger than either one alone.\",\"当这两种金属熔化合并后，会形成一种合金，比单独任何一种都更坚固。\"]],\"inertia\":[[\"Because of <b>inertia</b>, a fully loaded train needs a long distance to stop even after the brakes are applied.\",\"由于惯性，满载的列车即使刹车，也需要很长的距离才能停下来。\"],[\"Bureaucratic <b>inertia</b> kept the outdated rules in place long after everyone agreed they no longer worked.\",\"官僚体制的惯性让这些过时的规章在大家早已认为行不通之后，仍长期保留着。\"]],\"volcano\":[[\"The <b>volcano</b> erupted without warning, sending a column of ash several kilometres into the sky.\",\"这座火山毫无征兆地喷发，火山灰柱冲上了数公里的高空。\"],[\"Over thousands of years, the island was built up entirely by an underwater <b>volcano</b>.\",\"在数千年的时间里，这座岛屿完全是由一座海底火山喷发堆积而成的。\"]],\"heuristic\":[[\"When an exact calculation would take too long, engineers use a <b>heuristic</b> — a practical rule of thumb that usually gives a good enough answer.\",\"当精确计算太耗时时，工程师会采用启发式方法——一种通常能给出足够好答案的经验法则。\"],[\"The chess program relies on <b>heuristics</b> to decide which moves are worth examining in depth.\",\"这个国际象棋程序依靠启发式规则，来决定哪些走法值得深入分析。\"]],\"maturation\":[[\"The <b>maturation</b> of the human brain continues well into a person's twenties, especially in the areas involved in planning.\",\"人类大脑的成熟一直持续到二十多岁，负责规划的区域尤其如此。\"],[\"During <b>maturation</b>, the young wine slowly loses its harsh taste and develops a smoother flavour.\",\"在成熟过程中，新酿的葡萄酒慢慢去掉生涩味，口感变得更加柔和。\"]],\"galaxy\":[[\"Our solar system lies in one of the spiral arms of the Milky Way <b>galaxy</b>.\",\"我们的太阳系位于银河系的一条旋臂之中。\"],[\"The new telescope captured light from a <b>galaxy</b> so distant that the light had been travelling for more than ten billion years.\",\"这台新望远镜捕捉到了一个极其遥远的星系发出的光，这些光已经传播了一百多亿年。\"]],\"alkaline\":[[\"The soil in this valley is slightly <b>alkaline</b>, so farmers grow crops that tolerate a high pH.\",\"这座山谷的土壤略呈碱性，所以农民种植能耐受高pH值的作物。\"],[\"Soap feels slippery to the touch because the solution it forms in water is <b>alkaline</b>.\",\"肥皂摸起来滑溜溜的，因为它溶于水后形成的溶液呈碱性。\"]],\"dictation\":[[\"In Friday's French class, the teacher read a short paragraph aloud for <b>dictation</b>.\",\"在周五的法语课上，老师朗读了一小段文章，让学生们听写。\"],[\"For years she took <b>dictation</b> from the firm's partners and typed up their letters the same day.\",\"多年来她一直听事务所合伙人口述记录，并把他们的信件当天打好。\"]],\"minister\":[[\"The finance <b>minister</b> announced that taxes on small businesses would be reduced next year.\",\"财政部长宣布，明年将降低小企业的税负。\"],[\"After the election, she was appointed <b>minister</b> of education and promised to hire more teachers.\",\"选举之后，她被任命为教育部长，并承诺增聘教师。\"]],\"referee\":[[\"The <b>referee</b> blew his whistle and pointed to the penalty spot.\",\"裁判吹响哨子，指向了点球点。\"],[\"The players surrounded the <b>referee</b> to protest the decision, but the goal stood.\",\"球员们围住裁判抗议这次判罚，但进球依然有效。\"]],\"crest\":[[\"After three hours of climbing, they reached the <b>crest</b> of the ridge and could finally see the valley below.\",\"爬了三个小时后，他们终于到达山脊的顶峰，能看见下面的山谷了。\"],[\"The <b>crest</b> of the wave broke and sent white spray flying over the deck.\",\"波浪的顶峰碎裂开来，白色浪花飞溅到甲板上。\"]],\"arrive\":[[\"The overnight train <b>arrives</b> at the station at six fifteen in the morning.\",\"这趟夜班火车早上六点十五分到达车站。\"],[\"After months of failed experiments, the team finally <b>arrived</b> at an explanation for the strange results.\",\"经过数月失败的实验，团队终于得出了能解释这些异常结果的结论。\"]],\"framework\":[[\"The report offers a <b>framework</b> for deciding how the research budget should be divided among departments.\",\"这份报告提供了一个框架，用于决定研究预算应在各部门之间如何分配。\"],[\"Carpenters first built the wooden <b>framework</b> of the house, and only then began to raise the walls.\",\"木匠们先搭好房子的木框架，然后才开始砌墙。\"]],\"trash\":[[\"Please put food scraps in the compost bin instead of throwing them in the <b>trash</b>.\",\"请把厨余放进堆肥桶，不要扔进垃圾桶。\"],[\"Volunteers spent the morning picking up <b>trash</b> that visitors had left along the riverbank.\",\"志愿者们花了一上午，清理游客在河岸边留下的垃圾。\"]],\"blueberry\":[[\"Wild <b>blueberries</b> grow low to the ground in the pine forests of Maine.\",\"野生蓝莓在缅因州的松林里贴着地面生长。\"],[\"She stirred a handful of fresh <b>blueberries</b> into the pancake batter before cooking it.\",\"她在下锅煎之前，把一把新鲜蓝莓搅进了煎饼面糊里。\"]],\"enforce\":[[\"The new fishing law is hard to <b>enforce</b> because there are too few inspectors along the coast.\",\"这部新的渔业法规难以执行，因为沿海一带的检查人员太少。\"],[\"Traffic police <b>enforce</b> the speed limit by fining drivers who go too fast.\",\"交警通过对超速司机罚款来强制执行限速规定。\"]],\"reflex\":[[\"When the doctor taps just below your knee, your lower leg jerks forward by <b>reflex</b>.\",\"当医生轻敲你的膝盖下方时，你的小腿会因反射动作向前弹起。\"],[\"Catching the falling glass was pure <b>reflex</b> — her hand moved before she had time to think.\",\"接住掉落的玻璃杯纯属反射——她的手在来不及思考之前就动了。\"]],\"stress\":[[\"Students who are under constant <b>stress</b> often sleep poorly and find it hard to concentrate in class.\",\"长期处于压力之下的学生往往睡不好，上课也难以集中注意力。\"],[\"Regular exercise is one of the simplest and most effective ways to relieve <b>stress</b>.\",\"规律运动是缓解压力最简单也最有效的方法之一。\"]],\"interpretation\":[[\"Her <b>interpretation</b> of the poem focuses on its images of winter and decay.\",\"她对这首诗的解释着重于其中冬天与衰败的意象。\"],[\"Two research teams reached opposite conclusions because they used different <b>interpretations</b> of the same data.\",\"两个研究团队对同一组数据作出了不同的解释，因此得出了相反的结论。\"]],\"blatant\":[[\"Copying a classmate's essay word for word is a <b>blatant</b> form of cheating.\",\"逐字抄袭同学的文章，是明目张胆的作弊。\"],[\"It was a <b>blatant</b> attempt to mislead voters, and the newspapers quickly exposed it.\",\"这是明目张胆地误导选民，报纸很快就将其揭露了出来。\"]],\"allocate\":[[\"The city council voted to <b>allocate</b> more money to repairing rural roads and bridges.\",\"市议会投票决定拨出更多资金，用于修缮乡村道路和桥梁。\"],[\"At the start of term, each student is <b>allocated</b> a desk, a locker and a login for the library system.\",\"每学期开学时，每名学生都会分到一张课桌、一个储物柜和一个图书馆系统账号。\"]],\"snail\":[[\"A garden <b>snail</b> carries its coiled shell on its back and moves by gliding on a layer of mucus.\",\"花园蜗牛背着螺旋形的壳，靠在一层黏液上滑行来移动。\"],[\"After the rain, dozens of <b>snails</b> came out and slowly crossed the wet garden path.\",\"雨后，几十只蜗牛爬了出来，慢慢穿过湿漉漉的花园小径。\"]],\"transfer\":[[\"Heat <b>transfers</b> quickly from the hot soup into the metal spoon left standing in the bowl.\",\"热量会迅速从热汤转移到插在碗里的金属勺子上。\"],[\"In her second year, she <b>transferred</b> to a university closer to her home town.\",\"大二那年，她转学到了一所离家乡更近的大学。\"]],\"analyse\":[[\"The laboratory will <b>analyse</b> the water samples to check for traces of lead.\",\"实验室将分析这些水样，检测其中是否含有微量铅。（analyse 是英式拼写）\"],[\"Researchers <b>analysed</b> sales data from fifty stores before recommending a price cut.\",\"研究人员分析了五十家门店的销售数据，才建议降价。\"]],\"protocol\":[[\"Computers follow a shared <b>protocol</b> that specifies exactly how data is packaged and sent across the network.\",\"计算机遵循一套共享的协议，精确规定数据如何打包并通过网络发送。\"],[\"Under diplomatic <b>protocol</b>, the visiting president is greeted at the airport by the foreign minister.\",\"按照外交礼仪的协议，来访的总统由外交部长在机场迎接。\"]],\"exit\":[[\"In case of fire, use the nearest <b>exit</b> and do not take the lift.\",\"如遇火灾，请使用最近的出口，不要乘坐电梯。\"],[\"The theatre has four <b>exits</b>, so the audience can leave quickly at the end of the show.\",\"这家剧院有四个出口，演出结束时观众可以迅速离场。\"]],\"calligraphy\":[[\"In her <b>calligraphy</b> class, students practise each stroke of a character hundreds of times.\",\"在她的书法课上，学生们要把一个字的每一笔练习上百遍。\"],[\"The old letter was written in beautiful <b>calligraphy</b> that is still easy to read after two hundred years.\",\"这封古老的信件用优美的书法写成，两百年后依然清晰易读。\"]],\"custard\":[[\"For dessert there was apple pie served with warm <b>custard</b>.\",\"甜点是苹果派配温热的蛋奶冻。\"],[\"If you heat the <b>custard</b> too quickly, it will split and turn lumpy.\",\"如果把蛋奶冻加热得太快，它会油水分离、结成块。\"]],\"attentive\":[[\"He was an <b>attentive</b> host who noticed at once when a guest's glass was empty.\",\"他是个体贴周到的主人，客人的杯子一空就立刻察觉。\"],[\"The nurses were <b>attentive</b> to the old man's needs throughout the night.\",\"护士们整夜都悉心照料着这位老人的需要。\"]],\"astrology\":[[\"<b>Astrology</b> claims that the positions of the planets influence human character, but it has no scientific basis.\",\"占星术声称行星的位置会影响人的性格，但它并没有科学依据。\"],[\"In ancient Babylon, <b>astrology</b> and astronomy were practised by the same priests.\",\"在古巴比伦，占星术和天文学是由同一批祭司从事的。\"]],\"lemur\":[[\"The ring-tailed <b>lemur</b> lives only on the island of Madagascar.\",\"环尾狐猴只生活在马达加斯加岛上。\"],[\"At the zoo, the <b>lemurs</b> spend most of the day sunbathing and grooming one another.\",\"在动物园里，狐猴们大部分时间都在晒太阳和互相梳理毛发。\"]],\"supreme\":[[\"The case eventually reached the <b>Supreme</b> Court, whose decision could not be appealed.\",\"这个案子最终到了最高法院，其判决不得上诉。\"],[\"In the legal system, the constitution holds <b>supreme</b> authority over all ordinary laws.\",\"在法律体系中，宪法拥有高于一切普通法律的最高权威。\"]],\"reflection\":[[\"She stared at her <b>reflection</b> in the shop window and adjusted her hat.\",\"她望着自己在橱窗玻璃中的倒影，整了整帽子。\"],[\"The still lake gave a perfect <b>reflection</b> of the mountains behind it.\",\"平静的湖面完美地映出了背后群山的倒影。\"]],\"applaud\":[[\"The audience <b>applauded</b> for several minutes when the violinist finished the concerto.\",\"小提琴家演奏完协奏曲时，观众鼓掌了好几分钟。\"],[\"Critics <b>applauded</b> the mayor's decision to protect the old town from demolition.\",\"批评人士对市长保护老城免遭拆除的决定表示赞赏。\"]],\"accent\":[[\"He speaks English fluently, but with a strong Scottish <b>accent</b>.\",\"他英语说得很流利，但带着浓重的苏格兰口音。\"],[\"After twenty years in Canada, her French <b>accent</b> had almost disappeared.\",\"在加拿大生活了二十年后，她的法语口音几乎已经消失了。\"]],\"chef\":[[\"The restaurant's head <b>chef</b> tastes every sauce before the evening service begins.\",\"这家餐厅的主厨在晚餐营业开始前会品尝每一道酱汁。\"],[\"He trained as a <b>chef</b> in Lyon and worked in kitchens across France for a decade.\",\"他在里昂接受厨师培训，又在法国各地的厨房工作了十年。\"]],\"abstract\":[[\"Young children often find <b>abstract</b> ideas like fairness harder to grasp than concrete objects.\",\"幼儿常常觉得「公平」这类抽象概念比具体物品更难理解。\"],[\"The gallery's new exhibition is devoted to <b>abstract</b> paintings made of bold shapes and colours.\",\"画廊的新展览专门展出由大胆形状和色彩构成的抽象画。\"]],\"insulator\":[[\"Rubber is an effective <b>insulator</b>, which is why electricians wear rubber gloves.\",\"橡胶是一种有效的绝缘体，所以电工会戴橡胶手套。\"],[\"A thick layer of snow acts as an <b>insulator</b>, protecting the plants underneath from the frost.\",\"厚厚的积雪起着隔热绝缘的作用，保护下面的植物免受霜冻。\"]],\"design\":[[\"The bridge's elegant <b>design</b> allows it to sway slightly in strong winds without cracking.\",\"这座桥精巧的设计使它能在强风中轻微摆动而不开裂。\"],[\"She decided to study industrial <b>design</b> because she wanted to create objects people use every day.\",\"她决定学工业设计，因为她想创造人们每天都会用到的物品。\"]],\"display\":[[\"The museum's new <b>display</b> of Viking jewellery attracted record numbers of visitors.\",\"博物馆新陈列的维京珠宝吸引了创纪录数量的参观者。\"],[\"Rare manuscripts are kept in a glass <b>display</b> case under soft light to protect the pages.\",\"珍贵手稿被陈列在玻璃展柜中，在柔和的灯光下保护书页。\"]],\"heroine\":[[\"The novel's <b>heroine</b> is a young pilot who flies supplies into remote mountain villages.\",\"这部小说的女主人公是一名年轻飞行员，把物资运进偏远的山村。\"],[\"She became a national <b>heroine</b> after pulling two children from the burning building.\",\"她从着火的大楼里救出两个孩子后，成了全国闻名的女英雄。\"]],\"axe\":[[\"He split the log in two with a single swing of the <b>axe</b>.\",\"他一斧头就把木头劈成了两半。\"],[\"Early farmers used stone <b>axes</b> to clear forest land for their crops.\",\"早期的农民用石斧砍伐森林，开垦土地种庄稼。\"]],\"deer\":[[\"A <b>deer</b> stepped silently out of the trees and crossed the road ahead of us.\",\"一只鹿悄无声息地从树林里走出来，穿过了我们前面的路。\"],[\"During the rutting season, male <b>deer</b> fight each other with their antlers.\",\"在发情季，雄鹿会用鹿角互相打斗。\"]],\"engineer\":[[\"The <b>engineer</b> checked the bridge's supports after the earthquake and declared it safe.\",\"地震后，工程师检查了大桥的支撑结构，宣布它安全。\"],[\"Civil <b>engineers</b> designed a channel that carries flood water away from the town.\",\"土木工程师设计了一条渠道，把洪水引离城镇。\"]],\"beef\":[[\"The stew is made with chunks of <b>beef</b> simmered slowly in red wine.\",\"这道炖菜用大块牛肉在红酒里慢慢炖成。\"],[\"Japan imports a large amount of <b>beef</b> from Australia and the United States.\",\"日本从澳大利亚和美国进口大量牛肉。\"]],\"puzzle\":[[\"The children spent the whole afternoon putting together a thousand-piece jigsaw <b>puzzle</b>.\",\"孩子们花了一整个下午拼一盒一千片的拼图。\"],[\"This <b>puzzle</b> is missing two pieces, so we cannot complete the picture of the harbour.\",\"这盒拼图少了两片，所以我们拼不完整幅海港图。\"]],\"imagination\":[[\"The story fired the children's <b>imagination</b>, and they spent weeks drawing maps of the island.\",\"这个故事激发了孩子们的想象力，他们花了好几周画这座岛的地图。\"],[\"Good science requires <b>imagination</b> as well as careful measurement.\",\"好的科学既需要严谨的测量，也需要想象力。\"]],\"arrange\":[[\"Could you <b>arrange</b> a meeting with the suppliers for next Tuesday morning?\",\"你能安排下周二上午和供应商开个会吗？\"],[\"She <b>arranged</b> the flowers in a tall glass vase by the window.\",\"她把花插在窗边一只高玻璃花瓶里，摆放得整整齐齐。\"]],\"actress\":[[\"The <b>actress</b> won an award for her performance as a wartime nurse.\",\"这位女演员凭借饰演一名战时护士赢得了奖项。\"],[\"As a young <b>actress</b>, she performed in small theatres before moving into film.\",\"年轻时她是一名女演员，先在小剧场演出，后来才转入电影界。\"]],\"database\":[[\"The library's <b>database</b> contains the title and author of every book it has bought since 1980.\",\"这家图书馆的数据库收录了它自1980年以来所购每本书的书名和作者。\"],[\"Police checked the fingerprint <b>database</b> and found a match within an hour.\",\"警方查询了指纹数据库，不到一小时就找到了匹配记录。\"]],\"province\":[[\"Quebec is the largest <b>province</b> of Canada by land area.\",\"魁北克是加拿大陆地面积最大的省。\"],[\"Each <b>province</b> is responsible for its own schools and hospitals.\",\"每个省负责管理自己的学校和医院。\"]],\"alignment\":[[\"After the accident, the car pulled to the left because its wheels were out of <b>alignment</b>.\",\"事故之后，这辆车总是向左偏，因为车轮的定位对齐出了问题。\"],[\"The planets are rarely in perfect <b>alignment</b> with one another.\",\"行星们很少会完全对齐在一条直线上。\"]],\"analyze\":[[\"Students will <b>analyze</b> the poem line by line in tomorrow's seminar.\",\"在明天的研讨课上，学生们将逐行分析这首诗。（analyze 是美式拼写）\"],[\"Software now <b>analyzes</b> thousands of medical images to help doctors spot tumours earlier.\",\"如今软件能分析成千上万张医学影像，帮助医生更早发现肿瘤。\"]],\"party\":[[\"The governing <b>party</b> lost several seats in the regional elections.\",\"执政党在这次地区选举中失去了好几个席位。\"],[\"Voters who join a political <b>party</b> can help choose its leader and its candidates.\",\"加入政党的选民可以参与推选该党的领袖和候选人。\"]],\"ambush\":[[\"The soldiers walked straight into an <b>ambush</b> in the narrow valley.\",\"士兵们在这条狭窄的山谷里正中了伏击。\"],[\"Rebels <b>ambushed</b> the supply convoy as it crossed the bridge at dawn.\",\"拂晓时分，叛军在供给车队过桥时伏击了它。\"]],\"minor\":[[\"He escaped the crash with only <b>minor</b> injuries — a cut hand and a few bruises.\",\"他在这场车祸中只受了轻伤——手划破了，还有几处淤青。\"],[\"There are a few <b>minor</b> differences between the two editions of the textbook.\",\"这本教材的两个版本之间有几处细小的差别。\"]],\"suspension\":[[\"He received a three-day <b>suspension</b> from school after the fight in the playground.\",\"他在操场上打架后被停学三天。\"],[\"Under the rules, a second offence can lead to <b>suspension</b> for the rest of the term.\",\"按规定，第二次违规可导致停学至本学期结束。\"]],\"fatal\":[[\"The climber made one <b>fatal</b> mistake: he set out without checking the weather forecast.\",\"这位登山者犯了一个致命的错误：出发前没有查看天气预报。\"],[\"Without treatment, the disease is often <b>fatal</b> in young children.\",\"这种疾病若不治疗，对幼儿来说往往是致命的。\"]],\"market\":[[\"Farmers bring their vegetables to the town <b>market</b> every Saturday morning.\",\"农民们每周六早上把蔬菜带到镇上的市场去卖。\"],[\"There is a growing <b>market</b> for electric bicycles in European cities.\",\"欧洲城市对电动自行车的需求市场正在不断扩大。\"]],\"crane\":[[\"A tower <b>crane</b> lifted the steel beams to the top floor of the building under construction.\",\"一台塔式起重机把钢梁吊到了在建大楼的顶层。\"],[\"Workers used a mobile <b>crane</b> to move the fallen tree off the road.\",\"工人们用一台移动式起重机把倒下的树从路上移走。\"]],\"surfing\":[[\"He learned <b>surfing</b> as a teenager on the beaches near his home in Cornwall.\",\"他十几岁时在康沃尔家附近的海滩上学会了冲浪。\"],[\"The bay is popular for <b>surfing</b> because the waves there are high but not dangerous.\",\"这个海湾很适合冲浪，因为那里的浪高却不危险。\"]],\"notebook\":[[\"She carries a small <b>notebook</b> everywhere and writes down any idea that comes to her.\",\"她随身带着一个小笔记本，想到什么主意就记下来。\"],[\"His lecture <b>notebook</b> was filled with neat diagrams of cell structures.\",\"他的听课笔记本里写满了整齐的细胞结构图。\"]],\"archaeology\":[[\"She studied <b>archaeology</b> because she wanted to understand how the first farming villages lived.\",\"她学考古学，是因为她想了解最早的农耕村落是如何生活的。\"],[\"Advances in DNA analysis have transformed <b>archaeology</b> by revealing how ancient populations moved.\",\"DNA分析的进步揭示了古代人群如何迁徙，彻底改变了考古学。\"]],\"veterinarian\":[[\"The <b>veterinarian</b> examined the dog's paw and removed a thorn from between its toes.\",\"兽医检查了这只狗的爪子，从趾缝里拔出了一根刺。\"],[\"As a <b>veterinarian</b> on a dairy farm, he treats cattle more often than pets.\",\"作为奶牛场的兽医，他治疗牛比治疗宠物的时候多。\"]],\"invisible\":[[\"Bacteria are <b>invisible</b> to the naked eye and can only be seen under a microscope.\",\"细菌是肉眼看不见的，只能在显微镜下看到。\"],[\"Most of the work of raising a family is <b>invisible</b> to outsiders.\",\"养家的大部分付出，外人是看不见的。\"]],\"shipment\":[[\"The first <b>shipment</b> of vaccines arrived at the airport early this morning.\",\"第一批运送的疫苗今天清晨抵达了机场。\"],[\"A <b>shipment</b> of grain is waiting at the port to be loaded onto the freighter.\",\"一批粮食正等在港口，准备装上货轮。\"]],\"signal\":[[\"The railway <b>signal</b> turned green, and the train began to move out of the station.\",\"铁路信号灯变绿了，火车开始驶出车站。\"],[\"Rising prices are a <b>signal</b> that demand for housing is outrunning supply.\",\"房价上涨是一个信号，表明住房需求正在超过供给。\"]],\"major\":[[\"The new motorway will be a <b>major</b> improvement for traffic between the two cities.\",\"这条新高速公路将大大改善两座城市之间的交通。\"],[\"Air pollution is a <b>major</b> cause of breathing problems in large cities.\",\"空气污染是大城市呼吸问题的一个主要成因。\"]],\"slave\":[[\"In the ancient world, a captured soldier often became the <b>slave</b> of the army that defeated him.\",\"在古代世界，被俘的士兵常会成为战胜方的奴隶。\"],[\"The museum's exhibition tells the stories of <b>slaves</b> who escaped along secret routes to freedom.\",\"博物馆的展览讲述了奴隶们沿着秘密路线逃向自由的故事。\"]],\"heel\":[[\"She hurt her <b>heel</b> when she landed badly after jumping off the wall.\",\"她从墙上跳下来落地不稳，伤到了脚后跟。\"],[\"These running shoes have extra cushioning under the <b>heel</b>.\",\"这双跑鞋在脚后跟下面有额外的缓冲层。\"]],\"premier\":[[\"The <b>premier</b> opened the new hospital and praised the staff who would work there.\",\"总理为这家新医院揭幕，并赞扬了将在这里工作的医护人员。\"],[\"Canada's <b>premier</b> at the provincial level heads the government of a province.\",\"在加拿大，省级层面的总理是一省政府的首脑。\"]],\"conflict\":[[\"The novel is built around the <b>conflict</b> between a father who wants to keep the farm and a son who wants to sell it.\",\"这部小说围绕一对父子的冲突展开：父亲想保住农场，儿子却想把它卖掉。\"],[\"Armed <b>conflict</b> forced thousands of families to leave their homes in the border region.\",\"武装冲突迫使边境地区的数千个家庭离开家园。\"]],\"appropriate\":[[\"Jeans are not <b>appropriate</b> clothing for a formal job interview.\",\"牛仔裤不是正式求职面试的得体着装。\"],[\"The teacher chose books that are <b>appropriate</b> for children of different reading levels.\",\"老师为不同阅读水平的孩子挑选了合适的书籍。\"]],\"suspect\":[[\"The police released a photograph of the <b>suspect</b> and asked the public for help.\",\"警方公布了嫌疑人的照片，请求公众提供线索。\"],[\"The main <b>suspect</b> in the robbery was arrested at the airport with a suitcase of stolen jewellery.\",\"这起抢劫案的主要嫌疑人在机场被抓获，他的手提箱里装着被盗的珠宝。\"]],\"beget\":[[\"In the old translation of the Bible, fathers are said to <b>beget</b> sons, generation after generation.\",\"在《圣经》的古译本里，父亲「生」儿子，一代接一代地繁衍后代。\"],[\"A healthy pair of rabbits can <b>beget</b> dozens of offspring in a single year.\",\"一对健康的兔子一年内就能繁殖出几十只后代。\"]],\"side-effect\":[[\"Drowsiness is a common <b>side effect</b> of this allergy medicine, so do not drive after taking it.\",\"嗜睡是这种抗过敏药常见的副作用，所以服药后不要开车。\"],[\"The drug controls the disease well, but it has several unpleasant <b>side effects</b>.\",\"这种药控制病情效果不错，但有几种令人不适的副作用。\"]],\"court\":[[\"The case was heard in a <b>court</b> in London and lasted for nearly six weeks.\",\"这起案件在伦敦一家法庭审理，持续了近六周。\"],[\"She took her former employer to <b>court</b> over unpaid wages.\",\"她因拖欠工资把前雇主告上了法庭。\"]],\"feature\":[[\"The most striking <b>feature</b> of the landscape is the deep canyon carved by the river.\",\"这片地貌最醒目的特征，是河流冲刷出的深邃峡谷。\"],[\"He has his mother's eyes — the family's most recognisable <b>feature</b>.\",\"他的眼睛像他母亲——这是这个家族最易辨认的特征。\"]],\"bloody\":[[\"He came home with a <b>bloody</b> nose after being hit by the football.\",\"他被足球砸中后，流着鼻血回了家。\"],[\"The bandage was <b>bloody</b> where the wound had reopened.\",\"伤口重新裂开的地方，绷带被血浸透了。\"]],\"booming\":[[\"The small port town is <b>booming</b> now that cruise ships stop there every week.\",\"自从游轮每周都停靠之后，这座小港口城镇繁荣了起来。\"],[\"A <b>booming</b> housing market pushed prices beyond what young families could afford.\",\"繁荣的房地产市场把房价推到了年轻家庭负担不起的程度。\"]],\"infect\":[[\"A single mosquito bite can <b>infect</b> a person with malaria.\",\"被蚊子叮一口就可能使人感染疟疾。\"],[\"The virus <b>infects</b> the leaves first, turning them yellow before the whole plant dies.\",\"这种病毒先传染叶片，使其变黄，然后整株植物死亡。\"]],\"coherence\":[[\"Her essay lacks <b>coherence</b>: each paragraph is fine on its own, but they do not connect.\",\"她的文章缺乏连贯性：每段单独看都不错，但段与段之间衔接不上。\"],[\"The <b>coherence</b> of the plan depends on every department working to the same timetable.\",\"这个计划的连贯性取决于每个部门都按同一时间表行事。\"]],\"garage\":[[\"He keeps his motorcycle in the <b>garage</b> next to the lawn mower and the bicycles.\",\"他把摩托车停在车库里，旁边是割草机和自行车。\"],[\"The house has a double <b>garage</b> with room for two cars and a workbench.\",\"这所房子有一间双车位车库，能停两辆车，还放得下一张工作台。\"]],\"corporate\":[[\"She works in the <b>corporate</b> head office, managing the company's social media accounts.\",\"她在企业总部工作，负责管理公司的社交媒体账号。\"],[\"The scandal forced several <b>corporate</b> executives to resign.\",\"这起丑闻迫使数名企业高管辞职。\"]],\"biodegrade\":[[\"These shopping bags are made of plant fibres and will <b>biodegrade</b> within a few months in soil.\",\"这些购物袋由植物纤维制成，在土壤中几个月内就能生物降解。\"],[\"Unlike ordinary plastic, the new packaging <b>biodegrades</b> instead of lasting for centuries in landfill.\",\"与普通塑料不同，这种新包装能生物降解，不会在垃圾填埋场里存留数百年。\"]],\"terrain\":[[\"The mountain <b>terrain</b> was so steep that the soldiers had to abandon their vehicles.\",\"山地地形太陡，士兵们只好弃车步行。\"],[\"Wheeled robots struggle on rough <b>terrain</b> covered with loose rocks.\",\"轮式机器人在满是松动石块的崎岖地形上行动困难。\"]],\"scanner\":[[\"At the airport, each suitcase passes through a <b>scanner</b> that can detect metal and explosives.\",\"在机场，每个手提箱都要经过一台能探测金属和爆炸物的扫描仪。\"],[\"He placed the old photograph on the <b>scanner</b> to make a digital copy.\",\"他把老照片放在扫描仪上，制作了一份电子版。\"]],\"juggle\":[[\"The street performer could <b>juggle</b> five burning torches without dropping one.\",\"这位街头艺人能同时抛接五支点燃的火炬，一支也不掉。\"],[\"Children watched in amazement as the clown <b>juggled</b> apples and took bites out of them in mid-air.\",\"孩子们惊奇地看着小丑玩杂耍抛苹果，还在半空中咬上一口。\"]],\"eloquent\":[[\"Her <b>eloquent</b> speech about clean water moved the whole audience to silence.\",\"她关于清洁饮水的雄辩演讲让全场听众都安静了下来。\"],[\"The lawyer gave an <b>eloquent</b> defence that convinced the jury in under an hour.\",\"律师作了口才出众的辩护，不到一小时就说服了陪审团。\"]],\"certify\":[[\"An accountant must <b>certify</b> the company's accounts before they are published.\",\"会计师必须先证明核实公司的账目，然后才能公布。\"],[\"The label shows that this timber is <b>certified</b> as coming from responsibly managed forests.\",\"标签表明这批木材已获证明，来自负责任管理的森林。\"]],\"befriend\":[[\"At summer camp she quickly <b>befriended</b> a girl from another town, and they wrote to each other for years.\",\"在夏令营里，她很快和一个外地女孩交上了朋友，两人通信多年。\"],[\"He <b>befriended</b> the lonely old man next door and visited him every Sunday.\",\"他和隔壁孤独的老人交上了朋友，每周日都去看他。\"]],\"consent\":[[\"The operation cannot go ahead without the patient's written <b>consent</b>.\",\"没有病人的书面同意，手术就不能进行。\"],[\"She <b>consented</b> to let the researchers use her interview in their study.\",\"她同意让研究人员在研究中引用她的访谈。\"]],\"price\":[[\"The <b>price</b> of train tickets rose sharply at the start of the holiday season.\",\"假期开始时，火车票价格大幅上涨。\"],[\"Housing <b>prices</b> in the capital have doubled in ten years.\",\"首都的房价十年间翻了一番。\"]],\"interact\":[[\"In this experiment, the two chemicals <b>interact</b> to produce a bright blue flame.\",\"在这个实验中，这两种化学物质相互作用，产生明亮的蓝色火焰。\"],[\"How teachers <b>interact</b> with shy students can strongly affect their confidence.\",\"老师如何与害羞的学生互动，会极大影响他们的自信心。\"]],\"circumference\":[[\"The <b>circumference</b> of the old oak was so great that four children holding hands could not reach around it.\",\"这棵老橡树的圆周大得惊人，四个孩子手拉手都围不过来。\"],[\"If you know a circle's radius, you can calculate its <b>circumference</b> with a simple formula.\",\"知道了圆的半径，就能用一个简单公式算出它的圆周。\"]],\"hippo\":[[\"A <b>hippo</b> spends most of the day submerged in the river, with only its eyes and nostrils above the water.\",\"河马一天中大部分时间都泡在河里，只把眼睛和鼻孔露出水面。\"],[\"Despite its huge size, a <b>hippo</b> can run surprisingly fast on land for short distances.\",\"河马虽然体型庞大，却能在陆地上短距离跑得惊人地快。\"]],\"donor\":[[\"The hospital thanked the blood <b>donors</b> whose gifts had saved the accident victim's life.\",\"医院感谢了那些献血者，他们的血救了事故伤者的命。\"],[\"An anonymous <b>donor</b> paid for the new children's library.\",\"一位匿名捐献者出资建了这座新的儿童图书馆。\"]],\"enrollment\":[[\"<b>Enrollment</b> in the evening Spanish course has doubled this year.\",\"今年报名参加晚间西班牙语课程的人数翻了一番。\"],[\"After <b>enrollment</b>, new students receive an ID card and a tour of the campus.\",\"注册完成后，新生会领到一张学生证，并参观校园。\"]],\"field\":[[\"The sheep graze in a <b>field</b> bordered by an old stone wall.\",\"羊群在一片田野里吃草，田野边上是一道古老的石墙。\"],[\"In June the <b>fields</b> around the village turn gold as the wheat ripens.\",\"到了六月，村子周围的田野随着麦子成熟而变成金黄色。\"]],\"march\":[[\"The soldiers <b>marched</b> twenty kilometres a day through the mountains.\",\"士兵们每天在山地中行进二十公里。\"],[\"The long <b>march</b> across the desert took the caravan almost a month.\",\"这支商队横穿沙漠的长途行进花了近一个月。\"]],\"zone\":[[\"This part of the city is a pedestrian <b>zone</b> where cars are not allowed.\",\"市区的这一片是步行地带，不准汽车进入。\"],[\"The factory was built in a special economic <b>zone</b> near the port.\",\"这家工厂建在港口附近的一个经济特区里。\"]],\"governor\":[[\"The <b>governor</b> of California signed the new water law after months of debate.\",\"经过数月辩论，加利福尼亚州州长签署了新的水资源法。\"],[\"Each state elects its own <b>governor</b> for a four-year term.\",\"每个州都选举自己的州长，任期四年。\"]],\"caribou\":[[\"Herds of <b>caribou</b> migrate hundreds of kilometres across the Arctic tundra each year.\",\"北美驯鹿群每年在北极苔原上迁徙数百公里。\"],[\"In Eurasia the same animal is called a reindeer, but in North America it is known as the <b>caribou</b>.\",\"同一种动物在欧亚大陆叫驯鹿，在北美则被称为北美驯鹿。\"]],\"tailor\":[[\"The <b>tailor</b> measured his shoulders and waist before cutting the cloth for the suit.\",\"裁缝在裁剪西装布料前，先量了他的肩宽和腰围。\"],[\"She took the torn jacket to a <b>tailor</b> in the old town to have it repaired.\",\"她把撕破的夹克送到老城的一位裁缝那里修补。\"]],\"blooming\":[[\"The cherry trees along the river are <b>blooming</b> earlier than usual this spring.\",\"今年春天，河边的樱花树比往常开得更早。\"],[\"By May the whole hillside was covered with <b>blooming</b> wild flowers.\",\"到了五月，整面山坡都开满了盛开的野花。\"]],\"decline\":[[\"The village school closed after a long <b>decline</b> in the number of local children.\",\"由于当地儿童数量长期衰退减少，这所乡村学校关闭了。\"],[\"Historians still argue about the causes of the Roman Empire's <b>decline</b>.\",\"历史学家仍在争论罗马帝国衰落的原因。\"]],\"banish\":[[\"The king <b>banished</b> the disloyal duke to a remote island for the rest of his life.\",\"国王把这位不忠的公爵放逐到一座偏远的岛上，终身不得返回。\"],[\"For his part in the plot, the general was <b>banished</b> from the capital and stripped of his rank.\",\"由于参与了这场阴谋，这位将军被放逐出京城，并被剥夺了军衔。\"]],\"oxygen\":[[\"Plants produce <b>oxygen</b> during photosynthesis and release it into the air.\",\"植物在光合作用中产生氧气并将其释放到空气中。\"],[\"At high altitude there is less <b>oxygen</b> in each breath, so climbers often carry oxygen tanks.\",\"在高海拔地区，每一口呼吸中的氧气更少，所以登山者常携带氧气瓶。\"]],\"clam\":[[\"At low tide, children dug in the wet sand looking for <b>clams</b>.\",\"退潮时，孩子们在湿沙里挖蛤蜊。\"],[\"A <b>clam</b> protects its soft body by snapping its two shells tightly shut.\",\"蛤蜊靠把两片壳紧紧闭合来保护自己柔软的身体。\"]],\"cub\":[[\"The lioness carried her <b>cub</b> gently by the back of its neck.\",\"母狮轻轻叼着幼崽的后颈把它搬走。\"],[\"Two bear <b>cubs</b> wrestled in the grass while their mother watched from the trees.\",\"两只熊幼崽在草地上打闹，它们的母亲在树旁看着。\"]],\"mule\":[[\"In steep mountain villages, farmers still use <b>mules</b> to carry loads along narrow paths.\",\"在陡峭的山村里，农民仍用骡子沿着窄路驮运货物。\"],[\"A <b>mule</b> is the offspring of a male donkey and a female horse, and it cannot have young of its own.\",\"骡子是公驴和母马的后代，它自己不能生育。\"]],\"rat\":[[\"The old warehouse by the docks was full of <b>rats</b> living among the sacks of grain.\",\"码头旁的旧仓库里到处是老鼠，它们住在粮袋之间。\"],[\"Laboratory <b>rats</b> are used to test whether new medicines are safe.\",\"实验室里用大老鼠来测试新药是否安全。\"]],\"photography\":[[\"The arrival of digital <b>photography</b> changed the newspaper industry within a decade.\",\"数字摄影的出现，在十年内改变了报纸行业。\"],[\"Before film was invented, <b>photography</b> required heavy glass plates coated with chemicals, and she studies this early history of <b>photography</b> at college.\",\"在胶片发明之前，摄影学需要使用涂有化学药品的沉重玻璃板，她在大学里学的正是这段早期摄影史。\"]],\"analog\":[[\"An <b>analog</b> signal varies smoothly, unlike a digital signal, which jumps between separate values.\",\"模拟信号是平滑变化的，不像数字信号那样在分立的数值之间跳变。\"],[\"Old radio broadcasts were sent as <b>analog</b> waves that any receiver could pick up.\",\"早期的无线电广播以模拟信号波的形式发送，任何接收机都能收到。\"]],\"clamp\":[[\"He <b>clamped</b> the two boards together overnight so the glue would set properly.\",\"他把两块木板夹紧过夜，好让胶水充分凝固。\"],[\"Carpenters use a metal <b>clamp</b> to hold pieces of wood steady while they work.\",\"木匠用金属夹具把木料稳稳夹住再加工。\"]],\"refund\":[[\"The airline gave every passenger a full <b>refund</b> after the flight was cancelled.\",\"航班取消后，航空公司给每位乘客全额退款。\"],[\"If the shoes do not fit, you can return them within thirty days for a <b>refund</b>.\",\"如果鞋子不合脚，你可以在三十天内退货退款。\"]],\"bacteria\":[[\"Most <b>bacteria</b> are harmless, and some in the gut actually help us digest food.\",\"大多数细菌是无害的，肠道里的一些细菌还能帮助我们消化食物。\"],[\"Washing your hands with soap removes the <b>bacteria</b> that can cause illness.\",\"用肥皂洗手能去除可能致病的细菌。\"]],\"subsidy\":[[\"The government offers a <b>subsidy</b> to farmers who switch to water-saving irrigation.\",\"政府向改用节水灌溉的农民提供补贴。\"],[\"Thanks to a housing <b>subsidy</b>, young teachers can afford to rent flats near the school.\",\"多亏了住房补贴，年轻教师租得起学校附近的公寓。\"]],\"valley\":[[\"The river winds through a green <b>valley</b> between two lines of hills.\",\"河流在两列山丘之间蜿蜒穿过一条绿色的山谷。\"],[\"Fog often fills the <b>valley</b> in the early morning and lifts by noon.\",\"清晨山谷里常弥漫着雾气，到中午才散去。\"]],\"attendance\":[[\"<b>Attendance</b> at the Saturday lectures has risen since the museum made them free.\",\"自从博物馆把周六讲座改为免费后，参加的人数上升了。\"],[\"The teacher takes <b>attendance</b> at the beginning of every class and notes who is absent.\",\"老师每节课开始时点名出勤，并记下谁缺席。\"]],\"expropriation\":[[\"The <b>expropriation</b> of farmland for the new motorway was opposed by many local families.\",\"为修建新高速公路而征用农田，遭到了许多当地家庭的反对。\"],[\"Under the law, <b>expropriation</b> for public projects must be paid for at a fair price.\",\"法律规定，为公共工程征用土地必须按公平价格给予补偿。\"]],\"incident\":[[\"The police are investigating an <b>incident</b> in which a shop window was smashed late last night.\",\"警方正在调查昨晚深夜一扇商店橱窗被砸的事件。\"],[\"No one was hurt in the <b>incident</b>, and the factory reopened the following morning.\",\"这次事件中无人受伤，工厂第二天早上重新开工。\"]],\"confess\":[[\"After hours of questioning, he finally <b>confessed</b> to stealing the money from the safe.\",\"经过数小时审讯，他终于坦白了从保险柜偷钱的事。\"],[\"She <b>confessed</b> that she had never actually read the report she was criticising.\",\"她坦白说，自己其实从未读过她所批评的那份报告。\"]],\"trip\":[[\"Our school <b>trip</b> to the science museum takes about an hour by coach.\",\"我们学校去科学博物馆的旅行，乘大巴大约要一小时。\"],[\"He is away on a business <b>trip</b> and will not be back until Friday.\",\"他出差去了，要到周五才回来。\"]],\"exposure\":[[\"Prolonged <b>exposure</b> to loud noise can permanently damage hearing.\",\"长时间暴露在高分贝噪音中会永久损伤听力。\"],[\"Workers handling the chemical must limit their <b>exposure</b> and wear protective gloves.\",\"接触这种化学品的工人必须限制暴露时间，并戴上防护手套。\"]],\"choreograph\":[[\"She was invited to <b>choreograph</b> a new ballet based on a folk tale.\",\"她受邀为一部取材于民间故事的新芭蕾舞剧编舞。\"],[\"The fight scenes were carefully <b>choreographed</b> so that no actor would be hurt.\",\"这些打斗场面都经过精心编排，确保演员不会受伤。\"]],\"larva\":[[\"A caterpillar is the <b>larva</b> of a butterfly or moth.\",\"毛毛虫是蝴蝶或飞蛾的幼虫。\"],[\"The mosquito's <b>larvae</b> live in still water and feed on tiny organisms.\",\"蚊子的幼虫生活在静水中，以微小生物为食。\"]],\"shore\":[[\"Waves carried the empty boat gently towards the rocky <b>shore</b>.\",\"海浪把这条空船轻轻推向了多岩石的海岸。\"],[\"Children collected shells along the <b>shore</b> while the tide was out.\",\"退潮时，孩子们沿着海岸捡贝壳。\"]],\"consistency\":[[\"The sauce should have the <b>consistency</b> of thick cream when it is ready.\",\"这酱汁做好时，应该有浓奶油那样的稠度。\"],[\"What impressed the judges was the <b>consistency</b> of her performance across all four rounds.\",\"给评委留下深刻印象的，是她在四轮比赛中表现的一致性。\"]],\"escalation\":[[\"Both governments sent more troops to the border, a dangerous <b>escalation</b> of the dispute.\",\"两国都向边境增兵，这是这场争端的危险升级。\"],[\"The argument began over a parking space and led to a rapid <b>escalation</b> into threats.\",\"这场争吵起因只是一个停车位，却迅速升级成了威胁。\"]],\"deposit\":[[\"Miners discovered a rich <b>deposit</b> of copper deep below the hills.\",\"矿工在山丘深处发现了一处富铜矿床。\"],[\"This valley contains the largest known <b>deposit</b> of the mineral in the country.\",\"这座山谷拥有全国已知的最大该矿物矿床。\"]],\"score\":[[\"Her <b>score</b> on the final exam was the highest in the class.\",\"她的期末考试分数是全班最高的。\"],[\"You need a <b>score</b> of at least sixty to pass the driving theory test.\",\"驾驶理论考试至少需要拿到六十分才能通过。\"]],\"librarian\":[[\"The <b>librarian</b> helped him track down a journal article from 1963.\",\"图书管理员帮他找到了一篇1963年的期刊文章。\"],[\"Ask the <b>librarian</b> at the front desk if you need to renew your books.\",\"如果你需要续借图书，去问前台的图书管理员。\"]],\"access\":[[\"A narrow path provides the only <b>access</b> to the beach from the village.\",\"一条小路是从村子通往海滩的唯一通道。\"],[\"The new building has step-free <b>access</b> so wheelchair users can enter easily.\",\"这座新建筑有无台阶通道，轮椅使用者可以方便地进入。\"]],\"thyme\":[[\"She seasoned the roast chicken with <b>thyme</b>, garlic and lemon.\",\"她用百里香、大蒜和柠檬给烤鸡调味。\"],[\"Wild <b>thyme</b> grows on the dry hillsides and fills the air with its scent in summer.\",\"野生百里香生长在干燥的山坡上，夏天让空气里满是它的香气。\"]],\"illustrate\":[[\"To <b>illustrate</b> how tides work, the teacher used a bucket of water and a ball.\",\"为了阐明潮汐的原理，老师用了一桶水和一个球。\"],[\"The following diagram <b>illustrates</b> the stages in the life cycle of a frog.\",\"下图阐明了青蛙生命周期的各个阶段。\"]],\"mosquito\":[[\"A <b>mosquito</b> whined around his ear all night and kept him awake.\",\"一只蚊子整夜在他耳边嗡嗡叫，吵得他睡不着。\"],[\"Sleeping under a net protects children from <b>mosquito</b> bites in the rainy season.\",\"雨季里睡在蚊帐下可以保护孩子不被蚊子叮咬。\"]],\"predict\":[[\"It is difficult to <b>predict</b> exactly where the storm will make landfall.\",\"很难准确预言这场风暴将在哪里登陆。\"],[\"Economists <b>predicted</b> that food prices would rise after the drought.\",\"经济学家预言干旱之后食品价格会上涨。\"]],\"accept\":[[\"She was delighted to <b>accept</b> the university's offer of a place on the course.\",\"她很高兴地接受了这所大学的课程录取。\"],[\"The shop does not <b>accept</b> cheques, only cash and cards.\",\"这家商店不接受支票，只收现金和银行卡。\"]],\"excuse\":[[\"Being tired is not an <b>excuse</b> for handing in your homework late.\",\"累了不是迟交作业的借口。\"],[\"He made the <b>excuse</b> that the train had been delayed, but nobody believed him.\",\"他借口说火车晚点了，但没人相信他。\"]],\"basic\":[[\"Reading and writing are <b>basic</b> skills that every child should master at primary school.\",\"读写是每个孩子都应在小学掌握的基本技能。\"],[\"The course teaches the <b>basic</b> principles of photography in the first three weeks.\",\"这门课在前三周讲授摄影的基本原理。\"]],\"believe\":[[\"I <b>believe</b> the meeting is on Thursday, but let me check the calendar.\",\"我相信会议是在周四，不过我查一下日历。\"],[\"Many scientists <b>believe</b> the species will disappear within fifty years if the forest keeps shrinking.\",\"许多科学家相信，如果森林继续缩小，这个物种将在五十年内消失。\"]],\"blissful\":[[\"They spent a <b>blissful</b> week in a cottage by the sea, far from phones and email.\",\"他们在海边一间小屋里度过了极乐的一周，远离电话和邮件。\"],[\"The baby fell into a <b>blissful</b> sleep after her feed.\",\"婴儿吃饱后甜甜地睡着了，一脸极乐满足的样子。\"]],\"umbrella\":[[\"She opened her <b>umbrella</b> as soon as the first drops of rain began to fall.\",\"第一滴雨落下时，她就撑开了雨伞。\"],[\"A beach <b>umbrella</b> gave them some shade during the hottest part of the day.\",\"一把海滩伞在一天中最热的时候为他们遮了阴。\"]],\"remedy\":[[\"Ginger tea is a traditional <b>remedy</b> for an upset stomach.\",\"姜茶是治疗胃部不适的传统药物偏方。\"],[\"The doctor prescribed a herbal <b>remedy</b> to help him sleep.\",\"医生开了一种草药药物帮他入睡。\"]],\"gust\":[[\"A sudden <b>gust</b> of wind blew his hat into the river.\",\"一阵突如其来的狂风把他的帽子吹进了河里。\"],[\"<b>Gusts</b> of up to ninety kilometres per hour are expected along the coast tonight.\",\"预计今晚沿海地区将出现时速达九十公里的阵风。\"]],\"pan\":[[\"Heat the oil in a heavy frying <b>pan</b> before adding the onions.\",\"先把油在厚底平底锅里烧热，再下洋葱。\"],[\"She washed the <b>pans</b> and left them to dry beside the sink.\",\"她把平底锅洗好，放在水槽边晾干。\"]],\"lecture\":[[\"The professor's <b>lecture</b> on black holes was so clear that even first-year students followed it easily.\",\"这位教授关于黑洞的演讲非常清晰，连大一学生都听得很轻松。\"],[\"Attendance at the Friday <b>lecture</b> is compulsory for all students on the course.\",\"修这门课的所有学生都必须参加周五的讲座。\"]],\"objective\":[[\"A good reviewer stays <b>objective</b> and judges the book on its merits, not on personal taste.\",\"好的评论者会保持客观，按作品本身的优劣而不是个人好恶来评价。\"],[\"It is hard to be <b>objective</b> about your own child's behaviour.\",\"对自己孩子的行为很难做到客观。\"]],\"barn\":[[\"The farmer stores hay for the winter in the big red <b>barn</b> behind the farmhouse.\",\"农民把过冬的干草存放在农舍后面那座红色大谷仓里。\"],[\"An old <b>barn</b> on the hill was converted into a studio for local artists.\",\"山上的一座旧谷仓被改建成了供当地艺术家使用的工作室。\"]],\"artistry\":[[\"The vase shows the potter's <b>artistry</b> in every curve of its shape.\",\"这只花瓶的每一条曲线都展现出陶艺家的艺术性。\"],[\"Her playing was admired not just for its accuracy but for its <b>artistry</b>.\",\"她的演奏受到赞赏，不只是因为准确，更因为其中的艺术性。\"]],\"bison\":[[\"Huge herds of <b>bison</b> once roamed the grasslands of North America.\",\"曾经有大群美洲野牛在北美大草原上漫游。\"],[\"A male <b>bison</b> can weigh as much as a small car.\",\"一头雄性美洲野牛的重量可达一辆小汽车。\"]],\"fiction\":[[\"She prefers reading <b>fiction</b> — novels and short stories — to history books.\",\"比起历史书，她更喜欢读虚构小说——长篇和短篇小说。\"],[\"His claim to have climbed the mountain alone turned out to be pure <b>fiction</b>.\",\"他声称独自登顶的说法被证明纯属虚构。\"]],\"citizen\":[[\"As a <b>citizen</b> of the country, she has the right to vote in every election.\",\"作为这个国家的公民，她有权在每次选举中投票。\"],[\"The city asked its <b>citizens</b> to save water during the drought.\",\"干旱期间，市政府呼吁市民节约用水。\"]],\"seminar\":[[\"In the graduate <b>seminar</b>, twelve students discuss one research paper each week.\",\"在这门研究生研讨会上，十二名学生每周讨论一篇研究论文。\"],[\"The visiting professor gave a <b>seminar</b> on recent developments in oceanography.\",\"这位访问教授举办了一场关于海洋学最新进展的研讨会。\"]],\"arrest\":[[\"Police <b>arrested</b> two men outside the bank shortly after the alarm went off.\",\"警铃响起后不久，警察在银行外逮捕了两名男子。\"],[\"His <b>arrest</b> was reported on the front page of every newspaper the next day.\",\"他被逮捕的消息第二天登上了各家报纸的头版。\"]],\"otter\":[[\"An <b>otter</b> floated on its back in the river, holding a stone on its chest to crack open a shell.\",\"一只水獭仰浮在河面上，胸口放着一块石头，用来砸开贝壳。\"],[\"River <b>otters</b> slide down muddy banks into the water just for fun.\",\"河獭会顺着泥泞的河岸滑进水里，纯粹为了好玩。\"]],\"snowfall\":[[\"The ski resort reported the heaviest <b>snowfall</b> in twenty years.\",\"这家滑雪度假村报告了二十年来最大的降雪量。\"],[\"After a night of heavy <b>snowfall</b>, the whole valley lay silent and white.\",\"一夜大雪之后，整条山谷一片寂静雪白。\"]],\"conditioning\":[[\"In Pavlov's famous experiment, <b>conditioning</b> led dogs to salivate at the sound of a bell alone.\",\"在巴甫洛夫著名的实验中，条件反射使狗仅听到铃声就分泌唾液。\"],[\"Classical <b>conditioning</b> works by pairing a neutral signal with something that naturally triggers a response.\",\"经典条件反射的原理，是把一个中性信号与能自然引发反应的事物配对出现。\"]],\"psychology\":[[\"She chose <b>psychology</b> as her major because she wanted to understand how memory works.\",\"她选择心理学作为专业，因为她想弄清记忆是如何运作的。\"],[\"Sports <b>psychology</b> studies how pressure and confidence affect an athlete's performance.\",\"运动心理学研究压力和信心如何影响运动员的表现。\"]],\"amend\":[[\"Parliament voted to <b>amend</b> the law so that part-time workers receive the same benefits.\",\"议会投票修正了这部法律，使兼职员工享有同样的福利。\"],[\"Please <b>amend</b> the contract to include the new delivery date before signing it.\",\"请先修正合同，加入新的交付日期，然后再签字。\"]],\"theater\":[[\"The old <b>theater</b> in the town centre was restored and reopened last spring.\",\"镇中心的那家老剧院经过修复，于去年春天重新开放。\"],[\"She has worked in the <b>theater</b> for thirty years, first as an actor and later as a director.\",\"她在剧院界工作了三十年，先做演员，后来当导演。\"]],\"generator\":[[\"When the storm cut the power, the hospital switched to its emergency <b>generator</b>.\",\"暴风雨切断供电时，医院切换到了备用发电机。\"],[\"A portable <b>generator</b> provided electricity for the lights and sound system at the outdoor concert.\",\"一台便携式发电机为这场户外音乐会的灯光和音响供电。\"]],\"demand\":[[\"When <b>demand</b> for a product rises faster than supply, its price usually goes up.\",\"当对一种产品的需求增长快于供给时，它的价格通常会上涨。\"],[\"There is strong <b>demand</b> for engineers who can work with renewable energy systems.\",\"市场对能从事可再生能源系统的工程师需求旺盛。\"]],\"profit\":[[\"The bakery made a small <b>profit</b> in its first year despite high rent.\",\"这家面包房尽管租金很高，第一年还是获得了一点利润。\"],[\"The company reported record <b>profits</b> after launching its new phone.\",\"该公司在推出新款手机后报告了创纪录的利润。\"]],\"euthanasia\":[[\"The debate over <b>euthanasia</b> raises difficult questions about pain, dignity and the role of doctors.\",\"关于安乐死的辩论提出了有关痛苦、尊严和医生角色的棘手问题。\"],[\"In a few countries, <b>euthanasia</b> is legal under strict conditions for patients with incurable diseases.\",\"在少数国家，对于身患绝症的病人，安乐死在严格条件下是合法的。\"]],\"encounter\":[[\"On the trail they had a close <b>encounter</b> with a black bear, which fortunately walked away.\",\"在山路上他们与一头黑熊近距离遭遇，所幸熊自己走开了。\"],[\"Her first <b>encounter</b> with the ocean came at the age of twenty, on a trip to the coast.\",\"她二十岁去海边旅行时，才第一次与大海相遇。\"]],\"considerable\":[[\"The repairs will take a <b>considerable</b> amount of time and money.\",\"这次维修将耗费相当可观的时间和金钱。\"],[\"There is <b>considerable</b> disagreement among experts about how fast the ice cap is melting.\",\"专家们对于冰盖融化速度存在相当大的分歧。\"]],\"farm\":[[\"His family has run the same <b>farm</b> for four generations.\",\"他的家族经营着同一座农场，已经四代人了。\"],[\"On the <b>farm</b>, work begins before sunrise, when the cows are milked.\",\"在农场，工作在日出前就开始了，那时要给奶牛挤奶。\"]],\"development\":[[\"The child's language <b>development</b> was slower than average, so a specialist assessed her.\",\"这个孩子的语言发展比平均水平慢，所以请了专家来评估。\"],[\"The coastal town owes its rapid <b>development</b> to the new port and railway.\",\"这座海滨小镇的快速发展要归功于新港口和铁路。\"]],\"neutrality\":[[\"Switzerland is famous for its long-standing policy of <b>neutrality</b> in international conflicts.\",\"瑞士以其在国际冲突中长期奉行中立政策而闻名。\"],[\"A judge must maintain strict <b>neutrality</b> between the two sides in a case.\",\"法官必须在案件双方之间保持严格的中立。\"]],\"zipper\":[[\"The <b>zipper</b> on his jacket got stuck, and he had to pull it down with pliers.\",\"他夹克上的拉链卡住了，不得不用钳子把它拉下来。\"],[\"She closed the suitcase and fastened the <b>zipper</b> carefully before leaving for the airport.\",\"去机场前，她合上手提箱，仔细拉好了拉链。\"]],\"binding\":[[\"Once both parties sign, the agreement is legally <b>binding</b> and cannot simply be ignored.\",\"双方一旦签字，这份协议就具有法律约束力，不能随意忽视。\"],[\"The court's ruling is <b>binding</b> on all lower courts in the state.\",\"这家法院的裁决对州内所有下级法院都有约束力。\"]],\"magnet\":[[\"A fridge <b>magnet</b> in the shape of a lighthouse holds the shopping list on the door.\",\"一块灯塔形状的冰箱磁体把购物清单吸在门上。\"],[\"The scrapyard uses a huge <b>magnet</b> on a crane to lift old cars.\",\"废车场用起重机上的巨大磁体吊起报废汽车。\"]],\"antagonistic\":[[\"The two departments had become openly <b>antagonistic</b> toward each other over the budget.\",\"这两个部门在预算问题上已经变得公开敌对。\"],[\"He took an <b>antagonistic</b> tone from the very start of the negotiation.\",\"他从谈判一开始就摆出敌对的语气。\"]],\"unfold\":[[\"She <b>unfolded</b> the map on the table and pointed to the village where they would spend the night.\",\"她把地图在桌上展开，指出他们今晚要住宿的村子。\"],[\"As the investigation <b>unfolded</b>, it became clear that the fire had been started deliberately.\",\"随着调查的展开，情况逐渐明朗：这场火是有人故意放的。\"]],\"etymology\":[[\"<b>Etymology</b> traces the word 'window' back to an Old Norse term meaning 'wind eye'.\",\"词源学把window一词追溯到一个古诺尔斯语词，意思是「风之眼」。\"],[\"He enjoys <b>etymology</b> because every long word hides a small piece of history.\",\"他喜欢词源学，因为每个长单词里都藏着一小段历史。\"]],\"linguistics\":[[\"<b>Linguistics</b> examines not only grammar but also how children acquire their first language.\",\"语言学不仅研究语法，还研究儿童如何习得第一语言。\"],[\"She did her doctorate in <b>linguistics</b>, specialising in how sounds change over centuries.\",\"她读的是语言学博士，专攻语音如何随世纪变迁。\"]],\"expertise\":[[\"The rescue team relied on her <b>expertise</b> in mountain weather to choose a safe route.\",\"救援队依靠她在山地天气方面的专长来选择安全路线。\"],[\"His <b>expertise</b> in restoring medieval manuscripts is known across Europe.\",\"他在修复中世纪手稿方面的专长闻名欧洲。\"]],\"biology\":[[\"In <b>biology</b> class, students dissected a flower to study its reproductive parts.\",\"在生物学课上，学生们解剖了一朵花，研究它的生殖结构。\"],[\"Marine <b>biology</b> deals with everything from microscopic plankton to blue whales.\",\"海洋生物学研究的对象从微小的浮游生物到蓝鲸无所不包。\"]],\"meditation\":[[\"Ten minutes of <b>meditation</b> each morning helps her stay calm during busy days.\",\"每天早晨十分钟的冥想能帮她在忙碌的日子里保持平静。\"],[\"The monks begin the day with silent <b>meditation</b> before sunrise.\",\"僧侣们在日出前以静默冥想开始一天。\"]],\"meticulous\":[[\"The restorer was <b>meticulous</b>: she cleaned the painting one square centimetre at a time.\",\"这位修复师一丝不苟：她一次只清洁画作的一平方厘米。\"],[\"He kept <b>meticulous</b> records of every bird he saw on the expedition.\",\"他对这次探险中见到的每一只鸟都做了极为细致的记录。\"]],\"lean\":[[\"The old fence <b>leans</b> to one side and will fall over if it is not repaired.\",\"这道旧篱笆向一边倾斜，再不修就会倒。\"],[\"The ladder <b>leaned</b> against the wall at a dangerous angle.\",\"梯子以一个危险的角度倾斜靠在墙上。\"]],\"bleach\":[[\"She used a mild <b>bleach</b> solution to whiten the stained tablecloth.\",\"她用温和的漂白液把沾了污渍的桌布漂白。\"],[\"Sunlight can <b>bleach</b> the colour out of curtains within a single summer.\",\"阳光能在一个夏天内把窗帘的颜色漂白晒褪。\"]],\"burger\":[[\"He ordered a cheese <b>burger</b> and a portion of fries at the counter.\",\"他在柜台点了一个芝士汉堡和一份薯条。\"],[\"The café sells a vegetable <b>burger</b> made from beans and mushrooms.\",\"这家咖啡馆卖一种用豆子和蘑菇做的素食汉堡。\"]],\"friction\":[[\"<b>Friction</b> between the tyres and the road is what allows a car to turn without sliding off.\",\"轮胎与路面之间的摩擦力使汽车能够转弯而不打滑冲出路面。\"],[\"Without oil, <b>friction</b> inside the engine would quickly wear the metal parts away.\",\"没有机油，发动机内部的摩擦会很快把金属部件磨坏。\"]],\"export\":[[\"Norway's main <b>exports</b> are oil, gas and seafood.\",\"挪威的主要出口产品是石油、天然气和海产品。\"],[\"The factory <b>exports</b> most of its bicycles to Germany and the Netherlands.\",\"这家工厂把大部分自行车出口到德国和荷兰。\"]],\"joy\":[[\"The children shouted with <b>joy</b> when the first snow began to fall.\",\"第一场雪开始落下时，孩子们高兴得欢呼起来。\"],[\"Her face lit up with <b>joy</b> at the news that she had passed.\",\"听到自己通过的消息，她脸上绽放出喜悦。\"]],\"motivation\":[[\"His main <b>motivation</b> for learning Japanese was to read manga in the original.\",\"他学日语的主要动机是想读原版漫画。\"],[\"Money is not the only <b>motivation</b>: many volunteers are driven by a wish to help their neighbours.\",\"金钱不是唯一的动机：许多志愿者是出于帮助邻里的愿望。\"]],\"state\":[[\"Texas is the second largest <b>state</b> in the United States by both area and population.\",\"得克萨斯州是美国面积和人口都排第二的州。\"],[\"Each <b>state</b> sets its own rules for obtaining a driving licence.\",\"每个州都有自己考取驾照的规定。\"]],\"diagnosis\":[[\"After a week of tests, the doctors reached a <b>diagnosis</b> of pneumonia.\",\"经过一周的检查，医生们作出了肺炎的诊断。\"],[\"Early <b>diagnosis</b> of the disease greatly improves the chances of a full recovery.\",\"这种疾病的早期诊断能大大提高完全康复的机会。\"]],\"lead\":[[\"Old water pipes were often made of <b>lead</b>, which can slowly poison drinking water.\",\"过去的水管常用铅制成，会慢慢污染饮用水。\"],[\"<b>Lead</b> is so dense that even a small block of it feels surprisingly heavy.\",\"铅的密度非常大，即使一小块也重得惊人。\"]],\"woods\":[[\"They walked through the <b>woods</b> as the light faded, following the sound of a stream.\",\"天色渐暗时，他们穿过树林，循着溪流声前行。\"],[\"The cottage stands at the edge of the <b>woods</b>, a ten-minute walk from the village.\",\"这间小屋位于树林的边缘，离村子步行十分钟。\"]],\"labor\":[[\"Building the canal required the <b>labor</b> of thousands of workers over ten years.\",\"修建这条运河用了上万名劳动者十年的劳动。\"],[\"In many countries, child <b>labor</b> in factories is now against the law.\",\"在许多国家，工厂使用童工劳动现在是非法的。\"]],\"entertainment\":[[\"The long flight offered films and games as in-flight <b>entertainment</b>.\",\"这趟长途航班提供电影和游戏作为机上娱乐。\"],[\"For <b>entertainment</b> in the evenings, the hotel arranged local music and dancing.\",\"为了晚间娱乐，酒店安排了当地的音乐和舞蹈表演。\"]],\"beset\":[[\"The expedition was <b>beset</b> by storms and equipment failures from the very first week.\",\"这支探险队从第一周起就被暴风雨和设备故障所困扰围攻。\"],[\"The new company is <b>beset</b> by debt and may not survive the winter.\",\"这家新公司被债务困扰，可能撑不过这个冬天。\"]],\"laptop\":[[\"She wrote most of her thesis on a second-hand <b>laptop</b> in the university library.\",\"她的论文大部分是在大学图书馆里用一台二手笔记本电脑写的。\"],[\"Please place your <b>laptop</b> in a separate tray when you go through airport security.\",\"过机场安检时，请把笔记本电脑单独放在一个托盘里。\"]],\"accumulate\":[[\"Dust had <b>accumulated</b> on the shelves of the empty house over the years.\",\"多年下来，空房子里的架子上积满了灰尘。\"],[\"If you <b>accumulate</b> small savings every week, they grow into a surprising sum.\",\"如果你每周积累一点小储蓄，它们会累积成一笔可观的数目。\"]],\"attachment\":[[\"I forgot to include the <b>attachment</b>, so the email arrived without the report.\",\"我忘了加附件，所以那封邮件里没有报告。\"],[\"The vacuum cleaner comes with an <b>attachment</b> for cleaning stairs and furniture.\",\"这台吸尘器配有一个用于清洁楼梯和家具的附件。\"]],\"turtle\":[[\"A green sea <b>turtle</b> can live for more than eighty years and return to the same beach to lay its eggs.\",\"一只绿海龟能活八十多年，还会回到同一片海滩产卵。\"],[\"Volunteers guard the beach at night so that poachers cannot steal the <b>turtles'</b> eggs.\",\"志愿者们夜里守在海滩上，防止偷猎者偷走海龟的蛋。\"]],\"workshop\":[[\"The writing <b>workshop</b> meets on Thursdays, and each member brings a short piece to discuss.\",\"这个写作工作坊每周四聚会，每位成员带一篇短作来讨论。\"],[\"Local potters ran a weekend <b>workshop</b> teaching children how to shape clay on a wheel.\",\"当地陶艺家办了一个周末工作坊，教孩子们在拉坯机上塑形陶土。\"]],\"askew\":[[\"The picture on the wall was slightly <b>askew</b>, so she straightened it.\",\"墙上的画有点歪斜，她把它扶正了。\"],[\"His tie hung <b>askew</b> after the long, tiring journey.\",\"经过漫长疲惫的旅途，他的领带歪斜地挂着。\"]],\"appealing\":[[\"The idea of spending a year travelling before university is very <b>appealing</b> to many school leavers.\",\"上大学前先旅行一年的想法，对许多中学毕业生很有吸引力。\"],[\"The cottage has an <b>appealing</b> garden full of herbs and old roses.\",\"这间小屋有一座有吸引力的花园，种满了香草和古老的玫瑰。\"]],\"obvious\":[[\"It was <b>obvious</b> from her smile that she had passed the exam.\",\"从她的笑容就能明显看出，她通过了考试。\"],[\"The most <b>obvious</b> solution — repairing the old bridge — was also the cheapest.\",\"最明显的办法——修好旧桥——同时也是最便宜的。\"]],\"defendant\":[[\"The <b>defendant</b> remained silent while the witness described the night of the crime.\",\"证人描述案发当晚的情形时，被告一直保持沉默。\"],[\"The judge reminded the <b>defendant</b> that he had the right to a lawyer.\",\"法官提醒被告，他有权请律师。\"]],\"embassy\":[[\"He queued outside the <b>embassy</b> early in the morning to apply for a visa.\",\"他一大早就去大使馆外排队申请签证。\"],[\"The <b>embassy</b> advised its citizens to leave the country while flights were still running.\",\"大使馆建议本国公民趁航班还在运行尽快离境。\"]],\"lemon\":[[\"She squeezed half a <b>lemon</b> into the salad dressing to sharpen its flavour.\",\"她把半个柠檬挤进沙拉酱里，让味道更清爽。\"],[\"A hot drink of <b>lemon</b> and honey is a popular home remedy for a sore throat.\",\"柠檬蜂蜜热饮是治疗喉咙痛的常见家庭偏方。\"]],\"ethic\":[[\"The doctor's <b>ethic</b> is simple: the patient's welfare always comes first.\",\"这位医生的伦理很简单：病人的福祉永远排在第一位。\"],[\"A strong work <b>ethic</b> made her the first to arrive and the last to leave the office.\",\"强烈的职业伦理让她总是第一个到办公室、最后一个离开。\"]],\"aspiration\":[[\"Her <b>aspiration</b> is to become the first doctor in her village's history.\",\"她的抱负是成为村里有史以来第一位医生。\"],[\"The speech spoke to young people's <b>aspirations</b> for cleaner cities and fairer jobs.\",\"这场演讲说出了年轻人对更清洁的城市和更公平工作的抱负。\"]],\"emergency\":[[\"He was rushed to <b>emergency</b> with a broken leg after falling off the ladder.\",\"他从梯子上摔下来摔断了腿，被紧急送往急诊。\"],[\"The hospital's <b>emergency</b> department treated dozens of people after the storm.\",\"暴风雨过后，这家医院的急诊科救治了几十个人。\"]],\"attractive\":[[\"The old town is an <b>attractive</b> place, with narrow streets and a lively market square.\",\"这座老城是个迷人的地方，有狭窄的街道和热闹的市场广场。\"],[\"The job offers an <b>attractive</b> salary and four weeks of holiday a year.\",\"这份工作提供有吸引力的薪水和每年四周的假期。\"]],\"management\":[[\"Good time <b>management</b> is the skill most new university students struggle to learn.\",\"良好的时间管理是大多数大学新生最难学会的技能。\"],[\"The hotel is under new <b>management</b> and has been completely redecorated.\",\"这家酒店换了新的管理方，已经全面重新装修。\"]],\"amateur\":[[\"He is an <b>amateur</b> astronomer who built his own telescope from spare parts.\",\"他是一名业余天文学爱好者，用零部件自己组装了一台望远镜。\"],[\"The concert was given by an <b>amateur</b> choir, but the singing was excellent.\",\"这场音乐会由一支业余合唱团演出，但歌声非常出色。\"]],\"potential\":[[\"The drug shows <b>potential</b> side effects that must be checked in larger trials.\",\"这种药物显示出潜在的副作用，必须在更大规模的试验中检验。\"],[\"There is a <b>potential</b> problem with building so close to the river: flooding.\",\"在离河这么近的地方建房有一个潜在的问题：洪水。\"]],\"ash\":[[\"After the fire, the wooden house was reduced to a pile of grey <b>ash</b>.\",\"大火之后，这座木屋只剩下一堆灰烬。\"],[\"Volcanic <b>ash</b> covered the cars and rooftops of the town like grey snow.\",\"火山灰像灰色的雪一样覆盖了小镇的汽车和屋顶。\"]],\"blacklist\":[[\"The site was <b>blacklisted</b> after it was found to be spreading computer viruses.\",\"这个网站被发现传播电脑病毒后，被列入了黑名单。\"],[\"Drivers who cause serious accidents can be <b>blacklisted</b> by insurance companies.\",\"造成严重事故的司机可能被保险公司列入黑名单。\"]],\"asthma\":[[\"Cold air can trigger an <b>asthma</b> attack in some children.\",\"冷空气会诱发一些儿童的哮喘发作。\"],[\"She always carries an inhaler because her <b>asthma</b> can flare up without warning.\",\"她总是随身带吸入器，因为她的哮喘可能毫无征兆地发作。\"]],\"root\":[[\"The tree's <b>roots</b> spread far underground in search of water.\",\"这棵树的根在地下伸展得很远，寻找水源。\"],[\"A dentist may have to treat the <b>root</b> of a tooth if the decay reaches deep inside.\",\"如果蛀牙深入内部，牙医可能需要处理牙根。\"]],\"affect\":[[\"The drought will <b>affect</b> farmers across the whole region, not just in one valley.\",\"这场干旱将影响整个地区的农民，不只是一个山谷。\"],[\"How much sleep you get can <b>affect</b> your memory the next day.\",\"睡眠多少会影响你第二天的记忆力。\"]],\"depression\":[[\"She sought help for <b>depression</b> after months of low mood and poor sleep.\",\"在情绪低落、睡眠不佳数月后，她为抑郁症寻求了帮助。\"],[\"Exercise and regular routines are often recommended alongside treatment for <b>depression</b>.\",\"运动和规律作息常被推荐作为抑郁症治疗的辅助手段。\"]],\"jaw\":[[\"The boxer took a hard punch to the <b>jaw</b> in the final round.\",\"这位拳击手在最后一回合下颌挨了重重一拳。\"],[\"Fossils of the creature's <b>jaw</b> show teeth adapted for crushing shellfish.\",\"这种生物颌的化石显示，它的牙齿适合压碎贝类。\"]],\"coherent\":[[\"After three drafts, her argument finally became <b>coherent</b> and persuasive.\",\"改了三稿之后，她的论证终于变得连贯且有说服力。\"],[\"He was too tired to give a <b>coherent</b> account of what had happened.\",\"他太累了，无法连贯地讲述发生了什么。\"]],\"bequeath\":[[\"In her will, she <b>bequeathed</b> her library of rare books to the university.\",\"她在遗嘱中把自己收藏的珍本书库遗赠给了这所大学。\"],[\"The old farmer <b>bequeathed</b> the farm to his youngest daughter.\",\"老农夫把农场遗赠给了小女儿。\"]],\"inevitable\":[[\"With both engines failing, a crash landing became <b>inevitable</b>.\",\"由于两个引擎都出现故障，迫降成了必然的结果。\"],[\"Change is <b>inevitable</b> as a city grows; the question is how it is managed.\",\"城市成长时变化是必然的，问题在于如何管理这种变化。\"]],\"assert\":[[\"The report <b>asserts</b> that the painting is genuine, but several experts disagree.\",\"这份报告断言这幅画是真品，但几位专家并不同意。\"],[\"She <b>asserted</b> her right to see the documents before signing anything.\",\"她在签署任何文件前，坚决主张自己有权查看这些文件。\"]],\"mend\":[[\"He learned to <b>mend</b> fishing nets from his grandfather on the harbour wall.\",\"他在码头墙上跟祖父学会了修补渔网。\"],[\"It took them years to <b>mend</b> their friendship after the argument.\",\"那场争吵之后，他们花了好几年才修复友谊。\"]],\"ring\":[[\"He gave her a gold <b>ring</b> set with a single small diamond.\",\"他送给她一枚镶着一颗小钻石的金戒指。\"],[\"Traditionally, wedding <b>rings</b> are worn on the fourth finger of the left hand.\",\"按照传统，结婚戒指戴在左手的无名指上。\"]],\"lava\":[[\"Rivers of glowing <b>lava</b> flowed down the volcano's slopes towards the sea.\",\"炽热的熔岩如河流般顺着火山坡流向大海。\"],[\"Once the <b>lava</b> cools and hardens, it forms black rock full of tiny holes.\",\"熔岩冷却凝固后，会形成布满小孔的黑色岩石。\"]],\"reinforcement\":[[\"Teachers use praise as positive <b>reinforcement</b> to encourage good behaviour.\",\"老师用表扬作为正强化，来鼓励良好的行为。\"],[\"In the experiment, food served as <b>reinforcement</b>, so the pigeons learned to peck the key faster.\",\"在这个实验中，食物起到了强化作用，鸽子因此更快学会了啄按键。\"]],\"opera\":[[\"The <b>opera</b> tells the story of a young soldier who falls in love during a war.\",\"这部歌剧讲述了一名年轻士兵在战争中坠入爱河的故事。\"],[\"She sang in the chorus of the local <b>opera</b> company for five seasons.\",\"她在当地歌剧团的合唱团唱了五季。\"]],\"journal\":[[\"Her study was published in a leading medical <b>journal</b> last month.\",\"她的研究上个月发表在一家顶尖的医学期刊上。\"],[\"He submitted the paper to three <b>journals</b> before it was finally accepted.\",\"这篇论文他投了三家期刊才终于被接收。\"]],\"attendant\":[[\"The flight <b>attendant</b> showed passengers how to fasten their seat belts.\",\"乘务员（空乘服务员）向乘客演示了如何系好安全带。\"],[\"A museum <b>attendant</b> reminded visitors not to touch the paintings.\",\"一位博物馆服务员提醒参观者不要触摸画作。\"]],\"esteem\":[[\"The scientist is held in high <b>esteem</b> by colleagues around the world.\",\"这位科学家受到世界各地同行的高度尊重。\"],[\"Winning the award greatly raised the young writer's <b>esteem</b> among critics.\",\"获奖大大提高了这位年轻作家在评论界赢得的尊重。\"]],\"suit\":[[\"He wore a dark <b>suit</b> and tie to his sister's wedding.\",\"他穿着深色西装、打着领带去参加姐姐的婚礼。\"],[\"The shop sells two-piece <b>suits</b> for under two hundred pounds.\",\"这家店卖两百英镑以内的两件套西装。\"]],\"sociology\":[[\"<b>Sociology</b> looks at how families, schools and workplaces shape people's behaviour.\",\"社会学研究家庭、学校和职场如何塑造人的行为。\"],[\"She switched from history to <b>sociology</b> after a course on urban communities.\",\"上了一门关于城市社区的课后，她从历史转到了社会学。\"]],\"shop\":[[\"There is a small <b>shop</b> on the corner that sells bread, milk and newspapers.\",\"街角有一家小店，卖面包、牛奶和报纸。\"],[\"His grandfather ran a bicycle repair <b>shop</b> for forty years.\",\"他的祖父经营了一家自行车修理小店，长达四十年。\"]],\"wedding\":[[\"Their <b>wedding</b> took place in a small church overlooking the sea.\",\"他们的婚礼在一座俯瞰大海的小教堂里举行。\"],[\"She baked the three-tier <b>wedding</b> cake herself.\",\"那个三层婚礼蛋糕是她亲手烤的。\"]],\"assignment\":[[\"The <b>assignment</b> for this week is to write a two-page summary of the chapter.\",\"这周的作业是写一篇两页的章节摘要。\"],[\"He finished the photography <b>assignment</b> by taking pictures at the harbour at dawn.\",\"他通过在拂晓时去港口拍照，完成了摄影作业。\"]],\"plain\":[[\"Herds of zebra graze on the open <b>plain</b>, where they can spot lions from far away.\",\"斑马群在开阔的平原上吃草，在那里可以老远就发现狮子。\"],[\"The railway crosses a flat, treeless <b>plain</b> for nearly two hundred kilometres.\",\"这条铁路穿越一片平坦、无树的平原，长近二百公里。\"]],\"appreciate\":[[\"Visitors stood quietly to <b>appreciate</b> the paintings in the small gallery.\",\"参观者静静地站在小画廊里欣赏这些画作。\"],[\"You need some knowledge of harmony to fully <b>appreciate</b> this composer's music.\",\"要充分欣赏这位作曲家的音乐，需要一些和声方面的知识。\"]],\"tone\":[[\"The photograph uses warm <b>tones</b> of gold and brown to suggest late autumn.\",\"这张照片运用金色和棕色的暖色调来表现深秋。\"],[\"By slightly changing the <b>tone</b> of the paint, the artist made the wall look sunlit.\",\"画家稍稍改变了颜料的色调，就让这面墙看起来像被阳光照着。\"]],\"altitude\":[[\"At an <b>altitude</b> of 3,000 metres, many visitors feel short of breath.\",\"在海拔3000米的地方，许多游客会感到呼吸急促。\"],[\"The plane climbed to its cruising <b>altitude</b> of ten thousand metres.\",\"飞机爬升到了它一万米的巡航高度（海拔）。\"]],\"drill\":[[\"He used a power <b>drill</b> to bore a hole through the brick wall.\",\"他用电钻在砖墙上打了一个孔。\"],[\"A dentist's <b>drill</b> spins thousands of times a minute to remove decayed tooth.\",\"牙医的钻机每分钟旋转数千次，以去除蛀牙部分。\"]],\"badminton\":[[\"They play <b>badminton</b> at the sports centre every Wednesday evening.\",\"他们每周三晚上在体育中心打羽毛球。\"],[\"In <b>badminton</b>, the shuttlecock must cross the net without touching the ground.\",\"在羽毛球运动中，羽毛球必须过网且不能落地。\"]],\"investigate\":[[\"Police are <b>investigating</b> the cause of the fire that destroyed the warehouse.\",\"警方正在调查这场烧毁仓库的大火的起因。\"],[\"The committee will <b>investigate</b> why the bridge project went so far over budget.\",\"委员会将调查这座桥的工程为什么严重超支。\"]],\"encroachment\":[[\"The <b>encroachment</b> of farmland into the forest has destroyed the birds' nesting sites.\",\"农田对森林的侵占破坏了鸟类的筑巢地。\"],[\"Residents complained about the <b>encroachment</b> of new buildings onto the public beach.\",\"居民们抱怨新建筑侵占公共海滩。\"]],\"eyelid\":[[\"A speck of dust got under her <b>eyelid</b> and made her eye water.\",\"一粒灰尘钻进了她的眼皮底下，让她直流眼泪。\"],[\"His <b>eyelids</b> grew heavy as the long lecture went on.\",\"冗长的讲座进行着，他的眼皮越来越沉。\"]],\"aperture\":[[\"A wider <b>aperture</b> lets more light into the camera, which is useful indoors.\",\"更大的孔径能让更多光线进入相机，在室内拍照时很有用。\"],[\"Photographers adjust the <b>aperture</b> to control how much of the scene is in sharp focus.\",\"摄影师通过调节光圈（孔径）来控制画面中有多少部分清晰对焦。\"]],\"herd\":[[\"A <b>herd</b> of cattle gathered at the river to drink in the late afternoon.\",\"傍晚时分，一群牛聚集在河边喝水。\"],[\"The herder moves his <b>herd</b> of goats to higher pastures in summer.\",\"牧人夏天把他的羊群（兽群）赶到更高的牧场。\"]],\"boiling\":[[\"The water is <b>boiling</b>, so you can add the pasta now.\",\"水已经沸腾了，现在可以下面条了。\"],[\"She poured the <b>boiling</b> water over the tea leaves and waited three minutes.\",\"她把沸腾的水浇在茶叶上，等了三分钟。\"]],\"violin\":[[\"She started learning the <b>violin</b> at the age of five and now plays in an orchestra.\",\"她五岁开始学小提琴，现在在交响乐团里演奏。\"],[\"The <b>violin</b> section sits at the front left of the orchestra, closest to the audience.\",\"小提琴声部位于乐团左前方，离观众最近。\"]],\"scribe\":[[\"In ancient Egypt, a <b>scribe</b> recorded taxes and harvests on rolls of papyrus.\",\"在古埃及，抄写员把税收和收成记录在纸莎草卷上。\"],[\"Before printing, every copy of a book had to be written out by a <b>scribe</b>.\",\"印刷术出现之前，每一份书稿都得由抄写员手写出来。\"]],\"electric\":[[\"The city is replacing its diesel buses with <b>electric</b> ones to cut air pollution.\",\"该市正在用电动巴士替换柴油巴士，以减少空气污染。\"],[\"An <b>electric</b> kettle boils water much faster than a pot on the stove.\",\"电水壶烧水比炉子上的锅快得多。\"]],\"turkey\":[[\"They roasted a large <b>turkey</b> for the family's holiday dinner.\",\"他们为家庭节日晚餐烤了一只大火鸡。\"],[\"Wild <b>turkeys</b> can fly short distances despite their heavy bodies.\",\"野生火鸡尽管身体沉重，却能飞很短的距离。\"]],\"algebra\":[[\"In <b>algebra</b>, letters such as x and y stand for numbers whose values may be unknown.\",\"在代数中，x和y这样的字母代表数值可能未知的数。\"],[\"She found <b>algebra</b> easier than geometry because she liked solving equations.\",\"她觉得代数比几何容易，因为她喜欢解方程。\"]],\"cockroach\":[[\"A <b>cockroach</b> darted across the kitchen floor and vanished under the fridge.\",\"一只蟑螂蹿过厨房地板，消失在冰箱底下。\"],[\"<b>Cockroaches</b> can survive for weeks without food, which makes them hard to get rid of.\",\"蟑螂几周不吃东西也能存活，所以很难清除。\"]],\"trait\":[[\"Patience is a <b>trait</b> that every good primary-school teacher needs.\",\"耐心是每位优秀小学老师都需要具备的特质。\"],[\"Eye colour is an inherited <b>trait</b> passed from parents to children.\",\"眼睛的颜色是一种由父母传给子女的遗传特质。\"]],\"cocoa\":[[\"She made two mugs of hot <b>cocoa</b> for the children after they came in from the snow.\",\"孩子们从雪地里回来后，她给他们冲了两杯热可可。\"],[\"<b>Cocoa</b> beans are dried and roasted before they are turned into chocolate.\",\"可可豆先要晒干烘烤，然后才能制成巧克力。\"]],\"revolution\":[[\"One complete <b>revolution</b> of the Earth around the Sun takes about 365 days.\",\"地球绕太阳一整圈公转大约需要365天。\"],[\"Because the Moon's rotation matches its <b>revolution</b> around Earth, we always see the same side of it.\",\"由于月球的自转与其绕地球的公转同步，我们总是只看到它的同一面。\"]],\"bargain\":[[\"At the market, she <b>bargained</b> with the carpet seller for nearly twenty minutes before agreeing on a price.\",\"在市场上，她和地毯商贩讨价还价了近二十分钟才谈定价格。\"],[\"Tourists are expected to <b>bargain</b> in this bazaar; the first price is rarely the final one.\",\"在这个集市里，游客讨价还价是惯例，第一次开价很少是最终价。\"]],\"gulf\":[[\"The Mississippi River flows into the <b>Gulf</b> of Mexico near New Orleans.\",\"密西西比河在新奥尔良附近注入墨西哥湾（海湾）。\"],[\"Warm water from the <b>gulf</b> feeds the hurricanes that form there each summer.\",\"这个海湾的暖水为每年夏天在那里形成的飓风提供能量。\"]],\"swimming\":[[\"<b>Swimming</b> is excellent exercise because it uses almost every muscle group.\",\"游泳是极好的运动，因为它能锻炼到几乎每一组肌肉。\"],[\"The lake is not safe for <b>swimming</b> after heavy rain, when bacteria levels rise.\",\"大雨之后这片湖不适合游泳，因为细菌含量会升高。\"]],\"agenda\":[[\"The first item on the <b>agenda</b> is the budget for next year's repairs.\",\"议程的第一项是明年的维修预算。\"],[\"She checked the meeting <b>agenda</b> to see when her proposal would be discussed.\",\"她查看了会议议程，想知道自己的提案什么时候讨论。\"]],\"scarf\":[[\"She wrapped a thick wool <b>scarf</b> around her neck before going out into the snow.\",\"出门走进雪地前，她在脖子上围了一条厚羊毛围巾。\"],[\"His red <b>scarf</b> made him easy to spot in the crowded station.\",\"他的红色围巾让他在拥挤的车站里很容易被认出来。\"]],\"awful\":[[\"The weather was <b>awful</b> all week: cold rain and a biting wind.\",\"这一周天气可怕极了：又冷又下雨，风刮得刺骨。\"],[\"He felt <b>awful</b> about forgetting his mother's birthday.\",\"他忘记了母亲的生日，心里觉得非常糟糕。\"]],\"affection\":[[\"She showed her <b>affection</b> for her grandfather by visiting him every weekend.\",\"她每周末都去看望祖父，以此表达对他的感情。\"],[\"The old dog greeted its owner with obvious <b>affection</b>, wagging its tail wildly.\",\"这条老狗明显满怀感情地迎接主人，尾巴摇个不停。\"]],\"seagull\":[[\"A <b>seagull</b> swooped down and stole a chip straight from his hand.\",\"一只海鸥俯冲下来，直接从他手里抢走了一条薯条。\"],[\"<b>Seagulls</b> circled above the fishing boats, waiting for scraps.\",\"海鸥在渔船上空盘旋，等着捡些碎食。\"]],\"erasure\":[[\"Constant <b>erasure</b> had worn a hole in the page where the date had been changed five times.\",\"由于反复擦除，日期被改了五次的那处纸面磨破了一个洞。\"],[\"The editor noticed the <b>erasure</b> of a whole paragraph in the original manuscript.\",\"编辑注意到原稿中有一整段被擦除的痕迹。\"]],\"oil\":[[\"The portrait is painted in <b>oils</b>, which allow the artist to blend colours slowly.\",\"这幅肖像是用油画颜料画的，油料能让画家慢慢调和颜色。\"],[\"In the gallery, an <b>oil</b> painting of the harbour at sunset drew the biggest crowd.\",\"画廊里，一幅描绘日落时海港的油画吸引了最多观众。\"]],\"baker\":[[\"The <b>baker</b> starts work at three in the morning so that the bread is ready by seven.\",\"面包师凌晨三点就开始工作，好让面包在七点时出炉。\"],[\"Our local <b>baker</b> makes the sourdough loaves that the whole street queues for.\",\"我们本地的面包师做的酸面团面包，整条街的人都排队买。\"]],\"stanza\":[[\"The poem is divided into six <b>stanzas</b> of four lines each.\",\"这首诗分成六个诗节，每节四行。\"],[\"In the final <b>stanza</b>, the poet returns to the image of the river from the opening lines.\",\"在最后一个诗节里，诗人回到了开头诗行中河流的意象。\"]],\"manual\":[[\"Before using the washing machine, read the safety warnings in the <b>manual</b>.\",\"使用洗衣机前，先读手册里的安全警告。\"],[\"The car comes with a thick owner's <b>manual</b> explaining every dashboard light.\",\"这辆车附带一本厚厚的车主手册，解释仪表盘上的每一个指示灯。\"]],\"assault\":[[\"The newspaper reported an <b>assault</b> on a shopkeeper in the town centre.\",\"报纸报道了镇中心一起袭击店主的事件。\"],[\"Police charged the man with <b>assault</b> after the fight outside the stadium.\",\"体育场外的斗殴之后，警方以袭击罪起诉了这名男子。\"]],\"chunk\":[[\"He broke the ice into <b>chunks</b> and dropped them into the water jugs.\",\"他把冰敲成大块，放进水壶里。\"],[\"She cut the pumpkin into large <b>chunks</b> before roasting them with herbs.\",\"她把南瓜切成大块，再和香草一起烤。\"]],\"exhibit\":[[\"The <b>exhibit</b> includes a full-size model of a blue whale hanging from the ceiling.\",\"这次展览包括一个悬挂在天花板上的蓝鲸全尺寸模型。\"],[\"Photographs from the expedition will be on <b>exhibit</b> at the natural history museum until March.\",\"这次远征的照片将在自然历史博物馆展出到三月。\"]],\"statute\":[[\"Under the new <b>statute</b>, companies must report chemical spills within twenty-four hours.\",\"根据这项新法令，公司必须在二十四小时内上报化学品泄漏。\"],[\"The <b>statute</b> was passed by parliament in 1998 and has been amended twice since.\",\"这项法令于1998年由议会通过，此后修改过两次。\"]],\"wheel\":[[\"The invention of the <b>wheel</b> allowed people to move heavy loads over long distances for the first time.\",\"轮子的发明使人们第一次能把重物运送到很远的地方。\"],[\"Early <b>wheels</b> were solid wooden discs; spokes came much later.\",\"早期的轮子是实心木盘，轮辐是后来才出现的。\"]],\"capacity\":[[\"The hard drive has a storage <b>capacity</b> of two terabytes, enough for hundreds of films.\",\"这块硬盘的存储容量是2TB，足够装几百部电影。\"],[\"This measuring jug has a <b>capacity</b> of exactly one litre.\",\"这个量杯的容量正好是一升。\"]],\"duke\":[[\"The <b>duke</b> owned most of the farmland in the county and lived in a house with sixty rooms.\",\"这位公爵拥有该郡大部分农田，住在一座有六十个房间的宅邸里。\"],[\"In the play, the <b>duke</b> disguises himself as a friar to observe his city unnoticed.\",\"在剧中，公爵装扮成修道士，以便不被人注意地观察他的城市。\"]],\"carpenter\":[[\"The <b>carpenter</b> built a set of shelves that fit exactly into the alcove.\",\"木匠做了一组正好嵌入壁龛的架子。\"],[\"As a <b>carpenter</b>, he can read a building plan and turn it into furniture within days.\",\"作为木匠，他能看懂建筑图纸，并在几天内把它做成家具。\"]],\"broccoli\":[[\"Steamed <b>broccoli</b> keeps more of its vitamin C than broccoli boiled for a long time.\",\"蒸西兰花比久煮的西兰花能保留更多的维生素C。\"],[\"She planted rows of <b>broccoli</b> in the vegetable garden behind the house.\",\"她在屋后的菜园里种了一排排西兰花。\"]],\"custody\":[[\"The suspect is being held in police <b>custody</b> while detectives continue their questioning.\",\"嫌疑人被警方拘留，侦探们继续对他进行讯问。\"],[\"He was taken into <b>custody</b> at the airport and released the following morning.\",\"他在机场被拘留，第二天早上获释。\"]],\"cake\":[[\"For his birthday she baked a chocolate <b>cake</b> with seven candles.\",\"他生日时，她烤了一个插着七根蜡烛的巧克力蛋糕。\"],[\"Would you like another slice of <b>cake</b> with your tea?\",\"你想再来一块蛋糕配茶吗？\"]],\"kingdom\":[[\"The <b>kingdom</b> was ruled by the same family for over three hundred years.\",\"这个王国由同一个家族统治了三百多年。\"],[\"In the story, a young shepherd becomes king of a small mountain <b>kingdom</b>.\",\"故事里，一名年轻牧羊人成了山地小王国的国王。\"]],\"breed\":[[\"Farmers <b>breed</b> these cattle for their milk rather than their meat.\",\"农民繁育这种牛是为了产奶而不是产肉。\"],[\"Mosquitoes <b>breed</b> in standing water, so empty any buckets left outside.\",\"蚊子在静水中繁殖，所以要倒掉留在户外的水桶里的水。\"]],\"belly\":[[\"The cat rolled onto its back and showed its white <b>belly</b>.\",\"猫翻了个身，露出白色的腹部（肚皮）。\"],[\"He slid down the hill on his <b>belly</b>, like a penguin on ice.\",\"他像冰面上的企鹅一样，趴着用肚子滑下了山坡。\"]],\"aftermath\":[[\"In the <b>aftermath</b> of the earthquake, rescue teams searched the ruins for survivors.\",\"地震过后，在其余波之中，救援队在废墟中搜寻幸存者。\"],[\"The economic <b>aftermath</b> of the war lasted for more than a decade.\",\"这场战争的经济余波持续了十多年。\"]],\"creature\":[[\"The deep sea is home to <b>creatures</b> that glow in complete darkness.\",\"深海中生活着能在完全黑暗中发光的生物。\"],[\"A tiny <b>creature</b> with eight legs was crawling across the microscope slide.\",\"一只长着八条腿的小生物正在显微镜载玻片上爬行。\"]],\"tuna\":[[\"A bluefin <b>tuna</b> can weigh over 300 kilograms and swim as fast as a racehorse runs.\",\"一条蓝鳍金枪鱼体重可超过300公斤，游速可与赛马奔跑相当。\"],[\"She opened a tin of <b>tuna</b> and mixed it with mayonnaise for the sandwiches.\",\"她打开一罐金枪鱼罐头，和蛋黄酱拌在一起做三明治。\"]],\"hostel\":[[\"They stayed in a youth <b>hostel</b> in the mountains, sharing a dormitory with six other hikers.\",\"他们住在山里的一家青年旅馆，与另外六名徒步者同住一间宿舍。\"],[\"The <b>hostel</b> charges very little and provides a simple breakfast of bread and coffee.\",\"这家青年旅馆收费很低，还提供面包和咖啡组成的简单早餐。\"]],\"altruism\":[[\"True <b>altruism</b> means helping others without expecting anything in return.\",\"真正的利他主义意味着帮助他人而不求回报。\"],[\"Biologists debate whether pure <b>altruism</b> exists in animal behaviour.\",\"生物学家在争论，动物行为中是否存在纯粹的利他主义。\"]],\"expedition\":[[\"The <b>expedition</b> to Antarctica took two years to plan and lasted a whole summer.\",\"这次南极远征筹备了两年，持续了整个夏天。\"],[\"Members of the <b>expedition</b> collected rock samples from the floor of the valley.\",\"远征队员从谷底采集了岩石样本。\"]],\"marionette\":[[\"The puppeteer made the <b>marionette</b> bow gracefully to the audience.\",\"操纵者让提线木偶优雅地向观众鞠躬。\"],[\"Each <b>marionette</b> in the show is controlled by up to twelve strings.\",\"这场演出中的每个提线木偶都由多达十二根线控制。\"]],\"fisherman\":[[\"The <b>fisherman</b> set out before dawn and returned with his nets full of sardines.\",\"渔民在黎明前出海，回来时渔网里满是沙丁鱼。\"],[\"Generations of <b>fishermen</b> in the village have read the weather from the behaviour of seabirds.\",\"村里几代渔民都靠观察海鸟的行为来判断天气。\"]],\"hit\":[[\"The falling branch <b>hit</b> the roof of the car and dented it badly.\",\"掉落的树枝击打在车顶上，把它砸出一个大坑。\"],[\"He swung the bat and <b>hit</b> the ball clean over the fence.\",\"他挥动球棒，把球干脆利落地击过围栏。\"]],\"ampere\":[[\"The unit of electric current, the <b>ampere</b>, is named after the French physicist André-Marie Ampère.\",\"电流的单位安培，是以法国物理学家安德烈-马里·安培的名字命名的。\"],[\"The circuit is protected by a fuse rated at thirteen <b>amperes</b>.\",\"这条电路由一个额定十三安培的保险丝保护。\"]],\"association\":[[\"In the word game, players write down the first <b>association</b> that a given word brings to mind.\",\"在这个词语游戏里，玩家要写下给定词最先引起的联想。\"],[\"Free <b>association</b> — saying whatever comes into your head — was used by early psychologists to explore the mind.\",\"自由联想——想到什么就说什么——被早期心理学家用来探索内心。\"]],\"god\":[[\"In Greek mythology, Zeus was the king of the <b>gods</b> and ruled from Mount Olympus.\",\"在希腊神话中，宙斯是众神之王，从奥林匹斯山统治。\"],[\"The temple was built to honour a sea <b>god</b> who was believed to protect sailors.\",\"这座神庙是为纪念一位海神而建的，人们相信他能保护水手。\"]],\"motive\":[[\"Police have not yet established a <b>motive</b> for the attack.\",\"警方尚未查明这次袭击的动机。\"],[\"His <b>motive</b> for changing jobs was not money but the chance to work outdoors.\",\"他换工作的动机不是钱，而是能有机会在户外工作。\"]],\"reduction\":[[\"In chemistry, <b>reduction</b> is the gain of electrons, the opposite of oxidation.\",\"在化学中，还原是得到电子，与氧化相反。\"],[\"During <b>reduction</b>, the iron ore loses oxygen and becomes pure iron in the furnace.\",\"在还原过程中，铁矿石在熔炉中失去氧，变成纯铁。\"]],\"kitchen\":[[\"She renovated the <b>kitchen</b>, adding a wide counter where the whole family could cook together.\",\"她翻新了厨房，加了一个宽大的台面，全家人可以一起做饭。\"],[\"Steam from the soup fogged up the <b>kitchen</b> windows.\",\"汤的蒸汽把厨房的窗户蒙上了一层雾。\"]],\"external\":[[\"The <b>external</b> walls of the old house were insulated to reduce heat loss in winter.\",\"这栋老房子的外墙做了保温处理，以减少冬季的热量流失。\"],[\"<b>External</b> factors such as drought, rather than the farmers' methods, caused the poor harvest.\",\"造成收成不佳的是干旱等外部因素，而不是农民的耕作方法。\"]],\"quiz\":[[\"The professor gave a short <b>quiz</b> at the start of class to check whether students had done the reading.\",\"教授在课开始时进行了一次小测验，检查学生是否读了材料。\"],[\"I failed the pop <b>quiz</b> because I had not reviewed the vocabulary.\",\"我突击小测验没及格，因为我没有复习词汇。\"]],\"cartilage\":[[\"<b>Cartilage</b> cushions the ends of bones so that joints can move smoothly.\",\"软骨垫在骨头末端，使关节能够平滑地活动。\"],[\"The shark's skeleton is made of <b>cartilage</b> rather than bone, which makes it lighter and more flexible.\",\"鲨鱼的骨骼由软骨而非硬骨构成，因此更轻、更灵活。\"]],\"incision\":[[\"The surgeon made a small <b>incision</b> just below the rib cage.\",\"外科医生在肋骨下方切了一个小切口。\"],[\"The <b>incision</b> healed within two weeks and left only a faint scar.\",\"切口在两周内愈合，只留下了一道淡淡的疤痕。\"]],\"audacious\":[[\"Her <b>audacious</b> plan to cross the desert alone surprised even experienced explorers.\",\"她独自穿越沙漠的大胆计划连经验丰富的探险家都感到吃惊。\"],[\"The young architect submitted an <b>audacious</b> design that nobody expected the committee to accept.\",\"这位年轻建筑师提交了一个大胆的设计，没人料到委员会会接受。\"]],\"hemoglobin\":[[\"<b>Hemoglobin</b> in red blood cells carries oxygen from the lungs to the rest of the body.\",\"红细胞中的血红蛋白把氧气从肺部运送到身体各处。\"],[\"A low <b>hemoglobin</b> level can cause fatigue because the tissues receive less oxygen.\",\"血红蛋白水平过低会导致疲劳，因为组织获得的氧气减少。\"]],\"analogy\":[[\"The teacher used an <b>analogy</b> between a cell and a factory to explain how organelles work together.\",\"老师用细胞和工厂之间的类比来讲解细胞器如何协同工作。\"],[\"By <b>analogy</b> with the heart, a pump can be said to 'beat' as it pushes fluid through pipes.\",\"与心脏类比，泵在把液体推过管道时也可以说是“跳动”。\"]],\"franchisee\":[[\"As a <b>franchisee</b>, she pays the coffee chain a monthly fee but runs her own shop.\",\"作为加盟商，她每月向这家连锁咖啡店缴纳费用，但经营自己的店铺。\"],[\"The <b>franchisee</b> must follow the company's recipes and opening hours exactly.\",\"加盟商必须严格遵守公司的配方和营业时间。\"]],\"pragmatic\":[[\"The mayor took a <b>pragmatic</b> approach, fixing the bus routes residents used most instead of redesigning the whole system.\",\"市长采取了务实的做法，先修居民用得最多的公交线路，而不是重新设计整个系统。\"],[\"<b>Pragmatic</b> considerations — cost and time — mattered more to the engineers than theoretical elegance.\",\"对工程师来说，成本和时间等实际考虑比理论上的优雅更重要。\"]],\"glasses\":[[\"He took off his <b>glasses</b> and rubbed his tired eyes.\",\"他摘下眼镜，揉了揉疲惫的眼睛。\"],[\"Without her <b>glasses</b>, the words on the board were just a blur.\",\"没有眼镜，黑板上的字只是一片模糊。\"]],\"learning\":[[\"<b>Learning</b> a second language is easier for children, whose brains are still highly flexible.\",\"儿童学习第二语言更容易，因为他们的大脑仍然高度灵活。\"],[\"The study found that sleep after <b>learning</b> helps the brain store new information.\",\"研究发现，学习之后睡眠有助于大脑储存新信息。\"]],\"hat\":[[\"She wore a wide-brimmed <b>hat</b> to protect her face from the desert sun.\",\"她戴了一顶宽檐帽，保护脸不被沙漠的阳光晒伤。\"],[\"The magician pulled a rabbit out of his <b>hat</b>, to the children's delight.\",\"魔术师从帽子里拉出一只兔子，孩子们高兴极了。\"]],\"clutch\":[[\"The child <b>clutched</b> her mother's hand as they crossed the busy street.\",\"过繁忙的街道时，孩子紧紧抓住母亲的手。\"],[\"He <b>clutched</b> the railing to keep from slipping on the icy steps.\",\"他紧抓栏杆，以免在结冰的台阶上滑倒。\"]],\"drum\":[[\"The drummer kept the beat on a large <b>drum</b> made of wood and animal skin.\",\"鼓手在一面由木头和兽皮制成的大鼓上敲出节拍。\"],[\"The hollow <b>drum</b> echoed across the valley when the ceremony began.\",\"仪式开始时，空心鼓的声音在山谷中回荡。\"]],\"overseas\":[[\"The company sells most of its products <b>overseas</b>, especially in Europe and Southeast Asia.\",\"这家公司的大部分产品销往海外，尤其是欧洲和东南亚。\"],[\"She studied <b>overseas</b> for a year and returned with fluent Spanish.\",\"她在海外学习了一年，回来时西班牙语已经很流利。\"]],\"merchant\":[[\"The <b>merchant</b> travelled along the Silk Road, selling silk and spices in distant cities.\",\"这位商人沿着丝绸之路旅行，在遥远的城市出售丝绸和香料。\"],[\"Local <b>merchants</b> complained that the new mall was taking away their customers.\",\"当地商人抱怨说，新商场抢走了他们的顾客。\"]],\"millipede\":[[\"Despite its name, a <b>millipede</b> does not really have a thousand legs — most species have a few hundred.\",\"尽管名字叫千足虫，千足虫其实并没有一千条腿——大多数种类只有几百条。\"],[\"The <b>millipede</b> curled into a tight spiral when the bird approached.\",\"鸟靠近时，千足虫蜷缩成一个紧紧的螺旋。\"]],\"reform\":[[\"The government introduced a <b>reform</b> of the tax system to help small businesses.\",\"政府推行税制改革，以帮助小企业。\"],[\"The new law <b>reformed</b> the way elections were financed.\",\"新法律改革了选举经费的筹集方式。\"]],\"archery\":[[\"In <b>archery</b>, steady breathing matters as much as a strong arm.\",\"在射箭中，平稳的呼吸和有力的手臂同样重要。\"],[\"She won a gold medal in <b>archery</b> at the national games.\",\"她在全国运动会上赢得了射箭金牌。\"]],\"belie\":[[\"His calm expression <b>belied</b> the nervousness he actually felt before the interview.\",\"他平静的表情掩饰了他面试前实际感到的紧张。\"],[\"The building's plain exterior <b>belies</b> the luxury inside.\",\"这栋建筑朴素的外表掩盖了内部的奢华。\"]],\"karate\":[[\"He has practised <b>karate</b> since he was six and now holds a black belt.\",\"他从六岁起练习空手道，现在已经是黑带。\"],[\"<b>Karate</b> emphasises discipline and respect as much as fighting technique.\",\"空手道强调纪律和尊重，与格斗技巧同样重要。\"]],\"badge\":[[\"The officer wore a silver <b>badge</b> on her chest with her number on it.\",\"这名警官胸前佩戴着一枚银色徽章，上面有她的编号。\"],[\"Conference staff <b>badged</b> every visitor before allowing them into the hall.\",\"会议工作人员给每位访客佩戴标记徽章后才允许他们进入大厅。\"]],\"assure\":[[\"The guide <b>assured</b> the hikers that the trail was safe after the storm.\",\"向导向徒步者保证，暴风雨后这条小路是安全的。\"],[\"I can <b>assure</b> you that the results will be announced on Friday.\",\"我可以向你保证，结果将在周五公布。\"]],\"microscope\":[[\"Under the <b>microscope</b>, the drop of pond water was full of tiny moving organisms.\",\"在显微镜下，这滴池塘水里满是微小的活动生物。\"],[\"The <b>microscope</b> allowed scientists to see bacteria for the first time in the seventeenth century.\",\"显微镜使科学家在十七世纪第一次看到了细菌。\"]],\"jungle\":[[\"The <b>jungle</b> was so dense that sunlight barely reached the ground.\",\"丛林非常茂密，阳光几乎照不到地面。\"],[\"Monkeys swung through the <b>jungle</b> canopy above the researchers' camp.\",\"猴子在研究人员营地上方的丛林树冠层中荡来荡去。\"]],\"plug\":[[\"He pulled the <b>plug</b> out of the socket before repairing the lamp.\",\"修台灯之前，他把插头从插座里拔了出来。\"],[\"The <b>plug</b> on this charger does not fit European outlets.\",\"这个充电器的插头不适合欧洲的插座。\"]],\"stare\":[[\"The child <b>stared</b> at the painting, fascinated by its bright colours.\",\"孩子凝视着这幅画，被它鲜艳的色彩迷住了。\"],[\"It is rude to <b>stare</b> at strangers on the train.\",\"在火车上盯着陌生人看是不礼貌的。\"]],\"arrival\":[[\"The <b>arrival</b> of the rainy season ended the long drought.\",\"雨季的到来结束了长期的干旱。\"],[\"Passengers cheered at the <b>arrival</b> of the first train in the new station.\",\"第一列火车抵达新车站时，乘客们欢呼起来。\"]],\"floor\":[[\"The wooden <b>floor</b> creaked as she walked across the old house.\",\"她走过这栋老房子时，木地板嘎吱作响。\"],[\"He dropped the glass, and it shattered on the kitchen <b>floor</b>.\",\"他把杯子掉在地上，杯子在厨房地板上摔碎了。\"]],\"doctrine\":[[\"The church's <b>doctrine</b> was written down in the fourth century and is still taught today.\",\"这间教会的教义在四世纪被记录下来，至今仍在传授。\"],[\"The Truman <b>Doctrine</b> shaped American foreign policy during the Cold War.\",\"杜鲁门主义在冷战期间塑造了美国的外交政策。\"]],\"singing\":[[\"Her <b>singing</b> filled the small hall and moved the audience to tears.\",\"她的歌声充满了小礼堂，感动得观众落泪。\"],[\"<b>Singing</b> in a choir taught him how to breathe properly and listen to others.\",\"在合唱团唱歌教会了他如何正确呼吸和倾听他人。\"]],\"lightning\":[[\"<b>Lightning</b> lit up the whole sky for a second during the storm.\",\"暴风雨中，闪电在一瞬间照亮了整个天空。\"],[\"The old tree was struck by <b>lightning</b> and split in two.\",\"这棵老树被闪电击中，劈成了两半。\"]],\"shield\":[[\"The soldier raised his <b>shield</b> to block the falling arrows.\",\"士兵举起盾牌，挡住落下的箭。\"],[\"In the museum, a bronze <b>shield</b> from the Bronze Age is displayed beside a sword.\",\"博物馆里，一面青铜时代的青铜盾牌陈列在一把剑的旁边。\"]],\"noodle\":[[\"The chef stretched the <b>noodles</b> by hand until they were long and thin.\",\"厨师手工把面条拉得又长又细。\"],[\"Instant <b>noodles</b> are cheap, but they contain a lot of salt.\",\"方便面很便宜，但含盐量很高。\"]],\"arbitrary\":[[\"The border between the two provinces was <b>arbitrary</b>, following no river or mountain range.\",\"两个省之间的边界是任意划定的，没有沿着任何河流或山脉。\"],[\"Students complained that the grading seemed <b>arbitrary</b>, with similar essays receiving very different marks.\",\"学生们抱怨评分似乎很任意，相似的作文得分却相差很大。\"]],\"barber\":[[\"The <b>barber</b> trimmed his beard and cut his hair short for the summer.\",\"理发师修剪了他的胡须，并把他的头发剪短以迎接夏天。\"],[\"He has gone to the same <b>barber</b> for twenty years.\",\"二十年来他一直在同一位理发师那里理发。\"]],\"influence\":[[\"The teacher's <b>influence</b> on her students lasted long after they graduated.\",\"这位老师对学生的影响在他们毕业后很久仍在持续。\"],[\"Climate has a strong <b>influence</b> on what crops farmers can grow.\",\"气候对农民能种什么庄稼有很大影响。\"]],\"endeavor\":[[\"Learning to fly was a difficult but rewarding <b>endeavor</b> for the young pilot.\",\"对这位年轻飞行员来说，学开飞机是一项艰难但值得的努力。\"],[\"The team <b>endeavored</b> to finish the bridge before the rainy season began.\",\"团队努力在雨季开始前完成这座桥。\"]],\"stalk\":[[\"Each <b>stalk</b> of wheat carries dozens of grains at its tip.\",\"每根小麦茎秆的顶端都结着几十粒麦粒。\"],[\"The corn <b>stalks</b> grew taller than the farmer by midsummer.\",\"到了仲夏，玉米秆长得比农民还高。\"]],\"pigment\":[[\"Early artists made <b>pigment</b> by grinding coloured stones into powder.\",\"早期画家通过把彩色石头磨成粉末来制作颜料。\"],[\"This <b>pigment</b> fades quickly in sunlight, so the painting is kept in a dark room.\",\"这种颜料在阳光下褪色很快，所以这幅画被保存在暗室里。\"]],\"range\":[[\"The store sells a wide <b>range</b> of tools, from simple hammers to electric drills.\",\"这家商店出售各种各样的工具，从简单的锤子到电钻都有。\"],[\"Temperatures in the desert <b>range</b> from over forty degrees in the day to near freezing at night.\",\"沙漠的温度范围从白天四十多度到夜晚接近零度。\"]],\"latitude\":[[\"Cities at the same <b>latitude</b> can have very different climates because of ocean currents.\",\"处于同一纬度的城市，由于洋流的影响，气候可能大不相同。\"],[\"The island lies at a <b>latitude</b> of about twenty degrees north.\",\"这座岛屿位于北纬约二十度。\"]],\"consummate\":[[\"The treaty was <b>consummated</b> after years of negotiation between the two countries.\",\"经过两国多年的谈判，这项条约终于签订生效。\"],[\"The merger was <b>consummated</b> in March, creating the largest bank in the region.\",\"这次合并于三月完成，造就了该地区最大的银行。\"]],\"discipline\":[[\"Strict <b>discipline</b> in the laboratory keeps dangerous chemicals from causing accidents.\",\"实验室里严格的纪律防止危险化学品引发事故。\"],[\"The school relaxed its <b>discipline</b> rules, allowing students to choose some of their courses.\",\"这所学校放宽了纪律规定，允许学生自选部分课程。\"]],\"loss\":[[\"The airline reported a heavy <b>loss</b> last year because fuel prices rose sharply.\",\"这家航空公司去年报告了巨额亏损，因为燃油价格大幅上涨。\"],[\"The company cut jobs in an effort to reduce its <b>losses</b>.\",\"公司裁员以努力减少亏损。\"]],\"irrigation\":[[\"<b>Irrigation</b> allowed farmers to grow crops in the dry plains far from any river.\",\"灌溉使农民能在远离河流的干旱平原上种植作物。\"],[\"The ancient Egyptians built <b>irrigation</b> channels to carry Nile water into their fields.\",\"古埃及人修建灌溉渠道，把尼罗河水引入田地。\"]],\"dress\":[[\"She wore a long blue <b>dress</b> to her sister's wedding.\",\"她穿了一条蓝色长连衣裙参加姐姐的婚礼。\"],[\"The <b>dress</b> was made of silk and decorated with small white flowers.\",\"这条连衣裙由丝绸制成，点缀着白色小花。\"]],\"lamp\":[[\"She switched on the desk <b>lamp</b> and began to read.\",\"她打开台灯，开始读书。\"],[\"The <b>lamp</b> by the sofa gives off a warm, soft light.\",\"沙发旁的台灯发出温暖柔和的光。\"]],\"honeydew\":[[\"A ripe <b>honeydew</b> smells sweet and feels slightly soft at the stem end.\",\"成熟的蜜瓜闻起来很甜，瓜蒂一端摸起来微微发软。\"],[\"For dessert we had chilled <b>honeydew</b> with a squeeze of lime.\",\"甜点我们吃了冰镇蜜瓜，挤了一点青柠汁。\"]],\"snowboarding\":[[\"<b>Snowboarding</b> down the steep slope requires balance and courage.\",\"沿陡坡单板滑雪需要平衡和勇气。\"],[\"He took up <b>snowboarding</b> last winter and now goes to the mountains every weekend.\",\"他去年冬天开始玩单板滑雪，现在每个周末都去山里。\"]],\"enactment\":[[\"After the <b>enactment</b> of the clean air law, factory emissions fell sharply.\",\"《清洁空气法》制定颁布后，工厂排放大幅下降。\"],[\"The <b>enactment</b> of the treaty required approval from both parliaments.\",\"这项条约的制定需要两国议会的批准。\"]],\"breast\":[[\"The doctor explained how regular screening can detect <b>breast</b> cancer early.\",\"医生解释了定期筛查如何能早期发现乳腺癌。\"],[\"Any lump found in the <b>breast</b> should be checked by a doctor without delay.\",\"在乳房中发现的任何肿块都应立即由医生检查。\"]],\"autograph\":[[\"Fans waited for hours to get the singer's <b>autograph</b>.\",\"粉丝们等了几个小时，就为了得到这位歌手的亲笔签名。\"],[\"The book's first page bore the author's <b>autograph</b> in blue ink.\",\"这本书的第一页上有作者用蓝墨水写的亲笔签名。\"]],\"octopus\":[[\"An <b>octopus</b> can squeeze through any opening larger than its beak.\",\"章鱼能挤过任何比它的喙大的开口。\"],[\"The <b>octopus</b> changed colour to match the rocks and disappeared from view.\",\"章鱼改变颜色与岩石融为一体，从视线中消失了。\"]],\"blizzard\":[[\"The <b>blizzard</b> closed the airport and left thousands of passengers stranded.\",\"暴风雪导致机场关闭，数千名乘客滞留。\"],[\"During the <b>blizzard</b>, visibility fell to less than ten metres.\",\"暴风雪期间，能见度降到不到十米。\"]],\"composition\":[[\"In the painting's <b>composition</b>, the river leads the viewer's eye toward the mountains.\",\"在这幅画的构图中，河流引导观者的视线望向群山。\"],[\"The photographer improved the <b>composition</b> by moving the tree to the left third of the frame.\",\"摄影师把树移到画面左三分之一处，改善了构图。\"]],\"phase\":[[\"The <b>phases</b> of the Moon — new, crescent, half and full — repeat every twenty-nine days or so.\",\"月相——新月、娥眉月、半月和满月——大约每二十九天循环一次。\"],[\"During the full-moon <b>phase</b>, the whole face of the Moon is lit by the Sun.\",\"在满月这一月相时，月球的整个表面都被太阳照亮。\"]],\"stitch\":[[\"The cut was deep, and the doctor said it would need several <b>stitches</b>.\",\"伤口很深，医生说需要缝几针。\"],[\"The surgeon closed the wound with neat <b>stitches</b>.\",\"外科医生用整齐的缝针缝合了伤口。\"]],\"freezer\":[[\"She stored the leftover soup in the <b>freezer</b> for next week.\",\"她把剩下的汤存放在冷冻柜里，留到下周。\"],[\"Ice cream must be kept in the <b>freezer</b>, or it will melt.\",\"冰淇淋必须放在冷冻柜里，否则会融化。\"]],\"plaza\":[[\"Every evening, elderly residents gather in the <b>plaza</b> to dance and chat.\",\"每天傍晚，老年居民聚集在广场上跳舞聊天。\"],[\"The new <b>plaza</b> in front of the station has fountains and rows of benches.\",\"车站前的新广场有喷泉和一排排长椅。\"]],\"butterfly\":[[\"The <b>butterfly</b> rested on the flower, slowly opening and closing its wings.\",\"蝴蝶停在花上，慢慢地张合翅膀。\"],[\"A caterpillar transforms into a <b>butterfly</b> inside the chrysalis.\",\"毛毛虫在蛹里蜕变成蝴蝶。\"]],\"capillary\":[[\"<b>Capillaries</b> are so narrow that red blood cells pass through them one at a time.\",\"毛细血管非常细，红细胞只能一个一个地通过。\"],[\"Oxygen passes from the <b>capillaries</b> into the surrounding tissues.\",\"氧气从毛细血管进入周围组织。\"]],\"substance\":[[\"Water is a <b>substance</b> made of hydrogen and oxygen atoms.\",\"水是由氢原子和氧原子构成的物质。\"],[\"The white <b>substance</b> on the leaves turned out to be a harmless fungus.\",\"叶子上的白色物质原来是一种无害的真菌。\"]],\"playground\":[[\"The children ran to the <b>playground</b> as soon as the bell rang.\",\"铃声一响，孩子们就跑向游乐场。\"],[\"The city built a new <b>playground</b> with slides and climbing frames near the school.\",\"市政府在学校附近建了一个带滑梯和攀爬架的新游乐场。\"]],\"aromatic\":[[\"<b>Aromatic</b> herbs such as basil and mint are added at the end of cooking.\",\"罗勒和薄荷等芳香草本在烹饪最后加入。\"],[\"The <b>aromatic</b> oil from orange peel is used in perfumes.\",\"橙皮中的芳香油被用于香水。\"]],\"duck\":[[\"A mother <b>duck</b> led her ducklings across the pond in a neat line.\",\"一只母鸭带着小鸭子排成整齐的一列游过池塘。\"],[\"<b>Ducks</b> feed on small plants and insects in shallow water.\",\"鸭子以浅水中的小植物和昆虫为食。\"]],\"temperate\":[[\"<b>Temperate</b> regions have four distinct seasons and moderate rainfall.\",\"温带地区四季分明，降雨适中。\"],[\"Most of the world's wheat is grown in <b>temperate</b> zones.\",\"世界上大部分小麦种植在温带地区。\"]],\"pill\":[[\"The doctor told him to take one <b>pill</b> after each meal.\",\"医生让他每餐后服用一片药丸。\"],[\"She swallowed the <b>pill</b> with a glass of water.\",\"她就着一杯水吞下了药丸。\"]],\"herb\":[[\"This <b>herb</b> has been used in traditional medicine for centuries to reduce fever.\",\"这种草药在传统医学中已被使用数百年，用来退烧。\"],[\"The garden grows <b>herbs</b> such as mint, which can be brewed into a calming tea.\",\"花园里种着薄荷等草药，可以泡成安神茶。\"]],\"fluid\":[[\"A <b>fluid</b> takes the shape of whatever container holds it.\",\"流体会呈现出盛放它的容器的形状。\"],[\"The engineer tested how the <b>fluid</b> flowed through pipes of different widths.\",\"工程师测试了流体如何流过不同宽度的管道。\"]],\"addition\":[[\"Young children learn <b>addition</b> by counting blocks and then writing the numbers.\",\"幼儿通过数积木然后写数字来学习加法。\"],[\"He checked the bill using mental <b>addition</b> and found a mistake.\",\"他用心算加法核对账单，发现了一个错误。\"]],\"pendulum\":[[\"A <b>pendulum</b> swings back and forth at a steady rate, which made it useful in early clocks.\",\"摆以稳定的速率来回摆动，这使它在早期时钟中很有用。\"],[\"The period of a <b>pendulum</b> depends on its length, not on how heavy the bob is.\",\"摆的周期取决于它的长度，而不是摆锤有多重。\"]],\"efficiency\":[[\"The new engine's <b>efficiency</b> means the car uses twenty percent less fuel.\",\"新发动机的效率意味着这辆车省油百分之二十。\"],[\"Working in short, focused periods improved her <b>efficiency</b> greatly.\",\"以短时间专注的方式工作大大提高了她的效率。\"]],\"kangaroo\":[[\"A baby <b>kangaroo</b> develops inside its mother's pouch before it can hop on its own.\",\"小袋鼠在能自己跳跃之前，一直在母亲的育儿袋里成长。\"],[\"<b>Kangaroos</b> move by hopping on their powerful hind legs.\",\"袋鼠靠有力的后腿跳跃移动。\"]],\"fishing\":[[\"<b>Fishing</b> at dawn, when the lake is calm, is his favourite way to relax.\",\"在黎明时分湖面平静时钓鱼是他最喜欢的放松方式。\"],[\"The village depends on <b>fishing</b> for most of its income.\",\"这个村庄的大部分收入依靠捕鱼。\"]],\"insulin\":[[\"<b>Insulin</b> allows the body's cells to take in sugar from the blood.\",\"胰岛素使身体细胞能从血液中摄取糖分。\"],[\"People with type 1 diabetes must inject <b>insulin</b> every day.\",\"1 型糖尿病患者必须每天注射胰岛素。\"]],\"typhoon\":[[\"The <b>typhoon</b> brought heavy rain and winds strong enough to uproot trees.\",\"台风带来了暴雨和足以连根拔起树木的强风。\"],[\"Fishing boats returned to harbour before the <b>typhoon</b> reached the coast.\",\"台风到达海岸之前，渔船返回了港口。\"]],\"government\":[[\"The <b>government</b> announced new funding for rural hospitals.\",\"政府宣布为农村医院提供新的资金。\"],[\"In a democracy, the <b>government</b> is chosen by the voters.\",\"在民主国家，政府由选民选出。\"]],\"mall\":[[\"The new <b>mall</b> has over two hundred shops and a cinema on the top floor.\",\"这家新购物中心有两百多家商店，顶层有一家电影院。\"],[\"Teenagers often meet their friends at the <b>mall</b> on weekends.\",\"青少年常在周末在购物中心和朋友见面。\"]],\"pat\":[[\"She <b>patted</b> the dog gently on the head.\",\"她轻轻拍了拍狗的头。\"],[\"He <b>patted</b> his pockets, looking for the train ticket.\",\"他拍了拍口袋，找火车票。\"]],\"referendum\":[[\"The country held a <b>referendum</b> on whether to leave the trade union.\",\"这个国家就是否退出贸易联盟举行了公投。\"],[\"In the <b>referendum</b>, sixty percent of voters supported the change.\",\"在这次公投中，百分之六十的选民支持这项改变。\"]],\"olfactory\":[[\"The <b>olfactory</b> system allows us to distinguish thousands of different smells.\",\"嗅觉系统使我们能够分辨成千上万种不同的气味。\"],[\"Dogs have far more <b>olfactory</b> receptors than humans, which is why their sense of smell is stronger.\",\"狗的嗅觉受体远比人类多，这就是它们的嗅觉更强的原因。\"]],\"convert\":[[\"The factory was <b>converted</b> into apartments after it closed.\",\"工厂关闭后被改造成了公寓。\"],[\"Plants <b>convert</b> sunlight into chemical energy through photosynthesis.\",\"植物通过光合作用把阳光转化成化学能。\"]],\"consult\":[[\"You should <b>consult</b> a doctor if the fever lasts more than three days.\",\"如果发烧持续三天以上，你应该咨询医生。\"],[\"The committee <b>consulted</b> local residents before approving the plan.\",\"委员会在批准该计划前咨询了当地居民。\"]],\"domestication\":[[\"The <b>domestication</b> of dogs from wolves began at least fifteen thousand years ago.\",\"狗从狼的驯化至少始于一万五千年前。\"],[\"<b>Domestication</b> changed wheat so that its seeds no longer scatter in the wind.\",\"驯化改变了小麦，使其种子不再随风散落。\"]],\"immune\":[[\"After recovering from the disease, she was <b>immune</b> to it for life.\",\"从这种疾病康复后，她对其终身免疫。\"],[\"Vaccines train the <b>immune</b> system to recognise a virus before it causes illness.\",\"疫苗训练免疫系统在病毒致病之前识别它。\"]],\"coagulate\":[[\"When a blood vessel is cut, platelets help the blood <b>coagulate</b> and form a clot.\",\"血管被割破时，血小板帮助血液凝结形成血块。\"],[\"The milk <b>coagulated</b> into curds when lemon juice was added.\",\"加入柠檬汁后，牛奶凝结成了凝乳。\"]],\"network\":[[\"The railway <b>network</b> connects every major city in the country.\",\"铁路网络连接了这个国家的每一个主要城市。\"],[\"A <b>network</b> of volunteers delivered food to elderly people during the lockdown.\",\"一个志愿者网络在封锁期间为老年人送食物。\"]],\"avid\":[[\"An <b>avid</b> reader, she finishes a novel almost every week.\",\"她是个热切的读者，几乎每周读完一本小说。\"],[\"The museum attracted <b>avid</b> collectors from all over the world.\",\"这家博物馆吸引了来自世界各地的热切收藏者。\"]],\"discrepancy\":[[\"There was a <b>discrepancy</b> between the witness's story and the camera footage.\",\"证人的说法与监控录像之间存在差异。\"],[\"The accountant investigated the <b>discrepancy</b> in the company's accounts.\",\"会计调查了公司账目中的差异。\"]],\"metropolis\":[[\"Shanghai grew from a small port into a vast <b>metropolis</b> within a century.\",\"上海在一个世纪内从一个小港口成长为一座巨大的都市。\"],[\"Life in the <b>metropolis</b> is fast, expensive, and exciting.\",\"大都市的生活节奏快、开销大、令人兴奋。\"]],\"blare\":[[\"Car horns <b>blared</b> as the traffic jam stretched for miles.\",\"交通堵塞绵延数英里，汽车喇叭高声鸣响。\"],[\"Music <b>blared</b> from the speakers in the square all evening.\",\"整个晚上，音乐从广场上的扬声器里高声播放。\"]],\"skunk\":[[\"A <b>skunk</b> sprays a foul-smelling liquid when it feels threatened.\",\"臭鼬在感到威胁时喷出难闻的液体。\"],[\"The <b>skunk's</b> black-and-white stripes warn predators to stay away.\",\"臭鼬黑白相间的条纹警告捕食者远离它。\"]],\"jacket\":[[\"He hung his <b>jacket</b> on the hook by the door.\",\"他把夹克挂在门边的钩子上。\"],[\"A waterproof <b>jacket</b> is essential for hiking in the mountains in spring.\",\"春天在山里徒步，防水夹克是必不可少的。\"]],\"environs\":[[\"The castle and its <b>environs</b> attract thousands of tourists each summer.\",\"这座城堡及其周边地区每年夏天吸引成千上万的游客。\"],[\"Archaeologists surveyed the <b>environs</b> of the ancient city, searching for its outer walls.\",\"考古学家勘察了这座古城的周边地区，寻找它的外城墙。\"]],\"spine\":[[\"The <b>spine</b> protects the spinal cord, which carries signals between the brain and the body.\",\"脊柱保护着脊髓，脊髓在大脑和身体之间传递信号。\"],[\"Lifting heavy boxes with a bent <b>spine</b> can cause back injuries.\",\"弯着脊柱搬重箱子会导致背部受伤。\"]],\"circulate\":[[\"The heart pumps blood so that it can <b>circulate</b> through the whole body.\",\"心脏泵血，使血液能在全身循环。\"],[\"Fresh air <b>circulates</b> through the building through vents in the roof.\",\"新鲜空气通过屋顶的通风口在建筑内循环。\"]],\"contradict\":[[\"The new fossils <b>contradict</b> the theory that these dinosaurs were cold-blooded.\",\"新发现的化石反驳了这些恐龙是冷血动物的理论。\"],[\"His statements to the police <b>contradict</b> what he said in court.\",\"他向警方所作的陈述与他在法庭上的说法自相矛盾。\"]],\"bolt\":[[\"He tightened the <b>bolt</b> with a wrench until the metal plate was firmly fixed.\",\"他用扳手拧紧螺栓，直到金属板牢固固定。\"],[\"Each <b>bolt</b> on the bridge is inspected once a year for rust.\",\"桥上的每个螺栓每年检查一次是否生锈。\"]],\"raven\":[[\"A <b>raven</b> croaked from the top of the dead tree.\",\"一只渡鸦在枯树顶上呱呱叫。\"],[\"<b>Ravens</b> are intelligent birds that can solve puzzles to get food.\",\"渡鸦是聪明的鸟类，能通过解谜获取食物。\"]],\"mat\":[[\"She wiped her muddy boots on the <b>mat</b> outside the door.\",\"她在门外的垫子上擦了擦沾满泥的靴子。\"],[\"In yoga class, each student unrolls a <b>mat</b> before the lesson begins.\",\"瑜伽课上，每个学生在上课前铺开一张垫子。\"]],\"corn\":[[\"<b>Corn</b> was first domesticated in Mexico thousands of years ago.\",\"玉米数千年前首次在墨西哥被驯化。\"],[\"The farmer dried the <b>corn</b> in the sun before storing it for winter.\",\"农民把玉米在阳光下晒干，然后储存起来过冬。\"]],\"cram\":[[\"She <b>crammed</b> all her clothes into one small suitcase.\",\"她把所有衣服都塞进了一个小行李箱。\"],[\"The train was <b>crammed</b> with commuters during the morning rush.\",\"早高峰时，火车里塞满了通勤者。\"]],\"hierarchy\":[[\"In the army's <b>hierarchy</b>, orders pass from generals down to ordinary soldiers.\",\"在军队的层级中，命令从将军下达给普通士兵。\"],[\"Wolves live in packs with a clear <b>hierarchy</b> led by a dominant pair.\",\"狼群居生活，有着由一对占主导地位的狼领导的明确层级。\"]],\"mineral\":[[\"Quartz is a <b>mineral</b> made of silicon and oxygen.\",\"石英是由硅和氧组成的矿物。\"],[\"The spring water is rich in <b>minerals</b> such as calcium and magnesium.\",\"这泉水富含钙和镁等矿物质。\"]],\"aurora\":[[\"The <b>aurora</b> filled the Arctic sky with waves of green and purple light.\",\"极光让北极的天空布满了绿色和紫色的光波。\"],[\"<b>Auroras</b> occur when charged particles from the Sun strike gases in the upper atmosphere.\",\"当来自太阳的带电粒子撞击高层大气中的气体时，就会产生极光。\"]],\"crash\":[[\"The two cars <b>crashed</b> at the icy intersection, but nobody was badly hurt.\",\"两辆车在结冰的十字路口相撞，但没人受重伤。\"],[\"Waves <b>crashed</b> against the rocks below the lighthouse.\",\"海浪撞击着灯塔下方的岩石。\"]],\"arm\":[[\"He broke his <b>arm</b> falling off the bicycle.\",\"他从自行车上摔下来，摔断了手臂。\"],[\"The baby reached out her <b>arms</b> to be picked up.\",\"宝宝伸出手臂要人抱。\"]],\"civil\":[[\"The dispute was settled in a <b>civil</b> court rather than a criminal one.\",\"这场纠纷在民事法庭而非刑事法庭解决。\"],[\"Marriage and property disputes are matters of <b>civil</b> law.\",\"婚姻和财产纠纷属于民事法律的范畴。\"]],\"optic\":[[\"Fibre <b>optic</b> cables carry information as pulses of light.\",\"光纤电缆以光脉冲的形式传输信息。\"],[\"The <b>optic</b> nerve carries signals from the eye to the brain.\",\"视神经把信号从眼睛传递到大脑。\"]],\"compel\":[[\"The evidence was so strong that it <b>compelled</b> the jury to reach a guilty verdict.\",\"证据如此有力，迫使陪审团作出有罪裁决。\"],[\"A sudden thirst <b>compelled</b> him to stop and drink from the stream.\",\"突然的口渴迫使他停下来喝溪水。\"]],\"prawn\":[[\"<b>Prawns</b> are cooked quickly, turning pink in just a few minutes.\",\"对虾烹饪得很快，几分钟就变成粉红色。\"],[\"The fisherman sorted the <b>prawns</b> from the rest of the catch.\",\"渔民把对虾从其余渔获中分拣出来。\"]],\"slate\":[[\"The roof of the old cottage was covered with grey <b>slate</b> tiles.\",\"这座老农舍的屋顶覆盖着灰色的板岩瓦。\"],[\"<b>Slate</b> splits easily into thin, flat sheets, which makes it useful for roofing.\",\"板岩容易分裂成薄薄的平板，这使它适合用作屋顶材料。\"]],\"aware\":[[\"She was <b>aware</b> that the road ahead was closed, so she took another route.\",\"她意识到前面的路封闭了，于是走了另一条路。\"],[\"Most consumers are now <b>aware</b> of the environmental cost of plastic packaging.\",\"大多数消费者现在意识到了塑料包装对环境的代价。\"]],\"average\":[[\"Temperatures in this region <b>average</b> twenty-five degrees in July.\",\"这个地区七月的气温平均为二十五度。\"],[\"The factory's output <b>averages</b> five hundred units a day.\",\"这家工厂的产量平均每天五百件。\"]],\"imply\":[[\"Her silence seemed to <b>imply</b> that she disagreed with the plan.\",\"她的沉默似乎暗示她不同意这个计划。\"],[\"The dark clouds <b>imply</b> that a storm is coming.\",\"乌云暗示暴风雨即将来临。\"]],\"key\":[[\"He turned the <b>key</b> in the lock and pushed the door open.\",\"他转动锁里的钥匙，推开了门。\"],[\"She keeps a spare <b>key</b> under the flowerpot by the door.\",\"她在门边的花盆下放了一把备用钥匙。\"]],\"softball\":[[\"<b>Softball</b> is similar to baseball, but it uses a larger ball and a smaller field.\",\"垒球与棒球相似，但用球更大、场地更小。\"],[\"The company organises a <b>softball</b> game for its staff every summer.\",\"公司每年夏天为员工组织一场垒球比赛。\"]],\"velocity\":[[\"The <b>velocity</b> of the river increases where the channel narrows.\",\"河道变窄处，河水的速度（流速）增加。\"],[\"Scientists measured the <b>velocity</b> of the falling object at each second of its descent.\",\"科学家测量了这个下落物体在下降每一秒的速度。\"]],\"division\":[[\"She works in the marketing <b>division</b> of a large electronics company.\",\"她在一家大型电子公司的市场部门工作。\"],[\"The <b>division</b> responsible for safety checks every product before it is sold.\",\"负责安全的部门在每个产品出售前都进行检查。\"]],\"historian\":[[\"The <b>historian</b> spent ten years studying letters written during the war.\",\"这位历史学家花了十年研究战争期间写的信件。\"],[\"<b>Historians</b> disagree about why the empire collapsed so quickly.\",\"历史学家们对这个帝国为何如此迅速崩溃意见不一。\"]],\"sensory\":[[\"The <b>sensory</b> system of a shark can detect tiny electrical signals from its prey.\",\"鲨鱼的感觉系统能探测到猎物发出的微弱电信号。\"],[\"Bright lights and loud sounds provide strong <b>sensory</b> input for young children.\",\"明亮的灯光和响亮的声音为幼儿提供强烈的感官输入。\"]],\"emerge\":[[\"The sun <b>emerged</b> from behind the clouds in the late afternoon.\",\"傍晚时分，太阳从云层后面出现了。\"],[\"New evidence has <b>emerged</b> that changes our understanding of the disease.\",\"新的证据已经出现，改变了我们对这种疾病的理解。\"]],\"diminution\":[[\"The <b>diminution</b> of the glacier over fifty years is visible in old photographs.\",\"从老照片上可以看出这条冰川五十年来的减少。\"],[\"There has been a steady <b>diminution</b> in the number of bees in the region.\",\"该地区蜜蜂数量一直在稳步减少。\"]],\"enhance\":[[\"Adding spices <b>enhances</b> the flavour of the soup.\",\"加入香料能增强汤的风味。\"],[\"The new software <b>enhances</b> the quality of old photographs.\",\"这款新软件能提升老照片的质量。\"]],\"agent\":[[\"She hired an <b>agent</b> to sell her house while she was abroad.\",\"她在国外期间雇了一名代理人出售她的房子。\"],[\"As the company's <b>agent</b> in Asia, he signs contracts on its behalf.\",\"作为公司在亚洲的代理，他代表公司签署合同。\"]],\"corollary\":[[\"A <b>corollary</b> of the theory is that heavier objects should not fall faster than light ones.\",\"这个理论的一个推论是，较重的物体不应比较轻的物体下落得更快。\"],[\"If demand rises, a natural <b>corollary</b> is that prices will rise too.\",\"如果需求上升，一个自然的推论是价格也会上涨。\"]],\"format\":[[\"The teacher asked students to submit the essay in a standard <b>format</b>.\",\"老师要求学生以标准格式提交论文。\"],[\"The <b>format</b> of the exam changed this year: there are now two essays instead of one.\",\"今年考试的格式变了：现在有两篇作文而不是一篇。\"]],\"strawberry\":[[\"Fresh <b>strawberries</b> are sweetest when they are picked fully ripe.\",\"完全成熟时采摘的新鲜草莓最甜。\"],[\"She spread <b>strawberry</b> jam on the warm toast.\",\"她在热吐司上涂了草莓酱。\"]],\"corruption\":[[\"The mayor was arrested for <b>corruption</b> after accepting money from builders.\",\"市长因收受建筑商的钱而以腐败罪被捕。\"],[\"<b>Corruption</b> in the police force weakened public trust in the law.\",\"警察队伍中的腐败削弱了公众对法律的信任。\"]],\"weaving\":[[\"<b>Weaving</b> cloth on a loom was once a common skill in farming villages.\",\"在织布机上织布曾经是农耕村庄里常见的技能。\"],[\"The museum displays <b>weaving</b> tools that are over a thousand years old.\",\"博物馆展示了一千多年前的织造工具。\"]],\"wardrobe\":[[\"She hung her winter coats in the large <b>wardrobe</b> by the window.\",\"她把冬天的外套挂在窗边的大衣柜里。\"],[\"The <b>wardrobe</b> was made of oak and had a mirror on one door.\",\"这个衣柜由橡木制成，一扇门上有一面镜子。\"]],\"ceremony\":[[\"The graduation <b>ceremony</b> was held in the university's main hall.\",\"毕业典礼在大学的主礼堂举行。\"],[\"The opening <b>ceremony</b> of the games began with a parade of athletes.\",\"运动会的开幕式以运动员入场开始。\"]],\"empiricism\":[[\"<b>Empiricism</b> holds that knowledge comes primarily from observation and experiment.\",\"经验主义认为，知识主要来自观察和实验。\"],[\"The rise of <b>empiricism</b> in the seventeenth century changed how science was practised.\",\"十七世纪经验主义的兴起改变了科学研究的方式。\"]],\"navigation\":[[\"Before GPS, sailors relied on the stars for <b>navigation</b> across open oceans.\",\"在 GPS 出现之前，水手依靠星星在茫茫大海上导航。\"],[\"The <b>navigation</b> system in the car warned the driver about traffic ahead.\",\"汽车里的导航系统提醒司机前方有交通拥堵。\"]],\"island\":[[\"The <b>island</b> can only be reached by boat, and no cars are allowed on it.\",\"这座岛屿只能乘船到达，岛上不允许汽车通行。\"],[\"Thousands of species on the <b>island</b> exist nowhere else on Earth.\",\"岛上的数千个物种在地球上其他任何地方都不存在。\"]],\"identity\":[[\"Language plays an important role in a community's sense of <b>identity</b>.\",\"语言在一个群体的身份认同感中起着重要作用。\"],[\"Moving to a new country made him think deeply about his own <b>identity</b>.\",\"移居到一个新国家使他深入思考自己的身份认同。\"]],\"hamster\":[[\"The <b>hamster</b> stuffed seeds into its cheek pouches to carry them to its nest.\",\"仓鼠把种子塞进颊囊里，带回巢里。\"],[\"At night, the <b>hamster</b> ran for hours on its wheel.\",\"夜里，仓鼠在它的轮子上跑了几个小时。\"]],\"territory\":[[\"The two countries disputed the <b>territory</b> along their shared border.\",\"两国对共同边界沿线的领土存在争议。\"],[\"A male wolf defends its <b>territory</b> against other packs.\",\"雄狼保卫自己的领地，抵御其他狼群。\"]],\"artery\":[[\"The coronary <b>artery</b> supplies blood to the heart muscle itself.\",\"冠状动脉为心肌本身供血。\"],[\"Blocked <b>arteries</b> can lead to a heart attack if they are not treated.\",\"动脉阻塞如果不治疗可能导致心脏病发作。\"]],\"buffalo\":[[\"A herd of <b>buffalo</b> grazed on the wet grassland near the river.\",\"一群水牛在河边潮湿的草地上吃草。\"],[\"<b>Buffalo</b> are strong swimmers and often cross rivers in groups.\",\"水牛是游泳能手，经常成群过河。\"]],\"opossum\":[[\"When threatened, an <b>opossum</b> may 'play dead' for several minutes.\",\"受到威胁时，负鼠可能会“装死”几分钟。\"],[\"The <b>opossum</b> carries its babies in a pouch, like a kangaroo.\",\"负鼠像袋鼠一样把宝宝装在育儿袋里。\"]],\"crust\":[[\"The Earth's <b>crust</b> is thinnest beneath the oceans.\",\"地球的地壳在海洋之下最薄。\"],[\"Movements in the <b>crust</b> can trigger earthquakes along fault lines.\",\"地壳的运动会沿断层线引发地震。\"]],\"tissue\":[[\"Muscle <b>tissue</b> contracts to produce movement in the body.\",\"肌肉组织收缩，在体内产生运动。\"],[\"The plant's <b>tissues</b> carry water from the roots to the leaves.\",\"植物的组织把水分从根输送到叶子。\"]],\"obedience\":[[\"The dog's <b>obedience</b> was the result of months of patient training.\",\"这只狗的服从是数月耐心训练的结果。\"],[\"In the experiment, <b>obedience</b> to authority led some participants to follow harmful instructions.\",\"在这项实验中，对权威的服从导致一些参与者执行了有害的指令。\"]],\"sweat\":[[\"<b>Sweat</b> cools the body as it evaporates from the skin.\",\"汗液从皮肤蒸发时使身体降温。\"],[\"After the race, his shirt was soaked with <b>sweat</b>.\",\"比赛后，他的衬衫被汗浸透了。\"]],\"queen\":[[\"The <b>queen</b> ruled the country for over fifty years.\",\"这位王后（女王）统治这个国家五十多年。\"],[\"In chess, the <b>queen</b> is the most powerful piece on the board.\",\"国际象棋中，后（王后）是棋盘上最强的棋子。\"]],\"trauma\":[[\"The accident caused severe <b>trauma</b> to his chest, and he was rushed to hospital.\",\"这次事故对他的胸部造成了严重创伤，他被紧急送往医院。\"],[\"Survivors of the earthquake suffered psychological <b>trauma</b> for years afterwards.\",\"地震幸存者在之后多年里遭受着心理创伤。\"]],\"narrator\":[[\"The <b>narrator</b> of the novel is an old sailor telling the story of his youth.\",\"这部小说的叙述者是一位讲述自己青年时代故事的老水手。\"],[\"An unreliable <b>narrator</b> makes the reader question everything in the story.\",\"不可靠的叙述者让读者对故事中的一切产生怀疑。\"]],\"editor\":[[\"The <b>editor</b> asked the reporter to shorten the article by half.\",\"编辑要求记者把文章缩短一半。\"],[\"As <b>editor</b> of the journal, she decides which papers get published.\",\"作为这家期刊的编辑，她决定哪些论文可以发表。\"]],\"prince\":[[\"The <b>prince</b> inherited the throne after his father's death.\",\"王子在父亲去世后继承了王位。\"],[\"In the fairy tale, the <b>prince</b> crossed the desert to rescue the princess.\",\"在童话里，王子穿越沙漠去营救公主。\"]],\"weathering\":[[\"<b>Weathering</b> breaks down rocks into smaller pieces through wind, water and temperature changes.\",\"风化通过风、水和温度变化把岩石分解成更小的碎片。\"],[\"The statue's features have been softened by centuries of <b>weathering</b>.\",\"这座雕像的面部特征因几个世纪的风化而变得模糊。\"]],\"compromise\":[[\"After hours of negotiation, the two sides finally reached a <b>compromise</b>.\",\"经过数小时谈判，双方终于达成了妥协。\"],[\"Neither side was fully satisfied, which is often the sign of a fair <b>compromise</b>.\",\"双方都不完全满意，这往往是公平妥协的标志。\"]],\"financial\":[[\"The company is in <b>financial</b> trouble after losing its biggest customer.\",\"失去最大的客户后，这家公司陷入了财务困境。\"],[\"<b>Financial</b> aid helped the students pay for their university education.\",\"助学金帮助学生们支付了大学费用。\"]],\"astonished\":[[\"We were <b>astonished</b> to learn that the tiny village had produced three Olympic champions.\",\"得知这个小村庄出了三位奥运冠军，我们感到非常吃惊。\"],[\"She looked <b>astonished</b> when her name was announced as the winner.\",\"当她的名字被宣布为获胜者时，她看起来很吃惊。\"]],\"thermometer\":[[\"The <b>thermometer</b> showed that the water had reached ninety degrees.\",\"温度计显示水温已达到九十度。\"],[\"Nurses use a <b>thermometer</b> to check whether a patient has a fever.\",\"护士用温度计检查病人是否发烧。\"]],\"pharmacy\":[[\"You can collect your prescription medicine at the <b>pharmacy</b> on the corner.\",\"你可以在街角的药房领取处方药。\"],[\"The <b>pharmacy</b> stays open all night in case of emergencies.\",\"这家药房通宵营业，以备紧急情况。\"]],\"ligament\":[[\"<b>Ligaments</b> connect bones to other bones and keep joints stable.\",\"韧带把骨头与骨头连接起来，保持关节稳定。\"],[\"He tore a <b>ligament</b> in his knee while skiing and needed surgery.\",\"他滑雪时撕裂了膝盖的一条韧带，需要手术。\"]],\"assertion\":[[\"The author's <b>assertion</b> that cities cause loneliness is not supported by the data.\",\"作者关于城市导致孤独的断言没有数据支持。\"],[\"She made the <b>assertion</b> calmly, without raising her voice.\",\"她平静地作出了这个断言，没有提高嗓门。\"]],\"birthday\":[[\"We baked a cake for Grandma's eightieth <b>birthday</b>.\",\"我们为奶奶的八十岁生日烤了一个蛋糕。\"],[\"His <b>birthday</b> falls on a Sunday this year.\",\"他的生日今年恰逢周日。\"]],\"mining\":[[\"<b>Mining</b> for coal in this region began in the nineteenth century.\",\"这个地区的煤矿开采始于十九世纪。\"],[\"Modern <b>mining</b> uses machines to dig deeper than hand tools ever could.\",\"现代采矿使用机器，挖掘深度远超手工工具。\"]],\"text\":[[\"Students were asked to compare two <b>texts</b> about the same historical event.\",\"学生们被要求比较两篇关于同一历史事件的文本。\"],[\"The original <b>text</b> of the poem was written in Latin.\",\"这首诗的原文是用拉丁文写的。\"]],\"assumption\":[[\"The plan rests on the <b>assumption</b> that prices will stay low.\",\"这个计划建立在价格将保持低位的假设之上。\"],[\"His <b>assumption</b> turned out to be wrong: the road was closed after all.\",\"他的假设被证明是错的：这条路最终还是封闭了。\"]],\"chain\":[[\"The gate was locked with a heavy iron <b>chain</b>.\",\"大门用一条沉重的铁链条锁着。\"],[\"She wore a thin gold <b>chain</b> around her neck.\",\"她脖子上戴着一条细金链。\"]],\"bookcase\":[[\"The <b>bookcase</b> reached from the floor to the ceiling and held hundreds of volumes.\",\"这个书柜从地板一直到天花板，装了数百本书。\"],[\"He built the <b>bookcase</b> himself out of pine wood.\",\"他用松木亲手做了这个书柜。\"]],\"endangerment\":[[\"The factory was fined for the <b>endangerment</b> of workers exposed to toxic dust.\",\"这家工厂因危害接触有毒粉尘的工人而被罚款。\"],[\"Habitat loss is the main cause of the species' <b>endangerment</b>.\",\"栖息地丧失是该物种陷入濒危的主要原因。\"]],\"compact\":[[\"The machine <b>compacts</b> the soil before the road surface is laid.\",\"这台机器在铺设路面之前把土壤压紧。\"],[\"Snow <b>compacted</b> by skiers turned the slope into hard ice.\",\"被滑雪者压紧的雪使斜坡变成了坚硬的冰面。\"]],\"bonus\":[[\"Employees received a <b>bonus</b> at the end of the year for meeting their targets.\",\"员工因完成目标在年底获得了奖金。\"],[\"The <b>bonus</b> was based on the company's profits, not on individual sales.\",\"奖金是根据公司的利润而不是个人销售额发放的。\"]],\"broker\":[[\"The <b>broker</b> helped the couple buy their first home and negotiated the price for them.\",\"经纪人帮助这对夫妇购买了他们的第一套房子，并为他们谈妥了价格。\"],[\"Stock <b>brokers</b> buy and sell shares on behalf of their clients.\",\"股票经纪人代表客户买卖股票。\"]],\"disorder\":[[\"Sleep <b>disorders</b> can affect concentration and memory during the day.\",\"睡眠紊乱会影响白天的注意力和记忆力。\"],[\"The doctor diagnosed a <b>disorder</b> of the thyroid gland.\",\"医生诊断出甲状腺功能紊乱。\"]],\"descent\":[[\"The plane began its <b>descent</b> half an hour before landing.\",\"飞机在着陆前半小时开始下降。\"],[\"The <b>descent</b> from the summit took longer than the climb because of the ice.\",\"由于结冰，从山顶下降比攀登花的时间更长。\"]],\"loveseat\":[[\"The small apartment had just enough room for a <b>loveseat</b> and a coffee table.\",\"这间小公寓刚好放得下一张双人沙发和一张茶几。\"],[\"They sat on the <b>loveseat</b> by the window, watching the rain.\",\"他们坐在窗边的双人沙发上看雨。\"]],\"response\":[[\"The <b>response</b> to the survey was overwhelmingly positive.\",\"对这项调查的回应绝大多数是积极的。\"],[\"In <b>response</b> to the drought, the trees shed their leaves early.\",\"为了应对干旱，这些树提前落叶。\"]],\"convict\":[[\"The court <b>convicted</b> him of theft after a three-day trial.\",\"经过三天的审判，法庭判定他盗窃罪成立。\"],[\"She was <b>convicted</b> on the basis of DNA evidence.\",\"她根据 DNA 证据被定罪。\"]],\"ruin\":[[\"The <b>ruins</b> of the Roman bathhouse still attract archaeologists today.\",\"这座罗马浴场的废墟至今仍吸引着考古学家。\"],[\"Only broken walls remain of the castle, a <b>ruin</b> since the fire of 1640.\",\"这座城堡只剩下残墙，自 1640 年的火灾以来一直是一片废墟。\"]],\"exemption\":[[\"Small farms received an <b>exemption</b> from the new water tax.\",\"小农场获得了新水税的豁免。\"],[\"His <b>exemption</b> from military service was granted because of his poor eyesight.\",\"他因视力不佳而获得免服兵役的豁免。\"]],\"wavelength\":[[\"Red light has a longer <b>wavelength</b> than blue light.\",\"红光的波长比蓝光长。\"],[\"Radio stations broadcast at different <b>wavelengths</b> so that they do not interfere with each other.\",\"电台以不同的波长广播，以免相互干扰。\"]],\"essay\":[[\"For homework, each student wrote an <b>essay</b> about a historical figure they admired.\",\"家庭作业中，每个学生写了一篇关于他们敬佩的历史人物的文章。\"],[\"Her <b>essay</b> argued that zoos should focus on conservation rather than entertainment.\",\"她的文章论证说，动物园应专注于保护而不是娱乐。\"]],\"backtrack\":[[\"Realising they had taken the wrong path, the hikers <b>backtracked</b> to the river crossing.\",\"意识到走错了路，徒步者原路返回到过河处。\"],[\"The software lets users <b>backtrack</b> through their changes step by step.\",\"该软件让用户逐步返回查看之前的修改。\"]],\"focus\":[[\"The <b>focus</b> of the lecture was how bees communicate through dance.\",\"这场讲座的焦点是蜜蜂如何通过舞蹈交流。\"],[\"In the photograph, the <b>focus</b> is on the child in the foreground.\",\"在这张照片中，焦点是前景中的孩子。\"]],\"anecdote\":[[\"The professor opened the lecture with an <b>anecdote</b> about her first experiment.\",\"教授以一则关于她第一次实验的轶事开始了讲座。\"],[\"His speech was full of personal <b>anecdotes</b> rather than statistics.\",\"他的演讲满是个人轶事，而不是数据。\"]],\"ocean\":[[\"The Pacific is the largest and deepest <b>ocean</b> on Earth.\",\"太平洋是地球上最大、最深的海洋。\"],[\"Plastic waste carried by rivers eventually reaches the <b>ocean</b>.\",\"河流携带的塑料垃圾最终流入海洋。\"]],\"diagram\":[[\"The <b>diagram</b> shows how blood flows through the four chambers of the heart.\",\"这张图表展示了血液如何流经心脏的四个腔室。\"],[\"She drew a <b>diagram</b> of the water cycle on the whiteboard.\",\"她在白板上画了一张水循环的图表。\"]],\"surplus\":[[\"Farmers sold their <b>surplus</b> grain to neighbouring provinces.\",\"农民把过剩的粮食卖给邻近省份。\"],[\"A <b>surplus</b> of workers and too few jobs pushed wages down.\",\"劳动力过剩而工作岗位太少，压低了工资。\"]],\"highway\":[[\"The new <b>highway</b> cut the journey between the two cities to three hours.\",\"新高速公路把两座城市之间的旅程缩短到三小时。\"],[\"Trucks are not allowed on this <b>highway</b> during the morning rush hour.\",\"早高峰期间，这条高速公路不允许卡车通行。\"]],\"fine\":[[\"He paid a <b>fine</b> of two hundred dollars for parking in a disabled space.\",\"他因把车停在残疾人车位而缴纳了两百美元罚款。\"],[\"The library charges a small <b>fine</b> for books returned late.\",\"图书馆对逾期归还的图书收取少量罚款。\"]],\"element\":[[\"Oxygen is an <b>element</b>, while water is a compound of hydrogen and oxygen.\",\"氧是一种元素，而水是氢和氧的化合物。\"],[\"The periodic table organises all known <b>elements</b> by their atomic number.\",\"元素周期表按原子序数排列所有已知元素。\"]],\"clerk\":[[\"The <b>clerk</b> at the hotel desk checked us in within minutes.\",\"酒店前台的职员几分钟内就为我们办好了入住。\"],[\"She worked as a <b>clerk</b> in a law office, filing documents and answering phones.\",\"她在一家律师事务所当职员，负责归档文件和接电话。\"]],\"tundra\":[[\"The <b>tundra</b> has no trees because the soil stays frozen for most of the year.\",\"苔原没有树木，因为土壤一年中大部分时间都冻结着。\"],[\"Reindeer migrate across the <b>tundra</b> in search of lichen to eat.\",\"驯鹿在苔原上迁徙，寻找地衣食用。\"]],\"neural\":[[\"<b>Neural</b> pathways strengthen each time a skill is practised.\",\"每次练习技能，神经通路都会得到加强。\"],[\"The study examined how <b>neural</b> activity changes during sleep.\",\"这项研究考察了睡眠期间神经活动如何变化。\"]],\"transform\":[[\"The caterpillar <b>transforms</b> into a butterfly inside the chrysalis.\",\"毛毛虫在蛹内变形为蝴蝶。\"],[\"The invention of the steam engine <b>transformed</b> industry in the nineteenth century.\",\"蒸汽机的发明使十九世纪的工业发生了巨变。\"]],\"beaver\":[[\"A <b>beaver</b> can fell a small tree in a single night with its strong teeth.\",\"海狸用强壮的牙齿一夜就能咬倒一棵小树。\"],[\"<b>Beavers</b> build dams that turn streams into ponds.\",\"海狸筑坝，把溪流变成池塘。\"]],\"minimize\":[[\"Wearing a helmet <b>minimizes</b> the risk of head injury in a fall.\",\"戴头盔能把摔倒时头部受伤的风险降到最低。\"],[\"The design <b>minimizes</b> waste by using every offcut of wood.\",\"这种设计利用每一块木头边角料，把浪费降到最低。\"]],\"gravel\":[[\"The path was covered with <b>gravel</b> that crunched under their boots.\",\"小路铺满了砾石，在他们的靴子下咯吱作响。\"],[\"<b>Gravel</b> is mixed with cement and water to make concrete.\",\"砾石与水泥和水混合制成混凝土。\"]],\"ferris\":[[\"From the top of the <b>Ferris</b> wheel, they could see the whole harbour.\",\"在摩天轮的顶端，他们能看到整个海港。\"],[\"The first <b>Ferris</b> wheel was built for the Chicago World's Fair in 1893.\",\"第一座摩天轮是为 1893 年芝加哥世博会建造的。\"]],\"tornado\":[[\"The <b>tornado</b> tore the roofs off several houses in the small town.\",\"龙卷风掀掉了小镇上几座房子的屋顶。\"],[\"A <b>tornado</b> forms when warm, moist air meets cold, dry air under certain conditions.\",\"当暖湿空气在特定条件下与冷干空气相遇时，龙卷风就会形成。\"]],\"epitome\":[[\"The tiny, perfectly organised workshop was the <b>epitome</b> of efficiency.\",\"这间小巧、井井有条的作坊是效率的缩影。\"],[\"He is the <b>epitome</b> of a good teacher: patient, curious and fair.\",\"他是好老师的缩影：耐心、好奇又公正。\"]],\"razor\":[[\"He replaced the blade in his <b>razor</b> before shaving.\",\"刮胡子前，他换了剃须刀的刀片。\"],[\"The old-fashioned <b>razor</b> must be handled with care to avoid cuts.\",\"这种老式剃须刀必须小心使用，以免割伤。\"]],\"grip\":[[\"She <b>gripped</b> the rope tightly as she climbed the rock face.\",\"她爬岩壁时紧紧握住绳子。\"],[\"The climber lost his <b>grip</b> and slid a few metres before the rope caught him.\",\"这位登山者手一滑，没能握紧，滑下几米后被绳子拉住。\"]],\"monkey\":[[\"The <b>monkey</b> peeled the banana with surprising speed.\",\"猴子以惊人的速度剥开了香蕉。\"],[\"<b>Monkeys</b> use their tails to balance as they move through the trees.\",\"猴子在树间移动时用尾巴保持平衡。\"]],\"formula\":[[\"The <b>formula</b> for the area of a circle is π times the radius squared.\",\"圆面积的公式是 π 乘以半径的平方。\"],[\"Chemists write water as H2O, its chemical <b>formula</b>.\",\"化学家把水写成 H2O，这是它的化学式。\"]],\"lighthouse\":[[\"The <b>lighthouse</b> guided ships safely past the rocky coast at night.\",\"灯塔在夜间引导船只安全通过多岩石的海岸。\"],[\"They climbed the spiral stairs to the top of the <b>lighthouse</b>.\",\"他们沿着螺旋楼梯爬到了灯塔顶端。\"]],\"earnestness\":[[\"Her <b>earnestness</b> in every rehearsal inspired the rest of the choir.\",\"她在每次排练中的认真激励了合唱团的其他成员。\"],[\"He spoke with such <b>earnestness</b> that the committee took his warning seriously.\",\"他说得如此认真，以至于委员会认真对待了他的警告。\"]],\"eagle\":[[\"The <b>eagle</b> circled high above the valley, searching for prey.\",\"鹰在山谷上空高高盘旋，搜寻猎物。\"],[\"An <b>eagle's</b> eyesight is so sharp that it can spot a rabbit from two kilometres away.\",\"鹰的视力非常敏锐，能从两公里外发现一只兔子。\"]],\"interface\":[[\"The app's <b>interface</b> was redesigned so that new users could learn it in minutes.\",\"这款应用的界面重新设计过，新用户几分钟就能学会。\"],[\"A touchscreen provides a simple <b>interface</b> between the user and the machine.\",\"触摸屏为用户和机器之间提供了一个简单的界面。\"]],\"excavate\":[[\"Archaeologists <b>excavated</b> a Roman villa buried beneath the farmer's field.\",\"考古学家挖掘了一座埋在农民田地下的罗马别墅。\"],[\"Before <b>excavating</b> the site, the team photographed every layer of soil.\",\"在挖掘遗址之前，团队拍摄了每一层土壤。\"]],\"delegate\":[[\"Each country sent a <b>delegate</b> to the climate conference.\",\"每个国家都派了一名代表参加气候大会。\"],[\"A good manager <b>delegates</b> tasks instead of trying to do everything alone.\",\"好的管理者会把任务委派下去，而不是试图独自完成一切。\"]],\"nostril\":[[\"Water entered one <b>nostril</b> as he dived into the pool.\",\"他跳入泳池时，水进入了一个鼻孔。\"],[\"The horse's <b>nostrils</b> flared as it smelled the smoke.\",\"马闻到烟味时，鼻孔张大了。\"]],\"lantern\":[[\"They hung a red <b>lantern</b> by the door to celebrate the New Year.\",\"他们在门边挂了一盏红灯笼庆祝新年。\"],[\"The <b>lantern</b> swung gently in the night breeze, casting shadows on the wall.\",\"灯笼在夜风中轻轻摇晃，在墙上投下影子。\"]],\"throw\":[[\"She <b>threw</b> the ball to her teammate across the court.\",\"她把球扔给球场对面的队友。\"],[\"He <b>threw</b> the old newspapers into the recycling bin.\",\"他把旧报纸扔进回收箱。\"]],\"agriculture\":[[\"<b>Agriculture</b> in the region depends heavily on irrigation from the river.\",\"该地区的农业在很大程度上依赖河流灌溉。\"],[\"The invention of the plough changed <b>agriculture</b> forever.\",\"犁的发明永远改变了农业。\"]],\"pollute\":[[\"Factories that <b>pollute</b> the river face heavy fines.\",\"污染河流的工厂面临巨额罚款。\"],[\"Exhaust fumes <b>pollute</b> the air in busy city centres.\",\"废气污染了繁忙市中心的空气。\"]],\"soup\":[[\"She made a pot of vegetable <b>soup</b> with carrots, onions and beans.\",\"她做了一锅由胡萝卜、洋葱和豆子组成的蔬菜汤。\"],[\"Hot <b>soup</b> is exactly what you need on a cold winter evening.\",\"在寒冷的冬夜，一碗热汤正是你需要的。\"]],\"melon\":[[\"We shared a chilled <b>melon</b> after lunch on the hot veranda.\",\"午饭后，我们在炎热的阳台上分吃了一个冰镇的瓜。\"],[\"The farmer tested the <b>melon</b> by tapping it and listening for a hollow sound.\",\"农民通过轻敲瓜并听空心的声音来判断它是否成熟。\"]],\"bent\":[[\"The old nail was <b>bent</b>, so he straightened it with a hammer.\",\"这根旧钉子是弯的，于是他用锤子把它敲直。\"],[\"She walked with a <b>bent</b> back after years of working in the fields.\",\"多年在地里劳作后，她走路时背是弯的。\"]],\"scarcity\":[[\"Water <b>scarcity</b> forces farmers in the region to choose drought-resistant crops.\",\"水资源稀缺迫使该地区的农民选择抗旱作物。\"],[\"The <b>scarcity</b> of affordable housing is a growing problem in big cities.\",\"经济适用房的稀缺是大城市日益严重的问题。\"]],\"ejection\":[[\"The pilot's <b>ejection</b> from the damaged jet saved his life.\",\"飞行员从受损的喷气机中弹射（弹出）出来，救了他的命。\"],[\"Data showed a sudden <b>ejection</b> of particles from the star's surface.\",\"数据显示恒星表面有粒子突然弹出。\"]],\"bounce\":[[\"The ball <b>bounced</b> twice before crossing the net.\",\"球在过网前弹跳了两次。\"],[\"Light <b>bounces</b> off the surface of the water at the same angle it arrives.\",\"光以入射的相同角度从水面反射开。\"]],\"tour\":[[\"They took a guided <b>tour</b> of the ancient castle and its gardens.\",\"他们参加了有导游带领的古城堡及其花园游览。\"],[\"The band went on <b>tour</b>, playing in twelve cities in one month.\",\"乐队巡回演出，一个月内在十二个城市表演。\"]],\"boulevard\":[[\"The wide <b>boulevard</b> was lined with cafés and plane trees.\",\"这条宽阔的林荫大道两旁是咖啡馆和梧桐树。\"],[\"Families strolled along the <b>boulevard</b> in the cool of the evening.\",\"傍晚凉爽时，家家户户沿着林荫大道散步。\"]],\"thread\":[[\"She passed the <b>thread</b> through the eye of the needle.\",\"她把线穿过针眼。\"],[\"A single <b>thread</b> of silk is surprisingly strong for its thickness.\",\"一根丝线相对于它的粗细来说，强度惊人。\"]],\"insight\":[[\"The experiment gave researchers a new <b>insight</b> into how memory works.\",\"这项实验让研究人员对记忆如何运作有了新的见解。\"],[\"Her years as a nurse gave her a deep <b>insight</b> into patients' fears.\",\"多年的护士生涯让她对病人的恐惧有了深刻的见解。\"]],\"easel\":[[\"The artist set her canvas on the <b>easel</b> and stepped back to judge the proportions.\",\"画家把画布放在画架上，退后一步审视比例。\"],[\"An <b>easel</b> stood in the corner of the studio, holding an unfinished portrait.\",\"工作室的角落里立着一个画架，上面放着一幅未完成的肖像。\"]],\"spinning\":[[\"<b>Spinning</b> wool into yarn was a daily task for women in the village a century ago.\",\"一个世纪前，把羊毛纺成纱线是村里妇女的日常工作。\"],[\"The <b>spinning</b> wheel turns flax fibres into linen thread.\",\"纺车把亚麻纤维纺成亚麻线。\"]],\"cave\":[[\"Early humans painted animals on the walls of this <b>cave</b> more than ten thousand years ago.\",\"一万多年前，早期人类在这座洞穴的墙壁上绘制动物。\"],[\"Bats sleep in the <b>cave</b> during the day and hunt insects at night.\",\"蝙蝠白天在洞穴里睡觉，晚上捕食昆虫。\"]],\"sheet\":[[\"She changed the <b>sheet</b> on the bed and put the old one in the wash.\",\"她换了床上的床单，把旧的那条拿去洗。\"],[\"A thin <b>sheet</b> of ice covered the pond in the morning.\",\"早晨，池塘上覆盖着一层薄冰。\"]],\"adolescent\":[[\"The novel tells the story of an <b>adolescent</b> growing up in a small coastal town.\",\"这部小说讲述了一个青少年在沿海小镇长大的故事。\"],[\"<b>Adolescents</b> need more sleep than adults because their brains are still developing.\",\"青少年比成年人需要更多睡眠，因为他们的大脑仍在发育。\"]],\"moss\":[[\"Soft green <b>moss</b> covered the stones by the stream.\",\"柔软的绿色苔藓覆盖了溪边的石头。\"],[\"<b>Moss</b> grows best in damp, shady places where few other plants survive.\",\"苔藓在潮湿、阴凉、其他植物难以生存的地方生长得最好。\"]],\"resilient\":[[\"Children are remarkably <b>resilient</b>: most recover quickly from setbacks that would discourage adults.\",\"孩子们的韧性惊人：他们大多能迅速从会让成年人气馁的挫折中恢复过来。\"],[\"The <b>resilient</b> rubber returns to its original shape after being stretched.\",\"这种有韧性的橡胶在被拉伸后能恢复原状。\"]],\"ubiquitous\":[[\"Plastic has become <b>ubiquitous</b> in modern life, from packaging to clothing.\",\"塑料在现代生活中已无处不在，从包装到服装都有它。\"],[\"Coffee shops are <b>ubiquitous</b> in this city — there is one on almost every corner.\",\"这座城市里咖啡店无处不在——几乎每个街角都有一家。\"]],\"bias\":[[\"The study was designed to avoid <b>bias</b> by keeping the researchers unaware of which group each patient belonged to.\",\"这项研究的设计是为了避免偏见：让研究人员不知道每位病人属于哪一组。\"],[\"News reports can show <b>bias</b> in the stories they choose to cover.\",\"新闻报道在选择报道哪些事件时可能表现出偏见。\"]],\"arithmetic\":[[\"Mental <b>arithmetic</b> — adding and multiplying in your head — improves with practice.\",\"心算——在脑子里做加法和乘法——通过练习可以提高。\"],[\"The shopkeeper did the <b>arithmetic</b> on a scrap of paper and handed over the change.\",\"店主在一张小纸片上算了算账，把零钱递了过去。\"]],\"amusing\":[[\"He told an <b>amusing</b> story about getting lost in the desert with only a compass.\",\"他讲了一个有趣的故事：只带着一个指南针在沙漠里迷了路。\"],[\"The children found the clown's tricks very <b>amusing</b>.\",\"孩子们觉得小丑的把戏非常有趣。\"]],\"carp\":[[\"<b>Carp</b> can survive in muddy ponds where many other fish cannot.\",\"鲤鱼能在许多其他鱼无法生存的泥泞池塘里存活。\"],[\"In the temple pond, dozens of red <b>carp</b> gathered to be fed.\",\"寺庙的池塘里，几十条红鲤鱼聚集着等喂食。\"]],\"iron\":[[\"<b>Iron</b> rusts when it is exposed to water and air for a long time.\",\"铁长时间接触水和空气会生锈。\"],[\"The bridge was built of <b>iron</b> and stone in the 1880s.\",\"这座桥建于 19 世纪 80 年代，由铁和石头建成。\"]],\"shoe\":[[\"One <b>shoe</b> was muddy and the other was clean, because he had stepped in a puddle with only one foot.\",\"一只鞋沾满了泥，另一只很干净，因为他只有一只脚踩进了水坑。\"],[\"Trail <b>shoes</b> with thick soles protect your feet on rocky paths.\",\"鞋底厚的越野鞋能在多岩石的小路上保护你的脚。\"]],\"soccer\":[[\"<b>Soccer</b> is played with eleven players on each side and a round ball.\",\"足球每方十一名球员，使用一个圆球进行比赛。\"],[\"The <b>soccer</b> match ended in a draw after ninety minutes.\",\"九十分钟后，这场足球比赛以平局结束。\"]],\"nest\":[[\"The birds built their <b>nest</b> in the hollow of an old tree.\",\"鸟儿在一棵老树的树洞里筑了巢。\"],[\"A wasp <b>nest</b> hung from the branch above the path.\",\"一个黄蜂巢悬挂在小路上方的树枝上。\"]],\"gerbil\":[[\"The <b>gerbil</b> dug tunnels in the sand at the bottom of its cage.\",\"沙鼠在笼子底部的沙子里挖隧道。\"],[\"<b>Gerbils</b> come from desert regions and need very little water.\",\"沙鼠来自沙漠地区，需要的水很少。\"]],\"expression\":[[\"The <b>expression</b> 'raining cats and dogs' simply means raining heavily.\",\"“raining cats and dogs”这个表达的意思就是下大雨。\"],[\"Freedom of <b>expression</b> allows artists to criticise the government in their work.\",\"表达自由允许艺术家在作品中批评政府。\"]],\"beware\":[[\"Hikers should <b>beware</b> of sudden storms in the mountains.\",\"徒步者应该当心山里的突发暴风雨。\"],[\"<b>Beware</b> of emails asking for your password — they are almost always scams.\",\"当心要求你提供密码的电子邮件——它们几乎都是骗局。\"]],\"nevertheless\":[[\"The climb was long and dangerous; <b>nevertheless</b>, the team reached the summit by noon.\",\"攀登漫长而危险；不过，团队还是在中午到达了山顶。\"],[\"He had little experience. <b>Nevertheless</b>, he solved the problem faster than anyone else.\",\"他经验不多。不过，他比任何人都更快地解决了问题。\"]],\"encouragement\":[[\"With her teacher's <b>encouragement</b>, she entered the national speech contest.\",\"在老师的鼓励下，她参加了全国演讲比赛。\"],[\"The coach's <b>encouragement</b> helped the team keep going after two defeats.\",\"教练的鼓励帮助球队在两次失利后继续坚持。\"]],\"crustal\":[[\"<b>Crustal</b> movements along the fault slowly push the mountains higher.\",\"沿断层的地壳运动慢慢把山脉推得更高。\"],[\"Scientists study <b>crustal</b> rocks to learn how the continents formed.\",\"科学家研究地壳岩石，以了解大陆是如何形成的。\"]],\"chopstick\":[[\"He picked up the noodles with <b>chopsticks</b> in one smooth motion.\",\"他用筷子以一个流畅的动作夹起了面条。\"],[\"Learning to use <b>chopsticks</b> takes practice for most Western visitors.\",\"对大多数西方游客来说，学会用筷子需要练习。\"]],\"catalog\":[[\"Librarians <b>catalogued</b> every manuscript in the collection, noting its age and origin.\",\"图书管理员为收藏中的每份手稿编目，记录其年代和来源。\"],[\"The museum is <b>cataloguing</b> thousands of photographs donated by local families.\",\"博物馆正在为当地家庭捐赠的数千张照片编目。\"]],\"belch\":[[\"The baby <b>belched</b> loudly after finishing his bottle of milk.\",\"宝宝喝完一瓶奶后大声打嗝。\"],[\"He tried not to <b>belch</b> during the formal dinner, but the fizzy drink made it difficult.\",\"正式晚宴上他努力不打嗝，但碳酸饮料让他很难忍住。\"]],\"cashier\":[[\"The <b>cashier</b> counted the money twice before putting it in the register.\",\"收银员把钱数了两遍才放进收银机。\"],[\"She worked as a <b>cashier</b> in a supermarket while studying at night school.\",\"她一边在夜校学习，一边在超市当收银员。\"]],\"theology\":[[\"She studied <b>theology</b> at university, focusing on medieval religious texts.\",\"她在大学学习神学，专注于中世纪宗教文本。\"],[\"<b>Theology</b> and philosophy were taught together in medieval universities.\",\"在中世纪大学里，神学和哲学是一起教授的。\"]],\"squirrel\":[[\"The <b>squirrel</b> buried acorns in the garden to eat during winter.\",\"松鼠把橡子埋在花园里，以便冬天吃。\"],[\"A <b>squirrel</b> can leap from branch to branch without hesitation.\",\"松鼠可以毫不犹豫地在树枝间跳跃。\"]],\"accuse\":[[\"He was <b>accused</b> of stealing money from the office safe.\",\"他被指控从办公室保险箱里偷钱。\"],[\"The report <b>accuses</b> the company of ignoring safety warnings for years.\",\"这份报告指控该公司多年来忽视安全警告。\"]],\"beam\":[[\"The lighthouse <b>beams</b> its light across the water every few seconds.\",\"灯塔每隔几秒钟向水面发射光线。\"],[\"Sunlight <b>beamed</b> through the crack in the curtains.\",\"阳光从窗帘的缝隙中射了进来。\"]],\"announcement\":[[\"The <b>announcement</b> of the exam results will be made on Monday morning.\",\"考试成绩的公告将于周一上午发布。\"],[\"Passengers listened to the <b>announcement</b> about the delayed train.\",\"乘客们听着关于列车晚点的公告。\"]],\"ox\":[[\"In the past, farmers used an <b>ox</b> to pull the plough through heavy soil.\",\"过去，农民用牛拉犁穿过厚重的土壤。\"],[\"Two <b>oxen</b> pulled the cart up the hill.\",\"两头公牛拉着车上了山。\"]],\"accompany\":[[\"A nurse <b>accompanied</b> the patient to the operating room.\",\"一名护士陪伴病人前往手术室。\"],[\"The singer was <b>accompanied</b> on the piano by her teacher.\",\"这位歌手的演唱由她的老师用钢琴伴奏。\"]],\"arrangement\":[[\"The <b>arrangement</b> of chairs in a circle encouraged everyone to speak.\",\"椅子围成一圈的安排鼓励每个人发言。\"],[\"We made an <b>arrangement</b> to meet at the station at seven.\",\"我们安排好七点在车站见面。\"]],\"economy\":[[\"The country's <b>economy</b> grew slowly after the crisis.\",\"危机之后，这个国家的经济缓慢增长。\"],[\"Tourism is central to the island's <b>economy</b>, employing a third of its workers.\",\"旅游业是这座岛屿经济的核心，雇佣了三分之一的劳动力。\"]],\"chipmunk\":[[\"The <b>chipmunk</b> filled its cheek pouches with sunflower seeds.\",\"花栗鼠把向日葵籽塞满颊囊。\"],[\"<b>Chipmunks</b> store food in burrows to survive the long winter.\",\"花栗鼠把食物储存在洞里，以度过漫长的冬天。\"]],\"generate\":[[\"Wind turbines <b>generate</b> electricity without producing carbon dioxide.\",\"风力涡轮机发电时不产生二氧化碳。\"],[\"The discussion <b>generated</b> several new ideas for reducing waste.\",\"这次讨论产生了几个减少浪费的新想法。\"]],\"dynamite\":[[\"Workers used <b>dynamite</b> to blast a tunnel through the mountain.\",\"工人用炸药在山中炸出一条隧道。\"],[\"<b>Dynamite</b> made large mining and railway projects possible in the nineteenth century.\",\"炸药使十九世纪的大型采矿和铁路工程成为可能。\"]],\"termite\":[[\"<b>Termites</b> feed on wood and can damage the beams of a house.\",\"白蚁以木材为食，能损坏房屋的梁。\"],[\"A <b>termite</b> colony may contain millions of insects ruled by a single queen.\",\"一个白蚁群落可能包含数百万只昆虫，由一只蚁后统治。\"]],\"aesthetic\":[[\"The building's <b>aesthetic</b> combines clean modern lines with traditional materials.\",\"这座建筑的美学把简洁的现代线条与传统材料结合在一起。\"],[\"Japanese garden design follows an <b>aesthetic</b> of simplicity and balance.\",\"日本园林设计遵循简约与平衡的美学。\"]],\"act\":[[\"The Clean Air <b>Act</b> set strict limits on factory emissions.\",\"《清洁空气法案》对工厂排放设定了严格的限制。\"],[\"Parliament passed the <b>act</b> after a long and heated debate.\",\"经过漫长而激烈的辩论，议会通过了这项法案。\"]],\"civilize\":[[\"Education was once believed to <b>civilize</b> children by teaching them manners and reason.\",\"人们曾经认为，教育通过教孩子礼仪和理性使他们开化。\"],[\"Missionaries aimed to <b>civilize</b> the peoples they encountered, often erasing local customs instead.\",\"传教士旨在使他们遇到的人们文明化，却往往抹去了当地习俗。\"]],\"process\":[[\"Learning a language is a slow <b>process</b> that requires daily practice.\",\"学习语言是一个缓慢的过程，需要每天练习。\"],[\"The <b>process</b> of making cheese begins with heating the milk.\",\"制作奶酪的过程从加热牛奶开始。\"]],\"particle\":[[\"A <b>particle</b> of dust floated in the beam of sunlight.\",\"一粒尘埃在阳光的光束中漂浮。\"],[\"Physicists study <b>particles</b> smaller than atoms to understand the structure of matter.\",\"物理学家研究比原子更小的粒子，以理解物质的结构。\"]],\"zoo\":[[\"The <b>zoo's</b> new programme breeds endangered animals and returns them to the wild.\",\"这家动物园的新计划繁殖濒危动物并将它们放归野外。\"],[\"Children watched the elephants being fed at the <b>zoo</b>.\",\"孩子们在动物园看大象喂食。\"]],\"architecture\":[[\"She studied <b>architecture</b> because she wanted to design public libraries.\",\"她学习建筑学，因为她想设计公共图书馆。\"],[\"The <b>architecture</b> of the old town mixes Gothic churches with modern glass towers.\",\"这座老城的建筑风格混合了哥特式教堂和现代玻璃塔楼。\"]],\"murder\":[[\"The detective found fresh evidence that changed the <b>murder</b> investigation completely.\",\"侦探找到了新证据，彻底改变了这起谋杀案的调查。\"],[\"He was sentenced to life in prison for the <b>murder</b> of his business partner.\",\"他因谋杀商业伙伴被判终身监禁。\"]],\"thumb\":[[\"He hurt his <b>thumb</b> catching the baseball without a glove.\",\"他没戴手套接棒球，伤了拇指。\"],[\"The baby sucked her <b>thumb</b> as she fell asleep.\",\"宝宝睡着时吮着拇指。\"]],\"analysis\":[[\"The <b>analysis</b> of the water samples showed traces of lead.\",\"对水样的分析显示有微量铅。\"],[\"A careful <b>analysis</b> of the data revealed a pattern nobody had noticed.\",\"对数据的仔细分析揭示了一个没人注意到的规律。\"]],\"likewise\":[[\"Plants need sunlight to grow, and animals <b>likewise</b> depend on it through the food chain.\",\"植物需要阳光生长，动物同样通过食物链依赖阳光。\"],[\"He apologised, and his brother did <b>likewise</b>.\",\"他道了歉，他的兄弟也同样道了歉。\"]],\"allowance\":[[\"The company pays a monthly travel <b>allowance</b> to its sales staff.\",\"公司每月向销售人员支付交通津贴。\"],[\"As a student, he lived on a small monthly <b>allowance</b> from his parents.\",\"作为学生，他靠父母每月给的一点津贴生活。\"]],\"ambition\":[[\"Her <b>ambition</b> was to become the first surgeon in her family.\",\"她的雄心是成为家里第一位外科医生。\"],[\"The young officer's <b>ambition</b> led him to volunteer for the hardest missions.\",\"这位年轻军官的雄心使他主动请缨执行最艰难的任务。\"]],\"beat\":[[\"Our team <b>beat</b> the champions by two goals in the final.\",\"在决赛中，我们队以两球击败了卫冕冠军。\"],[\"She <b>beat</b> players far more experienced than herself to win the title.\",\"她击败了比自己经验丰富得多的选手，赢得了冠军。\"]],\"skiing\":[[\"<b>Skiing</b> in fresh powder snow is very different from skiing on ice.\",\"在新鲜的粉雪中滑雪与在冰面上滑雪非常不同。\"],[\"He broke his leg <b>skiing</b> and spent the rest of the winter on crutches.\",\"他滑雪时摔断了腿，整个冬天剩下的时间都拄着拐杖。\"]],\"ensemble\":[[\"The <b>ensemble</b> of twelve musicians performed without a conductor.\",\"这个十二人合奏团在没有指挥的情况下演出。\"],[\"A string <b>ensemble</b> played softly in the corner of the hall.\",\"一个弦乐合奏团在大厅的角落里轻声演奏。\"]],\"bead\":[[\"The bride's dress was <b>beaded</b> by hand, a task that took the tailor three weeks.\",\"新娘的礼服是手工用珠装饰的，裁缝花了三周时间。\"],[\"Artisans <b>beaded</b> the edges of the leather bags with tiny glass beads.\",\"工匠用小玻璃珠装饰这些皮包的边缘。\"]],\"password\":[[\"Never share your <b>password</b>, even with someone who claims to work for the bank.\",\"永远不要分享你的密码，即使对方声称是银行工作人员。\"],[\"The system asks users to change their <b>password</b> every ninety days.\",\"该系统要求用户每九十天更改一次密码。\"]],\"capsule\":[[\"The <b>capsule</b> contains powder that dissolves slowly in the stomach.\",\"这粒胶囊含有在胃中缓慢溶解的粉末。\"],[\"He found <b>capsules</b> easier to swallow than large tablets.\",\"他发现胶囊比大药片更容易吞咽。\"]],\"barrel\":[[\"The workers <b>barreled</b> the olive oil for shipping overseas.\",\"工人们把橄榄油装桶，以便运往海外。\"],[\"Whisky is <b>barreled</b> and left to age for at least three years.\",\"威士忌被装入桶中，至少陈放三年。\"]],\"screw\":[[\"He tightened the <b>screw</b> with a small screwdriver.\",\"他用一把小螺丝刀拧紧了螺丝。\"],[\"A loose <b>screw</b> made the chair wobble.\",\"一颗松动的螺丝使椅子摇晃。\"]],\"spider\":[[\"The <b>spider</b> spun a web between two branches to catch flying insects.\",\"蜘蛛在两根树枝之间织网，捕捉飞虫。\"],[\"Most <b>spiders</b> are harmless to humans and help control pests.\",\"大多数蜘蛛对人类无害，并有助于控制害虫。\"]],\"constant\":[[\"The patient's condition requires <b>constant</b> monitoring by the nurses.\",\"这位病人的病情需要护士持续监测。\"],[\"A <b>constant</b> supply of fresh water is essential for the fish farm.\",\"持续供应新鲜水对养鱼场至关重要。\"]],\"ketchup\":[[\"He put <b>ketchup</b> on his fries and a little on the burger as well.\",\"他在薯条上放了番茄酱，汉堡上也放了一点。\"],[\"Homemade <b>ketchup</b> tastes fresher than the bottled kind.\",\"自制的番茄酱比瓶装的味道更新鲜。\"]],\"husk\":[[\"Before cooking, remove the <b>husk</b> and the silky threads from the corn.\",\"烹饪前，把玉米的外壳和玉米须去掉。\"],[\"Rice <b>husks</b> are sometimes burned as fuel in rural areas.\",\"稻壳有时在农村地区被当作燃料烧掉。\"]],\"criminal\":[[\"The <b>criminal</b> was caught on camera entering the bank at midnight.\",\"这名罪犯在午夜进入银行时被摄像头拍到。\"],[\"Police shared the <b>criminal's</b> photograph with stations across the country.\",\"警方把这名罪犯的照片发给了全国各地的警局。\"]],\"combustion\":[[\"<b>Combustion</b> of coal releases carbon dioxide and other gases into the air.\",\"煤的燃烧向空气中释放二氧化碳和其他气体。\"],[\"An engine depends on the controlled <b>combustion</b> of fuel in its cylinders.\",\"发动机依赖于燃料在其气缸中的受控燃烧。\"]],\"apathetic\":[[\"Voters were <b>apathetic</b> about the local election, and turnout was the lowest in decades.\",\"选民对地方选举冷漠，投票率是几十年来最低的。\"],[\"He seemed <b>apathetic</b>, showing no interest in the team's success or failure.\",\"他显得很冷漠，对团队的成败毫无兴趣。\"]],\"construe\":[[\"His silence was <b>construed</b> as agreement, although he had meant to object.\",\"他的沉默被解释为同意，尽管他本想反对。\"],[\"Lawyers disagreed about how to <b>construe</b> this clause of the contract.\",\"律师们对如何解释合同的这一条款意见不一。\"]],\"acquisition\":[[\"The <b>acquisition</b> of the smaller company doubled the firm's market share.\",\"对这家小公司的收购使该公司的市场份额翻了一番。\"],[\"News of the <b>acquisition</b> pushed the company's share price up sharply.\",\"收购的消息使公司股价大幅上涨。\"]],\"leopard\":[[\"The <b>leopard</b> dragged its prey up into a tree to keep it away from hyenas.\",\"豹把猎物拖到树上，以防鬣狗抢走。\"],[\"A <b>leopard's</b> spotted coat helps it hide in dappled sunlight.\",\"豹子带斑点的皮毛帮助它在斑驳的阳光下隐藏。\"]],\"concoct\":[[\"He <b>concocted</b> an excuse about a train delay, but nobody believed him.\",\"他编造了一个火车晚点的借口，但没人相信他。\"],[\"The witnesses <b>concocted</b> the whole story to protect the real thief.\",\"证人们编造了整个故事来保护真正的窃贼。\"]],\"dustpan\":[[\"She swept the broken glass into a <b>dustpan</b> and emptied it into the bin.\",\"她把碎玻璃扫进簸箕，倒进垃圾桶。\"],[\"The <b>dustpan</b> hangs on a hook next to the broom in the kitchen.\",\"簸箕挂在厨房里扫帚旁边的钩子上。\"]],\"breeze\":[[\"A cool <b>breeze</b> came off the sea and relieved the afternoon heat.\",\"一阵凉爽的微风从海上吹来，缓解了午后的炎热。\"],[\"The curtains moved gently in the <b>breeze</b> from the open window.\",\"窗帘在从开着的窗户吹进的微风中轻轻摆动。\"]],\"prescription\":[[\"The doctor wrote a <b>prescription</b> for antibiotics and told him to rest.\",\"医生开了一张抗生素处方，并嘱咐他休息。\"],[\"This medicine is available only on <b>prescription</b>.\",\"这种药只能凭处方购买。\"]],\"tax\":[[\"Citizens pay <b>tax</b> on their income to fund schools, roads and hospitals.\",\"公民就收入缴税，以资助学校、道路和医院。\"],[\"The government raised the <b>tax</b> on cigarettes to discourage smoking.\",\"政府提高了香烟税，以劝阻吸烟。\"]],\"twist\":[[\"She <b>twisted</b> the wet towel to squeeze out the water.\",\"她拧了拧湿毛巾，把水挤出来。\"],[\"The road <b>twists</b> through the mountains, with a new view at every turn.\",\"这条路在山间蜿蜒曲折，每个转弯都有新的风景。\"]],\"abandon\":[[\"The sailors had to <b>abandon</b> the sinking ship and climb into lifeboats.\",\"水手们不得不弃船，爬进救生艇。\"],[\"She never <b>abandoned</b> her plan to become a doctor, even after failing the exam twice.\",\"即使两次考试落榜，她也从未放弃当医生的计划。\"]],\"adaptability\":[[\"The fox's <b>adaptability</b> allows it to live in forests, deserts and even cities.\",\"狐狸的适应性使它能在森林、沙漠甚至城市中生存。\"],[\"Employers value <b>adaptability</b> because jobs change quickly with new technology.\",\"雇主重视适应能力，因为新技术让工作变化很快。\"]],\"alleged\":[[\"The <b>alleged</b> thief was arrested but released when no evidence was found.\",\"那名所谓的小偷被逮捕，但在没有找到证据后被释放了。\"],[\"Police are examining the <b>alleged</b> crime scene for fingerprints.\",\"警方正在检查这个据称的犯罪现场，寻找指纹。\"]],\"amber\":[[\"Ancient insects are sometimes found preserved in <b>amber</b>, hardened tree resin millions of years old.\",\"古代昆虫有时会被发现封存在琥珀里——那是数百万年前硬化的树脂。\"],[\"The traffic light turned <b>amber</b>, warning drivers to prepare to stop.\",\"交通灯变成琥珀色（黄灯），提醒司机准备停车。\"]],\"annoyance\":[[\"The constant noise from the construction site was a daily <b>annoyance</b> for residents.\",\"建筑工地没完没了的噪音让居民们每天都烦恼不已。\"],[\"To his <b>annoyance</b>, the train was cancelled for the second day in a row.\",\"让他恼火的是，火车连续第二天被取消了。\"]],\"anthem\":[[\"The crowd stood and sang the national <b>anthem</b> before the match.\",\"比赛前，观众起立齐唱国歌。\"],[\"At the medal ceremony, the winner's <b>anthem</b> was played as the flag rose.\",\"在颁奖仪式上，随着国旗升起，奏响了冠军国家的国歌。\"]],\"archer\":[[\"The <b>archer</b> drew his bow, aimed carefully, and hit the centre of the target.\",\"弓箭手拉开弓，仔细瞄准，正中靶心。\"],[\"In the legend, a young <b>archer</b> shoots an apple off his own son's head.\",\"传说中，一位年轻弓箭手射中了自己儿子头顶的苹果。\"]],\"assign\":[[\"The teacher <b>assigned</b> each student a different topic for the presentation.\",\"老师给每个学生分配了不同的演讲题目。\"],[\"Two officers were <b>assigned</b> to guard the entrance.\",\"两名警员被派去守卫入口。\"]],\"assorted\":[[\"The box contained <b>assorted</b> chocolates of many different flavours.\",\"盒子里装着各种口味的什锦巧克力。\"],[\"She bought a bag of <b>assorted</b> screws and nails for small repairs at home.\",\"她买了一袋各种型号的螺丝和钉子，用来做家里的小修小补。\"]],\"authentic\":[[\"The museum confirmed that the painting is an <b>authentic</b> work from the seventeenth century.\",\"博物馆确认这幅画是十七世纪的真品。\"],[\"Tourists love the small restaurant because it serves <b>authentic</b> local food.\",\"游客喜欢这家小餐馆，因为它供应地道的本地菜。\"]],\"bilingual\":[[\"She grew up <b>bilingual</b>, speaking Spanish at home and English at school.\",\"她从小双语长大，在家说西班牙语，在学校说英语。\"],[\"The museum provides <b>bilingual</b> labels in French and English next to every exhibit.\",\"博物馆在每件展品旁都提供法英双语说明牌。\"]],\"blemish\":[[\"One act of dishonesty can <b>blemish</b> a politician's reputation for years.\",\"一次不诚实的行为就能玷污一位政客多年的声誉。\"],[\"The scandal <b>blemished</b> the company's image, and sales fell soon after.\",\"这桩丑闻损害了公司的形象，销量随即下跌。\"]],\"bored\":[[\"The students grew <b>bored</b> during the long lecture and began checking their phones.\",\"学生们在冗长的讲座中感到无聊，开始看手机。\"],[\"He was <b>bored</b> with the same routine and decided to learn a new skill.\",\"他厌倦了千篇一律的日常，决定学一门新手艺。\"]],\"bromine\":[[\"<b>Bromine</b> is a reddish-brown liquid element that gives off a strong, unpleasant vapour.\",\"溴是一种红棕色的液态元素，会散发出强烈刺鼻的蒸气。\"],[\"Compounds of <b>bromine</b> were once widely used in photography and medicines.\",\"溴的化合物曾广泛用于摄影和药物。\"]],\"carve\":[[\"The artist used a sharp knife to <b>carve</b> the block of wood into a horse.\",\"艺术家用锋利的刀把一块木头雕成一匹马。\"],[\"He <b>carved</b> his name into the tree trunk when he was twelve.\",\"他十二岁时把自己的名字刻在了树干上。\"]],\"chant\":[[\"The crowd began to <b>chant</b> the team's name as the players ran out.\",\"球员们跑出场时，人群开始齐声高喊球队的名字。\"],[\"Monks <b>chant</b> the scriptures every morning before dawn.\",\"僧侣们每天黎明前唱诵经文。\"]],\"characterize\":[[\"Thick forests and heavy rain <b>characterize</b> the climate of this coastal region.\",\"茂密的森林和充沛的雨水是这一沿海地区气候的特征。\"],[\"The biologist <b>characterized</b> the new species by its striped tail and nocturnal habits.\",\"生物学家以条纹尾巴和夜间活动习性来描绘这一新物种的特征。\"]],\"chin\":[[\"He rested his <b>chin</b> on his hand and stared out of the window.\",\"他用手托着下巴，望着窗外发呆。\"],[\"The boxer took a hard punch to the <b>chin</b> in the final round.\",\"那名拳击手在最后一回合下巴挨了一记重拳。\"]],\"choke\":[[\"The baby started to <b>choke</b> on a grape, and her mother quickly patted her back.\",\"婴儿被一颗葡萄噎住了，她妈妈赶紧拍她的后背。\"],[\"Thick smoke from the fire made the firefighters <b>choke</b> and cough.\",\"大火的浓烟呛得消防员直咳嗽。\"]],\"contemplate\":[[\"She sat by the lake to <b>contemplate</b> her future after graduation.\",\"她坐在湖边沉思毕业后的未来。\"],[\"The committee is <b>contemplating</b> a change to the exam system.\",\"委员会正在认真考虑改革考试制度。\"]],\"creativity\":[[\"The art teacher encouraged <b>creativity</b> by letting students design their own projects.\",\"美术老师让学生自己设计课题，以鼓励创造力。\"],[\"Good engineers need <b>creativity</b> as well as technical knowledge.\",\"优秀的工程师既需要技术知识，也需要创造力。\"]],\"crow\":[[\"A <b>crow</b> perched on the fence, watching the farmers work in the field.\",\"一只乌鸦停在栅栏上，看着农民们在地里干活。\"],[\"<b>Crows</b> are intelligent birds that can use sticks as tools to reach food.\",\"乌鸦是聪明的鸟类，能用树枝当工具够取食物。\"]],\"device\":[[\"This small <b>device</b> measures the air pressure and temperature at the same time.\",\"这个小装置能同时测量气压和温度。\"],[\"Doctors implanted a <b>device</b> in the patient's chest to control his heartbeat.\",\"医生在病人胸腔里植入了一个装置来控制他的心跳。\"]],\"dimension\":[[\"The room's <b>dimensions</b> are five metres by four, just big enough for two desks.\",\"这个房间的尺寸是五米乘四米，刚好放得下两张书桌。\"],[\"Physicists sometimes describe time as a fourth <b>dimension</b>, alongside the three dimensions of space.\",\"物理学家有时把时间描述为第四个维度，与空间的三个维度并列。\"]],\"direction\":[[\"The wind changed <b>direction</b> and blew the smoke back towards the town.\",\"风向变了，把烟又吹回了镇子的方向。\"],[\"She asked a police officer for <b>directions</b> to the nearest station.\",\"她向一名警察问去最近车站的路。\"]],\"employee\":[[\"The company gives every <b>employee</b> two weeks of paid holiday a year.\",\"公司每年给每位雇员两周带薪假期。\"],[\"A former <b>employee</b> leaked the secret documents to a newspaper.\",\"一名前雇员把秘密文件泄露给了报社。\"]],\"ephemeral\":[[\"Mayflies are truly <b>ephemeral</b>: the adults live for only a day or two.\",\"蜉蝣确实朝生暮死：成虫只活一两天。\"],[\"Fame on social media can be <b>ephemeral</b>, forgotten within a week.\",\"社交媒体上的名气可能转瞬即逝，一周内就被遗忘。\"]],\"escort\":[[\"Two police officers acted as <b>escorts</b> for the visiting president's car.\",\"两名警员担任来访总统座车的护送者。\"],[\"The prisoner was led into the courtroom by a guard acting as his <b>escort</b>.\",\"囚犯由一名担任护送者的警卫带进法庭。\"]],\"exhibition\":[[\"The museum is holding an <b>exhibition</b> of photographs from the early twentieth century.\",\"博物馆正在举办一场二十世纪早期的摄影展览。\"],[\"Thousands of visitors came to the trade <b>exhibition</b> to see the newest farm machines.\",\"成千上万的参观者来到贸易展览会，观看最新式的农用机械。\"]],\"extravagance\":[[\"The palace was built with such <b>extravagance</b> that even the door handles were made of gold.\",\"这座宫殿修建得极尽奢侈，连门把手都是金子做的。\"],[\"Buying a third sports car was pure <b>extravagance</b> for a man who rarely drove.\",\"对一个很少开车的人来说，再买第三辆跑车纯粹是铺张浪费。\"]],\"gradual\":[[\"Recovery was slow and <b>gradual</b>, but each week she could walk a little further.\",\"康复缓慢而渐进，但她每周都能多走一点。\"],[\"A <b>gradual</b> warming of the climate changed the kinds of plants that could grow there.\",\"气候逐渐变暖改变了能在那里生长的植物种类。\"]],\"marsh\":[[\"Herons and frogs live in the <b>marsh</b> at the edge of the lake.\",\"苍鹭和青蛙栖息在湖边的沼泽里。\"],[\"The path crosses a wet <b>marsh</b>, so walkers need waterproof boots.\",\"这条小路穿过一片潮湿的沼泽，行人需要防水靴。\"]],\"melody\":[[\"The song's simple <b>melody</b> was easy for children to sing along with.\",\"这首歌旋律简单，孩子们很容易跟着唱。\"],[\"He whistled a cheerful <b>melody</b> while he worked in the garden.\",\"他在花园里干活时，吹着口哨哼着欢快的旋律。\"]],\"mutton\":[[\"The stew is made with <b>mutton</b>, potatoes and carrots, and cooks slowly for hours.\",\"这道炖菜用羊肉、土豆和胡萝卜做，要慢炖几个小时。\"],[\"In the market, <b>mutton</b> costs more than pork but less than beef.\",\"在市场上，羊肉比猪肉贵，但比牛肉便宜。\"]],\"oasis\":[[\"After days in the desert, the travellers finally reached an <b>oasis</b> with palm trees and fresh water.\",\"在沙漠里走了几天后，旅行者们终于到达一片有棕榈树和淡水的绿洲。\"],[\"The small park is an <b>oasis</b> of calm in the middle of the noisy city.\",\"这座小公园是喧闹城市中一片宁静的绿洲。\"]],\"oboe\":[[\"The <b>oboe</b> gives the tuning note before an orchestral concert begins.\",\"双簧管在管弦乐音乐会开始前吹出定音音高。\"],[\"She practised the <b>oboe</b> for an hour every morning before school.\",\"她每天早上上学前练一小时双簧管。\"]],\"protagonist\":[[\"The <b>protagonist</b> of the novel is a young sailor who crosses the Atlantic alone.\",\"这部小说的主角是一名独自横渡大西洋的年轻水手。\"],[\"In the film, the <b>protagonist</b> must choose between her family and her career.\",\"在影片中，主角必须在家庭和事业之间作出选择。\"]],\"quota\":[[\"The country set a <b>quota</b> on imported cars to protect its own industry.\",\"该国对进口汽车设定配额，以保护本国工业。\"],[\"Each fisherman has a monthly <b>quota</b> limiting how many fish he may catch.\",\"每位渔民都有月度配额，限制他可以捕捞的鱼量。\"]],\"retreat\":[[\"The army was forced to <b>retreat</b> after its supply lines were cut.\",\"补给线被切断后，军队被迫撤退。\"],[\"As the tide began to <b>retreat</b>, pools of water were left among the rocks.\",\"潮水开始退去时，岩石间留下了一个个水洼。\"]],\"scepter\":[[\"The king held a golden <b>scepter</b> in his right hand during the ceremony.\",\"仪式上，国王右手握着一根金色权杖。\"],[\"In the painting, the queen's crown and <b>scepter</b> symbolise her royal power.\",\"画中女王的王冠和权杖象征着她的王权。\"]],\"server\":[[\"When the company's <b>server</b> crashed, nobody could open their email.\",\"公司服务器宕机时，谁都打不开邮箱。\"],[\"The game stores each player's progress on a central <b>server</b>.\",\"这款游戏把每个玩家的进度存放在中央服务器上。\"]],\"sow\":[[\"The farmer keeps one <b>sow</b> that gives birth to about ten piglets each spring.\",\"农夫养着一头母猪，每年春天产下大约十只小猪。\"],[\"The <b>sow</b> lay in the mud while her piglets drank her milk.\",\"母猪躺在泥里，小猪们在吃它的奶。\"]],\"soybean\":[[\"Farmers in this region grow <b>soybeans</b> and corn in rotation.\",\"这个地区的农民轮种大豆和玉米。\"],[\"Tofu and soy sauce are both made from the <b>soybean</b>.\",\"豆腐和酱油都是用大豆制成的。\"]],\"stage\":[[\"The singer walked onto the <b>stage</b> and the audience began to clap.\",\"歌手走上舞台，观众开始鼓掌。\"],[\"Actors were rehearsing on <b>stage</b> while carpenters built the scenery behind them.\",\"演员们在舞台上排练，木匠在他们身后搭建布景。\"]],\"tactile\":[[\"Blind readers rely on <b>tactile</b> dots to read Braille with their fingertips.\",\"盲人读者靠触觉凸点用指尖阅读盲文。\"],[\"The museum's <b>tactile</b> exhibit lets children feel the rough skin of a model dinosaur.\",\"博物馆的触觉展区让孩子们亲手摸一摸模型恐龙粗糙的皮肤。\"]],\"therapy\":[[\"After the accident, he needed months of physical <b>therapy</b> to walk again.\",\"事故之后，他需要几个月的物理治疗才能重新走路。\"],[\"Speech <b>therapy</b> helped the child pronounce difficult sounds clearly.\",\"言语治疗帮助这个孩子把难发的音说清楚。\"]],\"toad\":[[\"A <b>toad</b> sat under the garden stones, waiting for insects to pass by.\",\"一只蟾蜍蹲在花园的石头下面，等着昆虫经过。\"],[\"Unlike frogs, <b>toads</b> have dry, warty skin and live mostly on land.\",\"与青蛙不同，蟾蜍的皮肤干燥多疣，主要生活在陆地上。\"]],\"tumor\":[[\"Doctors found a small <b>tumor</b> in his lung and removed it by surgery.\",\"医生在他肺部发现了一个小肿瘤，并通过手术切除了它。\"],[\"Tests showed the <b>tumor</b> was not cancerous, to the family's great relief.\",\"检查显示肿瘤不是恶性的，全家人大大松了一口气。\"]],\"underwear\":[[\"He packed clean <b>underwear</b> and socks for the three-day trip.\",\"他为三天的旅行收拾了干净的内衣和袜子。\"],[\"Thermal <b>underwear</b> keeps hikers warm in freezing mountain weather.\",\"保暖内衣能让徒步者在严寒的山地天气里保持温暖。\"]],\"unemployment\":[[\"When the factory closed, <b>unemployment</b> in the town rose sharply.\",\"工厂关闭后，镇上的失业率急剧上升。\"],[\"The government created training programmes to reduce long-term <b>unemployment</b>.\",\"政府设立了培训项目，以减少长期失业。\"]],\"aim\":[[\"The new law <b>aims</b> to reduce air pollution in large cities.\",\"这项新法律旨在减少大城市的空气污染。\"],[\"The course <b>aims</b> at giving students practical laboratory skills.\",\"这门课程旨在给予学生实用的实验室技能。\"]],\"alcohol\":[[\"The doctor advised him to stop drinking <b>alcohol</b> for the sake of his liver.\",\"医生建议他为了肝脏健康戒酒（酒精饮料）。\"],[\"Hand sanitiser contains <b>alcohol</b>, which kills most bacteria on the skin.\",\"洗手液含有酒精，能杀死皮肤上的大多数细菌。\"]],\"aluminum\":[[\"<b>Aluminum</b> is light and does not rust, so it is widely used in aircraft.\",\"铝很轻且不生锈，因此广泛用于飞机。\"],[\"She wrapped the sandwiches in <b>aluminum</b> foil to keep them fresh.\",\"她用铝箔把三明治包起来保鲜。\"]],\"amaze\":[[\"The speed of the young chess player <b>amazed</b> even the grandmasters.\",\"这位年轻棋手的速度连特级大师都感到惊奇。\"],[\"It <b>amazes</b> me how much a baby learns in its first year.\",\"婴儿在第一年里学到这么多东西，真让我惊奇。\"]],\"amiable\":[[\"Our host was an <b>amiable</b> man who made every guest feel at home.\",\"我们的主人是个和蔼可亲的人，让每位客人都宾至如归。\"],[\"She has an <b>amiable</b> smile that puts nervous students at ease.\",\"她笑容亲切，让紧张的学生放松下来。\"]],\"appoint\":[[\"The university will <b>appoint</b> a new president next month.\",\"大学下个月将任命一位新校长。\"],[\"She was <b>appointed</b> head of the research team.\",\"她被任命为研究团队的负责人。\"]],\"asphalt\":[[\"Workers spread hot <b>asphalt</b> over the road and rolled it flat.\",\"工人们把滚烫的沥青铺在路上，再碾压平整。\"],[\"In summer, the <b>asphalt</b> on the playground softens under the hot sun.\",\"夏天，操场上的沥青在烈日下会变软。\"]],\"author\":[[\"The <b>author</b> of the novel spent ten years researching its historical background.\",\"这部小说的作者花了十年研究其历史背景。\"],[\"Each student must name the <b>author</b> of every source used in the essay.\",\"每个学生必须在论文中注明所用每份资料的作者。\"]],\"bass\":[[\"He caught a large <b>bass</b> in the lake and released it back into the water.\",\"他在湖里钓到一条大鲈鱼，又把它放回了水里。\"],[\"<b>Bass</b> are popular game fish in North American lakes and rivers.\",\"鲈鱼是北美湖泊河流中受欢迎的垂钓鱼种。\"]],\"beg\":[[\"The hungry man <b>begged</b> passers-by for a few coins.\",\"那个饥饿的男子向路人乞求几个硬币。\"],[\"She <b>begged</b> her parents to let her keep the stray puppy.\",\"她恳求父母让她收养那只流浪小狗。\"]],\"besiege\":[[\"The enemy army <b>besieged</b> the city for six months, cutting off its food supply.\",\"敌军围攻这座城市六个月，切断了它的粮食供应。\"],[\"Reporters <b>besieged</b> the actor with questions as he left the airport.\",\"演员走出机场时，记者们围住他连珠炮似地提问。\"]],\"brass\":[[\"The door handles are made of polished <b>brass</b>.\",\"门把手是抛光黄铜做的。\"],[\"Trumpets and trombones belong to the <b>brass</b> section of the orchestra.\",\"小号和长号属于管弦乐队的铜管声部。\"]],\"cabinet\":[[\"The prime minister met with her <b>cabinet</b> to discuss the budget.\",\"首相与她的内阁开会讨论预算。\"],[\"After the election, several <b>cabinet</b> ministers resigned.\",\"选举之后，几位内阁大臣辞职了。\"]],\"ceiling\":[[\"The old hall has a high <b>ceiling</b> painted with scenes from ancient stories.\",\"这座老礼堂天花板很高，上面绘着古代故事场景。\"],[\"A lamp hangs from the <b>ceiling</b> above the dining table.\",\"餐桌上方的天花板上吊着一盏灯。\"]],\"congratulate\":[[\"I <b>congratulated</b> her on winning the science prize.\",\"我祝贺她赢得了科学奖。\"],[\"The coach <b>congratulated</b> the team after their surprise victory.\",\"球队意外获胜后，教练向全队表示祝贺。\"]],\"constituent\":[[\"Water is a <b>constituent</b> of every living cell.\",\"水是每个活细胞的组成部分。\"],[\"The chemist analysed the powder to identify each <b>constituent</b>.\",\"化学家分析这种粉末，以确定它的各个组成部分。\"]],\"contrary\":[[\"<b>Contrary</b> to popular belief, bats are not blind.\",\"与普遍看法相反，蝙蝠并不是瞎的。\"],[\"The two brothers hold <b>contrary</b> opinions on almost every political question.\",\"两兄弟在几乎每个政治问题上都持相反意见。\"]],\"crack\":[[\"The ice on the lake began to <b>crack</b> as the temperature rose.\",\"气温上升时，湖面上的冰开始破裂。\"],[\"He dropped the cup, and the handle <b>cracked</b> off.\",\"他把杯子摔了，杯柄裂断了。\"]],\"displacement\":[[\"In the experiment, the <b>displacement</b> of the object was measured in centimetres from its starting point.\",\"实验中，物体的位移以厘米为单位，从其起点量起。\"],[\"The physics problem asks students to calculate the car's <b>displacement</b>, not the total distance it travelled.\",\"这道物理题要求学生计算汽车的位移，而不是它行驶的总路程。\"]],\"dough\":[[\"She kneaded the <b>dough</b> for ten minutes before shaping it into a loaf.\",\"她把面团揉了十分钟，然后整形成一条面包。\"],[\"Leave the <b>dough</b> in a warm place so that it can rise.\",\"把面团放在温暖的地方让它发酵。\"]],\"enhancement\":[[\"The new camera offers a clear <b>enhancement</b> in image quality at night.\",\"这款新相机在夜间成像质量上有明显增强。\"],[\"Software updates brought several <b>enhancements</b> to the phone's battery life.\",\"软件更新给手机续航带来了几处增强。\"]],\"enlightenment\":[[\"The <b>Enlightenment</b> encouraged people to question tradition and trust reason.\",\"启蒙运动鼓励人们质疑传统、相信理性。\"],[\"Thinkers of the <b>Enlightenment</b>, such as Voltaire, defended freedom of speech.\",\"伏尔泰等启蒙思想家捍卫言论自由。\"]],\"estrangement\":[[\"Years without contact led to a deep <b>estrangement</b> between the two brothers.\",\"多年不联系导致两兄弟之间深深的疏远。\"],[\"The novel describes a wife's growing <b>estrangement</b> from her husband.\",\"小说描写了一位妻子与丈夫日益加深的疏远。\"]],\"exaltation\":[[\"The general received the nation's highest <b>exaltation</b> for his service.\",\"这位将军因功绩获得了国家最高赞誉。\"],[\"Poets wrote verses in <b>exaltation</b> of the young king.\",\"诗人们写下诗篇，赞誉这位年轻的国王。\"]],\"firefly\":[[\"On summer nights, <b>fireflies</b> blink in the grass beside the river.\",\"夏夜里，萤火虫在河边的草丛中一闪一闪。\"],[\"A <b>firefly</b> produces light in its abdomen through a chemical reaction.\",\"萤火虫通过腹部的一种化学反应发光。\"]],\"grasshopper\":[[\"A <b>grasshopper</b> can jump twenty times the length of its own body.\",\"蚱蜢能跳出自身体长二十倍的距离。\"],[\"In summer, <b>grasshoppers</b> chirp in the meadows by rubbing their legs together.\",\"夏天，蚱蜢在草地上摩擦腿部发出唧唧声。\"]],\"hardware\":[[\"The computer store sells both software and <b>hardware</b>, such as keyboards and printers.\",\"这家电脑店既卖软件，也卖键盘、打印机等硬件。\"],[\"A faster processor is a piece of <b>hardware</b> that can speed up the whole machine.\",\"更快的处理器是能让整台机器提速的硬件。\"]],\"implement\":[[\"The school decided to <b>implement</b> the new timetable in September.\",\"学校决定在九月实施新的课程表。\"],[\"It took two years to <b>implement</b> the plan for cleaner rivers.\",\"实施这项河流清洁计划花了两年时间。\"]],\"intersection\":[[\"Two cars collided at the <b>intersection</b> because the traffic light was broken.\",\"因为交通灯坏了，两辆车在十字路口相撞。\"],[\"Turn left at the next <b>intersection</b> and the library will be on your right.\",\"在下一个十字路口左转，图书馆就在你的右手边。\"]],\"invest\":[[\"They <b>invested</b> most of their savings in government bonds.\",\"他们把大部分积蓄投资于政府债券。\"],[\"The city will <b>invest</b> in new buses and repair the roads.\",\"这座城市将投资购置新公交车并维修道路。\"]],\"lion\":[[\"A male <b>lion</b> can weigh more than 180 kilograms.\",\"一头雄狮体重可达 180 公斤以上。\"],[\"The <b>lion</b> rested in the shade while the females hunted.\",\"狮子在树荫下休息，母狮们则出去捕猎。\"]],\"maintain\":[[\"It is expensive to <b>maintain</b> an old house; something always needs repair.\",\"维护一座老房子很花钱，总有东西要修。\"],[\"The pilot struggled to <b>maintain</b> control of the plane in the storm.\",\"飞行员在暴风雨中努力保持对飞机的控制。\"]],\"notion\":[[\"The lecture challenged the common <b>notion</b> that sharks are mindless killers.\",\"这场讲座挑战了鲨鱼是无意识杀手的普遍观念。\"],[\"She had no <b>notion</b> of how expensive life in the capital would be.\",\"她完全没概念首都的生活开销会这么大。\"]],\"nucleus\":[[\"The <b>nucleus</b> of an atom contains protons and neutrons.\",\"原子核里包含质子和中子。\"],[\"Almost all of an atom's mass is concentrated in its tiny <b>nucleus</b>.\",\"原子几乎全部的质量都集中在它微小的原子核里。\"]],\"organic\":[[\"The farm grows <b>organic</b> vegetables without chemical fertilisers.\",\"这家农场种植不用化肥的有机蔬菜。\"],[\"<b>Organic</b> matter in the soil, such as decayed leaves, feeds the plants.\",\"土壤中的有机质，比如腐烂的树叶，能为植物提供养分。\"]],\"participation\":[[\"Active <b>participation</b> in class discussions helps students remember ideas better.\",\"积极参与课堂讨论能帮助学生更好地记住知识点。\"],[\"<b>Participation</b> in the survey is voluntary and anonymous.\",\"参与这项调查是自愿且匿名的。\"]],\"plum\":[[\"She picked a ripe <b>plum</b> from the tree and took a bite.\",\"她从树上摘下一颗熟透的李子，咬了一口。\"],[\"<b>Plum</b> trees blossom in early spring, covering the branches with white flowers.\",\"李子树在早春开花，枝头开满白花。\"]],\"printing\":[[\"The invention of <b>printing</b> made books much cheaper and spread knowledge widely.\",\"印刷术的发明让书籍便宜了许多，并广泛传播了知识。\"],[\"Before <b>printing</b>, monks copied every book by hand, page by page.\",\"在印刷术出现之前，僧侣们靠手一页页抄写每本书。\"]],\"probe\":[[\"NASA's space <b>probe</b> sent back the first close-up pictures of Pluto.\",\"美国宇航局的太空探测器发回了第一批冥王星特写照片。\"],[\"The <b>probe</b> landed on the comet after a journey of ten years.\",\"这台探测器经过十年航行后在彗星上着陆。\"]],\"recovery\":[[\"Her <b>recovery</b> from the operation took longer than the doctors expected.\",\"她手术后的康复比医生预期的要久。\"],[\"The country's economic <b>recovery</b> began when exports started to grow again.\",\"出口重新增长时，这个国家的经济复苏开始了。\"]],\"reptile\":[[\"Snakes, lizards and crocodiles are all <b>reptiles</b>.\",\"蛇、蜥蜴和鳄鱼都是爬行动物。\"],[\"A <b>reptile</b> cannot control its own body temperature and depends on the sun for warmth.\",\"爬行动物不能调节自身体温，要靠阳光取暖。\"]],\"scratch\":[[\"The cat <b>scratched</b> the wooden leg of the table with its claws.\",\"猫用爪子抓挠桌子的木腿。\"],[\"Be careful not to <b>scratch</b> the screen when you clean the phone.\",\"清洁手机时小心别刮花屏幕。\"]],\"subject\":[[\"History was her favourite <b>subject</b> at school.\",\"历史是她在上学时最喜欢的学科。\"],[\"Students must choose at least one science <b>subject</b> in their final year.\",\"学生在最后一年必须至少选一门科学学科。\"]],\"swamp\":[[\"Alligators hide in the warm water of the <b>swamp</b>.\",\"短吻鳄藏在沼泽地温暖的水里。\"],[\"Building a road across the <b>swamp</b> required deep concrete foundations.\",\"修一条穿过沼泽地的路需要打很深的混凝土地基。\"]],\"thief\":[[\"The <b>thief</b> entered through a broken window and stole the jewellery.\",\"小偷从一扇破窗户进来，偷走了珠宝。\"],[\"Police caught the bicycle <b>thief</b> while he was trying to sell the stolen bike.\",\"警察在自行车窃贼试图销赃时抓住了他。\"]],\"tunnel\":[[\"The train disappeared into the mountain <b>tunnel</b> and came out on the other side.\",\"火车驶进山间隧道，又从另一头出来。\"],[\"Engineers built a <b>tunnel</b> under the river to connect the two parts of the city.\",\"工程师在河底修了一条隧道，连接城市的两部分。\"]],\"visitor\":[[\"The museum receives more than a million <b>visitors</b> every year.\",\"这家博物馆每年接待一百多万名参观者。\"],[\"Each <b>visitor</b> to the laboratory must wear a badge and sign in.\",\"每位来实验室的参观者都必须佩戴证件并登记。\"]],\"wage\":[[\"The factory pays its workers a weekly <b>wage</b> rather than a monthly salary.\",\"这家工厂按周给工人发工资，而不是月薪。\"],[\"Many families struggle to live on a minimum <b>wage</b>.\",\"许多家庭靠最低工资艰难度日。\"]],\"wheat\":[[\"Golden fields of <b>wheat</b> stretch to the horizon on the plains.\",\"平原上金色的小麦田一直延伸到地平线。\"],[\"Flour for bread is usually made by grinding <b>wheat</b>.\",\"做面包的面粉通常由小麦磨制而成。\"]],\"zoology\":[[\"She studies <b>zoology</b> because she wants to work with endangered animals.\",\"她学动物学，因为她想从事濒危动物保护工作。\"],[\"The <b>zoology</b> department keeps a large collection of insect specimens.\",\"动物学系收藏了大量昆虫标本。\"]],\"accomplish\":[[\"By working every weekend, she <b>accomplished</b> more in a month than others did in a year.\",\"靠每个周末都工作，她一个月完成的事比别人一年还多。\"],[\"The team <b>accomplished</b> its goal of cleaning the riverbank in one day.\",\"团队在一天内完成了清理河岸的目标。\"]],\"adjust\":[[\"It took him a few weeks to <b>adjust</b> to life in a foreign country.\",\"他花了几周时间适应国外生活。\"],[\"New students quickly <b>adjust</b> to the school's routines.\",\"新生很快就能适应学校的作息。\"]],\"appreciative\":[[\"The audience was <b>appreciative</b> and applauded the young pianist warmly.\",\"观众满怀感激（欣赏），热情地为年轻钢琴家鼓掌。\"],[\"She wrote an <b>appreciative</b> note to the nurse who had cared for her.\",\"她给照顾过她的护士写了一封感谢信。\"]],\"arduous\":[[\"Climbing the mountain in deep snow was an <b>arduous</b> journey that took nine days.\",\"在深雪中登山是一段艰巨的旅程，花了九天时间。\"],[\"Mastering ancient scripts is slow, <b>arduous</b> work that can take a decade.\",\"学会解读古代文字是缓慢而艰巨的工作，可能要花十年。\"]],\"armchair\":[[\"He fell asleep in the <b>armchair</b> in front of the television.\",\"他在电视机前的扶手椅上睡着了。\"],[\"The old leather <b>armchair</b> by the fire is grandfather's favourite seat.\",\"炉边那把旧皮扶手椅是祖父最喜欢的座位。\"]],\"assimilate\":[[\"Immigrants often take years to <b>assimilate</b> into a new culture.\",\"移民往往需要数年才能同化融入新文化。\"],[\"The empire <b>assimilated</b> the conquered peoples, who adopted its language and laws.\",\"这个帝国同化了被征服的民族，他们采用了它的语言和法律。\"]],\"assistant\":[[\"The professor's research <b>assistant</b> collected data from two hundred patients.\",\"教授的研究助理从两百名病人那里收集了数据。\"],[\"She works as a teaching <b>assistant</b> at a primary school.\",\"她在一所小学当助教（助理）。\"]],\"astronaut\":[[\"The <b>astronaut</b> spent six months aboard the space station.\",\"这名宇航员在空间站上待了六个月。\"],[\"Before the flight, each <b>astronaut</b> trains for years in simulators.\",\"飞行之前，每位宇航员都要在模拟器里训练数年。\"]],\"attend\":[[\"More than five hundred people <b>attended</b> the conference in Beijing.\",\"五百多人出席了在北京举行的这次会议。\"],[\"All students are required to <b>attend</b> the safety training.\",\"所有学生都必须出席安全培训。\"]],\"benign\":[[\"The biopsy showed the tumour was <b>benign</b>, so no further treatment was needed.\",\"活检显示肿瘤是良性的，不需要进一步治疗。\"],[\"Fortunately, most lumps of this kind turn out to be <b>benign</b>.\",\"幸运的是，这类肿块大多是良性的。\"]],\"binge\":[[\"After the exams, the students went on a weekend <b>binge</b> of parties and late nights.\",\"考试结束后，学生们周末狂欢，连着聚会熬夜。\"],[\"Doctors warn that <b>binge</b> drinking can damage the liver in a single night.\",\"医生警告说，一夜狂欢式酗酒就可能损伤肝脏。\"]],\"city\":[[\"The <b>city</b> plans to plant ten thousand trees along its streets.\",\"这座城市计划沿街种植一万棵树。\"],[\"He moved from a small village to the <b>city</b> to find work.\",\"他从小村子搬到城市找工作。\"]],\"client\":[[\"The lawyer met her <b>client</b> to discuss the case before the trial.\",\"律师在开庭前与她的客户会面讨论案情。\"],[\"The design company won a contract with a major <b>client</b> in the car industry.\",\"这家设计公司拿下了汽车行业一位大客户的合同。\"]],\"comet\":[[\"Halley's <b>Comet</b> returns to the inner solar system every 76 years.\",\"哈雷彗星每 76 年返回太阳系内侧一次。\"],[\"A <b>comet's</b> tail points away from the Sun, blown by the solar wind.\",\"彗星的尾巴在太阳风吹拂下背向太阳。\"]],\"confront\":[[\"He finally <b>confronted</b> his fear of heights by climbing a small tower.\",\"他最终通过爬上一座小塔，直面了自己的恐高。\"],[\"Farmers in the south <b>confront</b> a shortage of water every summer.\",\"南方的农民每个夏天都要面对缺水的难题。\"]],\"conjure\":[[\"The magician <b>conjured</b> a rabbit out of an empty hat.\",\"魔术师从一顶空帽子里变出了一只兔子。\"],[\"With a wave of his wand, he <b>conjured</b> up a shower of paper flowers.\",\"他魔杖一挥，变出一阵纸花雨。\"]],\"contradiction\":[[\"There is a clear <b>contradiction</b> between his two statements about the money.\",\"他关于这笔钱的两份陈述之间存在明显矛盾。\"],[\"Her actions are in <b>contradiction</b> with everything she says she believes.\",\"她的所作所为与她声称相信的一切自相矛盾。\"]],\"cost\":[[\"The <b>cost</b> of building the bridge doubled because steel prices rose.\",\"由于钢材价格上涨，建桥成本翻了一番。\"],[\"Students must pay the full <b>cost</b> of the field trip themselves.\",\"学生必须自付实地考察的全部成本。\"]],\"creep\":[[\"The cat <b>crept</b> silently across the floor towards the mouse.\",\"猫悄无声息地爬过地板，朝老鼠靠近。\"],[\"Ivy <b>creeps</b> up the wall and covers the whole side of the house.\",\"常春藤爬上墙面，盖满了房子的整侧。\"]],\"devotion\":[[\"Her <b>devotion</b> to her students made her the most loved teacher in the school.\",\"她对学生的奉献让她成为全校最受爱戴的老师。\"],[\"The monks' daily life is marked by prayer and <b>devotion</b>.\",\"僧侣们的日常生活以祈祷和奉献为标志。\"]],\"earring\":[[\"She lost one <b>earring</b> at the party and searched the floor for it.\",\"她在聚会上丢了一只耳环，在地板上找了半天。\"],[\"The gold <b>earrings</b> were a gift from her grandmother.\",\"这副金耳环是祖母送的礼物。\"]],\"embryo\":[[\"In its first weeks, the human <b>embryo</b> is only a few millimetres long.\",\"在最初几周，人类胚胎只有几毫米长。\"],[\"The chick <b>embryo</b> develops inside the egg for twenty-one days.\",\"小鸡的胚胎在蛋内发育二十一天。\"]],\"exhalation\":[[\"During <b>exhalation</b>, the diaphragm relaxes and air flows out of the lungs.\",\"呼气时，膈肌放松，空气流出肺部。\"],[\"The doctor listened to the patient's breathing, counting each inhalation and <b>exhalation</b>.\",\"医生听着病人的呼吸，数着每一次吸气和呼气。\"]],\"farmer\":[[\"The <b>farmer</b> grows wheat on the flat land beside the river.\",\"农夫在河边平坦的土地上种小麦。\"],[\"Local <b>farmers</b> sell their vegetables at the weekend market.\",\"当地农民在周末集市上卖自家蔬菜。\"]],\"gland\":[[\"The thyroid <b>gland</b> in the neck produces hormones that control metabolism.\",\"颈部的甲状腺能产生控制新陈代谢的激素。\"],[\"Sweat <b>glands</b> all over the skin help cool the body on hot days.\",\"遍布皮肤的汗腺帮助身体在炎热的日子里散热。\"]],\"herbivore\":[[\"A rabbit is a <b>herbivore</b> that feeds mainly on grass and leaves.\",\"兔子是主要以草和树叶为食的食草动物。\"],[\"Large <b>herbivores</b> like elephants shape the landscape by eating young trees.\",\"大象等大型食草动物通过啃食小树塑造着地貌。\"]],\"immigrant\":[[\"The city was built largely by <b>immigrants</b> from many different countries.\",\"这座城市主要是由来自许多国家的移民建成的。\"],[\"As an <b>immigrant</b>, he had to learn a new language and a new way of life.\",\"作为移民，他不得不学一门新语言、适应一种新的生活方式。\"]],\"index\":[[\"Look up the topic in the <b>index</b> at the back of the book to find the right page.\",\"在书后的索引里查这个主题，就能找到对应的页码。\"],[\"A good <b>index</b> lists every important name and concept mentioned in the text.\",\"好的索引会列出正文提到的每个重要名称和概念。\"]],\"individual\":[[\"Each <b>individual</b> plant in the experiment was measured separately.\",\"实验中的每一株个体植物都被单独测量。\"],[\"The vaccine's effect varies from one <b>individual</b> to another.\",\"这种疫苗的效果因个体而异。\"]],\"inhibit\":[[\"Certain chemicals in the brain <b>inhibit</b> the growth of some bacteria.\",\"大脑中的某些化学物质会抑制某些细菌的生长。\"],[\"Fear of failure can <b>inhibit</b> students from speaking in a foreign language.\",\"对失败的恐惧会抑制学生开口说外语。\"]],\"intervene\":[[\"The teacher had to <b>intervene</b> when the argument between the students turned physical.\",\"学生们的争吵升级到动起手来，老师不得不介入。\"],[\"The central bank may <b>intervene</b> to stop the currency from falling further.\",\"中央银行可能会介入，防止货币进一步贬值。\"]],\"koala\":[[\"A <b>koala</b> sleeps for up to twenty hours a day in eucalyptus trees.\",\"考拉在桉树上每天能睡多达二十个小时。\"],[\"<b>Koalas</b> eat almost nothing but eucalyptus leaves.\",\"考拉几乎只吃桉树叶。\"]],\"lake\":[[\"We swam in the <b>lake</b> every morning during our holiday.\",\"假期里我们每天早上都在湖里游泳。\"],[\"The <b>lake</b> freezes in January, and people skate on the ice.\",\"这个湖一月结冰，人们在冰上滑冰。\"]],\"negotiation\":[[\"After weeks of <b>negotiation</b>, the two countries signed a trade agreement.\",\"经过数周谈判，两国签署了一项贸易协定。\"],[\"The price is open to <b>negotiation</b> if you buy in large quantities.\",\"如果大量购买，价格可以商量（有谈判余地）。\"]],\"obesity\":[[\"<b>Obesity</b> increases the risk of heart disease and diabetes.\",\"肥胖会增加患心脏病和糖尿病的风险。\"],[\"The school introduced more sports lessons to fight childhood <b>obesity</b>.\",\"学校增加了体育课时来应对儿童肥胖问题。\"]],\"outskirts\":[[\"They bought a house on the <b>outskirts</b> of the city, where land is cheaper.\",\"他们在市郊买了一栋房子，那里地价更便宜。\"],[\"The factory was moved to the <b>outskirts</b> to reduce pollution downtown.\",\"工厂搬到了市郊，以减少市中心的污染。\"]],\"pizza\":[[\"We ordered a large <b>pizza</b> with mushrooms and peppers to share.\",\"我们点了一份大号披萨，加了蘑菇和青椒，大家分着吃。\"],[\"<b>Pizza</b> originated in Naples, where bakers topped flat bread with tomatoes and cheese.\",\"披萨起源于那不勒斯，面包师在扁面包上放番茄和奶酪。\"]],\"prairie\":[[\"Vast herds of bison once roamed the North American <b>prairie</b>.\",\"大群野牛曾在北美大草原上漫游。\"],[\"The <b>prairie</b> stretches flat and treeless to the horizon.\",\"大草原平坦无树，一直延伸到地平线。\"]],\"quilt\":[[\"Grandmother sewed the <b>quilt</b> from pieces of old dresses.\",\"祖母用旧裙子的布片缝了这床被子。\"],[\"In winter they sleep under a thick, warm <b>quilt</b>.\",\"冬天他们盖一床厚实暖和的被子。\"]],\"rafting\":[[\"We went white-water <b>rafting</b> down the mountain river last summer.\",\"去年夏天我们去山间河流玩了激流漂流。\"],[\"<b>Rafting</b> requires a life jacket, a helmet and a trained guide.\",\"漂流需要救生衣、头盔和受过训练的向导。\"]],\"sanitation\":[[\"Clean water and basic <b>sanitation</b> have cut child deaths from diarrhoea dramatically.\",\"清洁饮水和基本卫生设施大幅减少了儿童死于腹泻的人数。\"],[\"After the flood, workers restored <b>sanitation</b> in the camps by building new toilets.\",\"洪水过后，工作人员通过修建新厕所恢复了营地的卫生设施。\"]],\"satellite\":[[\"A weather <b>satellite</b> takes pictures of clouds every fifteen minutes.\",\"气象卫星每十五分钟拍摄一次云图。\"],[\"The television signal is sent around the world by <b>satellite</b>.\",\"电视信号通过卫星传遍世界。\"]],\"scorpion\":[[\"The <b>scorpion</b> hides under rocks during the day and hunts at night.\",\"蝎子白天躲在岩石下，夜里出来捕食。\"],[\"A <b>scorpion's</b> sting can be extremely painful and sometimes dangerous.\",\"蝎子的蜇刺非常疼，有时甚至危险。\"]],\"seesaw\":[[\"Two children played on the <b>seesaw</b> in the park, rising and falling in turn.\",\"两个孩子在公园里玩跷跷板，轮流升起落下。\"],[\"If one child is much heavier, the <b>seesaw</b> will not balance.\",\"如果一个孩子重得多，跷跷板就平衡不了。\"]],\"severe\":[[\"The region suffered a <b>severe</b> drought that lasted for three years.\",\"该地区遭受了一场持续三年的严重干旱。\"],[\"He was taken to hospital with <b>severe</b> burns on his arms.\",\"他因手臂严重烧伤被送往医院。\"]],\"sprint\":[[\"The runners crouched at the start of the 100-metre <b>sprint</b>.\",\"选手们蹲在百米短跑的起跑线上。\"],[\"She won the <b>sprint</b> by a fraction of a second.\",\"她以零点几秒的优势赢得了这场短跑。\"]],\"theory\":[[\"Darwin's <b>theory</b> of evolution explains how species change over time.\",\"达尔文的进化理论解释了物种如何随时间变化。\"],[\"The <b>theory</b> sounds convincing, but it still needs experimental evidence.\",\"这个理论听起来很有说服力，但仍需要实验证据。\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"She added a few drops of <b>vanilla</b> to the cake mixture.\",\"她往蛋糕糊里加了几滴香草精。\"],[\"<b>Vanilla</b> comes from the pods of a tropical orchid.\",\"香草来自一种热带兰花的豆荚。\"]],\"watch\":[[\"He glanced at his <b>watch</b> and realised he was late for the train.\",\"他扫了一眼手表，意识到自己赶火车要迟到了。\"],[\"This waterproof <b>watch</b> can be worn while swimming.\",\"这块防水手表游泳时也能戴。\"]],\"waterfall\":[[\"The river drops fifty metres over a cliff, forming a spectacular <b>waterfall</b>.\",\"河水从悬崖上跌落五十米，形成一道壮观的瀑布。\"],[\"We could hear the roar of the <b>waterfall</b> long before we saw it.\",\"还没看到瀑布，我们老远就听到了它的轰鸣声。\"]],\"allegory\":[[\"The novel is an <b>allegory</b> of the dangers of absolute power.\",\"这部小说是一则关于绝对权力危险的寓言。\"],[\"In the <b>allegory</b>, the journey of the pilgrim represents the course of a human life.\",\"在这则寓言里，朝圣者的旅程代表人的一生。\"]],\"ambiguous\":[[\"His answer was so <b>ambiguous</b> that nobody knew whether he agreed or not.\",\"他的回答模棱两可，没人知道他到底同意还是不同意。\"],[\"The contract contains an <b>ambiguous</b> clause that lawyers argue about.\",\"合同里有一条含糊不清的条款，律师们争论不休。\"]],\"antibiotic\":[[\"The doctor prescribed an <b>antibiotic</b> to treat the bacterial infection.\",\"医生开了一种抗生素来治疗细菌感染。\"],[\"<b>Antibiotics</b> have no effect on viruses such as the common cold.\",\"抗生素对普通感冒等病毒无效。\"]],\"anxious\":[[\"She felt <b>anxious</b> while waiting for the exam results.\",\"等待考试结果时，她感到很焦虑。\"],[\"Parents are often <b>anxious</b> about their children's safety online.\",\"家长们常常为孩子上网的安全而焦虑。\"]],\"apprenticeship\":[[\"He served a four-year <b>apprenticeship</b> with a master carpenter before opening his own workshop.\",\"他在一位木匠师傅门下当了四年学徒，之后才开自己的作坊。\"],[\"Under the <b>apprenticeship</b> system, young workers learned a trade by working beside experts.\",\"在学徒制下，年轻工人通过在行家身边工作来学手艺。\"]],\"arson\":[[\"Police believe the warehouse fire was <b>arson</b> and are looking for the person who set it.\",\"警方认为仓库火灾是纵火所致，正在追查放火者。\"],[\"He was sentenced to ten years in prison for <b>arson</b>.\",\"他因纵火被判十年监禁。\"]],\"atom\":[[\"An <b>atom</b> consists of a nucleus surrounded by electrons.\",\"原子由原子核和周围的电子构成。\"],[\"Everything around us is made of <b>atoms</b> joined together in different ways.\",\"我们周围的一切都是由原子以不同方式结合而成的。\"]],\"avenue\":[[\"The parade marched down the wide <b>avenue</b> lined with flags.\",\"游行队伍沿着旗帜林立的宽阔大街前进。\"],[\"Their apartment overlooks a busy <b>avenue</b> with shops on both sides.\",\"他们的公寓俯瞰一条繁忙的大街，两旁都是商店。\"]],\"beautify\":[[\"Volunteers planted flowers along the street to <b>beautify</b> the neighbourhood.\",\"志愿者沿街种花，美化社区。\"],[\"The city spent millions to <b>beautify</b> the old harbour area.\",\"市政府花了数百万美化老港区。\"]],\"blaze\":[[\"The dry forest began to <b>blaze</b> after lightning struck a tree.\",\"闪电击中一棵树后，干燥的森林开始熊熊燃烧。\"],[\"Flames <b>blazed</b> from the windows of the burning building.\",\"火焰从燃烧大楼的窗户里熊熊窜出。\"]],\"burglary\":[[\"The family returned home to find a <b>burglary</b> had taken place while they were away.\",\"一家人回到家，发现他们不在时家里发生了入室盗窃。\"],[\"Police recorded a sharp fall in <b>burglaries</b> after street lights were improved.\",\"路灯改善后，警方记录的入室盗窃案大幅下降。\"]],\"calcium\":[[\"Milk and cheese are rich in <b>calcium</b>, which builds strong bones.\",\"牛奶和奶酪富含钙，钙能强健骨骼。\"],[\"Children need enough <b>calcium</b> while their bones are still growing.\",\"儿童在骨骼生长阶段需要充足的钙。\"]],\"challenge\":[[\"Climbing the north face of the mountain was the greatest <b>challenge</b> of his life.\",\"攀登这座山的北壁是他一生中最大的挑战。\"],[\"The new job presented a <b>challenge</b> she was eager to accept.\",\"这份新工作带来了她渴望迎接的挑战。\"]],\"compass\":[[\"Lost in the forest, he used a <b>compass</b> to find his way north.\",\"在森林里迷路后，他用指南针找到了北向。\"],[\"A <b>compass</b> needle always points towards magnetic north.\",\"指南针的指针总是指向磁北。\"]],\"debt\":[[\"He worked two jobs for five years to pay off his <b>debt</b>.\",\"他打了两份工，用五年还清债务。\"],[\"The country's national <b>debt</b> grew rapidly after the war.\",\"战后这个国家的国债迅速增长。\"]],\"deceleration\":[[\"The <b>deceleration</b> of the train was so smooth that passengers hardly noticed it stopping.\",\"火车减速非常平稳，乘客几乎没察觉它停了下来。\"],[\"Astronauts experience strong <b>deceleration</b> when their capsule re-enters the atmosphere.\",\"宇航员在返回舱重入大气层时会经历强烈的减速。\"]],\"deviation\":[[\"Any <b>deviation</b> from the standard procedure must be reported at once.\",\"任何偏离标准程序的偏差都必须立即报告。\"],[\"The compass showed a <b>deviation</b> of five degrees from true north.\",\"指南针显示与正北方向有五度偏差。\"]],\"discernment\":[[\"Her <b>discernment</b> in choosing staff built a strong and loyal team.\",\"她在选人上的洞察力打造了一支强大而忠诚的团队。\"],[\"Reading widely develops <b>discernment</b>: you learn which sources to trust.\",\"广泛阅读能培养洞察力：你会学到哪些来源可信。\"]],\"doctorate\":[[\"She completed her <b>doctorate</b> in chemistry at the age of twenty-seven.\",\"她二十七岁时完成了化学博士学位。\"],[\"A <b>doctorate</b> usually requires at least three years of original research.\",\"博士学位通常需要至少三年的原创研究。\"]],\"dynamic\":[[\"The <b>dynamic</b> leader reorganised the company within a year.\",\"这位充满活力的领导者在一年内重组了公司。\"],[\"Ecosystems are <b>dynamic</b>: species are constantly interacting and changing.\",\"生态系统是动态的：物种不断互动和变化。\"]],\"elaboration\":[[\"The first lecture gave the outline; the second provided the <b>elaboration</b> with examples.\",\"第一讲给出了提纲，第二讲用例子作了详细阐述。\"],[\"His brief note needed further <b>elaboration</b> before the committee could act on it.\",\"他的简短说明需要进一步详细阐述，委员会才能据此行动。\"]],\"erection\":[[\"The <b>erection</b> of the steel tower took two years and hundreds of workers.\",\"这座钢塔的竖立耗时两年、动用数百名工人。\"],[\"Before the <b>erection</b> of the statue, engineers reinforced its concrete base.\",\"在雕像竖立之前，工程师先加固了它的混凝土底座。\"]],\"erosion\":[[\"Wind and rain cause soil <b>erosion</b> on the bare hillsides.\",\"风雨造成了光秃山坡上的土壤侵蚀。\"],[\"Planting trees is the best way to prevent <b>erosion</b> along the river banks.\",\"植树是防止河岸侵蚀的最好办法。\"]],\"establishment\":[[\"The <b>establishment</b> of the university in 1898 changed the town forever.\",\"这所大学于 1898 年建立，永远改变了这座城镇。\"],[\"Since its <b>establishment</b>, the charity has helped thousands of children.\",\"自建立以来，这家慈善机构已帮助了数千名儿童。\"]],\"extremity\":[[\"He pushed his body to the <b>extremity</b> of endurance during the desert crossing.\",\"在穿越沙漠时，他把身体推到了忍耐的极端。\"],[\"The discussion stopped short of <b>extremity</b>: nobody proposed violence.\",\"讨论没有走到极端：没有人提出使用暴力。\"]],\"fence\":[[\"A wooden <b>fence</b> surrounds the garden to keep out the deer.\",\"花园四周有一圈木栅栏，防止鹿进来。\"],[\"The children climbed over the <b>fence</b> into the orchard.\",\"孩子们翻过栅栏进了果园。\"]],\"fission\":[[\"Nuclear <b>fission</b> splits a heavy atom into lighter parts and releases energy.\",\"核裂变把一个重原子分裂成较轻的部分并释放能量。\"],[\"Power stations use controlled <b>fission</b> of uranium to generate electricity.\",\"发电站利用铀的受控裂变来发电。\"]],\"genetic\":[[\"Eye colour is a <b>genetic</b> trait passed from parents to children.\",\"眼睛颜色是父母传给子女的遗传特征。\"],[\"Some diseases are <b>genetic</b> and run in families for generations.\",\"有些疾病是遗传性的，在家族中代代相传。\"]],\"granary\":[[\"After the harvest, the farmers stored the wheat in the village <b>granary</b>.\",\"收获后，农民把小麦存进村里的粮仓。\"],[\"The ancient <b>granary</b> could hold enough grain to feed the city for a year.\",\"这座古代粮仓能存下足够全城吃一年的粮食。\"]],\"hummingbird\":[[\"A <b>hummingbird</b> beats its wings about seventy times per second.\",\"蜂鸟每秒扇动翅膀约七十次。\"],[\"The tiny <b>hummingbird</b> hovered beside the flower, drinking its nectar.\",\"小小的蜂鸟悬停在花旁，吸食花蜜。\"]],\"hypothesis\":[[\"The <b>hypothesis</b> that bacteria cause the disease was later confirmed by experiments.\",\"细菌致病的假设后来被实验证实。\"],[\"Scientists tested the <b>hypothesis</b> by measuring temperatures at different depths.\",\"科学家通过测量不同深度的温度来检验这个假设。\"]],\"inflammation\":[[\"The redness and swelling around the cut are signs of <b>inflammation</b>.\",\"伤口周围的红肿是炎症的迹象。\"],[\"Ice can reduce the pain and <b>inflammation</b> of a twisted ankle.\",\"冰敷可以减轻扭伤脚踝的疼痛和炎症。\"]],\"input\":[[\"The computer processes the <b>input</b> from the keyboard and displays it on screen.\",\"计算机处理键盘的输入，并把它显示在屏幕上。\"],[\"Farmers increased the <b>input</b> of fertiliser to raise crop yields.\",\"农民加大了化肥投入，以提高作物产量。\"]],\"janitor\":[[\"The school <b>janitor</b> unlocks the classrooms every morning at seven.\",\"学校看门人每天早上七点打开教室门。\"],[\"When a pipe burst at night, the <b>janitor</b> was the first to arrive.\",\"夜里水管爆裂时，看门人第一个赶到。\"]],\"link\":[[\"Scientists have found a <b>link</b> between smoking and lung cancer.\",\"科学家发现了吸烟与肺癌之间的联系。\"],[\"The new railway will <b>link</b> the capital with the northern ports.\",\"新铁路将把首都与北方港口连接起来。\"]],\"milk\":[[\"She poured a glass of <b>milk</b> for the child before bed.\",\"她在睡前给孩子倒了一杯牛奶。\"],[\"Farmers <b>milk</b> the cows early every morning.\",\"农民每天清晨给奶牛挤奶。\"]],\"nomad\":[[\"A <b>nomad</b> moves from place to place with his herds, following the seasons.\",\"游牧者带着牲畜随季节逐水草而居。\"],[\"In the desert, <b>nomads</b> carry everything they own on camels.\",\"在沙漠中，游牧者把全部家当都驮在骆驼上。\"]],\"odd\":[[\"It felt <b>odd</b> to be back in his childhood home after twenty years.\",\"二十年后重回童年的家，感觉很奇怪。\"],[\"There is something <b>odd</b> about the way the machine vibrates.\",\"这台机器震动的方式有点奇怪。\"]],\"overall\":[[\"<b>Overall</b>, the harvest this year is better than last year's.\",\"大体上，今年的收成比去年好。\"],[\"The trip was tiring but, <b>overall</b>, worth every hour.\",\"这趟旅行很累，但总的来说，每一小时都值。\"]],\"performance\":[[\"The violinist gave a moving <b>performance</b> of the concerto.\",\"小提琴手动情地表演了这首协奏曲。\"],[\"Tickets for tonight's <b>performance</b> sold out within an hour.\",\"今晚这场表演的票一小时内就售罄了。\"]],\"plow\":[[\"The farmer hitched the horse to the <b>plow</b> and began the spring work.\",\"农夫把马套上犁，开始春耕。\"],[\"An iron <b>plow</b> can turn heavy soil far faster than a wooden one.\",\"铁犁翻耕厚土比木犁快得多。\"]],\"poker\":[[\"They played <b>poker</b> every Friday night, betting with matchsticks instead of money.\",\"他们每周五晚上玩扑克，用火柴棍代替钱下注。\"],[\"A good <b>poker</b> player hides his emotions behind a calm face.\",\"好的扑克玩家会用平静的表情掩藏情绪。\"]],\"pond\":[[\"Ducks paddled across the <b>pond</b> while frogs croaked in the reeds.\",\"鸭子划过池塘，青蛙在芦苇丛里呱呱叫。\"],[\"In winter, the village children skate on the frozen <b>pond</b>.\",\"冬天，村里的孩子在结冰的池塘上滑冰。\"]],\"rice\":[[\"In southern China, farmers plant <b>rice</b> in flooded fields.\",\"在中国南方，农民在水田里种水稻（大米）。\"],[\"A bowl of <b>rice</b> accompanies almost every meal in this region.\",\"在这一地区，几乎每顿饭都配一碗米饭。\"]],\"shade\":[[\"We sat in the <b>shade</b> of a large tree to escape the midday heat.\",\"我们坐在大树的阴影里躲避正午的酷热。\"],[\"Plants that grow in deep <b>shade</b> need very little sunlight.\",\"生长在浓荫里的植物几乎不需要阳光。\"]],\"solution\":[[\"The chemist stirred salt into water to make a <b>solution</b>.\",\"化学家把盐搅入水中制成溶液。\"],[\"In the experiment, students heated the blue <b>solution</b> until crystals appeared.\",\"实验中，学生加热蓝色溶液，直到晶体出现。\"]],\"stroke\":[[\"After his <b>stroke</b>, he had to learn to speak and walk again.\",\"中风之后，他必须重新学习说话和走路。\"],[\"High blood pressure greatly increases the risk of a <b>stroke</b>.\",\"高血压会大大增加中风的风险。\"]],\"supply\":[[\"The city's water <b>supply</b> comes from a reservoir in the mountains.\",\"这座城市的供水来自山里的水库。\"],[\"When <b>supply</b> falls short of demand, prices rise.\",\"当供给跟不上需求时，价格就会上涨。\"]],\"zebra\":[[\"Each <b>zebra</b> has a unique pattern of black and white stripes.\",\"每匹斑马的黑白条纹图案都是独一无二的。\"],[\"A herd of <b>zebras</b> grazed near the water hole, watching for lions.\",\"一群斑马在水坑边吃草，警惕着狮子。\"]],\"zinc\":[[\"<b>Zinc</b> is used to coat steel and protect it from rusting.\",\"锌被用来镀在钢材上防锈。\"],[\"Oysters are one of the richest natural sources of <b>zinc</b>.\",\"牡蛎是锌含量最丰富的天然食物之一。\"]],\"absorb\":[[\"A sponge can <b>absorb</b> many times its own weight in water.\",\"海绵能吸收比自身重量多好几倍的水。\"],[\"Dark surfaces <b>absorb</b> more heat from sunlight than light ones.\",\"深色表面比浅色表面从阳光中吸收更多热量。\"]],\"affluence\":[[\"The suburb's large houses and gardens reflect its <b>affluence</b>.\",\"这个郊区的大房子和花园反映了它的富裕。\"],[\"With growing <b>affluence</b>, more families could afford cars and holidays abroad.\",\"随着日益富裕，更多家庭买得起汽车、能出国度假。\"]],\"agency\":[[\"She found her job through an employment <b>agency</b>.\",\"她通过一家职业介绍机构（中介）找到了工作。\"],[\"The environmental <b>agency</b> tests the river water every month.\",\"环保机构每月检测河水。\"]],\"ailment\":[[\"His only <b>ailment</b> was a mild cough that cleared up in a few days.\",\"他的小病只是一点轻微咳嗽，几天就好了。\"],[\"Old people often visit the clinic for minor <b>ailments</b> like back pain.\",\"老人常因腰痛之类的小病去诊所。\"]],\"appear\":[[\"A small island <b>appeared</b> on the horizon as the fog lifted.\",\"雾散时，地平线上出现了一座小岛。\"],[\"Stars begin to <b>appear</b> as the sky darkens after sunset.\",\"日落后天空变暗，星星开始出现。\"]],\"baseball\":[[\"He hit the <b>baseball</b> over the fence for a home run.\",\"他把棒球击过围栏，打出全垒打。\"],[\"<b>Baseball</b> games in this league are played from April to October.\",\"这个联盟的棒球比赛从四月打到十月。\"]],\"buoyancy\":[[\"The cork's <b>buoyancy</b> keeps it floating on the surface of the water.\",\"软木的浮力使它浮在水面上。\"],[\"A life jacket provides extra <b>buoyancy</b> for swimmers in trouble.\",\"救生衣为遇险的游泳者提供额外的浮力。\"]],\"calculus\":[[\"In <b>calculus</b>, students learn how to measure rates of change.\",\"在微积分里，学生学习如何测量变化率。\"],[\"Newton and Leibniz developed <b>calculus</b> independently in the seventeenth century.\",\"牛顿和莱布尼茨在十七世纪各自独立地创立了微积分。\"]],\"camouflage\":[[\"The moth's brown wings provide <b>camouflage</b> against tree bark.\",\"飞蛾棕色的翅膀在树皮上起到伪装作用。\"],[\"Soldiers wear uniforms designed as <b>camouflage</b> in the forest.\",\"士兵穿的制服设计成能在森林中伪装。\"]],\"classification\":[[\"The <b>classification</b> of living things into groups is called taxonomy.\",\"把生物分成各类的做法叫作分类学。\"],[\"Linnaeus created a system of <b>classification</b> for plants and animals.\",\"林奈创建了一套动植物分类系统。\"]],\"cognition\":[[\"Sleep plays an important role in <b>cognition</b>, especially memory and learning.\",\"睡眠在认知中起重要作用，尤其是记忆和学习。\"],[\"The study examines how children's <b>cognition</b> develops between ages three and seven.\",\"这项研究考察三到七岁儿童的认知如何发展。\"]],\"collate\":[[\"Please <b>collate</b> the exam papers and check that every page is in order.\",\"请核对试卷，确保每一页顺序正确。\"],[\"The secretary <b>collated</b> the reports from all departments into one file.\",\"秘书把各部门的报告核对整理成一份文件。\"]],\"colonize\":[[\"European powers <b>colonized</b> much of Africa in the nineteenth century.\",\"欧洲列强在十九世纪殖民了非洲大部分地区。\"],[\"Bees <b>colonize</b> a new hive when their colony grows too large.\",\"蜜蜂群体过大时，会去殖民一个新的蜂巢。\"]],\"compensate\":[[\"The airline <b>compensated</b> passengers for the cancelled flight with hotel rooms and meals.\",\"航空公司用酒店和餐食赔偿被取消航班的乘客。\"],[\"Insurance will <b>compensate</b> the farmer for the crops lost in the flood.\",\"保险将赔偿农夫在洪水中损失的庄稼。\"]],\"conservation\":[[\"The park was created for the <b>conservation</b> of the region's rare birds.\",\"这个公园是为保护该地区珍稀鸟类而建的。\"],[\"<b>Conservation</b> of water is essential in this dry climate.\",\"在这种干旱气候下，节约（保护）水资源至关重要。\"]],\"cord\":[[\"He tied the package with a strong <b>cord</b> before mailing it.\",\"他用一根结实的绳索把包裹捆好再寄出。\"],[\"The lamp's <b>cord</b> was too short to reach the socket.\",\"台灯的电线太短，够不到插座。\"]],\"cucumber\":[[\"She sliced a <b>cucumber</b> into the salad.\",\"她把一根黄瓜切进沙拉里。\"],[\"<b>Cucumbers</b> grow on vines and need plenty of water in summer.\",\"黄瓜长在藤上，夏天需要大量水分。\"]],\"dedicate\":[[\"She <b>dedicated</b> her life to teaching children in poor mountain villages.\",\"她把一生奉献给贫困山村的儿童教育。\"],[\"The author <b>dedicated</b> the book to his parents.\",\"作者把这本书题献给他的父母。\"]],\"employer\":[[\"Her <b>employer</b> pays for her to attend evening classes.\",\"她的雇主出钱让她上夜校。\"],[\"Every <b>employer</b> must provide a safe workplace by law.\",\"法律规定每个雇主都必须提供安全的工作场所。\"]],\"employment\":[[\"Full <b>employment</b> is one of the government's main economic goals.\",\"充分就业是政府的主要经济目标之一。\"],[\"The new factory brought <b>employment</b> to hundreds of local families.\",\"新工厂为当地数百户家庭带来了就业。\"]],\"enigma\":[[\"How the stones were moved remains an <b>enigma</b> to this day.\",\"这些石头当年是怎样搬运的，至今仍是个谜。\"],[\"The writer's private life was an <b>enigma</b> even to his closest friends.\",\"这位作家的私生活即使对他最亲近的朋友也是个谜。\"]],\"enzyme\":[[\"An <b>enzyme</b> in saliva begins breaking down starch in the mouth.\",\"唾液中的一种酶在口腔里就开始分解淀粉。\"],[\"High temperatures can destroy <b>enzymes</b> and stop chemical reactions in cells.\",\"高温会破坏酶，使细胞内的化学反应停止。\"]],\"fresco\":[[\"The church ceiling is covered with a sixteenth-century <b>fresco</b> of angels.\",\"教堂天花板上有一幅十六世纪的天使壁画。\"],[\"Artists painted the <b>fresco</b> directly onto wet plaster before it dried.\",\"艺术家趁灰泥未干，直接在湿灰泥上绘制壁画。\"]],\"function\":[[\"The main <b>function</b> of the heart is to pump blood around the body.\",\"心脏的主要功能是把血液泵送到全身。\"],[\"Each part of the machine has a specific <b>function</b>.\",\"机器的每个部件都有特定的功能。\"]],\"honey\":[[\"Bees store <b>honey</b> in the hive to feed themselves through winter.\",\"蜜蜂把蜂蜜存放在蜂巢里，靠它过冬。\"],[\"She stirred a spoonful of <b>honey</b> into her tea.\",\"她往茶里搅了一勺蜂蜜。\"]],\"hypnosis\":[[\"Under <b>hypnosis</b>, the patient recalled events from early childhood.\",\"在催眠状态下，病人回想起了童年早期的事情。\"],[\"Some dentists use <b>hypnosis</b> to help patients relax during treatment.\",\"一些牙医用催眠帮助病人在治疗中放松。\"]],\"inn\":[[\"The travellers spent the night at a small <b>inn</b> in the mountains.\",\"旅行者们在山里一家小客栈过夜。\"],[\"The old <b>inn</b> has provided food and beds to pilgrims for three hundred years.\",\"这家老客栈三百年来一直为朝圣者提供食宿。\"]],\"kneel\":[[\"He <b>knelt</b> down to tie his daughter's shoelaces.\",\"他跪下来给女儿系鞋带。\"],[\"The gardener <b>kneels</b> on a cushion while planting the flowers.\",\"园丁种花时跪在垫子上。\"]],\"movie\":[[\"We watched a <b>movie</b> about the first journey to the Moon.\",\"我们看了一部关于首次登月之旅的电影。\"],[\"The <b>movie</b> was filmed in the desert of New Mexico.\",\"这部电影是在新墨西哥州的沙漠里拍摄的。\"]],\"mustard\":[[\"He spread <b>mustard</b> on his sandwich to give it a sharper taste.\",\"他在三明治上抹了芥末，让味道更冲一些。\"],[\"<b>Mustard</b> seeds are ground to make the yellow sauce.\",\"芥末酱是把芥菜籽磨碎制成的。\"]],\"oat\":[[\"<b>Oats</b> grow well in cool northern climates where wheat struggles.\",\"燕麦在凉爽的北方气候中长得好，而小麦在那里却难以生长。\"],[\"She eats <b>oat</b> porridge with honey for breakfast.\",\"她早餐吃加蜂蜜的燕麦粥。\"]],\"obsession\":[[\"His <b>obsession</b> with cleanliness made him wash his hands dozens of times a day.\",\"他对洁净的强迫观念使他一天洗几十次手。\"],[\"For the young painter, colour became an <b>obsession</b> he explored in every canvas.\",\"对这位年轻画家来说，色彩成了他在每幅画中探索的痴迷（强迫观念）。\"]],\"outcome\":[[\"Nobody could predict the <b>outcome</b> of the election until the final votes were counted.\",\"在最后选票统计出来之前，没有人能预测选举的结果。\"],[\"The <b>outcome</b> of the experiment surprised everyone on the team.\",\"实验的结果让团队里的每个人都吃了一惊。\"]],\"painting\":[[\"The <b>painting</b> shows a quiet village under a stormy sky.\",\"这幅画描绘了暴风雨天空下安静的村庄。\"],[\"She took up oil <b>painting</b> after she retired.\",\"她退休后开始学油画（绘画）。\"]],\"perception\":[[\"Colour <b>perception</b> differs slightly from person to person.\",\"每个人对颜色的感知略有不同。\"],[\"The experiment studied how babies' <b>perception</b> of speech sounds develops.\",\"这项实验研究婴儿对语音的感知如何发展。\"]],\"pine\":[[\"A tall <b>pine</b> stood alone on the rocky hilltop.\",\"一棵高大的松树孤零零地立在多石的山顶上。\"],[\"<b>Pine</b> trees stay green all winter because their needles lose little water.\",\"松树整个冬天常青，因为它的针叶失水很少。\"]],\"pocket\":[[\"He kept the key in his coat <b>pocket</b>.\",\"他把钥匙放在大衣口袋里。\"],[\"The trousers have deep <b>pockets</b> on both sides.\",\"这条裤子两侧都有深口袋。\"]],\"raccoon\":[[\"A <b>raccoon</b> knocked over the rubbish bin looking for food at night.\",\"一只浣熊夜里为找食物打翻了垃圾桶。\"],[\"<b>Raccoons</b> appear to wash their food before eating it.\",\"浣熊看起来会在吃食物前先洗一洗。\"]],\"resource\":[[\"Water is a precious <b>resource</b> in this dry region.\",\"在这一干旱地区，水是宝贵的资源。\"],[\"The library is a valuable <b>resource</b> for students preparing their essays.\",\"图书馆对准备论文的学生是宝贵的资源。\"]],\"sediment\":[[\"Layers of <b>sediment</b> settled at the bottom of the ancient lake.\",\"沉积物层层沉降在古代湖泊的底部。\"],[\"Over millions of years, <b>sediment</b> hardens into rock.\",\"经过数百万年，沉积物会硬化成岩石。\"]],\"starfish\":[[\"At low tide, we found a bright orange <b>starfish</b> in a rock pool.\",\"退潮时，我们在一个岩石水洼里发现了一只亮橙色的海星。\"],[\"A <b>starfish</b> can regrow a lost arm over several months.\",\"海星能在几个月里重新长出失去的腕。\"]],\"store\":[[\"The corner <b>store</b> stays open until midnight every day.\",\"街角那家商店每天营业到午夜。\"],[\"She bought a notebook at the school <b>store</b>.\",\"她在学校商店买了一本笔记本。\"]],\"survive\":[[\"Only a few plants can <b>survive</b> the desert's extreme heat.\",\"只有少数植物能在沙漠的极端高温中存活。\"],[\"He was the only passenger to <b>survive</b> the plane crash.\",\"他是这场空难中唯一的幸存乘客。\"]],\"symbolism\":[[\"The novel's <b>symbolism</b> is rich: the river stands for the passage of time.\",\"这部小说的象征主义手法丰富：河流象征时间的流逝。\"],[\"In <b>symbolism</b>, artists used images and suggestions rather than direct statements.\",\"在象征主义中，艺术家用意象和暗示而非直白陈述。\"]],\"taekwondo\":[[\"She has practised <b>taekwondo</b> since she was eight and now holds a black belt.\",\"她从八岁起练跆拳道，现在是黑带。\"],[\"<b>Taekwondo</b>, a Korean martial art, is famous for its fast, high kicks.\",\"跆拳道是韩国武术，以快速高踢闻名。\"]],\"toothbrush\":[[\"Dentists advise changing your <b>toothbrush</b> every three months.\",\"牙医建议每三个月换一把牙刷。\"],[\"She packed her <b>toothbrush</b> and toothpaste in a small bag.\",\"她把牙刷和牙膏装进一个小包里。\"]],\"tyranny\":[[\"The people rose up against the king's <b>tyranny</b> and demanded their rights.\",\"人民起来反抗国王的暴政，要求自己的权利。\"],[\"Under his <b>tyranny</b>, newspapers were closed and opponents were jailed.\",\"在他暴政之下，报纸被关闭，反对者被监禁。\"]],\"verdict\":[[\"The jury returned a <b>verdict</b> of not guilty after two days of discussion.\",\"陪审团经过两天讨论后作出了无罪的裁决。\"],[\"Everyone waited silently for the judge to announce the <b>verdict</b>.\",\"所有人默默等待法官宣布裁决。\"]],\"wave\":[[\"A huge <b>wave</b> crashed over the rocks and soaked the fishermen.\",\"一道巨浪拍过岩石，把渔民淋了个透。\"],[\"Surfers wait for the perfect <b>wave</b> before paddling out.\",\"冲浪者在划出海前等待完美的浪头。\"]],\"wizard\":[[\"In the story, an old <b>wizard</b> teaches the boy how to use magic.\",\"故事里，一位老巫师教男孩如何使用魔法。\"],[\"The children dressed up as <b>wizards</b> for the school play.\",\"孩子们在学校戏剧中打扮成巫师。\"]],\"abolish\":[[\"The country <b>abolished</b> slavery in 1834.\",\"这个国家在 1834 年废除了奴隶制。\"],[\"Parliament voted to <b>abolish</b> the unpopular tax.\",\"议会投票废除了这项不得人心的税。\"]],\"administer\":[[\"A nurse will <b>administer</b> the vaccine to all the children in the school.\",\"一名护士将为学校所有孩子接种（施用）疫苗。\"],[\"The charity <b>administers</b> funds for disaster relief in three provinces.\",\"这家慈善机构管理着三个省的救灾资金。\"]],\"affluent\":[[\"She grew up in an <b>affluent</b> suburb with large houses and private schools.\",\"她在一个富裕的郊区长大，那里有大房子和私立学校。\"],[\"As the country became more <b>affluent</b>, people spent more on travel.\",\"随着国家日益富裕，人们花在旅行上的钱变多了。\"]],\"appreciation\":[[\"Studying abroad deepened his <b>appreciation</b> of his own culture.\",\"留学加深了他对本民族文化的欣赏。\"],[\"Music lessons gave the children a lasting <b>appreciation</b> of classical music.\",\"音乐课让孩子们对古典音乐有了一生的欣赏。\"]],\"arid\":[[\"The <b>arid</b> land receives less than 100 millimetres of rain a year.\",\"这片干旱的土地一年降雨不到 100 毫米。\"],[\"Few plants can survive in such an <b>arid</b> climate without irrigation.\",\"没有灌溉，很少有植物能在如此干旱的气候中存活。\"]],\"aspect\":[[\"We must consider every <b>aspect</b> of the problem before deciding.\",\"做决定前，我们必须考虑问题的各个方面。\"],[\"The financial <b>aspect</b> of the project worried the committee most.\",\"这个项目的财务方面最让委员会担心。\"]],\"authoritative\":[[\"This is the most <b>authoritative</b> dictionary of the English language.\",\"这是最权威的英语词典。\"],[\"She gave an <b>authoritative</b> account of the expedition, having led it herself.\",\"她亲自带队远征，对这次远征作了权威的记述。\"]],\"basketball\":[[\"She threw the <b>basketball</b> through the hoop from the free-throw line.\",\"她在罚球线把篮球投进了篮筐。\"],[\"<b>Basketball</b> was invented in 1891 by a Canadian teacher in Massachusetts.\",\"篮球是 1891 年由一位在马萨诸塞州的加拿大教师发明的。\"]],\"binder\":[[\"She keeps her lecture notes in a ring <b>binder</b>.\",\"她把讲义笔记放在一个活页夹里。\"],[\"Each report was placed in a separate <b>binder</b> on the shelf.\",\"每份报告都单独放在架子上的一个活页夹里。\"]],\"bury\":[[\"They <b>buried</b> the old king in the cathedral beside his ancestors.\",\"他们把老国王埋葬在大教堂里他祖先的身旁。\"],[\"The dog <b>buried</b> its bone in the garden.\",\"狗把它的骨头埋在了花园里。\"]],\"clash\":[[\"The two armies <b>clashed</b> at dawn near the river.\",\"两军黎明时分在河边发生冲突。\"],[\"His views on education <b>clash</b> with those of the school board.\",\"他对教育的看法与校董事会相冲突。\"]],\"cod\":[[\"<b>Cod</b> was once so plentiful in the North Atlantic that fishermen could fill a boat in hours.\",\"鳕鱼曾经在北大西洋多到渔民几小时就能装满一船。\"],[\"For dinner they baked <b>cod</b> with lemon and herbs.\",\"晚餐他们用柠檬和香草烤了鳕鱼。\"]],\"collude\":[[\"The two companies <b>colluded</b> to fix prices, breaking competition law.\",\"这两家公司共谋操纵价格，违反了竞争法。\"],[\"Officials <b>colluded</b> with smugglers to let illegal goods pass the border.\",\"官员们与走私者勾结，放行非法货物过境。\"]],\"converge\":[[\"Thousands of fans <b>converged</b> on the stadium for the final match.\",\"成千上万的球迷汇聚到体育场观看决赛。\"],[\"The two rivers <b>converge</b> just north of the city.\",\"两条河在城北不远处汇合。\"]],\"deduce\":[[\"From the wet footprints, she <b>deduced</b> that someone had entered during the rain.\",\"从湿脚印她推论出有人在下雨时进来过。\"],[\"Scientists <b>deduced</b> the planet's size from the dimming of its star.\",\"科学家从恒星变暗推论出这颗行星的大小。\"]],\"deduction\":[[\"From the footprints, the detective's <b>deduction</b> was that two people had entered the house.\",\"侦探由脚印推断（演绎）出有两个人进过这栋房子。\"],[\"In science, <b>deduction</b> means drawing a specific conclusion from a general rule.\",\"在科学中，演绎指从一般规律推出具体结论。\"]],\"despite\":[[\"<b>Despite</b> the rain, the football match continued.\",\"尽管下雨，足球比赛还是继续进行。\"],[\"She finished the race <b>despite</b> a painful ankle.\",\"尽管脚踝疼痛，她还是跑完了全程。\"]],\"dill\":[[\"She seasoned the salmon with fresh <b>dill</b> and lemon juice.\",\"她用新鲜莳萝和柠檬汁给三文鱼调味。\"],[\"<b>Dill</b> is often used in pickles to add its distinctive flavour.\",\"莳萝常用于腌菜，增添其独特的风味。\"]],\"disposal\":[[\"The safe <b>disposal</b> of chemical waste is strictly regulated.\",\"化学废物的安全处理受到严格监管。\"],[\"The hospital has special bins for the <b>disposal</b> of used needles.\",\"医院有专门处理用过针头的回收箱。\"]],\"ditch\":[[\"Rainwater collects in the <b>ditch</b> beside the road.\",\"雨水汇集在路边的沟渠里。\"],[\"Farmers dug a <b>ditch</b> to drain the flooded field.\",\"农民挖了一条沟渠，给被淹的田地排水。\"]],\"elastic\":[[\"The waistband of the trousers is <b>elastic</b>, so it stretches to fit.\",\"裤子的腰带是松紧的，所以能拉伸贴合。\"],[\"An <b>elastic</b> band held the stack of letters together.\",\"一根橡皮筋把这叠信捆在一起。\"]],\"exhilaration\":[[\"Skiing down the steep slope filled her with <b>exhilaration</b>.\",\"从陡坡上滑雪而下让她满心兴奋。\"],[\"After months of work, finishing the marathon brought a rush of <b>exhilaration</b>.\",\"经过数月训练，跑完马拉松带来一阵兴奋感。\"]],\"flamingo\":[[\"A flock of pink <b>flamingos</b> stood in the shallow lake, feeding on algae.\",\"一群粉红色的火烈鸟站在浅湖里，吃着水藻。\"],[\"The <b>flamingo's</b> pink colour comes from pigments in the shrimps it eats.\",\"火烈鸟的粉色来自它所吃虾里的色素。\"]],\"fluctuate\":[[\"The price of oil <b>fluctuates</b> from month to month.\",\"油价逐月波动。\"],[\"Her body temperature <b>fluctuated</b> between 38 and 39 degrees all day.\",\"她的体温一整天在 38 度到 39 度之间波动。\"]],\"fork\":[[\"She ate her salad with a <b>fork</b> in her right hand.\",\"她右手拿着叉子吃沙拉。\"],[\"Place a knife and <b>fork</b> beside each plate.\",\"在每个盘子旁放一把刀和一把叉子。\"]],\"fox\":[[\"A red <b>fox</b> slipped through the hedge and ran across the field.\",\"一只赤狐穿过树篱，跑过田野。\"],[\"The <b>fox</b> is known in stories for its cunning.\",\"狐狸在故事里以狡猾著称。\"]],\"hairdresser\":[[\"The <b>hairdresser</b> washed and trimmed her hair.\",\"美发师给她洗了头并修剪了头发。\"],[\"He has been going to the same <b>hairdresser</b> for ten years.\",\"十年来他一直去同一位美发师那里理发。\"]],\"injury\":[[\"He missed the rest of the season because of a knee <b>injury</b>.\",\"他因膝盖受伤缺席了本赛季余下的比赛。\"],[\"Wearing a seat belt greatly reduces the risk of serious <b>injury</b> in a crash.\",\"系安全带能大大降低车祸中严重受伤的风险。\"]],\"intelligence\":[[\"Tests of <b>intelligence</b> measure reasoning and problem-solving, not knowledge alone.\",\"智力测试测的是推理和解决问题的能力，而非单纯的知识。\"],[\"Dolphins show remarkable <b>intelligence</b> in learning signals and games.\",\"海豚在学习信号和游戏方面表现出非凡的智力。\"]],\"intricate\":[[\"The watchmaker repaired the <b>intricate</b> mechanism with tiny tools.\",\"钟表匠用小工具修理了这个错综复杂的机械装置。\"],[\"An <b>intricate</b> pattern of vines was carved around the door.\",\"门四周刻着错综复杂的藤蔓图案。\"]],\"item\":[[\"Each <b>item</b> on the shopping list must be checked off as it goes into the basket.\",\"购物清单上的每件物品放进篮子时都要打勾。\"],[\"The museum's most valuable <b>item</b> is a gold crown from the eighth century.\",\"博物馆最珍贵的物品是一顶八世纪的金冠。\"]],\"license\":[[\"You need a driving <b>license</b> before you can legally drive a car.\",\"你要先有驾驶执照才能合法开车。\"],[\"The restaurant lost its <b>license</b> for serving alcohol to teenagers.\",\"这家餐馆因向青少年售酒被吊销了许可证。\"]],\"muscle\":[[\"Lifting weights builds <b>muscle</b> in the arms and shoulders.\",\"举重能锻炼手臂和肩膀的肌肉。\"],[\"The heart is a <b>muscle</b> that works without rest throughout your life.\",\"心脏是一块终生不停工作的肌肉。\"]],\"occupy\":[[\"The bookstore <b>occupies</b> the whole ground floor of the building.\",\"这家书店占用了这栋楼的整个一层。\"],[\"The exhibition will <b>occupy</b> three rooms of the museum.\",\"这次展览将占用博物馆的三个展厅。\"]],\"office\":[[\"Her <b>office</b> is on the fifth floor, next to the meeting room.\",\"她的办公室在五楼，会议室旁边。\"],[\"The company opened a new <b>office</b> in Singapore last year.\",\"公司去年在新加坡开了一家新办事处（办公室）。\"]],\"pants\":[[\"He bought a new pair of <b>pants</b> for the job interview.\",\"他为求职面试买了一条新裤子。\"],[\"Her <b>pants</b> were muddy after working in the garden.\",\"她在花园里干完活后，裤子上沾满了泥。\"]],\"physicist\":[[\"The <b>physicist</b> spent years studying the behaviour of particles at high speeds.\",\"这位物理学家多年研究高速粒子的行为。\"],[\"A young <b>physicist</b> proposed a new explanation for the strange results.\",\"一位年轻物理学家对这些奇怪结果提出了新的解释。\"]],\"pigeon\":[[\"Children fed the <b>pigeons</b> in the town square.\",\"孩子们在城镇广场上喂鸽子。\"],[\"A racing <b>pigeon</b> can find its way home from hundreds of kilometres away.\",\"赛鸽能从几百公里外找到回家的路。\"]],\"pinch\":[[\"She <b>pinched</b> a little salt between her fingers and sprinkled it over the soup.\",\"她用手指捏了一点盐，撒在汤上。\"],[\"Don't <b>pinch</b> your little brother; it hurts him.\",\"别捏你弟弟，会把他捏疼的。\"]],\"plastic\":[[\"The toys are made of coloured <b>plastic</b> rather than wood.\",\"这些玩具是彩色塑料做的，而不是木头。\"],[\"Single-use <b>plastic</b> bags are a major source of ocean pollution.\",\"一次性塑料袋是海洋污染的主要来源。\"]],\"preserve\":[[\"Salt was used for centuries to <b>preserve</b> meat through the winter.\",\"几个世纪以来，人们用盐来保存肉类过冬。\"],[\"The organisation works to <b>preserve</b> the region's ancient forests.\",\"这个组织致力于保存该地区古老的森林。\"]],\"proliferate\":[[\"Rabbits <b>proliferated</b> rapidly after they were introduced to the island.\",\"兔子被引入这座岛后迅速繁殖。\"],[\"Shopping malls have <b>proliferated</b> in the suburbs over the past decade.\",\"过去十年，购物中心在郊区激增。\"]],\"rabbit\":[[\"A wild <b>rabbit</b> darted out of the bushes and vanished into its burrow.\",\"一只野兔从灌木丛中窜出，消失在洞穴里。\"],[\"The children keep a pet <b>rabbit</b> in a hutch in the garden.\",\"孩子们在花园的笼子里养了一只宠物兔。\"]],\"scalp\":[[\"He scratched his <b>scalp</b> where the mosquito had bitten him.\",\"他挠了挠被蚊子咬过的头皮。\"],[\"A healthy <b>scalp</b> is essential for strong hair growth.\",\"健康的头皮对头发的强健生长至关重要。\"]],\"spacecraft\":[[\"The <b>spacecraft</b> carried two astronauts into orbit around the Earth.\",\"这艘航天器把两名宇航员送入绕地球的轨道。\"],[\"Engineers tested the <b>spacecraft</b> for years before its first flight.\",\"工程师在首次飞行前对这艘航天器测试了数年。\"]],\"sulfate\":[[\"Copper <b>sulfate</b> forms bright blue crystals used in chemistry classes.\",\"硫酸铜（硫酸盐）形成亮蓝色晶体，用于化学课实验。\"],[\"The factory must remove <b>sulfates</b> from its waste water before releasing it.\",\"工厂必须在排放前去除废水中的硫酸盐。\"]],\"swallow\":[[\"The baby was learning to <b>swallow</b> solid food.\",\"这个婴儿正在学着吞咽固体食物。\"],[\"He <b>swallowed</b> the medicine with a glass of water.\",\"他就着一杯水吞下了药。\"]],\"transfusion\":[[\"After losing a lot of blood, the patient was given a <b>transfusion</b>.\",\"大量失血后，病人接受了输血。\"],[\"Before a <b>transfusion</b>, the donor's blood type must match the patient's.\",\"输血前，供血者的血型必须与病人匹配。\"]],\"wander\":[[\"He <b>wandered</b> through the old town without any particular destination.\",\"他在老城里漫无目的地徘徊。\"],[\"Don't let your mind <b>wander</b> during the safety instructions.\",\"听安全说明时别走神（让思绪游荡）。\"]],\"withdrawal\":[[\"Smokers in <b>withdrawal</b> often feel restless and irritable for a few weeks.\",\"戒断期的吸烟者往往会几周感到焦躁易怒。\"],[\"<b>Withdrawal</b> symptoms can begin within hours of the last dose.\",\"戒断症状可能在最后一次用药后几小时内出现。\"]],\"actuality\":[[\"In <b>actuality</b>, the 'ancient' ruins were built less than two hundred years ago.\",\"实际上，这些「古代」遗迹建成还不到两百年。\"],[\"The novel contrasts the hero's dreams with the <b>actuality</b> of life in a mining town.\",\"这部小说把主人公的梦想与矿业小镇生活的现实性作了对照。\"]],\"affinity\":[[\"The dye has a strong <b>affinity</b> for cotton fibers, so the color survives repeated washing.\",\"这种染料对棉纤维有很强的亲和力，所以颜色经多次洗涤也不会褪去。\"],[\"She felt an immediate <b>affinity</b> with the other volunteers, who shared her love of fieldwork.\",\"她立刻对其他志愿者产生了亲近感，他们和她一样热爱野外工作。\"]],\"alloy\":[[\"Bronze is an <b>alloy</b> of copper and tin that is harder than either metal alone.\",\"青铜是铜和锡的合金，比其中任何一种金属单独使用都更硬。\"],[\"The aircraft's frame is made from a lightweight aluminum <b>alloy</b>.\",\"这架飞机的框架由轻质铝合金制成。\"]],\"altruistic\":[[\"<b>Altruistic</b> behavior in vampire bats includes sharing blood meals with hungry roost mates.\",\"吸血蝙蝠的利他行为包括与饥饿的同栖伙伴分享血液餐。\"],[\"His <b>altruistic</b> donation funded the village school without any publicity.\",\"他利他的捐赠悄悄资助了这所乡村学校，没有任何宣传。\"]],\"amenity\":[[\"The dormitory's best <b>amenity</b> is a shared kitchen on every floor.\",\"这栋宿舍楼最受欢迎的便利设施是每层都有一间共用厨房。\"],[\"Hotels compete by adding <b>amenities</b> such as gyms, pools, and late checkout.\",\"酒店靠增设健身房、泳池、延迟退房等便利设施来竞争。\"]],\"augment\":[[\"The farmer <b>augmented</b> his income by repairing machinery for neighbors.\",\"这位农民靠给邻居修机器来增加收入。\"],[\"Glasses <b>augment</b> the eye's ability to focus light on the retina.\",\"眼镜增强了眼睛把光线聚焦到视网膜上的能力。\"]],\"authenticate\":[[\"Experts were called in to <b>authenticate</b> the painting before the auction.\",\"拍卖前请来专家证实这幅画的真伪。\"],[\"The bank uses a code sent to your phone to <b>authenticate</b> each transaction.\",\"银行用发送到你手机的验证码来证实每笔交易的真实性。\"]],\"bet\":[[\"He placed a small <b>bet</b> on the underdog team and won surprisingly.\",\"他在一支不被看好的球队身上押了一小注，意外地赢了。\"],[\"I wouldn't <b>bet</b> on the weather staying clear all weekend.\",\"我可不敢打赌整个周末都是晴天。\"]],\"bottle\":[[\"Divers recovered a sealed <b>bottle</b> from the wreck containing a note dated 1912.\",\"潜水员从沉船里打捞出一个密封的瓶子，里面有一张写于 1912 年的字条。\"],[\"Please return the empty <b>bottles</b> to the crate by the door.\",\"请把空瓶子放回门边的箱子里。\"]],\"catalyst\":[[\"A small amount of platinum acts as a <b>catalyst</b>, speeding the reaction without being consumed.\",\"少量铂充当催化剂，加快反应而自身并不被消耗。\"],[\"The railway's arrival was a <b>catalyst</b> for the town's rapid growth.\",\"铁路的到来成为这座小镇迅速发展的催化因素。\"]],\"chairman\":[[\"The <b>chairman</b> opened the meeting by summarizing last quarter's losses.\",\"主席在会议开始时总结了上个季度的亏损。\"],[\"As <b>chairman</b> of the committee, she had the final say on the budget.\",\"作为委员会主席，她对预算有最终决定权。\"]],\"clock\":[[\"The station <b>clock</b> had stopped at midnight, so passengers relied on their phones.\",\"车站的时钟停在了午夜，乘客们只好看手机。\"],[\"Workers in the factory <b>clock</b> in at six every morning.\",\"这家工厂的工人每天早上六点打卡上班。\"]],\"codex\":[[\"The <b>codex</b>, a bound book of handwritten pages, gradually replaced the scroll in the late Roman world.\",\"手抄本——一种装订成册的手写书页——在罗马世界晚期逐渐取代了卷轴。\"],[\"Only three Maya <b>codices</b> are known to have survived the Spanish conquest.\",\"据知只有三部玛雅手抄本在西班牙征服后幸存下来。\"]],\"condone\":[[\"The school does not <b>condone</b> cheating, even on ungraded practice quizzes.\",\"学校不宽恕作弊行为，哪怕是不计分的练习测验也不行。\"],[\"By staying silent, the manager seemed to <b>condone</b> the staff's corner-cutting.\",\"经理保持沉默，看起来像是在宽恕员工偷工减料的行为。\"]],\"cow\":[[\"Each <b>cow</b> on the farm wears a tag that tracks its milk production.\",\"农场里每头奶牛都戴着记录产奶量的标签。\"],[\"<b>Cows</b> spend much of the day grazing and chewing cud.\",\"奶牛一天中大部分时间都在吃草和反刍。\"]],\"crystal\":[[\"Under pressure deep underground, carbon atoms arrange themselves into a diamond <b>crystal</b>.\",\"在地下深处的高压下，碳原子排列成金刚石晶体。\"],[\"Salt <b>crystals</b> formed along the edge of the evaporating pond.\",\"盐晶体在蒸发池塘的边缘形成了。\"]],\"definite\":[[\"The contract sets a <b>definite</b> deadline: all work must finish by March 1.\",\"合同定了一个明确的期限：所有工作必须在 3 月 1 日前完成。\"],[\"There has been a <b>definite</b> improvement in water quality since the factory closed.\",\"自从工厂关闭以来，水质有了明显的改善。\"]],\"delay\":[[\"Heavy snow caused a three-hour <b>delay</b> at the airport.\",\"大雪导致机场延误了三个小时。\"],[\"The committee decided to <b>delay</b> the vote until more data were available.\",\"委员会决定推迟投票，直到有更多数据为止。\"]],\"delivery\":[[\"The <b>delivery</b> of the new printing press was postponed by a week.\",\"新印刷机的交付被推迟了一周。\"],[\"Same-day <b>delivery</b> of groceries became common in large cities.\",\"食品杂货当日交付在大城市变得很普遍。\"]],\"detection\":[[\"Early <b>detection</b> of the disease greatly improves the chances of successful treatment.\",\"及早探测出这种疾病能大大提高治疗成功的几率。\"],[\"The new sensor allows <b>detection</b> of methane leaks at very low concentrations.\",\"这种新传感器能探测到极低浓度的甲烷泄漏。\"]],\"diameter\":[[\"The telescope's mirror has a <b>diameter</b> of 2.4 meters.\",\"这台望远镜的镜面直径为 2.4 米。\"],[\"A redwood trunk can reach a <b>diameter</b> of more than five meters at its base.\",\"红杉树干底部的直径可超过五米。\"]],\"diverse\":[[\"The estuary supports a <b>diverse</b> community of fish, crabs, and wading birds.\",\"这片河口栖息着多种多样的鱼类、螃蟹和涉禽。\"],[\"Applicants came from <b>diverse</b> backgrounds, from farming families to urban engineers.\",\"申请者背景各异，有农民家庭出身的，也有城市工程师。\"]],\"eel\":[[\"The electric <b>eel</b> can generate a shock strong enough to stun its prey.\",\"电鳗能放出足以击晕猎物的电击。\"],[\"Young <b>eels</b> migrate thousands of kilometers from the ocean back to freshwater rivers.\",\"幼鳗从海洋洄游数千公里，回到淡水河流中。\"]],\"elbow\":[[\"He rested his <b>elbows</b> on the railing and watched the boats below.\",\"他把胳膊肘撑在栏杆上，看着下面的船。\"],[\"The plumber installed a pipe with a sharp <b>elbow</b> to turn the corner of the wall.\",\"水管工装了一段带急弯头的管道，让管子绕过墙角。\"]],\"enmity\":[[\"The two families' <b>enmity</b> lasted for generations after the land dispute.\",\"土地纠纷之后，这两个家族的敌意持续了数代人。\"],[\"Trade gradually softened the old <b>enmity</b> between the neighboring kingdoms.\",\"贸易逐渐缓和了这两个邻国之间由来已久的敌意。\"]],\"evaluate\":[[\"Before buying the mill, engineers <b>evaluated</b> the river's flow across all four seasons.\",\"在买下磨坊之前，工程师评估了这条河四季的水流量。\"],[\"The committee will <b>evaluate</b> each proposal against the same set of criteria.\",\"委员会将用同一套标准评价每一份提案。\"]],\"extract\":[[\"Chemists use solvents to <b>extract</b> the active compound from the plant's leaves.\",\"化学家用溶剂从这种植物的叶子中提取有效成分。\"],[\"It is difficult to <b>extract</b> useful information from such a disorganized archive.\",\"从如此杂乱无章的档案里提取有用信息很困难。\"]],\"fly\":[[\"A single <b>fly</b> kept circling the lamp, distracting everyone at the table.\",\"一只苍蝇一直绕着台灯打转，让桌旁的人都分了心。\"],[\"House <b>flies</b> can carry bacteria from garbage to uncovered food.\",\"家蝇能把细菌从垃圾带到没有遮盖的食物上。\"]],\"gladiator\":[[\"A <b>gladiator</b> who survived many bouts could eventually win his freedom.\",\"在多场搏斗中活下来的角斗士最终可能赢得自由。\"],[\"The museum displays the bronze helmet of a <b>gladiator</b> found near the arena.\",\"博物馆展出了在竞技场附近发现的一名角斗士的青铜头盔。\"]],\"hare\":[[\"A <b>hare</b> relies on speed and sudden changes of direction to escape foxes.\",\"野兔靠速度和突然变向来逃脱狐狸的追捕。\"],[\"Unlike rabbits, <b>hares</b> are born with fur and open eyes.\",\"与兔子不同，野兔出生时就有毛、眼睛也是睁开的。\"]],\"iceberg\":[[\"Only about one tenth of an <b>iceberg</b> rises above the water's surface.\",\"冰山只有约十分之一露出水面。\"],[\"The ship's radar detected the <b>iceberg</b> long before it came into view.\",\"船上的雷达早在冰山进入视野之前就探测到了它。\"]],\"import\":[[\"The country must <b>import</b> most of its oil from overseas.\",\"这个国家的大部分石油必须从海外进口。\"],[\"<b>Imports</b> of grain rose sharply during the drought year.\",\"干旱之年粮食进口量大幅上升。\"]],\"integrate\":[[\"The new curriculum <b>integrates</b> computer science into the existing math courses.\",\"新课程体系把计算机科学整合进现有的数学课程中。\"],[\"It took the immigrants a generation to fully <b>integrate</b> into the city's life.\",\"这些移民花了一代人的时间才完全融入这座城市的生活。\"]],\"label\":[[\"Each specimen jar bore a <b>label</b> recording where and when the insect was collected.\",\"每个标本瓶上都贴着标签，记录昆虫的采集地点和时间。\"],[\"Check the nutrition <b>label</b> before assuming a snack is low in sodium.\",\"在断定某种零食低钠之前，先看看营养标签。\"]],\"ladybug\":[[\"Gardeners welcome <b>ladybugs</b> because they eat aphids that damage crops.\",\"园丁们欢迎瓢虫，因为它们吃危害庄稼的蚜虫。\"],[\"A <b>ladybug's</b> bright red shell warns birds that it tastes unpleasant.\",\"瓢虫鲜红的外壳是在警告鸟儿：它的味道不好吃。\"]],\"landscape\":[[\"Glaciers carved the rugged <b>landscape</b> of valleys and sharp ridges we see today.\",\"冰川雕刻出了我们今天看到的山谷与尖峭山脊交错的崎岖地貌。\"],[\"Centuries of farming have transformed the <b>landscape</b> of the river plain.\",\"几个世纪的耕作改变了这片河谷平原的地貌。\"]],\"monastery\":[[\"The <b>monastery</b> on the cliff preserved manuscripts through the medieval centuries.\",\"悬崖上的这座修道院在中世纪保存了大量手稿。\"],[\"Monks at the <b>monastery</b> rose before dawn for the first prayers of the day.\",\"修道院里的僧侣在黎明前起床，做一天中的第一次祈祷。\"]],\"motel\":[[\"They stopped at a roadside <b>motel</b> after driving nine hours through the desert.\",\"在沙漠里开了九小时车后，他们在一家路边汽车旅馆停了下来。\"],[\"The <b>motel</b> offered free parking right outside each room, which suited travelers with cars.\",\"这家汽车旅馆每个房间门外都有免费停车位，正合自驾旅客的心意。\"]],\"option\":[[\"Students have the <b>option</b> of taking the exam online or in person.\",\"学生可以选择在线考试或到现场考试。\"],[\"When the bridge closed, the ferry became the only <b>option</b> for crossing the river.\",\"桥关闭后，渡轮成了过河的唯一选项。\"]],\"phobia\":[[\"Her <b>phobia</b> of heights made even a second-floor balcony uncomfortable.\",\"她的恐高症让她站在二楼阳台上都感到不适。\"],[\"Therapists treat a specific <b>phobia</b> by exposing the patient to the feared object gradually.\",\"治疗师通过让患者逐步接触恐惧对象来治疗特定的恐惧症。\"]],\"plankton\":[[\"<b>Plankton</b> drift with the currents and form the base of most ocean food webs.\",\"浮游生物随洋流漂移，构成大多数海洋食物网的基础。\"],[\"Whales filter enormous quantities of water to feed on tiny <b>plankton</b>.\",\"鲸鱼过滤大量海水，以微小的浮游生物为食。\"]],\"plot\":[[\"The novel's <b>plot</b> turns on a letter that arrives twenty years too late.\",\"这部小说的情节围绕一封迟到了二十年的信展开。\"],[\"Critics praised the film's acting but found its <b>plot</b> predictable.\",\"影评人称赞了这部电影的演技，但认为情节缺乏新意。\"]],\"quinoa\":[[\"<b>Quinoa</b> was a staple crop of Andean farmers long before it became popular abroad.\",\"藜麦早在风靡海外之前，就是安第斯农民的主粮。\"],[\"Because <b>quinoa</b> contains all nine essential amino acids, nutritionists call it a complete protein.\",\"因为藜麦含有人体必需的全部九种氨基酸，营养学家称它为完全蛋白。\"]],\"relapse\":[[\"Without follow-up care, many patients <b>relapse</b> within the first year of recovery.\",\"没有后续护理，许多患者会在康复的第一年内复发。\"],[\"A sudden <b>relapse</b> forced him back into the hospital for another round of treatment.\",\"病情突然复发迫使他再次入院接受新一轮治疗。\"]],\"research\":[[\"Her <b>research</b> on soil microbes took her to farms on three continents.\",\"她对土壤微生物的研究让她走遍了三大洲的农场。\"],[\"The university increased funding for climate <b>research</b> this year.\",\"这所大学今年增加了对气候研究的经费。\"]],\"skin\":[[\"The <b>skin</b> is the body's largest organ and its first line of defense.\",\"皮肤是人体最大的器官，也是第一道防线。\"],[\"A tomato's thin <b>skin</b> splits easily when the fruit ripens too fast in hot weather.\",\"番茄薄薄的表皮在炎热天气里熟得太快时容易裂开。\"]],\"structure\":[[\"The <b>structure</b> of the beehive allows thousands of insects to live in a small space.\",\"蜂巢的结构让成千上万只昆虫能住在狭小的空间里。\"],[\"Engineers reinforced the bridge's steel <b>structure</b> after the earthquake.\",\"地震后，工程师加固了这座桥的钢结构。\"]],\"technique\":[[\"The potter's glazing <b>technique</b> had been passed down through five generations.\",\"这位陶工的上釉技法已经传承了五代人。\"],[\"Surgeons now use a <b>technique</b> that repairs the valve through a tiny incision.\",\"外科医生现在使用一种通过微小切口修复瓣膜的技法。\"]],\"warfare\":[[\"Trench <b>warfare</b> defined much of the First World War on the Western Front.\",\"堑壕战是第一次世界大战西线战场的主要战争形式。\"],[\"The treatise discusses how siege <b>warfare</b> changed after the invention of gunpowder.\",\"这篇论著讨论了火药发明后攻城战发生的变化。\"]],\"weave\":[[\"Artisans <b>weave</b> the dyed threads into blankets on wooden looms.\",\"工匠们在木织机上把染好的线编织成毯子。\"],[\"The spider <b>weaves</b> a new web each evening to replace the one damaged by rain.\",\"蜘蛛每天傍晚编织一张新网，替换被雨水损坏的旧网。\"]],\"aluminium\":[[\"<b>Aluminium</b> (spelled 'aluminum' in American English) is prized for being light yet strong.\",\"铝（美式拼写为 aluminum）的优点是既轻又结实——注意本词是英式拼写 aluminium。\"],[\"Recycling <b>aluminium</b> cans uses only a fraction of the energy needed to make new ones.\",\"回收铝罐所用的能源只是制造新罐的一小部分。\"]],\"anchor\":[[\"The ship dropped <b>anchor</b> in the sheltered bay and waited out the storm.\",\"船在避风的海湾里下锚，等待风暴过去。\"],[\"In the experiment, the first price mentioned <b>anchored</b> all later negotiations.\",\"在这项实验中，最先报出的价格锚定了之后所有的谈判。\"]],\"aptitude\":[[\"The test measures <b>aptitude</b> for mechanical reasoning rather than memorized facts.\",\"这项测试测的是机械推理的天赋，而不是死记硬背的知识。\"],[\"She showed an early <b>aptitude</b> for languages, picking up Portuguese in a single summer.\",\"她很早就显露出语言天赋，一个夏天就学会了葡萄牙语。\"]],\"assembly\":[[\"The car plant's <b>assembly</b> line stops automatically if a sensor detects a defect.\",\"这家汽车厂的装配线一旦传感器检测到缺陷就会自动停下来。\"],[\"The school held an <b>assembly</b> to honor the graduating class.\",\"学校举行集会，向毕业班致敬。\"]],\"bat\":[[\"A <b>bat</b> navigates in total darkness by emitting sounds and listening for the echoes.\",\"蝙蝠靠发出声音并聆听回声，在完全黑暗中导航。\"],[\"Some <b>bats</b> pollinate night-blooming flowers while feeding on their nectar.\",\"有些蝙蝠在吸食花蜜时为夜间开花的植物授粉。\"]],\"battle\":[[\"The <b>battle</b> of Hastings in 1066 reshaped the English language as well as its monarchy.\",\"1066 年的黑斯廷斯战役不仅重塑了英格兰的君主制，也改变了英语。\"],[\"Both armies avoided a pitched <b>battle</b> and maneuvered for weeks instead.\",\"两军都避免正面交锋，转而周旋了数周。\"]],\"cinnamon\":[[\"<b>Cinnamon</b> is harvested by stripping the inner bark of a tropical tree and letting it curl as it dries.\",\"肉桂是剥下热带树木的内皮、让它在晾干时自然卷曲而制成的。\"],[\"A pinch of <b>cinnamon</b> gave the plain rice pudding its warm flavor.\",\"一小撮肉桂让这份平淡的米布丁有了温暖的香气。\"]],\"convey\":[[\"A good map can <b>convey</b> in seconds what takes pages of text to describe.\",\"一张好地图能在几秒内传达文字需要几页才能描述的信息。\"],[\"Pipes <b>convey</b> water from the reservoir to the treatment plant.\",\"管道把水从水库输送到处理厂。\"]],\"culmination\":[[\"The concert was the <b>culmination</b> of months of rehearsals by the youth orchestra.\",\"这场音乐会是青年乐团数月排练的顶点成果。\"],[\"Her election marked the <b>culmination</b> of a twenty-year career in local politics.\",\"她的当选标志着她二十年地方政治生涯的顶峰。\"]],\"disease\":[[\"Clean drinking water sharply reduced the spread of <b>disease</b> in the growing cities.\",\"干净的饮用水大幅减少了疾病在不断扩张的城市中的传播。\"],[\"Plant pathologists study how <b>disease</b> moves through a wheat field.\",\"植物病理学家研究疾病如何在麦田里蔓延。\"]],\"displace\":[[\"The new supermarket <b>displaced</b> several small family-run shops on the street.\",\"新超市取代了街上几家家庭经营的小店。\"],[\"A floating object <b>displaces</b> a volume of water equal to its own weight.\",\"漂浮的物体会排开与自身重量相等体积的水。\"]],\"dispute\":[[\"The boundary <b>dispute</b> between the two villages lasted nearly a century.\",\"两个村庄之间的边界争端持续了近一个世纪。\"],[\"Workers and management settled their <b>dispute</b> over overtime pay after mediation.\",\"经过调解，工人与管理层解决了关于加班费的争端。\"]],\"dissipation\":[[\"The <b>dissipation</b> of heat through the metal fins keeps the engine from overheating.\",\"热量通过金属散热片消散，使发动机不至于过热。\"],[\"Friction causes the gradual <b>dissipation</b> of the pendulum's energy.\",\"摩擦导致摆的能量逐渐消散。\"]],\"dream\":[[\"In his <b>dream</b>, he was flying over the coastline where he grew up.\",\"在梦里，他飞越了自己长大的那片海岸。\"],[\"The REM stage of sleep is when most vivid <b>dreams</b> occur.\",\"快速眼动睡眠期是大多数生动梦境出现的阶段。\"]],\"elementary\":[[\"The course covers <b>elementary</b> statistics: means, medians, and simple graphs.\",\"这门课讲授初等统计学：平均数、中位数和简单图表。\"],[\"Children learn <b>elementary</b> arithmetic long before they encounter algebra.\",\"孩子们在接触代数很久以前就学会了初等算术。\"]],\"emigration\":[[\"The famine of the 1840s triggered mass <b>emigration</b> from Ireland.\",\"19 世纪 40 年代的饥荒引发了爱尔兰的大规模向外移民。\"],[\"<b>Emigration</b> rates fell once the economy at home began to recover.\",\"国内经济开始复苏后，移出率下降了。\"]],\"encore\":[[\"The audience clapped so loudly that the pianist returned for an <b>encore</b>.\",\"观众掌声如雷，钢琴家不得不返场再演一曲。\"],[\"Calls for an <b>encore</b> continued long after the house lights came up.\",\"剧场灯亮起后，要求再演的呼声仍持续了很久。\"]],\"equilibrium\":[[\"Predator and prey populations tend toward an <b>equilibrium</b> when food is steady.\",\"食物稳定时，捕食者与猎物的数量会趋向平衡。\"],[\"The gymnast paused on the beam until she regained her <b>equilibrium</b>.\",\"体操运动员在平衡木上停了一下，直到重新找回平衡。\"]],\"errand\":[[\"He ran a quick <b>errand</b> to the pharmacy before dinner.\",\"晚饭前他去药房办了件小差事。\"],[\"The messenger was sent on an <b>errand</b> to deliver the sealed letter to the governor.\",\"信使奉命跑一趟差事，把密封信送到总督手里。\"]],\"exception\":[[\"With the <b>exception</b> of one elderly lighthouse keeper, everyone left the island before the storm.\",\"除了一位年迈的灯塔看守人，所有人都在风暴来临前离开了小岛。\"],[\"Every rule in the grammar book seems to have at least one <b>exception</b>.\",\"这本语法书里的每条规则似乎都至少有一个例外。\"]],\"exchange\":[[\"Students from the two schools <b>exchanged</b> letters for a year before meeting in person.\",\"两校学生通信交换了一年才见面。\"],[\"The merchants <b>exchanged</b> silver for spices at the port.\",\"商人们在港口用白银交换香料。\"]],\"existence\":[[\"The telescope provided the first solid evidence for the <b>existence</b> of the distant planet.\",\"这台望远镜为那颗遥远行星的存在提供了第一个确凿证据。\"],[\"The species clings to <b>existence</b> in a single protected valley.\",\"这个物种在一条受保护的山谷里勉强存续着。\"]],\"fable\":[[\"In the <b>fable</b>, the tortoise beats the hare by never stopping.\",\"在这则寓言故事里，乌龟靠从不停步赢了野兔。\"],[\"Aesop's <b>fables</b> end with a moral stated in a single line.\",\"伊索寓言故事的结尾都会用一句话点明寓意。\"]],\"fertile\":[[\"Volcanic ash eventually weathers into <b>fertile</b> soil rich in minerals.\",\"火山灰最终风化成富含矿物质的肥沃土壤。\"],[\"The floodplain was so <b>fertile</b> that farmers harvested two crops a year.\",\"这片冲积平原十分肥沃，农民一年能收两季庄稼。\"]],\"flock\":[[\"A <b>flock</b> of starlings twisted in the evening sky like a single organism.\",\"一群椋鸟在傍晚的天空中翻卷，如同一个整体。\"],[\"The shepherd led his <b>flock</b> of sheep to higher pasture before the snow.\",\"牧羊人在下雪前把羊群赶到了高处的牧场。\"]],\"granite\":[[\"The courthouse was built from local gray <b>granite</b> quarried a few miles away.\",\"法院大楼用的是几英里外开采的本地灰色花岗岩。\"],[\"<b>Granite</b> cools slowly underground, which gives its crystals time to grow large.\",\"花岗岩在地下缓慢冷却，其晶体因此有时间长得很大。\"]],\"guarantee\":[[\"The manufacturer <b>guarantees</b> the watch against defects for five years.\",\"制造商为这块手表提供五年质量担保。\"],[\"No test score can <b>guarantee</b> success at university.\",\"任何考试分数都不能担保大学阶段的成功。\"]],\"heart\":[[\"The <b>heart</b> pumps roughly 7,500 liters of blood through the body each day.\",\"心脏每天将大约 7,500 升血液泵遍全身。\"],[\"During exercise, the <b>heart</b> rate can double within a minute.\",\"运动时，心率能在一分钟内翻倍。\"]],\"inventory\":[[\"The shop closes one day each January to count its entire <b>inventory</b>.\",\"这家商店每年一月停业一天，清点全部库存。\"],[\"Low <b>inventory</b> forced the dealer to turn away buyers.\",\"库存不足迫使经销商拒绝了买家。\"]],\"kiss\":[[\"She gave her daughter a quick <b>kiss</b> on the forehead before the school bus arrived.\",\"校车到来前，她在女儿额头上轻轻亲吻了一下。\"],[\"The two old friends greeted each other with a <b>kiss</b> on each cheek.\",\"两位老朋友见面时互相亲吻对方的脸颊打招呼。\"]],\"liberal\":[[\"The college prides itself on a <b>liberal</b> arts education rather than narrow job training.\",\"这所学院以自由的博雅教育自豪，而不是狭隘的职业培训。\"],[\"After the reforms, the country adopted a more <b>liberal</b> trade policy.\",\"改革之后，这个国家采取了更为自由开放的贸易政策。\"]],\"loan\":[[\"The bank approved a <b>loan</b> for the couple to renovate the farmhouse.\",\"银行批准了一笔贷款，让这对夫妇翻修农舍。\"],[\"He repaid the student <b>loan</b> five years after graduating.\",\"他毕业五年后还清了学生贷款。\"]],\"logistics\":[[\"Moving food to a remote island is a problem of <b>logistics</b> more than of supply.\",\"把食物运到偏远岛屿，与其说是供应问题，不如说是物流问题。\"],[\"The army's <b>logistics</b> corps kept fuel and ammunition flowing to the front.\",\"军队的物流部队持续向前线输送燃料和弹药。\"]],\"neuron\":[[\"A single <b>neuron</b> can connect to thousands of other nerve cells.\",\"单个神经元可以与数千个其他神经细胞相连。\"],[\"Damage to motor <b>neurons</b> gradually weakens voluntary movement.\",\"运动神经元受损会逐渐削弱随意运动能力。\"]],\"novelist\":[[\"The <b>novelist</b> set her story in the fishing village where she had spent her childhood.\",\"这位小说家把故事背景设在她童年生活过的渔村。\"],[\"As a young <b>novelist</b>, he supported himself by writing radio scripts.\",\"年轻时，这位小说家靠写广播剧本谋生。\"]],\"ongoing\":[[\"The <b>ongoing</b> restoration of the cathedral is expected to take another decade.\",\"大教堂持续进行中的修复工程预计还需十年。\"],[\"Researchers cautioned that the study is <b>ongoing</b> and its conclusions may change.\",\"研究人员提醒说这项研究仍在持续进行，结论可能会改变。\"]],\"parrot\":[[\"The <b>parrot</b> learned to imitate the doorbell so well that it fooled the dog.\",\"这只鹦鹉学门铃声学得惟妙惟肖，连狗都被骗了。\"],[\"Wild <b>parrots</b> use their strong beaks to crack open hard seeds.\",\"野生鹦鹉用强有力的喙撬开坚硬的种子。\"]],\"petal\":[[\"Each <b>petal</b> of the cherry blossom falls only a few days after the flower opens.\",\"樱花的每片花瓣在开花后几天就会飘落。\"],[\"Bees are guided to the flower's center by colored patterns on the <b>petals</b>.\",\"蜜蜂被花瓣上的彩色纹路引导到花的中心。\"]],\"piston\":[[\"The <b>piston</b> moves up and down inside the cylinder, compressing the fuel mixture.\",\"活塞在气缸内上下运动，压缩燃油混合气。\"],[\"A cracked <b>piston</b> ring lets oil leak into the combustion chamber.\",\"活塞环破裂会让机油漏进燃烧室。\"]],\"plateau\":[[\"The trail climbs steeply for two hours before reaching a windy <b>plateau</b>.\",\"小路陡峭地爬升两个小时后，到达一处多风的高原。\"],[\"Settlers farmed the high <b>plateau</b> despite its short growing season.\",\"尽管生长季短，定居者仍在这片高原上耕作。\"]],\"portfolio\":[[\"For the interview, the illustrator brought a <b>portfolio</b> of her published work.\",\"面试时，这位插画师带来了一本收录她已发表作品的作品集。\"],[\"Applicants to the architecture program must submit a design <b>portfolio</b>.\",\"申请建筑专业的学生必须提交一份设计作品集。\"]],\"radiation\":[[\"The Earth's atmosphere blocks most of the Sun's ultraviolet <b>radiation</b>.\",\"地球大气层挡住了太阳的大部分紫外辐射。\"],[\"Workers near the reactor wear badges that measure their exposure to <b>radiation</b>.\",\"反应堆附近的工人佩戴能测量辐射暴露量的徽章。\"]],\"rotten\":[[\"The fallen log was so <b>rotten</b> that it crumbled when touched.\",\"倒下的原木已经腐烂到一碰就碎。\"],[\"Farmers discard <b>rotten</b> fruit before packing to protect the rest of the crop.\",\"农民在装箱前会挑出腐烂的水果，以免影响其余收成。\"]],\"steering\":[[\"The kart's <b>steering</b> felt loose, so the mechanic tightened the linkage.\",\"卡丁车的转向感觉发松，技工便紧了紧连杆。\"],[\"Power <b>steering</b> makes turning the wheel almost effortless at low speeds.\",\"动力转向让低速时打方向盘几乎毫不费力。\"]],\"strategy\":[[\"The chess player's <b>strategy</b> was to trade pieces and win in the endgame.\",\"这位棋手的策略是兑子，然后在残局取胜。\"],[\"The company's <b>strategy</b> focused on small towns that larger chains ignored.\",\"这家公司的策略聚焦于大连锁忽略的小城镇。\"]],\"trachea\":[[\"The <b>trachea</b> is reinforced by rings of cartilage that keep the airway open.\",\"气管由软骨环支撑，使气道保持畅通。\"],[\"Food is prevented from entering the <b>trachea</b> by a flap called the epiglottis.\",\"会厌这块瓣膜阻止食物进入气管。\"]],\"trick\":[[\"The magician's card <b>trick</b> baffled even the other performers.\",\"魔术师的纸牌戏法连其他表演者都看不明白。\"],[\"He taught his dog a new <b>trick</b>: rolling over on command.\",\"他教狗学了个新把戏：听到口令就打滚。\"]],\"window\":[[\"She opened the <b>window</b> to let the smell of paint escape.\",\"她打开窗户，让油漆味散出去。\"],[\"Frost formed delicate patterns on the train <b>window</b> overnight.\",\"一夜之间，火车窗户上结出了精致的冰花图案。\"]],\"yard\":[[\"The children built a fort of blankets and sticks in the back <b>yard</b>.\",\"孩子们在后院用毯子和树枝搭了一个堡垒。\"],[\"Vegetable beds filled most of the small <b>yard</b> behind the house.\",\"屋后小小的院子大部分被菜畦占满了。\"]],\"acclaim\":[[\"The young violinist won international <b>acclaim</b> after a single recording.\",\"这位年轻的小提琴家仅凭一张唱片就赢得了国际赞誉。\"],[\"Critics greeted the restored film with <b>acclaim</b>.\",\"影评人对这部修复后的电影报以赞誉。\"]],\"ape\":[[\"The documentary follows an <b>ape</b> learning to use sticks to fish termites from a mound.\",\"这部纪录片跟踪一只猿学会用树枝从蚁丘里钓白蚁。\"],[\"Unlike monkeys, an <b>ape</b> has no tail and a larger brain relative to body size.\",\"与猴子不同，猿没有尾巴，而且脑相对身体的比例更大。\"]],\"apologize\":[[\"The airline <b>apologized</b> for the cancellation and rebooked passengers at no charge.\",\"航空公司为取消航班道歉，并免费为乘客改签。\"],[\"He <b>apologized</b> to the librarian for returning the book a month late.\",\"他为晚还书一个月向图书管理员道歉。\"]],\"attach\":[[\"Please <b>attach</b> the signed form to the end of your application.\",\"请把签好字的表格附加在申请材料末尾。\"],[\"Workers <b>attached</b> the cable to the crane's hook before lifting the beam.\",\"起吊横梁前，工人把缆绳附加固定在起重机吊钩上。\"]],\"beckon\":[[\"From the doorway, the guide <b>beckoned</b> the group to follow her into the cave.\",\"向导站在洞口，招手示意大家跟她进洞。\"],[\"The lighthouse seemed to <b>beckon</b> ships toward the harbor entrance.\",\"灯塔仿佛在召唤船只驶向港口入口。\"]],\"bemuse\":[[\"The contract's dense clauses <b>bemused</b> even the experienced lawyer.\",\"合同里晦涩难懂的条款连经验丰富的律师都被弄糊涂了。\"],[\"He gave a <b>bemused</b> shrug and admitted he had no idea which train to take.\",\"他迷惑地耸耸肩，承认自己完全不知道该坐哪趟火车。\"]],\"besmirch\":[[\"A single bribery scandal <b>besmirched</b> the judge's lifelong reputation.\",\"一桩受贿丑闻玷污了这位法官一生的声誉。\"],[\"The factory's runoff <b>besmirched</b> the once-clear reputation of the valley's river.\",\"工厂排放的污水玷污了这条山谷河流曾经清澈的名声。\"]],\"brittle\":[[\"Old plastic becomes <b>brittle</b> and cracks easily after years in the sun.\",\"旧塑料在阳光下放多年后会变脆，容易开裂。\"],[\"The manuscript's <b>brittle</b> pages must be handled with gloves and turned slowly.\",\"手稿易碎的书页必须戴手套、慢慢翻动。\"]],\"broom\":[[\"She swept the flour off the bakery floor with a stiff <b>broom</b>.\",\"她用一把硬扫帚把面包房地板上的面粉扫掉。\"],[\"Traditionally, a witch's <b>broom</b> in folklore was a symbol of household work, not flight.\",\"在民间传说中，女巫的扫帚传统上是家务的象征，而不是飞行工具。\"]],\"cantaloupe\":[[\"A ripe <b>cantaloupe</b> smells sweet at the stem end and feels heavy for its size.\",\"成熟的哈密瓜在蒂部闻起来香甜，拿在手里分量压手。\"],[\"The melon farmer planted <b>cantaloupes</b> in the sunniest field.\",\"瓜农把哈密瓜种在阳光最充足的田里。\"]],\"chronic\":[[\"<b>Chronic</b> back pain kept him from sitting through long lectures.\",\"慢性的背痛让他无法坐着听完长讲座。\"],[\"The region suffers from a <b>chronic</b> shortage of clean water.\",\"这个地区长期遭受清洁水源短缺，这是个慢性问题。\"]],\"classic\":[[\"The novel is now considered a <b>classic</b>, though reviewers ignored it when it appeared.\",\"这部小说如今被视为经典，尽管出版时评论界对它不屑一顾。\"],[\"A <b>classic</b> example of erosion is the Grand Canyon, carved by the Colorado River.\",\"侵蚀的经典例子就是由科罗拉多河冲刷出的大峡谷。\"]],\"coach\":[[\"The <b>coach</b> taught the rowers to match their strokes exactly.\",\"教练教桨手们让划桨动作完全一致。\"],[\"After twenty seasons, the <b>coach</b> retired with more wins than any predecessor.\",\"执教二十个赛季后，这位教练带着比任何前任都多的胜场退休了。\"]],\"coalesce\":[[\"Over millions of years, the tiny dust grains <b>coalesced</b> into planets.\",\"数百万年间，微小的尘埃颗粒逐渐合并成了行星。\"],[\"The scattered protests <b>coalesced</b> into a single national movement.\",\"分散的抗议活动合并成了一场全国性的运动。\"]],\"code\":[[\"The programmer found the bug by reading the <b>code</b> line by line.\",\"程序员逐行阅读代码，找到了那个 bug。\"],[\"Ancient merchants used a secret <b>code</b> to protect their price lists.\",\"古代商人用密码代码保护他们的价目表。\"]],\"coerce\":[[\"The confession was thrown out because police had <b>coerced</b> the suspect.\",\"这份供词被驳回，因为警方曾胁迫嫌疑人。\"],[\"No one can <b>coerce</b> the committee into approving a budget it opposes.\",\"没有人能胁迫委员会批准它反对的预算。\"]],\"commence\":[[\"Construction of the observatory will <b>commence</b> once the road is finished.\",\"道路修好后，天文台的建设就将开始。\"],[\"The ceremony <b>commenced</b> with a reading of the names of the graduates.\",\"仪式以宣读毕业生名单开始。\"]],\"conductor\":[[\"Copper is an excellent <b>conductor</b> of both heat and electricity.\",\"铜是热和电的优良导体。\"],[\"Pure water is a poor <b>conductor</b>, but dissolved salts make it conduct well.\",\"纯水导电性很差，但溶解了盐分后就能很好地导电。\"]],\"counseling\":[[\"The university offers free <b>counseling</b> to students struggling with anxiety.\",\"这所大学为受焦虑困扰的学生提供免费咨询。\"],[\"Career <b>counseling</b> helped her realize that research suited her better than sales.\",\"职业咨询帮她意识到研究比销售更适合自己。\"]],\"country\":[[\"Iceland is a <b>country</b> where nearly all electricity comes from renewable sources.\",\"冰岛是一个几乎全部电力都来自可再生能源的国家。\"],[\"Citizens of the <b>country</b> voted in the first free election in decades.\",\"这个国家的公民参加了几十年来第一次自由选举。\"]],\"deterrent\":[[\"The steep fine serves as a <b>deterrent</b> against dumping waste in the river.\",\"高额罚款对往河里倾倒废物起到了威慑作用。\"],[\"Bright lights are a simple <b>deterrent</b> to burglars.\",\"明亮的灯光是威慑窃贼的简单威慑物。\"]],\"discourse\":[[\"The professor's <b>discourse</b> on medieval trade lasted nearly two hours.\",\"教授关于中世纪贸易的论述持续了近两个小时。\"],[\"Public <b>discourse</b> about the dam focused on cost rather than on ecology.\",\"公众关于这座水坝的论述集中在成本上，而不是生态上。\"]],\"economics\":[[\"She studies <b>economics</b>, focusing on how minimum wages affect small businesses.\",\"她学的是经济学，专攻最低工资如何影响小企业。\"],[\"The <b>economics</b> of solar power improved as panel prices fell.\",\"随着光伏板价格下降，太阳能发电的经济学变得可行起来。\"]],\"estimate\":[[\"Engineers <b>estimate</b> that the tunnel will take four years to complete.\",\"工程师估计这条隧道需要四年才能完工。\"],[\"Her rough <b>estimate</b> of the crowd was later confirmed by aerial photographs.\",\"她对人数的粗略估计后来被航拍照片证实。\"]],\"gear\":[[\"The clockmaker cut each <b>gear</b> tooth by hand.\",\"钟表匠手工切削每个齿轮的齿。\"],[\"When one <b>gear</b> turns, it drives the smaller gear at twice the speed.\",\"一个齿轮转动时，会带动较小的齿轮以两倍速度运转。\"]],\"hockey\":[[\"In ice <b>hockey</b>, players may be sent to the penalty box for rough play.\",\"在冰球比赛中，球员可能因动作粗暴被罚进受罚席。\"],[\"Field <b>hockey</b> is played on grass or turf with a small hard ball.\",\"曲棍球在草地或人造草皮上进行，用的是一个坚硬的小球。\"]],\"immigrate\":[[\"Her grandparents <b>immigrated</b> to Canada in the 1950s and settled near Toronto.\",\"她的祖父母在 20 世纪 50 年代移入加拿大，定居在多伦多附近。\"],[\"Many who <b>immigrate</b> for work send part of their earnings back home.\",\"许多为工作移入他国的人会把部分收入寄回家。\"]],\"internship\":[[\"During her <b>internship</b> at the aquarium, she learned to prepare food for the penguins.\",\"在水族馆实习期间，她学会了为企鹅准备食物。\"],[\"The <b>internship</b> lasted one summer and counted toward his degree.\",\"这次实习持续了一个暑假，并计入学分。\"]],\"knife\":[[\"The chef sharpened the <b>knife</b> before slicing the fish.\",\"厨师在切鱼之前先把刀磨快。\"],[\"Archaeologists found a flint <b>knife</b> beside the ancient hearth.\",\"考古学家在古代灶台旁发现了一把燧石刀。\"]],\"leadership\":[[\"Her calm <b>leadership</b> during the flood kept the rescue teams coordinated.\",\"洪水期间她沉着的领导力让各支救援队保持了协调。\"],[\"The course teaches <b>leadership</b> through case studies of explorers and engineers.\",\"这门课通过探险家和工程师的案例教授领导力。\"]],\"lens\":[[\"The camera's <b>lens</b> fogged up as soon as we stepped into the humid greenhouse.\",\"我们一走进潮湿的温室，相机透镜就蒙上了雾气。\"],[\"A convex <b>lens</b> brings parallel light rays together at a focal point.\",\"凸透镜把平行光线汇聚到一个焦点上。\"]],\"literacy\":[[\"Adult <b>literacy</b> programs in the region raised reading rates within a decade.\",\"该地区的成人读写能力（扫盲）项目在十年内提高了识字率。\"],[\"Digital <b>literacy</b> now includes judging whether an online source is trustworthy.\",\"如今数字读写能力还包括判断网络信息来源是否可靠。\"]],\"lizard\":[[\"The <b>lizard</b> warmed itself on a flat rock, motionless except for its breathing.\",\"蜥蜴趴在一块平坦的岩石上晒太阳，除了呼吸一动不动。\"],[\"Some <b>lizards</b> can shed their tails to escape a predator's grasp.\",\"有些蜥蜴能断尾逃生，摆脱捕食者的抓握。\"]],\"logo\":[[\"The coffee chain's green <b>logo</b> is recognized on every continent.\",\"这家咖啡连锁的绿色商标在各大洲都为人所识。\"],[\"She redesigned the festival's <b>logo</b> using only two colors.\",\"她只用两种颜色重新设计了这个节日的商标。\"]],\"mature\":[[\"A <b>mature</b> oak can produce thousands of acorns in a single autumn.\",\"一棵成熟的橡树一个秋天就能结出数千颗橡子。\"],[\"The wine is left to <b>mature</b> in oak barrels for two years.\",\"这种葡萄酒要在橡木桶中陈酿（成熟）两年。\"]],\"molecule\":[[\"A water <b>molecule</b> consists of two hydrogen atoms bonded to one oxygen atom.\",\"一个水分子由两个氢原子与一个氧原子结合而成。\"],[\"Heat makes <b>molecules</b> move faster and collide more often.\",\"加热会使分子运动加快、碰撞更频繁。\"]],\"musician\":[[\"The street <b>musician</b> played the violin where the subway lines crossed.\",\"这位街头音乐家在地铁换乘处拉小提琴。\"],[\"Every <b>musician</b> in the orchestra tuned to the oboe's A before the concert.\",\"音乐会前，乐团每位音乐家都按双簧管的 A 音调音。\"]],\"nebula\":[[\"The Orion <b>Nebula</b> is a vast cloud of gas where new stars are forming.\",\"猎户座星云是一大片正在形成新恒星的气体云。\"],[\"Through a small telescope, the <b>nebula</b> appears as a faint greenish patch.\",\"通过小型望远镜，这片星云看起来是一块淡淡的绿色光斑。\"]],\"papaya\":[[\"<b>Papaya</b> trees grow quickly and can bear fruit within a year of planting.\",\"木瓜树生长很快，种下后一年内就能结果。\"],[\"Unripe <b>papaya</b> is used in salads in Thai cooking.\",\"未成熟的木瓜在泰式烹饪中用来做沙拉。\"]],\"pilgrim\":[[\"Each year, thousands of <b>pilgrims</b> walk the mountain path to the shrine.\",\"每年都有成千上万的朝圣者沿着山路走向神殿。\"],[\"The <b>pilgrims</b> carried only water and bread for the three-day journey.\",\"朝圣者们三天的旅程只带了水和面包。\"]],\"restaurant\":[[\"The small <b>restaurant</b> near the harbor serves only what the boats bring in that day.\",\"海港边的小餐馆只供应渔船当天带回的海鲜。\"],[\"He worked as a dishwasher in a <b>restaurant</b> while studying at night.\",\"他一边在餐馆洗盘子，一边晚上读书。\"]],\"saga\":[[\"The Icelandic <b>saga</b> recounts voyages to lands west of Greenland.\",\"这部冰岛传奇故事讲述了航行至格陵兰以西土地的旅程。\"],[\"Her novel is a family <b>saga</b> spanning four generations of lighthouse keepers.\",\"她的小说是一部家族传奇故事，跨越四代灯塔看守人。\"]],\"silk\":[[\"Merchants carried <b>silk</b> westward along the routes now called the Silk Road.\",\"商人沿着如今被称为丝绸之路的路线把丝绸运往西方。\"],[\"A <b>silk</b> scarf is woven from threads produced by silkworms.\",\"丝绸围巾是用蚕吐出的丝线织成的。\"]],\"skeleton\":[[\"The whale's <b>skeleton</b> hangs from the ceiling of the natural history museum.\",\"鲸鱼的骨骼悬挂在自然历史博物馆的天花板上。\"],[\"Calcium keeps the <b>skeleton</b> strong, but bones also store minerals for the blood.\",\"钙让骨骼保持强壮，而骨骼也为血液储存矿物质。\"]],\"sodium\":[[\"Table salt is a compound of <b>sodium</b> and chlorine.\",\"食盐是钠和氯的化合物。\"],[\"Processed foods are often high in <b>sodium</b>, even when they do not taste salty.\",\"加工食品往往钠含量高，即使吃起来不咸也是如此。\"]],\"unpack\":[[\"It took her a week to <b>unpack</b> all the boxes after moving.\",\"搬家后，她花了一周才把所有箱子拆包整理完。\"],[\"Customs officers asked the traveler to <b>unpack</b> the suitcase for inspection.\",\"海关人员要求这名旅客拆包打开行李箱接受检查。\"]],\"value\":[[\"Honesty was the <b>value</b> his grandmother repeated more than any other.\",\"诚实是他祖母比任何其他价值观都更常念叨的一个。\"],[\"Different cultures place different emphasis on the <b>value</b> of individual achievement.\",\"不同文化对个人成就这一价值观的重视程度不同。\"]],\"vector\":[[\"In physics, force is a <b>vector</b> because it has both magnitude and direction.\",\"在物理学中，力是矢量，因为它既有大小又有方向。\"],[\"Students learn to add <b>vectors</b> by placing them tip to tail.\",\"学生们学习把矢量首尾相连来进行矢量加法。\"]],\"volunteer\":[[\"She works as a <b>volunteer</b> at the animal shelter on weekends.\",\"她周末在动物收容所做志愿者。\"],[\"Hundreds of <b>volunteers</b> planted trees along the riverbank.\",\"数百名志愿者在河岸边种树。\"]],\"affair\":[[\"The scandal became a public <b>affair</b> that dominated the newspapers for weeks.\",\"这桩丑闻成了一件人人议论的公共事件，连续几周占据报纸头条。\"],[\"Foreign <b>affairs</b> were handled by a small ministry with a staff of twelve.\",\"外交事务由一个只有十二名职员的小部门处理。\"]],\"aggregate\":[[\"The <b>aggregate</b> rainfall for the year was the lowest since records began.\",\"这一年的降雨量合计是自有记录以来最低的。\"],[\"In <b>aggregate</b>, the small farms produce more food than the large estates.\",\"把所有小农场加起来合计，它们产出的粮食比大庄园还多。\"]],\"alertness\":[[\"Coffee improves <b>alertness</b> for a few hours, but it cannot replace sleep.\",\"咖啡能让人在几小时内提高警觉，但不能代替睡眠。\"],[\"The night guard's <b>alertness</b> caught the intruder before anything was taken.\",\"夜班警卫的警觉让入侵者在偷走任何东西之前就被发现了。\"]],\"amphibian\":[[\"A frog is an <b>amphibian</b>: it begins life in water and later breathes air on land.\",\"青蛙是两栖动物：它在水中开始生命，后来在陆地上呼吸空气。\"],[\"Most <b>amphibians</b> must keep their skin moist to breathe through it.\",\"大多数两栖动物必须保持皮肤湿润，才能通过皮肤呼吸。\"]],\"antigen\":[[\"The vaccine trains the immune system to recognize a viral <b>antigen</b>.\",\"疫苗训练免疫系统识别一种病毒抗原。\"],[\"When an <b>antigen</b> enters the body, white blood cells begin producing antibodies.\",\"当抗原进入人体，白细胞便开始产生抗体。\"]],\"apologetic\":[[\"He gave an <b>apologetic</b> smile and explained that the train had broken down.\",\"他带着歉意的微笑解释说火车抛锚了。\"],[\"The company sent an <b>apologetic</b> letter to customers whose orders were lost.\",\"公司给订单丢失的顾客寄了一封道歉的信。\"]],\"artifact\":[[\"The museum's oldest <b>artifact</b> is a clay tablet inscribed with a tax record.\",\"博物馆最古老的文物是一块刻有税收记录的泥板。\"],[\"Each <b>artifact</b> in the tomb was photographed before being moved.\",\"墓中每件文物在移走之前都被拍了照片。\"]],\"bag\":[[\"Volunteers <b>bagged</b> the donated clothes and stacked them by size.\",\"志愿者把捐赠的衣服装袋，按尺码堆放好。（bag 在这里是动词「装袋」）\"],[\"Workers <b>bag</b> the harvested coffee beans before weighing them.\",\"工人们先把采收的咖啡豆装袋，然后再称重。\"]],\"become\":[[\"The caterpillar will <b>become</b> a butterfly inside its chrysalis.\",\"毛毛虫会在蛹里变成蝴蝶。\"],[\"As the metal cools, it <b>becomes</b> brittle.\",\"金属冷却时会变成易碎的状态。\"]],\"book\":[[\"The <b>book</b> she borrowed from the library was written a century ago.\",\"她从图书馆借的这本书写于一个世纪前。\"],[\"He kept a small <b>book</b> of bird sightings in his coat pocket.\",\"他外套口袋里装着一本小小的观鸟记录册。\"]],\"branch\":[[\"An owl perched on the lowest <b>branch</b> of the oak, watching the field.\",\"一只猫头鹰停在橡树最低的树枝上，注视着田野。\"],[\"The storm tore a heavy <b>branch</b> from the elm and dropped it across the path.\",\"暴风雨把榆树上一根粗树枝撕了下来，砸在小路上。\"]],\"candle\":[[\"Before electricity, students read at night by <b>candle</b> light.\",\"在有电之前，学生们晚上靠蜡烛的光读书。\"],[\"She lit a <b>candle</b> in the window to guide the travelers home.\",\"她在窗边点了一支蜡烛，为回家的人引路。\"]],\"cashew\":[[\"The <b>cashew</b> nut grows at the bottom of a pear-shaped fruit called the cashew apple.\",\"腰果长在一个梨形果实（腰果苹果）的底部。\"],[\"Workers wear gloves when shelling <b>cashews</b> because the shell oil can burn skin.\",\"工人剥腰果时戴手套，因为果壳油会灼伤皮肤。\"]],\"celery\":[[\"She chopped <b>celery</b> and carrots into the soup as it simmered.\",\"汤在炖煮时，她把芹菜和胡萝卜切好放了进去。\"],[\"Wild <b>celery</b> grows in marshes and has a much stronger flavor than the garden kind.\",\"野生芹菜长在沼泽里，味道比园艺品种浓烈得多。\"]],\"cheer\":[[\"The crowd <b>cheered</b> when the home team scored in the final minute.\",\"主队在最后一分钟进球时，人群欢呼起来。\"],[\"A loud <b>cheer</b> rose from the stands as the runner crossed the finish line.\",\"选手冲过终点线时，看台上爆发出响亮的欢呼声。\"]],\"claim\":[[\"After the fire, the shopkeeper filed a <b>claim</b> with the insurance company.\",\"火灾之后，店主向保险公司提出了索赔。\"],[\"Passengers can <b>claim</b> compensation when a flight is delayed overnight.\",\"航班延误过夜时，乘客可以索赔（要求赔偿）。\"]],\"comb\":[[\"She ran a <b>comb</b> through her wet hair before braiding it.\",\"她先用梳子把湿头发梳通，然后才编辫子。\"],[\"Archaeologists found a carved bone <b>comb</b> in the Viking burial.\",\"考古学家在维京人的墓葬中发现了一把雕花骨梳。\"]],\"constitution\":[[\"The country's <b>constitution</b> guarantees freedom of the press.\",\"这个国家的宪法保障新闻自由。\"],[\"After independence, delegates spent two years drafting a new <b>constitution</b>.\",\"独立之后，代表们花了两年时间起草新宪法。\"]],\"couple\":[[\"A <b>couple</b> of ducks nested by the pond this spring.\",\"今年春天，一对鸭子在池塘边筑了巢。\"],[\"The elderly <b>couple</b> had run the bakery together for forty years.\",\"这对老夫妇一起经营这家面包房已经四十年了。\"]],\"devil\":[[\"In the folk tale, a farmer outwits the <b>devil</b> by asking for an impossible harvest.\",\"在这则民间故事里，一个农民靠提出无理的收成要求智胜了魔鬼。\"],[\"The novel portrays the tyrant as a <b>devil</b> who enjoyed cruelty for its own sake.\",\"小说把这个暴君刻画成一个以残忍为乐的魔鬼。\"]],\"discretion\":[[\"The librarian used her <b>discretion</b> to waive the fine for the lost book.\",\"图书管理员出于谨慎斟酌（自由裁量），免除了这本遗失图书的罚款。\"],[\"Diplomats handled the leaked letters with <b>discretion</b>, refusing to comment publicly.\",\"外交官们谨慎地处理了泄露的信件，拒绝公开评论。\"]],\"disruption\":[[\"The strike caused serious <b>disruption</b> to train services across the region.\",\"罢工导致整个地区的列车服务严重中断。\"],[\"A fallen tree caused a brief <b>disruption</b> of power to the village.\",\"一棵倒下的树导致村里的电力短暂中断。\"]],\"droplet\":[[\"Each <b>droplet</b> of mist that lands on the leaf eventually rolls into the soil.\",\"落在叶子上的每一颗雾气小滴最终都会滚进土壤里。\"],[\"Coughing spreads tiny <b>droplets</b> that can carry viruses to others.\",\"咳嗽会喷出微小的飞沫（小滴），把病毒传给他人。\"]],\"emit\":[[\"Fireflies <b>emit</b> light through a chemical reaction in their abdomens.\",\"萤火虫通过腹部的化学反应释放（发出）光。\"],[\"The factory was fined for <b>emitting</b> smoke above the legal limit.\",\"这家工厂因释放的烟尘超过法定上限而被罚款。\"]],\"exhaustion\":[[\"After three days of rescue work, the firefighters collapsed from <b>exhaustion</b>.\",\"经过三天救援工作，消防员们精疲力竭地倒下了。\"],[\"Heat <b>exhaustion</b> is an early warning sign of heatstroke.\",\"热衰竭（精疲力竭的一种）是中暑的早期预警信号。\"]],\"grocery\":[[\"She stopped at the <b>grocery</b> store on her way home to buy milk and eggs.\",\"她回家路上在一家杂货店停下，买了牛奶和鸡蛋。\"],[\"The corner <b>grocery</b> has been run by the same family since 1960.\",\"街角这家杂货店自 1960 年以来一直由同一个家庭经营。\"]],\"hedgehog\":[[\"The <b>hedgehog</b> rolled into a ball of spines when the dog approached.\",\"狗走近时，刺猬蜷成了一个带刺的球。\"],[\"Gardeners leave piles of leaves where <b>hedgehogs</b> can hibernate through winter.\",\"园丁们会留一些落叶堆，让刺猬在里面冬眠过冬。\"]],\"hoe\":[[\"The farmer used a <b>hoe</b> to break up the soil between the rows of beans.\",\"农民用锄头把豆行之间的土翻松。\"],[\"Before tractors, a <b>hoe</b> and a plow were the main tools of most farms.\",\"在拖拉机出现之前，锄头和犁是大多数农场的主要工具。\"]],\"inspect\":[[\"Customs officers <b>inspect</b> a sample of containers at the port each day.\",\"海关人员每天在港口检查一部分集装箱。\"],[\"The engineer <b>inspected</b> the bridge cables for signs of corrosion.\",\"工程师检查了桥的缆索，看是否有腐蚀迹象。\"]],\"isolate\":[[\"Doctors <b>isolated</b> the infected patients to stop the outbreak from spreading.\",\"医生把感染的病人隔离开来（使孤立），阻止疫情蔓延。\"],[\"Chemists managed to <b>isolate</b> the compound responsible for the plant's bitter taste.\",\"化学家成功分离出了让这种植物发苦的化合物。\"]],\"lick\":[[\"The calf <b>licked</b> the salt block hanging by the gate.\",\"小牛舔着挂在栅栏门边的盐砖。\"],[\"She <b>licked</b> the envelope and pressed it shut.\",\"她舔了舔信封，把它封上。\"]],\"murderer\":[[\"Detectives identified the <b>murderer</b> from fingerprints left on the window.\",\"侦探凭窗户上留下的指纹确定了凶手。\"],[\"In the play, the <b>murderer</b> turns out to be the victim's own business partner.\",\"在剧中，凶手原来是受害者自己的生意合伙人。\"]],\"nail\":[[\"He hammered a <b>nail</b> into the beam and hung the lantern from it.\",\"他把一颗钉子钉进横梁，把灯笼挂了上去。\"],[\"The old boards were held together by rusty <b>nails</b>.\",\"这些旧木板靠生锈的钉子固定在一起。\"]],\"newton\":[[\"Force is measured in <b>newtons</b>: one newton accelerates a kilogram by one meter per second squared.\",\"力以牛顿为单位测量：一牛顿能让一千克质量获得每秒一米的加速度。\"],[\"The spring scale showed a pull of about forty <b>newtons</b>.\",\"弹簧秤显示拉力约为四十牛顿（单位）。\"]],\"offset\":[[\"Planting trees can <b>offset</b> some of the carbon a flight produces.\",\"种树可以弥补一次飞行产生的部分碳排放。\"],[\"The losses in the first quarter were <b>offset</b> by strong sales later in the year.\",\"第一季度的亏损被下半年强劲的销售弥补了。\"]],\"patient\":[[\"The <b>patient</b> was asked to fast for twelve hours before the blood test.\",\"病人被要求在抽血检查前禁食十二小时。（patient 在这里是名词「病人」）\"],[\"Each <b>patient</b> in the trial received either the drug or a placebo.\",\"试验中每位病人要么服用药物，要么服用安慰剂。\"]],\"piano\":[[\"She practiced the <b>piano</b> for an hour before school every day.\",\"她每天上学前练一小时钢琴。\"],[\"The movers wrapped the <b>piano</b> in blankets before carrying it down the stairs.\",\"搬运工先用毯子把钢琴包好，再抬下楼梯。\"]],\"saw\":[[\"The carpenter cut the plank to length with a hand <b>saw</b>.\",\"木匠用手锯把木板锯成需要的长度。\"],[\"A circular <b>saw</b> spins a toothed blade fast enough to slice through lumber in seconds.\",\"圆锯让带齿的锯片高速旋转，几秒钟就能切开木材。\"]],\"service\":[[\"Tourism is a <b>service</b> industry: it sells experiences rather than goods.\",\"旅游业属于服务业：它出售的是体验而不是商品。\"],[\"The region's economy shifted from farming to <b>services</b> such as banking and healthcare.\",\"这个地区的经济从农业转向了银行、医疗等服务业。\"]],\"silver\":[[\"The miners extracted <b>silver</b> from the ore using mercury.\",\"矿工用水银从矿石中提取银。\"],[\"Her grandmother's <b>silver</b> teapot had tarnished to a dull gray.\",\"她祖母的银茶壶已经氧化成了暗灰色。\"]],\"simulation\":[[\"Pilots train in a flight <b>simulation</b> before handling a real aircraft.\",\"飞行员在驾驶真正的飞机之前，先在飞行模拟中训练。\"],[\"The computer <b>simulation</b> predicted how the flood would spread through the valley.\",\"计算机模拟预测了洪水将如何在山谷中蔓延。\"]],\"spear\":[[\"The hunter threw his <b>spear</b> at the boar but missed.\",\"猎人把长矛掷向野猪，却没有命中。\"],[\"Bronze <b>spear</b> heads have been found at battle sites across the region.\",\"该地区各处战场遗址都发现了青铜长矛头。\"]],\"tardy\":[[\"The bus was <b>tardy</b> because of the icy roads, arriving twenty minutes late.\",\"因为路面结冰，公交车迟到了二十分钟。\"],[\"Students who are repeatedly <b>tardy</b> must meet with the counselor.\",\"屡次迟到的学生必须与辅导员谈话。\"]],\"telescope\":[[\"With a backyard <b>telescope</b>, you can see the rings of Saturn on a clear night.\",\"用一台后院望远镜，在晴朗的夜晚就能看到土星环。\"],[\"The space <b>telescope</b> orbits Earth above the distorting effects of the atmosphere.\",\"这台太空望远镜在大气层上方绕地球运行，避开了大气的扭曲影响。\"]],\"thesis\":[[\"Her <b>thesis</b> argues that the canal, not the railway, first unified the national market.\",\"她的论文论证说，最先统一全国市场的是运河而不是铁路。\"],[\"He spent three years writing his doctoral <b>thesis</b> on glacier movement.\",\"他花了三年时间写关于冰川运动的博士论文。\"]],\"toy\":[[\"The toddler dragged a wooden <b>toy</b> train behind her all afternoon.\",\"这个幼儿一下午都拖着一辆木制玩具火车。\"],[\"Wind-up <b>toys</b> were among the first mass-produced playthings for children.\",\"发条玩具是最早批量生产的儿童玩物之一。\"]],\"volt\":[[\"The battery supplies twelve <b>volts</b> to the car's electrical system.\",\"这块电池为汽车电气系统提供十二伏特的电压。\"],[\"A single lightning bolt can carry hundreds of millions of <b>volts</b>.\",\"一道闪电可以携带数亿伏特的电压。\"]],\"voltage\":[[\"High <b>voltage</b> lines carry electricity over long distances with less loss.\",\"高压（高电压）线路能以更小的损耗远距离输电。\"],[\"Check the <b>voltage</b> before plugging the device into a foreign outlet.\",\"把设备插到国外的插座前，先确认电压。\"]],\"watercolor\":[[\"She painted the harbor scene in <b>watercolor</b>, letting the white paper show through as foam.\",\"她用水彩画了这幅海港景色，让白色纸面透出来充当浪花。\"],[\"<b>Watercolor</b> dries quickly, so the artist must plan each wash in advance.\",\"水彩干得快，所以画家必须事先规划好每一层渲染。\"]],\"activist\":[[\"The environmental <b>activist</b> organized a cleanup of the polluted river.\",\"这位环保活动家组织了一次清理污染河流的行动。\"],[\"Student <b>activists</b> collected signatures for a petition to protect the library budget.\",\"学生活动家们为一份保护图书馆预算的请愿书征集签名。\"]],\"adapt\":[[\"Polar bears have <b>adapted</b> to life on the sea ice over thousands of years.\",\"北极熊在数千年里适应了海冰上的生活。\"],[\"The novel was <b>adapted</b> into a film that kept most of the original dialogue.\",\"这部小说被改编（使适应新形式）成电影，保留了大部分原始对白。\"]],\"aid\":[[\"After the earthquake, neighboring countries sent <b>aid</b> in the form of tents and medicine.\",\"地震后，邻国送来了帐篷和药品形式的援助。\"],[\"Hearing <b>aids</b> amplify sound for people with hearing loss.\",\"助听器为听力受损的人放大声音，提供听力援助。\"]],\"angel\":[[\"In the painting, an <b>angel</b> with folded wings watches over the sleeping child.\",\"画中一位收拢翅膀的天使守护着熟睡的孩子。\"],[\"The chapel ceiling is covered with carved wooden <b>angels</b>.\",\"小教堂的天花板上布满了木雕天使。\"]],\"appraise\":[[\"Experts <b>appraised</b> the antique vase at nearly a million yuan.\",\"专家对这只古董花瓶的评价鉴定结果接近一百万元。\"],[\"Before insuring the collection, the museum had each painting <b>appraised</b>.\",\"为藏品投保之前，博物馆请人逐一评价鉴定了每幅画。\"]],\"assume\":[[\"The model <b>assumes</b> that rainfall stays constant, which real weather rarely does.\",\"这个模型假设降雨量保持不变，而真实天气很少如此。\"],[\"Do not <b>assume</b> the trail is safe just because it is marked on the map.\",\"不要仅仅因为地图上标了这条路，就假设它安全。\"]],\"available\":[[\"Clean water is not <b>available</b> in every village along the desert route.\",\"沿沙漠路线的每个村庄并不都能获得干净水（可获得的）。\"],[\"The report will be <b>available</b> online from Monday morning.\",\"这份报告从周一早上起可在网上获得。\"]],\"backup\":[[\"Always keep a <b>backup</b> of your thesis on a separate drive.\",\"务必把论文的备份存在另一个硬盘上。\"],[\"The hospital switches to a <b>backup</b> generator when the main power fails.\",\"主电源故障时，医院会切换到备用（备份）发电机。\"]],\"barley\":[[\"<b>Barley</b> is one of the oldest cultivated grains, grown in Mesopotamia by 8000 BCE.\",\"大麦是最古老的栽培谷物之一，公元前 8000 年已在美索不达米亚种植。\"],[\"Farmers planted <b>barley</b> because it tolerates cold, dry soil better than wheat.\",\"农民种大麦，是因为它比小麦更耐寒冷干旱的土壤。\"]],\"batter\":[[\"Waves <b>battered</b> the seawall throughout the night of the storm.\",\"暴风雨之夜，海浪整夜连续猛击着防波堤。\"],[\"Hailstones <b>battered</b> the greenhouse roof until several panes cracked.\",\"冰雹连续猛击温室屋顶，直到几块玻璃裂开。\"]],\"beak\":[[\"The puffin uses its colorful <b>beak</b> to carry many small fish at once.\",\"海鹦用它色彩鲜艳的鸟喙一次叼住许多小鱼。\"],[\"A hummingbird's long <b>beak</b> lets it reach nectar deep inside tube-shaped flowers.\",\"蜂鸟细长的鸟喙能让它够到管状花朵深处的花蜜。\"]],\"bookshelf\":[[\"The <b>bookshelf</b> sagged under the weight of the encyclopedias.\",\"书架被百科全书压得弯了下来。\"],[\"He built a <b>bookshelf</b> from reclaimed timber in the workshop.\",\"他在工坊里用回收木材做了一个书架。\"]],\"candidate\":[[\"Each <b>candidate</b> for the scholarship submitted two essays and a reference letter.\",\"每位奖学金候选人提交了两篇文章和一封推荐信。\"],[\"The river valley is a strong <b>candidate</b> for protection as a national park.\",\"这条河谷是设立国家公园的有力候选地点。\"]],\"castle\":[[\"The <b>castle</b> on the hill guarded the river crossing for three centuries.\",\"山上的城堡守卫着渡口，守了三个世纪。\"],[\"Children built a sand <b>castle</b> and watched the tide slowly take it.\",\"孩子们堆了一座沙堡，看着潮水慢慢把它冲走。\"]],\"cleanse\":[[\"The river's flow <b>cleanses</b> the lagoon of stagnant water each spring.\",\"每年春天，河水都会冲刷净化潟湖里的死水。\"],[\"Doctors <b>cleansed</b> the wound with sterile water before dressing it.\",\"医生先用无菌水净化（清洗）伤口，然后才包扎。\"]],\"clench\":[[\"He <b>clenched</b> his fists as he listened to the unfair verdict.\",\"听到不公的判决时，他紧握双拳。\"],[\"The monkey <b>clenched</b> the branch with all four limbs during the gust.\",\"阵风中，猴子用四肢紧握住树枝。\"]],\"comprehensive\":[[\"The report offers a <b>comprehensive</b> survey of bird populations across the continent.\",\"这份报告对全大陆的鸟类种群做了一次全面的调查。\"],[\"Students take a <b>comprehensive</b> exam covering all four years of coursework.\",\"学生们要参加一次涵盖四年课程的全面考试。\"]],\"compulsion\":[[\"His <b>compulsion</b> to check the locked door ten times a night made sleep difficult.\",\"他每晚要检查十次门锁的强迫行为让他难以入睡。\"],[\"Under no <b>compulsion</b>, she confessed the mistake to the committee.\",\"没有受到任何强迫，她主动向委员会承认了错误。\"]],\"consensus\":[[\"After long debate, the scientists reached a <b>consensus</b> that the species was endangered.\",\"经过长时间辩论，科学家们达成共识：这个物种濒临灭绝。\"],[\"There is a growing <b>consensus</b> among historians about the cause of the collapse.\",\"历史学家们对崩溃原因的共识正在形成。\"]],\"contact\":[[\"Geologists found no <b>contact</b> between the two rock layers where the fault had shifted them.\",\"断层错动之处，地质学家在两层岩石之间找不到接触面。\"],[\"She stayed in <b>contact</b> with her research team by radio throughout the expedition.\",\"整个考察期间，她通过无线电与研究团队保持联系。\"]],\"contrive\":[[\"The prisoners <b>contrived</b> a ladder from bedsheets and smuggled tools.\",\"囚犯们谋划着用床单和偷运进来的工具拼出了一架梯子。\"],[\"The playwright <b>contrives</b> a meeting between the two brothers in the final act.\",\"剧作家在最后一幕谋划安排了两兄弟的相遇。\"]],\"cookie\":[[\"She dunked the <b>cookie</b> in her tea to soften it.\",\"她把饼干蘸进茶里泡软。\"],[\"The bakery sells oatmeal <b>cookies</b> by the dozen.\",\"这家面包房的燕麦饼干按打出售。\"]],\"demonstration\":[[\"Thousands joined the <b>demonstration</b> in the square to protest the new tax.\",\"数千人参加了广场上的示威，抗议新税。\"],[\"The <b>demonstration</b> remained peaceful as marchers carried banners past the parliament.\",\"示威保持和平，游行者举着横幅走过议会大楼。\"]],\"derived\":[[\"The word 'salary' is <b>derived</b> from the Latin word for salt.\",\"salary（薪水）一词源自拉丁语中表示盐的词。\"],[\"Much of the region's electricity is <b>derived</b> from coal.\",\"该地区的大部分电力源自煤炭。\"]],\"diaphragm\":[[\"When the <b>diaphragm</b> contracts, it flattens and draws air into the lungs.\",\"膈膜收缩时变平，把空气吸入肺部。\"],[\"Singers train the <b>diaphragm</b> to control long, steady notes.\",\"歌手训练膈膜来控制悠长平稳的音符。\"]],\"eccentricity\":[[\"His chief <b>eccentricity</b> was keeping forty clocks, all set to different times.\",\"他最大的古怪之处是养了四十只钟，每只的时间都调得不一样。\"],[\"Victorian readers forgave the inventor's <b>eccentricities</b> because of his genius.\",\"维多利亚时代的读者因为这位发明家的天才而原谅了他的种种古怪。\"]],\"esophagus\":[[\"The <b>esophagus</b> pushes food to the stomach in waves of muscle contraction.\",\"食道通过一波波肌肉收缩把食物推向胃部。\"],[\"A fish bone stuck in the <b>esophagus</b> can require emergency treatment.\",\"鱼刺卡在食道里可能需要急诊处理。\"]],\"eternity\":[[\"For the waiting passengers, the delayed train felt like an <b>eternity</b>.\",\"对等待的乘客来说，晚点的火车漫长得像永恒。\"],[\"Some desert rocks seem untouched for an <b>eternity</b>.\",\"有些沙漠岩石仿佛永恒未被触动过一般。\"]],\"fig\":[[\"The <b>fig</b> tree in the courtyard gave shade long before its fruit ripened.\",\"院子里的无花果树在果实成熟很久之前就提供了荫凉。\"],[\"Wasps play a surprising role in pollinating <b>figs</b>.\",\"黄蜂在无花果授粉中扮演了出人意料的角色。\"]],\"fluctuation\":[[\"Daily <b>fluctuation</b> in temperature can stress young seedlings.\",\"每日温度的波动会让幼苗承受压力。\"],[\"The graph shows the <b>fluctuation</b> of the lake's water level over fifty years.\",\"这张图显示了五十年间湖水水位的波动。\"]],\"garbage\":[[\"The city collects <b>garbage</b> twice a week, on Tuesdays and Fridays.\",\"市里每周收两次垃圾，周二和周五。\"],[\"Bears that feed on <b>garbage</b> lose their fear of people.\",\"吃垃圾的熊会失去对人的恐惧。\"]],\"ginger\":[[\"Fresh <b>ginger</b> gives the soup a sharp, warming bite.\",\"新鲜生姜给这汤带来辛辣温暖的口感。\"],[\"<b>Ginger</b> was once so valuable that it was traded like a spice of gold.\",\"生姜曾经珍贵到像黄金一样的香料那样被交易。\"]],\"highlight\":[[\"The report <b>highlights</b> the shortage of nurses in rural clinics.\",\"这份报告强调了农村诊所护士短缺的问题。\"],[\"In her lecture, she <b>highlighted</b> one experiment that changed the whole field.\",\"在讲座中，她强调了一个改变了整个领域的实验。\"]],\"hotel\":[[\"The <b>hotel</b> overlooks the harbor and fills up months ahead in summer.\",\"这家酒店俯瞰海港，夏天要提前几个月预订。\"],[\"Shipwrecked sailors were given rooms at the port's only <b>hotel</b>.\",\"遭遇海难的水手被安排住进港口唯一的酒店。\"]],\"imagery\":[[\"The poem's <b>imagery</b> of flooded fields conveys loss without naming it.\",\"这首诗里被淹没的田野的意象，没有明说却传达了失落。\"],[\"Satellite <b>imagery</b> revealed a new island formed by the eruption.\",\"卫星图像（意象）显示喷发形成了一座新岛屿。\"]],\"implicit\":[[\"There was an <b>implicit</b> agreement that the loser would pay for dinner.\",\"大家有个含蓄的（心照不宣的）约定：输的人请吃晚饭。\"],[\"Her criticism carried an <b>implicit</b> praise for how far the team had come.\",\"她的批评里含蓄地肯定了团队已经取得的进步。\"]],\"jewelry\":[[\"The tomb contained gold <b>jewelry</b> inlaid with turquoise.\",\"墓中出土了镶嵌绿松石的金珠宝。\"],[\"She keeps her grandmother's <b>jewelry</b> in a cedar box.\",\"她把祖母的珠宝放在一个雪松木盒子里。\"]],\"landslide\":[[\"Heavy rain triggered a <b>landslide</b> that blocked the mountain road for a week.\",\"暴雨引发了山体滑坡，堵住了山路整整一周。\"],[\"Engineers monitor the slope for early signs of a <b>landslide</b>.\",\"工程师监测这处山坡，寻找山体滑坡的早期征兆。\"]],\"lime\":[[\"She squeezed a wedge of <b>lime</b> over the grilled fish.\",\"她把一角酸橙挤在烤鱼上。\"],[\"<b>Lime</b> trees need protection from frost even in mild climates.\",\"酸橙树即使在温和的气候里也需要防冻。\"]],\"nutrition\":[[\"Good <b>nutrition</b> in the first years of life affects brain development.\",\"生命最初几年的良好营养会影响大脑发育。\"],[\"The label lists the product's <b>nutrition</b> facts per hundred grams.\",\"标签上列出了该产品每百克的营养成分。\"]],\"officer\":[[\"The police <b>officer</b> directed traffic around the flooded intersection.\",\"这名警官在被淹的路口指挥交通。\"],[\"Each customs <b>officer</b> stamps the passport after a brief inspection.\",\"每位海关官员在简短检查后在护照上盖章。\"]],\"organ\":[[\"The liver is the largest internal <b>organ</b> in the human body.\",\"肝脏是人体最大的内脏器官。\"],[\"Plants store starch in <b>organs</b> such as roots and tubers.\",\"植物把淀粉储存在根和块茎等器官中。\"]],\"organism\":[[\"A single-celled <b>organism</b> can carry out all the functions of life on its own.\",\"单细胞有机体能独立完成生命的全部功能。\"],[\"Coral is not a rock but a living <b>organism</b>.\",\"珊瑚不是岩石，而是活的有机体。\"]],\"printer\":[[\"The office <b>printer</b> jammed again just before the deadline.\",\"办公室的打印机在截止时间前又卡纸了。\"],[\"Early <b>printers</b> set each line of type by hand.\",\"早期的印刷工（靠印刷机工作的人）手工排每一行字。\"]],\"radar\":[[\"The ship's <b>radar</b> picked up a vessel that had no lights showing.\",\"船上的雷达探测到一艘没有亮灯的船只。\"],[\"Weather <b>radar</b> showed the storm moving toward the coast.\",\"气象雷达显示风暴正向海岸移动。\"]],\"rainfall\":[[\"Annual <b>rainfall</b> in the desert averages less than 25 centimeters.\",\"这片沙漠的年降雨量平均不到 25 厘米。\"],[\"Farmers keep records of <b>rainfall</b> to decide when to sow.\",\"农民记录降雨量，以决定何时播种。\"]],\"scroll\":[[\"The ancient <b>scroll</b> unrolled to reveal a map of the river system.\",\"这卷古代卷轴展开后，露出一幅河流系统地图。\"],[\"Before books, texts were copied onto <b>scrolls</b> of papyrus.\",\"在书出现之前，文本被抄写在纸草卷轴上。\"]],\"silt\":[[\"The river deposits <b>silt</b> on the floodplain, enriching the soil each year.\",\"河流把淤泥沉积在冲积平原上，每年使土壤更肥沃。\"],[\"A thick layer of <b>silt</b> buried the harbor after the dam was built.\",\"大坝建成后，厚厚一层淤泥埋住了港口。\"]],\"specific\":[[\"The instructions give <b>specific</b> measurements rather than vague directions.\",\"这些说明给出了具体的尺寸，而不是含糊的指引。\"],[\"Each species is adapted to a <b>specific</b> range of temperature.\",\"每个物种都适应某个具体的温度范围。\"]],\"admirable\":[[\"Her patience with the frightened children was <b>admirable</b>.\",\"她对受惊的孩子们表现出的耐心令人钦佩。\"],[\"The expedition showed <b>admirable</b> discipline when supplies ran low.\",\"物资告罄时，这支探险队展现出令人钦佩的纪律性。\"]],\"alienate\":[[\"His constant criticism began to <b>alienate</b> his closest supporters.\",\"他没完没了的批评开始疏远他最亲近的支持者。\"],[\"A manager who never listens will <b>alienate</b> the whole team.\",\"从不倾听的经理会疏远整个团队。\"]],\"analogous\":[[\"The heart's function is <b>analogous</b> to that of a pump.\",\"心脏的功能与泵相似。\"],[\"Gills are <b>analogous</b> to lungs in that both exchange gases with the environment.\",\"鳃与肺相似，因为两者都与外界进行气体交换。\"]],\"annoy\":[[\"The dripping tap began to <b>annoy</b> everyone in the quiet reading room.\",\"水龙头滴水的声音开始使安静阅览室里的每个人都烦恼。\"],[\"Mosquitoes <b>annoy</b> the cattle all summer, biting from dawn to dusk.\",\"整个夏天，蚊子从早到晚叮咬牛群，使它们烦恼不已。\"]],\"banjo\":[[\"The musician switched from guitar to <b>banjo</b> for the folk songs.\",\"演奏民歌时，这位乐手从吉他换成了班卓琴。\"],[\"A <b>banjo</b> produces its bright sound from a stretched membrane over a round body.\",\"班卓琴明亮的声音来自圆形琴身上绷紧的膜。\"]],\"barbaric\":[[\"The chronicle describes the prison conditions as <b>barbaric</b>.\",\"这部编年史把监狱里的状况描述为野蛮的。\"],[\"Even by the standards of the time, the punishment was considered <b>barbaric</b>.\",\"即便以当时的标准看，这种惩罚也被认为是野蛮的。\"]],\"believable\":[[\"The novel's dialogue is so natural that every character feels <b>believable</b>.\",\"这部小说的对白非常自然，每个角色都让人觉得可信。\"],[\"For the alibi to be <b>believable</b>, it had to match the train timetable exactly.\",\"要让这个不在场证明可信，它必须与火车时刻表完全吻合。\"]],\"bereave\":[[\"The war <b>bereaved</b> many families in the border villages.\",\"战争使边境村庄的许多家庭丧亲（失去亲人）。\"],[\"She was <b>bereaved</b> twice in one year, losing both her husband and her brother.\",\"她在一年内两次丧亲，先后失去了丈夫和兄弟。\"]],\"bladder\":[[\"The <b>bladder</b> stores urine until it is released from the body.\",\"膀胱储存尿液，直到它被排出体外。\"],[\"Fish use a swim <b>bladder</b> to control their buoyancy.\",\"鱼类用鳔（一种膀胱状器官）来控制浮力。\"]],\"bland\":[[\"The hospital served <b>bland</b> food that patients on restricted diets could tolerate.\",\"医院提供平淡的食物，让需要限制饮食的病人也能接受。\"],[\"Without salt or spices, the stew tasted <b>bland</b>.\",\"没有盐和香料，这锅炖菜吃起来平淡无味。\"]],\"cartoon\":[[\"The political <b>cartoon</b> showed the mayor juggling three budgets at once.\",\"这幅政治卡通（漫画）画着市长同时应付三份预算。\"],[\"Children watched a <b>cartoon</b> while the adults prepared lunch.\",\"大人们准备午饭时，孩子们看了一部卡通片。\"]],\"chop\":[[\"He <b>chopped</b> firewood until the pile reached the fence.\",\"他一直砍柴，直到柴堆堆到了栅栏边。\"],[\"The cook <b>chopped</b> the onions finely before adding them to the pan.\",\"厨师先把洋葱切（砍）碎，再下锅。\"]],\"clump\":[[\"A <b>clump</b> of bamboo sheltered the garden from the wind.\",\"一丛竹子为花园挡住了风。（clump 是「成丛」）\"],[\"Frogs laid their eggs in <b>clumps</b> among the reeds.\",\"青蛙把卵一团团地产在芦苇丛中。\"]],\"coffee\":[[\"<b>Coffee</b> plants grow best on mountain slopes, shaded by taller trees.\",\"咖啡植株在山坡上、由高大树木遮荫时，长势最好。\"],[\"The port exported more <b>coffee</b> than any other product that year.\",\"那一年，这个港口出口的咖啡比任何其他产品都多。\"]],\"competition\":[[\"<b>Competition</b> for nesting sites is fierce among seabirds on the cliff.\",\"悬崖上的海鸟对筑巢地点的竞争非常激烈。\"],[\"Two firms in <b>competition</b> lowered their prices within a week.\",\"两家互相竞争的公司在一周内先后降了价。\"]],\"core\":[[\"Earth's <b>core</b> is mostly iron and nickel, hotter than the surface of the sun.\",\"地球的核心主要由铁和镍构成，温度比太阳表面还高。\"],[\"Remove the apple's <b>core</b> before slicing it for the pie.\",\"做派之前，先把苹果的核心（果核）去掉。\"]],\"degrade\":[[\"Sunlight slowly <b>degrades</b> the plastic, making it weak and discolored.\",\"阳光慢慢降级（降解）这种塑料，使它变脆、褪色。\"],[\"Bacteria in the soil <b>degrade</b> fallen leaves into nutrients.\",\"土壤中的细菌把落叶降级分解成养分。\"]],\"derive\":[[\"Many modern medicines are <b>derived</b> from compounds first found in plants.\",\"许多现代药物是从最初在植物中发现的化合物中取得的。\"],[\"The village <b>derives</b> its income mainly from tourism.\",\"这个村庄的收入主要从旅游业中取得。\"]],\"dilemma\":[[\"The captain faced a <b>dilemma</b>: turn back and lose the cargo, or sail into the storm.\",\"船长面临窘境：返航就会失去货物，继续前进就要驶入风暴。\"],[\"Conservationists face the <b>dilemma</b> of protecting one species at the expense of another.\",\"保护主义者面临着保护一个物种就要牺牲另一个物种的窘境。\"]],\"distribute\":[[\"Volunteers <b>distributed</b> blankets and hot food at the shelter.\",\"志愿者在避难所分发毯子和热食。\"],[\"The seeds are <b>distributed</b> by wind once the pod dries and splits.\",\"豆荚干裂后，种子靠风来分发（传播）。\"]],\"excrement\":[[\"Animal <b>excrement</b> fertilizes the soil and returns nutrients to the grassland.\",\"动物的排泄物给土壤施肥，把养分还给草原。\"],[\"Researchers study fossil <b>excrement</b> to learn what ancient animals ate.\",\"研究人员研究粪便化石（排泄物化石），以了解古代动物吃什么。\"]],\"exuberance\":[[\"Her <b>exuberance</b> on stage infected the whole audience.\",\"她在舞台上的热情洋溢感染了全场观众。\"],[\"The puppy's <b>exuberance</b> knocked over two chairs in the kitchen.\",\"小狗的热情洋溢劲儿撞翻了厨房里的两把椅子。\"]],\"fireworks\":[[\"The festival ended with <b>fireworks</b> reflected in the river below.\",\"节日以烟花作结，烟花倒映在下面的河面上。\"],[\"<b>Fireworks</b> were invented in China, where they were first used to scare away evil spirits.\",\"烟花发明于中国，最初用来驱赶邪灵。\"]],\"goddess\":[[\"Demeter was the Greek <b>goddess</b> of the harvest.\",\"得墨忒耳是希腊神话中掌管丰收的女神。\"],[\"A bronze statue of the <b>goddess</b> stood at the entrance to the temple.\",\"神庙入口处立着一尊这位女神的青铜像。\"]],\"habitat\":[[\"Wetlands are a vital <b>habitat</b> for migratory birds.\",\"湿地是候鸟至关重要的栖息地。\"],[\"The panda's <b>habitat</b> shrank as bamboo forests were cut down.\",\"随着竹林被砍伐，熊猫的栖息地不断缩小。\"]],\"horizon\":[[\"The ship sank slowly below the <b>horizon</b> as we watched from the cliffs.\",\"我们站在悬崖上，看着船慢慢沉到地平线以下。\"],[\"At dawn, a thin line of light appeared on the eastern <b>horizon</b>.\",\"黎明时分，东方地平线上出现了一线微光。\"]],\"impose\":[[\"The city <b>imposed</b> a fine on factories that released untreated wastewater.\",\"市政府对排放未经处理废水的工厂强加了罚款。\"],[\"New taxes were <b>imposed</b> on imported luxury goods.\",\"对进口奢侈品强加了新税。\"]],\"laser\":[[\"The surgeon used a <b>laser</b> to make a precise cut that healed quickly.\",\"外科医生用激光做了一个愈合很快的精确切口。\"],[\"A <b>laser</b> beam can measure the distance to the Moon within centimeters.\",\"激光束能把到月球的距离测到厘米级精度。\"]],\"locate\":[[\"Rescuers used dogs to <b>locate</b> survivors under the rubble.\",\"救援人员用搜救犬定位（找到）废墟下的幸存者。\"],[\"The library helped her <b>locate</b> a copy of the out-of-print book.\",\"图书馆帮她定位找到了这本绝版书的一册。\"]],\"magpie\":[[\"The <b>magpie</b> is famous for collecting shiny objects near its nest.\",\"喜鹊以在巢边收集闪亮物品而闻名。\"],[\"A pair of <b>magpies</b> built their domed nest in the tallest pine.\",\"一对喜鹊在最高的松树上筑了圆顶巢。\"]],\"medieval\":[[\"The <b>medieval</b> castle had walls three meters thick.\",\"这座中世纪的城堡城墙有三米厚。\"],[\"In <b>medieval</b> Europe, most people could not read or write.\",\"在中世纪的欧洲，大多数人不会读写。\"]],\"mode\":[[\"Switch the machine to its quiet <b>mode</b> before using it at night.\",\"晚上使用前，把机器切换到静音模式。\"],[\"The most common <b>mode</b> of transport in the delta is the boat.\",\"在这片三角洲，最常见的交通模式（方式）是乘船。\"]],\"neighbor\":[[\"Our <b>neighbor</b> across the street grows tomatoes on his roof.\",\"街对面的邻居在屋顶上种番茄。\"],[\"When the power failed, <b>neighbors</b> shared candles and cooked together.\",\"停电时，邻居们互相分享蜡烛，一起做饭。\"]],\"pajamas\":[[\"The child refused to change out of his <b>pajamas</b> all Sunday morning.\",\"这孩子整个周日上午都不肯换下睡衣。\"],[\"She bought cotton <b>pajamas</b> for the winter trip.\",\"她为冬天的旅行买了一套棉睡衣。\"]],\"passenger\":[[\"Each <b>passenger</b> was allowed one bag in the cabin.\",\"每位乘客可以带一个包进客舱。\"],[\"The ferry can carry up to three hundred <b>passengers</b>.\",\"这艘渡轮最多可载三百名乘客。\"]],\"pasture\":[[\"The cattle were moved to a fresh <b>pasture</b> every few weeks.\",\"牛群每隔几周就被转移到一片新的牧场草地。\"],[\"Sheep grazed the high <b>pasture</b> above the tree line.\",\"绵羊在林线以上的高山牧场草地上吃草。\"]],\"pear\":[[\"The <b>pear</b> tree by the gate produced more fruit than the family could eat.\",\"大门边的梨树结的果子多得全家人都吃不完。\"],[\"He packed a <b>pear</b> and a sandwich for the hike.\",\"他为徒步装了一个梨和一个三明治。\"]],\"pension\":[[\"After forty years at the post office, she retired on a modest <b>pension</b>.\",\"在邮局工作四十年后，她靠一份微薄的养老金退休了。\"],[\"The company raised its contributions to the workers' <b>pension</b> fund.\",\"公司提高了对工人养老金基金的缴款。\"]],\"portrait\":[[\"The artist painted a <b>portrait</b> of the queen in her coronation robes.\",\"画家为女王画了一幅身着加冕礼服的肖像。\"],[\"A faded <b>portrait</b> of the founder hangs in the school's main hall.\",\"学校大厅里挂着创始人的一幅褪色的肖像。\"]],\"prisoner\":[[\"The castle's tower once held <b>prisoners</b> captured in battle.\",\"城堡的塔楼曾经关押过在战斗中被俘的囚犯。\"],[\"Each <b>prisoner</b> was allowed one letter home per month.\",\"每名囚犯每月可以往家里寄一封信。\"]],\"resistance\":[[\"The <b>resistance</b> of the wire increases as it gets hotter.\",\"导线温度越高，电阻越大。\"],[\"Copper has low electrical <b>resistance</b>, which is why it is used in wiring.\",\"铜的电阻低，所以被用于电线。（resistance 在这里是物理义「电阻」）\"]],\"resonance\":[[\"The singer's voice set the wine glass vibrating through <b>resonance</b>.\",\"歌手的嗓音通过共振让酒杯振动起来。\"],[\"Engineers avoid the bridge's natural <b>resonance</b> frequency when troops march across.\",\"部队过桥时，工程师会避开桥的固有共振频率。\"]],\"select\":[[\"The committee will <b>select</b> three finalists from the forty applicants.\",\"委员会将从四十名申请者中选择三名入围者。\"],[\"Bees <b>select</b> flowers by color and scent, not by shape.\",\"蜜蜂按颜色和气味选择花朵，而不是按形状。\"]],\"sensor\":[[\"A motion <b>sensor</b> switches the porch light on when someone approaches.\",\"有人走近时，动作传感器会打开门廊的灯。\"],[\"The probe's <b>sensors</b> measured temperature and pressure as it descended.\",\"探测器下降时，它的传感器测量了温度和压力。\"]],\"site\":[[\"The construction <b>site</b> was fenced off to keep pedestrians away.\",\"建筑工地（地点）被围了起来，不让行人靠近。\"],[\"Archaeologists chose the <b>site</b> because the soil there preserved bone unusually well.\",\"考古学家选择这个地点，是因为那里的土壤保存骨骼格外完好。\"]],\"spring\":[[\"The mattress <b>spring</b> poked through the fabric after years of use.\",\"用了多年后，床垫的弹簧从面料里戳了出来。\"],[\"A coiled <b>spring</b> stores energy when compressed and releases it when let go.\",\"盘绕的弹簧受压时储存能量，松开时释放能量。\"]],\"strike\":[[\"The rail workers voted to go on <b>strike</b> for higher pay.\",\"铁路工人投票决定为涨工资而罢工。\"],[\"During the <b>strike</b>, buses replaced the halted trains.\",\"罢工期间，公交车代替了停运的火车。\"]],\"switch\":[[\"The <b>switch</b> by the door controls both the ceiling light and the fan.\",\"门边的开关同时控制吊灯和风扇。\"],[\"He flipped the <b>switch</b>, and the workshop went dark.\",\"他拨动开关，工坊一下子黑了下来。\"]],\"tariff\":[[\"The government lowered the <b>tariff</b> on imported grain during the shortage.\",\"短缺期间，政府降低了进口粮食的关税。\"],[\"High <b>tariffs</b> protected the young industry from foreign competition.\",\"高关税保护了这个新兴产业免受外国竞争。\"]],\"trout\":[[\"The stream is stocked with rainbow <b>trout</b> each spring.\",\"每年春天，人们往这条小溪里投放虹鳟鱼。\"],[\"<b>Trout</b> need cold, well-oxygenated water to survive.\",\"鳟鱼需要寒冷、含氧量高的水才能生存。\"]],\"peacock\":[[\"The <b>peacock</b> spread its tail into a shimmering fan to impress the hens.\",\"孔雀展开尾巴，变成一把闪闪发光的扇子来吸引母孔雀。\"],[\"A <b>peacock's</b> feathers were once prized as decorations in royal courts.\",\"孔雀的羽毛曾经是宫廷里珍贵的装饰品。\"]],\"pliers\":[[\"He gripped the bent nail with <b>pliers</b> and pulled it straight out.\",\"他用钳子夹住弯钉子，一下子把它拔了出来。\"],[\"Electricians carry insulated <b>pliers</b> for cutting and twisting wires.\",\"电工随身带绝缘钳子，用来剪切和绞合电线。\"]],\"sausage\":[[\"The butcher ground the pork, seasoned it, and stuffed it into <b>sausage</b> casings.\",\"屠夫把猪肉绞碎、调味，然后灌进香肠肠衣里。\"],[\"Grilled <b>sausages</b> were served with mustard at the market stall.\",\"市场摊位上供应配芥末的烤香肠。\"]],\"shrine\":[[\"Candles and flowers covered the small roadside <b>shrine</b>.\",\"路边的小神龛上摆满了蜡烛和鲜花。\"],[\"Pilgrims climbed nine hundred steps to reach the mountain <b>shrine</b>.\",\"朝圣者爬了九百级台阶才到达山上的神龛。\"]],\"action\":[[\"The committee promised <b>action</b> on the flooding problem before the next rainy season.\",\"委员会承诺在下一个雨季来临之前就洪水问题采取行动。\"],[\"In the novel, most of the <b>action</b> takes place in a small fishing village.\",\"在这部小说里，大部分情节都发生在一个小渔村里。\"]],\"aggressive\":[[\"The dog became <b>aggressive</b> whenever strangers approached the gate.\",\"每当陌生人走近大门，这条狗就变得好斗。\"],[\"Male deer grow more <b>aggressive</b> during the mating season and fight with their antlers.\",\"雄鹿在交配季节变得更好斗，会用鹿角打斗。\"]],\"agility\":[[\"Border collies are famous for their <b>agility</b> in herding sheep across rough hillsides.\",\"边境牧羊犬以在崎岖山坡上牧羊时的敏捷性而闻名。\"],[\"The dance training improved the children's balance and <b>agility</b>.\",\"舞蹈训练提高了孩子们的平衡能力和敏捷性。\"]],\"antarctic\":[[\"<b>Antarctic</b> waters are home to krill, tiny shrimp-like animals that whales feed on.\",\"南极水域生活着磷虾，这种像小虾一样的微小动物是鲸的食物。\"],[\"Researchers spend the dark <b>Antarctic</b> winter studying ice cores at the research station.\",\"研究人员在科考站度过黑暗的南极冬季，研究冰芯。\"]],\"anthology\":[[\"The course textbook is an <b>anthology</b> of short stories by writers from six continents.\",\"这门课的教材是一本选集，收录了来自六大洲作家的小说。\"],[\"Her poems were included in an <b>anthology</b> of modern Chinese poetry published last year.\",\"她的诗被收进去年出版的一本现代中国诗歌选集。\"]],\"apostrophe\":[[\"An <b>apostrophe</b> shows missing letters in contractions like “don't” for “do not”.\",\"撇号用来表示缩略词中省略的字母，比如用 don't 表示 do not。\"],[\"In English, an <b>apostrophe</b> plus s often marks possession, as in “the student's book”.\",\"英语中，撇号加 s 常表示所属，比如「学生的书」。\"]],\"ardent\":[[\"She is an <b>ardent</b> supporter of protecting old-growth forests.\",\"她是保护原始森林的热情支持者。\"],[\"The explorer was an <b>ardent</b> believer in mapping every river of the continent.\",\"这位探险家热情地坚信要测绘这片大陆的每一条河流。\"]],\"argument\":[[\"Her main <b>argument</b> is that smaller classes, not longer hours, improve learning.\",\"她的主要论点是：提高学习效果的是小班，而不是更长的课时。\"],[\"The essay presents a clear <b>argument</b> supported by data from three studies.\",\"这篇文章提出了一个明确的论点，并有三项研究的数据支持。\"]],\"armor\":[[\"Medieval knights wore steel <b>armor</b> that could weigh more than twenty kilograms.\",\"中世纪骑士穿的钢制盔甲可以重达二十多公斤。\"],[\"The armadillo's hard shell acts as natural <b>armor</b> against predators.\",\"犰狳坚硬的外壳是抵御天敌的天然盔甲。\"]],\"ascertain\":[[\"The police tried to <b>ascertain</b> the cause of the fire from the remaining evidence.\",\"警方试图从残存的证据中查明火灾的原因。\"],[\"Before signing, she wanted to <b>ascertain</b> that the house had no hidden damage.\",\"签约之前，她想查明这栋房子没有隐藏的损坏。\"]],\"asset\":[[\"The farmland proved to be the family's most valuable <b>asset</b> when land prices rose.\",\"地价上涨后，这块农田成了家里最值钱的资产。\"],[\"Companies list their <b>assets</b> — buildings, equipment, and cash — on the balance sheet.\",\"公司在资产负债表上列出自己的资产——建筑、设备和现金。\"]],\"associate\":[[\"Many people <b>associate</b> the smell of sunscreen with summer holidays at the beach.\",\"许多人会把防晒霜的气味与海滩暑假联想在一起。\"],[\"Children learn to <b>associate</b> the shape of a letter with its sound.\",\"孩子们学习把字母的形状和它的发音联想起来。\"]],\"barter\":[[\"Before money existed, people used <b>barter</b>, trading grain for tools or cloth.\",\"在货币出现之前，人们以物易物，用粮食换工具或布匹。\"],[\"The two farmers <b>bartered</b> a basket of eggs for a bag of potatoes.\",\"两个农民以物易物，用一篮鸡蛋换了一袋土豆。\"]],\"betray\":[[\"He felt his closest friend had <b>betrayed</b> him by revealing the secret to their boss.\",\"他觉得最亲近的朋友把秘密告诉了老板，背叛了他。\"],[\"The spy <b>betrayed</b> his country by selling documents to the enemy.\",\"这名间谍把文件卖给敌人，背叛了自己的国家。\"]],\"biblical\":[[\"The flood story appears in many cultures, not only in <b>biblical</b> texts.\",\"洪水的故事在许多文化中都有，不只出现在圣经的文本里。\"],[\"She studies <b>biblical</b> Hebrew in order to read the oldest manuscripts.\",\"她学习圣经希伯来语，为的是能读最古老的手稿。\"]],\"bridge\":[[\"The new <b>bridge</b> shortened the trip between the two towns from two hours to twenty minutes.\",\"新桥（桥梁）把两镇之间的行程从两小时缩短到二十分钟。\"],[\"Engineers inspected the <b>bridge</b> after the earthquake to check for cracks.\",\"地震后，工程师检查了这座桥梁是否有裂缝。\"]],\"canvas\":[[\"The artist stretched the <b>canvas</b> over a wooden frame before beginning the portrait.\",\"画家先把画布绷在木框上，然后开始画肖像。\"],[\"Sailors once made sails from heavy <b>canvas</b> that could withstand strong winds.\",\"水手们曾经用厚重的画布（帆布）做能经受强风的船帆。\"]],\"capable\":[[\"The new robot is <b>capable</b> of lifting boxes twice its own weight.\",\"这台新机器人有能力举起自身重量两倍的箱子。\"],[\"She is a highly <b>capable</b> surgeon who has performed hundreds of operations.\",\"她是一位能力很强外科医生，已经做过几百台手术。\"]],\"centrifugal\":[[\"In a spinning washing machine, <b>centrifugal</b> force pushes the water out through holes in the drum.\",\"在旋转的洗衣机里，离心力把水从滚筒的小孔甩出去。\"],[\"A centrifuge uses <b>centrifugal</b> force to separate blood cells from plasma.\",\"离心机利用离心作用（离心力）把血细胞从血浆中分离出来。\"]],\"commemorate\":[[\"The city built a monument to <b>commemorate</b> the firefighters who died in the disaster.\",\"这座城市建了一座纪念碑，纪念在灾难中牺牲的消防员。\"],[\"A special stamp was issued to <b>commemorate</b> the fiftieth anniversary of the university.\",\"学校发行了一枚特种邮票，纪念大学建校五十周年。\"]],\"computer\":[[\"The first electronic <b>computers</b> filled an entire room and were slower than a modern pocket calculator.\",\"第一批电子计算机占满整个房间，运算速度还不如现在的袖珍计算器。\"],[\"She wrote the program on her <b>computer</b> and ran it overnight to process the climate data.\",\"她在自己的计算机上写好程序，让它整夜运行来处理气候数据。\"]],\"conspire\":[[\"The officials were accused of <b>conspiring</b> to fix prices across the whole industry.\",\"这些官员被指控密谋在整个行业内操纵价格。\"],[\"Several nobles <b>conspired</b> against the king and planned to seize the palace.\",\"几名贵族密谋反对国王，计划夺取王宫。\"]],\"construct\":[[\"Workers are <b>constructing</b> a new bridge across the river, and it should open next spring.\",\"工人们正在河上建造一座新桥，预计明年春天通车。\"],[\"The museum was <b>constructed</b> from local stone in the 1890s.\",\"这座博物馆于 19 世纪 90 年代用当地石材建造。\"]],\"consumer\":[[\"<b>Consumers</b> are buying more energy-efficient appliances than they did ten years ago.\",\"与十年前相比，消费者购买的节能家电更多了。\"],[\"The law protects the <b>consumer's</b> right to return faulty goods within thirty days.\",\"法律保护消费者在三十天内退回有缺陷商品的权利。\"]],\"corner\":[[\"They met at the street <b>corner</b> where the bakery stands and walked to school together.\",\"他们在面包房所在的街角碰面，一起走去学校。\"],[\"A small grocery store occupies the <b>corner</b> of Fifth Avenue and Main Street.\",\"一家小杂货店位于第五大道和主街的街角。\"]],\"engineering\":[[\"She studied civil <b>engineering</b> and now designs bridges in coastal cities.\",\"她学的是土木工程学，现在在沿海城市设计桥梁。\"],[\"Genetic <b>engineering</b> allows scientists to move a useful gene from one organism into another.\",\"基因工程让科学家能把一个有用的基因从一种生物转移到另一种生物里。\"]],\"envoy\":[[\"The president sent a special <b>envoy</b> to negotiate the ceasefire.\",\"总统派出一名特使（使节）去谈判停火。\"],[\"As an <b>envoy</b>, she represented her country at peace talks in Geneva.\",\"作为使节，她代表自己的国家出席日内瓦的和平谈判。\"]],\"ethnicity\":[[\"The census records each resident's <b>ethnicity</b> so that services can be planned for different communities.\",\"人口普查记录每位居民的种族性（民族归属），以便为不同群体规划服务。\"],[\"Her research examines how <b>ethnicity</b> shapes the experience of immigrants in large cities.\",\"她的研究考察种族性（民族背景）如何影响移民在大城市中的经历。\"]],\"excellence\":[[\"The award recognizes <b>excellence</b> in teaching across the university.\",\"这个奖项表彰全校范围内的教学卓越成就。\"],[\"The orchestra is known worldwide for its <b>excellence</b> in performing Baroque music.\",\"这支乐队以演奏巴洛克音乐的卓越水准闻名世界。\"]],\"expectation\":[[\"The hotel did not meet our <b>expectations</b>: the rooms were small and the service slow.\",\"这家酒店没达到我们的期望：房间小，服务也慢。\"],[\"Parents' <b>expectations</b> can strongly influence how hard children study.\",\"父母的期望会强烈影响孩子学习的努力程度。\"]],\"experiment\":[[\"In the <b>experiment</b>, one group of plants received extra light while the other group did not.\",\"在这项实验中，一组植物接受额外光照，另一组则没有。\"],[\"Young children learn about floating and sinking by <b>experimenting</b> with objects in water.\",\"幼儿通过在水里试验各种物体来认识浮与沉。\"]],\"facility\":[[\"The sports <b>facility</b> includes a swimming pool, two gyms, and an indoor track.\",\"这处体育设施包括一个游泳池、两座体育馆和一条室内跑道。\"],[\"The factory built a new treatment <b>facility</b> to clean its wastewater before releasing it.\",\"工厂新建了一处处理设施，在排放前净化废水。\"]],\"flee\":[[\"Thousands of residents had to <b>flee</b> their homes as the wildfire approached the town.\",\"野火逼近城镇，数千名居民不得不逃离家园。\"],[\"The deer <b>fled</b> into the forest at the sound of the hunters' dogs.\",\"听到猎犬的叫声，鹿逃进了森林。\"]],\"flexible\":[[\"Yoga keeps her muscles <b>flexible</b> enough to touch her toes easily.\",\"瑜伽让她的肌肉保持灵活，轻松就能摸到脚趾。\"],[\"The course offers a <b>flexible</b> schedule, so students with jobs can study in the evenings.\",\"这门课程时间安排灵活，有工作的学生可以在晚上学习。\"]],\"giraffe\":[[\"A <b>giraffe's</b> long neck allows it to eat leaves that other animals cannot reach.\",\"长颈鹿的长脖子让它能吃到其他动物够不着的树叶。\"],[\"A <b>giraffe</b> has the same number of neck bones as a human, but each one is far longer.\",\"长颈鹿的颈椎数量和人类相同，但每一节都比人类的长得多。\"]],\"habit\":[[\"Reading for twenty minutes before bed became a daily <b>habit</b> she rarely broke.\",\"睡前读二十分钟书成了她很少打破的日常习惯。\"],[\"Breaking a smoking <b>habit</b> is difficult because the behaviour becomes automatic.\",\"戒掉吸烟的习惯很难，因为这个行为已经变得自动化了。\"]],\"intestine\":[[\"Most nutrients are absorbed in the small <b>intestine</b> after food leaves the stomach.\",\"食物离开胃之后，大部分营养在小肠（肠的一部分）中被吸收。\"],[\"The large <b>intestine</b> absorbs water from the remaining material and forms solid waste.\",\"大肠从剩余物质中吸收水分，形成固体废物。\"]],\"keyboard\":[[\"He typed the report on a <b>keyboard</b> with several broken keys.\",\"他用一块有好几个键坏掉的键盘打出这份报告。\"],[\"The piano has a <b>keyboard</b> of eighty-eight keys, fifty-two white and thirty-six black.\",\"钢琴的键盘有八十八个键，五十二个白键、三十六个黑键。\"]],\"kick\":[[\"The player <b>kicked</b> the ball over the fence and into the neighbour's garden.\",\"那名球员把球踢过栅栏，踢进了邻居的院子。\"],[\"Babies <b>kick</b> their legs when they are excited or want attention.\",\"婴儿兴奋或想引起注意时会踢腿。\"]],\"momentum\":[[\"In physics, <b>momentum</b> equals mass multiplied by velocity, so a slow truck can carry more of it than a fast bicycle.\",\"在物理学中，动量等于质量乘以速度，所以一辆慢速卡车可以比一辆快速自行车拥有更大的动量。\"],[\"When two ice skaters push apart, the total <b>momentum</b> of the pair stays the same even though each skater moves.\",\"两名滑冰者互相推开时，尽管两人都动了起来，但两人总的动量保持不变。\"]],\"motor\":[[\"An electric <b>motor</b> converts electrical energy into the rotation that drives the fan blades.\",\"电动机把电能转化成带动扇叶的转动。\"],[\"The washing machine stopped working because its <b>motor</b> had burned out.\",\"洗衣机因为电动机烧坏而停转了。\"]],\"myth\":[[\"In Greek <b>myth</b>, Prometheus steals fire from the gods and gives it to humans.\",\"在希腊神话中，普罗米修斯从众神那里盗取火种送给人类。\"],[\"The story that we use only ten percent of our brains is a <b>myth</b> with no scientific basis.\",\"说我们只用了大脑的百分之十，这个说法是个没有科学依据的神话（误传）。\"]],\"nature\":[[\"The debate over <b>nature</b> and nurture asks how much of our behaviour is inborn and how much is learned.\",\"「先天与后天」之争探讨的是：我们的行为有多少是天生的，有多少是后天习得的。\"],[\"Identical twins raised apart help scientists separate the effects of <b>nature</b> from those of upbringing.\",\"在不同环境中长大的同卵双胞胎，帮助科学家区分先天因素和养育环境的影响。\"]],\"necklace\":[[\"She wore a pearl <b>necklace</b> that had belonged to her grandmother.\",\"她戴着一条属于祖母的珍珠项链。\"],[\"The museum displays a gold <b>necklace</b> made more than two thousand years ago.\",\"博物馆展出一条两千多年前制作的金项链。\"]],\"norm\":[[\"Shaking hands when you meet someone is the <b>norm</b> in many business cultures.\",\"在许多商务文化中，见面握手是准则（惯例）。\"],[\"In this school, arriving five minutes early is the <b>norm</b> rather than the exception.\",\"在这所学校，提前五分钟到是准则（常态），而不是例外。\"]],\"orchestra\":[[\"The <b>orchestra</b> tuned its instruments while the audience settled into their seats.\",\"观众落座时，管弦乐队正在给乐器调音。\"],[\"She plays the cello in a youth <b>orchestra</b> that performs works by Beethoven and Brahms.\",\"她在一个青年管弦乐队里拉大提琴，乐队演奏贝多芬和勃拉姆斯的作品。\"]],\"parsley\":[[\"She sprinkled chopped <b>parsley</b> over the soup just before serving it.\",\"上汤之前，她在汤上撒了切碎的欧芹。\"],[\"<b>Parsley</b> is often used as a garnish, but it is also rich in vitamin C.\",\"欧芹常用作装饰菜，但它也富含维生素 C。\"]],\"plumber\":[[\"We called a <b>plumber</b> when a pipe under the kitchen sink began to leak.\",\"厨房水槽下面的水管开始漏水时，我们叫了水管工。\"],[\"The <b>plumber</b> replaced the worn washer in the tap and the dripping stopped.\",\"水管工换掉水龙头里磨损的垫圈，滴水就停了。\"]],\"pollen\":[[\"In spring, pine trees release clouds of yellow <b>pollen</b> into the air.\",\"春天，松树向空气中释放出一团团黄色的花粉。\"],[\"Bees carry <b>pollen</b> from flower to flower as they collect nectar.\",\"蜜蜂采蜜时把花粉从一朵花带到另一朵花。\"]],\"pomegranate\":[[\"A ripe <b>pomegranate</b> is full of jewel-like red seeds surrounded by sweet-tart juice.\",\"成熟的石榴里满是宝石般的红色籽粒，裹着酸甜的汁液。\"],[\"<b>Pomegranate</b> trees have been cultivated around the Mediterranean for thousands of years.\",\"石榴树在地中海周边已经被种植了数千年。\"]],\"rowing\":[[\"<b>Rowing</b> became an Olympic sport in 1900, with crews racing in narrow boats called shells.\",\"划船在 1900 年成为奥运项目，队员们驾驶称为赛艇的窄船比赛。\"],[\"She goes <b>rowing</b> on the river every morning before work to stay fit.\",\"她每天上班前都去河上划船，保持体形。\"]],\"soil\":[[\"Rich, dark <b>soil</b> holds water well and helps vegetables grow.\",\"肥沃的深色土壤保水性好，有助于蔬菜生长。\"],[\"After the forest fire, rain washed away the top layer of <b>soil</b> from the hillside.\",\"森林大火之后，雨水把山坡表层的土壤冲走了。\"]],\"sorrow\":[[\"She expressed deep <b>sorrow</b> over the loss of her childhood home in the fire.\",\"童年的家毁于火灾，她深感悲伤。\"],[\"The letter brought the family great <b>sorrow</b>: their son would not be coming home.\",\"那封信给这个家庭带来巨大悲伤：他们的儿子再也回不了家了。\"]],\"spearman\":[[\"In the painting, a lone <b>spearman</b> guards the gate of the ancient city.\",\"画中，一名持矛者独自守卫着古城的城门。\"],[\"The army placed its <b>spearmen</b> in the front line to stop the enemy cavalry.\",\"军队把持矛者排在最前列，抵挡敌方骑兵。\"]],\"stability\":[[\"Regular exercise improves the <b>stability</b> of blood sugar levels in many patients.\",\"规律运动能改善许多病人血糖水平的稳定。\"],[\"Engineers tested the bridge's <b>stability</b> under strong winds before opening it to traffic.\",\"工程师在通车前测试了大桥在强风下的稳定性。\"]],\"sympathy\":[[\"She felt great <b>sympathy</b> for the families who had lost their homes in the flood.\",\"她对在洪水中失去家园的家庭深表同情。\"],[\"The teacher spoke with <b>sympathy</b> to the student whose grandmother had just died.\",\"老师同情地安慰那位刚失去祖母的学生。\"]],\"tie\":[[\"He wore a dark suit with a red <b>tie</b> to the interview.\",\"他穿深色西装、系红领带去参加面试。\"],[\"In formal business settings in Japan, men usually wear a <b>tie</b>.\",\"在日本正式的商务场合，男士通常系领带。\"]],\"trademark\":[[\"The company registered its logo as a <b>trademark</b> to stop competitors from copying it.\",\"公司把标志注册为注册商标，防止竞争对手仿冒。\"],[\"A <b>trademark</b> can be a word, a symbol, or even a distinctive sound.\",\"注册商标可以是一个词、一个符号，甚至是一段独特的声音。\"]],\"treason\":[[\"He was charged with <b>treason</b> after passing military secrets to a foreign government.\",\"他把军事机密交给外国政府后，被以叛国罪起诉。\"],[\"In medieval England, <b>treason</b> against the king was punished by death.\",\"在中世纪的英格兰，叛国（反对国王）会被处以死刑。\"]],\"waiter\":[[\"The <b>waiter</b> took our order and recommended the grilled fish.\",\"服务员记下我们的点单，并推荐了烤鱼。\"],[\"He worked as a <b>waiter</b> in the evenings to pay for his university studies.\",\"他晚上当服务员，挣钱支付大学学费。\"]],\"adjustment\":[[\"A small <b>adjustment</b> to the telescope's angle brought the planet into clear view.\",\"对望远镜的角度稍作调整，行星便清晰地进入视野。\"],[\"After moving abroad, she needed a few months of <b>adjustment</b> to the new language and customs.\",\"搬到国外后，她需要几个月来调整适应新的语言和习俗。\"]],\"allergy\":[[\"His <b>allergy</b> to peanuts is so severe that even a trace of peanut oil can make him ill.\",\"他对花生过敏非常严重，哪怕一点点花生油都会让他发病。\"],[\"Spring <b>allergies</b> caused by tree pollen make her sneeze through April and May.\",\"由树花粉引起的春季过敏让她在四五月里喷嚏不断。\"]],\"almond\":[[\"She added sliced <b>almonds</b> to the salad for extra crunch.\",\"她在沙拉里加了杏仁片，增加脆脆的口感。\"],[\"<b>Almond</b> trees bloom early in spring, covering the valley with pale pink flowers.\",\"杏仁（扁桃）树在早春开花，淡粉色的花覆盖整个山谷。\"]],\"anger\":[[\"His <b>anger</b> faded once he understood that the delay was caused by the storm, not by carelessness.\",\"当他明白延误是暴风雨造成的、而不是疏忽，他的愤怒就平息了。\"],[\"Deep breathing can help people control their <b>anger</b> in stressful situations.\",\"深呼吸能帮助人们在压力大的场合控制愤怒。\"]],\"animation\":[[\"The studio spent three years making the <b>animation</b>, drawing thousands of frames by hand.\",\"这家工作室花了三年制作这部动画，手绘了成千上万帧画面。\"],[\"Computer <b>animation</b> allowed the filmmakers to create a realistic ocean storm.\",\"电脑动画让电影制作人能做出逼真的海上风暴。\"]],\"antithesis\":[[\"The quiet, bookish brother was the <b>antithesis</b> of his loud, adventurous sister.\",\"这个安静好学的弟弟与他吵闹爱冒险的姐姐正好是对立面。\"],[\"Forced silence in class is the <b>antithesis</b> of what discussion-based learning tries to achieve.\",\"课堂上强迫沉默与讨论式学习想要达到的目标正好是对立面。\"]],\"articulate\":[[\"She <b>articulated</b> her objections clearly, listing three reasons the plan would fail.\",\"她清晰地表达了自己的反对意见，列出了计划会失败的三个理由。\"],[\"A good leader can <b>articulate</b> a vision that the whole team understands.\",\"好的领导者能清晰表达一个全队都理解的愿景。\"]],\"audit\":[[\"An outside firm <b>audits</b> the charity's accounts every year to verify that donations are used properly.\",\"一家外部公司每年审计这家慈善机构的账目，核实捐款是否使用得当。\"],[\"The tax office decided to <b>audit</b> the restaurant after finding errors in its returns.\",\"税务部门在餐厅的报税中发现错误后，决定对其进行审计。\"]],\"aviation\":[[\"The Wright brothers' first flight in 1903 marks the beginning of modern <b>aviation</b>.\",\"1903 年莱特兄弟的首次飞行标志着现代航空的开端。\"],[\"She works in <b>aviation</b> safety, inspecting aircraft before they return to service.\",\"她从事航空安全工作，在飞机重新投入使用前进行检查。\"]],\"awkward\":[[\"He is an <b>awkward</b> dancer who keeps stepping on his partner's feet.\",\"他跳舞很笨拙，老是踩到舞伴的脚。\"],[\"Carrying the ladder through the narrow doorway was <b>awkward</b> and slow.\",\"把梯子搬过狭窄的门口又笨拙又慢。\"]],\"backfire\":[[\"His plan to save money by skipping maintenance <b>backfired</b> when the machine broke down completely.\",\"他想省下保养费来省钱，结果适得其反，机器彻底坏了。\"],[\"Criticising the manager in public <b>backfired</b>: she ended up with even less support than before.\",\"当众批评经理适得其反：她得到的支持比以前更少了。\"]],\"bandage\":[[\"The nurse wrapped a clean <b>bandage</b> around the cut on his knee.\",\"护士用干净的绷带包扎他膝盖上的伤口。\"],[\"Keep the <b>bandage</b> dry and change it every morning until the wound heals.\",\"保持绷带干燥，每天早上更换，直到伤口愈合。\"]],\"bar\":[[\"Security guards <b>barred</b> the reporters from entering the courtroom during the hearing.\",\"庭审期间，保安禁止记者进入法庭。\"],[\"Students under eighteen are <b>barred</b> from the laboratory without a teacher present.\",\"没有老师在场时，未满十八岁的学生被禁止进入实验室。\"]],\"beep\":[[\"The microwave <b>beeps</b> three times when the cooking time is finished.\",\"烹饪时间结束时，微波炉会发出三声哔声。\"],[\"The truck <b>beeped</b> loudly as it reversed toward the loading dock.\",\"卡车倒向装卸台时发出响亮的哔哔声。\"]],\"bend\":[[\"You need to <b>bend</b> the wire into a hook shape to hang the picture.\",\"你需要把铁丝弯成钩子的形状来挂画。\"],[\"The road makes a sharp <b>bend</b> just before the village, so drivers must slow down.\",\"公路在村子前有一个急弯（弯曲处），司机必须减速。\"]],\"bid\":[[\"At the auction, a collector <b>bid</b> two million dollars for the rare painting.\",\"拍卖会上，一名收藏家出价两百万美元买这幅稀有画作。\"],[\"Three construction firms were invited to <b>bid</b> for the contract to build the new library.\",\"三家建筑公司受邀出价竞标新图书馆的建造合同。\"]],\"bloodstream\":[[\"Once absorbed, the medicine enters the <b>bloodstream</b> and travels to every part of the body.\",\"药物一旦被吸收，就会进入血流，被送到身体的各个部位。\"],[\"Bacteria in the <b>bloodstream</b> can cause a dangerous whole-body infection.\",\"血流中的细菌会引起危险的全身感染。\"]],\"carnivore\":[[\"The lion is a <b>carnivore</b> that hunts zebras and antelopes on the open plains.\",\"狮子是食肉动物，在开阔的平原上捕猎斑马和羚羊。\"],[\"Most <b>carnivores</b> have sharp teeth and claws for tearing flesh.\",\"大多数食肉动物都有锋利的牙齿和爪子，用来撕裂肉食。\"]],\"carrot\":[[\"Rabbits in the garden ate the tops of the young <b>carrots</b>.\",\"花园里的兔子把嫩胡萝卜的叶子吃了。\"],[\"She grated two <b>carrots</b> into the soup to give it colour and sweetness.\",\"她把两根胡萝卜擦丝放进汤里，给汤增添颜色和甜味。\"]],\"circus\":[[\"As a child, he dreamed of joining the <b>circus</b> as an acrobat.\",\"小时候，他梦想加入马戏团当杂技演员。\"],[\"The <b>circus</b> set up its big tent on the field outside town for a week of shows.\",\"马戏团在镇外的场地上搭起大帐篷，进行为期一周的演出。\"]],\"codify\":[[\"The government decided to <b>codify</b> the trade rules into a single written law.\",\"政府决定把贸易规则编成法典，形成一部统一的成文法。\"],[\"Customs that had been followed for centuries were finally <b>codified</b> in the nineteenth century.\",\"沿袭了几个世纪的习俗最终在十九世纪被编成法典。\"]],\"commencement\":[[\"At the <b>commencement</b> ceremony, graduates throw their caps into the air.\",\"在毕业典礼上，毕业生们把学位帽抛向空中。\"],[\"Families travelled from across the country to attend the university's <b>commencement</b>.\",\"家属们从全国各地赶来参加大学的毕业典礼。\"]],\"composer\":[[\"Beethoven continued working as a <b>composer</b> even after he lost his hearing.\",\"贝多芬在失聪之后仍继续作曲家的创作。\"],[\"The film's <b>composer</b> wrote a score that mixes orchestra with electronic sounds.\",\"这部电影的作曲家写了一部把管弦乐和电子音效结合起来的配乐。\"]],\"convince\":[[\"The lawyer tried to <b>convince</b> the jury that the witness was unreliable.\",\"律师试图使陪审团相信这名证人不可靠。\"],[\"Data from the pilot project finally <b>convinced</b> the board to fund the full programme.\",\"试点项目的数据终于使董事会相信，应该为完整项目拨款。\"]],\"course\":[[\"The university offers a <b>course</b> in marine biology every spring semester.\",\"这所大学每学年春季学期都开一门海洋生物学课程。\"],[\"She took an online <b>course</b> to learn data analysis while working full time.\",\"她全职工作的同时上了一门在线课程学习数据分析。\"]],\"crucial\":[[\"The first ten minutes after a stroke are <b>crucial</b> for the patient's recovery.\",\"中风后的头十分钟对病人的康复至关重要。\"],[\"Clean water is <b>crucial</b> to the survival of the desert expedition.\",\"清洁的水对沙漠探险队的生存至关重要。\"]],\"crusade\":[[\"The First <b>Crusade</b> set out in 1096 and reached Jerusalem three years later.\",\"第一次十字军东征于 1096 年出发，三年后抵达耶路撒冷。\"],[\"During the <b>Crusades</b>, European knights travelled east to fight for control of the Holy Land.\",\"十字军东征期间，欧洲骑士东行，争夺圣地的控制权。\"]],\"dissolve\":[[\"Stir the salt into warm water until it <b>dissolves</b> completely.\",\"把盐搅进温水里，直到它完全溶解。\"],[\"Sugar <b>dissolves</b> faster in hot tea than in cold water.\",\"糖在热茶里比在冷水里溶解得更快。\"]],\"domain\":[[\"Questions of fairness fall within the <b>domain</b> of moral philosophy.\",\"公平问题属于道德哲学的范围（领域）。\"],[\"Ocean currents were once the <b>domain</b> of sailors; now satellites map them daily.\",\"洋流曾经是水手的范围（领域）；如今卫星每天绘制洋流图。\"]],\"eruption\":[[\"The volcanic <b>eruption</b> of 1815 threw so much ash into the air that the following year had no summer.\",\"1815 年的火山喷发把大量火山灰送入空中，导致第二年没有夏天。\"],[\"Before an <b>eruption</b>, scientists monitor gas levels and tiny earthquakes around the volcano.\",\"喷发之前，科学家会监测火山周围的气体浓度和微小地震。\"]],\"etiquette\":[[\"In Japanese business <b>etiquette</b>, business cards are exchanged with both hands.\",\"在日本商务礼仪中，名片要用双手递接。\"],[\"Table <b>etiquette</b> differs across cultures: slurping noodles is polite in some places and rude in others.\",\"餐桌礼仪因文化而异：在一些地方吃面条出声是有礼貌的，在另一些地方则很失礼。\"]],\"experience\":[[\"Her twenty years of <b>experience</b> as a pilot made her calm during the emergency landing.\",\"二十年的飞行经验让她在紧急迫降时保持冷静。\"],[\"You cannot learn surgery from books alone; it requires hands-on <b>experience</b>.\",\"外科不能只靠书本学，必须有实际操作的经验。\"]],\"frequency\":[[\"The station broadcasts at a <b>frequency</b> of 98.5 megahertz.\",\"这个电台以 98.5 兆赫的频率播出。\"],[\"Dogs can hear sounds at much higher <b>frequencies</b> than humans can.\",\"狗能听到频率比人类高得多的声音。\"]],\"fundamental\":[[\"The right to a fair trial is a <b>fundamental</b> principle of the legal system.\",\"获得公正审判的权利是法律体系的根本原则。\"],[\"Photosynthesis is <b>fundamental</b> to almost all life on Earth, since it produces most of our oxygen.\",\"光合作用对地球上几乎所有生命都是根本性的，因为它产生了我们的大部分氧气。\"]],\"gorilla\":[[\"A male <b>gorilla</b> can weigh twice as much as a female and leads the family group.\",\"雄性大猩猩的体重可达雌性的两倍，并带领整个家族群体。\"],[\"<b>Gorillas</b> communicate with grunts, hoots, and chest-beating displays.\",\"大猩猩用咕噜声、吼叫和捶胸来交流。\"]],\"horse\":[[\"The farmer's <b>horse</b> pulled the cart loaded with hay to the barn.\",\"农夫的马拉着装满干草的车去谷仓。\"],[\"Wild <b>horses</b> once roamed the grasslands of Central Asia in large herds.\",\"野马曾经成群地在中亚草原上漫游。\"]],\"indifferent\":[[\"He was <b>indifferent</b> to the outcome of the game and left before it ended.\",\"他对比赛结果漠不关心，没等结束就离开了。\"],[\"Voters who feel <b>indifferent</b> often stay home on election day.\",\"觉得漠不关心的选民在选举日往往待在家里。\"]],\"jellyfish\":[[\"The sting of some <b>jellyfish</b> can be dangerous, so swimmers should watch for them near the shore.\",\"有些水母的蜇刺很危险，所以游泳者要留意近岸处的水母。\"],[\"A <b>jellyfish</b> has no brain, heart, or bones, yet it has survived for millions of years.\",\"水母没有大脑、心脏或骨骼，却已经存活了数百万年。\"]],\"lamb\":[[\"In spring, the fields are full of newborn <b>lambs</b> staying close to their mothers.\",\"春天，田野里满是刚出生的羔羊，紧紧跟在母羊身边。\"],[\"The farmer fed the orphaned <b>lamb</b> with a bottle of warm milk.\",\"农夫用一瓶温牛奶喂这只失去母亲的羔羊。\"]],\"latency\":[[\"Gamers complain about high <b>latency</b> because their characters react a fraction of a second too late.\",\"游戏玩家抱怨延迟太高，因为角色的反应慢了零点几秒。\"],[\"Engineers reduced the network's <b>latency</b> by moving the servers closer to users.\",\"工程师把服务器移到离用户更近的地方，降低了网络延迟。\"]],\"leaf\":[[\"A single oak <b>leaf</b> can host dozens of tiny insects over the summer.\",\"一片橡树叶子在一个夏天能栖居几十只小昆虫。\"],[\"In autumn, the maple's <b>leaves</b> turn bright red before they fall.\",\"秋天，枫树的叶子在掉落前变成鲜红色。\"]],\"legend\":[[\"The <b>legend</b> tells of a hidden valley where no one ever grows old.\",\"传说讲了一个隐秘的山谷，那里的人永远不会变老。\"],[\"Robin Hood may be based on a real outlaw, but most of his story is <b>legend</b>.\",\"罗宾汉可能有真实的原型，但他的故事大部分是传说。\"]],\"louse\":[[\"The school nurse checked the children's hair for head <b>lice</b> after an outbreak in the class.\",\"班里爆发头虱后，校医检查了孩子们的头发。\"],[\"A body <b>louse</b> can spread disease when people live in crowded, unwashed conditions.\",\"在拥挤、不卫生的居住条件下，体虱（虱子的一种）会传播疾病。\"]],\"media\":[[\"Social <b>media</b> allow news of a disaster to spread around the world within minutes.\",\"社交传媒（媒体）让灾难的消息在几分钟内传遍全世界。\"],[\"The candidate's campaign received heavy coverage in the national <b>media</b>.\",\"这位候选人的竞选活动得到了全国传媒（媒体）的大量报道。\"]],\"memoir\":[[\"In her <b>memoir</b>, the scientist describes growing up in a small mining town.\",\"在这本回忆录中，这位科学家讲述了自己在一个矿业小镇长大的经历。\"],[\"The general's <b>memoirs</b> give a personal account of the final months of the war.\",\"这位将军的回忆录从个人角度记述了战争的最后几个月。\"]],\"nursery\":[[\"The <b>nursery</b> looks after children from six months to three years old while their parents work.\",\"这家托儿所照看六个月到三岁的孩子，他们的父母上班时孩子就放在这里。\"],[\"Working parents in the city rely on affordable <b>nurseries</b> near their offices.\",\"城里上班的父母依赖办公室附近价格实惠的托儿所。\"]],\"operation\":[[\"The <b>operation</b> to remove the tumour took four hours, but it was successful.\",\"切除肿瘤的手术花了四个小时，但很成功。\"],[\"After the <b>operation</b>, he stayed in hospital for a week to recover.\",\"手术后，他住院一周休养恢复。\"]],\"oven\":[[\"She put the bread dough into a hot <b>oven</b> and set the timer for thirty minutes.\",\"她把面包面团放进热烤箱，定时三十分钟。\"],[\"The pizza <b>oven</b> reaches 450 degrees, so the crust cooks in just two minutes.\",\"披萨烤箱的温度能达到 450 度，饼皮两分钟就烤好。\"]],\"painter\":[[\"The <b>painter</b> spent months on a single landscape, returning to the same hill at dawn each day.\",\"这位画家在一幅风景画上花了几个月，每天黎明都回到同一座山丘。\"],[\"Vermeer was a Dutch <b>painter</b> famous for his quiet scenes of daily life lit by window light.\",\"维米尔是荷兰画家，以窗边光线下宁静的日常生活场景闻名。\"]],\"peep\":[[\"The children <b>peeped</b> through the fence to watch the puppies in the neighbour's yard.\",\"孩子们透过栅栏窥视邻居院子里的小狗。\"],[\"She took a quick <b>peep</b> inside the box but would not say what she had seen.\",\"她往盒子里快速窥视了一眼，却不肯说看到了什么。\"]],\"pilot\":[[\"The <b>pilot</b> announced that strong headwinds would delay the landing by twenty minutes.\",\"飞行员宣布，强逆风将使降落推迟二十分钟。\"],[\"Before becoming an airline <b>pilot</b>, she trained for two years at a flight school.\",\"成为航空公司飞行员之前，她在飞行学校训练了两年。\"]],\"producer\":[[\"As the film's <b>producer</b>, she raised the money and hired the director and cast.\",\"作为这部电影的生产者（制片人），她筹集资金并聘请了导演和演员。\"],[\"In a pond ecosystem, green plants are the <b>producers</b> that capture energy from sunlight.\",\"在池塘生态系统中，绿色植物是生产者，把阳光的能量固定下来。\"]],\"quantum\":[[\"A <b>quantum</b> is the smallest possible amount of energy that can be gained or lost by an atom.\",\"量子是原子能够获得或失去的最小的能量单位。\"],[\"<b>Quantum</b> computers use the strange behaviour of tiny particles to process information in new ways.\",\"量子计算机利用微小粒子的奇特行为，以新的方式处理信息。\"]],\"reference\":[[\"Her former professor agreed to serve as a <b>reference</b> for her scholarship application.\",\"她以前的教授同意担任她奖学金申请的推荐人。\"],[\"Employers often call an applicant's <b>references</b> before offering the job.\",\"雇主在录用前常常会致电求职者的推荐人核实情况。\"]],\"rye\":[[\"Dark breads in northern Europe are traditionally made from <b>rye</b> flour.\",\"北欧的黑面包传统上用黑麦粉制作。\"],[\"<b>Rye</b> grows well in cold climates where wheat struggles to survive.\",\"黑麦在小麦难以存活的寒冷气候里也能长得很好。\"]],\"sculpture\":[[\"She studied <b>sculpture</b> at art school and now works mainly in bronze and stone.\",\"她在艺术学校学雕塑学（雕塑），现在主要用青铜和石材创作。\"],[\"The museum's garden contains a modern steel <b>sculpture</b> shaped like a wave.\",\"博物馆的花园里有一件波浪形的现代钢制雕塑（作品）。\"]],\"spin\":[[\"The dancer <b>spun</b> three times on one foot without losing her balance.\",\"舞者单脚旋转了三圈，没有失去平衡。\"],[\"A top will <b>spin</b> for a long time if the surface beneath it is smooth.\",\"如果下面的表面光滑，陀螺能旋转很久。\"]],\"technical\":[[\"The report contains too much <b>technical</b> language for a general reader to follow.\",\"这份报告里技术性语言太多，普通读者看不懂。\"],[\"A <b>technical</b> problem with the brakes forced the airline to ground the plane.\",\"刹车的一个技术问题迫使航空公司停飞了这架飞机。\"]],\"transcript\":[[\"The university mailed her official <b>transcript</b> directly to the graduate school she applied to.\",\"大学把她的正式成绩单直接寄给了她申请的研究生院。\"],[\"To transfer credits, students must request a <b>transcript</b> showing every course and grade.\",\"要转学分，学生必须申请一份列出所有课程和成绩的成绩单。\"]],\"zenith\":[[\"At noon in the tropics, the sun can stand almost exactly at its <b>zenith</b>.\",\"在热带地区，正午的太阳几乎可以正好位于天顶。\"],[\"Astronomers photographed the comet as it passed near the <b>zenith</b> shortly after midnight.\",\"午夜过后不久，彗星经过天顶附近时，天文学家给它拍了照片。\"]],\"acre\":[[\"The farm covers forty <b>acres</b> of rolling grassland used for grazing cattle.\",\"这个农场占地四十英亩，是连绵的草地，用来放牛。\"],[\"An <b>acre</b> is about four thousand square metres, roughly the size of a football field.\",\"一英亩大约是四千平方米，差不多一个足球场大小。\"]],\"affiliation\":[[\"Candidates must declare any political <b>affiliation</b> before joining the committee.\",\"候选人在加入委员会之前必须申报任何政治隶属关系。\"],[\"His <b>affiliation</b> with the research institute is printed under his name on the paper.\",\"论文上他的名字下方印着他所隶属的研究机构。\"]],\"alleviate\":[[\"The new medicine helped <b>alleviate</b> her back pain within an hour.\",\"新药在一小时内就帮她缓解了背痛。\"],[\"Planting trees along the river can <b>alleviate</b> flooding in the town downstream.\",\"沿河植树可以减轻下游城镇的洪涝。\"]],\"ambulance\":[[\"An <b>ambulance</b> arrived within eight minutes and took the injured cyclist to hospital.\",\"救护车八分钟内赶到，把受伤的骑行者送往医院。\"],[\"The <b>ambulance</b> crew stabilised the patient before the drive to the emergency room.\",\"救护车上的医护人员在开往急诊室前先稳定了病人的状况。\"]],\"animal\":[[\"The blue whale is the largest <b>animal</b> that has ever lived on Earth.\",\"蓝鲸是地球上有史以来最大的动物。\"],[\"Every <b>animal</b> in the shelter was checked by a vet before being offered for adoption.\",\"收容所里的每只动物在被领养前都由兽医检查过。\"]],\"apron\":[[\"The chef tied on a clean <b>apron</b> before starting the evening service.\",\"厨师在开始晚间营业前系上一条干净的围裙。\"],[\"She keeps her pencils and tools in the pockets of her work <b>apron</b>.\",\"她把铅笔和工具放在工作围裙的口袋里。\"]],\"ascent\":[[\"The final <b>ascent</b> to the summit took six hours in deep snow.\",\"最后向顶峰的上升（攀登）一段在深雪中走了六个小时。\"],[\"Ticket prices began a steady <b>ascent</b> as the concert date approached.\",\"随着音乐会日期临近，票价开始稳步上升。\"]],\"asterisk\":[[\"In the table, an <b>asterisk</b> marks the figures that are estimated rather than measured.\",\"表格中，星号标出的是估算而非实测的数字。\"],[\"Words marked with an <b>asterisk</b> in the list are irregular verbs.\",\"列表中标有星号的词是不规则动词。\"]],\"authority\":[[\"As a leading <b>authority</b> on earthquakes, she is often asked to comment after a major quake.\",\"作为地震领域的权威，她常在大地震后被请去发表评论。\"],[\"The professor is an <b>authority</b> on medieval poetry whose books are used in universities worldwide.\",\"这位教授是中世纪诗歌方面的权威，他的书被世界各地的大学使用。\"]],\"awake\":[[\"She likes to <b>awake</b> early and watch the sunrise over the harbour.\",\"她喜欢早早醒来，看太阳从海港升起。\"],[\"The birds <b>awake</b> at first light and fill the valley with song.\",\"鸟儿在第一缕曙光中醒来，歌声充满山谷。\"]],\"balanced\":[[\"A <b>balanced</b> diet includes vegetables, grains, protein, and some healthy fats.\",\"均衡的饮食包括蔬菜、谷物、蛋白质和一些健康脂肪。\"],[\"The article gives a <b>balanced</b> account, presenting both supporters' and critics' views.\",\"这篇文章报道均衡，呈现了支持者和批评者的观点。\"]],\"bashful\":[[\"The <b>bashful</b> child hid behind her mother when the guests arrived.\",\"客人来时，这个害羞的孩子躲到妈妈身后。\"],[\"He gave a <b>bashful</b> smile when the teacher praised his drawing in front of the class.\",\"老师当着全班表扬他的画时，他害羞地笑了。\"]],\"benevolent\":[[\"The <b>benevolent</b> landowner built a school and a clinic for the village at his own expense.\",\"这位仁慈的地主自掏腰包为村里建了学校和诊所。\"],[\"A <b>benevolent</b> smile from the judge put the nervous witness at ease.\",\"法官仁慈的微笑让紧张的证人放松下来。\"]],\"bossy\":[[\"Her older sister can be <b>bossy</b>, telling everyone where to sit and what to do.\",\"她姐姐有时很专横，指挥每个人坐哪儿、做什么。\"],[\"Nobody liked working under such a <b>bossy</b> team leader.\",\"没人喜欢在这么专横的组长手下工作。\"]],\"bud\":[[\"In early spring, the apple trees <b>bud</b> long before the first leaves open.\",\"早春时节，苹果树在第一批叶子展开之前就发芽（长出芽）了。\"],[\"Rose bushes begin to <b>bud</b> as soon as the weather turns mild.\",\"天气一转暖，玫瑰丛就开始发芽。\"]],\"bust\":[[\"A marble <b>bust</b> of the Roman emperor stands in the museum's entrance hall.\",\"一尊罗马皇帝的大理石半身像立在博物馆的门厅里。\"],[\"The artist modelled a <b>bust</b> of her grandfather from old photographs.\",\"艺术家根据旧照片为祖父塑了一尊半身像。\"]],\"camel\":[[\"A <b>camel</b> can cross the desert for days without drinking because it stores fat in its hump.\",\"骆驼能在沙漠里走好几天不喝水，因为它的驼峰里储存着脂肪。\"],[\"Traders once crossed the Sahara in long <b>camel</b> caravans carrying salt and gold.\",\"商人曾经赶着长长的骆驼商队，驮着盐和黄金穿越撒哈拉。\"]],\"cascade\":[[\"After the heavy rain, water <b>cascaded</b> down the steps of the dam.\",\"大雨之后，水倾泻着冲下大坝的台阶。\"],[\"Her hair <b>cascaded</b> over her shoulders as she took off the hat.\",\"她摘下帽子时，头发倾泻般披落在肩上。\"]],\"categorize\":[[\"Librarians <b>categorize</b> books by subject so that readers can find them easily.\",\"图书管理员按主题给书籍分类，方便读者查找。\"],[\"The survey <b>categorized</b> respondents into five age groups.\",\"这项调查把受访者分成了五个年龄组来分类统计。\"]],\"chart\":[[\"The <b>chart</b> shows how average temperatures have risen over the past fifty years.\",\"这张图表显示了过去五十年平均气温的上升情况。\"],[\"Sailors once relied on hand-drawn <b>charts</b> of the coastline to navigate safely.\",\"水手曾经依靠手绘的海岸线海图（图表）安全航行。\"]],\"cheetah\":[[\"The <b>cheetah</b> is the fastest land animal, reaching 60 kilometres per hour in a few seconds.\",\"猎豹是陆地上跑得最快的动物，几秒内就能达到时速 60 公里。\"],[\"Unlike lions, a <b>cheetah</b> hunts alone and relies on speed rather than strength.\",\"与狮子不同，猎豹独自捕猎，靠的是速度而不是力量。\"]],\"conjecture\":[[\"Without more fossil evidence, the dinosaur's colour remains pure <b>conjecture</b>.\",\"没有更多化石证据，恐龙的颜色就纯粹是推测。\"],[\"His <b>conjecture</b> that the tomb lay under the hill turned out to be correct.\",\"他推测陵墓在山丘之下，后来证明是对的。\"]],\"crumb\":[[\"She brushed the bread <b>crumbs</b> off the table into her hand.\",\"她把桌上的面包屑拂到手里。\"],[\"Only a few <b>crumbs</b> of cake were left on the plate when the children returned.\",\"孩子们回来时，盘子里只剩下一点蛋糕屑（碎屑）。\"]],\"date\":[[\"Sweet <b>dates</b> are a traditional food for breaking the fast during Ramadan.\",\"甜枣是斋月期间开斋的传统食物。\"],[\"The <b>date</b> palm can grow in hot desert oases where few other trees survive.\",\"枣椰树能在炎热的沙漠绿洲中生长，那里很少有其他树能存活。\"]],\"den\":[[\"The fox raised her cubs in a <b>den</b> dug beneath the roots of an old oak.\",\"狐狸在老橡树根下挖的兽穴里养育幼崽。\"],[\"Bears spend the winter sleeping in a <b>den</b>, living off stored body fat.\",\"熊整个冬天在兽穴里冬眠，靠体内储存的脂肪存活。\"]],\"detect\":[[\"The sensor can <b>detect</b> even tiny amounts of smoke in the air.\",\"这个传感器能察觉空气中哪怕极微量的烟雾。\"],[\"Doctors use blood tests to <b>detect</b> the disease at an early stage.\",\"医生用血液检查在早期察觉这种疾病。\"]],\"dialogue\":[[\"The film's <b>dialogue</b> sounds natural because the actors improvised parts of it.\",\"这部电影的对话听起来很自然，因为演员即兴发挥了一部分。\"],[\"Leaders from both countries resumed their <b>dialogue</b> after a two-year break.\",\"两国领导人在中断两年后恢复了对话。\"]],\"disability\":[[\"The building added ramps and lifts so that visitors with a <b>disability</b> can reach every floor.\",\"大楼加装了坡道和电梯，有残疾的访客也能到达每一层。\"],[\"His <b>disability</b> did not stop him from becoming a champion wheelchair racer.\",\"残疾没有阻止他成为轮椅竞速冠军。\"]],\"emission\":[[\"The new law limits the <b>emission</b> of harmful gases from factory chimneys.\",\"新法律限制工厂烟囱有害气体的排放。\"],[\"Electric cars produce no exhaust <b>emissions</b> while driving in the city.\",\"电动汽车在城市里行驶时不产生尾气排放。\"]],\"empathy\":[[\"Good doctors need <b>empathy</b> to understand what their patients are going through.\",\"好医生需要同理心，才能理解病人正在经历什么。\"],[\"Reading novels can build <b>empathy</b> by letting us live inside another person's mind.\",\"读小说能培养同理心，因为它让我们进入另一个人的内心世界。\"]],\"examination\":[[\"A careful <b>examination</b> of the painting revealed a signature hidden under the frame.\",\"仔细检查这幅画后，人们在画框下发现了隐藏的签名。\"],[\"The doctor's <b>examination</b> showed that the infection had cleared completely.\",\"医生的检查表明感染已经完全清除。\"]],\"exterior\":[[\"The building's brick <b>exterior</b> has survived a century of storms.\",\"这栋建筑的砖砌外部经受住了一个世纪的风暴。\"],[\"From the <b>exterior</b>, the cave looks small, but inside it opens into a huge chamber.\",\"从外部看，这个洞穴很小，但里面却豁然开朗成一个巨大的洞室。\"]],\"extermination\":[[\"The <b>extermination</b> of wolves from the region upset the balance of the whole ecosystem.\",\"该地区狼的灭绝打破了整个生态系统的平衡。\"],[\"Rat <b>extermination</b> campaigns in ports were once used to stop the spread of plague.\",\"港口灭鼠运动曾经被用来阻止鼠疫的传播。\"]],\"feather\":[[\"A single <b>feather</b> from an eagle's wing can be over thirty centimetres long.\",\"鹰翅膀上的一根羽毛可以长达三十多厘米。\"],[\"Birds replace worn <b>feathers</b> through a yearly process called moulting.\",\"鸟类通过一年一度的换羽来更换磨损的羽毛。\"]],\"grapefruit\":[[\"Half a <b>grapefruit</b> with a little honey makes a fresh start to breakfast.\",\"半个葡萄柚加点蜂蜜，是清爽的早餐开端。\"],[\"<b>Grapefruit</b> trees need warm winters, so they are grown mainly in Florida and Texas.\",\"葡萄柚树需要温暖的冬季，所以主要种在佛罗里达和得克萨斯。\"]],\"humid\":[[\"The air in the rainforest is so <b>humid</b> that clothes never fully dry.\",\"雨林里的空气非常潮湿，衣服从来干不透。\"],[\"August in the city is hot and <b>humid</b>, with thunderstorms most afternoons.\",\"城里的八月又热又潮湿，多数下午都有雷阵雨。\"]],\"lettuce\":[[\"She washed the <b>lettuce</b> and tore the leaves into a large salad bowl.\",\"她洗好生菜，把叶子撕碎放进一个大沙拉碗里。\"],[\"<b>Lettuce</b> wilts quickly in heat, so farmers harvest it early in the morning.\",\"生菜在高温下很快枯萎，所以农民在清晨采收。\"]],\"mandolin\":[[\"He learned to play the <b>mandolin</b> from his grandfather, who had brought one from Italy.\",\"他跟祖父学弹曼陀林，祖父从意大利带来了一把。\"],[\"The folk band featured a fiddle, a guitar, and a bright-sounding <b>mandolin</b>.\",\"这支民谣乐队有一把小提琴、一把吉他和一把音色明亮的曼陀林。\"]],\"mint\":[[\"Fresh <b>mint</b> leaves give the tea a cool, clean taste.\",\"新鲜的薄荷叶让茶有一股清凉干净的味道。\"],[\"<b>Mint</b> spreads so aggressively that gardeners often grow it in pots.\",\"薄荷长势太猛，园丁们常常把它种在花盆里。\"]],\"neutral\":[[\"Switzerland remained <b>neutral</b> during both world wars.\",\"瑞士在两次世界大战期间都保持中立。\"],[\"A judge must stay <b>neutral</b> and listen to both sides before deciding.\",\"法官必须保持中立，听取双方意见后再作裁决。\"]],\"official\":[[\"A senior <b>official</b> from the ministry announced the new policy at a press conference.\",\"部里的一位高级官员在新闻发布会上宣布了新政策。\"],[\"Local <b>officials</b> inspected the bridge after residents reported cracks in the concrete.\",\"居民报告混凝土出现裂缝后，当地官员检查了这座桥。\"]],\"reaction\":[[\"Mixing vinegar and baking soda causes a chemical <b>reaction</b> that releases bubbles of carbon dioxide.\",\"把醋和小苏打混合会发生化学反应，释放出二氧化碳气泡。\"],[\"In this <b>reaction</b>, zinc replaces copper in the solution and the colour slowly fades.\",\"在这个化学反应中，锌置换了溶液中的铜，颜色慢慢变淡。\"]],\"recession\":[[\"During the <b>recession</b>, unemployment rose above ten percent in many industrial cities.\",\"衰退（经济衰退）期间，许多工业城市的失业率升到了百分之十以上。\"],[\"Economists define a <b>recession</b> as two consecutive quarters of shrinking output.\",\"经济学家把经济衰退定义为产出连续两个季度萎缩。\"]],\"recognition\":[[\"Face <b>recognition</b> software can identify a person from a photograph in seconds.\",\"人脸识别软件能在几秒内从照片中识别出一个人。\"],[\"Pattern <b>recognition</b> helps computers sort handwritten addresses on envelopes.\",\"模式识别帮助计算机分拣信封上手写的地址。\"]],\"sailing\":[[\"<b>Sailing</b> teaches you to read the wind and the water at the same time.\",\"帆船运动教你同时判断风向和水流。\"],[\"She took up <b>sailing</b> at fifty and now races small boats on the lake.\",\"她五十岁时开始从事帆船运动，现在在湖上参加小型帆船比赛。\"]],\"skirt\":[[\"She wore a long woollen <b>skirt</b> against the winter cold.\",\"她穿了一条长毛呢裙子抵御冬日的寒冷。\"],[\"The dancer's <b>skirt</b> spun out in a wide circle as she turned.\",\"舞者转身时，裙子旋成一个大大的圆圈。\"]],\"sorghum\":[[\"<b>Sorghum</b> tolerates drought better than corn, so farmers plant it in dry regions.\",\"高粱比玉米更耐旱，所以农民在干旱地区种高粱。\"],[\"In parts of China, <b>sorghum</b> grain is brewed into a strong traditional liquor.\",\"在中国一些地方，高粱被用来酿造传统的烈酒。\"]],\"swan\":[[\"A lone <b>swan</b> glided across the lake toward its nest among the reeds.\",\"一只天鹅划过湖面，游向芦苇丛中的巢。\"],[\"<b>Swans</b> mate for life and defend their cygnets fiercely against foxes.\",\"天鹅终身一夫一妻，会凶猛地保护小天鹅不受狐狸伤害。\"]],\"toss\":[[\"He <b>tossed</b> the keys onto the table and dropped into a chair.\",\"他把钥匙抛到桌上，一屁股坐进椅子里。\"],[\"The cook <b>tossed</b> the salad with olive oil and lemon juice.\",\"厨师把沙拉用橄榄油和柠檬汁抛拌均匀。\"]],\"township\":[[\"The <b>township</b> government built a new primary school for its three villages.\",\"乡镇政府为下辖的三个村子建了一所新小学。\"],[\"Each <b>township</b> in the county elects its own small council.\",\"该县的每个乡镇都选举自己的小规模委员会。\"]],\"trade\":[[\"<b>Trade</b> between the two ports grew after the canal opened in 1869.\",\"1869 年运河开通后，两个港口之间的贸易增长了。\"],[\"Silk was a major item of <b>trade</b> along the ancient Silk Road.\",\"丝绸是古代丝绸之路贸易的主要商品。\"]],\"trunk\":[[\"The elephant picked up a log with its <b>trunk</b> and carried it to the river.\",\"大象用象鼻卷起一根木头，把它运到河边。\"],[\"An elephant's <b>trunk</b> contains tens of thousands of muscles but no bone.\",\"大象的象鼻里有数万块肌肉，却没有一块骨头。\"]],\"turbine\":[[\"Steam spins the <b>turbine</b>, which drives the generator that produces electricity.\",\"蒸汽推动涡轮机转动，涡轮机再带动发电机发电。\"],[\"Wind <b>turbines</b> on the hill generate enough power for two thousand homes.\",\"山上的风力涡轮机发的电够两千户人家使用。\"]],\"vocational\":[[\"The <b>vocational</b> school trains electricians, cooks, and computer technicians.\",\"这所职业学校培养电工、厨师和计算机技术员。\"],[\"She chose <b>vocational</b> training in nursing instead of a general university degree.\",\"她选择了护理方面的职业培训，而不是普通的大学学位。\"]],\"adopt\":[[\"The couple decided to <b>adopt</b> a child after years of unsuccessful treatments.\",\"这对夫妇在多年治疗无果后决定收养一个孩子。\"],[\"Thousands of orphaned children were <b>adopted</b> by families abroad after the war.\",\"战后，成千上万的孤儿被外国的家庭收养。\"]],\"anthropologist\":[[\"The <b>anthropologist</b> lived with the tribe for two years to study its kinship system.\",\"这位人类学家与这个部落共同生活了两年，研究它的亲属制度。\"],[\"<b>Anthropologists</b> compare customs across cultures to understand how societies change.\",\"人类学家比较不同文化的习俗，以理解社会如何变迁。\"]],\"anticipate\":[[\"Farmers <b>anticipate</b> a good harvest this year because the rains came early.\",\"农民预料今年收成会好，因为雨水来得早。\"],[\"The store ordered extra umbrellas, <b>anticipating</b> a week of heavy rain.\",\"商店预料到会有一周大雨，提前多订了雨伞。\"]],\"arena\":[[\"The Roman <b>arena</b> could hold fifty thousand spectators for gladiator contests.\",\"罗马竞技场能容纳五万名观众观看角斗士比赛。\"],[\"The final match filled the ice-hockey <b>arena</b> long before the game began.\",\"决赛开始前很久，冰球竞技场就坐满了。\"]],\"arrears\":[[\"The tenant fell into <b>arrears</b> after losing his job and owed three months' rent.\",\"房客失业后拖欠房租，欠了三个月的租金（欠款）。\"],[\"The club reminded members in <b>arrears</b> to pay their fees before the end of the month.\",\"俱乐部提醒欠款的会员在月底前缴纳会费。\"]],\"axiom\":[[\"In geometry, the statement that a straight line is the shortest distance between two points is treated as an <b>axiom</b>.\",\"在几何学中，两点之间直线最短这一命题被视为公理。\"],[\"Economists begin many models with the <b>axiom</b> that people act in their own interest.\",\"经济学家建立许多模型时都以「人按自身利益行事」这一公理为出发点。\"]],\"bewilder\":[[\"The maze of identical corridors <b>bewildered</b> the new students on their first day.\",\"一模一样的走廊组成的迷宫让新生第一天就迷惑不解。\"],[\"Rapid changes in the instructions <b>bewildered</b> even the experienced workers.\",\"指示频繁变化，连有经验的工人也感到迷惑不解。\"]],\"bitter\":[[\"The medicine had a <b>bitter</b> taste, so the child refused to swallow it.\",\"这药味道苦，孩子不肯咽下去。\"],[\"Dark coffee without sugar tastes <b>bitter</b> to most first-time drinkers.\",\"不加糖的黑咖啡对多数初次喝的人来说是苦的。\"]],\"chair\":[[\"He pulled up a <b>chair</b> and sat down beside the patient's bed.\",\"他拉过一把椅子，在病人床边坐下。\"],[\"The wooden <b>chair</b> had been carved by her grandfather more than sixty years ago.\",\"这把木椅子是她祖父六十多年前雕刻的。\"]],\"citation\":[[\"Every <b>citation</b> in her thesis follows the same format: author, year, and page number.\",\"她论文里的每条引文都遵循同样的格式：作者、年份和页码。\"],[\"The professor asked students to add a <b>citation</b> for every fact taken from another work.\",\"教授要求学生为每一条取自他人著作的事实都加上引文出处。\"]],\"cleave\":[[\"With one swing of the axe, he <b>cleaved</b> the log into two pieces.\",\"他一斧子下去，把木头劈成两半。\"],[\"The ship's bow <b>cleaved</b> through the waves as the storm grew stronger.\",\"风暴越来越强时，船头劈开波浪前进。\"]],\"comment\":[[\"The teacher wrote a short <b>comment</b> at the end of each student's essay.\",\"老师在每个学生的作文末尾写了一小段评论。\"],[\"He declined to <b>comment</b> on the rumours about his resignation.\",\"他拒绝就有关他辞职的传闻发表评论。\"]],\"configuration\":[[\"The <b>configuration</b> of the planets on that night made three of them visible in a row.\",\"那晚行星的构造（排列位置）使其中三颗排成一列可见。\"],[\"Changing the <b>configuration</b> of the atoms turns graphite into diamond.\",\"改变原子的构造（排列方式），可以把石墨变成钻石。\"]],\"consulate\":[[\"She applied for her visa at the French <b>consulate</b> in Shanghai.\",\"她在上海的法国领事馆申请了签证。\"],[\"The <b>consulate</b> helped its citizens return home after the earthquake closed the airport.\",\"地震导致机场关闭后，领事馆帮助本国公民回国。\"]],\"cramp\":[[\"The swimmer got a <b>cramp</b> in his calf and had to hold onto the edge of the pool.\",\"游泳者小腿抽筋，不得不抓住池边。\"],[\"Long-distance runners stretch carefully to prevent muscle <b>cramps</b>.\",\"长跑运动员认真拉伸，预防肌肉抽筋。\"]],\"crosswalk\":[[\"Drivers must stop for pedestrians at the <b>crosswalk</b>, even when the light is green for cars.\",\"即使汽车是绿灯，司机也必须在斑马线前为行人停车。\"],[\"Children are taught to look both ways before using the <b>crosswalk</b>.\",\"孩子们被教导过斑马线前要左右看。\"]],\"decree\":[[\"The king issued a <b>decree</b> abolishing the unpopular tax.\",\"国王颁布法令，废除了这项不得人心的税。\"],[\"By <b>decree</b> of the city council, the old market was closed for renovation.\",\"根据市议会的法令，老市场关闭整修。\"]],\"define\":[[\"The dictionary <b>defines</b> courage as the ability to act despite fear.\",\"字典把勇气定义为：尽管恐惧仍能行动的能力。\"],[\"Biologists <b>define</b> a species as a group whose members can breed with one another.\",\"生物学家把物种定义为成员之间能够互相繁殖的群体。\"]],\"domestic\":[[\"<b>Domestic</b> flights within the country are cheaper than international ones.\",\"国内航班比国际航班便宜。\"],[\"The report focuses on <b>domestic</b> policy: housing, schools, and public health at home.\",\"这份报告关注国内政策：本国的住房、学校和公共卫生。\"]],\"emancipation\":[[\"The <b>emancipation</b> of the slaves was announced in 1863, during the Civil War.\",\"奴隶解放宣言在 1863 年内战期间宣布。\"],[\"For her, learning to drive was a small step toward <b>emancipation</b> from her parents' control.\",\"对她来说，学会开车是摆脱父母控制、走向解放的一小步。\"]],\"equip\":[[\"The rescue team was <b>equipped</b> with ropes, lights, and breathing apparatus.\",\"救援队装备了绳索、照明灯和呼吸器。\"],[\"Each classroom is <b>equipped</b> with a projector and a whiteboard.\",\"每间教室都装备了投影仪和白板。\"]],\"era\":[[\"The steam engine defined an <b>era</b> in which factories replaced hand workshops.\",\"蒸汽机定义了一个时代：工厂取代了手工工场。\"],[\"Historians call the period after 1945 the atomic <b>era</b>.\",\"历史学家把 1945 年之后的那段时期称为原子时代。\"]],\"excavation\":[[\"The <b>excavation</b> of the Roman villa uncovered mosaics that had been buried for 1,600 years.\",\"对这座罗马别墅的挖掘发现了埋藏 1600 年的马赛克。\"],[\"Before building began, an archaeological <b>excavation</b> was carried out on the site.\",\"施工开始前，先对这块地进行了考古挖掘。\"]],\"except\":[[\"Everyone in the class passed the test <b>except</b> one student who had been absent for a month.\",\"全班都通过了考试，除外（除了）一名缺课一个月的学生。\"],[\"The library is open every day <b>except</b> Sunday.\",\"图书馆每天开放，星期天除外。\"]],\"flea\":[[\"The dog kept scratching because a <b>flea</b> had bitten its neck.\",\"狗不停地挠痒，因为一只跳蚤咬了它的脖子。\"],[\"<b>Fleas</b> can jump more than a hundred times their own body length.\",\"跳蚤能跳出自身长度一百多倍的距离。\"]],\"fungus\":[[\"The blue patches on the old bread are a <b>fungus</b> that grows on decaying food.\",\"旧面包上的蓝色斑点是一种生长在腐烂食物上的真菌。\"],[\"Some <b>fungi</b> live on tree roots and help the trees absorb minerals from the soil.\",\"有些真菌生活在树根上，帮助树木从土壤中吸收矿物质。\"]],\"garlic\":[[\"She fried the <b>garlic</b> in olive oil before adding the tomatoes.\",\"她先把大蒜放在橄榄油里炸香，再加入西红柿。\"],[\"A clove of <b>garlic</b> a day was once believed to protect against colds.\",\"人们曾经相信每天吃一瓣大蒜能预防感冒。\"]],\"grant\":[[\"The university received a research <b>grant</b> of two million dollars to study ocean plastics.\",\"大学获得了一笔两百万美元的研究拨款，用来研究海洋塑料。\"],[\"Her application for a <b>grant</b> to restore the old library was approved in March.\",\"她申请拨款修复老图书馆的申请在三月获批。\"]],\"grove\":[[\"They rested in a <b>grove</b> of orange trees at noon, out of the fierce sun.\",\"正午，他们在一片橙树小树林里避开烈日休息。\"],[\"A small <b>grove</b> of bamboo stood behind the temple.\",\"寺庙后面有一小片竹林（小树林）。\"]],\"hug\":[[\"She gave her brother a long <b>hug</b> at the airport before his flight.\",\"哥哥登机前，她在机场给了他一个长长的拥抱。\"],[\"The child ran to <b>hug</b> his grandmother as soon as her train arrived.\",\"奶奶的火车一到，孩子就跑过去拥抱她。\"]],\"hunter\":[[\"The <b>hunter</b> followed the deer's tracks through the snow for two hours.\",\"猎人循着鹿在雪地上的足迹追踪了两个小时。\"],[\"In the story, a young <b>hunter</b> spares the wolf that once saved his life.\",\"故事里，年轻的猎人放过了曾经救过他命的一匹狼。\"]],\"industry\":[[\"The automobile <b>industry</b> employs hundreds of thousands of workers in this region.\",\"汽车工业在这个地区雇用了数十万工人。\"],[\"After 1850, the textile <b>industry</b> moved from small workshops into large factories.\",\"1850 年之后，纺织工业从小作坊搬进了大工厂。\"]],\"inhabit\":[[\"Penguins <b>inhabit</b> the cold coasts of Antarctica and nearby islands.\",\"企鹅栖息在南极洲和附近岛屿的寒冷海岸。\"],[\"Few animals can <b>inhabit</b> the driest parts of the Sahara.\",\"很少有动物能在撒哈拉最干旱的地带栖息。\"]],\"intense\":[[\"The desert sun was so <b>intense</b> at midday that the travellers rested until evening.\",\"正午的沙漠阳光太强烈，旅行者们休息到傍晚。\"],[\"She felt <b>intense</b> relief when the missing child was found safe.\",\"失踪的孩子平安找到时，她感到强烈的宽慰。\"]],\"intuition\":[[\"Her <b>intuition</b> told her the bridge was unsafe, and the inspection later proved her right.\",\"她的直觉告诉她这座桥不安全，后来的检查证明她是对的。\"],[\"Experienced nurses often rely on <b>intuition</b> built up over years of practice.\",\"有经验的护士常常依靠多年实践积累的直觉。\"]],\"kindergarten\":[[\"In <b>kindergarten</b>, children learn through play rather than formal lessons.\",\"在幼儿园，孩子们通过玩耍而不是正式课程来学习。\"],[\"He still remembers the teacher who taught him to tie his shoes in <b>kindergarten</b>.\",\"他还记得在幼儿园教他系鞋带的那位老师。\"]],\"king\":[[\"The <b>king</b> ruled the country for forty years and built roads, canals, and schools.\",\"这位国王统治国家四十年，修建了道路、运河和学校。\"],[\"In chess, the game ends when one <b>king</b> can no longer escape capture.\",\"在国际象棋中，当一方的国王（王）再也无法逃脱被吃时，对局就结束。\"]],\"lane\":[[\"The country <b>lane</b> was so narrow that two cars could not pass each other.\",\"这条乡间小路太窄，两辆车无法错车。\"],[\"Swimmers must stay in their own <b>lane</b> during the race.\",\"游泳比赛时，运动员必须待在自己的泳道（小路/车道）里。\"]],\"letter\":[[\"She wrote a long <b>letter</b> to her friend describing life in the new city.\",\"她给朋友写了一封长信，讲述新城市的生活。\"],[\"Before email, families separated by oceans kept in touch mainly by <b>letter</b>.\",\"电子邮件出现之前，远隔重洋的家人主要靠信件保持联系。\"]],\"lower\":[[\"The store <b>lowered</b> the price of winter coats at the end of January.\",\"商店在一月底降低了冬装的价格。\"],[\"Doctors advised him to <b>lower</b> his salt intake to protect his heart.\",\"医生建议他降低盐的摄入量，以保护心脏。\"]],\"malleable\":[[\"Gold is highly <b>malleable</b>: one gram can be beaten into a sheet covering a square metre.\",\"黄金可锻性极强：一克金子可以锤打成覆盖一平方米的薄片。\"],[\"Copper is soft and <b>malleable</b>, which makes it easy to shape into pipes and wires.\",\"铜质地软、可锻，因此容易加工成管子和电线。\"]],\"mayonnaise\":[[\"She spread <b>mayonnaise</b> on the bread before adding the chicken and lettuce.\",\"她先在面包上抹蛋黄酱，再放鸡肉和生菜。\"],[\"Homemade <b>mayonnaise</b> is made by slowly whisking oil into egg yolks.\",\"自制蛋黄酱是把油慢慢打进蛋黄里做成的。\"]],\"modify\":[[\"The engineers <b>modified</b> the design after the wind-tunnel test revealed a weakness.\",\"风洞测试暴露出一个弱点后，工程师修改了设计。\"],[\"You can <b>modify</b> the recipe by using honey instead of sugar.\",\"你可以用蜂蜜代替糖来修改这份食谱。\"]],\"mussel\":[[\"At low tide, rocks along the shore are covered with black <b>mussels</b>.\",\"退潮时，岸边的岩石上布满了黑色的贻贝。\"],[\"The restaurant serves <b>mussels</b> steamed in white wine and garlic.\",\"这家餐馆供应白葡萄酒加大蒜蒸的贻贝。\"]],\"pencil\":[[\"She sketched the bird's outline lightly in <b>pencil</b> before painting over it.\",\"她先用铅笔轻轻勾出鸟的轮廓，然后再上色。\"],[\"Exams must be written in pen, not <b>pencil</b>, so that answers cannot be changed later.\",\"考试必须用钢笔而不是铅笔作答，这样答案事后无法更改。\"]],\"previous\":[[\"The <b>previous</b> owner of the house had planted roses all along the fence.\",\"房子的先前主人沿着栅栏种满了玫瑰。\"],[\"Her <b>previous</b> job was in a hospital laboratory, before she moved into teaching.\",\"她先前的工作在医院实验室，之后才转行教书。\"]],\"psychoanalysis\":[[\"<b>Psychoanalysis</b>, developed by Freud, treats mental illness by exploring unconscious motives.\",\"精神分析由弗洛伊德创立，通过探索无意识动机来治疗心理疾病。\"],[\"In <b>psychoanalysis</b>, patients talk freely about dreams and childhood memories.\",\"在精神分析中，病人自由地讲述梦和童年记忆。\"]],\"push\":[[\"They had to <b>push</b> the car up the hill after the engine failed.\",\"发动机熄火后，他们不得不推着车上坡。\"],[\"Please <b>push</b> the door gently; it sticks in wet weather.\",\"请轻轻推门；潮湿天气时门会卡住。\"]],\"relaxation\":[[\"After the exams, she allowed herself a weekend of complete <b>relaxation</b> by the sea.\",\"考试结束后，她让自己在海边彻底放松了一个周末。\"],[\"Deep breathing is a simple <b>relaxation</b> technique used before public speaking.\",\"深呼吸是演讲前常用的一种简单放松方法。\"]],\"reunion\":[[\"At the class <b>reunion</b>, old friends met again after twenty years apart.\",\"在同学聚会上，老朋友们分别二十年后再次相见。\"],[\"The school holds a <b>reunion</b> every five years for its former students.\",\"学校每五年为校友举办一次（同学）聚会。\"]],\"rotation\":[[\"The Earth's <b>rotation</b> on its axis takes about twenty-four hours and gives us day and night.\",\"地球绕地轴的自转大约需要二十四小时，给我们带来昼夜。\"],[\"Because of the planet's slow <b>rotation</b>, one day on Venus lasts longer than its year.\",\"由于这颗行星自转缓慢，金星上的一天比它的一年还长。\"]],\"scale\":[[\"The fish's <b>scales</b> shone silver and green in the sunlight.\",\"这条鱼的鳞片在阳光下闪着银绿色的光。\"],[\"Before cooking, she scraped the <b>scales</b> off the fish with a knife.\",\"烹饪前，她用刀把鱼的鳞片刮掉。\"]],\"script\":[[\"The actors received the <b>script</b> only two weeks before filming began.\",\"演员们在开拍前两周才拿到剧本。\"],[\"She wrote the <b>script</b> for a play about the first women doctors.\",\"她写了一部关于第一批女医生的戏的剧本。\"]],\"slavery\":[[\"<b>Slavery</b> was abolished in the British Empire in 1833, though it took years to end in practice.\",\"奴隶制于 1833 年在大英帝国被废除，但在实践中又花了多年才真正结束。\"],[\"The museum documents the history of <b>slavery</b> and its effects on generations of families.\",\"这家博物馆记录了奴隶制的历史及其几代人所受的影响。\"]],\"spectrum\":[[\"A prism splits white light into a <b>spectrum</b> of colours from red to violet.\",\"棱镜把白光分解成从红到紫的光谱。\"],[\"Bees can see ultraviolet light, a part of the <b>spectrum</b> invisible to humans.\",\"蜜蜂能看见紫外线，那是人类看不见的那部分光谱。\"]],\"steak\":[[\"He ordered a grilled <b>steak</b> with pepper sauce and fries.\",\"他点了一份配胡椒汁和薯条的烤牛排。\"],[\"The butcher cut the <b>steak</b> thick so it would stay juicy on the grill.\",\"屠夫把牛排切得厚厚的，这样烤的时候能保持多汁。\"]],\"tide\":[[\"At low <b>tide</b>, children search the rock pools for crabs and small fish.\",\"退潮（低潮）时，孩子们在岩石水洼里找螃蟹和小鱼。\"],[\"The <b>tide</b> comes in twice a day, driven by the Moon's gravity.\",\"潮汐每天涨落两次，由月球引力驱动。\"]],\"toe\":[[\"She stubbed her <b>toe</b> on the table leg and limped for the rest of the day.\",\"她的脚趾撞到桌腿，那天剩下的时间都一瘸一拐的。\"],[\"Ballet dancers stand on their <b>toes</b> in special shoes called pointe shoes.\",\"芭蕾舞者穿着一种叫足尖鞋的特殊鞋子，用脚趾站立。\"]],\"vein\":[[\"Nurses draw blood from a <b>vein</b> in the arm, not from an artery.\",\"护士从手臂的静脉而不是动脉抽血。\"],[\"<b>Veins</b> carry blood back toward the heart, while arteries carry it away.\",\"静脉把血液送回心脏，动脉则把血液送走。\"]],\"witness\":[[\"The key <b>witness</b> told the court exactly what she had seen that night.\",\"关键证人在法庭上如实讲述了那晚她看到的一切。\"],[\"Two <b>witnesses</b> signed the will to confirm that it was genuine.\",\"两名证人在遗嘱上签字，证明遗嘱真实有效。\"]],\"alliance\":[[\"The two small kingdoms formed an <b>alliance</b> to resist the invading empire.\",\"两个小王国结成同盟，共同抵抗入侵的帝国。\"],[\"The military <b>alliance</b> requires each member to help defend the others.\",\"这个军事同盟要求每个成员国都有义务协助防御其他成员。\"]],\"ambiguity\":[[\"The contract's <b>ambiguity</b> about delivery dates led to a dispute between the two firms.\",\"合同中关于交货日期的歧义导致了两家公司之间的纠纷。\"],[\"Good exam questions avoid <b>ambiguity</b>, so students know exactly what is being asked.\",\"好的考试题避免歧义，让学生确切知道在问什么。\"]],\"amendment\":[[\"The first <b>amendment</b> to the US Constitution protects freedom of speech.\",\"美国宪法第一修正案保护言论自由。\"],[\"Parliament debated the <b>amendment</b> to the housing bill for three days before voting.\",\"议会在投票前就住房法案的修正案辩论了三天。\"]],\"approximation\":[[\"This figure is only an <b>approximation</b>; the exact count will be published next month.\",\"这个数字只是近似值；精确统计下个月公布。\"],[\"Using three for pi is a rough <b>approximation</b> that works for quick estimates.\",\"用 3 代替圆周率是一种粗略的近似值，快速估算时够用。\"]],\"assist\":[[\"Older students <b>assist</b> the teacher by handing out materials at the start of class.\",\"高年級学生在上课开始时协助老师分发材料。\"],[\"The new software <b>assists</b> doctors in reading X-ray images more accurately.\",\"新软件协助医生更准确地解读 X 光片。\"]],\"await\":[[\"A warm meal <b>awaited</b> the hikers when they finally reached the mountain hut.\",\"徒步者终于到达山间小屋时，一顿热饭在等着他们（正式的「等待」）。\"],[\"The results of the experiment are still <b>awaited</b> by scientists around the world.\",\"全世界的科学家仍在等待这项实验的结果。\"]],\"backpack\":[[\"They spent the summer <b>backpacking</b> through the mountains with nothing but a tent and a map.\",\"他们整个夏天背包旅行穿越山区，只带了一顶帐篷和一张地图。\"],[\"A <b>backpack</b> trip across Europe taught her to travel light and plan flexibly.\",\"一次背包旅行（横跨欧洲）教会她轻装出行、灵活规划。\"]],\"balloon\":[[\"The child let go of the <b>balloon</b>, and it floated up until it was a tiny dot in the sky.\",\"孩子松开了气球，它飘上天空，直到变成一个小点。\"],[\"Scientists release weather <b>balloons</b> twice a day to measure conditions high in the atmosphere.\",\"科学家每天放飞两次气象气球，测量高层大气的状况。\"]],\"barrier\":[[\"The Great Wall was built as a <b>barrier</b> against invasions from the north.\",\"长城是作为抵御北方入侵的障碍（屏障）而修建的。\"],[\"Language was the main <b>barrier</b> when she first studied abroad.\",\"她刚出国留学时，语言是主要的障碍。\"]],\"bewildered\":[[\"The <b>bewildered</b> tourists stood in the station, unable to read any of the signs.\",\"困惑的游客们站在车站里，一个指示牌也看不懂。\"],[\"He looked <b>bewildered</b> when the results were announced: he had expected to fail.\",\"结果公布时他一脸困惑：他本以为自己会不及格。\"]],\"blood\":[[\"The heart pumps <b>blood</b> through arteries to every part of the body.\",\"心脏把血液通过动脉泵送到身体的各个部位。\"],[\"She donates <b>blood</b> twice a year at the local hospital.\",\"她每年在当地医院献两次血（血液）。\"]],\"camping\":[[\"They went <b>camping</b> by the lake and cooked dinner over an open fire.\",\"他们去湖边露营，在篝火上做晚饭。\"],[\"<b>Camping</b> in winter requires a warm sleeping bag and a waterproof tent.\",\"冬天露营需要暖和的睡袋和防水的帐篷。\"]],\"candy\":[[\"The dentist warned the children that too much <b>candy</b> would damage their teeth.\",\"牙医警告孩子们，糖果吃多了会损坏牙齿。\"],[\"She kept a small bowl of wrapped <b>candies</b> on her desk for visitors.\",\"她在桌上放了一小碗包装好的糖果招待访客。\"]],\"cathedral\":[[\"The <b>cathedral</b> took more than a hundred years to build and still dominates the old town.\",\"这座大教堂建了一百多年，至今仍俯瞰着老城区。\"],[\"Visitors come to see the <b>cathedral's</b> stained-glass windows, which date from the thirteenth century.\",\"游客来参观大教堂的彩绘玻璃窗，它们可以追溯到十三世纪。\"]],\"censor\":[[\"During the war, letters from soldiers were <b>censored</b> to remove military details.\",\"战争期间，士兵的信件会被审查，删去军事细节。\"],[\"The film was <b>censored</b> before release, and several scenes were cut.\",\"这部电影在上映前经过审查，有几个场景被删掉。\"]],\"charm\":[[\"The old fishing village <b>charmed</b> visitors with its narrow lanes and painted boats.\",\"这个古老的渔村以狭窄的小巷和彩绘的渔船迷住了游客。\"],[\"Much of the novel's <b>charm</b> lies in its quiet humour and gentle characters.\",\"这部小说的迷人之处很大程度上在于它安静的幽默和温和的人物。\"]],\"clause\":[[\"A <b>clause</b> in the contract allows either side to end the agreement with thirty days' notice.\",\"合同中的一条条款允许任何一方提前三十天通知终止协议。\"],[\"Read every <b>clause</b> of the rental agreement before you sign it.\",\"签字之前，把租赁协议的每一条款都读一遍。\"]],\"commend\":[[\"The firefighter was <b>commended</b> for rescuing two children from the burning building.\",\"这名消防员因从着火的建筑中救出两个孩子而受到赞扬。\"],[\"The report <b>commends</b> the school for cutting dropout rates by half.\",\"报告赞扬这所学校把辍学率降低了一半。\"]],\"complement\":[[\"The sweet sauce is the perfect <b>complement</b> to the salty cheese.\",\"甜酱是咸奶酪的完美补充（搭配）。\"],[\"Her practical skills <b>complement</b> his theoretical knowledge, making them a strong team.\",\"她的实践技能补充了他的理论知识，两人是很强的团队。\"]],\"coyote\":[[\"A <b>coyote</b> trotted across the road at dusk, hunting for rabbits in the fields.\",\"黄昏时，一只郊狼小跑着穿过马路，去田野里猎兔子。\"],[\"<b>Coyotes</b> have adapted to city life and are now seen in many American suburbs.\",\"郊狼已经适应了城市生活，如今在许多美国郊区都能看到。\"]],\"crawl\":[[\"The baby learned to <b>crawl</b> before she could stand or walk.\",\"这个婴儿先学会了爬行，然后才会站和走。\"],[\"Traffic <b>crawled</b> through the city centre during the evening rush hour.\",\"晚高峰时，车流在市中心爬行般缓慢移动。\"]],\"dependence\":[[\"The country's <b>dependence</b> on imported oil makes its economy vulnerable to price shocks.\",\"这个国家对进口石油的依赖使其经济容易受到价格冲击。\"],[\"Babies are born in total <b>dependence</b> on their parents for food and protection.\",\"婴儿出生时完全依赖父母提供食物和保护。\"]],\"dew\":[[\"Early in the morning, the grass was covered with drops of <b>dew</b>.\",\"清晨，草地上布满了露水珠。\"],[\"Spider webs hung with <b>dew</b> glittered in the first sunlight.\",\"挂着露水的蜘蛛网在第一缕阳光下闪闪发光。\"]],\"dictate\":[[\"The doctor <b>dictated</b> the report into a recorder for the secretary to type up.\",\"医生把报告口授给录音机，让秘书打出来。\"],[\"In the old classroom, the teacher <b>dictated</b> sentences while students wrote them down.\",\"在老式课堂上，老师口授句子，学生们记下来。\"]],\"disaster\":[[\"The earthquake was the worst natural <b>disaster</b> in the country's recorded history.\",\"这次地震是该国有记录以来最严重的自然灾难。\"],[\"After the flood <b>disaster</b>, aid poured in from neighbouring provinces.\",\"洪水灾难之后，援助从邻近省份源源涌来。\"]],\"drag\":[[\"Two men <b>dragged</b> the heavy piano across the room to the window.\",\"两个人把沉重的钢琴拖过房间，拖到窗边。\"],[\"The anchor <b>dragged</b> along the muddy bottom, slowing the drifting boat.\",\"船锚拖着泥泞的河底，让漂流的船慢下来。\"]],\"electrician\":[[\"We called an <b>electrician</b> after the lights in the whole house suddenly went out.\",\"全屋的灯突然熄灭后，我们叫了电工。\"],[\"The <b>electrician</b> found that a mouse had chewed through one of the wires.\",\"电工发现一只老鼠咬断了其中一根电线。\"]],\"engine\":[[\"The car's <b>engine</b> converts the chemical energy in petrol into motion.\",\"汽车发动机把汽油中的化学能转化成运动。\"],[\"When the train's <b>engine</b> failed, passengers had to wait two hours for a replacement.\",\"火车的发动机出故障后，乘客不得不等了两小时才换上新车。\"]],\"enjoyment\":[[\"She plays the violin purely for <b>enjoyment</b>, never for an audience.\",\"她拉小提琴纯粹是为了享受，从不为观众演奏。\"],[\"Reading aloud to children increases their <b>enjoyment</b> of stories.\",\"给孩子大声朗读能增加他们对故事的享受。\"]],\"entry\":[[\"Look up the word in the dictionary and read the whole <b>entry</b>, including the examples.\",\"在字典里查这个词，把整个条目（包括例句）都读一遍。\"],[\"Each <b>entry</b> in the catalogue lists the title, the author, and the year of publication.\",\"目录中的每一条目都列出标题、作者和出版年份。\"]],\"epitaph\":[[\"His <b>epitaph</b> reads simply: “He loved the sea.”\",\"他的墓志铭简单地写着：「他热爱大海。」\"],[\"The poet wrote her own <b>epitaph</b> years before her death.\",\"这位诗人在去世前多年就写好了自己的墓志铭。\"]],\"exertion\":[[\"After the long climb, the hikers were pale with <b>exertion</b> and drank deeply from their bottles.\",\"长途攀登之后，徒步者们累得脸色发白（努力/费力所致），大口喝着水。\"],[\"Mental <b>exertion</b> over many hours can be as tiring as physical labour.\",\"长时间动脑的努力（用力）和体力劳动一样累人。\"]],\"factory\":[[\"The <b>factory</b> produces two thousand bicycles a day for export.\",\"这家工厂每天生产两千辆自行车用于出口。\"],[\"She worked in a clothing <b>factory</b> before opening her own shop.\",\"她在开自己的店之前，在一家服装工厂工作。\"]],\"fencing\":[[\"<b>Fencing</b> requires fast reflexes, precise footwork, and careful timing.\",\"击剑需要快速的反应、精确的步法和恰当的时机。\"],[\"At the Olympics, <b>fencing</b> medals are contested with foil, épée, and sabre.\",\"奥运会上，击剑奖牌通过花剑、重剑和佩剑角逐。\"]],\"hammer\":[[\"He struck the nail twice with the <b>hammer</b> to fix the shelf to the wall.\",\"他用锤子敲了两下钉子，把架子固定在墙上。\"],[\"The blacksmith's <b>hammer</b> rang against the hot iron all morning.\",\"铁匠的锤子整个上午都在热铁上敲得叮当响。\"]],\"hen\":[[\"The <b>hen</b> gathered her chicks under her wings when the hawk appeared.\",\"老鹰出现时，母鸡把小鸡拢到翅膀底下。\"],[\"A good laying <b>hen</b> can produce more than 250 eggs a year.\",\"一只好的产蛋母鸡一年能产 250 多个蛋。\"]],\"hero\":[[\"The firefighter became a local <b>hero</b> after pulling a family from the flood.\",\"消防员从洪水中救出一家人后，成了当地的英雄。\"],[\"In the epic, the <b>hero</b> crosses the sea to rescue his captured brother.\",\"在史诗中，英雄渡海去营救被俘的兄弟。\"]],\"imprisonment\":[[\"He was sentenced to five years' <b>imprisonment</b> for stealing company funds.\",\"他因盗用公司资金被判处五年监禁。\"],[\"Wrongful <b>imprisonment</b> can destroy a person's career even after release.\",\"错误的监禁即使在获释后也会毁掉一个人的职业生涯。\"]],\"incidence\":[[\"The <b>incidence</b> of the disease is highest in regions without clean drinking water.\",\"这种疾病的发生率在没有清洁饮用水地区最高。\"],[\"Regular screening has reduced the <b>incidence</b> of this cancer over the past decade.\",\"过去十年，定期筛查降低了这种癌症的发生率。\"]],\"injure\":[[\"He <b>injured</b> his knee playing football and could not walk without crutches.\",\"他踢足球时伤了膝盖（受了伤害），没有拐杖无法走路。\"],[\"The accident <b>injured</b> three passengers, though none seriously.\",\"事故使三名乘客受伤，好在都不严重。\"]],\"lord\":[[\"In feudal times, a <b>lord</b> granted land to his knights in exchange for military service.\",\"封建时代，勋爵（领主）把土地授予骑士，以换取军役。\"],[\"He was made a <b>lord</b> for his services to science and now sits in the upper house.\",\"他因对科学的贡献被封为勋爵，如今在上议院任职。\"]],\"manuscript\":[[\"The author's handwritten <b>manuscript</b> is kept in the national library.\",\"作者的手写手稿保存在国家图书馆。\"],[\"She sent the <b>manuscript</b> of her novel to three publishers in the same week.\",\"同一年一周内，她把小说手稿寄给了三家出版社。\"]],\"minimal\":[[\"The surgery requires only a <b>minimal</b> amount of anaesthetic.\",\"这台手术只需要极小量的麻醉剂。\"],[\"With <b>minimal</b> effort, the garden produced more vegetables than the family could eat.\",\"这个菜园几乎没费什么力，就产出了全家吃不完的蔬菜（极小的投入）。\"]],\"modeling\":[[\"Climate <b>modeling</b> combines physics and computing to predict how temperatures will change.\",\"气候建模结合物理和计算，预测气温将如何变化。\"],[\"Students used computer <b>modeling</b> to test the bridge design before building it.\",\"学生们用计算机建模在建造前测试桥梁设计。\"]],\"nitrogen\":[[\"<b>Nitrogen</b> makes up about 78 percent of the air we breathe.\",\"氮约占我们呼吸的空气的 78%。\"],[\"Farmers add <b>nitrogen</b> fertiliser to fields to help crops grow faster.\",\"农民给田地施氮肥，帮助作物长得更快。\"]],\"palette\":[[\"The painter squeezed blue, white, and ochre onto her <b>palette</b> before starting.\",\"画家开画前把蓝色、白色和赭色挤到调色板上。\"],[\"Autumn in the valley offers a <b>palette</b> of reds, golds, and deep greens.\",\"山谷的秋天呈现出红、金、深绿的调色板（色彩组合）。\"]],\"paper\":[[\"<b>Paper</b> was invented in China, traditionally credited to Cai Lun in the year 105.\",\"纸的发明在中国，传统上归功于公元 105 年的蔡伦。\"],[\"Before <b>paper</b> became cheap, Chinese writers wrote on bamboo strips and silk.\",\"纸变便宜之前，中国书写者写在竹简和丝帛上。\"]],\"pillow\":[[\"She fluffed the <b>pillow</b> and lay down for an afternoon nap.\",\"她把枕头拍松，躺下午睡。\"],[\"The hotel provides both a firm <b>pillow</b> and a soft one so guests can choose.\",\"酒店同时提供硬枕头和软枕头，让客人挑选。\"]],\"platelet\":[[\"<b>Platelets</b> rush to the site of a cut and stick together to form a clot.\",\"血小板会赶到伤口处，黏在一起形成血凝块。\"],[\"A low <b>platelet</b> count can make even a small bruise spread and heal slowly.\",\"血小板计数低会让小小的淤青扩散、愈合缓慢。\"]],\"principle\":[[\"The school is run on the <b>principle</b> that every child can succeed with the right support.\",\"这所学校的办学原则是：每个孩子得到恰当的支持都能成功。\"],[\"In <b>principle</b>, the plan sounds good, but the cost may make it impossible in practice.\",\"原则上这个计划听起来不错，但成本可能让它实际上行不通。\"]],\"professor\":[[\"The <b>professor</b> of geology takes her students to study real rock layers every summer.\",\"这位地质学教授每个夏天都带学生去研究真实的岩层。\"],[\"He became a full <b>professor</b> at thirty-five, the youngest in the department's history.\",\"他三十五岁成为正教授，是系里历史上最年轻的。\"]],\"radical\":[[\"The new mayor proposed <b>radical</b> changes to the city's transport system.\",\"新市长提出了对全市交通系统进行激进改革的方案。\"],[\"In the 1960s, her <b>radical</b> ideas about education were considered dangerous by many.\",\"20 世纪 60 年代，她激进的教育理念被许多人视为危险。\"]],\"resident\":[[\"Only <b>residents</b> of the building may use the roof garden.\",\"只有这栋楼的居民可以使用屋顶花园。\"],[\"The island has just two hundred permanent <b>residents</b>, most of them fishermen.\",\"这座岛只有两百名常住居民，大多是渔民。\"]],\"slip\":[[\"He <b>slipped</b> on the icy pavement and broke his wrist.\",\"他在结冰的人行道上滑倒，摔断了手腕。\"],[\"Careful — the wet tiles <b>slip</b> easily near the pool.\",\"小心——泳池边的湿地砖容易打滑（滑倒）。\"]],\"syndrome\":[[\"Down <b>syndrome</b> is caused by an extra copy of chromosome 21.\",\"唐氏综合征是由 21 号染色体多出一条引起的。\"],[\"Doctors recognised the <b>syndrome</b> by the pattern of fever, rash, and joint pain together.\",\"医生通过发烧、皮疹和关节痛同时出现的模式认出了这种综合征。\"]],\"talent\":[[\"Her <b>talent</b> for languages showed early: by ten, she spoke three fluently.\",\"她的语言才能很早就显露出来：十岁时已能流利地说三种语言。\"],[\"The school runs a programme to find and train young musical <b>talent</b>.\",\"学校有一个项目，发掘和培养年轻的音乐人才。\"]],\"threshold\":[[\"The <b>threshold</b> of hearing is the quietest sound a human ear can detect.\",\"听觉阈限是人耳能察觉到的最微弱的声音。\"],[\"Each person has a different pain <b>threshold</b>: some feel a stimulus as painful sooner than others.\",\"每个人的疼痛阈限不同：有些人更早把某种刺激感觉为疼痛。\"]],\"vineyard\":[[\"The hillside <b>vineyard</b> produces grapes for a sweet white wine.\",\"山坡上的葡萄园出产酿造甜白葡萄酒的葡萄。\"],[\"Workers harvest the <b>vineyard</b> by hand to avoid damaging the ripe grapes.\",\"工人们手工采收葡萄园，避免损坏成熟的葡萄。\"]],\"watt\":[[\"A modern LED bulb uses only nine <b>watts</b> but shines as brightly as an old sixty-watt bulb.\",\"现代 LED 灯泡只用九瓦特，却和过去六十瓦的灯泡一样亮。\"],[\"The kettle is rated at 1,500 <b>watts</b>, so it boils a litre of water in about three minutes.\",\"这个水壶的功率是 1500 瓦特，烧一升水大约需要三分钟。\"]],\"welfare\":[[\"The <b>welfare</b> system provides monthly support to families who lose their income.\",\"福利制度为失去收入的家庭提供每月补助。\"],[\"Teachers are trained to notice signs that a child's <b>welfare</b> is at risk at home.\",\"教师受过训练，能注意到孩子在家中福利（安危）受威胁的迹象。\"]],\"acknowledge\":[[\"The author <b>acknowledged</b> that her earlier theory had been wrong in one important respect.\",\"作者承认她早先的理论在一个重要方面是错误的。\"],[\"He <b>acknowledged</b> receipt of the package by signing the delivery form.\",\"他签了送货单，承认已经收到包裹。\"]],\"advance\":[[\"New farming methods helped <b>advance</b> food production across the region.\",\"新的耕作方法帮助推进了整个地区的粮食生产。\"],[\"The charity works to <b>advance</b> education for girls in rural areas.\",\"这家慈善机构致力于推进农村地区的女童教育。\"]],\"amount\":[[\"His savings <b>amount</b> to less than a month's salary after years of work.\",\"工作多年后，他的积蓄总计还不到一个月的工资。\"],[\"The donations <b>amounted</b> to over ten thousand dollars by the end of the week.\",\"到周末时，捐款总计超过了一万美元。\"]],\"banana\":[[\"Monkeys in the reserve are fed <b>bananas</b> and other fruit each morning.\",\"保护区里的猴子每天早晨被喂香蕉和其他水果。\"],[\"A ripe <b>banana</b> turns yellow and soft, while an unripe one stays green and firm.\",\"成熟的香蕉会变黄变软，未熟的则保持青绿坚硬。\"]],\"bench\":[[\"An elderly couple sat on a park <b>bench</b> feeding the pigeons.\",\"一对老夫妻坐在公园的长凳上喂鸽子。\"],[\"The carpenter built a wooden <b>bench</b> long enough for four people.\",\"木匠做了一条能坐四个人的木长凳。\"]],\"beneficial\":[[\"Regular reading is <b>beneficial</b> to children's language development.\",\"经常阅读对儿童的语言发展有益。\"],[\"Ladybirds are <b>beneficial</b> insects because they eat the aphids that damage crops.\",\"瓢虫是有益的昆虫，因为它们吃危害庄稼的蚜虫。\"]],\"bite\":[[\"The mosquito <b>bit</b> her arm, leaving an itchy red bump.\",\"蚊子咬了她的胳膊，留下一个发痒的红包。\"],[\"He told the children never to tease the dog, because a frightened dog may <b>bite</b>.\",\"他告诉孩子们不要逗狗，因为受惊的狗可能会咬人。\"]],\"converse\":[[\"At the conference dinner, she <b>conversed</b> with colleagues from three different countries.\",\"会议晚宴上，她与来自三个不同国家的同行交谈。\"],[\"The two old friends <b>conversed</b> late into the night about their school days.\",\"两位老朋友交谈到深夜，聊着学生时代的往事。\"]],\"credit\":[[\"The bank refused to extend <b>credit</b> to the company after two years of losses.\",\"公司连续两年亏损后，银行拒绝再向它提供信贷。\"],[\"Small farmers can now obtain <b>credit</b> to buy seeds and fertiliser before the planting season.\",\"小农户现在可以在播种季前获得信贷，购买种子和化肥。\"]],\"crime\":[[\"The city reduced <b>crime</b> by improving street lighting in its oldest districts.\",\"这座城市通过改善老城区的街道照明降低了罪行（犯罪率）。\"],[\"Stealing a car is a <b>crime</b> punishable by imprisonment in every state.\",\"偷车在每个州都是可判监禁的罪行。\"]],\"crown\":[[\"The <b>crown</b> displayed in the tower is set with diamonds, rubies, and pearls.\",\"塔中展出的王冠镶嵌着钻石、红宝石和珍珠。\"],[\"Queen Victoria wore the imperial <b>crown</b> only on state occasions.\",\"维多利亚女王只在国家典礼场合佩戴帝国王冠。\"]],\"dean\":[[\"The <b>dean</b> of the medical school welcomed the new students at orientation.\",\"医学院院长在迎新会上欢迎新生。\"],[\"Students with complaints about a course can take them to the <b>dean's</b> office.\",\"对课程有意见的学生可以找院长办公室反映。\"]],\"deliberation\":[[\"After three days of <b>deliberation</b>, the jury reached a unanimous verdict.\",\"经过三天的审议，陪审团作出了一致裁决。\"],[\"The committee's <b>deliberations</b> on the budget lasted until midnight.\",\"委员会对预算的审议一直持续到午夜。\"]],\"dictatorship\":[[\"The country lived under a <b>dictatorship</b> for twenty years, with no free elections or free press.\",\"这个国家在独裁统治下生活了二十年，没有自由选举，也没有新闻自由。\"],[\"Historians study how the republic slowly turned into a <b>dictatorship</b>.\",\"历史学家研究这个共和国如何慢慢变成独裁政权。\"]],\"disgrace\":[[\"The cheating scandal brought <b>disgrace</b> on the whole athletics team.\",\"作弊丑闻给整个田径队带来了耻辱。\"],[\"He resigned in <b>disgrace</b> after the missing money was traced to his account.\",\"丢失的钱被追查到他的账户后，他蒙羞（耻辱地）辞职了。\"]],\"embellishment\":[[\"The medieval map was drawn with <b>embellishments</b>: sea monsters and golden ships in the empty oceans.\",\"这张中世纪地图画有装饰：在空旷的海洋里画了海怪和金船。\"],[\"Her embroidery added a floral <b>embellishment</b> to the plain white dress.\",\"她的刺绣给素白的裙子增添了花卉装饰。\"]],\"error\":[[\"A single <b>error</b> in the spreadsheet changed the final total by a thousand dollars.\",\"电子表格里的一个错误让最终总额差了一千美元。\"],[\"The pilot corrected his <b>error</b> as soon as the warning light came on.\",\"警告灯亮起时，飞行员立即纠正了他的错误。\"]],\"evident\":[[\"It was <b>evident</b> from her smile that she had passed the examination.\",\"从她的笑容可以明显看出，她通过了考试。\"],[\"The growing influence of the internet on politics is <b>evident</b> in every election.\",\"互联网对政治日益增长的影响在每次选举中都很明显。\"]],\"extrication\":[[\"The <b>extrication</b> of the driver from the crushed car took firefighters nearly an hour.\",\"把司机从压扁的车里解救出来，消防员花了近一个小时。\"],[\"Rescue teams practised the <b>extrication</b> of survivors from collapsed buildings.\",\"救援队演练了从倒塌建筑中解救幸存者。\"]],\"fiber\":[[\"Cotton <b>fiber</b> is spun into thread and then woven into cloth.\",\"棉花纤维被纺成线，再织成布。\"],[\"Eating foods rich in <b>fiber</b>, such as beans and whole grains, aids digestion.\",\"吃豆类和全谷物等富含纤维的食物有助于消化。\"]],\"fortress\":[[\"The <b>fortress</b> on the hill guarded the entrance to the harbour for three centuries.\",\"山上的堡垒守卫了港口入口三个世纪。\"],[\"Thick stone walls made the <b>fortress</b> almost impossible to capture.\",\"厚厚的石墙使这座堡垒几乎无法攻克。\"]],\"gene\":[[\"A single <b>gene</b> on chromosome 7 is responsible for this inherited disease.\",\"7 号染色体上的一个基因导致了这种遗传病。\"],[\"Scientists found the <b>gene</b> that allows some bacteria to survive in boiling springs.\",\"科学家找到了能让某些细菌在沸腾温泉中存活的基因。\"]],\"harvest\":[[\"This year's wheat <b>harvest</b> was the largest in a decade thanks to timely rain.\",\"由于雨水及时，今年的小麦收获（收成）是十年来最大的。\"],[\"Farmers celebrate the <b>harvest</b> with a festival after the last grain is stored.\",\"最后一批粮食入库后，农民们用节日庆祝收获。\"]],\"hawk\":[[\"A <b>hawk</b> circled high above the field, watching for mice in the grass.\",\"一只隼（鹰隼类）在田野上空盘旋，搜寻草丛里的老鼠。\"],[\"The <b>hawk's</b> sharp eyesight lets it spot prey from hundreds of metres away.\",\"隼的敏锐视力让它能从几百米外发现猎物。\"]],\"identical\":[[\"The two <b>identical</b> twins were often mistaken for each other by their teachers.\",\"这对长得相同的双胞胎常被老师互相认错。\"],[\"No two snowflakes are exactly <b>identical</b>, scientists say, because each forms under slightly different conditions.\",\"科学家说，没有两片雪花完全相同，因为每片雪花形成的环境都略有不同。\"]],\"inscription\":[[\"The <b>inscription</b> on the stone gate records the year the temple was built.\",\"石门上的铭文记录了寺庙建造的年份。\"],[\"Archaeologists translated the <b>inscription</b> carved into the base of the statue.\",\"考古学家翻译了刻在雕像底座上的铭文。\"]],\"insect\":[[\"An <b>insect</b> has six legs and a body divided into three parts: head, thorax, and abdomen.\",\"昆虫有六条腿，身体分为三部分：头、胸和腹。\"],[\"Some <b>insects</b>, like bees, pollinate the flowers they visit for nectar.\",\"蜜蜂等一些昆虫在采蜜时会给花授粉。\"]],\"interest\":[[\"The bank pays three percent <b>interest</b> a year on savings accounts.\",\"银行对储蓄账户每年支付百分之三的利息。\"],[\"If you repay the loan early, you save hundreds of dollars in <b>interest</b>.\",\"提前还清贷款，可以省下几百美元的利息。\"]],\"jelly\":[[\"She spread strawberry <b>jelly</b> on her toast for breakfast.\",\"她早餐在吐司上抹果冻（草莓果冻）。\"],[\"The children shook the bowl to watch the <b>jelly</b> wobble.\",\"孩子们摇晃碗，看果冻晃来晃去。\"]],\"kettle\":[[\"She filled the <b>kettle</b> and switched it on to make tea.\",\"她把水壶装满水，按下开关烧水泡茶。\"],[\"The <b>kettle</b> whistled when the water came to a boil.\",\"水烧开时，水壶发出啸声。\"]],\"lip\":[[\"He bit his lower <b>lip</b> nervously while waiting for the results.\",\"等待结果时，他紧张地咬着下嘴唇。\"],[\"Cold wind cracked her <b>lips</b>, so she carried a tube of lip balm all winter.\",\"寒风把她的嘴唇吹裂了，所以她整个冬天都带着一支润唇膏。\"]],\"mechanic\":[[\"The <b>mechanic</b> found that the strange noise came from a loose belt in the engine.\",\"机械技工发现奇怪的噪声来自发动机里一条松了的皮带。\"],[\"A good <b>mechanic</b> can often diagnose a car problem just by listening to it.\",\"好的机械技工常常光听声音就能判断汽车的毛病。\"]],\"mentor\":[[\"Her <b>mentor</b>, a senior surgeon, reviewed every operation with her during her first year.\",\"她的导师是一位资深外科医生，第一年里陪她复盘了每一台手术。\"],[\"New teachers are paired with an experienced <b>mentor</b> for their first two years.\",\"新教师头两年会配一位有经验的导师。\"]],\"migrate\":[[\"Many families <b>migrated</b> to the industrial north in search of factory jobs.\",\"许多家庭移居到北方工业区，寻找工厂的工作。\"],[\"After the drought, whole villages <b>migrated</b> toward the river valley.\",\"干旱之后，整村整村的人移居到河谷地带。\"]],\"neighborhood\":[[\"The <b>neighborhood</b> has its own market, school, and small park within walking distance.\",\"这个社区步行范围内就有自己的市场、学校和小公园。\"],[\"Neighbours in the <b>neighborhood</b> organised a clean-up of the local canal.\",\"社区里的邻居们组织了一次本地运河的清理活动。\"]],\"panda\":[[\"The giant <b>panda</b> spends most of its day eating bamboo — up to fourteen hours.\",\"大熊猫一天大部分时间都在吃竹子，长达十四个小时。\"],[\"Wild <b>pandas</b> live only in a few mountain ranges in central China.\",\"野生熊猫只生活在中国中部的几座山脉里。\"]],\"picture\":[[\"The child drew a <b>picture</b> of her house with a red roof and a garden.\",\"孩子画了一幅图画：她的房子有红屋顶和一个花园。\"],[\"A <b>picture</b> of the harbour in 1900 hangs in the town museum.\",\"一幅 1900 年港口的图画（照片）挂在镇博物馆里。\"]],\"preschool\":[[\"At <b>preschool</b>, her daughter learned to share toys and wait her turn.\",\"在学前班，她女儿学会了分享玩具和轮流等待。\"],[\"The town built a new <b>preschool</b> so that three-year-olds would not have to travel far.\",\"镇上新建了一所学前班，让三岁的孩子不用跑远路。\"]],\"processor\":[[\"A faster <b>processor</b> lets the computer handle video editing without slowing down.\",\"更快的处理器让计算机处理视频编辑时不会变慢。\"],[\"The phone's <b>processor</b> runs eight cores to balance speed and battery life.\",\"这部手机的处理器有八个核心，兼顾速度和续航。\"]],\"pyramid\":[[\"The Great <b>Pyramid</b> of Giza was the tallest human-made structure for more than 3,800 years.\",\"吉萨大金字塔曾是三千八百多年里最高的人造建筑。\"],[\"Workers dragged huge stone blocks up ramps to build the <b>pyramid</b>.\",\"工人们把巨大的石块沿着坡道拖上去建造金字塔。\"]],\"registration\":[[\"Course <b>registration</b> opens on Monday, and popular classes fill up within hours.\",\"课程报到（注册）周一开始，热门课程几小时内就报满了。\"],[\"At the hotel, <b>registration</b> took only a few minutes with her passport and booking number.\",\"在酒店，凭护照和预订号几分钟就办好了报到（登记）。\"]],\"rehearsal\":[[\"The orchestra held its final <b>rehearsal</b> on the morning of the concert.\",\"乐队在音乐会当天的上午进行了最后一次排练。\"],[\"During <b>rehearsal</b>, the actors practised the fight scene until it looked real.\",\"排练时，演员们反复练习打斗场面，直到看起来逼真。\"]],\"river\":[[\"The <b>river</b> carries sediment from the mountains and deposits it on the plains.\",\"河流把沉积物从山里带出来，沉积在平原上。\"],[\"They crossed the <b>river</b> by ferry because the nearest bridge was ten kilometres away.\",\"他们乘渡船过河，因为最近的桥在十公里外。\"]],\"sandstone\":[[\"The cliffs are made of red <b>sandstone</b> laid down by an ancient desert.\",\"这些悬崖由红色砂岩构成，是古代沙漠沉积形成的。\"],[\"The old courthouse was built from local <b>sandstone</b> that glows gold at sunset.\",\"老法院用当地的砂岩建造，在日落时泛着金光。\"]],\"sector\":[[\"The tourism <b>sector</b> employs one in ten workers in the island economy.\",\"旅游业部门（行业）雇用了这个岛屿经济中十分之一的劳动力。\"],[\"Governments divide the economy into <b>sectors</b> such as farming, manufacturing, and services.\",\"政府把经济分成农业、制造业和服务业等部门（行业）。\"]],\"seed\":[[\"A tomato <b>seed</b> is tiny, but each one can grow into a plant two metres tall.\",\"番茄种子很小，但每一粒都能长成两米高的植株。\"],[\"Birds spread the plant's <b>seeds</b> by eating the fruit and dropping the seeds elsewhere.\",\"鸟类吃果实并在别处排出种子，从而传播这种植物的种子。\"]],\"significant\":[[\"The discovery of penicillin was a <b>significant</b> moment in the history of medicine.\",\"青霉素的发现是医学史上一个重要的时刻。\"],[\"There was a <b>significant</b> drop in air pollution after the factory installed filters.\",\"工厂安装过滤装置后，空气污染有重要的（显著的）下降。\"]],\"sonar\":[[\"Submarines use <b>sonar</b> to detect other vessels in the dark depths of the ocean.\",\"潜艇用声呐在黑暗的深海中探测其他船只。\"],[\"Bats navigate with a natural form of <b>sonar</b>, judging distance from echoes.\",\"蝙蝠用一种天然的声呐导航，根据回声判断距离。\"]],\"squid\":[[\"A giant <b>squid</b> can grow longer than a school bus but is rarely seen alive.\",\"大王鱿鱼能长得比一辆校车还长，但很少有人见过活的。\"],[\"The fisherman caught a <b>squid</b> whose body changed colour as it moved.\",\"渔民抓到一只鱿鱼，它的身体在游动时变换颜色。\"]],\"trail\":[[\"The mountain <b>trail</b> winds through pine forest for six kilometres before reaching the lake.\",\"这条山间小道穿过松林蜿蜒六公里，到达湖边。\"],[\"Hikers are asked to stay on the <b>trail</b> to protect the fragile plants beside it.\",\"徒步者被要求待在小道上，以保护路边脆弱的植物。\"]],\"tribe\":[[\"The <b>tribe</b> elects a council of elders to settle disputes between families.\",\"这个部落选举一个长老会来解决家族之间的纠纷。\"],[\"Each <b>tribe</b> in the region has its own language, dress, and ceremonies.\",\"该地区的每个部落都有自己的语言、服饰和仪式。\"]],\"university\":[[\"The <b>university</b> was founded in 1636 and is the oldest in the country.\",\"这所大学建于 1636 年，是全国最古老的。\"],[\"She applied to three <b>universities</b> and chose the one with the strongest biology programme.\",\"她申请了三所大学，选了生物学最强的那一所。\"]],\"ward\":[[\"He recovered in a hospital <b>ward</b> with five other patients after his operation.\",\"手术后，他在一间有其他五名病人的病房里休养。\"],[\"The children's <b>ward</b> is painted in bright colours to make young patients feel at ease.\",\"儿童病房刷成了明亮的颜色，让小病人感觉放松。\"]],\"yoga\":[[\"She practises <b>yoga</b> every morning to keep her back flexible and her mind calm.\",\"她每天早晨练瑜伽，保持背部灵活、心绪平静。\"],[\"The community centre offers free <b>yoga</b> classes for seniors twice a week.\",\"社区中心每周为老年人提供两次免费瑜伽课。\"]],\"abundant\":[[\"Fish were once so <b>abundant</b> in the river that villagers could catch them by hand.\",\"河里的鱼曾经非常丰富，村民用手就能抓到。\"],[\"The region has <b>abundant</b> rainfall, so rice grows well without irrigation.\",\"这个地区雨量丰富，所以水稻不用灌溉也能长得好。\"]],\"acceleration\":[[\"The car's <b>acceleration</b> is measured by how fast it goes from rest to 100 kilometres per hour.\",\"汽车的加速度用它从静止到时速 100 公里需要多久来衡量。\"],[\"Under gravity, a falling stone gains speed at a constant <b>acceleration</b> of about 9.8 metres per second squared.\",\"在重力作用下，下落的石头以约 9.8 米每二次方秒的恒定加速度加速。\"]],\"aerial\":[[\"An outdoor <b>aerial</b> on the roof gave the old television a much clearer picture.\",\"屋顶上的室外天线让老电视的画面清晰了许多。\"],[\"He climbed up to repair the radio <b>aerial</b> after the storm bent it.\",\"暴风雨把电台天线吹弯后，他爬上去修理。\"]],\"affordability\":[[\"The <b>affordability</b> of housing has fallen as prices rose faster than wages.\",\"房价涨得比工资快，住房的可负担性下降了。\"],[\"The committee studied the <b>affordability</b> of the new medicine for ordinary families.\",\"委员会研究了这种新药对普通家庭的可负担性。\"]],\"amass\":[[\"Over forty years, the collector <b>amassed</b> more than three thousand old maps.\",\"四十年间，这位收藏家积聚了三千多张老地图。\"],[\"The company <b>amassed</b> a huge fortune during the oil boom.\",\"这家公司在石油繁荣期积聚了巨额财富。\"]],\"antibody\":[[\"After vaccination, the body produces <b>antibodies</b> that recognise the virus.\",\"接种疫苗后，身体会产生能识别病毒的抗体。\"],[\"A blood test showed <b>antibodies</b> proving she had caught the disease before.\",\"血液检查显示有抗体，证明她以前感染过这种病。\"]],\"apology\":[[\"He wrote a letter of <b>apology</b> to the neighbours for the noise from his party.\",\"他给邻居写了一封道歉信，为派对的噪声致歉。\"],[\"The company issued a public <b>apology</b> after the faulty toys were recalled.\",\"有缺陷的玩具被召回后，公司发表了公开道歉。\"]],\"apparent\":[[\"It soon became <b>apparent</b> that the map was wrong and the river lay farther north.\",\"很快就明显看出地图错了，河流在更北边。\"],[\"Her relief was <b>apparent</b> to everyone when the missing hikers were found.\",\"失踪的徒步者被找到时，她的宽慰对所有人都很明显。\"]],\"appliance\":[[\"A washing machine is a household <b>appliance</b> that most families now consider essential.\",\"洗衣机是如今多数家庭认为必不可少的家用器具。\"],[\"The shop repairs electrical <b>appliances</b> such as fridges, ovens, and heaters.\",\"这家店修理冰箱、烤箱和取暖器等电器器具。\"]],\"auction\":[[\"The painting will be sold at <b>auction</b> next month and is expected to fetch a record price.\",\"这幅画下个月将被拍卖，预计会拍出创纪录的价格。\"],[\"Farmers bring their cattle to a weekly <b>auction</b> in the market town.\",\"农民把牛赶到集镇每周的拍卖会上出售。\"]],\"barren\":[[\"The <b>barren</b> hillside supports only a few thorny bushes after decades without rain.\",\"几十年没下雨，这片贫瘠的山坡上只长着几丛带刺的灌木。\"],[\"Nothing grows in the <b>barren</b> salt flats except a few hardy grasses.\",\"在这片贫瘠的盐碱滩上，除了几种耐盐的草，什么都不长。\"]],\"befall\":[[\"Whatever may <b>befall</b> us on the journey, we will face it together.\",\"旅途中无论发生（降临）什么，我们都会一起面对。\"],[\"A strange fate <b>befell</b> the ship: it vanished in calm weather within sight of the harbour.\",\"奇怪的命运降临在这艘船上：它在风平浪静、能看见港口的地方消失了。\"]],\"beloved\":[[\"The <b>beloved</b> teacher retired after forty years, and generations of her students came to say goodbye.\",\"这位深受爱戴的老师教了四十年后退休，几代学生都来为她送行。\"],[\"He read the letter from his <b>beloved</b> wife every night during the long voyage.\",\"漫长的航行中，他每晚都读深爱的妻子的来信。\"]],\"bill\":[[\"Parliament passed the education <b>bill</b> after months of debate.\",\"经过数月辩论，议会通过了教育法案。\"],[\"The new <b>bill</b> makes it illegal to sell tobacco to anyone under eighteen.\",\"新法案规定向十八岁以下者出售烟草违法。\"]],\"canal\":[[\"The Panama <b>Canal</b> lets ships pass between the Atlantic and Pacific without sailing around South America.\",\"巴拿马运河让船只无需绕行南美洲就能往来大西洋和太平洋。\"],[\"Farmers dug a <b>canal</b> to carry river water to their dry fields.\",\"农民挖了一条运河（水渠），把河水引到干旱的田地里。\"]],\"cauliflower\":[[\"She steamed the <b>cauliflower</b> and served it with a cheese sauce.\",\"她把花椰菜蒸熟，配奶酪酱上桌。\"],[\"<b>Cauliflower</b> is ready to harvest when its white head is firm and compact.\",\"花椰菜的白色花球结实紧凑时就可以采收了。\"]],\"compile\":[[\"The library is <b>compiling</b> a list of every book published in the region before 1900.\",\"图书馆正在汇编一份 1900 年前该地区出版的所有书籍的清单。\"],[\"It took the programmers a night to <b>compile</b> the data from forty field stations.\",\"程序员花了一夜汇编来自四十个野外站点的数据。\"]],\"congenital\":[[\"The baby was born with a <b>congenital</b> heart defect that required surgery in her first week.\",\"这个婴儿生有先天性心脏缺陷，出生第一周就需要手术。\"],[\"Some forms of blindness are <b>congenital</b>, present from birth even though neither parent is blind.\",\"有些失明是先天性的，从出生起就存在，即使父母都不失明。\"]],\"cough\":[[\"His <b>cough</b> kept the whole family awake during his first night with the flu.\",\"他得流感的第一个晚上，咳嗽让全家人都没睡好。\"],[\"Cover your mouth when you <b>cough</b> to avoid spreading germs.\",\"咳嗽时要捂住嘴，避免传播病菌。\"]],\"crop\":[[\"A late frost destroyed half of this year's peach <b>crop</b>.\",\"一场晚霜毁掉了今年一半的桃子收成。\"],[\"The potato <b>crop</b> was so large that prices fell across the whole region.\",\"土豆收成太大，整个地区的价格都跌了。\"]],\"delete\":[[\"She accidentally <b>deleted</b> the only copy of her thesis and had to rewrite a chapter.\",\"她不小心删除了论文的唯一一份副本，不得不重写一章。\"],[\"Press this key to <b>delete</b> the character to the left of the cursor.\",\"按这个键删除光标左边的字符。\"]],\"discrimination\":[[\"The taste test measured each judge's <b>discrimination</b> between nearly identical flavours.\",\"这项味觉测试测量每位评委对几乎相同口味的辨别（能力）。\"],[\"Fine <b>discrimination</b> between shades of blue develops in painters after years of practice.\",\"画家经过多年练习，会发展出对蓝色色调的精细辨别（力）。\"]],\"disguise\":[[\"The spy wore a grey wig and glasses as a <b>disguise</b> to cross the border unnoticed.\",\"间谍戴上灰色假发和眼镜作伪装，不被注意地越过边境。\"],[\"She <b>disguised</b> herself as a cleaner to enter the office after hours.\",\"她伪装成清洁工，在下班后进了办公室。\"]],\"evaporation\":[[\"<b>Evaporation</b> from the lake's surface increases sharply on hot, windy days.\",\"在炎热多风的日子，湖面的蒸发会急剧增加。\"],[\"As sweat undergoes <b>evaporation</b>, it carries heat away and cools the skin.\",\"汗液蒸发时会带走热量，使皮肤降温。\"]],\"evidence\":[[\"The footprints in the snow were the first <b>evidence</b> that someone had entered the cabin.\",\"雪地上的脚印是有人进过小屋的第一个证据。\"],[\"There is strong <b>evidence</b> that regular exercise protects the heart.\",\"有强有力的证据表明规律运动能保护心脏。\"]],\"extension\":[[\"The museum built an <b>extension</b> to display its growing collection of photographs.\",\"博物馆建了扩建部分（扩展建筑）来展示日益增多的摄影藏品。\"],[\"The <b>extension</b> of the railway to the coast brought tourists to the fishing villages.\",\"铁路向海岸的扩展（延伸）给渔村带来了游客。\"]],\"faucet\":[[\"The bathroom <b>faucet</b> dripped all night and left a rust stain in the sink.\",\"浴室的水龙头滴了一整夜，在水槽里留下锈斑。\"],[\"Turn off the <b>faucet</b> while brushing your teeth to save water.\",\"刷牙时关掉水龙头可以节约用水。\"]],\"forgetting\":[[\"<b>Forgetting</b> is not always a failure: the brain drops details it no longer needs.\",\"遗忘并不总是坏事：大脑会丢掉不再需要的细节。\"],[\"The <b>forgetting</b> curve shows that we lose new information fastest in the first day.\",\"遗忘曲线表明，新信息在第一天里忘得最快。\"]],\"grain\":[[\"A single <b>grain</b> of sand under the lens turned out to be a tiny shell fragment.\",\"显微镜下的一粒沙（谷粒大小）原来是一小片贝壳碎片。\"],[\"Each <b>grain</b> of rice in the bowl had been polished white.\",\"碗里的每一粒米（谷粒）都被打磨得洁白。\"]],\"hunting\":[[\"<b>Hunting</b> was once the main way humans obtained meat, long before farming.\",\"在农业出现之前很久，打猎曾经是人类获得肉食的主要方式。\"],[\"The government issues <b>hunting</b> licences to control the deer population.\",\"政府发放打猎许可证来控制鹿的数量。\"]],\"income\":[[\"Her main <b>income</b> comes from teaching, with a little extra from translation work.\",\"她的主要收入来自教书，翻译工作还有一点额外收入。\"],[\"The family's <b>income</b> fell sharply when the factory cut working hours.\",\"工厂缩减工时后，这个家庭的收入大幅下降。\"]],\"joule\":[[\"One <b>joule</b> is roughly the energy needed to lift a small apple one metre off the ground.\",\"一焦耳大约是把一个小苹果抬离地面一米所需的能量。\"],[\"The food label lists its energy content in both calories and <b>joules</b>.\",\"食品标签用卡路里和焦耳两种单位标出能量含量。\"]],\"jury\":[[\"The <b>jury</b> listened to six days of testimony before beginning its discussions.\",\"陪审团听了六天的证词才开始讨论。\"],[\"Serving on a <b>jury</b> is a civic duty that ordinary citizens take turns performing.\",\"担任陪审团成员是普通公民轮流履行的公民义务。\"]],\"kayaking\":[[\"<b>Kayaking</b> on the quiet river at dawn is her favourite way to start the weekend.\",\"清晨在平静的河上划皮划艇是她最喜欢的周末打开方式（皮划艇运动）。\"],[\"Beginners learn <b>kayaking</b> on a lake before attempting white-water rapids.\",\"初学者先在湖面上学习皮划艇运动，然后再尝试白水急流。\"]],\"library\":[[\"The public <b>library</b> lends books, films, and even tools to neighbourhood residents.\",\"公共图书馆向社区居民出借书籍、电影，甚至工具。\"],[\"He spent the winter in the <b>library</b> reading ships' logs from the eighteenth century.\",\"他整个冬天都泡在图书馆里，读十八世纪的航海日志。\"]],\"mammal\":[[\"The bat is the only <b>mammal</b> capable of true flight.\",\"蝙蝠是唯一能真正飞行的哺乳动物。\"],[\"Whales are <b>mammals</b>: they breathe air and nurse their young with milk.\",\"鲸是哺乳动物：它们呼吸空气，用乳汁哺育幼崽。\"]],\"mantle\":[[\"The Earth's <b>mantle</b> lies between the thin crust and the hot core, extending nearly 2,900 kilometres down.\",\"地球的地幔位于薄薄的地壳和炽热的地核之间，向下延伸近 2900 公里。\"],[\"Heat slowly circulates within the <b>mantle</b>, dragging the continents with it over millions of years.\",\"热量在地幔内缓慢循环，在数百万年里拖着大陆一起移动。\"]],\"microwave\":[[\"She heated the soup in the <b>microwave</b> for two minutes.\",\"她用微波炉把汤加热了两分钟。\"],[\"Never put metal foil in a <b>microwave</b>; it can spark and start a fire.\",\"千万不要把金属箔放进微波炉；它会打火甚至引发火灾。\"]],\"needle\":[[\"The nurse slid the <b>needle</b> into his arm to draw a blood sample.\",\"护士把针扎进他的胳膊抽血样。\"],[\"She threaded the <b>needle</b> and began sewing the button back onto his coat.\",\"她穿好针，开始把纽扣缝回他的外套上。\"]],\"neon\":[[\"<b>Neon</b> signs glow orange-red when electricity passes through the gas in the tube.\",\"电流通过管内的氖气时，霓虹（氖）灯牌会发出橙红色的光。\"],[\"<b>Neon</b> is an inert gas that makes up only a tiny fraction of the air.\",\"氖是一种惰性气体，只占空气的极小一部分。\"]],\"ore\":[[\"The mine extracts iron <b>ore</b> and ships it to steel plants by rail.\",\"这座矿山开采铁矿石，通过铁路运往钢铁厂。\"],[\"Copper <b>ore</b> often shows green streaks where the metal has weathered.\",\"铜矿石上常有金属风化后留下的绿色条纹。\"]],\"pandemic\":[[\"The 1918 flu <b>pandemic</b> killed more people than the First World War.\",\"1918 年的流感大流行夺走的生命比第一次世界大战还多。\"],[\"During a <b>pandemic</b>, a virus spreads across many countries at the same time.\",\"大流行期间，一种病毒会同时在许多国家传播。\"]],\"peanut\":[[\"He is allergic to <b>peanuts</b>, so he reads every food label carefully.\",\"他对花生过敏，所以仔细看每个食品标签。\"],[\"Farmers in the region plant <b>peanuts</b> in sandy soil after the last frost.\",\"该地区的农民在最后一次霜冻后，把花生种在沙质土壤里。\"]],\"porcupine\":[[\"A <b>porcupine</b> defends itself by raising its sharp quills when a predator approaches.\",\"天敌靠近时，豪猪会竖起尖刺自卫。\"],[\"The dog learned to avoid <b>porcupines</b> after one painful encounter in the woods.\",\"在树林里吃过一次苦头后，这条狗学会了躲开豪猪。\"]],\"predator\":[[\"The owl is a night <b>predator</b> that hunts mice by sound as much as by sight.\",\"猫头鹰是夜间捕食者，靠听觉和视觉一起猎老鼠。\"],[\"In this lake, the pike is the top <b>predator</b> and has no natural enemies.\",\"在这个湖里，狗鱼是顶级捕食者，没有天敌。\"]],\"pulley\":[[\"Using a <b>pulley</b>, the workers lifted the heavy beam with half the usual effort.\",\"用滑轮，工人们只花一半力气就吊起了沉重的横梁。\"],[\"A flag rises up the pole on a rope running over a <b>pulley</b> at the top.\",\"旗子靠一根绕过旗杆顶端滑轮的绳子升上去。\"]],\"restricted\":[[\"Access to the laboratory is <b>restricted</b> to staff with special passes.\",\"进入实验室受限，只有持特殊通行证的员工才能进。\"],[\"During the drought, water use was <b>restricted</b> to drinking and cooking.\",\"干旱期间，用水受限，只能用于饮用和做饭。\"]],\"rocket\":[[\"The <b>rocket</b> carried a telescope into orbit above the Earth's atmosphere.\",\"火箭把一台望远镜送入地球大气层之上的轨道。\"],[\"Children launched a model <b>rocket</b> from the school field and watched its parachute open.\",\"孩子们在学校操场上发射了一枚模型火箭，看着它的降落伞打开。\"]],\"roof\":[[\"Solar panels on the <b>roof</b> supply most of the house's electricity.\",\"屋顶上的太阳能板为这栋房子供应大部分电力。\"],[\"The old farmhouse had a thatched <b>roof</b> that had to be replaced every twenty years.\",\"老农舍的茅草屋顶每二十年就得更换一次。\"]],\"scalar\":[[\"Temperature is a <b>scalar</b>: it has a size but no direction.\",\"温度是标量：它只有大小，没有方向。\"],[\"In the equation, a <b>scalar</b> multiplies the whole vector and stretches it.\",\"在这个方程里，一个标量乘以整个向量，把它拉长。\"]],\"senate\":[[\"The <b>senate</b> voted to approve the treaty after a short debate.\",\"参议院经过短暂辩论后投票批准了这项条约。\"],[\"Each state elects two members to the <b>Senate</b>, regardless of its population.\",\"每个州无论人口多少，都选出两名参议院议员。\"]],\"solo\":[[\"She sang a <b>solo</b> in the school concert while the choir hummed behind her.\",\"她在学校音乐会上独唱，合唱团在她身后轻声伴唱。\"],[\"The album opens with a piano <b>solo</b> that lasts barely a minute.\",\"专辑以一段钢琴独奏（独唱式的独奏）开场，只有不到一分钟。\"]],\"spice\":[[\"Cinnamon is a <b>spice</b> made from the inner bark of a tropical tree.\",\"肉桂是一种香料，由热带树的内皮制成。\"],[\"Traders once sailed across oceans for <b>spices</b> like pepper, cloves, and nutmeg.\",\"商人曾经远渡重洋去贩运胡椒、丁香和肉豆蔻等香料。\"]],\"stock\":[[\"He bought <b>stock</b> in a railway company and received dividends every year.\",\"他买了一家铁路公司的股票，每年都收到股息。\"],[\"When the company announced record profits, its <b>stock</b> rose sharply in one day.\",\"公司宣布创纪录利润时，它的股票一天内大幅上涨。\"]],\"style\":[[\"Her writing <b>style</b> is plain and direct, with short sentences and few adjectives.\",\"她的写作风格平实直接，句子短，形容词少。\"],[\"The building mixes two <b>styles</b>: a Gothic tower on a classical base.\",\"这栋建筑混合了两种风格：古典基座上是哥特式塔楼。\"]],\"tiger\":[[\"The <b>tiger</b> slipped silently through the tall grass toward the deer.\",\"老虎悄无声息地穿过高草，靠近那头鹿。\"],[\"A <b>tiger's</b> stripes are unique — no two tigers share the same pattern.\",\"老虎的条纹独一无二——没有两只老虎的花纹相同。\"]],\"wall\":[[\"They painted the kitchen <b>wall</b> a pale yellow to brighten the room.\",\"他们把厨房的墙壁刷成淡黄色，让房间更明亮。\"],[\"A stone <b>wall</b> surrounded the garden and kept the rabbits out.\",\"一道石墙围着花园，把兔子挡在外面。\"]],\"wasp\":[[\"A <b>wasp</b> built its papery nest under the roof of the shed.\",\"一只黄蜂在棚子屋顶下筑了纸一样的巢。\"],[\"Unlike bees, a <b>wasp</b> can sting several times without dying.\",\"与蜜蜂不同，黄蜂蜇人多次也不会死。\"]],\"witch\":[[\"In the fairy tale, a <b>witch</b> lives in a house made of gingerbread deep in the forest.\",\"童话里，一个女巫住在森林深处一间姜饼做的房子里。\"],[\"During the seventeenth century, many innocent women were accused of being <b>witches</b>.\",\"十七世纪，许多无辜女性被指控为女巫。\"]],\"accident\":[[\"Three people were hurt in the road <b>accident</b>, but all recovered within a month.\",\"三人在这起交通事故中受伤，但都在一个月内康复了。\"],[\"By pure <b>accident</b>, she ran into her old teacher in a foreign airport.\",\"纯粹偶然（事故般的巧合），她在国外的机场遇到了以前的老师。\"]],\"actor\":[[\"The lead <b>actor</b> forgot his lines in the middle of the performance.\",\"主演演员在演出中途忘了台词。\"],[\"As a young <b>actor</b>, he performed in village theatres before reaching the national stage.\",\"年轻时，他作为演员在乡村剧院演出，后来才登上国家舞台。\"]],\"adequacy\":[[\"The committee questioned the <b>adequacy</b> of the town's water supply during droughts.\",\"委员会质疑该镇在干旱期间供水的充分性。\"],[\"Inspectors checked the <b>adequacy</b> of fire exits in every school in the district.\",\"检查员核查了区内每所学校消防出口的充分性。\"]],\"adolescence\":[[\"During <b>adolescence</b>, the body changes rapidly and teenagers need more sleep than adults.\",\"青春期期间，身体变化迅速，青少年比成年人需要更多睡眠。\"],[\"Friendships formed in <b>adolescence</b> can shape a person's confidence for years.\",\"青春期结成的友谊能影响一个人多年的自信。\"]],\"algae\":[[\"Green <b>algae</b> covered the surface of the pond after weeks of warm weather.\",\"几周暖和天气之后，绿色的藻类覆盖了池塘表面。\"],[\"<b>Algae</b> in the ocean produce a large share of the world's oxygen through photosynthesis.\",\"海洋中的藻类通过光合作用产生了世界上很大一部分氧气。\"]],\"alternative\":[[\"Cycling is a cheap <b>alternative</b> way to commute in a crowded city.\",\"在拥挤的城市里，骑自行车是一种便宜的可替代通勤方式。\"],[\"The plan offers an <b>alternative</b> route for trucks that avoids the town centre.\",\"这个方案提供了一条可替代的卡车路线，避开市中心。\"]],\"amazement\":[[\"To her <b>amazement</b>, the puppy had learned to open the gate by itself.\",\"让她惊奇的是，小狗已经学会自己开门了。\"],[\"The audience watched in <b>amazement</b> as the acrobat balanced on a single finger.\",\"观众惊奇地看着杂技演员用一根手指保持平衡。\"]],\"ambassador\":[[\"The <b>ambassador</b> presented her credentials to the president on her first day in the post.\",\"大使在就任第一天向总统递交了国书。\"],[\"As <b>ambassador</b> to France, he worked to strengthen trade between the two countries.\",\"作为驻法国大使，他致力于加强两国贸易。\"]],\"aquarium\":[[\"At the <b>aquarium</b>, children pressed against the glass to watch the sharks glide past.\",\"在水族馆，孩子们贴在玻璃上看鲨鱼滑过。\"],[\"He keeps a small home <b>aquarium</b> with tropical fish and live plants.\",\"他在家养了一个小水族箱（水族馆式的鱼缸），里面有热带鱼和活水草。\"]],\"assortment\":[[\"The bakery sells an <b>assortment</b> of breads, from crusty loaves to sweet rolls.\",\"这家面包房出售各式各样的面包，从脆皮面包到甜面包卷。\"],[\"Her drawer held a strange <b>assortment</b> of keys, coins, and old ticket stubs.\",\"她的抽屉里放着各式各样奇怪的东西：钥匙、硬币和旧票根。\"]],\"astronomy\":[[\"<b>Astronomy</b> began when ancient peoples tracked the movements of the Moon and planets.\",\"天文学起源于古代人追踪月球和行星的运行。\"],[\"With a small telescope, <b>astronomy</b> hobbyists can see the rings of Saturn.\",\"用一台小望远镜，天文学爱好者就能看到土星环。\"]],\"avoidance\":[[\"His <b>avoidance</b> of the topic told her the answer was bad news.\",\"他对这个话题的回避告诉她，答案是坏消息。\"],[\"Tax <b>avoidance</b> through legal loopholes is debated in every parliament.\",\"通过法律漏洞避税（回避税负）在每个议会都被讨论。\"]],\"bean\":[[\"She planted rows of <b>beans</b> along the fence, where they could climb as they grew.\",\"她沿着栅栏种了几排豆，让它们生长时可以攀爬。\"],[\"Coffee <b>beans</b> are roasted until dark and shiny before being ground.\",\"咖啡豆要烘焙到深色发亮，然后再磨碎。\"]],\"blink\":[[\"We <b>blink</b> about fifteen times a minute without noticing it.\",\"我们每分钟眨眼大约十五次，自己却毫无察觉。\"],[\"The cat did not <b>blink</b> as it watched the bird through the window.\",\"猫隔着窗户盯着鸟，一下眼都没眨。\"]],\"bony\":[[\"The stray dog was so <b>bony</b> that its ribs showed through its skin.\",\"这条流浪狗骨瘦得肋骨都透过皮肤显出来。\"],[\"His <b>bony</b> fingers tapped the table as he thought.\",\"他思考时，骨瘦的手指敲着桌子。\"]],\"churn\":[[\"Farmers once <b>churned</b> cream by hand until it thickened into butter.\",\"过去农民用手搅动奶油，直到它变稠成黄油。\"],[\"The sea <b>churned</b> under the ferry as the storm approached.\",\"暴风雨临近时，渡轮下的海水翻搅起来。\"]],\"clarinet\":[[\"She plays the <b>clarinet</b> in the school orchestra and practises every evening.\",\"她在学校乐队里吹单簧管，每天晚上练习。\"],[\"The <b>clarinet's</b> warm tone carries the melody in the slow movement.\",\"在慢乐章中，单簧管温暖的音色承担了旋律。\"]],\"cloak\":[[\"Fog <b>cloaked</b> the harbour, hiding the ships until midday.\",\"雾掩盖（笼罩）了港口，船只直到中午才显现。\"],[\"He tried to <b>cloak</b> his disappointment behind a polite smile.\",\"他试图用礼貌的微笑掩盖自己的失望。\"]],\"contract\":[[\"Both parties signed the <b>contract</b> after their lawyers reviewed every clause.\",\"双方律师审阅了每一条款后，两方签署了合同。\"],[\"A rental <b>contract</b> usually states who pays for repairs.\",\"租赁合同通常会写明由谁承担维修费用。\"]],\"controversy\":[[\"The dam project caused <b>controversy</b> because it would flood several villages.\",\"大坝工程引发了争论，因为它会淹没几个村庄。\"],[\"There is ongoing <b>controversy</b> among historians about who wrote the anonymous letters.\",\"历史学家之间对这些匿名信的作者一直存在争论。\"]],\"correlation\":[[\"There is a strong <b>correlation</b> between smoking and lung disease, visible in data from many countries.\",\"吸烟与肺病之间有很强的相关性，从许多国家的数据中都能看出来。\"],[\"A <b>correlation</b> between two variables does not prove that one causes the other.\",\"两个变量之间的相关性并不能证明其中一个导致了另一个。\"]],\"counsel\":[[\"The teacher <b>counselled</b> the student to retake the course rather than give up.\",\"老师劝告这名学生重修这门课，而不是放弃。\"],[\"Elders <b>counsel</b> the young hunters on how to read animal tracks.\",\"长辈们劝告（指导）年轻猎人如何辨认动物的足迹。\"]],\"crux\":[[\"The <b>crux</b> of the problem is funding: without it, the rescue plan cannot start.\",\"问题的关键点是资金：没有资金，救援计划就无法启动。\"],[\"Getting fresh water to the island is the <b>crux</b> of the whole relief effort.\",\"把淡水送上岛是整个救援工作的关键点。\"]],\"deficiency\":[[\"A vitamin D <b>deficiency</b> can weaken children's bones and slow their growth.\",\"维生素 D 缺乏症会削弱儿童的骨骼、减缓生长。\"],[\"Doctors treat iron <b>deficiency</b> with diet changes and supplements.\",\"医生用调整饮食和补充剂治疗缺铁（缺乏症）。\"]],\"deployment\":[[\"The <b>deployment</b> of rescue teams began within hours of the earthquake.\",\"地震发生几小时内，救援队的部署就开始了。\"],[\"The general planned the <b>deployment</b> of troops along the border.\",\"将军计划了沿边境的兵力部署。\"]],\"depress\":[[\"Weeks of grey weather began to <b>depress</b> even the most cheerful members of the team.\",\"连绵几周的阴天连队里最开朗的人都开始感到沮丧了（使沮丧）。\"],[\"Losing the final after leading for an hour <b>depressed</b> the players for days.\",\"领先一小时后输掉决赛，让队员们沮丧了好几天。\"]],\"deprivation\":[[\"Sleep <b>deprivation</b> slows reaction times as much as alcohol does.\",\"睡眠剥夺（缺乏）使反应时间变慢的程度和酒精一样。\"],[\"Children raised in severe <b>deprivation</b> often struggle at school.\",\"在严重匮乏（剥夺）中长大的孩子在学校常常很吃力。\"]],\"desk\":[[\"She keeps a photograph of her family on her office <b>desk</b>.\",\"她在办公桌上放了一张全家福。\"],[\"The hotel clerk checked the register on the front <b>desk</b> for our reservation.\",\"酒店前台（服务台/书桌式柜台）的职员查看登记簿，找我们的预订。\"]],\"detention\":[[\"The teacher gave him <b>detention</b> for arriving late three days in a row.\",\"他连续三天迟到，老师罚他留校。\"],[\"After-school <b>detention</b> meant staying in the classroom for an hour doing homework.\",\"放学后留校意味着在教室里多待一小时做作业。\"]],\"diplomat\":[[\"The <b>diplomat</b> spent months negotiating a trade agreement between the two nations.\",\"这位外交官花了几个月谈判两国之间的贸易协定。\"],[\"A skilled <b>diplomat</b> listens carefully before responding to a proposal.\",\"娴熟的外交官在回应提议之前会仔细聆听。\"]],\"dissertation\":[[\"Her <b>dissertation</b> on coastal erosion took three years of fieldwork to complete.\",\"她的学位论文研究海岸侵蚀，花了三年野外工作才完成。\"],[\"Before the defence, the committee read his 300-page <b>dissertation</b> twice.\",\"答辩之前，委员会读了两遍他那篇 300 页的学位论文。\"]],\"distort\":[[\"The curved mirror <b>distorted</b> her reflection, stretching her face into a long oval.\",\"弯曲的镜子扭曲了她的倒影，把脸拉成了长椭圆形。\"],[\"Heat rising from the road <b>distorts</b> the view of distant cars, making them shimmer.\",\"路面上升的热气扭曲了远处汽车的影像，使它们看起来摇曳不定。\"]],\"dividend\":[[\"The company paid a <b>dividend</b> of fifty cents per share this quarter.\",\"公司本季度每股派发五十美分的股息。\"],[\"Retirees often rely on <b>dividends</b> from their investments as steady income.\",\"退休人员常常依靠投资的股息作为稳定收入。\"]],\"elucidation\":[[\"The professor's careful <b>elucidation</b> of the theorem finally made it clear to the class.\",\"教授对这条定理的仔细阐明最终让全班都明白了。\"],[\"The footnote provides an <b>elucidation</b> of the poem's most obscure line.\",\"脚注对这首诗最晦涩的一行作了阐明。\"]],\"epoch\":[[\"The invention of printing began a new <b>epoch</b> in the history of knowledge.\",\"印刷术的发明开启了知识史上一个新的纪元。\"],[\"Geologists divide Earth's history into <b>epochs</b> based on changes in rock and fossils.\",\"地质学家根据岩石和化石的变化把地球历史划分为不同的纪元（世）。\"]],\"exam\":[[\"The final <b>exam</b> covers everything taught since September.\",\"期末考试涵盖九月以来教的全部内容。\"],[\"She revised her notes the night before the chemistry <b>exam</b>.\",\"化学考试前一晚，她复习了笔记。\"]],\"exceed\":[[\"The final cost must not <b>exceed</b> the budget the committee approved.\",\"最终成本不得超过委员会批准的预算。\"],[\"His harvest <b>exceeded</b> all expectations: twice as much wheat as last year.\",\"他的收成超过了所有人的预期：小麦是去年的两倍。\"]],\"flashlight\":[[\"He searched the dark basement with a <b>flashlight</b> until he found the fuse box.\",\"他打着手电筒在黑暗的地下室里找，直到找到保险丝盒。\"],[\"Every emergency kit should contain a <b>flashlight</b> with spare batteries.\",\"每个应急包里都应该有一支手电筒和备用电池。\"]],\"gustatory\":[[\"The <b>gustatory</b> nerves carry taste signals from the tongue to the brain.\",\"味觉神经把味觉信号从舌头传递到大脑。\"],[\"A chef's <b>gustatory</b> sense must be sharp enough to detect a missing pinch of salt.\",\"厨师的味觉必须敏锐到能察觉少放了一小撮盐。\"]],\"harbor\":[[\"The fishing boats returned to the <b>harbor</b> before the storm arrived.\",\"渔船在暴风雨来临之前返回了海港。\"],[\"The <b>harbor</b> is deep enough for large cargo ships to dock.\",\"这个海港足够深，大型货轮也能停靠。\"]],\"insist\":[[\"She <b>insisted</b> on paying for dinner even though we had invited her.\",\"尽管是我们请她，她还是坚持要付晚餐的钱。\"],[\"The doctor <b>insisted</b> that he rest for at least a week after the operation.\",\"医生坚持他手术后至少休息一周。\"]],\"intact\":[[\"The ancient vase was found <b>intact</b>, without a single crack, beneath the temple floor.\",\"这只古代花瓶在寺庙地板下被发现时完好无损，没有一条裂缝。\"],[\"Despite the crash, the black box remained <b>intact</b> and provided the key evidence.\",\"尽管发生了坠机，黑匣子仍完好无损，提供了关键证据。\"]],\"invoice\":[[\"The supplier sent an <b>invoice</b> for the delivered computers, payable within thirty days.\",\"供应商寄来了已交付电脑的发票，要求三十天内付款。\"],[\"Please keep the <b>invoice</b> as proof of purchase in case the machine needs repair.\",\"请保留发票作为购买凭证，以防机器需要维修。\"]],\"legislation\":[[\"New <b>legislation</b> requires factories to cut their emissions by half within five years.\",\"新立法要求工厂在五年内把排放削减一半。\"],[\"The <b>legislation</b> protecting tenants was passed after a long public debate.\",\"保护租户的立法经过长期公众辩论后获得通过。\"]],\"lifeguard\":[[\"The <b>lifeguard</b> dived in and pulled the struggling child to the edge of the pool.\",\"救生员跳进水里，把挣扎的孩子拉到池边。\"],[\"Every public beach in the area employs trained <b>lifeguards</b> during the summer.\",\"该地区每个公共海滩在夏天都聘请受过训练的救生员。\"]],\"longitude\":[[\"Lines of <b>longitude</b> run from pole to pole and measure distance east or west of Greenwich.\",\"经度线从一极到另一极，测量格林尼治以东或以西的距离。\"],[\"The ship's position was recorded as 30 degrees north latitude and 45 degrees west <b>longitude</b>.\",\"船的位置被记录为北纬 30 度、西经 45 度（经度）。\"]],\"mood\":[[\"The whole class was in a cheerful <b>mood</b> after the exam results came out.\",\"考试成绩公布后，全班心情愉快。\"],[\"Rainy weather puts him in a quiet, thoughtful <b>mood</b>.\",\"下雨天让他的心情变得安静、若有所思。\"]],\"oak\":[[\"An old <b>oak</b> in the village square has shaded generations of market stalls.\",\"村广场上的一棵老橡树为几代集市摊位遮过阴。\"],[\"<b>Oak</b> wood is strong and dense, so it is used for barrels and heavy furniture.\",\"橡树木质坚硬致密，因此用来做木桶和厚重的家具。\"]],\"operator\":[[\"The crane <b>operator</b> lifted the container with centimetre precision.\",\"起重机操作员以厘米级的精度吊起了集装箱。\"],[\"Machine <b>operators</b> receive safety training before working on the factory floor.\",\"机器操作员在进入车间前要接受安全培训。\"]],\"orientation\":[[\"During <b>orientation</b> week, new students tour the campus and meet their advisors.\",\"迎新周期间，新生参观校园并与导师见面。\"],[\"The university's <b>orientation</b> programme includes a library tour and a club fair.\",\"大学的迎新项目包括图书馆参观和社团招新会。\"]],\"ottoman\":[[\"He rested his feet on a leather <b>ottoman</b> while reading by the fire.\",\"他烤着火看书，把脚搁在皮脚凳上。\"],[\"The armchair came with a matching <b>ottoman</b> in the same fabric.\",\"这把扶手椅配了一只同面料的脚凳。\"]],\"philosophy\":[[\"She studied <b>philosophy</b> at university, focusing on ethics and logic.\",\"她在大学学哲学，主攻伦理学和逻辑学。\"],[\"His teaching <b>philosophy</b> is simple: students learn best by asking questions.\",\"他的教学哲学（理念）很简单：学生通过提问学得最好。\"]],\"polar\":[[\"<b>Polar</b> bears hunt seals on the sea ice around the North Pole.\",\"北极熊在北极周围的海冰上猎海豹（极地的熊）。\"],[\"The <b>polar</b> night lasts for months, during which the sun never rises.\",\"极地（极夜）长达数月，期间太阳从不升起。\"]],\"pulse\":[[\"The nurse took his <b>pulse</b> and found it fast but regular.\",\"护士摸了他的脉搏，发现快但规律。\"],[\"Your <b>pulse</b> rises during exercise because the heart pumps blood faster.\",\"运动时脉搏会加快，因为心脏把血液泵得更快。\"]],\"rigid\":[[\"The bridge's <b>rigid</b> steel frame barely moved even in the strongest wind.\",\"大桥刚性的钢框架即使在最强的风里也几乎不动。\"],[\"Ice is <b>rigid</b> because its molecules are locked into a fixed crystal pattern.\",\"冰是刚性的，因为它的分子被锁定在固定的晶体结构中。\"]],\"role\":[[\"She played the leading <b>role</b> in the school production of the play.\",\"她在学校这部戏的演出中担任主角（角色）。\"],[\"Bees play a crucial <b>role</b> in farming because they pollinate many crops.\",\"蜜蜂在农业中扮演着关键角色，因为它们为许多作物授粉。\"]],\"seahorse\":[[\"The male <b>seahorse</b> carries the eggs in a special pouch until they hatch.\",\"雄性海马把卵放在一个特殊的育儿袋里，直到它们孵化。\"],[\"A <b>seahorse</b> swims upright and anchors itself to coral with its curled tail.\",\"海马直立游泳，用卷曲的尾巴把自己固定在珊瑚上。\"]],\"surgeon\":[[\"The <b>surgeon</b> operated for six hours to repair the patient's damaged heart.\",\"外科医生手术了六个小时，修复病人受损的心脏。\"],[\"She trained for a decade to become a brain <b>surgeon</b>.\",\"她训练了十年才成为脑外科医生。\"]],\"symmetry\":[[\"The butterfly's wings show near-perfect <b>symmetry</b>, with matching patterns on each side.\",\"蝴蝶的翅膀呈现近乎完美的对称，两边的花纹相匹配。\"],[\"Architects used <b>symmetry</b> to give the palace a sense of balance and order.\",\"建筑师运用对称让宫殿有平衡和秩序感。\"]],\"symphony\":[[\"Beethoven's Ninth <b>Symphony</b> ends with a choir singing the Ode to Joy.\",\"贝多芬第九交响乐以合唱团演唱《欢乐颂》收尾。\"],[\"The orchestra will perform a <b>symphony</b> by Brahms on Friday evening.\",\"乐队将在周五晚上演奏勃拉姆斯的一部交响乐。\"]],\"towel\":[[\"After swimming, she wrapped herself in a dry <b>towel</b>.\",\"游泳后，她用一条干毛巾把自己裹起来。\"],[\"Hang the wet <b>towel</b> outside so it does not start to smell.\",\"把湿毛巾挂在外面，免得发臭。\"]],\"accommodation\":[[\"The conference provided free <b>accommodation</b> for visiting researchers in the university guesthouse.\",\"会议为来访研究人员在大学招待所提供免费住宿。\"],[\"Finding affordable <b>accommodation</b> near the campus is the first problem new students face.\",\"在校区附近找到负担得起的住宿，是新生面对的第一个问题。\"]],\"accountability\":[[\"Public officials face <b>accountability</b> through regular audits of how money is spent.\",\"公职人员通过对资金使用情况的定期审计来接受问责。\"],[\"The new law increases <b>accountability</b> for companies that pollute rivers.\",\"新法律加强了对污染河流企业的问责。\"]],\"acrobat\":[[\"The <b>acrobat</b> walked the tightrope thirty metres above the crowd without a safety net.\",\"杂技演员在没有安全网的情况下，走过离人群三十米高的钢丝。\"],[\"Young <b>acrobats</b> train for years to master a single backflip on the beam.\",\"年轻的杂技演员要训练多年，才能在平衡木上掌握一个后空翻。\"]],\"adequate\":[[\"The tent provides <b>adequate</b> shelter from rain but not from a storm.\",\"这顶帐篷足以（充足地）挡雨，但挡不住暴风雨。\"],[\"Students need <b>adequate</b> sleep before an exam to remember what they studied.\",\"学生考前需要充足的睡眠，才能记住复习的内容。\"]],\"aircraft\":[[\"The new <b>aircraft</b> can carry four hundred passengers across the Pacific without refuelling.\",\"这种新飞行器能载四百名乘客，不加油飞越太平洋。\"],[\"Lightning rarely damages modern <b>aircraft</b> because their metal skins conduct the charge away.\",\"闪电很少损坏现代飞行器，因为它们的金属外壳能把电荷导走。\"]],\"amplify\":[[\"A microphone <b>amplifies</b> the singer's voice so the back rows can hear every word.\",\"麦克风放大歌手的嗓音（放大声音），让后排也能听清每个字。\"],[\"The hall's curved ceiling <b>amplifies</b> sound naturally, without any speakers.\",\"大厅弯曲的天花板自然地放大声音，不需要任何扬声器。\"]],\"appetite\":[[\"After the long hike, the children had a huge <b>appetite</b> and finished every dish.\",\"长途徒步后，孩子们食欲大增，把每道菜都吃光了。\"],[\"Fever often reduces a patient's <b>appetite</b>, so doctors recommend light, frequent meals.\",\"发烧常常降低病人的食欲，所以医生建议少食多餐、吃清淡些。\"]],\"applicant\":[[\"Each <b>applicant</b> for the scholarship must submit two letters of recommendation.\",\"每位奖学金申请人必须提交两封推荐信。\"],[\"The company interviewed the five strongest <b>applicants</b> for the engineering post.\",\"公司面试了工程岗位最强的五位申请人。\"]],\"auditory\":[[\"The <b>auditory</b> nerve carries signals from the inner ear to the brain.\",\"听觉神经把信号从内耳传递到大脑。\"],[\"Some students learn best through <b>auditory</b> methods, such as listening to lectures.\",\"有些学生通过听觉方式学得最好，比如听讲座。\"]],\"base\":[[\"In chemistry, a <b>base</b> is a substance that can neutralise an acid to form a salt and water.\",\"在化学中，碱是能中和酸、生成盐和水的物质。\"],[\"Baking soda is a weak <b>base</b> often used to relieve stomach acid.\",\"小苏打是一种弱碱，常用来缓解胃酸。\"]],\"canyon\":[[\"The Colorado River carved the Grand <b>Canyon</b> over millions of years.\",\"科罗拉多河在数百万年间冲刷出了大峡谷。\"],[\"Hikers descended into the <b>canyon</b> at dawn, before the heat became dangerous.\",\"徒步者在黎明时分下到峡谷里，赶在酷热变得危险之前。\"]],\"chase\":[[\"The cat <b>chased</b> the mouse across the yard but lost it under the fence.\",\"猫追逐老鼠穿过院子，但老鼠从栅栏下逃脱了。\"],[\"Police <b>chased</b> the stolen car through three districts before stopping it.\",\"警察追逐这辆被盗汽车穿过三个区，最后才把它拦下。\"]],\"chemist\":[[\"The <b>chemist</b> Marie Curie discovered two new elements, polonium and radium.\",\"化学家玛丽·居里发现了两种新元素：钋和镭。\"],[\"A research <b>chemist</b> at the university is developing a cheaper way to split water into hydrogen.\",\"大学里的一位研究化学家正在开发一种更便宜的把水分解成氢的方法。\"]],\"chuckle\":[[\"He <b>chuckled</b> at the cartoon in the newspaper before turning the page.\",\"他看着报纸上的漫画轻笑了一声，然后翻了页。\"],[\"The old man <b>chuckled</b> as he remembered his first, disastrous attempt at baking.\",\"老人想起自己第一次灾难性的烘焙尝试时，轻轻笑了。\"]],\"coconut\":[[\"Workers climb the <b>coconut</b> palm with a rope looped around the trunk.\",\"工人们用绕在树干上的绳圈爬上椰子树。\"],[\"She drank the water straight from a green <b>coconut</b> at the beach stall.\",\"她在海滩摊位上直接喝了一个青椰子的椰汁。\"]],\"community\":[[\"The fishing <b>community</b> depends on the harbour for both work and food.\",\"这个渔业社区靠海港谋生和获取食物。\"],[\"Neighbours in the <b>community</b> raised money to repair the school roof.\",\"社区里的邻居们筹钱修理学校屋顶。\"]],\"constrain\":[[\"Tight deadlines <b>constrain</b> the engineers, forcing them to choose the simplest design.\",\"紧迫的期限强迫（约束）工程师们只能选择最简单的设计。\"],[\"His broken leg <b>constrained</b> him to bed for six weeks.\",\"断腿强迫他在床上躺了六周。\"]],\"crave\":[[\"After months at sea, the sailors <b>craved</b> fresh fruit and vegetables.\",\"在海上漂了几个月后，水手们渴望新鲜的水果和蔬菜。\"],[\"She often <b>craves</b> chocolate late at night while studying.\",\"她晚上学习时常常渴望吃巧克力。\"]],\"crouch\":[[\"The photographer <b>crouched</b> low to take the picture at the child's eye level.\",\"摄影师蹲伏着，在孩子的视线高度拍照。\"],[\"Villagers <b>crouched</b> around the fire, warming their hands.\",\"村民们蹲伏在火堆旁，烤手取暖。\"]],\"deflation\":[[\"During a period of <b>deflation</b>, prices fall and people delay purchases, expecting goods to get cheaper.\",\"通货紧缩期间，价格下跌，人们推迟购买，等着商品更便宜。\"],[\"The central bank cut interest rates to fight <b>deflation</b> in the early 2000s.\",\"21 世纪初，央行降息以对抗通货紧缩。\"]],\"developer\":[[\"As a software <b>developer</b>, she writes applications used by hospitals to track patients.\",\"作为软件开发人员，她编写医院用来追踪病人的应用。\"],[\"The app <b>developers</b> released an update that fixed the battery problem.\",\"应用开发人员发布了一次更新，修复了电池问题。\"]],\"door\":[[\"She knocked twice on the <b>door</b> before anyone answered.\",\"她敲了两下门，才有人应声。\"],[\"The cat slipped through the <b>door</b> while it was still closing.\",\"门还在关的时候，猫从门缝钻了出去。\"]],\"elimination\":[[\"The <b>elimination</b> of the disease from the region took twenty years of vaccination.\",\"从这一地区消除这种疾病，花了二十年的疫苗接种。\"],[\"Through a process of <b>elimination</b>, the detective identified the only possible suspect.\",\"通过排除法（消除法），侦探找出了唯一的嫌疑人。\"]],\"emphasis\":[[\"The new curriculum puts more <b>emphasis</b> on speaking than on grammar drills.\",\"新课程更强调口语，而不是语法练习。\"],[\"In his speech, the mayor placed <b>emphasis</b> on protecting the city's wetlands.\",\"市长在演讲中强调要保护城市的湿地。\"]],\"exploration\":[[\"The <b>exploration</b> of the deep ocean is as challenging as travel to the Moon.\",\"对深海的探索和登月旅行一样具有挑战性。\"],[\"Early <b>exploration</b> of the Arctic cost many ships and lives.\",\"早期对北极的探索付出了许多船只和生命的代价。\"]],\"extent\":[[\"The full <b>extent</b> of the flood damage became clear only after the water receded.\",\"洪水退去之后，洪灾的全部范围（程度）才清楚起来。\"],[\"To a large <b>extent</b>, a plant's growth depends on the quality of the soil.\",\"在很大程度上，植物的生长取决于土壤的质量。\"]],\"furniture\":[[\"The apartment came with basic <b>furniture</b>: a bed, a table, and two chairs.\",\"这套公寓配有基本家具：一张床、一张桌子和两把椅子。\"],[\"Oak <b>furniture</b> from the eighteenth century is still solid after two hundred years.\",\"十八世纪的橡木家具过了两百年依然坚固。\"]],\"gunpowder\":[[\"<b>Gunpowder</b> was invented in China and was first used for fireworks before weapons.\",\"火药发明于中国，最初用于烟花，后来才用于武器。\"],[\"The store of <b>gunpowder</b> was kept in a dry stone building far from the camp.\",\"火药存放在离营地很远的一间干燥的石头房子里。\"]],\"hereditary\":[[\"Colour blindness is a <b>hereditary</b> condition passed most often from mother to son.\",\"色盲是一种遗传病，最常由母亲传给儿子。\"],[\"The title was <b>hereditary</b>, passing from the king to his eldest son.\",\"这个头衔是世袭（遗传的），由国王传给长子。\"]],\"jail\":[[\"He spent three years in <b>jail</b> for a crime he did not commit.\",\"他因为一项没有犯过的罪在拘留所（监狱）坐了三年牢。\"],[\"The town's small <b>jail</b> holds prisoners only until their trial.\",\"镇上的小拘留所只在审判前关押犯人。\"]],\"llama\":[[\"In the Andes, farmers keep <b>llamas</b> to carry loads along mountain paths.\",\"在安第斯山脉，农民养美洲驼在山路上驮运货物。\"],[\"A <b>llama's</b> thick wool protects it from the cold nights of the high plateau.\",\"美洲驼厚厚的毛能保护它抵御高原寒冷的夜晚。\"]],\"orangutan\":[[\"The <b>orangutan</b> spends most of its life in the trees of Borneo's rainforests.\",\"红猩猩一生大部分时间都在婆罗洲雨林的树上度过。\"],[\"An <b>orangutan</b> mother cares for her baby for up to eight years, longer than almost any other animal.\",\"红猩猩母亲照顾幼崽长达八年，比几乎任何其他动物都久。\"]],\"piranha\":[[\"A school of <b>piranhas</b> can strip the flesh from a large fish in minutes.\",\"一群食人鱼能在几分钟内把一条大鱼的肉啃光。\"],[\"Despite their reputation, <b>piranhas</b> rarely attack healthy humans.\",\"尽管名声吓人，食人鱼很少攻击健康的人。\"]],\"savanna\":[[\"Elephants and zebras share the <b>savanna</b> with lions and hyenas.\",\"大象和斑马与狮子、鬣狗共享这片热带草原。\"],[\"During the dry season, the <b>savanna</b> turns yellow and animals gather at the remaining waterholes.\",\"旱季时，热带草原变黄，动物聚集在仅存的水洼边。\"]],\"solute\":[[\"In salt water, salt is the <b>solute</b> and water is the solvent.\",\"在盐水里，盐是溶质，水是溶剂。\"],[\"As more <b>solute</b> dissolves, the solution's boiling point slowly rises.\",\"随着更多溶质溶解，溶液的沸点慢慢升高。\"]],\"visual\":[[\"The presentation relied on <b>visual</b> aids — maps, charts, and photographs — rather than text.\",\"这场展示依赖视觉辅助——地图、图表和照片——而不是文字。\"],[\"Bats rely less on <b>visual</b> information than on sound to find their prey.\",\"蝙蝠依靠视觉信息少于依靠声音来寻找猎物。\"]],\"walnut\":[[\"She chopped <b>walnuts</b> into the cake batter for extra texture.\",\"她把核桃切碎拌进蛋糕糊里，增加口感。\"],[\"The table was made from a single wide board of polished <b>walnut</b>.\",\"这张桌子由一整块抛光的核桃木宽板制成。\"]],\"warranty\":[[\"The laptop comes with a two-year <b>warranty</b> covering parts and repairs.\",\"这台笔记本电脑有两年保修，涵盖零件和维修。\"],[\"Keep the receipt: without it, the <b>warranty</b> on the washing machine is not valid.\",\"保留收据：没有收据，洗衣机的保修就无效。\"]],\"yeast\":[[\"Bread rises because <b>yeast</b> releases tiny bubbles of carbon dioxide into the dough.\",\"面包发起来是因为酵母在面团里释放出微小的二氧化碳气泡。\"],[\"The baker added warm water to the <b>yeast</b> to wake it up before mixing the flour.\",\"面包师在和面前先用温水把酵母激活。\"]],\"answer\":[[\"Her <b>answer</b> to the last question was correct but too brief to earn full marks.\",\"她对最后一个问题的答案是对的，但太简略，没拿到满分。\"],[\"After a long pause, the witness finally gave an <b>answer</b> the judge could accept.\",\"长时间停顿之后，证人终于给出了一个法官能接受的答案。\"]],\"appointment\":[[\"She made a dentist's <b>appointment</b> for Tuesday morning.\",\"她约了周二上午看牙医（约会/预约）。\"],[\"Please arrive ten minutes before your <b>appointment</b> so the forms can be completed.\",\"请提前十分钟到达你的约会（预约）地点，以便填好表格。\"]],\"heredity\":[[\"<b>Heredity</b> determines eye colour, but environment can influence height and weight.\",\"遗传因素决定眼睛的颜色，但环境会影响身高和体重。\"],[\"The lecture compared the roles of <b>heredity</b> and learning in the development of language.\",\"这堂课比较了遗传因素和学习在语言发展中的作用。\"]],\"mobile\":[[\"A <b>mobile</b> library van visits the remote villages twice a month.\",\"一辆移动图书馆车每月两次到访偏远村庄。\"],[\"The sculpture is <b>mobile</b>: its metal pieces turn slowly in the wind.\",\"这件雕塑是可移动的：它的金属部件在风中缓慢转动。\"]],\"string\":[[\"He tied the parcel with a piece of <b>string</b> before taking it to the post office.\",\"他用一根细绳把包裹捆好，然后拿到邮局。\"],[\"A kite needs a long, light <b>string</b> that will not snap in a strong wind.\",\"风筝需要一根又长又轻的细绳，在强风下不会断。\"]],\"tragedy\":[[\"Shakespeare's <b>tragedy</b> Hamlet ends with the deaths of almost every main character.\",\"莎士比亚的悲剧《哈姆雷特》以几乎所有主要人物的死亡收尾。\"],[\"The play is a <b>tragedy</b> about a king whose pride destroys his whole family.\",\"这部戏是一出悲剧，讲一位国王的傲慢毁掉了整个家庭。\"]],\"volleyball\":[[\"In <b>volleyball</b>, each team may touch the ball at most three times before sending it over the net.\",\"排球比赛中，每队在把球击过网前最多触球三次。\"],[\"They played beach <b>volleyball</b> every evening until the light faded.\",\"他们每晚打沙滩排球，直到光线暗下来。\"]],\"automatic\":[[\"The factory installed <b>automatic</b> doors that open when a forklift approaches.\",\"工厂安装了自动门，叉车靠近时就会打开。\"],[\"Modern cameras make most settings <b>automatic</b>, so beginners can still take sharp pictures.\",\"现代相机的大多数设置都是自动的，初学者也能拍出清晰的照片。\"]],\"butcher\":[[\"The <b>butcher's</b> shop on the corner sells fresh lamb every Friday.\",\"街角的肉店每周五卖新鲜羊肉。\"],[\"The <b>butcher</b> weighed the beef and wrapped it in paper for the customer.\",\"肉店老板（屠夫）把牛肉称好，用纸包给顾客。\"]],\"contingency\":[[\"The expedition carried extra fuel as a <b>contingency</b> against bad weather.\",\"探险队多带了燃料，以防恶劣天气这类偶然事件。\"],[\"Every space mission plans for the <b>contingency</b> that a landing site becomes unsafe.\",\"每次太空任务都要为着陆点变得不安全这一偶然事件做预案。\"]],\"escape\":[[\"The prisoners dug a tunnel but were caught before they could <b>escape</b>.\",\"囚犯挖了地道，但在逃跑之前就被抓住了。\"],[\"No one was hurt when the gas began to <b>escape</b> from the broken pipe.\",\"破裂的管道开始漏气（逃逸）时，没有人受伤。\"]],\"fund\":[[\"The scholarship <b>fund</b> pays the tuition of twenty students from farming families each year.\",\"这个奖学金基金每年为二十名农家学生支付学费。\"],[\"Villagers set up a <b>fund</b> to rebuild the bridge washed away by the flood.\",\"村民们设立了一个基金，重建被洪水冲走的桥。\"]],\"knight\":[[\"The <b>knight</b> swore an oath to protect the kingdom before receiving his sword.\",\"骑士在接受宝剑之前宣誓保卫王国。\"],[\"In chess, the <b>knight</b> is the only piece that can jump over other pieces.\",\"在国际象棋中，骑士（马）是唯一能跳过其他棋子的棋子。\"]],\"peak\":[[\"They reached the mountain's <b>peak</b> at sunrise and planted a flag in the snow.\",\"他们在日出时登上山峰，在雪地里插上一面旗。\"],[\"From the <b>peak</b>, the whole valley and its river were visible below.\",\"从山峰上望去，整个山谷和河流都尽收眼底。\"]]}");
